INSERT INTO `booked_products` VALUES (4846776,'47','Jayne Winter',30719,201085,'Airport transfer with Innova','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-01-21','2024-01-21','Rendy','Tami',1,'Per Car',224000.00,NULL,'price is per car/way (max. 4 guests) Voucher airport transfer masih terpisah dari voucher room',NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-01-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-01-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(4846777,'47','Jayne Winter',30719,201080,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-01-20','2024-01-22','Rendy','Tami',1,'Double',1792000.00,'Swiss-Belhotel Sorong boast 126 guest rooms in Sorong with all the comforts you would expect from an international chain of four-star hotels in Sorong. Enjoy 37-inch LED TVs, cable channels, high-speed internet access and a full range of other amenities that will make your stay here the most comfortable one possible.','- Rates are inclusive of 21% Government Tax & Service. - Rates are valid for all market (local & foreigner). - Rate not valid for New Year.','Guaranteed early check-in on 21 January 2024 Flight Schedule ETA: 06.15 by Garuda Indonesia GA682 from Jakarta on 21 Jan','{\"date\": \"2024-01-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-01-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4846782,'47','Jayne Winter',30683,203335,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-01-20','2024-01-20','Rendy','Tami',1,'Double',504000.00,'Feel at home in one of our Superior Rooms - warm colors giving an inviting feel and ambiance. Although you are in the heart of Soekarno - Hatta Airport you can find a small oasis of relaxation where you will leave the hustle and bustle of traveling far behind Spacious 24 square meters Superior room with a king or twin beds offering comfortable stay equipped with modern facilities such as air conditioning, arm chair, work desk & chair, flat screen TV with cable and satellite channels, free access internet & Wi-Fi, in room safe, coffee/tea maker, mini cooler, private bathroom with shower and hair dryer, and many more.',NULL,'Roundtrip Transfer to/from Terminal 3 ETA: 15.45 by Emirates EK356 from Dubai on 20 Jan ETD: 00.10 by Garuda Indonesia GA682 to Sorong on 21 Jan','{\"date\": \"2024-01-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-01-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4848992,'50','Debora Mazuecos Lopez',30694,202088,'Lingsar Garden Suite','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-07-20','2024-07-22','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',6195840.00,'Located by the resort’s lush gardens, the Lingsar Suites are named after a significant religious site on the island, Pura Lingsar, where temples of two different faiths, Balinese Hindu and Sasak’s Waktu Telu, exist in the same complex. Your faith in the island escape will be restored by a stay in this superbly appointed and stunningly finished Suite, where an uncommon level of attention to detail, custom hand-made furniture and curated art pieces weave a magical spell, and contemporary luxury is enlivened with the local Lombok style. Our Lingsar Garden Suite has 8 units, 4 lower level suites (72-80 sqm) with private courtyard, 4 upper level suite (52 sqm) with balcony and tropical garden view. The Lingsar Garden Suites truly are a comfortable and suitably luxurious choice for any discerning traveler. This suite equipped with luxurious king-sized bed, hand-crafted custom furniture with art pieces in each suite, efficient and sustainable VRV air-conditioning, 40\" plasma TV with international channels, complimentary wired and wireless internet, safe deposit box, coffee & tea making facilities, private semi open-air bathroom with luxurious rain shower, luxurious bathroom amenities, hairdryer and bathrobe, daily turndown service, and many more.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-07-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4848994,'50','Debora Mazuecos Lopez',30852,202033,'Villa Surya - One Bedroom Private Pool and Tropical Garden','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-07-22','2024-07-24','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',7470400.00,'Our cozy one bed Villa Surya is perfect for a solo traveler or a romantic getaway at 150 sqm private property. The spacious bedroom features a king-size bed with an extra thick mattress with 100% cotton linen, ensuring a blissful sleep. With high-ceilings, large windows, and a pivoting door onto your patio, the space is able to breathe whilst being basked in a beautiful, natural light. The ensuite bathroom, equipped with a bespoke basin area, rainfall shower, quality toiletries and 100% cotton towels leads out to the real star of this villa, the indulgent open-air bathtub. Large enough for two, with views of your private pool and tropical garden, while away hours in pure relaxation.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-07-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4848995,'50','Debora Mazuecos Lopez',30711,200830,'Bisma Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-07-24','2024-07-27','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',13608000.00,'Spacious one-bedroom suite of 88 sqm with private balcony for a sophisticated Ubud getaway. Interiors feature extensive use of wood and fine Indonesian textiles and art, lending an understated elegance to the space. Featuring a private balcony, this room includes a flat-screen TV and an en-suite bathroom with a bathtub and a shower, and many more.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-07-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4848997,'50','Debora Mazuecos Lopez',30930,202592,'One Bedroom Bungalow','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-07-27','2024-07-29','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',5824000.00,'Room size : 37 sqm. Our One-Bedroom Bungalow is a unique Romantic Eco-Boho Bungalow nestles in Green Escape Resort. You will stay in a sumptuous air-conditioned bungalow that has been handcrafted using recycled wood and tastefully decorated to offer you an authentic Balinese getaway. It\'s the very epitome of a tranquil escape. This Bungalow offers a deluxe king-size bed and a daybed to relax. It offers a comfy mattress, as we know the benefits of a good night’s sleep. The semi-outdoor bathroom with a rain shower will help you revive yourself. Enjoy the comfy sofa on your private terrace which opens onto the exotic garden & pool. The daybed can be used to extend the sleeping capacity of your private bungalow.','50% Deposit Payment - 2.600.000 IDR - is required to confirm their booking within 7 days - Please pay before 7 November 2023.','HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-07-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4848998,'50','Debora Mazuecos Lopez',30728,208150,'Aik Belek / Waterfalls','Confirmed','EXC 10',1,'2024-07-21','2024-07-21','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',2028000.00,'This is featuring Lendang Bajur morning market before you reach Pusuk Pass, for its beautiful scenery of green hills and valley, where, wild monkey also expecting you to come with peanuts and bananas. The highlight of the trip is Sendang Gile waterfall. On the way back you can also stop by Malimbu hill for photo taking. Lunch is served at local restaurant.','The above rates valid for tours starting from Senggigi / Mataram Area. Additional charge will be apply for tours starting Kuta / Oberoi.',NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-21\", \"text\": \"Jalan Raya, Senggigi, Kec. Batu Layar, Kabupaten Lombok Barat, Nusa Tenggara Barat\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sudamala Resort, Senggigi\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(4849253,'50','Debora Mazuecos Lopez',30508,207384,'Padang Bai to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-24','2024-07-24','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (1-3)',1120000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-24\", \"text\": \"ETA 12.30 from Gili Air by Gili Gili Fast Boat\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbourt\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-24\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Bisma\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(4849276,'51','Marina Torrandel',30620,200813,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-06-25','2024-06-29','Jacob','Komang',1,'Double',3808000.00,'24 units (10 twin bed and 14 double bed) of 35 sqm each deluxe rooms with garden view are modern‐minimalism designed. Advance, facilities such as LCD TV, coffee/tea maker, balcony/terrace, safety deposit box, minibar, and complete bathroom facilities.','Inclusive of 21% Government Tax and Service Charge.',NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4850483,'52','DUMAS PHILIPPE',30671,200626,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-02-16','2024-02-17','Rendy','Tami',1,'Double',1170400.00,'De