e and satellite channels, free access internet & Wi-Fi, in room safe, coffee/tea maker, mini cooler, private bathroom with shower and hair dryer, and many more.','The contract rate is included to 21% government tax & service charge.','Guaranteed early check-in starting 09.00 AM on 24 February 2024. Check-out time is 12.00.','{\"date\": \"2024-02-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-02-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4861129,'47','Jayne Winter',30683,203335,'Mini-stay Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-02-01','2024-02-01','Rendy','Tami',1,'Double',504000.00,'Feel at home in one of our Superior Rooms - warm colors giving an inviting feel and ambiance. Although you are in the heart of Soekarno - Hatta Airport you can find a small oasis of relaxation where you will leave the hustle and bustle of traveling far behind Spacious 24 square meters Superior room with a king or twin beds offering comfortable stay equipped with modern facilities such as air conditioning, arm chair, work desk & chair, flat screen TV with cable and satellite channels, free access internet & Wi-Fi, in room safe, coffee/tea maker, mini cooler, private bathroom with shower and hair dryer, and many more.','Room usage for up to 6 hours Earliest check-in time 09.00 Latest check-out time 23.00','One-way transfer to Terminal 3 ETD: 00.15 by Emirates EK359 to Dubai on 02 Feb','{\"date\": \"2024-02-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-02-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4861554,'51','Marina Torrandel',30915,202450,'Ocean View Lodge Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-07-01','2024-07-03','Jacob','Komang',1,'Double',13761840.00,'The Ocean View Lodge is located between the two resort pools. There is only one room of this particular room type. The only lodge that sits on the cliffside, featuring the mesmerizing view and sounds of the Indian Ocean. The expanse landscape of Balangan Cliff can be viewed from the comfort of your room. With your own private plunge pool in front of your door step, guests can enjoy an intimate sundowner while catching an unblocked view of the sunset. Enjoy the sounds of the ocean waves at the comfort of your private outdoor terrace. If you wish to get more sun privately after a swim at our common pools, sun loungers are also included in this room. The front of the room is made up of wood-framed glass panels which allows natural light to flood through the room. And tropical plants sit on the side of the room which refreshes your senses.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4861589,'51','Marina Torrandel',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-25','2024-06-25','Jacob','Komang',2,'Persons (1-3)',784000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-25\", \"text\": \"ETA : 16.35 by Emirates EK368 from Dubai on 25 Jun 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"International Ngurah Rai Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-25\", \"text\": \"Pertiwi Bisma 2 Ubud, Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 981386\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(4861614,'51','Marina Torrandel',30508,207379,'Ubud to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-29','2024-06-29','Jacob','Komang',2,'Persons (1-3)',1200000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated