stle of traveling far behind Spacious 24 square meters Superior room with a king or twin beds offering comfortable stay equipped with modern facilities such as air conditioning, arm chair, work desk & chair, flat screen TV with cable and satellite channels, free access internet & Wi-Fi, in room safe, coffee/tea maker, mini cooler, private bathroom with shower and hair dryer, and many more.','Room usage for up to 6 hours Earliest check-in time 09.00 Latest check-out time 23.00','Including transfer between terminals ETA: 10.10 by Garuda Indonesia GA683 from Sorong on 24 Feb ETD: 18.00 by Singapore Airlines SQ963 to Singapore on 24 Feb','{\"date\": \"2024-02-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-02-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4882794,'79','Roberto Andrea Maria VASILE',30719,201080,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-01-02','2024-01-03','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Double',896000.00,'Swiss-Belhotel Sorong boast 126 guest rooms in Sorong with all the comforts you would expect from an international chain of four-star hotels in Sorong. Enjoy 37-inch LED TVs, cable channels, high-speed internet access and a full range of other amenities that will make your stay here the most comfortable one possible.','- Rates are inclusive of 21% Government Tax & Service. - Rates are valid for all market (local & foreigner). - Rate not valid for New Year.','Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel.','{\"date\": \"2024-01-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-01-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4882795,'79','Roberto Andrea Maria VASILE',30719,201085,'Airport transfer with Innov