e 12.00','{\"date\": \"2024-02-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-02-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4882818,'81','Daniel Boss',30959,212511,'One-way Airport Transfer','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-02-04','2024-02-04','Rendy','Tami',2,'Per Car',336000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-02-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-02-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(4883417,'83','Olive Penelope HOBBS',31083,203861,'4D3N LOB Rinca - Padar - Komodo Island Tour (Base Standard AC Option 1)','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-03-08','2024-03-11','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Person (1)',31800000.00,'TOUR ITINERARY 02 January / Day 01: Labuan Bajo - Manjerite - Kelor - Kalong Island Arrival at Komodo Airport in Labuan Bajo in the West of flores Island. Our guide will be waiting for you at the airport to transfer you to the Labuan Bajo pier. During this first day aboard a traditional boat we will visit the Menjarite and Kalong islands. We will sail for about 3 hours until we reach our first stop, Menjarite Island, where we can snorkel and relax. Then in the afternoon, we will sail to Kalong Island (Flying Fox Island). Here you will be able to see the incredible thousands of flying foxes that come out of the mangroves at sunset time 18:00 - 19:00, the beautiful sunset is really nice and can be seen from the boat. This is really a spectacle of nature. Then we will move to the island of PADAR island for the night. We will end the day enjoying a delicious dinner prepared by the crew and spend the night on the boat. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Boat Cabin Air conditioning 03 January / Day 02: Padar - Komodo - Pink Beach Get up early about 5.30 for hiking Padar Island and this moment best time for getting sunrise and takes us directly to the famous view of the three bays. We continued directly towards Loh Liang, the Ranger station on Komodo Island. We will pass around many small islands and in 2 and a half hours we will arrive at the Komodo Island pier. After registering, we will do a gentle trekking to see the giant curl/komodo dragon and other wild animals such as: Timor deer, wild boar, wild chicken and many species of tropical birds. A local ranger will guide you through the hike. You will return to the boat to head to a pink sand beach for snorkeling, swimming and relaxing. It is really spectacular, as well as the virgin coral reef with lots of colorful fish. This is one of the best places to snorkel. We will end the day enjoying a delicious dinner prepared by the crew and spend the night on the boat. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Boat Cabin Air conditioning 04 January / Day 03: Pink Beach - Manta Point - Taka Makassar - Manta Point - Sepayur Today we will sail to the Manta Point, where we will have the opportunity to explore giant mantas snorkeling, we will even be able to observe them from the boat (it cannot be guaranteed if the weather is not good, or there are strong waves and currents). Then we will have time to visit Taka Makassar, one of the most emblematic places that exist in the Komodo archipelago. The beautiful underwater scenery for snorkeling activity and fun on the crescent-shaped atoll. Lunch will be provided on board. In the afternoon we will sail to the island of Sebayur to snorkel and spend the night. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Boat Cabin Air conditioning 05 January / Day 04: Sebayur - Kanawa - Labuan Bajo - Airport As you have seen, Komodo National Park is much more than dragons. The clarity of its waters and beaches of white sand and corals are other strengths of this park. After breakfast on the boat, we will sail to Kanawa Island to do more snorkeling and relax while sunbathing on the beach. Enjoy your last moments in this beautiful destination. Then, we continue to Labuan Bajo airport to catch the flight to your next destination. Thank you for enjoying this Komodo Liveaboard with Come2Indonesia. We are waiting for you on other trips. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : - Attention: The itinerary is subject to change due to the weather, tide level and operating conditions without prior notice','What to bring: Small Size of Luggage, Sun block, Hat, Sun Glasses, Trekking Shoes (sport shoes) Swimming suit, Cash Money for Personal Expenses, etc',NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-03-08\", \"text\": \"ETA: 09.20 by Batik Air ID6333 from Denpasar on 08 Mar\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Labuan Bajo Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-03-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"La Cecile Hotel Labuan Bajo\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(4883517,'83','Olive Penelope HOBBS',30700,204108,'Deluxe Double Sea View Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-03-11','2024-03-12','Rendy','Komang',1,'Single',1080000.00,'This double room features a balcony, air conditioning and flat-screen TV. Inside bathroom there\'s facilities; free toiletries, shower, bidet, toilet, towels, slippers, shared toilet, hairdryer. Entertainment inside the room the guest can use free Wi-Fi in all rooms, pool facilities, satellite/cable channels, telephone. Dining, drinking, and snacking inside the room; coffee/tea maker, free bottled water, refrigerator.','All rates are quoted in Indonesia Rupiah (IDR), based on per room per night, valid for single or double occupancy per room','Please consult your departure transfer upon check-in','{\"date\": \"2024-03-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-03-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4883760,'84','Alain DELCOURT',30719,201080,'Deluxe Room','Confirm