e is per car/way (max. 4 guests)',NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-02-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-02-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(4883885,'85','14D13N BALI ( UBUD – NUSA PENIDA ) – GILI – BALI (SEMINYAK ) SPE',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-19','2024-06-19','Melysa','Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',420000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-19\", \"text\": \"ETA: QR 960 T 19JUN FROM DOH / 2310 BY QATAR AIRWAYS\", \"time\": \"23:10\", \"locality\": \"DENPASAR AIRPORT\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-19\", \"text\": \"TEJAPRANA BISMA ADDRESS : Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 PHONE : +62812 37230707 / +62361 6207070\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(4884696,'86','Enid TANENHAUS',30671,200626,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-02','2024-10-03','Rendy','Eddy',1,'Double',1232000.00,'Deluxe Room with a room area of 28 square meters each, there are 2 types of bed, king and twin bed with a size of 28 square meters each.',NULL,'Flights information: ETA: 22.40 by Singapore Airlines SQ759 from Singapore on 02 Oct ETD: 09.20 by Garuda Indonesia GA600 to Manado on 03 Oct','{\"date\": \"2024-10-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4887129,'89','Ms. Angelica Abela & Mr. Steve Michael Muscat',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-04-25','2024-04-25','Ayu','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-04-25\", \"text\": \"ETA 16.35 by Emirates EK368 from Dubai on 25 April 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Tejaprana Bisma\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(4887150,'89','Ms. Angelica Abela & Mr. Steve Michael Muscat',30623,200589,'Valley Villa','Confirmed',NULL,5,'2024-04-25','2024-04-30','Ayu','Tami',1,'Double',15680000.00,'The Valley View Villas are located on the lowest level of the hotel grounds. This ensures guests have a clear view of the jungle valley below and complete privacy. The bedroom features a King-sized bed, and the 100 m2 floor area gives guests lots of space inside, in addition to the beautiful outdoor area. Lounge on a chair on the personal terrace with gazebo, take a plunge in the infinity pool, or let the daily worries of life drift away in the outdoor natural stone bathtub. Air conditioning and a private bathroom with bathtub, along with many other amenities, add to the comfort level of these villas.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-04-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4887162,'89','Ms. Angelica Abela & Mr. Steve Michael Muscat',30508,207112,'1D Trip to Nusa Penida West Trip','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-04-27','2024-04-27','Ayu','Tami',2,'Persons (2 / Double)',952000.00,'Today we will live a different day in neighboring Nusa Penida. We will pick you up at your hotel to go to the port and there take the fast boat to Nusa Penida. After approximately 30 minutes fast, we will arrive at the paradise island of southeast Bali. There we will be waiting for you to start your route. Our first stop will be Angel’s Billabong, a natural paradise in the form of a natural pool. If you want to take a bath, be careful with the steps and follow your driver’s recommendation. From here we will go to Broken Beach, a small bay that was once a cave and has been losing the roof over time. We can not access by land but the view from above is beautiful and with a bit of luck, we can see giant manta rays swimming on the surface. Our next stop will be Kelingking Beach, one of the most famous and photographed beaches on the island with its cliffs and the hand-shaped mountain. And we will end the day with relaxing in Crystal Beach, a white sand beach and turquoise waters. Afternoon, we transfer you back to the harbor to catch a fast boat return to Bali.',NULL,'ETA : 08.30 from Kusamba by The Angkal Fast Boat ETD : 16.00 to Kusamba by The Angkal Fast Boat','{\"date\": \"2024-04-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(4887247,'89','Ms. Angelica Abela & Mr. Steve Michael Muscat',30508,213032,'Ubud to Kusamba','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-04-27','2024-04-27','Ayu','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-04-27\", \"text\": \"ETD : 08.00 from Kusamba - Sampalan by The Angkal Fast Boat\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Tejaprana Bisma\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(4889027,'91','Mark Krag',30719,201080,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-02-10','2024-02-11','Rendy','Eddy',1,'Twin',896000.00,'Swiss-Belhotel Sorong boast 126 guest rooms in Sorong with all the comforts you would expect from an international chain of four-star hotels in Sorong. Enjoy 37-inch LED TVs, cable channel