ibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel.','{\"date\": \"2024-03-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-03-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4890697,'96','Joanna Newton',30683,203330,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-03-25','2024-03-26','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Single',974400.00,'Step into one of our comfortable and spacious Deluxe Rooms. Here you can kick back and relax at ease and prepare for your next flight or meeting. Spacious 24 square meters deluxe room with a king or twin beds offering comfortable stay equipped with modern facilities such as air conditioning, arm chair, work desk & chair, flat screen TV with cable and satellite channels, free access internet & Wi-Fi, in room safe, coffee/tea maker, mini cooler, private bathroom with shower and hair dryer, and many more.','The contract rate is included to 21% government tax & service charge.','Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel.','{\"date\": \"2024-03-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-03-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4890882,'89','Ms. Angelica Abela & Mr. Steve Michael Muscat',32210,212636,'Junior Suite','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-04-30','2024-05-02','Ayu','Tami',1,'Double',3024000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-04-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4890892,'89','Ms. Angelica Abela & Mr. Steve Michael Muscat',30720,202971,'Bungalow Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-02','2024-05-03','Ayu','Tami',1,'Double',2240000.00,'Featuring essential home-style comforts, the cozy Bungalow category is enveloped by exotic flora and exudes old-world Balinese charm. Set amidst tropical landscape, this air-conditioned room comes with a private balcony, flat-screen cable TV and a safety deposit box. En suite bathroom comes with shower facilities.',NULL,'Honeymooners','{\"date\": \"2024-05-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4890929,'89','Ms. Angelica Abela & Mr. Steve Michael Muscat',30650,208425,'Private Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-05-03','2024-05-05','Ayu','Tami',1,'Double',4480000.00,'Each villa embraces calmness, comfort and privacy in a simple and elegant setting. Guests can relax while peacefully sipping drinks in an inviting plunge pool surrounded by a lush tropical garden and at an old-wooden deck terrace where they can have a peaceful siesta on the large-bean bags or day-bed mattress.',NULL,'Honeymooners','{\"date\": \"2024-05-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4890934,'89','Ms. Angelica Abela & Mr. Steve Michael Muscat',30508,207384,'Padang Bai to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-05','2024-05-05','Ayu','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-05\", \"text\": \"ETA 13.55 Gili Air - Padang Bai by BlueWater Express\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Mason Elephant Park & Lodge\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(4890936,'89','Ms. Angelica Abela & Mr. Steve Michael Muscat',31802,209048,'Garden View Room (Include meal)','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-05-05','2024-05-07','Ayu','Tami',1,'Double',9184000.00,'Our standard cozy, elephant-inspired rooms, surrounded by our lush botanical garden setting. These rooms include our ‘elephant chauffeur’ from your doorstep service. Air conditioning, Alarm clock, Bathrobe, Electronic door locks, Extra bed, Laundry service, Mini Bar, Tea and coffee maker, Work desk, Ceiling fan, Books in room, Turn down service, Torchlight, In Room Safe, Non-smoking rooms available',NULL,'Honeymooners','{\"date\": \"2024-05-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4890938,'89','Ms. Angelica Abela & Mr. Steve Michael Muscat',30508,202897,'Uluwatu Temple and Kecak Dance','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-07','2024-05-07','Ayu','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1836000.00,'This half-day tour, is an exciting tour package to visit Padang-Padang Beach, Uluwatu Temple, the famous Balinese Hindu Temple in south part of Bali with breathtaking view of sunset and Indian Ocean. Uluwatu Temple is one of Balinese Hindu Temples located right on the petrifying hill with the crevasse exist in the right and left side. Uluwatu Temple is one of Sad Khayangan (6 biggest temple in Bali) owns magnificent view of the Indian Ocean and sunset as a backdrop. This temple is very amazing where the location is right on the narrow peninsula with deep seawater under it. This tour package is combined with the spectacular Balinese traditional dance performance of Kecak Dance. Balinese Kecak Dance is a spectacular traditional dance with the group of people playing this dance with fire game. It is very exciting and unique dance due to the sound of gamelan is not using the normal gamelan but use their mouth. The dancers make the compact choir with the exquisite dance movement that is one of this dance features. After the dance we returned back to the hotel or seafood restaurant in Jimbaran.',NULL,'Pick up at Bali Niksoma at 13.00 for Uluwatu Temple Tour Please be ready at hotel\'s lobby','{\"date\": \"2024-05-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"10:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Mason Elephant Park & Lodge\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Bali Niksoma\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(4890940,'89','Ms. Angelica Abela & Mr. Steve Michael Muscat',30596,201103,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-07','2024-05-08','Ayu','Tami',1,'Double',2296000.00,'Contemporary and sleek 38-sqm room with dark furnishing adapting the latest in style with tropical modern touches. Thirty-four rooms in three storey building with private balcony where some are facing directly to the ocean and others to inner garden. Featuring cozy twin beds and a relaxation corner with a comfortable cushioned sofa or perfect for couples and solo travelers seeking a spacious double bed. Our room offers premium linens, plush pillows, a peaceful ambiance and a large picture window that leads to a private balcony, allowing you to immerse yourself in the tropical beauty of the outdoors to recharge after a day of activities. Enjoy high-speed internet, a flat-screen TV, coffee and tea-making facilities, and an in-room safe deposit box, ensuring a convenient and enjoyable stay.',NULL,'Honeymooners','{\"date\": \"2024-05-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4890942,'89','Ms. Angelica Abela & Mr. Steve Michael Muscat',30508,212566,'Legian to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-08','2024-05-08','Ayu','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-08\", \"text\": \"ETD 19.50 by Emirates EK369 to Dubai on 08 May 2024\", \"time\": \"15:50\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Bali Niksoma\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(4891957,'97','Janet Pelton Camp',30671,200626,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-03-26','2024-03-27','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Double',2400000.00,'Deluxe Room with a room area of 28 square meters each, there are 2 types of bed, king and twin bed with a size of 28 square meters each.',NULL,'Flights information: ETA: 13.20 by EVA BR27 from Taipei on 26 Mar ETD: 00.10 by Garuda Indonesia GA682 to Sorong on 27 Mar','{\"date\": \"2024-03-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-03-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4893975,'98','Simon Camenzuli',30806,213012,'3D2N Borneo Orangutan Tour - Super Deluxe II, III, IV, V','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-06-12','2024-06-14','Ayu','Ayu',2,'Persons (2 / Double)',21759584.00,NULL,NULL,'3D2N Orangutan Tour with English Speaking Guide Boat: Super Deluxe Houseboat Flight details: ETA 07.15 by Batik Air ID6202 from Jakarta on 12 June 2024 ETD 10.25 by Batik Air ID6303 to Semarang on 14 June 2024','{\"date\": \"2024-06-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(4893995,'98','Simon Camenzuli',30665,200975,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-06-17','2024-06-19','Ayu','Ayu',1,'Double',6624000.00,'A wonderful accommodation for a luxurious stay with an area of 30 sqm, magnificent view and features one king-sized bed with a capacity of 2 adults, private bathroom with shower room and access to sharing living room.','- Published rates are subject to 21% prevailing government tax and service charge. - Contract rates quoted are net rate and non-commissionable. Inclusive of 21% prevailing government tax and service charge. Applicable strictly for the sole use of the Company.','Honeymooners','{\"date\": \"2024-06-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4894001,'98','Simon Camenzuli',30682,200889,'Resort\'s Deluxe','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-20','2024-06-21','Ayu','Ayu',1,'Double',1898400.00,'Beautiful Hotel in Banyuwangi, East Java. Ijen Resort and Villas Close with Ijen Crater, very recommended place to stay with great view from your room. You can directly enjoy the mountain view or rice field view. Also can enjoy some great facility such us swimming pool with the great view near ijen mountain, in Banyuwangi.',NULL,'Honeymooners','{\"date\": \"2024-06-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4894008,'98','Simon Camenzuli',30508,202892,'Ruta Fantastica','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-23','2024-06-23','Ayu','Ayu',2,'Persons (2)',1872000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,'FD Tour Bedugul - Tanah Lot with English Speaking Guide Visits: Taman Ayun - Jatiluwih - Ulun Danu Bratan Temple - Tanah Lot','{\"date\": \"2024-06-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Kayon Resort Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Kayon Resort Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(4894011,'98','Simon Camenzuli',30508,207379,'Ubud to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-25','2024-06-25','Ayu','Ayu',1,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'Transfer Ubud - Padang Bai Harbor Boat detail: ETD 12:15 by BlueWater Express','{\"date\": \"2024-06-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Kayon Resort Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"