-06-29','2024-06-29','Ayu','Ayu',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'Transfer from Mason Elephant Park and Lodge to Melia Bali Nusa Dua Hotel','{\"date\": \"2024-06-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"12:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Mason Elephant Park and Lodge\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Melia Bali Nusa Dua\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(4896212,'98','Simon Camenzuli',30579,202490,'Melia Room Garden View','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-06-29','2024-07-01','Ayu','Ayu',1,'Double',5208000.00,'Decorated in wood, this room provides access to a tropical garden and has a king-size bed (or two single beds) and a 43-inch TV. It also provides a luxury bathtub and a rain shower.',NULL,'Honeymooners','{\"date\": \"2024-06-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4896213,'98','Simon Camenzuli',30508,202897,'Uluwatu Temple and Kecak Dance','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-30','2024-06-30','Ayu','Ayu',2,'Persons (2)',1836000.00,'This half-day tour, is an exciting tour package to visit Padang-Padang Beach, Uluwatu Temple, the famous Balinese Hindu Temple in south part of Bali with breathtaking view of sunset and Indian Ocean. Uluwatu Temple is one of Balinese Hindu Temples located right on the petrifying hill with the crevasse exist in the right and left side. Uluwatu Temple is one of Sad Khayangan (6 biggest temple in Bali) owns magnificent view of the Indian Ocean and sunset as a backdrop. This temple is very amazing where the location is right on the narrow peninsula with deep seawater under it. This tour package is combined with the spectacular Balinese traditional dance performance of Kecak Dance. Balinese Kecak Dance is a spectacular traditional dance with the group of people playing this dance with fire game. It is very exciting and unique dance due to the sound of gamelan is not using the normal gamelan but use their mouth. The dancers make the compact choir with the exquisite dance movement that is one of this dance features. After the dance we returned back to the hotel or seafood restaurant in Jimbaran.',NULL,'HD Tour Padang Padang Beach - Uluwatu Temple - Kecak Dance Performance with English Speaking Guide','{\"date\": \"2024-06-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"14:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Melia Bali Nusa Dua\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Melia Bali Nusa Dua\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(4896214,'98','Simon Camenzuli',30508,207268,'Nusa Dua to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-01','2024-07-01','Ayu','Ayu',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'Transfer Melia Bali Nusa Dua - Airport Flight detail: ETD 21.20 by Turkish Airlines TK67 to Istanbul on 01 Jul','{\"date\": \"2024-07-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"17:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Melia Bali Nusa Dua\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(4897766,'101','Olaf Schaefer',30671,200626,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-02-02','2024-02-03','Rendy','Febrina',1,'Double',1064000.00,'Deluxe Room with a room area of 28 square meters each, there are 2 types of bed, king and twin bed with a size of 28 square meters each.',NULL,'Flights information: ETA: 14.40 by Qatar Airways QR956 from Doha on 02 Feb ETD: 00.10 by Garuda Indonesia GA682 to Sorong on 03 Feb','{\"date\": \"2024-02-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": n