otel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.','08 Mar 2024 : Transfer From Hotel The Patra to Denapsar Airport','Transfer from Hotel to Denpasar Airport Pick up time : 06.30 AM at The Patra Resort Flight : ETD: 09.40 by Qatar Airways QR965 to Doha on 08 Mar','{\"date\": \"2024-03-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-03-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(4951781,'112','Susanna Josephine HARRISON',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-02-10','2024-02-11','Rendy','Komang',1,'Double',728000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. Please consult your departure transfer upon check-in.','{\"date\": \"2024-02-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-02-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4951804,'131','Nadine Dubois',30671,200626,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-03-25','2024-03-26','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Double',1120000.00,'Deluxe Room with a room area of 28 square meters each, there are 2 types of bed, king and twin bed with a size of 28 square meters each.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-03-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-03-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4953688,'152','Lisa Petersen​',30662,212912,'(Journaway) 7D6N Medan - Bukit Lawang - Brastagi - Lake Toba','Confirmed',NULL,7,'2024-02-08','2024-02-14','Rendy','Agus',2,'Persons (2-3 / Double)',21268800.00,'Day-01 : AIRPORT/MEDAN - BUKIT LAWANG Arrival at Kualanamu International Airport Medan meet by our tour guide and then drive to Bukit Lawang with enroute stop at several plantations for rubber and oil palm. Arriving in Bukit Lawang check-in to hotel. Meals : - • Overnight at : Eco-lodge Bukit Lawang Cottages - Standard Room Day-02 : BUKIT LAWANG - LEUSER PARK TREKKING (B,L,D) After breakfast walking to the jungle to start a jungle trekking to explore the nature of Leuser National Park with its rich flora and fauna, there will be chances to see Orangutans on their own natural habitat and other kinds of animal such as Thomas-leaf monkeys, long tail macaque, gibbon, black gibbon and other kind of flora and fauna of this tropical rain-forest. Lunch and dinner provided. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner • Overnight at : Tent or Shelter in the jungle Day-03 : CONTINUE TREKKING - RETURN TO BUKIT LAWANG (TUBING) (B,L) After breakfast prepared by tour guide continue trekking, today is full day walking and explore the rain tropical forest with its wildlife living in their natural habitat. In mid-afternoon, we will make our way back by tubing in the river. At the end, we will return to the hotel for check-in. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch • Overnight at : Eco-lodge Bukit Lawang Cottages - Standard Room Day-04 : BUKIT LAWANG - BERASTAGI (B) After breakfast drive to Berastagi with enroute stop at Sembahe river, arriving in Berastagi visiting Lumbhini Park to see the replica of the Shwedagon pagoda, and visit at Fruit Market. In mid-afternoon check-in to hotel. Meals : Breakfast • Overnight at : Mikie Holiday Resort - Superior Room • Alternative : Hotel Sinabung Hills - Superior Room Day-05 : SIBAYAK VOLCANO HIKING - TRANSFER TO SAMOSIR/LAKE TOBA (B) At early morning (take away your Breakfast Box) and transferred to the slope of Sibayak Volcano and then start hiking to the top of the Sibayak Volcano, to go and back will spend about 3 hours. Arriving on its peak enjoy the scenic panorama of its surroundings and the sunrise (weather depends). After take a rest and enjoy its view, start trekking back to Berastagi and then continuing the drive head for Samosir Island in Lake Toba via TELE. En-route stop at : • Dokan (to see the traditional village of the Batak Karo tribe) • Sipisopiso Waterfall (from here you can admire the scenic view of the Lake Toba from its northern tip combined with the slender 90 meters high waterfall) • Tele (a nice place for over-viewing the lake from its western part) • Efrata (another beautiful waterfall found on the way to Samosir Island) • Lumban Suhi-suhi (to see the Tobanase traditional houses where we could observe also the women doing the weaving) In mid-afternoon arriving at Tuktuk area on Samosir and check-in to hotel. Meals : Breakfast • Overnight at : Tabo Cottages - Deluxe Room • Alternative : Samosir Villa - Deluxe Room Day-06: SAMOSIR EXCURSION - AIRPORT/MEDAN CITY (B) After breakfast we start for our fullday excursion by car in the interior of Samosir Island with en-route visits at : • Ambarita (to see the stone chairs and tables where once used as the execution site by the ancient tribal chieftains) • Aek Natonang (here we can see the small lake found of the top of Samosir Island and its panorama view) • Tomok (to see the old sarcophages belonged to former Sidabutar Kings and his descendants) At mid-day, we will return to the harbor to catch the 1 PM ferry back to Parapat (1 hour sailing duration). Arriving at Parapat harbour continue the driving directly to Medan via Pematang Siantar and Tebing Tinggi (about 5 hours driving time). We will drop you off at the airport for overnight at airport hotel and be ready for morning flight departure. Meals : Breakfast Overnight: Hotel Horison Sky Kualanamu - Deluxe Room Day-07 : DEPARTURE After an early breakfast, you will continue to the departure terminal for your flight. TOUR ENDS. Meals : Breakfast','- All the above prices are not valid during Super High Season period for Idul Fitri (01-20 April 2024), Christmas & New Year festive season (18 December 2024 - 08 January 2025). - Surcharge to be advised','Per confirmed program: Day-01: AIRPORT/MEDAN – BUKIT LAWANG Day-02: BUKIT LAWANG – GUNUNG LEUSER NATIONAL PARK TREKKING Day-03: CONTINUE TREKKING – RETURN TO BUKIT LAWANG Day-04: BUKIT LAWANG – BERASTAGI Day-05: SIBAYAK VOLCANO HIKING – TRANSFER TO SAMOSIR/LAKE TOBA Day-06: SAMOSIR EXCURSION – AIRPORT/MEDAN CITY Day-07: DEPARTURE MEDAN Accommodation based on 1 Double Room: 2 Nights at Bukit Lawang Eco-Lodge – Butterfly Room 1 Night in Tent/shelter 1 Night Grand Mutiara Hotel – Standard Room 1 Nights at Tabo Cottages – Deluxe Room 1 Night at Hotel Anara Sky Kualanamu - Deluxe Room Flights information ETA: 10.15 by Batik Air ID7289 from Kuala Lumpur on 08 Feb ETD: 10.30 by Batik Air ID7147 to Singapore on 14 Feb','{\"date\": \"2024-02-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-02-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(4955534,'153','BARBARA GHIZZONI',30671,200626,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-08-09','2024-08-11','Ayu','Eddy',1,'Double',2240000.00,'Deluxe Room with a room area of 28 square meters each, there are 2 types of bed, king and twin bed with a size of 28 square meters each.',NULL,'Guests will arrive in the morning of 10 August 2024','{\"date\": \"20