200640,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-02','2024-05-03','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Twin',1638000.00,'Equipped with either a king size or deluxe twin beds, our Deluxe Rooms are designed for modern travellers who seek comfort while staying in Bromo.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4957948,'158','Sabrina Denise Roth',30803,202852,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-04','2024-05-05','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Twin',780000.00,'At 25 sqm of room size with 46 rooms available. This smart room category is more contemporary in appearance and comes with its own terrace or balcony. Minimalist furnishings are balanced by a neutral decor to soothe the senses and ensure restful slumber. Including a double bed (king or queen) or 2 single beds (twin) with maximum capacity of 2 adults + 1 child or 3 adults. The en-suite bathroom features a modern shower cubicle enclosed in glass together with a marble vanity.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4957951,'158','Sabrina Denise Roth',30571,202567,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-05','2024-05-06','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Twin',1290000.00,'Located at the Second Floor, 35 sqm comfort living with a touch of Balinese style featuring completed fitting, Cable TV , a fancy bathroom comprises rain shower and good quality amenities. Also dedicated Wi-Fi Access to complete your day.',NULL,'Flight details ETD : 08.00 by Batik Air ID6333 to Labuan Bajo on 06 May 2024','{\"date\": \"2024-05-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4957967,'158','Sabrina Denise Roth',31083,213614,'5D4N Flores Highlights','Confirmed',NULL,5,'2024-05-06','2024-05-10','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Persons (2-3 / Double)',18756000.00,'TOUR ITINERARY DAY 1 : DENPASAR - MAUMERE / ENDE - MONI Upon arrival in MAUMERE meet and greet with our Tour Guide and driving directly to Moni. Visit Sikka Village to see the oldest Portuguese church heritage and ikat weaving, also Stop at Paga Beach and Koka beach for relaxing and beach-walking. On arrival at Moni checking in at Kelimutu Ecolodge / Kelimutu Paradiso Resort. Lunch en route, dinner at local restaurant in Moni. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Kelimutu Ecolodge DAY 2 : MONI - KELIMUTU - BAJAWA It’s worth to experience the sun rise at Kelimutu three colored crater lakes, you will begin your day early in the morning (start about 04.00 o’clock). Last update: 15 Jul 2013, typical eruption style: Explosive, Kelimutu volcano eruptions: 1968, 1938, and 1865. Kelimutu (Keli Mutu) volcano in central Flores, Indonesia, is famous for its 3 colorful acid crater lakes, where different salts and oxides in suspension or solution give the lakes varying colors ranging from blue and dark green to intense red. In historic times, few small phreatic explosions have been the only activity at the volcano. The scenic craters with their lakes are popular tourist destinations. Background: The western lake, Tiwu Ata Mbupu (Lake of Old People) is commonly blue. Tiwu Nua Muri Kooh Tai (Lake of Young Men and Maidens) and Tiwu Ata Polo (Bewitched, or Enchanted Lake), which share a common crater wall, are commonly green- and red-coloured, respectively, although lake colours vary periodically. During the dry season reduction processes let Ba, Cu, and As minerals precipitate, in the wet season, the oxidation and precipitation of iron minerals (ferric oxide: Fe2O3) produces intense red colors. Active upwelling occurs at the two eastern lakes and is probably fed by subaqueous fumaroles. Kelimutu volcano is flanked by the older cones of Kelido and Kelibara 3 km to the north and 2 km to the south, respectively (Source: GVP) On the way you will experience the dramatic change in both nature pattern and ethnicity. You could be found yourself in the Lio ethnic’s environment – pay at call to their village Wologai and try to comprehend the locals daily life or just having closer look into their work of architectures. Lunch will be served at a local restaurant in Ende. Continue drive to Bajawa with Stop at Penggajawa Blue stone beach, here you could see local woman collect the stones to sell and building the house of garden. Before checking at hotel, drive to Soa hot spring, then checking at Virgo / Edelways Hotel. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Virgo Hotel or Edelways Hotel DAY 3 : BAJAWA - RUTENG Breakfast at hotel. Explore traditional village of Bajawa tribes. Visit Bena -a megalithic village where people do preserve their ancestral spirits believed and way of life-, which can be seen in their \"Ngadhu\" and \"Bhaga\". Ngadhu and Bhaga are conical thatched roof huts symbolized their Male and Female ancestral spirits. On the way stop on the slope of Inerie active volcano for taking pictures. Lunch will be provided enroute, then continue overland to Ruteng. Stops will be made at Aimere village to see \"arak\" distillation and fresh palm juice tapping and at \"Ranamese\" Lake, and snapshot at magnificent peak of Mt. Inerie -an active volcano-. Continue overland to Ruteng -cool and small town as the capital city of Manggarai Regency- where major Manggarainese tribe dwelt. On arrival direct check into spring hill hotel. Afternoon visit “Liang Bua” the home of Homo Florensies. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Spring Hill or Sindha or Revaya Hotel DAY 4 : RUTENG - LABUAN BAJO Breakfast at hotel. Driving to Labuan Bajo -the Western tip of Flores Island-. On the way stops will be made at Lembor or Cancar area to see the unexposed world wonder “Lingko” –The spider web shape rice fields–. It’s probably the only such a rice field ever exist on earth, then continue to Tengku lese to enjoy the fantastic Water fall, and other places according to local happenings. Lunch will be served at Local restaurant at Labuan bajo, Dinner and overnight at Puri Sari or La Cecile. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Seastra or Golo Hilltop or Puri Sari or La Cecile DAY 5 : LABUAN BAJO - DENPASAR After breakfast, taking short city sight seeing with visiting the Amelia sea view point Then local market before taking you to the airport for flight to Denpasar. Meals : Breakfast Attention: The itinerary is subject to change due to the weather, tide level and operating conditions without prior notice.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-06\", \"text\": \"ETA: 11.15 by Wings Air IW1961 from Labuan Bajo on 06 May 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Maumere Airport\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Puri Sari Beach Hotel Labuan Bajo\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(4957973,'158','Sabrina Denise Roth',31083,203795,'Komodo Island Full Day Tour (Fast Boat - Pick Up Labuan Bajo-Drop Off Seraya Island)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-10','2024-05-10','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Persons (2-3)',13524000.00,'TOUR ITINERARY Highlights: Padar Island, Komodo Island, Long Beach, Pink Beach, Manta Point & Kanawa. PICK UP / ARRIVE LABUAN BAJO - PADAR - KOMODO - PINK BEACH - MANTA POINT - LABUAHAN BAJO Pick up & meeting service with our tour guide and transfer to the pier of Labuan Bajo for sailing directly to Loh Liang – the Ranger station in Komodo Island. By passing through many small islands, it will be 3 hours with slow wooden boat and 1.50 hours by speed boat to reach the pier of Komodo island. After registering start to take basic trekking to see the GIANT RIZARD / KOMODO DRAGON and other wild animals as: Timor deer, wild pig, wild chicken and many variously of tropical bird. Please keep your look at any directions as sometimes you will also find young Komodo dragon hanging over the trees. A local ranger will be led you during the trek. Return to the boat on to Pink beach for snorkeling, swimming and relaxing. It is really spectacular and unspoiled coral reef and many color fish. Sail toward MANTA POINT to exploring Huge Mantas by snorkeling even watching from your boat trip (can’t be guaranteed if weather is not good, like wave and current are strongly). Lunch will be provided on board. Late in the afternoon back to Labuan Bajo harbor and transfer to your prefer Hotel for overnight and Dinner. Meals : Lunch Attention: The itinerary is subject to change due to the weather, tide level and operating conditions without prior notice.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(4957977,'158','Sabrina Denise Roth',30695,202097,'Beach Bungalow','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-05-10','2024-05-13','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Twin',14580000.00,'A special sanctuary designed for honeymooners or couple in romantic getaway, the beach bungalow sprawls across 32 sqm of wooden paneled space and boasts all the amenities of a tropical island living. The bungalow is equipped with premium bedding set in a four-poster elegant bed, outdoor shower and spacious wooden deck overlooking directly to the ocean. For your convenience, each beach bungalow is outfitted with air conditioner for an extra breeze to beat the tropical heat, a water heater, mini-fridge and personalized service to fill in your every need. Connecting beach bungalows are available.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-13\", \"text\": \"ETD 13.35 by ID6330 to Denpasar on 13 May\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4957981,'158','Sabrina Denise Roth',30695,212388,'One-Way Airport Transfer','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-13','2024-05-13','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Per Car',180000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(4957982,'158','Sabrina Denise Roth',30805,202740,'LBJ - DPS','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-13','2024-05-13','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Person',3520000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(4957987,'158','Sabrina Denise Roth',30508,212287,'Airport to Sanur','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-13','2024-05-13','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Persons (1-3)',300000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-13\", \"text\": \"ETA 14.55 by Batik Air ID6330 from Labuan Bajo on 13 May 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-13\", \"text\": \"Jl. Kusuma Sari No.1, Sanur, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali 80227\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Artotel Sanur\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(4958004,'158','Sabrina Denise Roth',30508,207269,'Sanur to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-16','2024-05-16','Rendy','Tami',2,'Persons (1-3)',600000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"text\": \"Jl. Kusuma Sari No.1, Sanur, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali 80227\", \"time\": \"11:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"ARTOTEL Sanur - Bali\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"text\": \"ETD 14.25 by Citilink QG1670 to Lombok on 16 May 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(4958006,'158','Sabrina Denise Roth',30805,212254,'DPS - LOP','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-16','2024-05-16','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Person',3740000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(4958012,'158','Sabrina Denise Roth',30728,208150,'Aik Belek / Waterfalls','Confirmed','EXC 10',1,'2024-05-20','2024-05-20','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Persons (2)',2028000.00,'This is featuring Lendang Bajur morning market before you reach Pusuk Pass, for its beautiful scenery of green hills and valley, where, wild monkey also expecting you to come with peanuts and bananas. The highlight of the trip is Sendang Gile waterfall. On the way back you can also stop by Malimbu hill for photo taking. Lunch is served at local restaurant.','The above rates valid for tours starting from Senggigi / Mataram Area. Additional charge will be apply for tours starting Kuta / Oberoi.',NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Mangsit Senggigi, Lombok 83355\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": \"Jeeva Santai Villas\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"text\": \"Jalan Baturiti I Kuta Lombok, 83573 Kuta Lombok\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"El Tropico Boutique Hotel\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(4958014,'158','Sabrina Denise Roth',31