osquito net upon request. This will be prepared at night and restored to a sofa in the morning for day use.',NULL,'Pickup from Kuta Lombok at 09.00 AM on 22 May: El Tropico Boutique Hotel Jalan Baturiti I Kuta Lombok, 83573 Kuta Lombok Dropoff at Lombok Airport: ETD: 15.45 by Citilink QG1673 to Denpasar on 24 May','{\"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4958026,'158','Sabrina Denise Roth',31284,205251,'Private Car Pick-up/Drop-off from Kores to Bangsal','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-24','2024-05-24','Rendy','Rendy',2,'3 /hours',1440000.00,'We do not accept check-ins after 9pm due to our remote location. NB: Please note that no commission is offered for transport arrangements made via the Lodge. Full payment must be made before the check-in date to confirm the services. Cancellation policy** & Transport Disclaimer*** apply.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(4958028,'158','Sabrina Denise Roth',31284,205229,'Fast Boat - From Gili Gede to GIli Asahan','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-24','2024-05-24','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Persons (4)',672000.00,'With the Gili Getaway fast-boat the guests can reach us from Bali and Nusa Penida in no time at all, whilst enjoying spectacular coastal views of this unique region. From Gili Gede to Gili Asahan we can arrange a local boat taxi, upon request & confirmation, The transfer takes around 20 minutes.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-