d for personal comfort and convenience, the Superior room category is an inviting space that captures the essence of Bali. At 35 sqm of room area, with double / twin bed capacity of 2A 1C or 3A with extra bed. Set amidst tropical landscape, this air-conditioned room comes with a private balcony, flat-screen cable TV and a safety deposit box. En suite bathroom comes with bath and shower facilities.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4963396,'160','CHARBONNIERE Guy',30508,212287,'Airport to Sanur','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-31','2024-08-31','Rendy','Wiwik',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-31\", \"text\": \"ETA 17.35 by Qatar QR962 from Doha on 31 August 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Denpasar Airport\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-31\", \"text\": \"Address: Jl. Cemara No.35, Sanur, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali 80228 Phone: +62 (361) 288009\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Puri Santrian Resort Sanur\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(4963719,'159','ALESSANDRO FANTIN',30571,202570,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-30','2024-08-31','Ayu','Eddy',3,'Double',4620000.00,'Located at the Third & Fourth Floor, 38 sqm comfort living with a touch of Balinese style featuring completed fitting, Cable TV , a fancy bathroom comprises rain shower and good quality amenities. Also dedicated WiFi Access to complete your day.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49