ne Bedroom Panoramic Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-04-17','2024-04-20','Melysa','Eddy',1,'Double',32778720.00,'These luxurious villas take full advantage of the peace and tranquility of the surrounding jungle, combined with the rhythmic sound of Ayung River and its cascading waterfalls below. Designed in an authentic Balinese style, Riverside Villas are perched high on wooden pillars. Their expansive decks feature a private infinity pool, poolside gazebo, shower and dining table – the ideal place to unwind and soak up the sights and sounds of the surrounding jungle.',NULL,'COMPLIMENTARY WEDDING ANNIVERSARY BENEFITS ● Flower petals on the bed and bathtub upon arrival ● Anniversary gift ● Anniversary cake ● One time 2 glasses of sparkling wine','{\"date\": \"2024-04-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(4982593,'174','Paul Fell',32195,215077,'One-way Airport Transfer','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-04-26','2024-04-26','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Per Car',224000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-04-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(4982595,'174','Paul Fell',32195,215077,'One-way Airport Transfer','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-04-27','2024-04-27','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Per Car',224000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-04-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(4983154,'147','BOUKIR MOSTAFA MR / ABDELLAOUI AICHA MRS',32338,215100,'Ubud to Tegalalang (Shared)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-04-19','2024-04-19','Melysa','Eddy',2,'Person (1)',1236480.00,'For the Ubud to Tegalalang trip, we currently do two tours per day. The morning tour starts at 9 am and the afternoon tour starts at 3 pm. If your guests are requesting a different time please contact us and we will do our best to accommodate them. The tours last about 2.5 hours.','This trip is shared with other guests.','Pick up at Lobby Hanging Gardens at 08:00 am. Important notes: - Please be ready at the lobby 5 minutes before. - We recommend you to do early breakfast in the hotel, - The driver will wait at the lobby for 15 minutes. (For those that didn\'t show up we will consider that the booking is declined, the driver will go back and you will miss the tour.)','{\"date\": \"2024-04-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(4985085,'176','Mark Taylor',30683,203329,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-06','2024-12-07','Rendy','Eddy',1,'Twin',980000.00,'Feel at home in one of our Superior Rooms - warm colors giving an inviting feel and ambiance. Although you are in the heart of Soekarno - Hatta Airport you can find a small oasis of relaxation where you will leave the hustle and bustle of traveling far behind spacious 24 square meters. Superior room with a king or twin beds offering comfortable stay equipped with modern facilities such as air conditioning, arm chair, work desk & chair, flat screen TV with cable and satellite channels, free access internet & Wi-Fi, in room safe, coffee/tea maker, mini cooler, private bathroom with shower and hair dryer, and many more.','The contract rate is included to 21% government tax & service charge.','Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel.','{\"date\": \"2024-12-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null