r a romantic getaway at 150 sqm private property. The spacious bedroom features a king-size bed with an extra thick mattress with 100% cotton linen, ensuring a blissful sleep. With high-ceilings, large windows, and a pivoting door onto your patio, the space is able to breathe whilst being basked in a beautiful, natural light. The ensuite bathroom, equipped with a bespoke basin area, rainfall shower, quality toiletries and 100% cotton towels leads out to the real star of this villa, the indulgent open-air bathtub. Large enough for two, with views of your private pool and tropical garden, while away hours in pure relaxation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-03-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-03-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5002154,'181','Scuba Travel Group - Misool March 2024',31158,204273,'Transfer Flight Domestic to Domestic - for CGK','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-03-14','2024-03-14','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Person (1)',470400.00,'Transfer is a service that provides convenience for passengers when transferring flights both departures and arrivals from and to airports throughout the world. For Domestic to domestic. Domestic Flight Transfer Services to Domestic Flights: - Meet guests at designated locations close to the door arrival. - Accompanying guests to the Transfer Desk. - Accompany guests to the departure lounge',NULL,'Arrival service: ETA: 17.00 by Garuda Indonesia GA601 from Manado on 14 Mar Assist client and escort to Jakarta Airport Hotel Pickup Service by Jakarta Airport Hotel Phone: +62811-1848-008 Departure service: Meet client at Jakarta Airport Hotel and assist for flight ETD: 00.10 by Garuda Indonesia GA682 to Sorong on 15 Mar','{\"date\": \"2024-03-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-03-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null,