om with a room area of 28 square meters each, there are 2 types of bed, king and twin bed with a size of 28 square meters each.',NULL,'Flights information ETA: 22.30 by China Eastern MU 5069 from Shanghai on 29 Apr ETD: 07.00 by Batik Air ID6542 to Kupang on 30 Apr','{\"date\": \"2024-04-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5002580,'191','ANDRE VREVEN',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-26','2024-11-27','Rendy','Eddy',1,'Double',784000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5002612,'193','Raza Kazmi',30508,207257,'Airport to Candidasa','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-03-15','2024-03-15','Rendy','Febrina',1,'Persons (1-3)',616000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-03-15\", \"text\": \"ETA: 12.25 by Garuda Indonesia GA621 from Sorong on 15 Mar\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Denpasar Airport\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-03-15\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Manggis, Manggis, Kec. Manggis, Kabupaten Karangasem, Bali 80871 Phone: +62 (363) 41333\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Amankila Hotel\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5002636,'193','Raza Kazmi',31661,208436,'Tulamben Bay/USAT Liberty Shipwreck - All Level Divers (for Diving)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-03-17','2024-03-17','Rendy','Febrina',2,'Per Person (Min. 2 Person)',3628800.00,'Tulamben 1 Day SCUBA Diving Trips Our Day Trips and Dive Safaris to Tulamben on Bali’s north east coast are enormously popular with visitors to Bali due to the wide variety of sites in the area. This includes the world-renowned 120 metre USAT Liberty Shipwreck. Upon arrival in Tulamben, as you settle into our base for the day, the Tulamben porters will unload the dive gear, tanks, etc. You will then listen to the dive briefing from your AquaMarine dive guide. Third Day Dives on a Tulamben dive trip are almost always possible but must be booked in advance. If you’d like to do a Night Dive in Tulamben Bay, we can arrange an overnight stay for you in one of our Suggested Hotels. Tulamben Bay Our dive base is located right on the water. It couldn’t be more convenient for the USAT Liberty Shipwreck! Tulamben Bay offers three main dive sites: The 120m USAT Liberty Shipwreck, The Coral Garden and The Wall/Drop-off. It is an excellent dive location for divers of all levels, from novice to experienced. Tulamben Bay is also ideal for snorkelers. We recommend you do two dives on the USAT Liberty Shipwreck. It is a fascinating site and would take weeks to explore (if you had time!). Make the most of your Tulamben Dive Trip and enjoy two (or more) dives on this world-famous wreck. For those who are not certified, Tulamben Bay is an ideal location to join Discover Scuba Diving. Non-divers may enjoy snorkeling above the wreck.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-03-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"Amankila Hotel\", \"location\": \"Jl. Raya Manggis, Manggis, Kec. Manggis, Kabupaten Karangasem, Bali 80871. Phone: +62 (363) 41333\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-03-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Amankila Hotel\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5002651,'193','Raza Kazmi',30508,213309,'Candidasa to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-03-19','2024-03-19','Rendy','Febrina',1,'Persons (1-3)',616000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-03-19\", \"text\": \"Please be ready in hotel lobby\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": \"Amankila Hotel\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-03-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Hanging Gardens of Bali\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5002671,'193','Raza Kazmi',30508,212411,'Ubud to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-03-19','2024-03-19','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-03-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-03-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5002701,'193','Raza Kazmi',30660,205139,'Riverside Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-03-19','2024-03-23','Rendy','Febrina',1,'Double',45472000.00,'These luxurious villas take full advantage of the peace and tranquility of the surrounding jungle, combined with the rhythmic sound of Ayung River and its cascading waterfalls below. Designed in an authentic Balinese style, Riverside Villas are perched high on wooden pillars. Their expansive decks feature a private infinity pool, poolside gazebo, shower and dining table – the ideal place to unwind and soak up the sights and sounds of the surrounding jungle.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-03-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-03-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5002740,'193','Raza Kazmi',30508,207262,'Ubud to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-03-23','2024-03-23','Rendy','Febrina',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-03-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"11:00\", \"locality\": \"Hanging Gardens of Bali\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-03-23\", \"text\": \"ETD: 17.20 by Garuda Indonesia GA419 to Jakarta on 23 Mar\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Denpasar Airport\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5003818,'194','Catherine Bates',32195,214479,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-03-16','2024-03-17','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Double',921760.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-03-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-03-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5003875,'195','Thomas Marshall CAREY',30683,203335,'Mini-stay Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-03-26','2024-03-26','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Single',504000.00,'Feel at home in one of our Superior Rooms - warm colors giving an inviting feel and ambiance. Although you are in the heart of Soekarno - Hatta Airport you can find a small oasis of relaxation where you will leave the hustle and bustle of traveling far behind Spacious 24 square meters Superior room with a king or twin beds offering comfortable stay equipped with modern facilities such as air conditioning, arm chair, work desk & chair, flat screen TV with cable and satellite channels, free access internet & Wi-Fi, in room safe, coffee/tea maker, mini cooler, private bathroom with shower and hair dryer, and many more.','Room usage for up to 6 hours Earliest check-in time 09.00 Latest check-out time 23.00 Including transfer between terminals','Please consult your departure transfer upon check-in.','{\"date\": \"2024-03-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-03-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5003884,'195','Thomas Marshall CAREY',30671,200626,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-04-07','2024-04-08','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Single',1120000.00,'Deluxe Room with a room area of 28 square meters each, there are 2 types of bed, king and twin bed with a size of 28 square meters each.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-04-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5004205,'196','David Curry',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-06','2024-05-07','Rendy','Wiwik',1,'Double',784000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Guaranteed late check-out up to 18.00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel.','{\"date\": \"2024-05-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5004370,'168','Yannic ETHIER',32485,215251,'Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-04-10','2024-04-14','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Double',5331200.00,'The sophisticated Suite Rooms at our resort in Ubud feature all the comforts of home combined with a range of luxury facilities and amenities. The rooms are available with king-size or twin bed options, and also feature a spacious private balcony overlooking the most beautiful rice terrace view. An en suite bathroom provides a standing shower as well as a sunken bath and full range of luxury bathroom amenities. The suites at our yoga retreat in Ubud are fully air-conditioned and also include a mini bar, TV cable, and free Wi-Fi access.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-04-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5004377,'168','Yannic ETHIER',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-04-10','2024-04-10','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-04-10\", \"text\": \"ETA: 19.55 by Lion Air JT3741 from Makassar on 10 Apr\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Denpasar Airport\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Puri Gangga Resort Ubud\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5004380,'168','Yannic ETHIER',30508,202882,'The Mother Temple Besakih and Surrounding','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-04-12','2024-04-12','Rendy','Wiwik',2,'Persons (2)',1724800.00,'The first destination is Kusamba Beach, it is one of the favorite places of interest in Bali which is famous with the beautiful beach, we can also meet a fish market in this place which is usually held between 10 am until 4 pm. Then we go to Goa Lawah, this is one of the favourite place to be visited, because here is a nature cave dwelt by thousands of tail bat located at north side from Jeroan/center of Goa Lawah Temple. Next we go to Bukit Jambul, it is strategically located beside of the main road from Denpasar to Besakih Temple and it is one of the tourist destinations that visited on Besakih Tour. It is situated in the plateau area which is blessed with the beautiful panorama of rice terrace and green coconuts three unfolding to the sea. After visit Bukit Jambul, we’ll continue to Besakih Temple is the biggest Hindu temple in Bali which the local people call Pura Besakih. It owns beautiful view from the top of temple area where we can see the wide nature panorama until to the ocean so that’s why this temple is many visited by tourists from all over the world. Then go to Kertagosa, This place also owns Taman Gili, a building floating or sees like floating because it is intentionally founded in the middle of a fish pond.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-04-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"Puri Gangga Resort Ubud\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Puri Gangga Resort Ubud\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5004848,'190','Sara Postigo',30508,207379,'Ubud to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-03-20','2024-03-20','Jacob','Tami',2,'Persons (1-3)',1120000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'Pick up time : 06.00 Pick