00,'Swiss-Belhotel Sorong boast 126 guest rooms in Sorong with all the comforts you would expect from an international chain of four-star hotels in Sorong. Enjoy 37-inch LED TVs, cable channels, high-speed internet access and a full range of other amenities that will make your stay here the most comfortable one possible.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-03-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-03-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5007123,'199','Markus Schmid',30719,214472,'Transport Fee (from Hotel to Airport)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-03-22','2024-03-22','Rendy','Eddy',1,'Per Car',280000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-03-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-03-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5007204,'200','Daniel Trigueros Moreno',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-03-31','2024-03-31','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (1-3)',672000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'Flight details ETA : 09.50 by Singapore Airlines SQ8600 from Singapore Pick up point : Ngurah Rai International Airport Drop Off Point : Tejaprana Bisma Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571','{\"date\": \"2024-03-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-03-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5007243,'200','Daniel Trigueros Moreno',30623,200585,'Forest Villa','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-03-31','2024-04-02','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',4704000.00,'The Sawah View Villas offer a perfect retreat. These one-bedroom villas offer a spacious floor area of 100 m2, with a King-sized bed, air conditioning, private bathroom with bathtub, and a beautiful view of the garden and paddy rice field surrounding the villa. Unwind in the private outdoor space in the gazebo on the personal terrace, laze in the infinity plunge pool, or simply lay back in the outdoor natural stone bathtub.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-03-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5007258,'200','Daniel Trigueros Moreno',30508,202892,'Ruta Fantastica','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-04-01','2024-04-01','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1747200.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,'Pick up time : 08.30 Please be ready at hotel\'s lobby for pick up Pick up point : Tejaprana Bisma Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571','{\"date\": \"2024-04-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5007273,'200','Daniel Trigueros Moreno',30805,212248,'DPS - TMC','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-04-02','2024-04-02','Guio','Tami',2,'Person',5992000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-04-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5007289,'200','Daniel Trigueros Moreno',30805,212249,'TMC - DPS','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-04-05','2024-04-05','Guio','Tami',2,'Person',5992000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-04-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5009099,'202','ROBIN DURECU',30508,212287,'Airport to Sanur','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-03-22','2024-03-22','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Persons (4-6)',672000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-03-22\", \"text\": \"ETA: 15.20 by EVA Air BR255 from Taipei on 22 Mar\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Denpasar Airport\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-03-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Puri Santrian Resort Sanur\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5009768,'203','Marta Gonzalez Izquierdo',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-03-31','2024-03-31','Jacob','Tami',2,'Persons (1-3)