autiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,'Pick up time : 08.30 Pick up & drop off point : Komaneka at Bisma Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone : (0361) 971933','{\"date\": \"2024-04-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5009861,'204','Ms. Elizabeth Schell',32532,215488,'One Day Birding Aroung Sorong','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-01-06','2024-01-06','Ayu','Ayu',2,'Persons (2)',3000000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-01-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-01-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5009881,'206','FRITZ STEPHAN GROUP',30671,200626,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-03-05','2024-03-06','Rendy','Rendy',6,'Double + Twin',6720000.00,'Deluxe Room with a room area of 28 square meters each, there are 2 types of bed, king and twin bed with a size of 28 square meters each.',NULL,'TWIN ROOM #1 FRITZ STEPHAN MR + AMEIL PATRICK MR TWIN ROOM #2 SARRAN DELPHINE MRS + VANDEWALLE FREDERIC MRS DOUBLE ROOM #3 LEONI STEPHANE MR + FONTANELLI MYRIAM MRS DOUBLE ROOM #4 CANCEL CHRISTOPHE MR + QUESNOT AUDE MRS DOUBLE ROOM #5 DUDENHOFER FABRICE MR + PROST AURELIE MRS TWIN ROOM #6 PROST DIDIER MR + JOCHMAN GODEFROY MR','{\"date\": \"2024-03-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-03-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5009887,'203','Marta Gonzalez Izquierdo',32531,215489,'1-Bedroom Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-04-04','2024-04-07','Jacob','Tami',1,'Double',8568000.00,'These one bedroom contemporary private Villas are fully tiled and have spacious Double bedrooms with AC and Satellite TV, built-in robes and en-suites bathroom with marble topped vanities and freshwater showers. The outdoor relaxation terraces have fully stocked fridge can be ordered, dining table and chairs and lounges. Each terrace flows onto wooden decking with sun lounges and a small plunge pool. Free and strong Wi-Fi connection provided in this villa and the entire resort. In-room dining service is available from our fine dining restaurant, with delicious meals and snacks served in your dining room or by the pool. We also can provide stocks in your villa with a range of foods and wines of your choice. From imported wines, spirits and other drinks to cheeses, fruits and more.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-04-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5009896,'207','Ms. Camellia FARHOODI',30508,212291,'Airport to Jimbaran','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-01-26','2024-01-26','Ayu','Ayu',1,'Persons (1-3)',2912000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-01-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-01-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5009902,'203','Marta Gonzalez Izquierdo',30508,207379,'Ubud to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-04-04','2024-04-04','Jacob','Tami',2,'Persons (1-3)',1120000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'Pick up time : 06.00 Pick up point : Komaneka at Bisma Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone : (0361) 971933','{\"date\": \"2024-04-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5009912,'203','Marta Gonzalez Izquierdo',30508,207386,'Padang Bai to Seminyak','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-04-07','2024-04-07','Jacob','Tami',2,'Persons (1-3)',1120000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'Boat Schedule by Gili Gili Fast Boat ETD : Gili Trawangan (GLT) - 10:30 ETA : Padang Bai (PDB) - 12:30 Pick up time : 12.30 Pick up point : Padang Bai Harbour Drop off point The Seminyak Beach Resort & Spa Jl. Kayu Aya, Pantai Seminyak, Kuta, Seminyak, Kec. Kuta, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361 Phone : (0361) 730814','{\"date\": \"2024-04-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5009922,'203','Marta Gonzalez Izquierdo',30606,203160,'Beach Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-04-07','2024-04-08','Jacob','Tami',1,'Double',4401600.00,'The Beach Room are a stylish, sleek and serene addition to our hotel on Seminyak Beach. Witness a marriage of contemporary design and Balinese tradition, complete with yielding beds, sunny balconies and lavish en-suite bathrooms with indulgent soaking tubs and powerful rain showers. Hand-carved wooden accents are offset by warm-toned furnishings and fabrics that span the spectrum from burgundy via espresso to cappuccino.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-04-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5009930,'208','Susanne Franziska Krehl',32282,214473,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-02-05','2024-02-06','Ayu','Ayu',1,'Double',792000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-02-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-02-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5009965,'203','Marta Gonzalez Izquierdo',30508,207270,'Seminyak to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-04-08','2024-04-08','Jacob','Tami',2,'Persons (1-3)',448000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'Flight details ETD 01.05 by Iberia IB7967 to Doha on 09 April Pick up time : 20.00 Please be ready at hotel\'s lobby for pick up Pick up point The Seminyak Beach Resort & Spa Jl. Kayu Aya, Pantai Seminyak, Kuta, Seminyak, Kec. Kuta, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361 Phone : (0361) 730814','{\"date\": \"2024-04-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5010101,'200','Daniel Trigueros Moreno',30508,207262,'Ubud to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-04-02','2024-04-02','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (1-3)',784000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'Pick up time : 05.20 Please be ready at hotel\'s lobby for pick up Flight Schedule ETD : 09.20 by Citilink QG1654 to Tambolaka on 02 April 2024 Pick up point : Tejaprana Bisma Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone : (0361) 6207070','{\"date\": \"2024-04-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5010196,'210','Ashwin Panemangalore',30673,200559,'Deluxe Double Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-18','2024-05-19','Ayu','Ayu',1,'Double',1380000.00,'Designed to capture nature vibes. Slide open the door to your private terrace to let in the fresh mountain air and relax.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5010201,'210','Ashwin Panemangalore',30803,202852,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-19','2024-05-20','Ayu','Ayu',1,'Double',810000.00,'At 25 sqm of room size with 46 rooms available. This smart room category is more contemporary in appearance and comes with its own terrace or balcony. Minimalist furnishings are balanced by a neutral decor to soothe the senses and ensure restful slumber. Including a double bed (king or queen) or 2 single beds (twin) with maximum capacity of 2 adults + 1 child or 3 adults. The en-suite bathroom features a modern shower cubicle enclosed in glass together with a marble vanity.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5010203,'210','Ashwin Panemangalore',30705,201148,'Premier Room Rice Field View','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-05-20','2024-05-23','Ayu','Ayu',1,'Double',4590000.00,'Room size: 30 sqm. Gaze out at rippling rice fields as you let your stress slip away in one of our Premier Ricefield View suites. Inside you have smooth tiles, warm wooden accents, and all the modern comforts you could ask for. Step onto the balcony and you have an airy nook where you can witness life unfold in the Balinese countryside. The room is 30 sqm and has a king size bed or twin beds.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5010207,'210','Ashwin Panemangalore',30508,202894,'Kehen Temple - Pengelipuran - Kintamani','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-21','2024-05-21','Ayu','Ayu',2,'Persons (2)',1680000.00,'Our wonderful tour starts from Kehen Temple. It is an ancient Hindu temple complex boasting unique architectural features. The staircases reaching from the ground to temple courtyard are carved sandstone mythical animal and Balinese folklore figure statues and also the central vestibule. The temple’s walls are also ornate with Chinese porcelain plates, which are a tribute to the historical relations between the local Bali kingdom and China. Afterwards, we continue to Penglipuran, a village that succeeded in preserving its 75-hectare bamboo forest located in the northern part of the village. Members of this village have a strong commitment to the system of \'Ayahan Desa\' - a philosophy committed to respecting the land on which the village stands. To concludes the day, we stop by at Tukad Cepung Waterfall. Well-guarded by the circular cliffs, this waterfall is difficult to locate for the first time visitor. The circular cliffs give you the feeling of being in a cave, while the open sky right from where the waterfall emerges, gives you the most enchanting view. The sunlight falls on the glistering waterfall creating a rainbow, which feels as though it is projected right up to you. If you have never seen water flowing from the sky, then this would be your chance! After spending your time there, we go back to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5010212,'210','Ashwin Panemangalore',30508,202893,'Lempuyang Temple Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI11',1,'2024-05-22','2024-05-22','Ayu','Ayu',2,'Persons (2)',1920000.00,'At the agreed time, our guide will pick you up to start the tour in the eastern part of Bali. The first place you will visit is Goa Lawah Temple. Goa Lawah Temple consists of two names, \"Goa\" which means cave and \"Lawah\" which means bat. Several thousand bats are flying in the cave as the name suggests. With the lights fading as you go deeper inside the cave, it gives off a very strange atmosphere. From Goa Lawah, we continue our way to Lempuyang Temple. Upon arrival, the temple will greet you with its gratifying panorama that extends into infinity. On a clear, sunny day, you\'ll be able to gaze out over the mountains, Amlapura city, and Mount Agung, an incredibly magnificent sight that\'s beautiful beyond words. This portrait of heaven is beautifully framed by the Gapura Candi Bentar (the gate of the temple). Our journey continues to visit Tirta Gangga. The site is a paradise surrounded by water, with all the pools decorated with unusual statues. With its seclusion and a view of the surrounding rice paddies, Tirta Gangga is a wonderful place. At the end of the trip we go to Tenganan Village, the most famous Bali Agas (the “original” Bali people) in the city. With its characteristics, the city village is arranged in parallel along the wide main road paved with rows of cobblestones. In Tenganan, women still weave the famous Kamben Geringsing, or \"burnt cloth,\" which has the power to immunize the wearer against evil. We take a close look at what they do in their daily lives in a traditional lifestyle. From Tenganan, we will transfer you to the hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5010216,'210','Ashwin Panemangalore',30508,202864,'Goa Gajah - Gedong Arca - Tirta Empul - Gunung Kawi - Tegallalang','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-23','2024-05-23','Ayu','Ayu',2,'Persons (2)',1812000.00,'We will be picking you up from your hotel to enjoy the wealth of art in Ubud. First we will visit Monkey Forest; the Ubud Monkey Forest is a nature reserve and temple complex in Ubud, Bali. It houses approximately 340 Crab-eating Macaque (Macacafas cicularis) monkeys. The Monkey Forest contains the Pura Dalem Agung Padangtegal temple as well as a \"Holy Spring\" bathing temple and another temple used for cremation ceremonies. Next we go to Ubud Traditional Art Market where the existence is not far different from other markets available in the tourism area. This market as a society economics center of Ubud and it is apposite to the existence of Ubud Empire that is called Puri Saren. Our last destination is Gua Gajah (Elephant Cave). This cave is built at crevasse edge from the federation of 2 rills that is called Pangkung River, where the irrigation is mixed with Petanu River flow. The word of Gua Gajah is anticipated coming from the word of Lwa Gajah, the name of Buddhist Temple or hermitage for Buddhist monk. There is a relief which is almost looking like the form of mountain on the entrance of this cave. It was carved many designed on the relief like grove with the stick, close leaf, animal for example forest pig, tortoise and specters. The cave mouth is decorated by the bas-relief with the eye turn around to the right or west side. At the end of tour we will transferred back you to the hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5010234,'210','Ashwin Panemangalore',30798,201644,'One Bedroom Deluxe Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-05-23','2024-05-25','Ayu','Ayu',1,'Double',2904000.00,'The two-story, 45sqm One Bedroom Deluxe Suite features an natural and airy interior, complemented with modern furnishings and views overlooking to the private terrace with a plunge pool. Floor-to-ceiling glass doors provide generous natural lighting and a dynamic ambience. Plush linens and a marble bathroom surround guests in elegance.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5010244,'210','Ashwin Panemangalore',30508,202892,'Ruta Fantastica','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-24','2024-05-24','Ayu','Ayu',2,'Persons (2)',1872000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5010248,'210','Ashwin Panemangalore',30508,207270,'Seminyak to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-25','2024-05-25','Ayu','Ayu',2,'Persons (1-3)',600000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5010251,'210','Ashwin Panemangalore',31083,203792,'Komodo Island Full Day Tour (Fast Boat - Pick Up/Drop Off Labuan Bajo)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-25','2024-05-25','Ayu','Ayu',2,'Persons (2-3)',13524000.00,'TOUR ITINERARY Highlights: Padar Island, Komodo Island, Long beach, Pink Beach, Manta Point & Kanawa. PICK UP / ARRIVE LABUAN BAJO - PADAR - KOMODO - PINK BEACH - MANTA POINT - LABUAHAN BAJO Pick up & meeting service with our tour guide and transfer to the pier of Labuan Bajo for sailing directly to Loh Liang – the Ranger station in Komodo Island. By passing through many small islands, it will be 3 hours with slow wooden boat and 1.50 hours by speed boat to reach the pier of Komodo island. After registering start to take basic trekking to see the GIANT RIZARD / KOMODO DRAGON and other wild animals as: Timor deer, wild pig, wild chicken and many variously of tropical bird. Please keep your look at any directions as sometimes you will also find young Komodo dragon hanging over the trees. A local ranger will be led you during the trek. Return to the boat on to Pink beach for snorkeling, swimming and relaxing. It is really spectacular and unspoiled coral reef and many color fish. Sail toward MANTA POINT to exploring Huge Mantas by snorkeling even watching from your boat trip (can’t be guaranteed if weather is not good, like wave and current are strongly). Lunch will be provided on board. Late in the afternoon back to Labuan Bajo harbor and transfer to your prefer Hotel for overnight and Dinner. Meals : Lunch Attention: The itinerary is subject to change due to the weather, tide level and operating conditions without prior notice.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5010263,'210','Ashwin Panemangalore',30701,207546,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-25','2024-05-26','Ayu','Ayu',1,'Double',900000.00,'Our Superior Room at 38 sqm of room area, equipped with AC, Western toilet and shower with hot & cold water, desk, seating area, and many more. Breakfast is included in the room rate. Featuring a balcony or terrace, guests can enjoy spectacular views of the garden, pool or the sea.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5010273,'210','Ashwin Panemangalore',30571,202567,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-26','2024-05-27','Ayu','Ayu',1,'Double',1290000.00,'Located at the Second Floor, 35 sqm comfort living with a touch of Balinese style featuring completed fitting, Cable TV, a fancy bathroom comprises rain shower and good quality amenities. Also dedicated Wi-Fi Access to complete your day.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5011861,'211','David Schenfeld',30806,202002,'4D3N Borneo Orangutan & Reforestation Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO7',4,'2024-04-21','2024-04-24','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Person (1)',11100000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN – KUMAI PORT – TANJUNG HARAPAN Your “Orangutan & Reforestation Tour” begins upon arrival at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan is Cape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch – Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : TANJUNG HARAPAN VILLAGE – PROBOSCIS TOUR – CAMP LEAKEY After an extraordinary breakfast, you go to visit the village inside the national park, named Tanjung Harapan Village. Here you will see the activities of the locals. After the visit, you will return to the klotok cruise up to the Sekonyer River. You will see nice vegetation around the river bank, including Nipa Palm, Pandanus, and some kinds of trees that are growing up around the river. See some wildlifes such as birds, Macaques, Proboscis Monkeys and Orangutans. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large monitor lizards. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. Note: The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. Meals : Breakfast – Lunch – Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : PONDOK TANGGUI – CAMP LEAKEY – BOAT After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continue to add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After lunch, you will have the opportunity to repeat feeding camp at Camp Leaky. It is a unique opportunity to dedicate more time to your observation and to discover more wild animals, along with the Orangutans. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note: If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast – Lunch – Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 4 : KUMAI PORT – PANGKALAN BUN Today we end our stay in the jungles of Borneo. Our “Orangutan & Reforestation Tour” is about to finish. In the early morning we will have breakfast on the boat, to then go to the port and in turn, be transferred to the airport. The boat departure will be at the latest at 10am, but we adapt to your flights if your flight leaves earlier in the morning. If you decide to take an afternoon flight, we can take you directly to the airport at 10 or if you want a city tour in the Arut village to drop you off at the airport later, it could be arranged at extra cost. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Flights information ETA: 07.00 by Nam Air IN190 from Jakarta on 21 Apr ETD: 11.20 by Batik Air6134 to Surabaya on 24 Apr EXCLUDED: Surcharge of IDR 100,000/person/day/camp applicable for every Sunday, national or public holiday and collective leave days must be paid upon arrival','{\"date\": \"2024-04-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5011862,'211','David Schenfeld',30571,202567,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-04-24','2024-04-26','Rendy','Tami',1,'Single',2580000.00,'Located at the Second Floor, 35 sqm comfort living with a touch of Balinese style featuring completed fitting, Cable TV, a fancy bathroom comprises rain shower and good quality amenities. Also dedicated Wi-Fi Access to complete your day.','Superior room fullybook, bookingan ini confirmed di tipe kamar Deluxe Pool Access','Please consult your departure transfer upon check-in. Flights information ETA: 15.45 by Lion Air J804 from Surabaya on 24 Apr ETD: 08.00 by Batik Air ID6333 to Labuan Bajo on 26 Apr','{\"date\": \"2024-04-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5011884,'212','Jean-Pierre NERAT',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-22','2024-10-23','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Double',1568000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. Please consult your departure transfer upon check-in.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5011885,'212','Jean-Pierre NERAT',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-02','2024-11-03','Rendy','Eddy',2,'Double',1568000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Late check-out up to 18.00 Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. Please consult your departure transfer upon check-in.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5013770,'215','Vicki Goodknight Dixon',32281,215532,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-03-09','2024-03-10','Rendy','Tami',1,'Double',728000.00,NULL,NULL,'Flight Details ETA 12.30 by Wings Air IW1528 from Sorong on 09 March 2024','{\"date\": \"2024-03-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-03-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5013775,'215','Vicki Goodknight Dixon',32281,215533,'Airport Transfer','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-03-09','2024-03-09','Rendy','Tami',1,'Per Car',168000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-03-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-03-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5014382,'216','Edith Brown',30720,202970,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-07-31','2024-08-02','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Single',8960000.00,'Styled for personal comfort and convenience, the Superior room category is an inviting space that captures the essence of Bali. At 35 sqm of room area, with double / twin bed capacity of 2A 1C or 3A with extra bed. Set amidst tropical landscape, this air-conditioned room comes with a private balcony, flat-screen cable TV and a safety deposit box. En suite bathroom comes with bath and shower facilities.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-3