cation\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5026222,'234','Dietmar Karl HEIGL',30671,200626,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-06','2024-10-07','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Double',1120000.00,'Deluxe Room with a room area of 28 square meters each, there are 2 types of bed, king and twin bed with a size of 28 square meters each.',NULL,'Check-in time 14.00 Check-out time 12.00','{\"date\": \"2024-10-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5026318,'235','Cynthia Cleveland',30711,200830,'Bisma Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-08-24','2024-08-28','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Single',15422400.00,'Spacious one-bedroom suite of 88 sqm with private balcony for a sophisticated Ubud getaway. Interiors feature extensive use of wood and fine Indonesian textiles and art, lending an understated elegance to the space. Featuring a private balcony, this room includes a flat-screen TV and an en-suite bathroom with a bathtub and a shower, and many more.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5026374,'235','Cynthia Cleveland',30508,202892,'Ruta Fantastica','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-25','2024-08-25','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Person (1)',1489600.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,'Program: Taman Ayun - Jatiluwih - Ulundanu Beratan - Tanah Lot','{\"date\": \"2024-08-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"Komaneka at Bisma\", \"location\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 971933\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Komaneka at Bisma\", \"location\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 971933\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5026376,'235','Cynthia Cleveland',30508,202895,'East Bali Tour','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-26','2024-08-26','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Person (1)',1528800.00,'In this part of the trip, we set off along the East Coast of the island. The first site visit will be the Kusamba Village, a fishing village where colorful Prahu in the black sand beaches. We will announce the salt making process by traditional method. We continue our journey on the east coast to reach Goa Lawah, Gua Lawah or Bat Cave is one of favorite places of interest in Bali and it is located near of hilly bank so it is called reef of Middle hill. We continue our trip to Tenganan Village, Tenganan Village is one of the oldest Balinese Traditional located in Karangasem Regency, east part of Bali. This village is much referred by cultural literature science of Tenganan Pegringsingan, which is very famous in the island. It owns very unique local community life pattern which is one example of Bali Aga Village cultures (Hindu Prehistoric) and different with other countryside in plain of Bali. From here, we go to Amlapura to visit the Royal Palace, The town of Amlapura is the capital of Karangasem (\'East Bali\'). The palace of the former kings of the region is located here, and their descendants have opened parts of the complex to the public. We will finish our trip with visit heaven of Tirta Gangga, Tirta Gangga is a beautiful park with the huge water fountain. At the end of tour we will transfer you back to the hotel.',NULL,'Program: Kusamba Beach – Goa Lawah Temple – Tenganan Village – Tirta Gangga Temple','{\"date\": \"2024-08-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"Komaneka at Bisma\", \"location\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 971933\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Komaneka at Bisma\", \"location\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 971933\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5026381,'235','Cynthia Cleveland',30508,202897,'Uluwatu Temple and Kecak Dance','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-28','2024-08-28','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Person (1)',1864800.00,'This half-day tour, is an exciting tour package to visit Padang-Padang Beach, Uluwatu Temple, the famous Balinese Hindu Temple in south part of Bali with breathtaking view of sunset and Indian Ocean. Uluwatu Temple is one of Balinese Hindu Temples located right on the petrifying hill with the crevasse exist in the right and left side. Uluwatu Temple is one of Sad Khayangan (6 biggest temple in Bali) owns magnificent view of the Indian Ocean and sunset as a backdrop. This temple is very amazing where the location is right on the narrow peninsula with deep seawater under it. This tour package is combined with the spectacular Balinese traditional dance performance of Kecak Dance. Balinese Kecak Dance is a spectacular traditional dance with the group of people playing this dance with fire game. It is very exciting and unique dance due to the sound of gamelan is not using the normal gamelan but use their mouth. The dancers make the compact choir with the exquisite dance movement that is one of this dance features. After the dance we returned back to the hotel or seafood restaurant in Jimbaran.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"13:30\", \"locality\": \"Komaneka at Bisma\", \"location\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 971933\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"The Vira Hotel Kuta\", \"location\": \"l. Kartika Plaza No.127, Kuta, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361 Telepon: (0361) 765700\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5027647,'236','John Burge',32201,214478,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-03-09','2024-03-10','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Twin',1895000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-03-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-03-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5027654,'236','John Burge',32570,215814,'Signature Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-03-10','2024-03-11','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Twin',700000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-03-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-03-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5027727,'237','D\'Anne Marie DUCLOS',30719,201080,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-1