35 by Singapore Airlines SQ965 from Singapore on 26 Mar ETD: 09.40 by Garuda Indonesia GA646 to Ambon on 27 Mar','{\"date\": \"2024-03-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-03-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5032403,'244','Max Kuehn',30808,213095,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-04-22','2024-04-23','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Double',2038400.00,'Room size: 40m2. Elegantly designed in combination of modern and Balinese Architecture building set within in a unique nature landscape equipped with cable television, air conditioning, balcony with table and chairs, private bathroom with standing shower. The rooms are facing rice field, swimming pool and garden. All standard rooms are uniquely decorated and features fine modern furnishings offering both comport and elegant style. Embedded in green rice filed the ARMA Resort New “Wisma Seni” provides you with an elegant, tranquil and serene environment. Free shaped swimming pool added into the privacy and dedicated for people seeking an alternative to the often hectic settings of their lives, an escape into a space where pressure and barriers dissolve. It is our commitment to welcome you in an uncompromised environment, sharing with you the real Bali.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-04-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5032404,'244','Max Kuehn',30508,207262,'Ubud to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-04-23','2024-04-23','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-04-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"15:00\", \"locality\": \"