m area of 28 square meters each, there are 2 types of bed, king and twin bed with a size of 28 square meters each.',NULL,'Check-in time 14.00 Check-out time 12.00 ROOMING LIST Single: MRS ANNE LAURE DECOMBEIX Double: MRS ISABELLE DECOMBEIX + MR RAPHAEL HERNU Flights information ETA: 16.25 by Lion Air JT749 from Surabaya on 06 Apr ETD: 00.40 by Emirates EK359 to Dubai on 07 Apr','{\"date\": \"2024-04-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5038470,'254','Andrew Mahon',30719,201080,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-17','2024-11-18','Rendy','Tami',1,'Twin',952000.00,'Swiss-Belhotel Sorong boast 126 guest rooms in Sorong with all the comforts you would expect from an international chain of four-star hotels in Sorong. Enjoy 37-inch LED TVs, cable channels, high-speed internet access and a full range of other amenities that will make your stay here the most comfortable one possible.',NULL,'Check-in time 14.00 Check-out time 12.00','{\"date\": \"2024-11-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5038477,'254','Andrew Mahon',30719,214471,'Transport Fee (from Airport to Hotel)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-17','2024-11-17','Rendy','Tami',1,'Per Car',280000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-11-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5038480,'254','Andrew Mahon',30671,200626,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-11','2024-11-12','Rendy','Tami',1,'Twin',1120000.00,'Deluxe Room with a room area of 28 square meters each, there are 2 types of bed, king and twin bed with a size of 28 square meters each.',NULL,'Check-in time 14.00 Check-out time 12.00 Flights information ETA: 19.45 by Cathay Pacific CX797 from Hong Kong on 11 Nov ETD: 09.40 by Garuda Indonesia GA646 to Ambon on 12 Nov','{\"date\": \"2024-11-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5038542,'256','Carlos Novella Sanchez Mr',30805,212255,'CGK-YIA','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-04-24','2024-04-24','Guio','Eddy',2,'Person',2568000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-04-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5038549,'256','Carlos Novella Sanchez Mr',30783,213070,'3D2N Best of Yogyakarta City Tour / C. Adhisthana*3 (Superior Room)','Confirmed','JS-Java01',3,'2024-04-24','2024-04-26','Guio','Eddy',2,'Persons (2 / Double)',9000000.00,'Day 1 : Arrival at Yogyakarta Welcome to the cradle of Indonesian culture, Yogyakarta. A tourist destination for its ancient palaces, temples, batik workshops, gamelan music orchestras, court dances and wayang puppet shows. Upon your arrival in Yogyakarta a representative of Come2Indonesia will be waiting for you with a sign indicating your name to take you to your hotel and the rest of the day is free for you. Meals : - Accommodation : C. Adhisthana Hotel - Superior Room Day 2 : Yogyakarta City Tour - Prambanan and Borobodur You will start your day with breakfast at the hotel. Today’s excursion will make us get lost in the authentic magic of Yogyakarta. One of the most beautiful and complete routes of the cultural capital of Indonesia. At the scheduled time, your guide will pick you up to begin your tour to Borobudur Temple (Candi Borobudur), the great Stupa, the largest Buddhist monument in the world and one of the seven wonders. We will tour around the temple, observe the hundreds and centenary statues of Buddha and witness how dozens of Buddhists come to preach from all over the world. Historically it was established during the relatively brief Sailendra dynasty of Central Java between 778 and 856 BC and is in constant restoration due to the breaks that the tremors of the neighbouring Merapi volcano have been producing during its history. After visiting one of the most important Buddhist temples in Southeast Asia, we continue our journey to the heart of the city. We will visit the Keraton, known as the Sultan’s Palace. The palace is a complex building two centuries old, located in the heart of the city. You will hear the song of “freedom” in the bird market. We will visit the “Water Castle” that occupies the highest part at the northern end of the vast complex of Taman Sari. Then we continue to Malioboro Street, main street of Yogyakarta, with its merchants, horse carriages, taxi-bikes and markets. An incredible experience that will make hours fly by. Finishing the tour in the centre of the city of Yogyakarta, we will head northeast towards Candi Prambanan, the temple of Hinduists which have been classified as a World Heritage Site by UNESCO since 1991. It was finished around the year 856 to commemorate the victory of the descendant Sanjaya of Siva, Rikai Pikatan on the last sovereign Sailendra of Central Java. Take your time to enjoy each carving on the rocks and feel the spirituality that each of the stones perched in this set of more than 200 Hindu temples that are dedicated to the Trimurti, the expression of God as the Creator, the Preserver and the Destroyer. After this unforgettable day, we will take you back to your hotel. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : C. Adhisthana Hotel - Superior Room Day 3 : Hotel - Airport You will enjoy a well-deserved breakfast at the hotel and according to the time of your flight, we will pick you up to take you to the airport and take the flight to your next destination. End of our services. Thank you very much for exploring Yogyakarta with Come2indonesia. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'0424 / Día 01: Llegada a Yogjakarta 0425 / Día 02: Borobudur – Candi Rejo 0426 / Día 03: Templo Prambanan – Yogyakarta City Tour – Bali','{\"date\": \"2024-04-24\", \"text\": \"ETA : GA 0208 / 24 APR /12:50 By Garuda Indonesia / Flight From Jakarta |\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Yogyakarta Aiport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-26\", \"text\": \"ETD : JT 566/ 26 APR / 13.40 By Lion Air / Flight To Denpasar |\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Yogyakarta Aiport\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5039993,'257','FRANCESCA LAZZONI',30719,201080,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-12','2024-10-13','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Double',952000.00,'Swiss-Belhotel Sorong boast 126 guest rooms in Sorong with all the comforts you would expect from an international chain of four-star hotels in Sorong. Enjoy 37-inch LED TVs, cable channels, high-speed internet access and a full range of other amenities that will make your stay here the most comfortable one possible.',NULL,'Check-in time 14.00 Check-out time 12.00 Early check-in is subject to availability upon arrival.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5039999,'257','FRANCESCA LAZZONI',30719,214472,'Transport Fee (from Hotel to Airport)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-13','2024-10-13','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Per Car',280000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": nu