angkiang Sidem Desa, Keliki, Kec. Tegallalang, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phn +62812-3702-7336 DROP OFF AT AIPORT ETD :',NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-02\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Bunutan Jl. Cocoa I No.Br, Kedewatan, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phn +62812-3702-7336\", \"time\": \"11:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Teja Lokha Ubud Villa\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-02\", \"text\": \"ETD : ID6335 / 02 MAY / 1535 By Batik Air / Flight to Labuan Bajo |\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Denpasar Aiport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5040291,'256','Carlos Novella Sanchez Mr',30700,204098,'Deluxe Double Garden View Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-02','2024-05-03','Guio','Eddy',1,'Double',896000.00,NULL,NULL,'1 (DBL) Deluxe room Include breakfast (honeymoon) + One-Way transfer from APT TO HOTEL','{\"date\": \"2024-05-02\", \"text\": \"ETA : ID6335 / 02 MAY / 20:20 By Batik Air / Flight to Labuan Bajo |\", \"time\": \"20:20\", \"locality\": \"Labuan Bajo Airport\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-03\", \"text\": \"Address : Jalan Golo No.Silatey, Labuan Bajo, Kec. Komodo, Kabupaten Manggarai Barat, Nusa Tenggara Tim. Telepon: (0385) 2440612\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"La Cecile Komodo Hotel and Cafe\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5040300,'259','David Mateo',30803,202852,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-18','2024-07-19','Nicholas','Febrina',1,'Double',840000.00,'At 25 sqm of room size with 46 rooms available. This smart room category is more contemporary in appearance and comes with its own terrace or balcony. Minimalist furnishings are balanced by a neutral decor to soothe the senses and ensure restful slumber. Including a double bed (king or queen) or 2 single beds (twin) with maximum capacity of 2 adults + 1 child or 3 adults. The en-suite bathroom features a modern shower cubicle enclosed in glass together with a marble vanity.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5040316,'256','Carlos Novella Sanchez Mr',30731,209834,'Private Cabin','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-05-03','2024-05-05','Guio','Eddy',2,'Person (1)',8624000.00,'DAY 1 : LABUAN BAJO - KELOR ISLAND - MENJARITE ISLAND - KALONG ISLAND Arrival at Komodo Airport in Labuan Bajo west Flores, meeting service with our Guide and transfer to the pier of Labuan Bajo for Kalong island. Stop at Menjalite and Kelor islands for snorkeling, relaxing and trekking, then continue to Kalong island. Here you can see the amazing thousands fling foxes set out from mangrove tree at 06-07pm, the lovely sunset really enjoyable could be seen from your boat trip in this place. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Private Boat DAY 2 : PADAR ISLAND - LONG BEACH - KOMODO ISLAND - TAKA MAKASSAR - MANTA POINT After having breakfast in your boat, heading to Padar Island, taking trek to Padar Island until having the top view point to get breathtaking scenery of three bays around, Padar Island hike in Komodo has some of the most amazing views in Indonesia, trek to downhill. Labuan Bajo is indeed famous for its various marine beauties. One of the prima donnas is Long Beach with a stretch of pink beach sand. There are indeed two beaches here that are famous for pink sand, namely Pink Beach and Long Beach. This time we visited the beach located behind Padar Island, Long Beach. Back to the Boat for sailing directly to Loh Liang - the Ranger station in Komodo Island. By passing through many small islands. After registering start to take basic trekking to see the GIANT RIZARD / KOMODO DRAGON and other wild animals as: Timor deer, wild pig, wild chicken and many variously of tropical bird. Please keep your look at any directions as sometimes you will also find young Komodo Dragon hanging over the trees. A local ranger will be led you during the trek. Return to the boat on sail toward MANTA POINT to exploring Huge Mantas by snorkeling even watching from your boat trip (can’t be guaranteed if weather is not good, like wave and current are strongly) visit also the taka Makassar its really tiny island with white sand beach really enjoyable to relaxing or beach walking then heading to Sebayur island, overnight dinner on boat. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Private Boat DAY 3 : SEBAYUR ISLAND - KANAWA ISLAND - LABUAN BAJO As you have seen, Komodo National Park is much more than dragons. The clarity of its waters and beaches of white sand and corals are other strengths of this park. After breakfast on the boat, we will sail to Kanawa Island to do more snorkeling and relax while sunbathing on the beach. Enjoy your last moments in this beautiful destination. Then, we continue to Labuan Bajo airport to catch the flight to your next destination. Thank you for enjoying this Komodo Liveaboard with Come2Indonesia. We are waiting for you on other trips. See you! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'SHARED 3D2N KOMODO TOUR 0503 / Día 10 : Labuhan Bajo - Menjarite - Kelor - Isla Kalong 0504 / Día 11 : Padar - Komodo - Pink Beach - Manta Point 0505 / Día 12 : Isla Kanawa - Labuan Bajo - Airport NO INCLUYE: • Propinas al guía y/o la tripulación del barco • Alcohol y refrescos • Tasa de entrada al Parque Nacional de Komodo (700.000 IDR para extranjeros) • Gastos personales • Todo lo no mencionado en el apartado “INCLUYE”.','{\"date\": \"2024-05-03\", \"text\": \"Alamat: Jalan Golo No.Silatey, Labuan Bajo, Kec. Komodo, Kabupaten Manggarai Barat, Nusa Tenggara Tim. Telepon: (0385) 2440612\", \"time\": \"10:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"La Cecile Komodo Hotel and Cafe\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-05\", \"text\": \"ETD : IU727 / 02 MAY / 16:00 By Super Air Jet / Flight to Lombok | connect to IU718 / 02 MAY / SUB-LOP 1730-1940\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Airport Labuan Bajo\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5040699,'260','LEA ANN PARKER',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-30','2024-08-31','Nicholas','Eddy',1,'Double',840000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'ETA QR 958 To Jakarta (CGK) / 30-AUG-24 / 0740 ETD IN190 From Jakarta (CGK) / 31-AUG-24 / 05:45LT / Terminal 1A','{\"date\": \"2024-08-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5042594,'254','Andrew Mahon',30671,200626,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-25','2024-11-26','Rendy','Tami',1,'Twin',1120000.00,'Deluxe Room with a room area of 28 square meters each, there are 2 types of bed, king and twin bed with a size of 28 square meters each.',NULL,'Check-in time 14.00 Check-out time 12.00','{\"date\": \"2024-11-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5042604,'261','Christina Van Helvoort',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-04-12','2024-04-13','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Single',784000.00,'Sleep soun