will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-04-23\", \"text\": \"ETA : 12.30 from Gili Air by Gili gili Fastboat\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-23\", \"text\": \"Address : Biu Biu Resort, Jl. Pantai Balangan, Jimbaran, South Kuta, Badung Regency, Bali 80361\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"La Joya Biu Biu\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5065857,'290','Ms. Raquel Munoz Garcia & Mr. Antonio Jose Munoz Ruiz',30915,202454,'Forest View Lodge Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-04-23','2024-04-24','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',3429552.00,'The Forest View Lodge is located between the two resort pools. There is only one room of this particular room type. The room highlights the expanse of lush green landscape of Balangan Cliff, which can be seen from the comfort of this room. A wide outdoor terrace with sun loungers are included, if you wish to get more sun privately after a swim at our common pools and also enjoy some views of the ocean line. The Forest View Lodge has the closest access to the resort’s private beach below. The sides of the room is made up of wood-framed glass panels which allows natural light to flood through the room. And tropical plants sit on the side of the room which refreshes your senses.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-04-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5065859,'290','Ms. Raquel Munoz Garcia & Mr. Antonio Jose Munoz Ruiz',30508,216161,'Uluwatu to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-04-25','2024-04-25','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (1-3)',784000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-04-25\", \"text\": \"