4,200657,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-15','2024-05-16',NULL,'Eddy',1,'Double',1411200.00,'Room area : 24 square meters. Our Deluxe Rooms are designed for modern travellers who seek comfort on a short stay in Ijen area. With its spacious rooms of 24 meters square with either a king size or deluxe twin beds, maximum occupancy is 2 adults. Equipped with one shower bathroom, LED TV 32\" with satelite channel, and air conditioning.',NULL,'Please send the guarantee letter/voucher following procedure below: - 30 (thirty) days reservation notice prior to the arrival date for Normal Period. - 45 (forty-five) days reservation notice prior to the arrival date for High Season (June 1th to August 31st) and Peak Season (D-3 to D+4 Idul Fitri (April 18 - 25th, 2023 and December 21st, 2023 to January 5th, 2024) period. - Otherwise, the cancellation policy will be applied.','{\"date\": \"2024-05-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5066319,'294','Paul Cyriel F De Keere',32680,216349,'Classic Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-05-04','2024-05-06','Melysa','Tami',5,'Double + Twin',12420000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5066344,'294','Paul Cyriel F De Keere',30508,207264,'Candidasa to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-06','2024-05-06','Melysa','Tami',1,'Persons (7-10)',1920000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-06\", \"text\": \"Alamat: Jl. Raya Candidasa, Sengkidu, Kec. Manggis, Kabupaten Karangasem, Bali\", \"time\": \"04:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sagara Candidasa\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-06\", \"text\": \"ETD 08.00 by Batik Air ID6333 to Labuan Bajo on 06 May 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5066359,'294','Paul Cyriel F De Keere',31083,212374,'3D2N LOB Rinca - Padar - Komodo Island Tour (Medium Standard Boat)','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-05-06','2024-05-08','Melysa','Tami',8,'Persons (8-9)',52656000.00,'TOUR ITINERARY Highlights: Menjarite, Kelor, Strawberry Rock, Kalong, Rinca, Padar, Komodo Island, Pink Beach, Taka Makassar, Manta Point, Kanawa, B.Cermin Mirror Cave DAY 1 : DENPASAR - LABUAN BAJO - MENJARITE - KELOR - KALONG ISLAND Arrival at Komodo Airport in Labuan Bajo west Flores, meeting service with our tour guide and transfer to the pier of Labuan Bajo for Rinca Island. It’s about 2 hours sail to the island of Komodo Dragon, stop at Menjarite island for snorkeling then continue to Rinca island-the Island of Komodo dragon, you will find not just e Dragons but also many wild animals like, deer, wild buffalo, long-tailed macaque and wild pig also numerous of birds. Keep your eyes look up as sometime you will find the young Komodo dragons on the trees. A local ranger will lead you through this natural preservation. Late afternoon sailing directly to Kalong Rinca Island to see the hundreds of fling foxes set out from the mangrove tree at 06-07pm, the lovely sunset from the boat trip really enjoyable. Lunch and dinner on boat. Meals : Lunch - Dinner DAY 2 : KALONG - PADAR - KOMODO - PINK BEACH - MANTA POINT - TAKA MAKASSAR - SEBAYUR After having breakfast in your boat, heading to Padar Island, taking trek to Padar Island until having the top view point to get breathtaking scenery of three bays around, Padar Island hike in Komodo has some of the most amazing views in Indonesia, trek to downhill and back to the Boat for sailing directly to Loh Liang – the Ranger station in Komodo Island. By passing through many small islands, After registering start to take basic trekking to see the GIANT RIZARD / KOMODO DRAGON and other wild animals as: Timor deer, wild pig, wild chicken and many variously of tropical bird. Please keep your look at any directions as sometimes you will also find young Komodo dragon hanging over the trees. A local ranger will be led you during the trek. Return to the boat on to Pink beach for snorkeling, swimming and relaxing. It is really spectacular and unspoiled coral reef and many color fish. This is one of best side for snorkeling diving. Sail toward MANTA POINT to exploring Huge Mantas by snorkeling even watching from your boat trip (can’t be guaranteed if weather is not good, like wave and current are strongly) visit also the taka Makassar its really tiny island with white sand beach really enjoyable to relaxing or beach walking then heading to Sebayur island, overnight dinner on boat. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner DAY 3 : SEBAYUR - KANAWA ISLANDS - LABUAN BAJO - DENPASAR After breakfast on the boat, taking swimming, snorkeling and relaxing as well at seraya and Kanawa. Then back to Labuan Bajo to continue your next excursion with visiting the Batu Cermin (Mirror Stone) Cave. The grotto is 75 by 75 meters large, and contains stalactites and stalagmites. Some tunnels are narrow and dark but in others sunlight falls. Then local market before taking you to the airport for flight to Denpasar. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch Attention: The itinerary is subject to change due to the weather, tide level and operating conditions without prior notice.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-06\", \"text\": \"ETA 09.10 by Batik Air ID6333 from Denpasar on 06 May\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Labuan Bajo Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-08\", \"text\": \"Macang Tanggar, Komodo, West Manggarai Regency, East Nusa Tenggara\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Luwansa Beach Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5066407,'294','Paul Cyriel F De Keere',31658,208111,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-08','2024-05-09','Melysa','Tami',5,'Double + Twin',4200000.00,'This room featured Air Conditioning, telephone, hot and cold water, satellite TV on 32 LCD screen. Bathroom amenities; Hair dryer, Bathrobe, Towels, Free toiletries, Guest toilet, Cleaning products, Body soap, Hair conditioner, Shampoo, Tooth brush, Toilet paper. Facilities inside the room are coffee/tea maker, mini bar, wake up service.','Room rates are quoted net inclusive breakfast and 21% tax & service charge',NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5066415,'294','Paul Cyriel F De Keere',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-09','2024-05-10','Melysa','Tami',5,'Double + Twin',4200000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel.','{\"date\": \"2024-05-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, 