egueiral Maria Angeles Sergio Russo Single Lisandro Rimoldi','{\"date\": \"2024-04-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5071948,'305','Russo Sergio Miguel',32683,216360,'Deluxe Room with Green View','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-04-10','2024-04-13','Guio','Komang',1,'Single',3484800.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-04-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5071949,'305','Russo Sergio Miguel',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-04-11','2024-04-11','Guio','Komang',7,'Persons (7-10)',4037600.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,'Taman Ayun-Jati Luwih-Bedugul-Tanah Lot','{\"date\": \"2024-04-11\", \"text\": \"Best Western Resort Ubud Jl. Sri Wedari No.99, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-11\", \"text\": \"Best Western Resort Ubud Jl. Sri Wedari No.99, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5071971,'305','Russo Sergio Miguel',30508,207262,'Ubud to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-04-13','2024-04-13','Guio','Komang',5,'Persons (4-6)',3920000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-04-13\", \"text\": \"Best Western Resort Jl. Sri Wedari No.99, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-13\", \"text\": \"ETD : 12.45 by Batik Airline ID6517Y to Jakarta (CGK) on 13 April 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai Airport Domestic\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5071991,'305','Russo Sergio Miguel',30508,207276,'Ubud to Nusa Dua','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-04-13','2024-04-13','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (1-3)',784000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-04-13\", \"text\": \"Best Western Resort Ubud Jl. Sri Wedari No.99, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"12:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-13\", \"text\": \"Hilton Bali Resort Jl. Raya Nusa Dua Selatan, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Ba