oy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel.','{\"date\": \"2024-05-01\", \"text\": \"ETA : 01 MAY / 16:00 / TO JAKARTA / SV 818 / BY SAUDI AIRLINES\", \"time\": \"16:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-02\", \"text\": \"ETD : 02MAY / 09.40 | TO YOGYAKARTA / ID6378 BY BATIK AIR\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5074394,'310','SERGIO GAMARRA VILLA MR / SILVIA HORTAL ESCOLANO MRS.',30508,212287,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-05','2024-05-05','Guio','Eddy',2,'Persons (1-3)',784000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-05\", \"text\": \"ETA : 05MAY / 17.05 | FROM SURABAYA / JT910 BY LION AIR\", \"time\": \"17:05\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-05\", \"text\": \"Tejaprana Bisma Jalan Bisma, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali 80571, Indonesia Phone Number: +62361 6207070\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5074397,'310','SERGIO GAMARRA VILLA MR / SILVIA HORTAL ESCOLANO MRS.',30623,200583,'Garden Villa','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-05-05','2024-05-08','Guio','Eddy',1,'Double',8280000.00,'The Garden View Villas are one-bedroom villas, and offer a spacious floor area of 100 m2, with a King-sized bed, air conditioning, private bathroom with bathtub, and a beautiful view of the garden surrounding the villa. Unwind in the private outdoor space in the gazebo on the personal terrace, laze in the infinity plunge pool, or simply lay back in the outdoor natural stone bathtub.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5074526,'310','SERGIO GAMARRA VILLA MR / SILVIA HORTAL ESCOLANO MRS.',30650,208425,'Private Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-05-08','2024-05-11','Guio','Eddy',1,'Double',6720000.00,'Each villa embraces calmness, comfort and privacy in a simple and elegant setting. Guests can relax while peacefully sipping drinks in an inviting plunge pool surrounded by a lush tropical garden and at an old-wooden deck terrace where they can have a peaceful siesta on the large-bean bags or day-bed mattress.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5074587,'311','Mr Salvador Soler',30710,200846,'Courtyard Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-03-27','2024-03-30','Guio','Komang',2,'Double',28224000.00,'Courtyard Pool Villa is tasteful villa overlooking a tropical garden with plenty space to relax. The villa room that built in 144 sqm area, oozes with peace and charm that comes from nature that surrounds. Featuring a plunge pool, this villa is fitted with air conditioning, a flat-screen TV, a safety deposit box, slippers, bathrobes, free toiletries are provided, and many more.','These rates are applicable for the capacity specified, non-commissionable and inclusive of breakfast, 10% service charge and 11% government tax.',NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-03-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-03-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5074588,'311','Mr Salvador Soler',30710,200846,'Courtyard Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-03-27','2024-03-30','Guio','Komang',1,'Twin',14112000.00,'Courtyard Pool Villa is tasteful villa overlooking a tropical garden with plenty space to relax. The villa room that built in 144 sqm area, oozes with peace and charm that comes from nature that surrounds. Featuring a plunge pool, this villa is fitted with air conditioning, a flat-screen TV, a safety deposit box, slippers, bathrobes, free toiletries are provided, and many more.','These rates are applicable for the capacity specified, non-commissionable and inclusive of breakfast, 10% service charge and 11% government tax.',NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-03-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-03-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5074611,'305','Russo Sergio Miguel',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-04-10','2024-04-10','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (7-10)',1120000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-04-10\", \"text\": \"ETA : 15.00 by Batik Airline ID6330 from Labuan Bajo on 10 April 2024\", \"time\": \"15:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-10\", \"text\": \"Best Western Resort Ubud Jl. Sri Wedari No.99, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Best Western Resort Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5074631,'310','SERGIO GAMARRA VILLA MR / SILVIA HORTAL ESCOLANO MRS.',30783,214885,'4 Days 3 Nights Yogyakarta Bromo Surabaya + Train Ticket Sancaka ( Without Guide )','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-05-02','2024-05-05','Guio','Eddy',2,'Persons (2 / Double)',12880000.00,'Explore Yogyakarta city and cross overland to Mount Bromo! The city is mostly known for its rich Javanese culture and is the home to the magnificent Borobudur and Prambanan temple. If it is your first time traveling to Indonesia, you will miss a wonderful gem if you failed pay this city a visit. In this tour, we will connect your route to Surabaya by train. Chase one of the best sunrise experience atop Mt. Bromo and witness the volcanic activity of Mt. Semeru, all from one vantage point! Day 1 : Arrival in Yogyakarta - Prambanan Temple Welcome to the cradle of Indonesian culture, Yogyakarta. A tourist destination for its ancient palaces, temples, batik workshops, gamelan music orchestras, court dances and wayang puppet shows. Upon your arrival in Yogyakarta a representative of Come2Indonesia will be waiting for you with a sign indicating your name. You will start the tour right away, and head northeast towards Prambanan, the temple of the Hinduists and classified as a World Heritage Site by UNESCO since 1991. From the airport, the journey to the temple is about 2-2,5 hours. The building of this temple was finished around the year 856 to commemorate the victory of the descendant of Sanjaya dynasty, Rikai Pikatan, against the last Shailendra sovereign of Central Java. Take your time to enjoy each carving on the rocks and feel the spirituality that each of the stones perched in this set of more than 200 Hindu temples that are dedicated to Shiva, one of the Trimurti which is an expression of God as the Creator, the Preserver and the Destroyer. After this unforgettable day, you will be taken to your hotel and enjoy your free time. Meals : - Accommodation : B. Gallery Prawirotaman - Superior Room Day 2 : Yogyakarta Tour - Borobodur Temple After breakfast and at the agreed time, your guide will pick you up at the hotel and together you will head towards the heart of the city. You will visit the Keraton, or also known as the Sultan’s Palace. The palace is a complex building two centuries old. Next, you will hear the song of the “freedom” of the birds in the bird market, you will visit the “Water Castle” that occupies the highest part at the northern end of the vast complex of Taman Sari. Then, stroll around Malioboro Street, one of the main streets of Yogyakarta, with its merchants, horse carriages, taxi-bikes and markets. An incredible experience that will make the hours fly by. Leaving the city, an hour and a half away, you will visit the infamous Borobudur Temple The great Stupa, the largest Buddhist monument in the world and one of the seven wonders. You will walk around the temple area, observe the hundreds and centenary statues of Buddha and witness how dozens of Buddhists come to preach from all over the world. Historically it was established during the relatively brief Syailendra dynasty of Central Java between 778 and 856 BC and is in constant restoration due to the breaks that the tremors of the neighbouring Merapi volcano has been producing during its history. After having this intense day of visits, we return to the hotel to rest. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : B. Gallery Prawirotaman - Superior Room Day 3 : Jogyakarta - Solo - Bromo (By Train) Ready with your suitcases, the time has come to say a farewell to this dream city. You will enjoy your breakfast at the hotel, and at the indicated time, with your guide, you will travel to Jombang / Mojokerta by train. Then by private car you will go to your hotel located on the slopes of the Bromo volcano. In total it will be about 8 hours of travel. check-in at the hotel and deserved rest. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : B. Lereng Bromo - Deluxe Room Day 4 : Bromo - Surabaya Airport Very early, your guide and a jeep driver will be waiting for you at the hotel to visit one of the most spectacular sunrises in Indonesia. Even if you have to get up early, it will be worth it. You will climb to a high point first in full darkness and, little by little the first rays of sun are giving way to a huge and indescribable caldera that makes up the entire view of the Bromo and Semeru Natural Park. With Bromo, a volcano of great fumaroles and behind it, the Semeru Volcano with explosions every 20 minutes exactly, will make you have one of the most rewarding experiences ever. After enjoying the sunrise, by jeep, you will go to the slopes of the volcano where you can go to the Bromo volcano and after climbing some stairs you can reach the very edge of its crater and see the impressive activity it has. We return to the hotel to cool off and so you can enjoy your breakfast. At the agreed time, you will have the transfer to Juanda Surabaya International Airport to catch the flight to your next destination. Thanks for exploring Java with Come2Indonesia. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -','Day 1 : Arrival at Yogyakarta International Airport - Prambanan Temple - Transfer to hotel Gallery Prawirotaman (Superior) Day 2 : Borobudur temple, Mendut and Pawon Temple - City Tour (Kraton, Tamansari and Market) Gallery Prawirotaman (Superior) Day 3 : Transfer to Yogyakarta Train Station, by train to Mojokerto, arrival at Mojokerto train station and then drive to Bromo, overnight at Lereng Bromo (Deluxe) Day 4 : Sunrise and Bromo crater tour ( incl. Jeep ) - back to hotel and then transfer to Surabaya airport',NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-02\", \"text\": \"ETA : 02MAY / 10.50 | FROM JAKARTA / ID6378 BY BATIK AIR\", \"time\": \"10:50\", \"locality\": \"YOGJAKARTA AIPORT\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-05\", \"text\": \"ETD : 05MAY / 15.05 | TO DENPASAR / JT910 BY LION AIR\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"SURABAYA AIPORT\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5074639,'310','SERGIO GAMARRA VILLA MR / SILVIA HORTAL ESCOLANO MRS.',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route (Without Guide)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-06','2024-05-06','Guio','Eddy',2,'Persons (2)',1747200.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.','Tour Ruta Fantástica – Templo Taman Ayun - Jatiluwih - Templo Ulun Danu Bratan - Tanah Lot','Tour Ruta Fantástica – Templo Taman Ayun - Jatiluwih - Templo Ulun Danu Bratan - Tanah Lot (Without Guide)','{\"date\": \"2024-05-06\", \"text\": \"Tejaprana Bisma Jalan Bisma, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali 80571, Indonesia Phone Number: +62361 6207070\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-06\", \"text\": \"Tejaprana Bisma Jalan Bisma, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali 80571, Indonesia Phone Number: +62361 6207070\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5075423,'310','SERGIO GAMARRA VILLA MR / SILVIA HORTAL ESCOLANO MRS.'