yside ensconced in complete luxury. Complete with daybeds and cushions for luxurious lounging, the villas also offer the wonderful furnishings and bathing facilities that come as standard at this boutique resort. An escape from the world, by reconnecting to it. A private individually Pool Villa is suitable for two person, has a king size bed with sunken bath and balcony overlooking the rice field.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5075601,'312','JOAN TUTUSAUS SOLE MR / ANABEL TRIGUEROS ANDUJAR MRS.',30914,202449,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-05-25','2024-05-28','Igo','Eddy',1,'Double',5544000.00,'The room is spacious at 48 sqm with king and twin size beds capacity of 2 (two) adults and 2 (two) child below 12 years old, decked with combination of Balinese-modern contemporary elements, immaculately designed to characterize each of Seven Balinese Goddesses. Located on a higher level of each Puri, the room is equipped with every amenity that could possibly be required, making it ideal for a single traveler or couples.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5075619,'312','JOAN TUTUSAUS SOLE MR / ANABEL TRIGUEROS ANDUJAR MRS.',30508,207380,'Nusa Dua to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-28','2024-05-28','Igo','Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"text\": \"Merusaka Nusa Dua Alamat: Kawasan Wisata Nusa Dua Lot S-3, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80363\", \"time\": \"