Deluxe Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-31','2024-06-01','Igo','Eddy',1,'Double',1355200.00,'The two-story, 45sqm One Bedroom Deluxe Suite features an natural and airy interior, complemented with modern furnishings and views overlooking to the private terrace with a plunge pool. Floor-to-ceiling glass doors provide generous natural lighting and a dynamic ambience. Plush linens and a marble bathroom surround guests in elegance.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5075986,'312','JOAN TUTUSAUS SOLE MR / ANABEL TRIGUEROS ANDUJAR MRS.',30508,207270,'Seminyak to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-01','2024-06-01','Igo','Eddy',2,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-01\", \"text\": \"Address : Jl. Pura Telaga Waja No.18a, Kerobokan Kelod, Kec. Kuta Utara, Kabupaten Badung, Bali, 80361, Indonesia Phone : +62361 9348348\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": \"Kayumas Seminyak Resort\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-01\", \"text\": \"01 JUN 2024 | 13:05H / FROM DENPASAR / SQ939 BY SINGAPORE AIRLINES\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"AIRPORT DENPASAR\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5077184,'315','Linda Michele Bilsing Closed 20233879',31158,204473,'VIP Service Fast Track International Arrival by Galih (Not Inc. VOA)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-04-09','2024-04-09','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Person (1)',1080000.00,'Arrival International: Pick up at before immigration area.',NULL,'MEETING POINT: Your personal assistant will be waiting for you holding a sign of your name, at the nearest point to the plane, usually at the end of jetbridge. They will assist you through immigration with fast track service, baggage claim and customs until the arrival hall exit. SPECIAL REQUEST: Escort the client to Anara Airport Hotel Flight information ETA: 23.45 by ANA NH835 from Tokyo on 09 Apr','{\"date\": \"2024-04-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5077925,'154','GIORGIA TRIPOLI',30719,214472,'Transport Fee (from Hotel to Airport)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-05','2024-05-05','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Per Car',280000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5079068,'309','Cal McIlwaine',30959,213942,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-05-30','2024-06-01','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Single',1948800.00,'Specially designed for savvy travelers seeking comfort and style at 48 sqm of room size. Available in King and Double bet with the option of an extra bed for an additional fee. The room features a cozy living room with a comfortable sofa, LED wall-mounted TV, complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi, and in-room amenities to ensure a relaxing stay experience.',NULL,'Check-in time 14.00 Check-out time 12.00 Guaranteed early check-in on 31 May 2024','{\"date\": \"2024-05-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5079070,'309','Cal McIlwaine',30959,212511,'One-way Airport Transfer','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-31','2024-05-31','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Per Car',168000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5079199,'158','Sabrina Denise Roth',30508,207265,'Canggu to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-25','2024-05-25','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Persons (1-3)',420000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"text\": \"Please be ready in hotel lobby\", \"time\": \"12:00\", \"locality\": \"Amandaya Canggu\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"text\": \"ETD: 16.55 by Thai Airways TG432 to Bangkok on 25 May\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Denpasar Airport\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5080926,'317','Donovan CLEUET',30696,206403,'Larantuka Sea View Suite','Confirmed',NULL,9,'2024-08-13','2024-08-22','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Single',46368000.00,'Linger all day by the beach a dream room for guests who crave the sound of the waves and the clear sea of Labuan Bajo. Everything can be obtained when opening the door that faces directly into the blue landscape of Labuan Bajo Strait. The scenery is more charming as it is surrounded by shady trees that are well-preserved by Sudamala. Our Larantuka Sea View Suite has 16 units, 8 lower level suites (67 sqm), with private terrace and bathtub, 8 upper level suite (48 sqm) with private balcony and luxurious rain shower. This suite is equipped with luxurious king-sized bed, efficient and sustainable air-conditioning, 43\" smart TV, complimentary wireless internet, safe deposit box, water heater, private bathroom with bathroom amenities, hairdryer, bathrobe, daily turndown service, and many more.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5081318,'319','Alfonso LIGUORI',30683,203335,'Mini-stay Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-04-25','2024-04-25','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Single',560000.00,'Feel at home in one of our Superior Rooms - warm colors giving an inviting feel and ambiance. Although you are in the heart of Soekarno - Hatta Airport you can find a small oasis of relaxation where you will leave the hustle and bustle of traveling far behind Spacious 24 square meters Superior room with a king or twin beds offering comfortable stay equipped with modern facilities such as air conditioning, arm chair, work desk & chair, flat screen TV with cable and satellite channels, free access internet & Wi-Fi, in room safe, coffee/tea maker, mini cooler, private bathroom with shower and hair dryer, and many more.','Room usage for up to 6 hours Earliest check-in time 09.00 Latest check-out time 23.00 Including transfer between terminals','Flights information ETA: 15.00 by Qatar Airways QR6381 from Doha on 25 Apr ETD: 00.30 by Batik Air ID7797 to Sorong on 26 Apr','{\"date\": \"2024-04-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5081319,'319','Alfonso LIGUORI',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-06','2024-05-07','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Single',784000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel.','{\"date\": \"2024-05-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5082515,'320','Laure Goudon Bechet',30611,201418,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-04-29','2024-05-03','Yuli','Febrina',2,'Double',16934400.00,'The Deluxe Room provides a restful environment to unwind after a busy day spent exploring the sights of Ubud. It is a cozy base featuring clean-line furnishings, a smart en-suite bathroom and a decorative wall that showcases Bali’s creative legacy. A private terrace or balcony blends seamlessly into the outdoors providing extra space to sit and relax.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-04-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5082516,'320','Laure Goudon Bechet',31235,204991,'One-Bedroom Villa','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-05-03','2024-05-05','Yuli','Febrina',2,'Double',7504000.00,'Enjoy an unforgettable experience with the comfort of our 1 Bedroom Bungalow which is specially designed for the comfort of either single or couple or small family. Our bungalow provides an open-concept bathroom equipped with a shower. Our bungalows only have bedroom and bathroom. The 4 units of bungalow are positioned in the 3rd row (approx. 50 meter from the beach)',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5082517,'320','Laure Goudon Bechet',30697,204647,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-05','2024-05-06','Yuli','Febrina',2,'Double',2912000.00,'Paradise awaits and escape into tranquility. Our Superior room is fresh and bright, combining modern and authentic decor for a breathtaking Indonesian experience. Our rooms feature free Wi-Fi, 32\" LCD TV, in-room safety box, minibar. 1 King bed or 2 Single beds and 1 day bed, no rollaway.','Rates in this contract include government tax & service charges and are non-commissionable.',NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5082518,'320','Laure Goudon Bechet',30915,202458,'Friends & Family Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-05-09','2024-05-11','Yuli','Febrina',2,'Double',7930137.60,'There are 12 units of the Family & Friends room and each room has its own separate entrance. This is a split-level room that comes with one private bathroom. The mezzanine/loft serves as the second bedroom, ideal for those travelling with their family or friends and wish to be together. The two beds are separated whereby the ground floor has a queen size bed and the loft has a double size daybed mattress. The room can accommodate up to 3 adults or 2 adults and 2 young children comfortably. The friends and family room has its own private outdoor terrace. A large wood-framed glass patio entrance connects the room to the outdoor terrace.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5082519,'320','Laure Goudon Bechet',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-04-29','2024-04-29','Yuli','Febrina',1,'Persons (1-4)',1120000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'Transfer Airport - Ubud with French speaking guide Flight detail: ETA at 16:55 by Qatar Airways QR962 from Doha on 29 Apr','{\"date\": \"2024-04-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Alaya Ubud Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5082520,'320','Laure Goudon Bechet',30508,202864,'Ubud and Surrounding Tour','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-04-30','2024-04-30','Yuli','Febrina',4,'Persons (1-4)',10662400.00,'We will be picking you up from your hotel to enjoy the wealth of art in Ubud. First we will visit Monkey Forest; the Ubud Monkey Forest is a nature reserve and temple complex in Ubud, Bali. It houses approximately 340 Crab-eating Macaque (Macacafas cicularis) monkeys. The Monkey Forest contains the Pura Dalem Agung Padangtegal temple as well as a \"Holy Spring\" bathing temple and another temple used for cremation ceremonies. Next we go to Ubud Traditional Art Market where the existence is not far different from other markets available in the tourism area. This market as a society economics center of Ubud and it is apposite to the existence of Ubud Empire that is called Puri Saren. Our last destination is Gua Gajah (Elephant Cave). This cave is built at crevasse edge from the federation of 2 rills that is called Pangkung River, where the irrigation is mixed with Petanu River flow. The word of Gua Gajah is anticipated coming from the word of Lwa Gajah, the name of Buddhist Temple or hermitage for Buddhist monk. There is a relief which is almost looking like the form of mountain on the entrance of this cave. It was carved many designed on the relief like grove with the stick, close leaf, animal for example forest pig, tortoise and specters. The cave mouth is decorated by the bas-relief with the eye turn around to the right or west side. At the end of tour we will transferred back you to the hotel.',NULL,'FD Tour Monkey Forest - Ubud Art Market - Goa Gajah with French speaking guide','{\"date\": \"2024-04-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Alaya Ubud Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Alaya Ubud Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5082563,'320','Laure Goudon Bechet',30783,201525,'4D3N Yogyakarta - Mt. Merapi with Jeep / Melia Purosani (Deluxe Room)','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-05-06','2024-05-09','Yuli','Febrina',4,'Persons (1-4)',21392000.00,'D1 Arrival Yogyakarta International Airport – Transfer to hotel: Welcome to the cradle of Indonesian culture, Yogyakarta. A tourist destination for its ancient palaces, temples, batik workshops, gamelan music orchestras, court dances and wayang puppet shows. Upon your arrival in Yogyakarta a representative of come2indonesia will be waiting for you with a sign indicating your name to take you to your hotel and the rest of the day is for you. D2 Borobudur temple – Candirejo Village Tour by Horse cart / bicycle – Merapi lava tour Including Jeep: You will have your deserved breakfast at the hotel. Today’s tour will make you enjoy the authentic Javanese essence. You will start your route in the direction of with the Borobudur Temple (Candi Borobudur), the great Stupa, the largest Buddhist monument in the world and one of the seven wonders. We will tour around the temple, observe the hundreds and centenary statues of Buddha and witness how dozens of Buddhists come to preach from all over the world. Historically it was established during the relatively brief Sailendra dynasty of Central Java between 778 and 856 BC and is in constant restoration due to the breaks that the tremors of the neighbouring Merapi volcano has been producing during its history. After visiting one of the most important Buddhist temples in Southeast Asia, and in a horse carriage (Andong) we will visit the villages that surround this temple. These are authentic Javanese villages where culture and tradition are the protagonists. As you spend your days in this country and go around the different islands, you will realize how different Indonesians are among them in terms of clothing, food, architecture and even language. Today we will learn about and share these Javanese places. Then we will go to Kaliurang / Kalidalem to see Mount Merapi in constant activity. Here in a 4x4 jeep driven by specialized drivers, we will climb its skirt to see the remains of the 2010 eruption such as houses buried by ashes, a multitude of objects paralyzed by lava, etc. In addition, an open-air tribute museum presided over by the clock that marks the time just when the lava passed through it has been improvised. Accompanied by photos of the rescue, it will make us feel very closely the experiences of that fateful day. After finishing this day full of emotions, we will take you back to your hotel. D3 City Tour Jogjakarta Visit Sultan Palace, Watercastle and Bird Market – Prambanan Temple: After breakfast and at the indicated time we will head towards the heart of the city. We will visit the Keraton known as the Sultan’s Palace. The palace is a complex building two centuries old, located in the heart of the city. You will hear the song of the “freedom” of the birds in the bird market, we will visit the “Water Castle” that occupies the highest part at the northern end of the vast complex of Taman Sari, Malioboro Street, main street of Yogyakarta, with its merchants, horse carriages, taxi-bikes and markets. An incredible experience that will make the hours fly by. After finishing the tour in the center of the city of Yogyakarta, we will go to the northeast direction Candi Prambanan, the temple of the Hinduists and classified as a World Heritage Site by Unesco since 1991. The built of this temple was finished around the year 856 to commemorate the victory of the descendant Sanjaya of Siva, Rikai Pikatan on the last sovereign Sailendra of Central Java. Take your time to enjoy each carving on the rocks and feel the spirituality that each of the stones perched in this set of more than 200 Hindu temples that are dedicated to the Trimurti, the expression of God as the Creator, the Preserver and the Destroyer. After this unforgettable day, we will take you to your hotel. D4 Transfer out Yogyakarta International airport: Today our adventure ends at the cradle of Indonesian culture. Depending on the time of your flight, we will pick you up to take you to the airport and take the flight to your next destination. End of our services. Thank you very much for exploring Yogyakarta by the hand of Come2indonesia.',NULL,'4D3N Yogyakarta Tour - Mt. Merapi with Jeep Guide: French speaking guide Accommodation: Melia Purosani - 2 units Deluxe Room Double Bed D1 / 06 May 2024: Transfer Yogyakarta Airport - Melia Purosani D2 / 07 May 2024: Yogyakarta City Tour - Prambanan Temple - Merapi (B) D3 / 08 May 2024: Borobudur Temple - Candirejo Village (B) D4 / 09 May 2024: Transfer Melia Purosani - Airport (B) Flight detail: ETA 06:35 by Super Air Jet IU777 from Lombok on 06 May ETD 13:40 by Lion Air JT566 to Denpasar on 09 May','{\"date\": \"2024-05-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5082564,'320','Laure Goudon Bechet',30508,212291,'Airport to Jimbaran','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-09','2024-05-09','Yuli','Febrina',1,'Persons (1-4)',851200.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'Transfer Airport - Dinner in Jimbaran - Check in Hotel with French speaking guide Flight detail: ETA 16:25 by Lion Air JT566 from Yogyakarta on 09 May','{\"date\": \"2024-05-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"La Joya Biu Biu\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5082566,'320','Laure Goudon Bechet',30508,212571,'Jimbaran to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-10','2024-05-10','Yuli','Febrina',1,'Persons (1-4)',851200.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'Transfer Jimbaran - Airport Flight detail: ETD 01:05 by Qatar Airways QR961 to Doha on 11 May','{\"date\": \"2024-05-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"21:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"La Joya Biu Biu\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5082588,'320','Laure Goudon Bechet',30805,207117,'YIA-DPS','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-09','2024-05-09','Yuli','Febrina',4,'Person',5992000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5082590,'97','Janet Pelton Camp',30959,213942,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-04-10','2024-04-12','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Double + Twin',0.00,'Specially designed for savvy travelers seeking comfort and style at 48 sqm of room size. Available in King and Double bet with the option of an extra bed for an additional fee. The room features a cozy living room with a comfortable sofa, LED wall-mounted TV, complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi, and in-room amenities to ensure a relaxing stay experience.',NULL,'Check-in time 14.00 Check-out time 12.00','{\"date\": \"2024-04-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\":