m','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-01','2024-05-02','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',1290000.00,'Located at the Second Floor, 35 sqm comfort living with a touch of Balinese style featuring completed fitting, Cable TV, a fancy bathroom comprises rain shower and good quality amenities. Also dedicated Wi-Fi Access to complete your day.',NULL,'Flight details ETA: 22:20 by Emirates EK398 from Dubai on 01 May','{\"date\": \"2024-05-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5083014,'323','Mrs. Manuela Fabbri Pagani',31572,216673,'One Bedroom Pool Villa with Garden View','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-05-02','2024-05-06','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',24192000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5083022,'323','Mrs. Manuela Fabbri Pagani',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-02','2024-05-02','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1872000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-02\", \"text\": \"Jl. Kartika Plaza No.127, Kuta, Kec. Kuta, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Vira Bali\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-02\", \"text\": \"Banjar Tanggayuda, Jl. Taman Sari, Kedewatan, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kappa Senses Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5083036,'323','Mrs. Manuela Fabbri Pagani',30508,202893,'Lempuyang Temple Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI11',1,'2024-05-06','2024-05-06','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1792000.00,'At the agreed time, our guide will pick you up to start the tour in the eastern part of Bali. The first place you will visit is Goa Lawah Temple. Goa Lawah Temple consists of two names, \"Goa\" which means cave and \"Lawah\" which means bat. Several thousand bats are flying in the cave as the name suggests. With the lights fading as you go deeper inside the cave, it gives off a very strange atmosphere. From Goa Lawah, we continue our way to Lempuyang Temple. Upon arrival, the temple will greet you with its gratifying panorama that extends into infinity. On a clear, sunny day, you\'ll be able to gaze out over the mountains, Amlapura city, and Mount Agung, an incredibly magnificent sight that\'s beautiful beyond words. This portrait of heaven is beautifully framed by the Gapura Candi Bentar (the gate of the temple). Our journey continues to visit Tirta Gangga. The site is a paradise surrounded by water, with all the pools decorated with unusual statues. With its seclusion and a view of the surrounding rice paddies, Tirta Gangga is a wonderful place. At the end of the trip we go to Tenganan Village, the most famous Bali Agas (the “original” Bali people) in the city. With its characteristics, the city village is arranged in parallel along the wide main road paved with rows of cobblestones. In Tenganan, women still weave the famous Kamben Geringsing, or \"burnt cloth,\" which has the power to immunize the wearer against evil. We take a close look at what they do in their daily lives in a traditional lifestyle. From Tenganan, we will transfer you to the hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-06\", \"text\": \"Banjar Tanggayuda, Jalan Taman Sari, Kedewatan, Ubud, Gianyar\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kappa Senses Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-06\", \"text\": \"Banjar Jl. Raya Tebola, Telaga Tawang, Kec. Sidemen, Kabupaten Karangasem\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Samanvaya Luxury Resort & Spa\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5083076,'323','Mrs. Manuela Fabbri Pagani',30930,202592,'One Bedroom Bungalow','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-05-07','2024-05-09','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',5376000.00,'Room size : 37 sqm. Our One-Bedroom Bungalow is a unique Romantic Eco-Boho Bungalow nestles in Green Escape Resort. You will stay in a sumptuous air-conditioned bungalow that has been handcrafted using recycled wood and tastefully decorated to offer you an authentic Balinese getaway. It\'s the very epitome of a tranquil escape. This Bungalow offers a deluxe king-size bed and a daybed to relax. It offers a comfy mattress, as we know the benefits of a good night’s sleep. The semi-outdoor bathroom with a rain shower will help you revive yourself. Enjoy the comfy sofa on your private terrace which opens onto the exotic garden & pool. The daybed can be used to extend the sleeping capacity of your private bungalow.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5083092,'323','Mrs. Manuela Fabbri Pagani',30828,216674,'Samudra - Private Pool','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-06','2024-05-07','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',7280000.00,'1 in total - Floor area 90sqm suitable for 2 persons. The construction is bamboo and wood and the villa consists of the bed in the middle of the villa (air conditioned) and the living areas around the outside. The villa is round in shape and has a lotus shaped roof on the top. It has a private plunge pool with incredible views along with an outdoor chill space. There is a dining and lounging area set up very comfortably for two persons. These areas are cooled by ceiling fans and breezes from the openings all around the building. The villa is open to the best views from the hotel and looks out onto the surrounding rice fields and hills with the ocean in the far distance. The bathroom has a shower, a super large vanity and a brass bathtub. The villa is one bedroom and suitable for two persons and comes complete with a full mini bar and tea and coffee making facilities including a Nespresso coffee pod machine.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5083148,'323','Mrs. Manuela Fabbri Pagani',30508,202897,'Uluwatu Temple and Kecak Dance','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-08','2024-05-08','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1713600.00,'This half-day tour, is an exciting tour package to visit Padang-Padang Beach, Uluwatu Temple, the famous Balinese Hindu Temple in south part of Bali with breathtaking view of sunset and Indian Ocean. Uluwatu Temple is one of Balinese Hindu Temples located right on the petrifying hill with the crevasse exist in the right and left side. Uluwatu Temple is one of Sad Khayangan (6 biggest temple in Bali) owns magnificent view of the Indian Ocean and sunset as a backdrop. This temple is very amazing where the location is right on the narrow peninsula with deep seawater under it. This tour package is combined with the spectacular Balinese traditional dance performance of Kecak Dance. Balinese Kecak Dance is a spectacular traditional dance with the group of people playing this dance with fire game. It is very exciting and unique dance due to the sound of gamelan is not using the normal gamelan but use their mouth. The dancers make the compact choir with the exquisite dance movement that is one of this dance features. After the dance we returned back to the hotel or seafood restaurant in Jimbaran.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"16:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Green Escape - Eco Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Green Escape - Eco Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5083163,'323','Mrs. Manuela Fabbri Pagani',30508,216161,'Uluwatu to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-09','2024-05-09','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Green Escape - Eco Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-09\", \"text\": \"ETD 11.45 by Batik Air ID6331 to Labuan Bajo on 09 May\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5083171,'323','Mrs. Manuela Fabbri Pagani',30696,206412,'Inerie Garden Suite','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-09','2024-05-10','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',3735200.00,'Meticulously designed to frame the greenery. “A peaceful retreat” is the right phrase to describe this suite, because it faces directly to the main garden of this green and sustainable property. The room is beautifully designed to frame the natural scenery in front of it. Staying overnight in the Inerie means gaining personal access to an open living area, where you can relax on the terrace of a neatly-designed spacious yard. Our Inerie Garden Suite has 15 units, 9 lower level suites (50-60 sqm), with private terrace and overlooking to the garden landscape, 6 upper level suite (45 sqm) with private balcony with an access to the central courtyard. This suite is equipped with luxurious king-sized and twin bed, efficient and sustainable air-conditioning, 43\" smart TV, complimentary wireless internet, safe deposit box, water heater, private bathroom with bathroom amenities, hairdryer, bathrobe, daily turndown service, and many more.',NULL,'Flight details ETA 12.55 by Batik Air ID6331 from Denpasar on 09 May','{\"date\": \"2024-05-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5083195,'323','Mrs. Manuela Fabbri Pagani',30695,202097,'Beach Bungalow','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-05-12','2024-05-16','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',18144000.00,'A special sanctuary designed for honeymooners or couple in romantic getaway, the beach bungalow sprawls across 32 sqm of wooden paneled space and boasts all the amenities of a tropical island living. The bungalow is equipped with premium bedding set in a four-poster elegant bed, outdoor shower and spacious wooden deck overlooking directly to the ocean. For your convenience, each beach bungalow is outfitted with air conditioner for an extra breeze to beat the tropical heat, a water heater, mini-fridge and personalized service to fill in your every need. Connecting beach bungalows are available.',NULL,'Flight details ETD : 13.35 by Batik Air ID6330 to Denpasar on 16 May','{\"date\": \"2024-05-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5084599,'182','RuDive Group',30508,207268,'Nusa Dua to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-09','2024-05-09','Rendy','Eddy',1,'Persons (7-10)',896000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-09\", \"text\": \"Please be ready in hotel lobby\", \"time\": \"22:00\", \"locality\": \"Melia Resort Nusa Dua\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-09\", \"text\": \"ETD: 01.30 by China Eastern MU 5030 to Shanghai on 10 May\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Denpasar Airport\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5084601,'182','RuDive Group',30508,207268,'Nusa Dua to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-09','2024-05-09','Rendy','Eddy',2,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"20:30\", \"locality\": \"Melia Resort Nusa Dua\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-09\", \"text\": \"ETD: 00.05 by Emirates EK399 to Dubai on 10 May\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Denpasar Airport\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5085198,'324','Birgit WAYAND',30807,216696,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-06','2024-07-07','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Single',879200.00,NULL,NULL,'Check-in time 14.00 Check-out time 12.00 Please consult your departure airport transfer upon check-in.','{\"date\": \"2024-