ncy bathroom comprises rain shower and good quality amenities. Also dedicated Wi-Fi Access to complete your day.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-11-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5088196,'327','Thomas Ploem Group',30508,207250,'Airport to Kuta','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-26','2024-10-26','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Persons (1-3)',250000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting at the arrival hall exit, holding a signboard of your name/group name. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 3 hours after the flight’s estimated arrival time (ETA). - For any flight delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-10-26\", \"text\": \"ETA: 16:35 by Emirates EK368 from Dubai on 26 Oct\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Denpasar Airport\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"The Vira Bali Hotel Kuta\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5088198,'327','Thomas Ploem Group',30508,207266,'Kuta to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-03','2024-11-03','Rendy','Rendy',4,'Persons (1-3)',1120000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver will wait up to 30 minutes after your scheduled pickup time. - Please keep in mind that any further delay could affect your timely arrival at the airport for your flight. - For any changes in flight departure time, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available). - Requests for pickup time earlier than originally booked are subject to availability.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-03\", \"text\": \"Please be ready in hotel lobby at the mentioned time.\", \"time\": \"10:00\", \"locality\": \"The Vira Bali Hotel Kuta\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-03\", \"text\": \"ETD: 13.00 by Singapore Airlines SQ939 to Singapore on 03 Nov\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Denpasar Airport\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5088240,'328','Mrs. Sandra Lizarbe',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-13','2024-05-13','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',420000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-13\", \"text\": \"ETA : 22.30 by QR 960 fr Doha on 13 May 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-13\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Artini Dijiwa\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5088243,'328','Mrs. Sandra Lizarbe',30705,201148,'Premier Room Rice Field View','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-05-13','2024-05-17','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',6120000.00,'Room size: 30 sqm. Gaze out at rippling rice fields as you let your stress slip away in one of our Premier Ricefield View suites. Inside you have smooth tiles, warm wooden accents, and all the modern comforts you could ask for. Step onto the balcony and you have an airy nook where you can witness life unfold in the Balinese countryside. The room is 30 sqm and has a king size bed or twin beds.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-05-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5088253,'328','Mrs. Sandra Lizarbe',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-16','2024-05-16','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1872000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Artini Dijiwa\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5088256,'328','Mrs. Sandra Lizarbe',30508,213032,'Ubud to Kusamba','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-17','2024-05-17','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',420000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Artini Dijiwa\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"text\": \"ETD 08.00 from Kusamba to Nusa Penida by The Angkal Fast Boat\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kusamba Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5088259,'328','Mrs. Sandra Lizarbe',30508,207112,'Trip To Nusa Penida from Bali','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-05-17','2024-05-17','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1020000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"text\": \"ETA 08.30 from Kusamba Harbour by The Angkal Fast Boat\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sampalan Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Angkal Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5088261,'328','Mrs. Sandra Lizarbe',31040,203404,'Ocean View Bungalow Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-17','2024-05-18','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',1140000.00,'Room size: 55 sqm. The ocean view bungalow room has 13 units available. The rooms at this Nusa Penida hotel provide guests with high-velocity internet and a flat-screen TV with satellite channels, and comforts such as ironing facilities and air conditioning. The units are designed in a comfortable manner. Offering amenities like hair dryers and bathrobes, the bathrooms also include a walk-in shower, a separate toilet and a sink.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5088442,'325','Jorge CASADO',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-04-30','2024-04-30','Rendy','Wiwik',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'Drop Off: The Sankara Resort Jl. Cempaka, Kumbuh, MAS, Ubud, Gianyar Regency, Bali 80571 Phone: +62361 8493515','{\"date\": \"2024-04-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-04-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5088453,'325','Jorge CASADO',30762,201268,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,8,'2024-04-30','2024-05-08','Rendy','Wiwik',1,'Double',15936000.00,'The Deluxe Rooms are 45 m2 and housed in a two stories building, over viewing to arrays of coconut trees and rice field. It features white-washed wood finishing, wooden floor and high quality king size bed with mosquito net, 29’ LED TV, DVD player, soft elegant cotton linen, and spacious bathroom featuring marble bathtub, shower room and guest amenities.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-04-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5089753,'328','Mrs. Sandra Lizarbe',30650,208425,'Private Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-05-18','2024-05-21','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',7200000.00,'Each villa embraces calmness, comfort and privacy in a simple and elegant setting. Guests can relax while peacefully sipping drinks in an inviting plunge pool surrounded by a lush tropical garden and at an old-wooden deck terrace where they can have a peaceful siesta on the large-bean bags or day-bed mattress.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5089772,'328','Mrs. Sandra Lizarbe',30508,207386,'Padang Bai to Seminyak','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-21','2024-05-21','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',600000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"text\": \"ETA 13.55 from Gili Air by BlueWater Express on 21 May\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"text\": \"Jl. Pura Telaga Waja No.18A, Kerobokan Kelod, Kec. Kuta Utara, Kabupaten Badung\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kayumas Seminyak Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5089787,'328','Mrs. Sandra Lizarbe',30798,201630,'One Bedroom Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-05-21','2024-05-23','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',2784000.00,'The two-story, 45sqm One Bedroom Suite features an natural and airy interior, complemented with modern furnishings and views overlooking to the private terrace with a plunge pool. Floor-to-ceiling glass doors provide generous natural lighting and a dynamic ambience. Plush linens and a marble bathroom surround guests in elegance.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5089836,'328','Mrs. Sandra Lizarbe',30508,207270,'Seminyak to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-23','2024-05-23','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',300000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"text\": \"Please be ready at hotel\'s lobby for pick up\", \"time\": \"20:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kayumas Seminyak Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"text\": \"ETD 01.05 by QR961 to Doha on 24 May 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5090003,'329','Christine Kaiser',30959,213942,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-07','2024-12-08','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Twin',974400.00,'Specially designed for savvy travelers seeking comfort and style at 48 sqm of room size. Available in King and Double bet with the option of an extra bed for an additional fee. The room features a cozy living room with a comfortable sofa, LED wall-mounted TV, complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi, and in-room amenities to ensure a relaxing stay experience.',NULL,'Check-in time 14.00 Check-out time 12.00 Early check-in is subject to availability upon arrival and may be charged additional cost.','{\"date\": \"2024-12-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5090004,'329','Christine Kaiser',30959,213942,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-18','2024-12-19','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Twin',974400.00,'Specially designed for savvy travelers seeking comfort and style at 48 sqm of room size. Available in King and Double bet with the option of an extra bed for an additional fee. The room features a cozy living room with a comfortable sofa, LED wall-mounted TV, complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi, and in-room amenities to ensure a relaxing stay experience.',NULL,'Check-in time 14.00 Check-out time 12.00 Early check-in is subject to availability upon arrival and may be charged additional cost.','{\"date\": \"2024-12-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5090005,'329','Christine Kaiser',30959,212511,'One-way Airport Transfer','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-07','2024-12-07','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Per Car',168000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-12-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5090006,'329','Christine Kaiser',30959,212511,'One-way Airport Transfer','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-19','2024-12-19','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Per Car',168000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-12-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5090189,'325','Jorge CASADO',30508,202881,'Batukaru - Jatiluwih Rice Terrace Incl. Lunch','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-03','2024-05-03','Rendy','Wiwik',2,'Persons (2)',1926400.00,'We begin the tour from a beautiful rice terrace of Jatiluwih. Unfolding from the foot of mountain until the coastal side, it is one of places in Bali with the beautiful view, as according to its name “Jati” and “Luwih”, where Jati mean really and Luwih meaning especial, good, and beautiful or the equivalent. The local paddies are planted in this place look typically of the high relative size plant if it is compared with other pre-eminent paddy planted by most farmers in Bali. Stroll around the area for a while and take a nice pictures, before we continue to Banyumala Twin Waterfall. The waterfall is special in that there are two flows of water to be seen, hence the name ‘twin’. Water cascades down steep rocks with gorgeous greenery surrounding them. Here you can take a refreshing dip in the plunge pool at the bottom - dunk your head and listen to the sounds of the water crashing down. After the refreshment, we conclude our day by heading to Wanagiri Hidden Hill. This hill has a charm of beauty that can make anyone who saw her feel hypnotized and fell in love Beautiful natural paintings depicting the beautiful mountains, the beautiful green trees, and the expanse of the lake can be seen clearly from this place. In addition to the panoramic view, cool and fresh air is also an added value that makes this tourist area worth visiting. Take photos and enjoy the scenery and then we head back to your hotel.',NULL,'Please ready at the lobby hotel on 08.30 AM Pick Up/Drop Off: The Sankara Resort Jl. Cempaka, Kumbuh, MAS, Ubud, Gianyar Regency, Bali 80571 Phone: +62361 8493515','{\"date\": \"2024-05-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5090197,'325','Jorge CASADO',30508,202882,'The Mother Temple Besakih and Goa Gajah Incl. Lunch','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-02','2024-05-02','Rendy','Wiwik',2,'Persons (2)',2083200.00,'The first destination is Kusamba Beach, it is one of the favorite places of interest in Bali which is famous with the beautiful beach, we can also meet a fish market in this place which is usually held between 10 am until 4 pm. Then we go to Goa Lawah, this is one of the favourite place to be visited, because here is a nature cave dwelt by thousands of tail bat located at north side from Jeroan/center of Goa Lawah Temple. Next we go to Bukit Jambul, it is strategically located beside of the main road from Denpasar to Besakih Temple and it is one of the tourist destinations that visited on Besakih Tour. It is situated in the plateau area which is blessed with the beautiful panorama of rice terrace and green coconuts three unfolding to the sea. After visit Bukit Jambul, we’ll continue to Besakih Temple is the biggest Hindu temple in Bali which the local people call Pura Besakih. It owns beautiful view from the top of temple area where we can see the wide nature panorama until to the ocean so that’s why this temple is many visited by tourists from all over the world. Then go to Kertagosa, This place also owns Taman Gili, a building floating or sees like floating because it is intentionally founded in the middle of a fish pond.',NULL,'Please ready at the lobby hotel on 08.30 AM Pick Up/Drop Off: The Sankara Resort Jl. Cempaka, Kumbuh, MAS, Ubud, Gianyar Regency, Bali 80571 Phone: +62361 8493515','{\"date\": \"2024-05-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5090224,'325','Jorge CASADO',30508,202864,'GUNUNG KAWI TEMPLE - TIRTA EMPUL - KINTAMANI INCL. LUNCH','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-05','2024-05-05','Rendy','Wiwik',2,'Persons (2)',2049600.00,'We will be picking you up from your hotel to enjoy the wealth of art in Ubud. First we will visit Monkey Forest; the Ubud Monkey Forest is a nature reserve and temple complex in Ubud, Bali. It houses approximately 340 Crab-eating Macaque (Macacafas cicularis) monkeys. The Monkey Forest contains the Pura Dalem Agung Padangtegal temple as well as a \"Holy Spring\" bathing temple and another temple used for cremation ceremonies. Next we go to Ubud Traditional Art Market where the existence is not far different from other markets available in the tourism area. This market as a society economics center of Ubud and it is apposite to the existence of Ubud Empire that is called Puri Saren. Our last destination is Gua Gajah (Elephant Cave). This cave is built at crevasse edge from the federation of 2 rills that is called Pangkung River, where the irrigation is mixed with Petanu River flow. The word of Gua Gajah is anticipated coming from the word of Lwa Gajah, the name of Buddhist Temple or hermitage for Buddhist monk. There is a relief which is almost looking like the form of mountain on the entrance of this cave. It was carved many designed on the relief like grove with the stick, close leaf, animal for example forest pig, tortoise and specters. The cave mouth is decorated by the bas-relief with the eye turn around to the right or west side. At the end of tour we will transferred back you to the hotel.',NULL,'Please ready at the lobby hotel on 08.30 AM Pick Up/Drop Off: The Sankara Resort Jl. Cempaka, Kumbuh, MAS, Ubud, Gianyar Regency, Bali 80571 Phone: +62361 8493515','{\"date\": \"2024-05-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5090258,'325','Jorge CASADO',30508,202881,'TREKKING & CANOE LAKE BUYAN & TAMBLINGAN - BANYUMALA WATERFALL - CAFE LUWAK','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-06','2024-05-06','Rendy','Wiwik',2,'Persons (2)',1579200.00,'We begin the tour from a beautiful rice terrace of Jatiluwih. Unfolding from the foot of mountain until the coastal side, it is one of places in Bali with the beautiful view, as according to its name “Jati” and “Luwih”, where Jati mean really and Luwih meaning especial, good, and beautiful or the equivalent. The local paddies are planted in this place look typically of the high relative size plant if it is compared with other pre-eminent paddy planted by most farmers in Bali. Stroll around the area for a while and take a nice pictures, before we continue to Banyumala Twin Waterfall. The waterfall is special in that there are two flows of water to be seen, hence the name ‘twin’. Water cascades down steep rocks with gorgeous greenery surrounding them. Here you can take a refreshing dip in the plunge pool at the bottom - dunk your head and listen to the sounds of the water crashing down. After the refreshment, we conclude our day by heading to Wanagiri Hidden Hill. This hill has a charm of beauty that can make anyone who saw her feel hypnotized and fell in love Beautiful natural paintings depicting the beautiful mountains, the beautiful green trees, and the expanse of the lake can be seen clearly from this place. In addition to the panoramic view, cool and fresh air is also an added value that makes this tourist area worth visiting. Take photos and enjoy the scenery and then we head back to your hotel.',NULL,'Please ready at the lobby hotel on 08.00 AM Pick Up/Drop Off: The Sankara Resort Jl. Cempaka, Kumbuh, MAS, Ubud, Gianyar Regency, Bali 80571 Phone: +62361 8493515','{\"date\": \"2024-05-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5090263,'325','Jorge CASADO',30508,202896,'Tanah Lot Temple - Uluwatu Temple incl. Lunch','Confirmed','C2I-BALI05',1,'2024-05-08','2024-05-08','Rendy','Wiwik',2,'Persons (2)',4032000.00,'At 08.00 am, we pick you up from your hotel and start our journey to Tunjuk Village in Tabanan district. Upon arrival, you will be greeted with open arms and with the warm smiles of the locals you meet along the way. You\'ll meet in the outer courtyard of the village temple and meet your local guides. Throughout the hike you will meet people from the village involved in the tasks that keep their lives busy day in and day out. You can choose to observe or participate in them to gain a better understanding of village life. The mighty water buffalo is still used to drag the plough through the muddy rice paddies and prepare the land for planting. Or maybe you want to help with planting or harvesting, depending on the time of year. When you complete the tour in the rice paddies, you\'ll follow your guide on a path through lush gardens where villagers go about their daily chores. There are women who beat the rice with heavy mallets to remove the hooves. After lunch we leave Tunjuk Village and continue our journey to visit THE TANAH LOT. We\'ll close the visit by watching the sunset at the most famous and photographed temple in Bali. Torn from the earth on a stone pedestal sculpted by the incoming tides, the solitary black towers of Tanah Lot and the plumes of foliage spilling over the precipices, recall the delicacy of Chinese painting. The Pura Tanah Lot or the Earth Temple in the middle of the sea was built in the 16th century. At the end of the day, you\'ll be transferred to your hotel.',NULL,'1X Dinner Jimbaran with 1 Bottle Wine Please ready at the lobby hotel on 09.00 AM Pick Up: The Sankara Resort Jl. Cempaka, Kumbuh, MAS, Ubud, Gianyar Regency, Bali 80571 Phone: +62361 8493515 Drop Off: Airis Uluwatu Jalan Raya Uluwatu KM23, Ungasan, Kuta Selatan, Badung - Bali Phone: (0361) 4725377 / 08553902377','{\"date\": \"2024-05-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5090268,'325','Jorge CASADO',31214,216723,'One Bedroom Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-05-08','2024-05-11','Rendy','Wiwik',1,'Double',8594880.00,'Villa features a private pool and gazebo. It comes with a 42-inch flat-screen cable TV with DVD player. An en suite bathroom has a Jacuzzi bathtub and separate shower. Villa Facilities: Pool View, Terrace, DVD Player, Video, Cable Channels, Plat-screen TV, Safe, Air Conditioning, Desk, Sitting Area, Private entrance, Sofa, Title/Marble Floor, Private Pool, Wardrobe/Closet, Clothes rack, Hairdryer, Free Toiletries, Toilet Bathroom, Slippers, Bathtub or Shower, Refrigerator, Dining Area, Electric Kettle, Outdoor Dining Area, Wake-up Service, Entire Unit Located on Ground Floor.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5090279,'325','Jorge CASADO',30508,212543,'Uluwatu to Seminyak','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-11','2024-05-11','Rendy','Wiwik',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'Please be ready at the lobby hotel on 12.00 PM Pick Up: Airis Uluwatu Jalan Raya Uluwatu KM23, Ungasan, Kuta Selatan, Badung - Bali Phone: (0361) 4725377 / 08553902377 Drop Off: The Seminyak Beach Resort Jl. Kayu Aya, Pantai Seminyak, Kuta, Seminyak, Kec. Kuta, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361 Phone: +62361 730814','{\"date\": \"2024-05-11\", \