091733,'336','Group 13-14 October 2024',31426,206241,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-13','2024-10-14','Rendy','Rendy',11,'Double + Twin',9548000.00,'Our comfortable packages start with our deluxe rooms, measuring 22 square meters and decorated in a chic contemporary style. Choose from rooms with either a queen-sized bed or twin single beds. Room is equipped with a cable TV, air conditioning and a minibar. It comes with private bathroom facilities, a seating area and a work desk. A hairdryer and tea/coffee maker are available, and many more.',NULL,'Check-in time 14.00 Check-out time 12.00 Early check-in is subject to availability upon arrival and may be charged additional cost.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5091734,'336','Group 13-14 October 2024',31426,206252,'Airport Transfer','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-13','2024-10-13','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Per Car',1960000.00,NULL,NULL,'The driver will be waiting at the exit of arrival hall, holding a signage of your/group name. If you find any difficulty, please contact Swiss-Belhotel Ambon airport representative: +6281344508053 (Mr Muslim) +62812-4054-1504 (Front Office)','{\"date\": \"2024-10-13\", \"text\": \"ETA: 15.35 by Garuda Indonesia GA646 from Jakarta on 13 Oct\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Ambon Airport\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5091735,'336','Group 13-14 October 2024',31426,206252,'Airport Transfer','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-14','2024-10-14','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Per Car',1960000.00,NULL,NULL,'Contact person of White Manta: Mr Nacho +62812 46974557 (WhatsApp)','{\"date\": \"2024-10-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-14\", \"text\": \"Guests must arrive by 10.00 at Ambon Dive Explore in Laha to meet up with White Manta Liveaboard\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Ambon Dive Explore in Laha\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5091740,'335','Patricia Sancho Izquierdo',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-15','2024-05-16','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',784000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel.','{\"date\": \"2024-05-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Soekarno-Hatta International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"text\": \"FM7 HOTEL JAKARTA\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Jakarta\"}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5091747,'335','Patricia Sancho Izquierdo',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-05-16','2024-05-18','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',10080000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan isCape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continueto add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5091763,'335','Patricia Sancho Izquierdo',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-19','2024-05-19','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"text\": \"ETA : 17.05h by Lion Air JT 910 from Surabaya on 19 May 2024\", \"time\": \"17:05\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Airport Ngurah Rai Domestic\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"text\": \"WAPA DIUME UBUD Jl. Suweta Banjar Bentuyung Ubud, Ubud, Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5091764,'335','Patricia Sancho Izquierdo',30778,201426,'1 Bedroom Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-05-19','2024-05-23','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',10584000.00,'A private individually villa overlooking to rice fields or private natural garden view. A one storey with pool that has a king size bed in the master bedroom. The bath room features a sunken bath and the balcony overlooking rice field. The 7 units Villa with Pool has private garden and inviting terraces, the villas offers wonderful views of the surrounding countryside ensconced in complete luxury. Complete with daybeds and cushions for luxurious lounging, the villas also offer the wonderful furnishings and bathing facilities that come as standard at this boutique resort. An escape from the world, by reconnecting to it. A private individually Pool Villa is suitable for two person, has a king size bed with sunken bath and balcony overlooking the rice field.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5091794,'335','Patricia Sancho Izquierdo',30621,212116,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-05-23','2024-05-25','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',3880800.00,'The Superior rooms in main Sal building will provide you the extra space and comfort that you aim for after a day surfing or simply enjoying the beach. With an Island chic design features these rooms represent the extra pamper that you deserve it. Room Amenities; Balcony, Wireless Internet Access, Air-conditioning, Mini Bar, Safety Box. Located in the stunning Bukit region, this intimate eco boutique resort is one of the best kept secrets in Bali, offering you the best service and beautiful amenities such as our gorgeous swimming pools.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5091796,'335','Patricia Sancho Izquierdo',30508,216161,'Uluwatu to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-25','2024-05-25','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"text\": \"Sal Secret Uluwatu Gg. Mertasari, Pecatu, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": \"20:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Uluwatu\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"text\": \"ETD: 01.00h by Philipines Airlines PR53826 May 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Internnational Airport Ngurah Rai\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5091807,'335','Patricia Sancho Izquierdo',30673,200559,'Deluxe Double Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-18','2024-05-19','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',0.00,'Designed to capture nature vibes. Slide open the door to your private terrace to let in the fresh mountain air and relax.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5092395,'338','Robert Fulkerson',30508,213360,'Tulamben to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-21','2024-09-21','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Persons (1-3)',784000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-21\", \"text\": \"Please be ready in hotel lobby at the mentioned time.\", \"time\": \"12:00\", \"locality\": \"Alam Batu Resort Tulamben\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Komaneka Bisma Resort Ubud\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5092398,'338','Robert Fulkerson',30711,200830,'Bisma Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-09-21','2024-09-24','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Double',9424800.00,'Spacious one-bedroom suite of 88 sqm with private balcony for a sophisticated Ubud getaway. Interiors feature extensive use of wood and fine Indonesian textiles and art, lending an understated elegance to the space. Featuring a private balcony, this room includes a flat-screen TV and an en-suite bathroom with a bathtub and a shower, and many more.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5092400,'338','Robert Fulkerson',30508,207262,'Ubud to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-24','2024-09-24','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver will wait up to 30 minutes after your scheduled pickup time. - Please keep in mind that any further delay could affect your timely arrival at the airport for your flight. - For any changes in flight departure time, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available). - Requests for pickup time earlier than originally booked are subject to availability.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-24\", \"text\": \"Please be ready in hotel lobby at the mentioned time.\", \"time\": \"17:00\", \"locality\": \"Komaneka Bisma Resort Ubud\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-24\", \"text\": \"ETD: 22.35 by JetStar JQ38 to Sydney on 24 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Denpasar Airport\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5092403,'338','Robert Fulkerson',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-22','2024-09-22','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Persons (2)',1747200.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-22\", \"text\": \"Please be ready in hotel lobby at the mentioned time.\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"Komaneka Resort Bisma\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Komaneka Resort Bisma\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5092405,'338','Robert Fulkerson',30508,202895,'East Bali Tour','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-23','2024-09-23','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Persons (2)',1825600.00,'In this part of the trip, we set off along the East Coast of the island. The first site visit will be the Kusamba Village, a fishing village where colorful Prahu in the black sand beaches. We will announce the salt making process by traditional method. We continue our journey on the east coast to reach Goa Lawah, Gua Lawah or Bat Cave is one of favorite places of interest in Bali and it is located near of hilly bank so it is called reef of Middle hill. We continue our trip to Tenganan Village, Tenganan Village is one of the oldest Balinese Traditional located in Karangasem Regency, east part of Bali. This village is much referred by cultural literature science of Tenganan Pegringsingan, which is very famous in the island. It owns very unique local community life pattern which is one example of Bali Aga Village cultures (Hindu Prehistoric) and different with other countryside in plain of Bali. From here, we go to Amlapura to visit the Royal Palace, The town of Amlapura is the capital of Karangasem (\'East Bali\'). The palace of the former kings of the region is located here, and their descendants have opened parts of the complex to the public. We will finish our trip with visit heaven of Tirta Gangga, Tirta Gangga is a beautiful park with the huge water fountain. At the end of tour we will transfer you back to the hotel.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-23\", \"text\": \"Please be ready in hotel lobby at the mentioned time\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"Komaneka Resort Bisma\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Komaneka Resort Bisma\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5093075,'334','Lorraine Lo-Yun LEE',32201,214478,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-12','2024-06-13','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Single',1575000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5093554,'316','Angela Kaye Leet',32743,216654,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-02','2024-08-03','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Double',796672.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \