, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5103261,'360','Thomas Ronald Arrowsmith',30783,216589,'4D3N Jogja-Bromo-Surabaya Incl. Train / A. The Phoenix (Deluxe Room) & Jiwa Jawa Bromo (Deluxe Room)','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-06-16','2024-06-19','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Persons (2 / Double)',19170000.00,'D1 : Arrival Yogyakarta International Airport – Visit Prambanan Temple – Transfer to hotel D2 : Borobudur temple incl. Mendut and Pawon ,Yogyakarta City Tour Visit Sultan Palace, Watercastle and Bird/Traditional Market D3 : Jogja – Mojokerto by Train then continue drive to Bromo – overnight in Bromo D4 : Sunrise and Mt. Bromo crater tour incl. Jeep ( Horse rise Exclude ) – Transfer to Surabaya airport',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-16\", \"text\": \"ETA 09.15 by Garuda Indonesia GA0204 from Jakarta on 16 Jun\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Yogyakarta International Airport (YIA)\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-19\", \"text\": \"ETD 15.10 by Batik Air ID6401 to Jakarta on 19 Jun\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Surabaya Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5103266,'360','Thomas Ronald Arrowsmith',30806,213001,'3D2N Borneo Orangutan Tour / Deluxe Houseboat I','Confirmed','C2B-DELUXE',3,'2024-06-20','2024-06-22','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Persons (2)',18397200.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN – KUMAI PORT – TANJUNG HARAPAN – PROBOSCIS TOUR Upon your arrival at Pangkalan Bun Airport, meet and greet with our staff and guide, then direct transfer to Kumai. It will take about 15–20 minutes by car. Upon your arrival in Kumai, you will be transferred directly to the houseboat. Lunch will be provided on board. Afterward, boating down the Kumai River. It takes approximately 15 minutes to reach the Seikonyer River, the main river in Tanjung Puting National Park. As you cruise up the Seikonyer River, you will see nice vegetation around the river bank: Nipa palm, Pandanus, and some kinds of trees that are growing up around the river. See some wildlife, such as birds, macaques, Proboscis monkeys, and orangutans. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. Then at 16.00, return back to the boat and continue boating up to observe and learn more about Proboscis monkeys along the river banks. Proboscis monkeys are an endemic animal that can be seen only in Borneo. Dinner and overnight on the Deluxe Houseboat Meals : Lunch – Dinner Accommodation : Deluxe Houseboat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY – CAMP LEAKEY After breakfast, you boat up to Pondok Tanggui, the second rehabilitation center for orangutans. Visit the orangutan feeding at 09.00 AM. Enjoy your time while taking some pictures. Then, at 10 a.m., return back to the houseboat and continue boating up to Camp Leakey. Camp Leakey is the highlight of the National Park. You will be passing by the Black River, which is full of wildlife, such as many kinds of birds, primates, fish, and crocodiles. Lunch will be served by our own cook with a variety of special food. On arrival in Camp Leakey, you will visit small museum to see all the work of Dr. Birute Galdikas, who studied the orangutan here from 1971 until today. Enjoy your time until 14.00, when you trek up into the forest to see orangutans feeding. Enjoy the time until 16.00, when you return to the boat and boat down directly to the Nipa Palm area to see thousands of fireflies. Dinner and overnight in the houseboat. Note : The Birute Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. Meals : Breakfast – Lunch – Dinner Accommodation : Deluxe Houseboat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT – PANGKALAN BUN After breakfast on board, you will boat down directly to Kumai and then have a direct transfer to Pangkalan Bun airport for your next destination. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-06-20\", \"text\": \"ETA 07.15 by Batik Air ID6202 from Jakarta on 20 Jun\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pangkalan Bun Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-22\", \"text\": \"ETD 08.50 by Batik Air ID6134 to Surabaya on 22 Jun\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5103269,'360','Thomas Ronald Arrowsmith',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-22','2024-06-22','Rendy','Tami',2,'Persons (1-3)',840000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-22\", \"text\": \"ETA 15.45 by Lion Air JT804 from Surabaya on 22 Jun\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-22\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Bisma\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5103270,'360','Thomas Ronald Arrowsmith',30711,200830,'Bisma Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-06-22','2024-06-26','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Double',15840000.00,'Spacious one-bedroom suite of 88 sqm with private balcony for a sophisticated Ubud getaway. Interiors feature extensive use of wood and fine Indonesian textiles and art, lending an understated elegance to the space. Featuring a private balcony, this room includes a flat-screen TV and an en-suite bathroom with a bathtub and a shower, and many more.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5103271,'360','Thomas Ronald Arrowsmith',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-23','2024-06-23','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Persons (2)',1872000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-23\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Bisma\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5103272,'360','Thomas Ronald Arrowsmith',30508,202894,'Kehen Temple - Pengelipuran - Kintamani Highlands','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-24','2024-06-24','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Persons (2)',1680000.00,'Our wonderful tour starts from Kehen Temple. It is an ancient Hindu temple complex boasting unique architectural features. The staircases reaching from the ground to temple courtyard are carved sandstone mythical animal and Balinese folklore figure statues and also the central vestibule. The temple’s walls are also ornate with Chinese porcelain plates, which are a tribute to the historical relations between the local Bali kingdom and China. Afterwards, we continue to Penglipuran, a village that succeeded in preserving its 75-hectare bamboo forest located in the northern part of the village. Members of this village have a strong commitment to the system of \'Ayahan Desa\' - a philosophy committed to respecting the land on which the village stands. To concludes the day, we stop by at Tukad Cepung Waterfall. Well-guarded by the circular cliffs, this waterfall is difficult to locate for the first time visitor. The circular cliffs give you the feeling of being in a cave, while the open sky right from where the waterfall emerges, gives you the most enchanting view. The sunlight falls on the glistering waterfall creating a rainbow, which feels as though it is projected right up to you. If you have never seen water flowing from the sky, then this would be your chance! After spending your time there, we go back to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-24\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Bisma\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5103273,'360','Thomas Ronald Arrowsmith',30508,207262,'Ubud to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-26','2024-06-26','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Persons (1-3)',840000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-26\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"04:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Bisma\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-26\", \"text\": \"ETD 08.00 by Batik Air ID6333 to Labuan Bajo on 26 Jun\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5103275,'360','Thomas Ronald Arrowsmith',31083,212384,'3D2N LOB Rinca - Padar - Komodo Island Tour (Superior Standard B. - Bintang Flores, etc)','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-06-26','2024-06-28','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Persons (2-3)',38124000.00,'TOUR ITINERARY Highlights: Menjarite, Kelor, Kalong, Rinca, Padar, Komodo Island, Pink Beach, Taka Makassar, Manta Point, Kanawa, Batu Cermin Mirror Cave DAY 1 : DENPASAR - LABUAN BAJO - MENJARITE - PADAR - KELOR - KALONG ISLAND Arrival at Komodo Airport in Labuan Bajo west Flores, meeting service with our tour guide and transfer to the pier of Labuan Bajo for Rinca Island. It’s about 2 hours sail to the island of Komodo Dragon, stop at Menjarite island for snorkeling then continue to Rinca island-the Island of Komodo dragon, you will find not just e Dragons but also many wild animals like, deer, wild buffalo, long-tailed macaque and wild pig also numerous of birds. Keep your eyes look up as sometime you will find the young Komodo dragons on the trees. A local ranger will lead you through this natural preservation. Late afternoon sailing directly to Kalong Rinca Island to see the hundreds of fling foxes set out from the mangrove tree at 06-07 pm, the lovely sunset from the boat trip really enjoyable here. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Boat Cabin Air Conditioning DAY 2 : KALONG - PADAR - KOMODO - PINK BEACH - MANTA POINT - TAKA MAKASSAR - LABUAN BAJO After having breakfast in your boat, heading to Padar Island, taking trek to Padar Island until having the top view point to get breathtaking scenery of three bays around, Padar Island hike in Komodo has some of the most amazing views in Indonesia, trek to downhill and back to the Boat for sailing directly to Loh Liang – the Ranger station in Komodo Island. By passing through many small islands, After registering start to take basic trekking to see the GIANT RIZARD / KOMODO DRAGON and other wild animals as: Timor deer, wild pig, wild chicken and many variously of tropical bird. Please keep your look at any directions as sometimes you will also find young Komodo dragon hanging over the trees. A local ranger will be led you during the trek. Return to the boat on to Pink beach for snorkeling, swimming and relaxing. It is really spectacular and unspoiled coral reef and many color fish. This is one of best side for snorkeling diving. Sail toward MANTA POINT to exploring Huge Mantas by snorkeling even watching from your boat trip (can’t be guaranteed if weather is not good, like wave and current are strongly) visit also the taka Makaasar its really tiny island with white sand beach really enjoyable to relaxing or beach walking then heading to Labuan bajo for overnight and dinner at above hotel list option. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner DAY 3 : LABUAN BAJO - DENPASAR After breakfast taking your next excursion with visiting local marke and Batu Cermin (Mirror Stone) Cave. The grotto is 75 by 75 meters large, and contains stalactites and stalagmites. Some tunnels are narrow and dark but in others sunlight falls, then process to the airport for flight to Denpasar or to your next destination. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch Attention: The itinerary is subject to change due to the weather, tide level and operating conditions without prior notice.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-26\", \"text\": \"ETA 09.10 by Batik Air ID6333 from Denpasar on 26 Jun\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Labuan Bajo Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-28\", \"text\": \"ETD 09.50 by Batik Ait ID6332 to Denpasar on 28 Jun\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5103278,'360','Thomas Ronald Arrowsmith',30508,212288,'Airport to Seminyak','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-28','2024-06-28','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Persons (1-3)',600000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-28\", \"text\": \"ETA 11.05 by Batik Air ID6332 from Labuan Bajo on 28 Jun\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-28\", \"text\": \"Jl. Kayu Aya, Pantai Seminyak, Kuta, Seminyak, Kec. Kuta, Kabupaten Badung, Bali\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Seminyak Beach Resort & Spa\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5103280,'360','Thomas Ronald Arrowsmith',30606,203160,'Beach Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-28','2024-06-29','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Double',4716000.00,'The Beach Room are a stylish, sleek and serene addition to our hotel on Seminyak Beach. Witness a marriage of contemporary design and Balinese tradition, complete with yielding beds, sunny balconies and lavish en-suite bathrooms with indulgent soaking tubs and powerful rain showers. Hand-carved wooden accents are offset by warm-toned furnishings and fabrics that span the spectrum from burgundy via espresso to cappuccino.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5103637,'177','SR IÑIGO ETXEBERRIA IZETA/ SRA AINARA LOPEZ FRANCISCO',30527,200122,'Terrace Villa','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-05-26','2024-05-30','Melysa','Komang',1,'Double',11040000.00,'After a day of adventure exploring the culture of Ubud and its surroundings, the Terrace View Villas offer a perfect retreat. These one-bedroom villas offer a spacious floor area of 70 m2, with a King-sized bed, air conditioning, private bathroom with bathtub, and a beautiful view of the nature surrounding the resort. Unwind in the private outdoor space in the gazebo on the personal terrace, laze in the infinity plunge pool, or simply lay back in the outdoor natural stone bathtub.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5103658,'177','SR IÑIGO ETXEBERRIA IZETA/ SRA AINARA LOPEZ FRANCISCO',30596,201103,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-05-30','2024-06-02','Melysa','Komang',1,'Double',7380000.00,'Contemporary and sleek 38-sqm room with dark furnishing adapting the latest in style with tropical modern touches. Thirty-four rooms in three storey building with private balcony where some are facing directly to the ocean and others to inner garden. Featuring cozy twin beds and a relaxation corner with a comfortable cushioned sofa or perfect for couples and solo travelers seeking a spacious double bed. Our room offers premium linens, plush pillows, a peaceful ambiance and a large picture window that leads to a private balcony, allowing you to immerse yourself in the tropical beauty of the outdoors to recharge after a day of activities. Enjoy high-speed internet, a flat-screen TV, coffee and tea-making facilities, and an in-room safe deposit box, ensuring a convenient and enjoyable stay.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5103660,'177','SR IÑIGO ETXEB