le',5400000.00,'20 units (10 double bed and 10 twin bed) of 29 sqm each superior rooms with valley view and garden are modern‐minimalism designed. Advance facilities such as LCD TV, coffee/tea maker, balcony/terrace, safety deposit box, minibar, and complete bathroom facilities.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5103817,'362','Fernando Martín Gordillo',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-06','2024-08-06','Jacob','Febrina',1,'Persons (1-3)',420000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-06\", \"text\": \"ETA 14:00 by Citilink QG684 from Jakarta on 06 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Denpasar Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pertiwi Bisma 2 Hotel Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5103842,'363','Lucia De Los Angeles Lozano',30508,214239,'Airport to Uluwatu','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-17','2024-06-17','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-17\", \"text\": \"ETA 20.50 by Singapore Airlines SQ946 from Singapore on 17 June\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-17\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bangbang Metuug, Pecatu, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Green Escape - Eco Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5103847,'363','Lucia De Los Angeles Lozano',30930,202592,'One Bedroom Bungalow','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-06-17','2024-06-21','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',11520000.00,'Room size : 37 sqm. Our One-Bedroom Bungalow is a unique Romantic Eco-Boho Bungalow nestles in Green Escape Resort. You will stay in a sumptuous air-conditioned bungalow that has been handcrafted using recycled wood and tastefully decorated to offer you an authentic Balinese getaway. It\'s the very epitome of a tranquil escape. This Bungalow offers a deluxe king-size bed and a daybed to relax. It offers a comfy mattress, as we know the benefits of a good night’s sleep. The semi-outdoor bathroom with a rain shower will help you revive yourself. Enjoy the comfy sofa on your private terrace which opens onto the exotic garden & pool. The daybed can be used to extend the sleeping capacity of your private bungalow.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5103851,'363','Lucia De Los Angeles Lozano',30508,216161,'Uluwatu to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-21','2024-06-21','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-21\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bangbang Metuug, Pecatu, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": \"14:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Green Escape - Eco Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-21\", \"text\": \"ETD 18.55 by Qatar Airways QR963 to Doha on 21 June\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5103884,'362','Fernando Martín Gordillo',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-07','2024-08-07','Jacob','Febrina',2,'Persons (2)',1872000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,'FD Tour Taman Ayun - Jatiluwih - Ulun Danu Beratan Temple - Tanah Lot with Spanish speaking guide','{\"date\": \"2024-08-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pertiwi Bisma 2 Hotel Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pertiwi Bisma 2 Hotel Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5103892,'362','Fernando Martín Gordillo',30508,202882,'The Mother Temple Besakih and Surrounding','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-08','2024-08-08','Jacob','Febrina',2,'Persons (2)',1848000.00,'The first destination is Kusamba Beach, it is one of the favorite places of interest in Bali which is famous with the beautiful beach, we can also meet a fish market in this place which is usually held between 10 am until 4 pm. Then we go to Goa Lawah, this is one of the favourite place to be visited, because here is a nature cave dwelt by thousands of tail bat located at north side from Jeroan/center of Goa Lawah Temple. Next we go to Bukit Jambul, it is strategically located beside of the main road from Denpasar to Besakih Temple and it is one of the tourist destinations that visited on Besakih Tour. It is situated in the plateau area which is blessed with the beautiful panorama of rice terrace and green coconuts three unfolding to the sea. After visit Bukit Jambul, we’ll continue to Besakih Temple is the biggest Hindu temple in Bali which the local people call Pura Besakih. It owns beautiful view from the top of temple area where we can see the wide nature panorama until to the ocean so that’s why this temple is many visited by tourists from all over the world. Then go to Kertagosa, This place also owns Taman Gili, a building floating or sees like floating because it is intentionally founded in the middle of a fish pond.',NULL,'FD Tour Kusamba - Goa Lawah - Bukit Jambul - Besakih Temple - Kerta Gosa with Spanish speaking guide','{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pertiwi Bisma 2 Hotel Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pertiwi Bisma 2 Hotel Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5103908,'362','Fernando Martín Gordillo',30508,207262,'Ubud to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-11','2024-08-11','Jacob','Febrina',1,'Persons (1-3)',420000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'Flight Details: ETD 07:00 by Lion Air JT3569 to Yogyakarta on 11 Aug','{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"03:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pertiwi Bisma 2 Hotel Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5103918,'362','Fernando Martín Gordillo',30805,207414,'DPS-YIA','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-11','2024-08-11','Jacob','Febrina',2,'Person',3300000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5104137,'362','Fernando Martín Gordillo',30783,201474,'2D1N Semarang - Yogyakarta / B. Gallery Prawirotaman','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-08-11','2024-08-12','Jacob','Febrina',2,'Persons (2 / Double)',6780000.00,'D1 : Arrival Semarang airport - Borobudur Temple tour incl. Mendut and Pawon - overnight in Yogyakarta Welcome to the cradle of Indonesian culture, Yogyakarta. A tourist destination for its ancient palaces, temples, batik workshops, gamelan music orchestras, court dances and wayang puppet shows. Upon your arrival in Semarang airport a representative of come2indonesia will be waiting for you with a sign indicating your name to start exploring this special city. We will start by heading towards Borobudur Temple (Candi Borobudur), the great Stupa, the largest Buddhist monument in the world and one of the seven wonders. We will tour around the temple, observe the hundreds and centenary statues of Buddha and witness how dozens of Buddhists come to preach from all over the world. Historically it was established during the relatively brief Sailendra dynasty of Central Java between 778 and 856 BC and is in constant restoration due to the breaks that the tremors of the neighbouring Merapi volcano has been producing during its history. After visiting one of the most important Buddhist temples in Southeast Asia, we continue our journey to the Mendut temple and Pawon temple. And then, we will take you to your Jogjakarta. D2 : Morning visit Prambanan Temple - City Tour Yogyakarta visit Sultan Palace, Watercastle and Bird Market - Transfer to Yogyakarta International Airport You will enjoy a well-deserved breakfast at the hotel and we will start by heading towards Candi Prambanan, the temple of the Hinduists and classified as a World Heritage Site by Unesco since 1991. The built of this temple was finished around the year 856 to commemorate the victory of the descendant Sanjaya of Siva, Rikai Pikatan on the last sovereign Sailendra of Central Java. Take your time to enjoy each carving on the rocks and feel the spirituality that each of the stones perched in this set of more than 200 Hindu temples that are dedicated to the Trimurti, the expression of God as the Creator, the Preserver and the destroyer. After this visit we go to the Keraton known as the Sultan’s Palace. The palace is a complex building two centuries old, located in the heart of the city. You will hear the song of the “freedom” of the birds in the bird market, we will visit the “Water Castle” that occupies the highest part at the northern end of the vast complex of Taman Sari, Malioboro Street, main street of Yogyakarta, with its merchants, horse carriages, taxi-bikes and markets. An incredible experience that will make the hours fly by. According to the time of your flight, we will pick you up to take you to the airport and take the flight to your next destination. End of our services. Thank you very much for exploring Yogyakarta by the hand of Come2indonesia.',NULL,'2D1N Yogyakarta - Semarang Tour with Spanish speaking guide Accommodation : Gallery Prawirotaman Hotel - 1 Double Deluxe Room D1/11 Aug 2024: Arrival in Yogyakarta - Borobudur Temple - Prambanan Temple - Keraton D2/12 Aug 2024: Taman Sari - Bird Market - Transfer to Semarang (B) Flight detail: ETA in Yogyakarta at 07:25 by Lion Air JT3569 on 11 Aug Drop off in Semarang: Artotel Gajahmada Semarang Jl. Gajahmada No. 101, Semarang Phone: +6224 86405777 / +628569 1999577','{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5104391,'362','Fernando Martín Gordillo',30672,200737,'Studio 25 (Superior) Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-12','2024-08-13','Jacob','Febrina',1,'Double',684000.00,'Studio 25 (Superior) room with 25 sqm sized room and with exclusive ARTOTEL bedding collection, some facilities in this room is 43\" inch lcd tv, 24 hours in-room service, high speed internet wi-fi, safety deposit box and hair dryer.',NULL,'Oneway Transfer Hotel - Airport on 13 Aug 2024 Flight detail: ETD 09:10 by Nam Air IN196 to Pangkalan Bun on 13 Aug','{\"date\": \"2024-08-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5104438,'365','Kenneth Vella',30783,213383,'4D3N Yogyakarta - Jomblang Cave / Land Arrangement only','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-08-17','2024-08-20','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Persons (2)',8848000.00,NULL,NULL,'ITINERARY: 17 Aug, Day 01 : Arrival Yogyakarta – Borobudur Temple 18 Aug, Day 02 : Jomblang Cave – Prambanan Temple 19 Aug, Day 03 : Dieng Plateau 20 Aug, Day 04 : Hotel – Transfer to Airport Pickup & Dropoff hotel in Yogyakarta: Jambuluwuk Boutique Hotel Yogyakarta. Jl. Gajah Mada No.67, Purwokinanti, Pakualaman, Kota Yogyakarta, Daerah Istimewa Yogyakarta 55166 Telepon: (0274) 585655','{\"date\": \"2024-08-17\", \"text\": \"ETA: 11.20 by AirAsia AK346 from Kuala Lumpur on 17 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Yogyakarta Airport YIA\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-20\", \"text\": \"ETD: 19.25 by Lion Air JT566 to Denpasar on 20 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Yogyakarta Airport YIA\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5104472,'366','Jacqueline Lewis',30671,200626,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-26','2024-09-27','Ayu','Eddy',1,'Double',1120000.00,'Deluxe Room with a room area of 28 square meters each, there are 2 types of bed, king and twin bed with a size of 28 square meters each.',NULL,'Check-in time 14.00 Check-out time 12.00 Flights information ETA: 15.40 by Emirates EK356 from Dubai on 26 Sep ETD: 02.00 by Batik Air ID6540 to Kupang on 27 Sep','{\"date\": \"2024-09-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5104473,'366','Jacqueline Lewis',30671,200626,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-09','2024-10-10','Ayu','Eddy',1,'Double',1120000.00,'Deluxe Room with a room area of 28 square meters each, there are 2 types of bed, king and twin bed with a size of 28 square meters each.',NULL,'Check-in time 14.00 Check-out time 12.00 Flights information ETA: 17.35 by Lion Air JT881 from Ambon on 09 Oct ETD: 00.40 by Emirates EK359 to Dubai on 10 Oct','{\"date\": \"2024-10-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5104475,'366','Jacqueline Lewis',32660,216224,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-27','2024-09-28','Ayu','Eddy',1,'Double',616000.00,'Providing rooms with a modern and elegant minimalist design equipped with complete facilities. Such as: Hot and Cool Water, Amenities, Linen and Bed with star hotel standard quality',NULL,'Check-in time 12.00 Check-out time 14.00 PLEASE CONSULT YOUR DEPARTURE TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK-IN','{\"date\": \"2024-09-27\", \"text\": \"ETA: 09.10 by Wings Air IW1943 from Kupang on 27 Sep\", \"time\": \"09:10\", \"locality\": \"Bandar Udara Mali Alor (Mali Airport)\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-28\", \"text\": \"Dropoff at Kalabahi Port to meet Tambora Liveaboard on 28 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Kalabahi Port\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5104501,'367','Jeff Ryner',30806,213012,'3D2N Borneo Orangutan Tour / Super Deluxe (Custom)','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-07-11','2024-07-13','Rendy','Rendy',4,'Persons (3-4)',0.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN – KUMAI PORT – TANJUNG HARAPAN – PROBOSCIS TOUR Upon your arrival at Pangkalan Bun Airport, meet and greet with our staff and guide, then direct transfer to Kumai. It will take about 15–20 minutes by car. Upon your arrival in Kumai, you will be transferred directly to the houseboat. Lunch will be provided on board. Afterward, boating down the Kumai River. It takes approximately 15 minutes to reach the Seikonyer River, the main river in Tanjung Puting National Park. As you cruise up the Seikonyer River, you will see nice vegetation around the river bank: Nipa palm, Pandanus, and some kinds of trees that are growing up around the river. See some wildlife, such as birds, macaques, Proboscis monkeys, and orangutans. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. Then at 16.00, return back to the boat and continue boating up to observe and learn more about Proboscis monkeys along the river banks. Proboscis monkeys are an endemic animal that can be seen only in Borneo. Dinner and overnight on the Super Deluxe Houseboat Meals : Lunch – Dinner Accommodation : Super Deluxe Houseboat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY – CAMP LEAKEY After breakfast, you boat up to Pondok Tanggui, the second rehabilitation center for orangutans. Visit the orangutan feeding at 09.00 AM. Enjoy your time while taking some pictures. Then, at 10 a.m., return back to the houseboat and continue boating up to Camp Leakey. Camp Leakey is the highlight of the National Park. You will be passing by the Black River, which is full of wildlife, such as many kinds of birds, primates, fish, and crocodiles. Lunch will be served by our own cook with a variety of special food. On arrival in Camp Leakey, you will visit small museum to see all the work of Dr. Birute Galdikas, who studied the orangutan here from 1971 until today. Enjoy your time until 14.00, when you trek up into the forest to see orangutans feeding. Enjoy the time until 16.00, when you return to the boat and boat down directly to the Nipa Palm area to see thousands of fireflies. Dinner and overnight in the houseboat. Note : The Birute Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. Meals : Breakfast – Lunch – Dinner Accommodation : Super Deluxe Houseboat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT – PANGKALAN BUN After breakfast on board, you will boat down directly to Kumai and then have a direct transfer to Pangkalan Bun airport for your next destination. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board. ITINERARY: Day 1: PANGKALAN BUN – KUMAI PORT – NIGHT TREKKING TOUR (L, D) Day 2: PONDOK TANGGUY – CAMP LEAKEY (B, L, D) Day 3: PONDOK TANGGUY - TANJUNG HARAPAN VILLAGE - TANJUNG HARAPAN - RIMBA ECO LODGE (B, L)','{\"date\": \"2024-07-11\", \"text\": \"ETA: TBA\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Pangkalan Bun Airport\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Rimba Eco Lodge\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5104502,'367','Jeff Ryner',30667,215577,'Diamond Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-13','2024-07-14','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Double',3472000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5104510,'368','Benjamin Bennett',32281,216284,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-15','2024-11-16','Rendy','Komang',1,'Single',784000.00,NULL,NULL,'Dietary requirements: Vegetarian','{\"date\": \"2024-11-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5104511,'368','Benjamin Bennett',32281,215533,'Airport Transfer','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-15','2024-11-15','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Per Car',168000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-11-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5104968,'362','Fernando Martín Gordillo',30805,212247,'SRG-PKN','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-13','2024-08-13','Jacob','Febrina',2,'Person',3520000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5104973,'362','Fernando Martín Gordillo',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-08-13','2024-08-15','Jacob','Febrina',2,'Persons (2)',10800000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan isCape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continueto add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'3D2N Borneo Orangutan Tour Based on Private Klotok, Fullboard, Spanish speaking guide Flight details: ETA 10:20 by Nam Air IN196 from Semarang on 13 Aug ETD 08:50 by Batik Air ID6134 to Surabaya on 15 Aug Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5105141,'350','MARTA OTERO MAYAN',30508,202894,'Templo Kehen – Panglipuran Village – Kintamani','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-12','2024-06-12','Jacob','Eddy',2,'Persons (2)',1680000.00,'Our wonderful tour starts from Kehen Temple. It is an ancient Hindu temple complex boasting unique architectural features. The staircases reaching from the ground to temple courtyard are carved sandstone mythical animal and Balinese folklore figure statues and also the central vestibule. The temple’s walls are also ornate with Chinese porcelain plates, which are a tribute to the historical relations between the local Bali kingdom and China. Afterwards, we continue to Penglipuran, a village that succeeded in preserving its 75-hectare bamboo forest located in the northern part of the village. Members of this village have a strong commitment to the system of \'Ayahan Desa\' - a philosophy committed to respecting the land on which the village stands. To concludes the day, we stop by at Tukad Cepung Waterfall. Well-guarded by the circular cliffs, this waterfall is difficult to locate for the first time visitor. The circular cliffs give you the feeling of being in a cave, while the open sky right from where the waterfall emerges, gives you the most enchanting view. The sunlight falls on the glistering waterfall creating a rainbow, which feels as though it is projected right up to you. If you have never seen water flowing from the sky, then this would be your chance! After spending your time there, we go back to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-12\", \"text\": \"PERTIWI BISMA 2 JALAN RAYA BISMA, UBUD, GIANYAR, BALI 80571, INDONESIA +62361 981386\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"PICK UP ON LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5105146,'350','MARTA OTERO MAYAN',30508,207262,'Ubud to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-16','2024-06-16','Jacob','Eddy',2,'Persons (1-3)',840000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-16\", \"text\": \"Pertiwi Bisma 2 Alamat: Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 phn +62361 981386\", \"time\": \"02:10\", \"locality\": \"PICK UP ON LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-16\", \"text\": \"ETD : 16 Jun / 07 :10 / FROM DENPASAR / ID6202 BY BATIK AIR\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"AIRPORT DENPASAR\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5105285,'362','Fernando Martín Gordillo',30805,212272,'PKN-SUB','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-15','2024-08-15','Jacob','Febrina',2,'Person',3740000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5105290,'362','Fernando Martín Gordillo',31015,203232,'3D2N - Surabaya Mount Bromo Ijen Tour Package drop Bali','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-08-15','2024-08-17','Jacob','Febrina',2,'Persons (2)',8880000.00,NULL,NULL,'3D2N Surabaya - Bromo - Ijen - Drop off Bali with English speaking guide Excluding Horse Riding in Bromo D1/15 Aug 2024: Arrival in Surabaya - Transfer to Bromo D2/16 Aug 2024: Bromo Tour - Transfer to Ijen D3/17 Aug 2024: Ijen Tour - Drop off in Seminyak (Bali) Accommodation: 15 - 16 Aug 2024 / Lereng Bromo Hotel Jl. Bromo, Ledok Sari, Wonokitri, Tosari, Pasuruan, Jawa Timur 67177 Phone: +62343 4020999 / +62813 36598889 16 - 17 Aug 2024 / Ketapang Indah Hotel Jl. Gatot Subroto Km. 6. Banyuwangi, Jawa Timur 68421 Phone: +62333 422280 / +62811 33324 002 Drop off in Bali on 17 Aug: Ize Seminyak Jl. Kayu Aya No. 68 Seminyak, Bali Phone: +62361 8466999 Flight details: ETA in Surabaya at 10:00 by Batik Air ID6134 from Pangkalan Bun on 15 Aug','{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5105310,'362','Fernando Martín Gordillo',31196,204658,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-15','2024-08-16','Jacob','Febrina',1,'Double',1428000.00,'Room type deluxe, with spacious room 3,41 m x 6,09 m and have type bed king size or twin bed. This type of room is available on the 2nd, 3rd and 4th floors and has of the hills view.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5105330,'362','Fernando Martín Gordillo',30803,202852,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-16','2024-08-17','Jacob','Febrina',1,'Double',840000.00,'At 25 sqm of room size with 46 rooms available. This smart room category is more contemporary in appearance and comes with its own terrace or balcony. Minimalist furnishings are balanced by a neutral decor to soothe the senses and ensure restful slumber. Including a double bed (king or queen) or 2 single beds (twin) with maximum capacity of 2 adults + 1 child or 3 adults. The en-suite bathroom features a modern shower cubicle enclosed in glass together with a marble vanity.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5105341,'362','Fernando Martín Gordillo',30598,201188,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-17','2024-08-18','Jacob','Febrina',1,'Double',1393200.00,'Enjoy calming Scandinavian-inspired decor, rainforest shower, flat-screen TV, sofa/day-bed, small balcony and more. Kick back, unwind nd recharge for your next Seminyak adventure.','Room rates inclusive 21% tax and service charge.',NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5105345,'362','Fernando Martín Gordillo',30508,207270,'Seminyak to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-18','2024-08-18','Jacob','Febrina',2,'Persons (1-3)',600000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"IZE Seminyak\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": \"ETD 12:25 by Wings Air IW1848 to Lombok on 18 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Denpasar Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5105355,'362','Fernando Martín Gordillo',30651,203799,'Garden Chalet Room','Confirmed',NULL,5,'2024-08-18','2024-08-23','Jacob','Febrina',1,'Double',6300000.00,'At 32 sqm of room area with 104 rooms available, located upstairs or downstairs with semi open bathroom those rooms are provided either with king or twin bed size and have full view on the tropical gardens of Mangsit. They all have private balcony access.','All rates are INCLUSIVE of government Tax & Service Charge (currently 11% and 10% respective)',NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5105440,'362','Fernando Martín Gordillo',30805,212254,'DPS-LOP','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-18','2024-08-18','Jacob','Febrina',2,'Person',3740000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5105455,'362','Fernando Martín Gordillo',30728,207493,'Bumi Gora / Kuta Tour','Confirmed','EXC 03',1,'2024-08-19','2024-08-19','Jacob','Febrina',2,'Persons (2)',1903200.00,'This tour takes you first to the Pottery Village of Banyumulek. Observe how the local women produce pottery stuffs. Then, visit Sukarare village; renowned for its traditional hand weaving of brightly patterned “songket”, “ikat” and “sarong” cloths. We will observe how the regenerate of weaving tradition goes on in the village. Girl, mother and grandmother even great grandmother do weaving activity together in the village. Next the tour continues to Ende village, featuring the unique traditional houses with its buffalo dung floors. Lunch is served at one of local restaurants in New Kuta Mandalika area. Then, we visit the beautiful beach of Tanjung A’an, one of the most scenic and un-spoilt beaches in this part of Lombok. We may have chance to trek Merese Hills to enjoy magnificent panorama of Indian Ocean.',NULL,'Exploring Lombok: The Sasak Tribe – Banyumalek – Tanjung A’an with English speaking guide. Including Lunch','{\"date\": \"2024-08-19\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Senggigi, Senggigi, Kec. Batu Layar, Kabupaten Lombok Barat Phone: +62370 693444 / +62821 44404046\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Holiday Resort Lombok\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-19\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Senggigi, Senggigi, Kec. Batu Layar, Kabupaten Lombok Barat Phone: +62370 693444 / +62821 44404046\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Holiday Resort Lombok\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5105504,'362','Fernando Martín Gordillo',30805,208054,'LOP-CGK','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-23','2024-08-23','Jacob','Febrina',2,'Person',3960000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5105507,'362','Fernando Martín Gordillo',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-23','2024-08-24','Jacob','Febrina',1,'Double',840000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Roundtrip Airport Transfer Flight Details: ETA 20:45 by Batik Air ID6575 from Surabaya on 23 Aug ETD 14:20 by Cathay Pacific CX776 to Hongkong on 24 Aug Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. - Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK–IN','{\"date\": \"2024-08-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5105696,'371','Anne Rucquoi',30959,212511,'One-way Airport Transfer','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-05','2024-05-05','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Per Car',168000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"dat