pt. This room is a canvas that showcases thought-provoking artworks by some of the most relevant Bali-based contemporary artists. This air-conditioned studio features a 49\" inch LED TV, high speed internet Wi-Fi, 24 hours in-room service, iPod dock, dolce gusto coffee maker, a minibar, en-suite bathroom comes with a shower, a hairdryer, free toiletries, and many more.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5107199,'158','Sabrina Denise Roth',30508,207278,'Full Day Tour Car & Driver (8-10 hours)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-15','2024-05-15','Rendy','Tami',2,'Persons (1-3)',1200000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-15\", \"text\": \"Jl. Kusuma Sari No.1, Sanur, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali 80227\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"ARTOTEL Sanur - Bali\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5107487,'374','JAVIER CEREIJO RIVERA MR / TANIA VALIENTE ESCOBAR MS',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-18','2024-06-18','Guio','Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-18\", \"text\": \"ETA : 18 JUNE 2024 / 15:00H / CX785 BY CATHAY PACIFIC / FROM HONG KONG\", \"time\": \"15:00\", \"locality\": \"AIRPORT DENPASAR\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-18\", \"text\": \"THE ARTINI DIJIWA UBUD Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phn : (0361) 972385\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5107489,'374','JAVIER CEREIJO RIVERA MR / TANIA VALIENTE ESCOBAR MS',30705,201147,'Premier Room Garden View','Confirmed',NULL,5,'2024-06-18','2024-06-23','Guio','Eddy',1,'Double',6244000.00,'Get back to nature in one of our Premier Garden View suites. These spacious, light-filled rooms have beautiful Balinese double doors that can be closed to create a cool air-conditioned space or opened to merge indoor and outdoor living. The balconies overlook the resort’s lush gardens, which are awash in tropical flowers and foliage.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5107491,'374','JAVIER CEREIJO RIVERA MR / TANIA VALIENTE ESCOBAR MS',30508,202896,'Bali Village Life - Tanah Lot Temple','Confirmed','C2I-BALI05',1,'2024-06-19','2024-06-19','Guio','Eddy',2,'Persons (2)',2441600.00,'At 08.00 am, we pick you up from your hotel and start our journey to Tunjuk Village in Tabanan district. Upon arrival, you will be greeted with open arms and with the warm smiles of the locals you meet along the way. You\'ll meet in the outer courtyard of the village temple and meet your local guides. Throughout the hike you will meet people from the village involved in the tasks that keep their lives busy day in and day out. You can choose to observe or participate in them to gain a better understanding of village life. The mighty water buffalo is still used to drag the plough through the muddy rice paddies and prepare the land for planting. Or maybe you want to help with planting or harvesting, depending on the time of year. When you complete the tour in the rice paddies, you\'ll follow your guide on a path through lush gardens where villagers go about their daily chores. There are women who beat the rice with heavy mallets to remove the hooves. After lunch we leave Tunjuk Village and continue our journey to visit THE TANAH LOT. We\'ll close the visit by watching the sunset at the most famous and photographed temple in Bali. Torn from the earth on a stone pedestal sculpted by the incoming tides, the solitary black towers of Tanah Lot and the plumes of foliage spilling over the precipices, recall the delicacy of Chinese painting. The Pura Tanah Lot or the Earth Temple in the middle of the sea was built in the 16th century. At the end of the day, you\'ll be transferred to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-19\", \"text\": \"THE ARTINI DIJIWA UBUD Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phn : (0361) 972385\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": \"MEET IN LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5107495,'374','JAVIER CEREIJO RIVERA MR / TANIA VALIENTE ESCOBAR MS',30508,202894,'Tegalalang – Tirta Empul – Templo Kehen – Penglipuran Villag','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-20','2024-06-20','Guio','Eddy',2,'Persons (2)',1568000.00,'Our wonderful tour starts from Kehen Temple. It is an ancient Hindu temple complex boasting unique architectural features. The staircases reaching from the ground to temple courtyard are carved sandstone mythical animal and Balinese folklore figure statues and also the central vestibule. The temple’s walls are also ornate with Chinese porcelain plates, which are a tribute to the historical relations between the local Bali kingdom and China. Afterwards, we continue to Penglipuran, a village that succeeded in preserving its 75-hectare bamboo forest located in the northern part of the village. Members of this village have a strong commitment to the system of \'Ayahan Desa\' - a philosophy committed to respecting the land on which the village stands. To concludes the day, we stop by at Tukad Cepung Waterfall. Well-guarded by the circular cliffs, this waterfall is difficult to locate for the first time visitor. The circular cliffs give you the feeling of being in a cave, while the open sky right from where the waterfall emerges, gives you the most enchanting view. The sunlight falls on the glistering waterfall creating a rainbow, which feels as though it is projected right up to you. If you have never seen water flowing from the sky, then this would be your chance! After spending your time there, we go back to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-20\", \"text\": \"THE ARTINI DIJIWA UBUD Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phn : (0361) 972385\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"MEET IN LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5107499,'374','JAVIER CEREIJO RIVERA MR / TANIA VALIENTE ESCOBAR MS',30508,202882,'The Mother Temple Besakih and Surrounding','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-21','2024-06-21','Guio','Eddy',2,'Persons (2)',1724800.00,'The first destination is Kusamba Beach, it is one of the favorite places of interest in Bali which is famous with the beautiful beach, we can also meet a fish market in this place which is usually held between 10 am until 4 pm. Then we go to Goa Lawah, this is one of the favourite place to be visited, because here is a nature cave dwelt by thousands of tail bat located at north side from Jeroan/center of Goa Lawah Temple. Next we go to Bukit Jambul, it is strategically located beside of the main road from Denpasar to Besakih Temple and it is one of the tourist destinations that visited on Besakih Tour. It is situated in the plateau area which is blessed with the beautiful panorama of rice terrace and green coconuts three unfolding to the sea. After visit Bukit Jambul, we’ll continue to Besakih Temple is the biggest Hindu temple in Bali which the local people call Pura Besakih. It owns beautiful view from the top of temple area where we can see the wide nature panorama until to the ocean so that’s why this temple is many visited by tourists from all over the world. Then go to Kertagosa, This place also owns Taman Gili, a building floating or sees like floating because it is intentionally founded in the middle of a fish pond.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-21\", \"text\": \"THE ARTINI DIJIWA UBUD Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phn : (0361) 972385\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"MEET IN LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5107630,'292','Belen Diaz Sanchez',30630,201570,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-04-29','2024-05-01','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',7800000.00,'Our sleek deluxe rooms feature a lounge settee, free high-speed wireless internet, and a flat-screen TV with satellite channels, perfect for unwinding after a sun-soaked day in Uluwatu. In addition to one king bed or two twin beds, guests have the choice of a room with a balcony or a terrace. All rooms feature scenic views of the lush gardens, sparkling pool, or reflection pond, plus thoughtful amenities like a rain shower, coffee and tea facilities, and 24-hour room service.',NULL,'Approved vouchers for reserved rooms must be produced on check-in unless a different arrangement has been agreed in writing with the tour operator prior to check-in.','{\"date\": \"2024-04-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5107781,'376','Stefano CAVADINI',30508,207259,'Airport to Tulamben','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-13','2024-07-13','Rendy','Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',784000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-13\", \"text\": \"ETA: 13JUL | 2240 FROM DOH / QR 960 BY QATAR AIRWAYS\", \"time\": \"22:40\", \"locality\": \"AIRPORT DENPASAR\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-13\", \"text\": \"MIMPI RESORT BALI TULAMBEN ADDRESS : Banyuwedang, Buleleng 81155 Northwest Bali – Indonesia Mimpi Tulamben : Tel : +62363 21642\\\"\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5107783,'376','Stefano CAVADINI',30577,202337,'Patio Room','Confirmed',NULL,10,'2024-07-13','2024-07-23','Rendy','Eddy',1,'Single',11200000.00,'At 25 square meters with 13 units available. Relax and enjoy the beauty of life in this simple Patio Room. Lounge in the cozy porch that is designed for you to have a little moment of joy.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5107784,'376','Stefano CAVADINI',32578,215839,'One Bedroom Garden Villa','Confirmed',NULL,9,'2024-07-23','2024-08-01','Rendy','Eddy',1,'Single',24353280.00,'Spend quality time with your loves one in this 65.30 sqm space featuring master bedroom with a king size bed. Inspired by Balinese Culture, this one bedroom villa features a writing desk, LCD TV with more than 30 international and local channels.',NULL,'PICK UP AT HARBOUR LOCATED IN JEMBATAN KUNING BY EKA JAYA FASTBOAT (ETA : 16.30 PM) Phone +62821-4642-5043.','{\"date\": \"2024-07-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5107785,'376','Stefano CAVADINI',30571,202567,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-01','2024-08-02','Rendy','Eddy',1,'Single',1372000.00,'Located at the Second Floor, 35 sqm comfort living with a touch of Balinese style featuring completed fitting, Cable TV, a fancy bathroom comprises rain shower and good quality amenities. Also dedicated Wi-Fi Access to complete your day.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-01\", \"text\": \"ETD: 02AUG | 0955 FROM DPS / QR 965 BY QATAR AIRWAYS\", \"time\": \"06:30\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5107802,'376','Stefano CAVADINI',30508,212491,'Sanur to Kuta','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-01','2024-08-01','Rendy','Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-01\", \"text\": \"Arrival time: 13.00 by Scoot Fast Cruises\", \"time\": \"13:00\", \"locality\": \"SANUR HARBOUR\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-01\", \"text\": \"The Vira Bali Boutique Hotel & Suite JI. Kartika Plaza, No.127, Kec. Kuta, Kabupaten 80361 Bali - Indonesia. Badung\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5107942,'374','JAVIER CEREIJO RIVERA MR / TANIA VALIENTE ESCOBAR MS',30927,202538,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-23','2024-06-24','Guio','Eddy',1,'Double',720000.00,'Finished to a very high standard quality, all rooms are spacious at 25 square meters with maximum capacity of 2 pax, equipped with large double bed. This room features a terrace overlooking the garden. It comes with a personal safe, air conditional, internet access in room, minibar, and includes a private bathroom with an open-air shower.','All the above rates are net inclusive of 21% government tax, service charge and non – commissionable.','24 OCT ==.> INCLUDE 1X TIME DOLPHIN TOUR (ARRANGE BY HOTEL) (PLEASE READY AT LOBBY ON 05:00 AM)','{\"date\": \"2024-06-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5107947,'374','JAVIER CEREIJO RIVERA MR / TANIA VALIENTE ESCOBAR MS',30508,202892,'Ubud – Jatiluwih – Bedugul – Cascada Munduk – Drop Lovina','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-23','2024-06-23','Guio','Eddy',2,'Persons (2)',2352000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-23\", \"text\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone (0361) 972385\\\"\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"MEET IN LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-23\", \"text\": \"Frangipani Beach Hotel Address: Jl Kartika 99, Kalibukbuk, Bali, Lovina, Indonesia Phone: +62362 3435764\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5109122,'374','JAVIER CEREIJO RIVERA MR / TANIA VALIENTE ESCOBAR MS',30554,202023,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-06-24','2024-06-26','Guio','Eddy',1,'Double',1971200.00,'Ground floor room with modern Balinese interior with sea view. Option of king size bed or twin beds.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5109132,'374','JAVIER CEREIJO RIVERA MR / TANIA VALIENTE ESCOBAR MS',30508,213309,'Candidasa to Kusamba','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-26','2024-06-26','Guio','Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-26\", \"text\": \"Hotel Genggong Bali Alamat: Jl.Puri Bagus, Candidasa, Sengkidu, Kec. Manggis, Kabupaten Karangasem, Bali 80871 Phone: 03634381005\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": \"MEET IN LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-26\", \"text\": \"Candidasa to Kusamba (departure time, 08.00)\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"KUSAMBA HARBOUR\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5109139,'374','JAVIER CEREIJO RIVERA MR / TANIA VALIENTE ESCOBAR MS',31040,203404,'Ocean View Bungalow Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-26','2024-06-27','Guio','Eddy',1,'Double',1064000.00,'Room size: 55 sqm. The ocean view bungalow room has 13 units available. The rooms at this Nusa Penida hotel provide guests with high-velocity internet and a flat-screen TV with satellite channels, and comforts such as ironing facilities and air conditioning. The units are designed in a comfortable manner. Offering amenities like hair dryers and bathrobes, the bathrooms also include a walk-in shower, a separate toilet and a sink.',NULL,'27 JUN ==> Including One way transfer from hotel to harbour arrange by Hotel.','{\"date\": \"2024-06-26\", \"text\": \"transfer from hotel to Banjar Nyuh harbour\", \"time\": \"14:50\", \"locality\": \"MEET IN LOBBY ON 27 JUN\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5109165,'374','JAVIER CEREIJO RIVERA MR / TANIA VALIENTE ESCOBAR MS',30508,216161,'Uluwatu to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-30','2024-06-30','Guio','Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-30\", \"text\": \"PLEASE BE READY ON LOBBY\", \"time\": \"11:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-30\", \"text\": \"ETD : 30 JUN 2024 - 16:00 / CX784 / From Denpasar BY Cathay Pacific\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"AIRPORT DENPASAR\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5109326,'374','JAVIER CEREIJO RIVERA MR / TANIA VALIENTE ESCOBAR MS',30508,212456,'Sanur to Uluwatu','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-27','2024-06-27','Guio','Eddy',2,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-27\", \"text\": \"ETA Sanur HBR 17:00\", \"time\": \"17:00\", \"locality\": \"SANUR HBR (BY THE ANGKAL)\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-27\", \"text\": \"SAL CENTRAL ULUWATU Alamat: Uluwatu, Jl. Pantai Bingin, Pecatu, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80362 Tel: +62 (0) 81237733887\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5109474,'377','Maria Del Pilar Llesta Gomez',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-30','2024-05-30','Jacob','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-30\", \"text\": \"ETA 18.35 by Jet Star Asia 3K245 from Singapore on 30 May\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-30\", \"text\": \"Jl. Hanoman, Ubud, Kec. Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Alaya Resort Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5109494,'377','Maria Del Pilar Llesta Gomez',30611,201418,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,5,'2024-05-30','2024-06-04','Jacob','Tami',1,'Double',10584000.00,'The Deluxe Room provides a restful environment to unwind after a busy day spent exploring the sights of Ubud. It is a cozy base featuring clean-line furnishings, a smart en-suite bathroom and a decorative wall that showcases Bali’s creative legacy. A private terrace or balcony blends seamlessly into the outdoors providing extra space to sit and relax.',NULL,'Voucher must be presented upon check in and hotel will thefore invoice within the 7 days period if credit facility has been extendeed by the hotel.','{\"date\": \"2024-05-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5109521,'377','Maria Del Pilar Llesta Gomez',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-01','2024-06-01','Jacob','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1747200.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-01\", \"text\": \"Jl. Hanoman, Ubud, Kec. Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Alaya Resort Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5109537,'377','Maria Del Pilar Llesta Gomez',30508,202893,'Lempuyang Temple Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI11',1,'2024-06-03','2024-06-03','Jacob','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1792000.00,'At the agreed time, our guide will pick you up to start the tour in the eastern part of Bali. The first place you will visit is Goa Lawah Temple. Goa Lawah Temple consists of two names, \"Goa\" which means cave and \"Lawah\" which means bat. Several thousand bats are flying in the cave as the name suggests. With the lights fading as you go deeper inside the cave, it gives off a very strange atmosphere. From Goa Lawah, we continue our way to Lempuyang Temple. Upon arrival, the temple will greet you with its gratifying panorama that extends into infinity. On a clear, sunny day, you\'ll be able to gaze out over the mountains, Amlapura city, and Mount Agung, an incredibly magnificent sight that\'s beautiful beyond words. This portrait of heaven is beautifully framed by the Gapura Candi Bentar (the gate of the temple). Our journey continues to visit Tirta Gangga. The site is a paradise surrounded by water, with all the pools decorated with unusual statues. With its seclusion and a view of the surrounding rice paddies, Tirta Gangga is a wonderful place. At the end of the trip we go to Tenganan Village, the most famous Bali Agas (the “original” Bali people) in the city. With its characteristics, the city village is arranged in parallel along the wide main road paved with rows of cobblestones. In Tenganan, women still weave the famous Kamben Geringsing, or \"burnt cloth,\" which has the power to immunize the wearer against evil. We take a close look at what they do in their daily lives in a traditional lifestyle. From Tenganan, we will transfer you to the hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-03\", \"text\": \"Jl. Hanoman, Ubud, Kec. Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Alaya Resort Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5109548,'377','Maria Del Pilar Llesta Gomez',30508,213032,'Ubud to Kusamba','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-04','2024-06-04','Jacob','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-04\", \"text\": \"Jl. Hanoman, Ubud, Kec. Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Alaya Resort Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-04\", \"text\": \"ETD 08.00 from Kusamba to Nusa Penida by The Angkal Fast Boat\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kusamba Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5109565,'377','Maria Del Pilar Llesta Gomez',30508,207112,'Trip To Nusa Penida from Bali','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-06-04','2024-06-04','Jacob','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',952000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-04\", \"text\": \"ETA 08.30 from Kusamba by The Angkal Fast Boat\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sampalan Harbour Nusa Penida\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5109579,'377','Maria Del Pilar Llesta Gomez',31285,208028,'Suite Room with Ocean View','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-06-04','2024-06-06','Jacob','Tami',1,'Double',3091200.00,'With 100 sqm of space, this suite comfortably accommodates up to 2 adults. It comes with air conditioning, a flat-screen TV with international channels, and a personal safe. The suite has a dining area and coffee/tea making facilities. Bathroom is fitted with separate toilet and shower. Fresh towels and bed linens are provided.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5109587,'377','Maria Del Pilar Llesta Gomez',30508,207337,'Snorkeling to Nusa Penida (from Nusa Penida) (Sharing Trip)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-05','2024-06-05','Jacob','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1232000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-05\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Toya Pakeh - Ped, Dusun Sebunibus, Sakti, Kec. Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Semabu Hills Hotel Nusa Penida\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5109632,'377','Maria Del Pilar Llesta Gomez',31242,205019,'One-Bedroom Villa with Private Pool','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-06-06','2024-06-09','Jacob','Tami',1,'Double',9996000.00,'Majo Private Villas is a resort ideally located on the island of Gili Trawangan. We offer high-end luxury accommodation and fine food in our on-site restaurant. Our private villas can accommodate 2 to 3 persons, and offer a fusion between top french design and traditional balinese style. Each of our 9 villas is around 125 sqm, has a private swimming pool, a comfortable outside area, outdoor shower and is designed with a particular attention to detail. We pride ourselves to offer an excellent guest service, and the whole concept of Majo Private villas has been entirely built about offering all of our guests an experience they will never forget, both through the details of the infrastructure and the quality of service. We can organize snorkelling trips, boat trips, massages and much more, please do not hesitate to ask us for any quotation if you require a service not mentioned in this contract.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5109688,'276','FLORENCE SAUVE',30508,207262,'Ubud to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-18','2024-05-18','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"text\": \"Please be ready in the lobby\", \"time\": \"11:45\", \"locality\": \"Wapa Di Ume Ubud\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"text\": \"ETD: 16.00 by Cathay Pacific CX784 to Hong Kong on 18 May\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Denpasar Airport\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5109697,'377','Maria Del Pilar Llesta Gomez',30508,212301,'Padang Bai to Uluwatu','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-09','2024-06-09','Jacob','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-09\", \"text\": \"ETA 13.55 from Gili Trawangan by BlueWater Express\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-09\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bangbang Metuug, Pecatu, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Green Escape - Eco Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5109703,'377','Maria Del Pilar Llesta Gomez',30930,202592,'One Bedroom Bungalow','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-09','2024-06-10','Jacob','Tami',1,'Double',2688000.00,'Room size : 37 sqm. Our One-Bedroom Bungalow is a unique Romantic Eco-Boho Bungalow nestles in Green Escape Resort. You will stay in a sumptuous air-conditioned bungalow that has been handcrafted using recycled wood and tastefully decorated to offer you an authentic Balinese getaway. It\'s the very epitome of a tranquil escape. This Bungalow offers a deluxe king-size bed and a daybed to relax. It offers a comfy mattress, as we know the benefits of a good night’s sleep. The semi-outdoor bathroom with a rain shower will help you revive yourself. Enjoy the comfy sofa on your private terrace which opens onto the exotic garden & pool. The daybed can be used to extend the sleeping capacity of your private bungalow.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5109704,'377','Maria Del Pilar Llesta Gomez',30508,216161,'Uluwatu to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-10','2024-06-10','Jacob','Tami',2,'Persons (1-3)',784000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-10\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bangbang Metuug, Pecatu, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": \"15:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Green Escape - Eco Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-10\", \"text\": \"ETD 19.40 by Emirates EK369 to Dubai on 10 June 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5110090,'378','NIKANOR',30617,200924,'BEJI Villa (One Bedroom Suite Pool Villa)','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-05-15','2024-05-19','Norberto','Komang',1,'Double',16536000.00,'The Beji villa is a one bedroom suite of 140 sqm with a private swimming pool and a tropical garden.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5110115,'378','NIKANOR',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-15','2024-05-15','Norberto','Komang',1,'Persons (1-3)',420000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-15\", \"text\": \"ETA : 08.25am by Qatar Airways from Doha on 15 May 2024\", \"time\": \"08:25\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"International Airport Ngurah Rai Denpasar\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-15\", \"text\": \"Kajane Mua Ubud Jl. Monkey Forest No.20, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 972877\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5110812,'89','Ms. Angelica Abela & Mr. Steve Michael Muscat',30720,202970,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-01','2024-05-02','Ayu','Tami',1,'Double',2072000.00,'Styled for personal comfort and convenience, the Superior room category is an inviting space that captures the essence of Bali. At 35 sqm of room area, with double / twin bed capacity of 2A 1C or 3A with extra bed. Set amidst tropical landscape, this air-conditioned room comes with a private balcony, flat-screen cable TV and a safety deposit box. En suite bathroom comes with bath and shower facilities.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-05-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5110813,'89','Ms. Angelica Abela & Mr. Steve Michael Muscat',30508,213319,'Munduk to Sanur','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-01','2024-05-01','Ayu','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',616000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-01\", \"text\": \"Jl. Kayu Putih - Munduk, Munduk, Kec. Banjar, Kabupaten Buleleng, Bali 81152\", \"time\": \"11:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Gumi Ayu EcoStay\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-01\", \"text\": \"Jl. Cemara No.35, Sanur, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali 80228\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Puri Santrian\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5113686,'380','JUDIT GENE CREUS',30783,201525,'4D3N Yogyakarta - Mt. Merapi with Jeep / A. The Phoenix*5 (Deluxe Legacy Room)','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-08-15','2024-08-18','Jacob','Wiwik',4,'Persons (4-6 / Double)',24540000.00,'D1 Arrival Yogyakarta International Airport – Transfer to hotel: Welcome to the cradle of Indonesian culture, Yogyakarta. A tourist destination for its ancient palaces, temples, batik workshops, gamelan music orchestras, court dances and wayang puppet shows. Upon your arrival in Yogyakarta a representative of come2indonesia will be waiting for you with a sign indicating your name to take you to your hotel and the rest of the day is for you. D2 Borobudur temple – Candirejo Village Tour by Horse cart / bicycle – Merapi lava tour Including Jeep: You will have your deserved breakfast at the hotel. Today’s tour will make you enjoy the authentic Javanese essence. You will start your route in the direction of with the Borobudur Temple (Candi Borobudur), the great Stupa, the largest Buddhist monument in the world and one of the seven wonders. We will tour around the temple, observe the hundreds and centenary statues of Buddha and witness how dozens of Buddhists come to preach from all over the world. Historically it was established during the relatively brief Sailendra dynasty of Central Java between 778 and 856 BC and is in constant restoration due to the breaks that the tremors of the neighbouring Merapi volcano has been producing during its history. After visiting one of the most important Buddhist temples in Southeast Asia, and in a horse carriage (Andong) we will visit the villages that surround this temple. These are authentic Javanese villages where culture and tradition are the protagonists. As you spend your days in this country and go around the different islands, you will realize how different Indonesians are among them in terms of clothing, food, architecture and even language. Today we will learn about and share these Javanese places. Then we will go to Kaliurang / Kalidalem to see Mount Merapi in constant activity. Here in a 4x4 jeep driven by specialized drivers, we will climb its skirt to see the remains of the 2010 eruption such as houses buried by ashes, a multitude of objects paralyzed by lava, etc. In addition, an open-air tribute museum presided over by the clock that marks the time just when the lava passed through it has been improvised. Accompanied by photos of the rescue, it will make us feel very closely the experiences of that fateful day. After finishing this day full of emotions, we will take you back to your hotel. D3 City Tour Jogjakarta Visit Sultan Palace, Watercastle and Bird Market – Prambanan Temple: After breakfast and at the indicated time we will head towards the heart of the city. We will visit the Keraton known as the Sultan’s Palace. The palace is a complex building two centuries old, located in the heart of the city. You will hear the song of the “freedom” of the birds in the bird market, we will visit the “Water Castle” that occupies the highest part at the northern end of the vast complex of Taman Sari, Malioboro Street, main street of Yogyakarta, with its merchants, horse carriages, taxi-bikes and markets. An incredible experience that will make the hours fly by. After finishing the tour in the center of the city of Yogyakarta, we will go to the northeast direction Candi Prambanan, the temple of the Hinduists and classified as a World Heritage Site by Unesco since 1991. The built of this temple was finished around the year 856 to commemorate the victory of the descendant Sanjaya of Siva, Rikai Pikatan on the last sovereign Sailendra of Central Java. Take your time to enjoy each carving on the rocks and feel the spirituality that each of the stones perched in this set of more than 200 Hindu temples that are dedicated to the Trimurti, the expression of God as the Creator, the Preserver and the Destroyer. After this unforgettable day, we will take you to your hotel. D4 Transfer out Yogyakarta International airport: Today our adventure ends at the cradle of Indonesian culture. Depending on the time of your flight, we will pick you up to take you to the airport and take the flight to your next destination. End of our services. Thank you very much for exploring Yogyakarta by the hand of Come2indonesia.',NULL,'Flight Detail: ETA: 12.50 by Garuda Indonesia GA0208 from Jakarta on 15 August 2024 Drop Off: Artotel Gajahmada Semarang Hotel Jl. Gajahmada No.101, Miroto, Kec. Semarang Tengah, Kota Semarang, Jawa Tengah 50134 Phone: +62856-4041-5777','{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5113698,'380','JUDIT GENE CREUS',30672,200737,'Studio 25 (Superior) Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-18','2024-08-19','Jacob','Wiwik',2,'Double',1608000.00,'Studio 25 (Superior) room with 25 sqm sized room and with exclusive ARTOTEL bedding collection, some facilities in this room is 43\" inch lcd tv, 24 hours in-room service, high speed internet wi-fi, safety deposit box and hair dryer.',NULL,'Flight Detail: ETD: 08.30 by Batik Air ID6302 to Pangkalan Bun on 19 August 2024 Please consult your departure transfer upon check in.','{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5113706,'380','JUDIT GENE CREUS',30672,215075,'Airport Transfer - One Way to Airport Semarang','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-19','2024-08-19','Jacob','Wiwik',2,'Per Car',360000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5113743,'380','JUDIT GENE CREUS',30805,212255,'CGK-YIA','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-15','2024-08-15','Jacob','Wiwik',4,'Person',5720000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5113748,'380','JUDIT GENE CREUS',30805,212247,'SRG-PKN','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-19','2024-08-19','Jacob','Wiwik',4,'Person',7040000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5113753,'380','JUDIT GENE CREUS',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-08-19','2024-08-21','Jacob','Wiwik',4,'Persons (4)',14880000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan isCape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continueto add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Flight Detail: ETA: 09.30 by Batik Air ID6302 from Semarang on 19 August 2024 ETD: 08.50 by Batik Air ID6134 to Surabaya connect to Bali on 21 August 2024 Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-08-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5113759,'380','JUDIT GENE CREUS',30805,213516,'PKN-DPS','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-21','2024-08-21','Jacob','Wiwik',4,'Person',14080000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5113764,'380','JUDIT GENE CREUS',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-21','2024-08-21','Jacob','Wiwik',1,'Persons (4-6)',840000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'Flight Detail: ETA: 14.35 by Lion Air JT922 from Surabaya on 21 August 2024 Drop Off: Komaneka Bisma Ubud Jalan Bisma Ubud Gianyar 80571, Bali, Indonesia Phone. +62361 971933','{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5113766,'380','JUDIT GENE CREUS',30711,200830,'Bisma Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-08-21','2024-08-25','Jacob','Wiwik',2,'Double',38880000.00,'Spacious one-bedroom suite of 88 sqm with private balcony for a sophisticated Ubud getaway. Interiors feature extensive use of wood and fine Indonesian textiles and art, lending an understated elegance to the space. Featuring a private balcony, this room includes a flat-screen TV and an en-suite bathroom with a bathtub and a shower, and many more.',NULL,'1X Dinner on 22 August.','{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5113767,'380','JUDIT GENE CREUS',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route (Taman Ayun-Jatiluwih-Ulundanu Beratan-Tanah Lot)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-22','2024-08-22','Jacob','Wiwik',4,'Persons (4)',2832000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,'Please be ready at the lobby hotel on 08.30 AM','{\"date\": \"2024-08-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34');
