le, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-11\", \"text\": \"PERTIWI BISMA 2 JALAN RAYA BISMA, UBUD, GIANYAR, BALI 80571, INDONESIA +62361 981386\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"PICK UP ON LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5114341,'240','Amy Carol Gulick',31275,216413,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-04','2024-05-05','Rendy','Eddy',1,'Double',0.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-04\", \"text\": \"ETA 10.25 by Wings Air IW1942 from Alor on 04 May 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"AIPORT\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-05\", \"text\": \"ETD 06.50 by Batik Air ID6541 to Jakarta on 05 May 2024\", \"time\": \"04:50\", \"locality\": \"READY ON LOBBY AT\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5114380,'383','Laura Garcia',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-21','2024-05-21','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (1-3)',784000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"text\": \"ETA : 22.40h by Qatar Airways QR960 from Doha on 21 May 2024\", \"time\": \"22:40\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"International Airport Ngurah Rai\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"text\": \"Tejaprana Bisma Ubud Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5114409,'383','Laura Garcia',30623,200587,'Terrace Villa','Confirmed',NULL,5,'2024-05-21','2024-05-26','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',14560000.00,'The Terrace Villas offer a spectacular view which creates an idyllic retreat, inviting guests to relax and unwind amidst the serene ambiance. With 100 m² of living space, these one-bedroom villas are well-equipped with a king-size bed, air conditioning, a private bathroom with a rainfall showerhead, a beautiful view of the jungle valley, and other various amenities for a comfortable stay. Discover solace in the peaceful seclusion of the villa’s private outdoor oasis, whether ensconced in the comforting ambiance of the gazebo, reclining next to the revitalizing plunge pool, or surrendering to absolute relaxation in the outdoor bathtub.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5114506,'383','Laura Garcia',30508,207379,'Ubud to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-26','2024-05-26','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (1-3)',1120000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-26\", \"text\": \"Tejaprana Bisma Ubud Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-26\", \"text\": \"ETD : 08.30 by Gili Gili Fastboat from Padangbai to Gili Air\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padangbai Harbour, Karangasem\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5114523,'383','Laura Garcia',30582,203387,'One Bedroom Luxury Villas','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-05-30','2024-06-01','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',6988800.00,'Each One Bedroom Luxury Villa is designed with a private infinity pool, scenic view across the Gamat Bay or garden view, and some have a small private garden. Every villas features the following: An integrated universal power outlet, Room safe (suitable for storing laptops), Cable TV with international news and movie channels, Eco-friendly bathroom amenities, Coffee and tea-making facilities.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5115355,'383','Laura Garcia',32602,215975,'Single Villa','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-05-26','2024-05-30','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',16800000.00,'Each room offers the same comfort: one or two bedroom villas with terrace, swimming pool, kitchenette and office space, comfortable sunbeds, lovely coconut garden. Particular care to the quality of the beddings, the home stylist Valérie Barkowski has added her touch of originality with a predominant colour selection of orange, grey, red, green, bordeaux or black. Choose your holiday colour!',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5115700,'383','Laura Garcia',30508,207278,'Full Day Tour Car & Driver (8-10 hours)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-31','2024-05-31','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',2912000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-31\", \"text\": \"Maua Nusa Penida Sakti, Kec. Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Penida\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-31\", \"text\": \"Maua Nusa Penida Sakti, Kec. Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"NUsa Penida\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5115767,'383','Laura Garcia',30508,212456,'Sanur to Uluwatu','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-01','2024-06-01','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-01\", \"text\": \"ETA : 13.00 from Nusa Penida by Maruti Fastboat on 01 Jun\", \"time\": \"13:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sanur Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-01\", \"text\": \"La Joya BiuBiu Resort Jl. Pantai Balangan, Jimbaran, South Kuta, Badung Regency, Bali 80361\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Uluwatu\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5115788,'383','Laura Garcia',30915,202457,'Gardenside Lodge Room','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-06-01','2024-06-04','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',9227160.00,'At 32 m2 room size, the Garden-side Lodge known for its rustic interior has its own outdoor terrace, which extends out to a private garden. Guests choose this room to wind down to the greener pastures and to take a break from the beach or the sunny outdoors. The lodge offers additional lounging space with a two-seat sofa settee on the side of the room. Wood-framed glass patio entrance connects this rustic room to its exclusive outdoor garden.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5115791,'383','Laura Garcia',30508,216161,'Uluwatu to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-04','2024-06-04','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (1-3)',784000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-04\", \"text\": \"La Joya BiuBiu Resort Uluwatu Biu Biu Resort, Jl. Pantai Balangan, Jimbaran, South Kuta, Badung Regency, Bali 80361\", \"time\": \"14:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Uluwatu\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-04\", \"text\": \"ETD : 18.55h by Qatar Airways QR963 to Doha on 04 Jun 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"International Ngurah Rai Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5115918,'385','Celestine de Zeeuw (4 Pax)',30662,213304,'5D4N Medan - Lake Toba Holidays','Confirmed','RVL-5D TOBA',5,'2024-05-06','2024-05-10','Yuli','Febrina',4,'Persons (4-5 / Double)',24564000.00,'DAY 01 : AIRPORT - HOTEL / CITY TOUR Arrival at Kualanamu International Airport transfer to hotel and then city tour by visiting Great Mosque, Sultan Palace, Chinese Temple and market afternoon return back to hotel. Meals : - Accommodation : Emerald Garden Hotel or Le Polonia Hotel or Similar Hotel DAY 02 : MEDAN - SAMOSIR After breakfast drive to Parapat via Tebing Tinggi, on the way stop at several plantation for rubber, cocoa and palm oil, arrival at Parapat crossing to Samosir Island by ferry boat and arrival at Samosir check in to Hotel. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : Samosir Villa or Tabo Cottages or Toledo Inn DAY 03 : SAMOSIR EXCURSION BY CAR After breakfast we start for our fullday excursion by car in the interior of Samosir island and en-route visiting : - Ambarita (to see the stone chairs and tables where once used as the execution site by the ancient tribal chieftains). - Aek Natonang (here we can see the small lake found of the top of Samosir Island and its panorama view). - Tomok (to see the old sarcophages belonged to former Sidabutar Kings and his descendants). In afternoon return back to hotel and free at leisure. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : Samosir Villa or Tabo Cottages or Toledo Inn DAY 04 : SAMOSIR - BRASTAGI After breakfast drive head for Samosir Island in Lake Toba via TELE. En-route stop at : - Lumban Suhi-suhi (to see the Tobanase traditional houses where we could observe also the women doing the weaving). - Efrata (a beautiful waterfall found on the way from Samosir to Tele) - Tele (a nice place for over-viewing the lake from its western part). - Sipisopiso Waterfall (from here you can admire the scenic view of the Lake Toba from its northern tip combined with the slender 90 meters high waterfall). - Dokan (to see the traditional village of the Batak Karo tribe). In mid afternoon arriving at Brastagi area on Samosir and check-in to hotel. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : Mikie Holiday Resort or Hotel Sibayak International or Sinabung Hills Hotel DAY 05 : BRASTAGI - MEDAN / AIRPORT After breakfast drive to Medan by Passing Sibolangit and Sembahe, upon arrival at Medan, directly transfer to Airport. Tour End. Meals : Breakfast',NULL,'Room booked: 2 Double Rooms English speaking guide 06 May 2024: AIRPORT – HOTEL / CITY TOUR (Emerald Garden Hotel / Confirmed Superior room) 07 May 20204: MEDAN – SAMOSIR (Tabo Cottages / Confirmed Deluxe room) (B) 08 May 2024. SAMOSIR EXCURSION BY CAR (Tabo Cottages / Confirmed Deluxe room) (B) 09 May 2024: SAMOSIR – BRASTAGI (Mikie Holiday Resort /Sinabung Hill) Both hotels booked and confirmed at Deluxe room (B) 10 May 2024: BRASTAGI – MEDAN / AIRPORT (B)','{\"date\": \"2024-05-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Emerald Garden Hotel\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Emerald Garden Hotel\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5116484,'386','Pedro Jose Torrijos Garrido',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-21','2024-06-22','Jacob','Komang',1,'Single',840000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. - Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK–IN','{\"date\": \"2024-06-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5116493,'387','Mr. Laurent Pierre La Fosse',31670,212390,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-21','2024-09-22','Ayu','Tami',1,'Double',1932000.00,'Room size 19 Sqm, with a Twin Bed, and the view like Pool View or Sea View (Subject to availability upon check-in) and Non-smoking Room. Inclusion for this room; Rate inclusive daily breakfast for 2 person, Free Wi-Fi, Welcome Drink,Tax & Service, Mineral Water, Tea & Coffee Maker in The Room, Free entrance fee & Free shuttle to VIP+ Lounge from Loccal Collection Hotel (min 2 pax)',NULL,'Flight details ETA 13.10 by Batik Air ID6331 from Denpasar on 21 September 2024','{\"date\": \"2024-09-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5116589,'386','Pedro Jose Torrijos Garrido',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-06-22','2024-06-24','Jacob','Komang',1,'Person (1)',8520000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan isCape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continueto add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-06-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5117537,'388','Maria Pamies Ramon',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-14','2024-05-15','Melysa','Wiwik',1,'Double',840000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. - Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. Flight Detail: ETA: 15.25 from Madrid on 14 May 2024 ETD: 06.00 by Batik Air ID6202 to Pangkalan Bun on 15 May 2024 PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK–IN','{\"date\": \"2024-05-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5117546,'388','Maria Pamies Ramon',30805,202689,'CGK-PKN','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-15','2024-05-15','Melysa','Wiwik',2,'Person',3520000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5117549,'388','Maria Pamies Ramon',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-05-15','2024-05-17','Melysa','Wiwik',2,'Persons (2)',10800000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the p