y\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5117562,'386','Pedro Jose Torrijos Garrido',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-27','2024-06-27','Jacob','Komang',1,'Persons (1-3)',420000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-27\", \"text\": \"ETA : 16.25 by Lion Air JT566 from Yogyakarta on 27 Jun 2024\", \"time\": \"16:25\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Airport Ngurah Rai\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-27\", \"text\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5117563,'388','Maria Pamies Ramon',30805,213516,'PKN-DPS','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-17','2024-05-17','Melysa','Wiwik',2,'Person',7040000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5117566,'388','Maria Pamies Ramon',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-17','2024-05-17','Melysa','Wiwik',1,'Persons (1-3)',420000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'FLIGHT DETAIL: ETA: 14.35 by Lion Air JT922 from Surabaya on 17 May 2024 DROP OFF: TEJAPRANA RESORT Jl. Raya Tegallalang, Banjar Sapat, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80561 Phone: +62361 9080939','{\"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5117571,'388','Maria Pamies Ramon',30527,200579,'Valley View Villa','Confirmed',NULL,6,'2024-05-17','2024-05-23','Melysa','Wiwik',1,'Double',18720000.00,'The Valley View Villas are located on the lowest level of the hotel grounds. This ensures guests have a clear view of the jungle valley below and complete privacy. The bedroom features a King-sized bed, and the 70 m2 floor area gives guests lots of space inside, in addition to the beautiful outdoor area. Lounge on a chair on the personal terrace with gazebo, take a plunge in the infinity pool, or let the daily worries of life drift away in the outdoor natural stone bathtub. Air conditioning and a private bathroom with bathtub, along with many other amenities, add to the comfort level of these villas.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5117579,'388','Maria Pamies Ramon',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-18','2024-05-18','Melysa','Wiwik',2,'Persons (2)',1872000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,'Program: Taman Ayun - Jatiluwih - Ulundanu Beratan - Tanah Lot Ready in the lobby at 08.30 AM Pick Up/Drop Off: TEJAPRANA RESORT Jl. Raya Tegallalang, Banjar Sapat, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80561 Phone: +62361 9080939','{\"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5117583,'386','Pedro Jose Torrijos Garrido',30705,201147,'Premier Room Garden View','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-06-27','2024-07-01','Jacob','Komang',1,'Double',5352000.00,'Get back to nature in one of our Premier Garden View suites. These spacious, light-filled rooms have beautiful Balinese double doors that can be closed to create a cool air-conditioned space or opened to merge indoor and outdoor living. The balconies overlook the resort’s lush gardens, which are awash in tropical flowers and foliage.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5117585,'388','Maria Pamies Ramon',30508,202893,'TENGANAN VILLAGE - PLAYA VIRGIN - TEMPLO LEMPUYANG','Confirmed','C2I-BALI11',1,'2024-05-19','2024-05-19','Melysa','Wiwik',2,'Persons (2)',1920000.00,'At the agreed time, our guide will pick you up to start the tour in the eastern part of Bali. The first place you will visit is Goa Lawah Temple. Goa Lawah Temple consists of two names, \"Goa\" which means cave and \"Lawah\" which means bat. Several thousand bats are flying in the cave as the name suggests. With the lights fading as you go deeper inside the cave, it gives off a very strange atmosphere. From Goa Lawah, we continue our way to Lempuyang Temple. Upon arrival, the temple will greet you with its gratifying panorama that extends into infinity. On a clear, sunny day, you\'ll be able to gaze out over the mountains, Amlapura city, and Mount Agung, an incredibly magnificent sight that\'s beautiful beyond words. This portrait of heaven is beautifully framed by the Gapura Candi Bentar (the gate of the temple). Our journey continues to visit Tirta Gangga. The site is a paradise surrounded by water, with all the pools decorated with unusual statues. With its seclusion and a view of the surrounding rice paddies, Tirta Gangga is a wonderful place. At the end of the trip we go to Tenganan Village, the most famous Bali Agas (the “original” Bali people) in the city. With its characteristics, the city village is arranged in parallel along the wide main road paved with rows of cobblestones. In Tenganan, women still weave the famous Kamben Geringsing, or \"burnt cloth,\" which has the power to immunize the wearer against evil. We take a close look at what they do in their daily lives in a traditional lifestyle. From Tenganan, we will transfer you to the hotel.',NULL,'Ready in the lobby at 08.30 AM Pick Up/Drop Off: TEJAPRANA RESORT Jl. Raya Tegallalang, Banjar Sapat, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80561 Phone: +62361 9080939','{\"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5117591,'388','Maria Pamies Ramon',30508,202892,'TEGALALANG - TIRTA EMPUL - PENGLIPURAN - CASCADA CEPUNG','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-20','2024-05-20','Melysa','Wiwik',2,'Persons (2)',1872000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,'Ready in the lobby at 08.30 AM Pick Up/Drop Off: TEJAPRANA RESORT Jl. Raya Tegallalang, Banjar Sapat, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80561 Phone: +62361 9080939','{\"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5117595,'388','Maria Pamies Ramon',30508,207379,'Ubud to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-23','2024-05-23','Melysa','Wiwik',1,'Persons (1-3)',600000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'Please ready in the lobby hotel at 06.00 AM PI