and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,'FD Tour Taman Ayun - Jatiluwih - Ulun Danu Beratan Temple - Tanah Lot with English speaking guide','{\"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Villa Semana Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Villa Semana Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5117818,'389','Hamdi Beday',30508,207379,'Ubud to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-24','2024-05-24','Melysa','Febrina',1,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'Transfer Ubud - Padang Bai Harbor Boat details: ETD 08:30 by Gili Gili Fast Boat to Gili Air','{\"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Villa Semana Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Gili Gili Fast Boat office at Padang Bai\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5117960,'389','Hamdi Beday',30508,207386,'Padang Bai to Seminyak','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-29','2024-05-29','Melysa','Febrina',1,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'Transfer Padang Bai Harbor - Seminyak Boat details: ETA 12:30 by Gili Gili Fast Boat from Gili Air','{\"date\": \"2024-05-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"12:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbor\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ayona Villa Seminyak\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5117970,'389','Hamdi Beday',31203,217022,'One Bedroom Villa with Private Pool','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-05-29','2024-06-02','Melysa','Febrina',1,'Double',10080000.00,NULL,NULL,'Honeymooners','{\"date\": \"2024-05-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5117998,'389','Hamdi Beday',30508,207270,'Seminyak to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-02','2024-06-02','Melysa','Febrina',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'Flight details: ETD 09:55 by Qatar Airways QR965 to Doha on 02 June','{\"date\": \"2024-06-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ayona Villa Seminyak\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5118061,'390','Mrs. Ana Maria Caro Leiro',30783,213435,'2D1N Semarang - Yogyakarta / C. Adhisthana*3 (Superior Room)','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-06-05','2024-06-06','Jacob','Tami',2,'Persons (2 / Double)',6660000.00,'D1 : Arrival Semarang airport - Borobudur Temple tour incl. Mendut and Pawon - overnight in Yogyakarta Welcome to the cradle of Indonesian culture, Yogyakarta. A tourist destination for its ancient palaces, temples, batik workshops, gamelan music orchestras, court dances and wayang puppet shows. Upon your arrival in Semarang airport a representative of come2indonesia will be waiting for you with a sign indicating your name to start exploring this special city. We will start by heading towards Borobudur Temple (Candi Borobudur), the great Stupa, the largest Buddhist monument in the world and one of the seven wonders. We will tour around the temple, observe the hundreds and centenary statues of Buddha and witness how dozens of Buddhists come to preach from all over the world. Historically it was established during the relatively brief Sailendra dynasty of Central Java between 778 and 856 BC and is in constant restoration due to the breaks that the tremors of the neighbouring Merapi volcano has been producing during its history. After visiting one of the most important Buddhist temples in Southeast Asia, we continue our journey to the Mendut temple and Pawon temple. And then, we will take you to your Jogjakarta. D2 : Morning visit Prambanan Temple - City Tour Yogyakarta visit Sultan Palace, Watercastle and Bird Market - Transfer to Yogyakarta International Airport You will enjoy a well-deserved breakfast at the hotel and we will start by heading towards Candi Prambanan, the temple of the Hinduists and classified as a World Heritage Site by Unesco since 1991. The built of this temple was finished around the year 856 to commemorate the victory of the descendant Sanjaya of Siva, Rikai Pikatan on the last sovereign Sailendra of Central Java. Take your time to enjoy each carving on the rocks and feel the spirituality that each of the stones perched in this set of more than 200 Hindu temples that are dedicated to the Trimurti, the expression of God as the Creator, the Preserver and the destroyer. After this visit we go to the Keraton known as the Sultan’s Palace. The palace is a complex building two centuries old, located in the heart of the city. You will hear the song of the “freedom” of the birds in the bird market, we will visit the “Water Castle” that occupies the highest part at the northern end of the vast complex of Taman Sari, Malioboro Street, main street of Yogyakarta, with its merchants, horse carriages, taxi-bikes and markets. An incredible experience that will make the hours fly by. According to the time of your flight, we will pick you up to take you to the airport and take the flight to your next destination. End of our services. Thank you very much for exploring Yogyakarta by the hand of Come2indonesia.',NULL,'Seafood intolerant','{\"date\": \"2024-06-05\", \"text\": \"ETA 14.30 by Batik Air ID6360 from Jakarta on 05 Jun\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Yogyakarta International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5118065,'390','Mrs. Ana Maria Caro Leiro',30672,200737,'Studio 25 (Superior) Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-06','2024-06-07','Jacob','Tami',1,'Double',684000.00,'Studio 25 (Superior) room with 25 sqm sized room and with exclusive ARTOTEL bedding collection, some facilities in this room is 43\" inch lcd tv, 24 hours in-room service, high speed internet wi-fi, safety deposit box and hair dryer.',NULL,'Seafood intolerant','{\"date\": \"2024-06-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5118075,'390','Mrs. Ana Maria Caro Leiro',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-06-07','2024-06-09','Jacob','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',10800000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan isCape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continueto add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Seafood intolerant Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-06-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5118087,'390','Mrs. Ana Maria Caro Leiro',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-09','2024-06-09','Jacob','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',420000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-09\", \"text\": \"ETA 15.45 by Lion Air JT804 from Surabaya on 09 Jun\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-09\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Artini Dijiwa\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5118120,'386','Pedro Jose Torrijos Garrido',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-28','2024-06-28','Jacob','Komang',1,'Person (1)',1596000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-28\", \"text\": \"The Artiini Dijiwa Ubud Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-28\", \"text\": \"The Artiini Dijiwa Ubud Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5118133,'374','JAVIER CEREIJO RIVERA MR / TANIA VALIENTE ESCOBAR MS',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-06-26','2024-06-26','Guio','Eddy',2,'Persons (2)',952000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-26\", \"text\": \"ETD : SAMPALAN HARBOUR BY ANGKAL 08:20\", \"time\": \"08:20\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-26\", \"text\": \"ANGKAL RESORT NUSA PENIDA Jl. Batu Nunggal-Suana, Suana, Kec. Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771 PH. +62822-1013-0068\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5118141,'386','Pedro Jose Torrijos Garrido',30508,207379,'Ubud to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-01','2024-07-01','Jacob','Komang',1,'Persons (1-3)',600000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-01\", \"text\": \"The Artiini Dijiwa Ubud Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-01\", \"text\": \"ETD : 08.30 by Gili Gili Fastboat from Padangbai to Gili Air on 01 July 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padangbai harbour, Karangasem\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5118175,'387','Mr. Laurent Pierre La Fosse',30508,215968,'1D Ubud & Surrounding Tour (Monkey Forest - Ubud Traditional Art Market - Elephant Cave)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-20','2024-09-20','Ayu','Ayu',1,'Person (1)',0.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": \"JeState Bali Villas\", \"location\": \"Jl. Uluwatu I, Jimbaran, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80364\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"JeState Bali Villas\", \"location\": \"Jl. Uluwatu I, Jimbaran, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80364\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5118176,'386','Pedro Jose Torrijos Garrido',30649,204187,'One Bedroom Pool Lagoon','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-07-01','2024-07-04','Jacob','Komang',1,'Single',4500000.00,'This room is perfect for travelers or business people! With a room area of ​​25m2 and equipped with a double / single bed, air conditioning controller, LED TV and high speed internet access. This modern designed bathroom is also equipped with a shower and toiletries to complete your needs during your stay at our hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5118350,'391','NICANOR',30617,200924,'BEJI Villa (One Bedroom Suite Pool Villa)','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-05-15','2024-05-19','Norberto','Komang',1,'Double',16536000.00,'The Beji villa is a one bedroom suite of 140 sqm with a private swimming pool and a tropical garden.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5118382,'391','NICANOR',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-15','2024-05-15','Norberto','Komang',2,'Persons (1-3)',840000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5119191,'392','Rut Margarita Lopez',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-11','2024-07-11','Guio','Wiwik',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'Flight Detail: ETA: 22.40 by Qatar Airways QR960 from Doha on 11 July 2024 Drop Off: BUBU SUITE BY PRASI Jl. Gn. Sari, Peliatan, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten, Gianyar. Phone: +628970218920 / 03619088667','{\"date\": \"2024-07-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5119296,'394','Mrs Maria De La Soledad',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-17','2024-05-18','Jacob','Praba',1,'Double',840000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. - Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK–IN','{\"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5119311,'394','Mrs Maria De La Soledad',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-05-18','2024-05-20','Jacob','Praba',2,'Persons (2)',10800000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan isCape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continueto add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"text\": \"ETA 07.15 BY ID 6202 FRM JAKARTA\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"BANDAR UDARA ISKANDAR\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"text\": \"ETD 13.10 BY IN197 TO SEMARANG\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5119328,'394','Mrs Maria De La Soledad',30783,214611,'3D2N Semarang - Yogyakarta / C. Adhisthana*3 (Superior Room)','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-05-20','2024-05-22','Jacob','Praba',2,'Persons (2 / Double)',8100000.00,'D1 : Arrival at Semarang Airport - Borobudur Temple tour incl. Mendut and Pawon - Transfer to Jogja Welcome to the cradle of Indonesian culture, Yogyakarta. A tourist destination for its ancient palaces, temples, batik workshops, gamelan music orchestras, court dances and wayang puppet shows. Upon your arrival in Semarang airport a representative of come2indonesia will be waiting for you with a sign indicating your name to start exploring this special city. We will start by heading towards Borobudur Temple (Candi Borobudur), the great Stupa, the largest Buddhist monument in the world and one of the seven wonders. We will tour around the temple, observe the hundreds and centenary statues of Buddha and witness how dozens of Buddhists come to preach from all over the world. Historically it was established during the relatively brief Sailendra dynasty of Central Java between 778 and 856 BC and is in constant restoration due to the breaks that the tremors of the neighbouring Merapi volcano has been producing during its history. After visiting one of the most important Buddhist temples in Southeast Asia, we continue our journey to the Mendut temple and Pawon temple. And then, we will take you to Jogjakarta. D2 : Jogjakarta City Tour visit Sultan Palace, Watercastle and Bird Market - Visit Prambanan Temple You will enjoy a well-deserved breakfast at the hotel and we will start by heading towards Keraton known as the Sultan’s Palace. The palace is a complex building two centuries old, located in the heart of the city. You will hear the song of the “freedom” of the birds in the bird market, we will visit the “Water Castle” that occupies the highest part at the northern end of the vast complex of Taman Sari, Malioboro Street, main street of Yogyakarta, with its merchants, horse carriages, taxi-bikes and markets. After this visit we go to Candi Prambanan, the temple of the Hinduists and classified as a World Heritage Site by Unesco since 1991. The built of this temple was finished around the year 856 to commemorate the victory of the descendant Sanjaya of Siva, Rikai Pikatan on the last sovereign Sailendra of Central Java. Take your time to enjoy each carving on the rocks and feel the spirituality that each of the stones perched in this set of more than 200 Hindu temples that are dedicated to the Trimurti, the expression of God as the Creator, the Preserver and the destroyer. An incredible experience that will make the hours fly by. After this unforgettable day, we will take you back to your hotel. D3 : Transfer to Yogyakarta International Airport You will enjoy a well-deserved breakfast at the hotel and according to the time of your flight, we will pick you up to take you to the airport and take the flight to your next destination. End of our services. Thank you very much for exploring Yogyakarta by the hand of Come2indonesia.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-20\", \"text\": \"ETA 14.20 BY IN197 FROM PANGKALAN BUN\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"AHMAD YANI AIRPORT\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"text\": \"ETD 14.00 JT566 TO BALI\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"YOGYAKARTA INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT (YIA)\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5119333,'394','Mrs Maria De La Soledad',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-22','2024-05-22','Jacob','Praba',1,'Persons (2)',360000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"text\": \"ETA 16.25 BY JT566 FROM YOGYAKARTA\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"NGURAH RAI INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"ARTINI DIJIWA UBUD\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5119337,'394','Mrs Maria De La Soledad',30705,201147,'Premier Room Garden View','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-22','2024-05-23','Jacob','Praba',1,'Double',1338000.00,'Get back to nature in one of our Premier Garden View suites. These spacious, light-filled rooms have beautiful Balinese double doors that can be closed to create a cool air-conditioned space or opened to merge indoor and outdoor living. The balconies overlook the resort’s lush gardens, which are awash in tropical flowers and foliage.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5119365,'394','Mrs Maria De La Soledad',30778,201424,'Lanai Room','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-05-23','2024-05-27','Jacob','Praba',1,'Double',8100000.00,'Nine existing Lanai are housed-ground floor, some with king size bed and some with real twin bedded. The bathroom is with sunken bath. All units are overlooking the rice field view. The 14 unit Lanai Room, nestled into the banks of the river valley, the Lanai rooms feel like an extension of the natural contours of the earth. Offers King size or Hollywood twin, boasting Wapa di Ume\'s signature natural feel whitewashed wood environs with a balcony overlooking the running water below, these well-appointed rooms allow guests to immerse themselves into their surroundings. The Lanai has connecting to the other rooms through the balcony.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5119369,'394','Mrs Maria De La Soledad',30508,207379,'Ubud to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-27','2024-05-27','Jacob','Praba',1,'Persons (2)',600000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-27\", \"text\": \"WAPA DI UME Jl. Suweta Banjar Bentuyung Ubud, Ubud, Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"UBUD\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-27\", \"text\": \"ETD 08.30 BY GILI GILI FASTBOAT PADANG BAI - BANGSAL\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"PADANG BAI\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5119439,'394','Mrs Maria De La Soledad',30661,203865,'Deluxe Pool Suite','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-05-27','2024-05-29','Jacob','Praba',1,'Double',3162000.00,'Would you love a quiet and peaceful spot to come home to after a day of exploring the surroundings? Then booking one of our pool side suites is the perfect choice for you. Each of these rooms can be made up as a double, twin or triple room so it can host up to three people to indulge in blissful serenity. You’ll be right by the swimming pool for a refreshing dip or to simply relax overlooking the beautiful gardens. The koi fish and guinea fowl will make sure to entertain you while you sit back and our restaurant staff is only a phone call away for room service if you are craving for something delicious to complete your day in paradise. Your Jivana experience will surely make you look back on your holiday with a smile on your face.',NULL,'The original voucher issued by travel agent must back up guest check in. The voucher should clearly specify all instructions and required services.','{\"date\": \"2024-05-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5119442,'394','Mrs Maria De La Soledad',30661,215777,'Lotus One Bedroom','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-29','2024-05-30','Jacob','Praba',1,'Double',2550000.00,'Are you looking for a romantic getaway, just the two of you? Then our one bedroom villa is exactly what you are looking for. Your own private spot in paradise will easily set the right atmosphere to share many precious and love filled moments together. You’ll be able to enjoy a morning tea or coffee with your loved one, a dip in your own private swimming pool or a romantic movie to end your day. And with food and drinks from the restaurant just one phone call away, you can forget about any distractions and completely focus on each other. Your quality time spent together at Jivana will turn into memories that will bring a smile to your face every single time.',NULL,'The original voucher issued by travel agent must back up guest check in. The voucher should clearly specify all instructions and required services.','{\"date\": \"2024-05-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5119445,'395','Mrs. Clara Puy Rodellar',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-14','2024-06-14','Jacob','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',420000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-14\", \"text\": \"ETA 22.40 by QR960 from Doha on 14 June\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-14\", \"text\": \"Jl. Tirta Tawar Br Kutuh Kaja No.105, Petulu, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Calma Ubud Suite & Villas\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5119447,'332','Xpert Holidays Group 12-13 July',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-12','2024-07-13','Rendy','Eddy',8,'Twin',6272000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. Flight details: ETA 13.10 by Cathay Pacific CX777 from Hong Kong on 12 July 2024 ETD 10.00 by Batik Air ID6674 to Tarakan on 13 July 2024 Total: 13 pax Name: Ms. Pui Wa Vicky Cheung Mr. Chi Man Lam Ms. Wai Mi So Mr. Kai Ming Pang Ms. Ling Kuen Elsa Chou Ms. Pui Chu Cheryl Cheung Ms. Sze Wun Cheung Mr. Yee Lap Solon Wu Mr. Io Meng Tang Mr. Kwong Choi Tam Mr. Che Wai Au Mr. Ming Pong Chow Mr. Mow Chiu Raymond Chan','{\"date\": \"2024-07-12\", \"text\": \"Flight details: ETA 13.10 by Cathay Pacific CX777 from Hong Kong on 12 July 2024\", \"time\": \"13:10\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-13\", \"text\": \"ETD 10.00 by Batik Air ID6674 to Tarakan on 13 July 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5119448,'395','Mrs. Clara Puy Rodellar',30678,217036,'Superior Room Plus','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-06-14','2024-06-16','Jacob','Tami',1,'Double',4026240.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5119451,'395','Mrs. Clara Puy Rodellar',30527,200122,'Terrace Villa','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-06-16','2024-06-19','Jacob','Tami',1,'Double',8280000.00,'After a day of adventure exploring the culture of Ubud and its surroundings, the Terrace View Villas offer a perfect retreat. These one-bedroom villas offer a spacious floor area of 70 m2, with a King-sized bed, air conditioning, private bathroom with bathtub, and a beautiful view of the nature surrounding the resort. Unwind in the private outdoor space in the gazebo on the personal terrace, laze in the infinity plunge pool, or simply lay back in the outdoor natural stone bathtub.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5119453,'395','Mrs. Clara Puy Rodellar',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-16','2024-06-16','Jacob','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1872000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-16\", \"text\": \"Jl. Tirta Tawar Br Kutuh Kaja No.105, Petulu, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Calma Ubud Suite & Villas\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-16\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Tegallalang, Banjar Sapat, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Tejaprana Resort & Spa\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5119515,'394','Mrs Maria De La Soledad',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-30','2024-05-31','Jacob','Praba',1,'Double',840000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet ac