00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5121502,'397','Javier Carbonell Huesa',30684,200640,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-14','2024-07-15','Nicholas','Eddy',1,'Double',1890000.00,'Equipped with either a king size or deluxe twin beds, our Deluxe Rooms are designed for modern travellers who seek comfort while staying in Bromo.',NULL,'Please send the guarantee letter/voucher following procedure below: - 30 (thirty) days reservation notice prior to the arrival date for Normal Period. - 45 (forty-five) days reservation notice prior to the arrival date for High Season (June 1th to August 31st) and Peak Season (D-3 to D+4 Idul Fitri (April 18 - 25th, 2023 and December 21st, 2023 to January 5th, 2024) period. - Otherwise, the cancellation policy will be applied.','{\"date\": \"2024-07-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5121503,'397','Javier Carbonell Huesa',30682,200889,'Resort\'s Deluxe','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-15','2024-07-16','Nicholas','Eddy',1,'Double',2418000.00,'Beautiful Hotel in Banyuwangi, East Java. Ijen Resort and Villas Close with Ijen Crater, very recommended place to stay with great view from your room. You can directly enjoy the mountain view or rice field view. Also can enjoy some great facility such us swimming pool with the great view near ijen mountain, in Banyuwangi.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5121624,'394','Mrs Maria De La Soledad',30508,207278,'Full Day Tour Car & Driver (8-10 hours)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-23','2024-05-23','Jacob','Praba',1,'Persons (2)',600000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"text\": \"ARTINI DIJIWA UBUD Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"UBUD\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"text\": \"WAPA DI UME Jl. Suweta Banjar Bentuyung Ubud, Ubud, Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"UBUD\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5121628,'85','14D13N BALI ( UBUD – NUSA PENIDA ) – GILI – BALI (SEMINYAK ) SPE',30623,200589,'Valley Villa','Confirmed',NULL,5,'2024-06-19','2024-06-24','Melysa','Eddy',1,'Double',16800000.00,'The Valley Villas are situated on the lowest levels of the hotel, ensuring guests a clear view of the jungle valley below. With a floor area of 100 m², these one-bedroom villas are well-equipped with a king-size bed, air conditioning, a private bathroom featuring a rainfall showerhead, a beautiful view of the jungle valley, and other various amenities for a comfortable stay. Escape to the peaceful seclusion of the villa’s private outdoor sanctuary, where you can find respite in the cozy confines of the gazebo, unwind in the refreshing plunge pool, or immerse yourself in blissful repose within the outdoor natural stone bathtub.',NULL,'HONEYMOON','{\"date\": \"2024-06-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5121640,'85','14D13N BALI ( UBUD – NUSA PENIDA ) – GILI – BALI (SEMINYAK ) SPE',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route (Templo Taman Ayun - Jatiluwih - Templo Ulun Danu Bratan - Tanah Lot )','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-21','2024-06-21','Melysa','Eddy',2,'Persons (2)',1872000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,'PICK UP & DROP OFF AT : TEJAPRANA BISMA ADDRESS : Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 PHONE : +62812 37230707 / +62361 6207070','{\"date\": \"2024-06-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"MEET AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5121649,'394','Mrs Maria De La Soledad',30508,207278,'Full Day Tour Car & Driver (8-10 hours)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-24','2024-05-24','Jacob','Praba',1,'Persons (2)',600000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"text\": \"WAPA DI UME Jl. Suweta Banjar Bentuyung Ubud, Ubud, Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"UBUD\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"text\": \"WAPA DI UME Jl. Suweta Banjar Bentuyung Ubud, Ubud, Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"UBUD\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5121663,'85','14D13N BALI ( UBUD – NUSA PENIDA ) – GILI – BALI (SEMINYAK ) SPE',30508,202864,'Goa Gajah – Tampaksiring – Gunung Kawi Sebatu – Tegalalang','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-22','2024-06-22','Melysa','Eddy',2,'Persons (2)',1812000.00,'We will be picking you up from your hotel to enjoy the wealth of art in Ubud. First we will visit Monkey Forest; the Ubud Monkey Forest is a nature reserve and temple complex in Ubud, Bali. It houses approximately 340 Crab-eating Macaque (Macacafas cicularis) monkeys. The Monkey Forest contains the Pura Dalem Agung Padangtegal temple as well as a \"Holy Spring\" bathing temple and another temple used for cremation ceremonies. Next we go to Ubud Traditional Art Market where the existence is not far different from other markets available in the tourism area. This market as a society economics center of Ubud and it is apposite to the existence of Ubud Empire that is called Puri Saren. Our last destination is Gua Gajah (Elephant Cave). This cave is built at crevasse edge from the federation of 2 rills that is called Pangkung River, where the irrigation is mixed with Petanu River flow. The word of Gua Gajah is anticipated coming from the word of Lwa Gajah, the name of Buddhist Temple or hermitage for Buddhist monk. There is a relief which is almost looking like the form of mountain on the entrance of this cave. It was carved many designed on the relief like grove with the stick, close leaf, animal for example forest pig, tortoise and specters. The cave mouth is decorated by the bas-relief with the eye turn around to the right or west side. At the end of tour we will transferred back you to the hotel.',NULL,'PICK UP & DROP OFF AT : TEJAPRANA BISMA ADDRESS : Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 PHONE : +62812 37230707 / +62361 6207070','{\"date\": \"2024-06-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": \"MEET AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5121723,'398','Esther Bukai',30619,200840,'Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,5,'2024-06-29','2024-07-04','Ayu','Ayu',1,'Twin',13566000.00,'Located near the main pool, these gracious 69 sqm suites feature a private balcony with views of rice fields or a tropical Balinese garden. The luxurious bathroom has a free-standing bathtub and comfortable dressing room, making it perfect for honeymooners.','These rates are applicable for the capacity specified, non-commissionable and inclusive of breakfast, 10% service charge and 11% government tax.','Please provide breakfast box at 03.30 AM on 04 July 2024.','{\"date\": \"2024-06-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5121724,'398','Esther Bukai',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-29','2024-06-29','Ayu','Ayu',2,'Persons (1-3)',784000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-29\", \"text\": \"ETA 11.00 by Singapore Airlines SQ936 from Singapore on 29 June 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-29\", \"text\": \"Komaneka at Monkey Forest Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud (0361) 4792518\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5121725,'398','Esther Bukai',30508,207262,'Ubud to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-04','2024-07-04','Ayu','Ayu',2,'Persons (1-3)',784000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'Please standby at the lobby hotel.','{\"date\": \"2024-07-04\", \"text\": \"ETD 07.00 by Lion Air JT746 to Manado on 04 July 2024\", \"time\": \"03:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Monkey Forest - Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud (03614792518)\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5121825,'312','JOAN TUTUSAUS SOLE MR / ANABEL TRIGUEROS ANDUJAR MRS.',30508,215968,'FD TOUR Munduk Wildeneres + Ulun Danu Temple with Candi Kuning Local Market','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-25','2024-05-25','Igo','Eddy',2,'Person (1)',0.00,NULL,NULL,'Include : Activities start at 10.30 AM (at Munduk Wildeneres) + Ulun Danu Temple + Candi Kuning Local Market with Spanish Speaking Guide','{\"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"text\": \"Wapa di Ume Ubud Alamat: Jl. Suweta Banjar Bentuyung Ubud, Ubud, Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"07:30\", \"locality\": \"MEET AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"text\": \"Merusaka Nusa Dua Alamat: Kawasan Wisata Nusa Dua Lot S-3, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80363\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5121826,'312','JOAN TUTUSAUS SOLE MR / ANABEL TRIGUEROS ANDUJAR MRS.',30508,215968,'Tegenungan Waterfall - Gunung Kawi Sebatu Temple - Tegallalang - Lunch at Taman Dedary - Puri Peliat','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-22','2024-05-22','Igo','Eddy',2,'Person (1)',0.00,NULL,'Tegenungan Waterfall - Gunung Kawi Sebatu Temple - Tegallalang - Lunch at Taman Dedary - Puri Peliatan - Ubud Monkey Forest','Visit: Tegenungan Waterfall - Gunung Kawi Sebatu Temple - Tegallalang - Lunch at Taman Dedary - Puri Peliatan - Ubud Monkey Forest','{\"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"text\": \"PICK UP AT DROP OFF AT Wapa di Ume Ubud Alamat: Jl. Suweta Banjar Bentuyung Ubud, Ubud, Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": \"MEET AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5121829,'312','JOAN TUTUSAUS SOLE MR / ANABEL TRIGUEROS ANDUJAR MRS.',30508,215968,'Goa Raja Waterfall - Besakih Temple - Kintamani with Lunch','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-23','2024-05-23','Igo','Eddy',2,'Person (1)',0.00,NULL,NULL,'Visit: Goa Raja Waterfall - Besakih Temple - Kintamani with Lunch','{\"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"text\": \"PICK UP AT DROP OFF AT Wapa di Ume Ubud Alamat: Jl. Suweta Banjar Bentuyung Ubud, Ubud, Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"MEET AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5121906,'85','14D13N BALI ( UBUD – NUSA PENIDA ) – GILI – BALI (SEMINYAK ) SPE',30508,202891,'Contact with Nature Tour','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-23','2024-06-23','Melysa','Eddy',2,'Persons (2)',1860000.00,'Deferent than the other tours! This tour will quietly finding you in the fullness of nature. First we will explore Pura Luhur Batukaru. Pura Luhur Batukaru Temple is one of the six directional temples on Bali that are believed to protect the island and its people from evil spirits. Pura Luhur Batukaru protects Bali from the West and was originally built in the 11th century. Pura Luhur Batukaru is one of Bali’s biggest Hindu temples, but because it is off the main tourist trail, sees fewer visitors than many of the other temples. Its peaceful setting amid rainforest at the foot of Mount Batukaru enhances its stunning Balinese architecture. We continue to reach the terrace rice fields Jatiluwih. Jatiluwih is a favorite tourist destination in Bali famous with the beautiful rice terrace unfolding from the foot of mountain until the coastal side. With the beautiful view as according to its name from Jati and Luwih, where Jati mean really and Luwih meaning especial, good, and beautiful or the equivalent. The local paddies are planted in this place look typically of the high relative size plant if it is compared with other pre-eminent paddy planted by most farmers in Bali. You’ll get to explore different parts of the terraces, jump over rivers. We continue our way to the Lake Buyan. We will see one of the most beautiful nature and vegetation scenery on the island. Buyan Lake is a smallest lake in Bali located in the plateau area with cool weather covers it. It is situated in the high land with hill and rain forest surrounds it. Since the location in the plateau area, the fog is usually blanketing the area. This lake can be seen from the top of hill which is called Asah Gobleg. The western end of Lake Buyan, we will start to see the sister lake of Buyan, the Lake Tamblingan. If we follow the road it will bring us closer and closer to Lake Tamblingan, or if we take direction to the right at the following junction at the end of the road, we will arrive in Munduk village, a village rich with coffee plantations. And our final destination is Munduk Waterfalls. This waterfall is a beautiful tourist destination in north part of Bali. Waterfall voice around the charming nature was amazing and it was the separate attraction which can be enjoyed by each visitor who comes to visit. In order to visit the waterfall, all visitors will follow the walkway down until the spot point.',NULL,'PICK UP & DROP OFF AT : TEJAPRANA BISMA ADDRESS : Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 PHONE : +62812 37230707 / +62361 6207070','{\"date\": \"2024-06-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"MEET AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5121924,'85','14D13N BALI ( UBUD – NUSA PENIDA ) – GILI – BALI (SEMINYAK ) SPE',30508,213032,'Ubud to Kusamba','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-24','2024-06-24','Melysa','Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',420000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-24\", \"text\": \"TEJAPRANA BISMA ADDRESS : Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 PHONE : +62812 37230707 / +62361 6207070\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": \"MEET AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-24\", \"text\": \"24 Jun 2024 : One Way Transfer Kusamba - Nusa Penida (departure at 08.00) BY THE ANGKAL\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"KUSAMBA\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5121941,'85','14D13N BALI ( UBUD – NUSA PENIDA ) – GILI – BALI (SEMINYAK ) SPE',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-06-24','2024-06-24','Melysa','Eddy',2,'Persons (2)',1020000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:20\", \"locality\": \"SAMPALAN PORT BY THE ANGKAL\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-24\", \"text\": \"ADIWANA WARNAKALI Sakti, Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klunkung, Bali 80771, Indonesia T: +62361620700 |M: +6287760045426\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5121951,'85','14D13N BALI ( UBUD – NUSA PENIDA ) – GILI – BALI (SEMINYAK ) SPE',30547,200475,'Ocean View Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-06-24','2024-06-26','Melysa','Eddy',1,'Double',4800000.00,'Adiwana Warnakali boasts a collection of 12 Ocean View suites, all situated on the lower level, have a room size 56 sqm and the type bed single or double. Each of these suites offers a generously-sized balcony that unveils breathtaking vistas of the vast, cerulean expanse of the Nusa Lembongan ocean and the majestic presence of Mount Agung. Here, your mornings resemble scenes from a captivating movie, with the invigorating scent of the sea and the soothing melody of waves crashing against the rugged cliffs. The spacious rooms are designed for your utmost comfort, sporting a nautical theme that incorporates oars as charming decorative elements. The bathrooms are adorned with striking blue tiles, adding to the overall maritime charm. Immerse yourself in an unforgettable and idyllic stay at Adiwana Warnakali.',NULL,'HONEYMOON','{\"date\": \"2024-06-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5121968,'85','14D13N BALI ( UBUD – NUSA PENIDA ) – GILI – BALI (SEMINYAK ) SPE',30650,208425,'Private Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-06-26','2024-06-29','Melysa','Eddy',1,'Double',9000000.00,'Each villa embraces calmness, comfort and privacy in a simple and elegant setting. Guests can relax while peacefully sipping drinks in an inviting plunge pool surrounded by a lush tropical garden and at an old-wooden deck terrace where they can have a peaceful siesta on the large-bean bags or day-bed mattress.',NULL,'HONEYMOON','{\"date\": \"2024-06-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5121970,'399','Mrs. Patricia Iborra Gimeno',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-27','2024-05-28','Melysa','Tami',1,'Double',784000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. - Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK–IN','{\"date\": \"2024-05-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5121990,'399','Mrs. Patricia Iborra Gimeno',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-05-28','2024-05-30','Melysa','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',10080000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan isCape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continueto add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"text\": \"ETA 07.15 by Batik Air ID6202 from Jakarta on 28 May\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-30\", \"text\": \"ETD 07.30 by Nam Air IN195 to Semarang on 30 May\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5121993,'85','14D13N BALI ( UBUD – NUSA PENIDA ) – GILI – BALI (SEMINYAK ) SPE',30508,207386,'Padang Bai to Seminyak','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-29','2024-06-29','Melysa','Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',600000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"13:55\", \"locality\": \"PADANG BAY BY BLUE WATER\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-29\", \"text\": \"KAYUMAS SEMINYAK RESORT ADDRESS : Jl. Pura Telaga Waja No.18a, Kerobokan Kelod, Kec. Kuta Utara, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361, Indonesia P: +62361 9348348\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5121999,'85','14D13N BALI ( UBUD – NUSA PENIDA ) – GILI – BALI (SEMINYAK ) SPE',30798,201630,'One Bedroom Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-06-29','2024-07-02','Melysa','Eddy',1,'Double',4176000.00,'The two-story, 45 sqm One Bedroom Suite features an natural and airy interior, complemented with modern furnishings and views overlooking to the private terrace with a plunge pool. Floor-to-ceiling glass doors provide generous natural lighting and a dynamic ambience. Plush linens and a marble bathroom surround guests in elegance.',NULL,'HONEYMOON','{\"date\": \"2024-06-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5122004,'85','14D13N BALI ( UBUD – NUSA PENIDA ) – GILI – BALI (SEMINYAK ) SPE',30508,207270,'Seminyak to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-02','2024-07-02','Melysa','Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',300000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-02\", \"text\": \"KAYUMAS SEMINYAK RESORT ADDRESS : Jl. Pura Telaga Waja No.18a, Kerobokan Kelod, Kec. Kuta Utara, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361, Indonesia P: +62361 9348348\", \"time\": \"15:00\", \"locality\": \"MEET AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-02\", \"text\": \"ETD : QR 963 / 02JUL FROM DENPASAR / 1910 BY QATAR AIRWAYS\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"DENPASAR AIRPORT\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5122042,'399','Mrs. Patricia Iborra Gimeno',31106,203994,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-02','2024-06-03','Melysa','Tami',1,'Double',756000.00,'Discover Makassar from a very comfortable room with a king-size bed (or two single beds), a practical desk with an executive chair, and a modern bathroom with an open shower. You will also really like the welcome minibar to start your stay as you deserve. Inside the room has flat-screen TV, high speed Wi-Fi, and refrigerator.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5122054,'399','Mrs. Patricia Iborra Gimeno',30644,201466,'5D4N Toraja Package Tour (4N Toraja)','Confirmed',NULL,5,'2024-06-03','2024-06-07','Melysa','Tami',2,'Persons (2 / Double)',17628800.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-03\", \"text\": \"ETA 09.10 by Wings Air IW1350 from Makassar on 03 June\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Lagaligo Bua Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-07\", \"text\": \"ETD 11.10 by Wings Air IW1331 to Makassar on 07 June\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Toraja Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5122127,'399','Mrs. Patricia Iborra Gimeno',30673,200559,'Deluxe Double Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-06-07','2024-06-09','Melysa','Tami',1,'Double',2352000.00,'Designed to capture nature vibes. Slide open the door to your private terrace to let in the fresh mountain air and relax.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5122137,'399','Mrs. Patricia Iborra Gimeno',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-09','2024-06-09','Melysa','Tami',2,'Persons (1-3)',784000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-09\", \"text\": \"ETA 18.55 by Citilink QG694 from Surabaya on 9 June\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-09\", \"text\": \"Banjar Junjungan, Jl. Tirta Tawar, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Korurua Dijiwa Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5122481,'401','Philip Wood',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-20','2024-11-21','Ayu','Ayu',1,'Double',784000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. - Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK–IN Flight details: ETA 17.05 GA601 from Manado on 20 November 2024 ETD 00.15 EK359 to Dubai on 21 November 2024','{\"date\": \"2024-11-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5122807,'402','DI FRANCESCO MARCELLO',32404,214285,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-20','2024-10-21','Ayu','Ayu',4,'Double + Twin',3539200.00,'Room Type 4 Deluxe Rooms (2 Double + 1 Twin + 1 Single)',NULL,'2 DBL + 1 TWN + 1 SGL Deluxe Room','{\"date\": \"2024-10-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5122811,'399','Mrs. Patricia Iborra Gimeno',30508,202864,'Ubud and Surrounding Tour','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-12','2024-06-12','Melysa','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1691200.00,'We will be picking you up from your hotel to enjoy the wealth of art in Ubud. First we will visit Monkey Forest; the Ubud Monkey Forest is a nature reserve and temple complex in Ubud, Bali. It houses approximately 340 Crab-eating Macaque (Macacafas cicularis) monkeys. The Monkey Forest contains the Pura Dalem Agung Padangtegal temple as well as a \"Holy Spring\" bathing temple and another temple used for cremation ceremonies. Next we go to Ubud Traditional Art Market where the existence is not far different from other markets available in the tourism area. This market as a society economics center of Ubud and it is apposite to the existence of Ubud Empire that is called Puri Saren. Our last destination is Gua Gajah (Elephant Cave). This cave is built at crevasse edge from the federation of 2 rills that is called Pangkung River, where the irrigation is mixed with Petanu River flow. The word of Gua Gajah is anticipated coming from the word of Lwa Gajah, the name of Buddhist Temple or hermitage for Buddhist monk. There is a relief which is almost looking like the form of mountain on the entrance of this cave. It was carved many designed on the relief like grove with the stick, close leaf, animal for example forest pig, tortoise and specters. The cave mouth is decorated by the bas-relief with the eye turn around to the right or west side. At the end of tour we will transferred back you to the hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-12\", \"text\": \"JL Tirta Tawar No 1, Banjar Junjungan Ubud 80571, Bali – Indonesia\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Korurua Dijiwa Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5122812,'399','Mrs. Patricia Iborra Gimeno',30508,207262,'Ubud to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-14','2024-06-14','Melysa','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-14\", \"text\": \"ETD 08.00 by Batik Air ID6333 to Labuan Bajo on 14 Jun\", \"time\": \"04:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Korurua Dijiwa Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5122815,'399','Mrs. Patricia Iborra Gimeno',30914,202449,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-06-16','2024-06-20','Melysa','Tami',1,'Double',7392000.00,'The room is spacious at 48 sqm with king and twin size beds capacity of 2 (two) adults and 2 (two) child below 12 years old, decked with combination of Balinese-modern contemporary elements, immaculately designed to characterize each of Seven Balinese Goddesses. Located on a higher level of each Puri, the room is equipped with every amenity that could possibly be required, making it ideal for a single traveler or couples.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5122816,'399','Mrs. Patricia Iborra Gimeno',30508,202896,'Bali Village Life - Tanah Lot Temple','Confirmed','C2I-BALI05',1,'2024-06-17','2024-06-17','Melysa','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',2441600.00,'At 08.00 am, we pick you up from your hotel and start our journey to Tunjuk Village in Tabanan district. Upon arrival, you will be greeted with open arms and with the warm smiles of the locals you meet along the way. You\'ll meet in the outer courtyard of the village temple and meet your local guides. Throughout the hike you will meet people from the village involved in the tasks that keep their lives busy day in and day out. You can choose to observe or participate in them to gain a better understanding of village life. The mighty water buffalo is still used to drag the plough through the muddy rice paddies and prepare the land for planting. Or maybe you want to help with planting or harvesting, depending on the time of year. When you complete the tour in the rice paddies, you\'ll follow your guide on a path through lush gardens where villagers go about their daily chores. There are women who beat the rice with heavy mallets to remove the hooves. After lunch we leave Tunjuk Village and continue our journey to visit THE TANAH LOT. We\'ll close the visit by watching the sunset at the most famous and photographed temple in Bali. Torn from the earth on a stone pedestal sculpted by the incoming tides, the solitary black towers of Tanah Lot and the plumes of foliage spilling over the precipices, recall the delicacy of Chinese painting. The Pura Tanah Lot or the Earth Temple in the middle of the sea was built in the 16th century. At the end of the day, you\'ll be transferred to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-17\", \"text\": \"Kawasan Wisata Nusa Dua Lot S-3, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80363\", \"time\": \"07:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Merusaka Nusa Dua\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5122817,'399','Mrs. Patricia Iborra Gimeno',30508,207268,'Nusa Dua to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-20','2024-06-20','Melysa','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-20\", \"text\": \"Kawasan Wisata Nusa Dua Lot S-3, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali\", \"time\": \"17:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Merusaka Nusa Dua\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-20\", \"text\": \"ETD 21.20 by Turkish Airlines TK67 to Istanbul on 20 June\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5122818,'399','Mrs. Patricia Iborra Gimeno',30884,217082,'Grand Deluxe','Confirmed',NULL,5,'2024-06-09','2024-06-14','Melysa','Tami',1,'Double',7784000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5122819,'309','Cal McIlwaine',30959,213942,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-21','2024-06-22','Rendy','Ayu',1,'Single',974400.00,'Specially designed for savvy travelers seeking comfort and style at 48 sqm of room size. Available in King and Double bet with the option of an extra bed for an additional fee. The room features a cozy living room with a comfortable sofa, LED wall-mounted TV, complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi, and in-room amenities to ensure a relaxing stay experience.',NULL,'Check-in time 14.00 Check-out time 12.00','{\"date\": \"2024-06-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5122846,'399','Mrs. Patricia Iborra Gimeno',30508,212289,'Airport to Nusa Dua','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-16','2024-06-16','Melysa','Tami',2,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-16\", \"text\": \"ETA 18.55 by Batik Air ID6334 from Labuan Bajo on 16 Jun\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-16\", \"text\": \"Kawasan Wisata Nusa Dua Lot S-3, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Merusaka Nusa Dua\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5122847,'399','Mrs. Patricia Iborra Gimeno',30508,202897,'Uluwatu Temple and Kecak Dance','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-18','2024-06-18','Melysa','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',2556000.00,'This half-day tour, is an exciting tour package to visit Padang-Padang Beach, Uluwatu Temple, the famous Balinese Hindu Temple in south part of Bali with breathtaking view of sunset and Indian Ocean. Uluwatu Temple is one of Balinese Hindu Temples located right on the petrifying hill with the crevasse exist in the right and left side. Uluwatu Temple is one of Sad Khayangan (6 biggest temple in Bali) owns magnificent view of the Indian Ocean and sunset as a backdrop. This temple is very amazing where the location is right on the narrow peninsula with deep seawater under it. This tour package is combined with the spectacular Balinese traditional dance performance of Kecak Dance. Balinese Kecak Dance is a spectacular traditional dance with the group of people playing this dance with fire game. It is very exciting and unique dance due to the sound of gamelan is not using the normal gamelan but use their mouth. The dancers make the compact choir with the exquisite dance movement that is one of this dance features. After the dance we returned back to the hotel or seafood restaurant in Jimbaran.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-18\", \"text\": \"Kawasan Wisata Nusa Dua Lot S-3, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali\", \"time\": \"15:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Merusaka Nusa Dua\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5122991,'403','Jose Arturo Blanco Garcia Mr / Aranzazu Mendez Muñoz Mrs + 1 PAX',30680,200914,'1 (DBL) Deluxe Room + 1 Extra Bed','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-28','2024-06-29',NULL,'Eddy',1,'Double',1288000.00,'Enjoy our spacious elegant deluxe room with 40 m2 of room size. Enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, hot and cold shower, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. - Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK–IN','{\"date\": \"2024-06-28\", \"text\": \"ETA: 28 JUN 2024 / 17:35 FROM ISTAMBUL / TK56 BY TURKISH AIRLINES\", \"time\": \"17:35\", \"locality\": \"AIRPORT JAKARTA\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-29\", \"text\": \"ETD: 29 JUN 2024 / 1530 TO DENPASAR GA 414 BY GARUDA\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"AIRPORT JAKARTA\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5123018,'403','Jose Arturo Blanco Garcia Mr / Aranzazu Mendez Muñoz Mrs + 1 PAX',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-29','2024-06-29',NULL,'Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-29\", \"text\": \"ETA: 29 JUN 2024 / 1825 FROM JAKARTA / GA 414 BY GARUDA\", \"time\": \"12:35\", \"locality\": \"AIRPORT DENPASAR\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-29\", \"text\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone (0361) 972385\\\"\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5123052,'403','Jose Arturo Blanco Garcia Mr / Aranzazu Mendez Muñoz Mrs + 1 PAX',30508,202864,'Goa Gajah – Tirta Empul – Gunung Kawi – Tegalalang','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-01','2024-07-01',NULL,'Eddy',3,'Persons (3)',1932000.00,'We will be picking you up from your hotel to enjoy the wealth of art in Ubud. First we will visit Monkey Forest; the Ubud Monkey Forest is a nature reserve and temple complex in Ubud, Bali. It houses approximately 340 Crab-eating Macaque (Macacafas cicularis) monkeys. The Monkey Forest contains the Pura Dalem Agung Padangtegal temple as well as a \"Holy Spring\" bathing temple and another temple used for cremation ceremonies. Next we go to Ubud Traditional Art Market where the existence is not far different from other markets available in the tourism area. This market as a society economics center of Ubud and it is apposite to the existence of Ubud Empire that is called Puri Saren. Our last destination is Gua Gajah (Elephant Cave). This cave is built at crevasse edge from the federation of 2 rills that is called Pangkung River, where the irrigation is mixed with Petanu River flow. The word of Gua Gajah is anticipated coming from the word of Lwa Gajah, the name of Buddhist Temple or hermitage for Buddhist monk. There is a relief which is almost looking like the form of mountain on the entrance of this cave. It was carved many designed on the relief like grove with the stick, close leaf, animal for example forest pig, tortoise and specters. The cave mouth is decorated by the bas-relief with the eye turn around to the right or west side. At the end of tour we will transferred back you to the hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-01\", \"text\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone (0361) 972385\\\"\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-01\", \"text\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone (0361) 972385\\\"\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5123060,'403','Jose Arturo Blanco Garcia Mr / Aranzazu Mendez Muñoz Mrs + 1 PAX',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route (Templo Taman Ayun - Jatiluwih - Templo Ulun Danu Bratan - Tanah Lot )','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-30','2024-06-30',NULL,'Eddy',3,'Persons (3)',2016000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-30\", \"text\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone (0361) 972385\\\"\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-30\", \"text\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone (0361) 972385\\\"\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5123120,'404','Mr. Raguel Martin',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-28','2024-05-28','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"text\": \"ETA 16.55 by IB7968 from Doha on 28 May\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Tejaprana Bisma\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5123127,'404','Mr. Raguel Martin',30623,200583,'Garden Villa','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-05-28','2024-06-01','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',10304000.00,'The Garden Villas provide an ideal sanctuary, featuring a private garden that ensures a peaceful and intimate atmosphere for guests seeking the perfect retreat. These one-bedroom villas are well-equipped with a floor area of 100 m², a king-size bed, air conditioning, sleek appointed bathroom with a rainfall showerhead, beautiful view of the garden, and various amenities for a comfortable stay. Unwind in the serenity of the villa’s private outdoor haven, whether it’s within the comforting embrace of the gazebo, lounging by the refreshing plunge pool, or indulging in pure relaxation while soaking in the outdoor natural stone bathtub.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5123168,'404','Mr. Raguel Martin',30508,202889,'Tamblingan Jungle Trek','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-01','2024-06-01','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',2105600.00,'Today we will explore the nature of Buyan and Tamblingan lake in our lovely village, it will help you to escape from the crowds and fell the Nature atmosphere of the real jungle of Bali. We will pick you at your hotel at 07:30 AM and we drive to Tamblingan lake. Arrive in the trekking start point, we will have an explanation about the trekking. We will start the trek by entering a lush protected rain-forest area with giant old tress, animal such as macaque, black giant squirrel, birds and old legend temple inside in the Jungle. You will then walk along the shore of this lake situated in the caldera of an extinct Jungle Mountain. Our trekking guide will explain more detail about plants and living creatures in the jungle. This tour also combine with a session of thirty five minutes exploring the Tamblingan lake by dugout canoe to finishing point. Finish with trekking we will drop you to your hotel but we will make a stop at Ulun Danu Temple. Ulun Danu Temple Bratan, the famous temple stands on a small promontory located in the shore of Lake Bratan and has beautiful scenery with this lake and the mountains as backdrop sight.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"07:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Tejaprana Bisma\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Munduk Moding Plantation Nature Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5123172,'403','Jose Arturo Blanco Garcia Mr / Aranzazu Mendez Muñoz Mrs + 1 PAX',30508,207275,'Ubud to Seminyak','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-03','2024-07-03',NULL,'Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-03\", \"text\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone (0361) 972385\\\"\", \"time\": \"12:00\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-03\", \"text\": \"KAYUMAS SEMINYAK RESORT ADDRESS : Jl. Pura Telaga Waja No.18A, Kerobokan Kelod, Kec. Kuta Utara, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361 Phone : (0361) 9348348\\\"\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5123193,'404','Mr. Raguel Martin',30578,203470,'Luxury Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-01','2024-06-02','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',3889440.00,'Discover our exquisite Luxury Suites, each spanning approximately 60 m² and nestled within our lush coffee plantation at various enchanting vantage points. These suites offer a personal terrace and a spacious en-suite bathroom adorned with a double sink, embodying a minimalist design that seamlessly incorporates some of the most beautiful natural elements found at MMP. Crafted with Merbau parquet flooring and adorned with Sulawesi cream marble in the bathroom, the Luxury Suites are a testament to nature\'s elegance. King-size poster beds, tropical hardwood couches, and premium cotton and linen fabrics, alongside captivating local artworks, combine to create a cozy interior ambiance. Enormous glass panel doors showcase panoramic vistas in every direction. As a luxurious touch, a generously sized hand-finished terrazzo bathtub beckons you to unwind in the soothing embrace of mountain water infused with fragrant essences, provided to enhance your tranquil experience.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5123205,'404','Mr. Raguel Martin',30508,213318,'Munduk to Uluwatu','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-02','2024-06-02','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',616000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-02\", \"text\": \"Jl. Asah Gobleg, Gobleg, Kec. Banjar, Kabupaten Buleleng, Bali 81152\", \"time\": \"12:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Munduk Moding Plantation Nature Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-02\", \"text\": \"Jl. Buana Sari, Pecatu, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Gypsea Bali Hotel & Restaurant\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5123235,'405','Mr. Borja Robledo Galan',30508,207268,'Nusa Dua to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-22','2024-05-22','Melysa','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Nusa Dua Selatan lot 4, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": \"05:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Apurva Kempinski Bali\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"text\": \"ETD 09.00 by Nam Air IN280 to Tambolaka on 22 May\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5123237,'405','Mr. Borja Robledo Galan',30508,212287,'Airport to Sanur','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-25','2024-05-25','Melysa','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"text\": \"ETA 13.55 by Wings Air IW1833 from Tambolaka on 25 May\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"text\": \"Jl. Danau Tamblingan No.89A, Sanur, Bali, Kota Denpasar, Bali 80228\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Andaz Bali\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5123239,'405','Mr. Borja Robledo Galan',30508,207269,'Sanur to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-26','2024-05-26','Melysa','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-26\", \"text\": \"Jalan Danau Tamblingan 89a, Sanur, Bali, 80228, Indonesia\", \"time\": \"14:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Andaz Bali\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-26\", \"text\": \"ETD 18.55 by Qatar Airways QR963 to Doha on 26 May\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5123258,'405','Mr. Borja Robledo Galan',30548,217099,'Ocean View Lagoon Access Suite King','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-25','2024-05-26','Melysa','Tami',1,'Double',12534000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5123260,'403','Jose Arturo Blanco Garcia Mr / Aranzazu Mendez Muñoz Mrs + 1 PAX',30798,201630,'1 (DBL) One bedroom Suite Room + Extra Bed','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-07-03','2024-07-06',NULL,'Eddy',1,'Double',7089600.00,'The two-story, 45 sqm One Bedroom Suite features an natural and airy interior, complemented with modern furnishings and views overlooking to the private terrace with a plunge pool. Floor-to-ceiling glass doors provide generous natural lighting and a dynamic ambience. Plush linens and a marble bathroom surround guests in elegance.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5123317,'403','Jose Arturo Blanco Garcia Mr / Aranzazu Mendez Muñoz Mrs + 1 PAX',30705,201148,'1 (DBL) Premier Room Rice Field View + Extra Bed','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-06-29','2024-07-03',NULL,'Eddy',1,'Double',11424000.00,'Gaze out at rippling rice fields as you let your stress slip away in one of our Premier Ricefield View suites. Inside you have smooth tiles, warm wooden accents, and all the modern comforts you could ask for. Step onto the balcony and you have an airy nook where you can witness life unfold in the Balinese countryside.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5123369,'403','Jose Arturo Blanco Garcia Mr / Aranzazu Mendez Muñoz Mrs + 1 PAX',30508,207270,'Seminyak to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-06','2024-07-06',NULL,'Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-06\", \"text\": \"KAYUMAS SEMINYAK RESORT ADDRESS : Jl. Pura Telaga Waja No.18A, Kerobokan Kelod, Kec. Kuta Utara, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361 Phone : (0361) 9348348\\\"\", \"time\": \"11:30\", \"locality\": \"MEET AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-06\", \"text\": \"ETD: 06 JUL 2024 / 1450 TO JAKARTA / QG685 BY CITILINK\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"DENPASAR AIRPORT\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5123402,'404','Mr. Raguel Martin',30508,212552,'Uluwatu to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-04','2024-06-04','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-04\", \"text\": \"Jl. Buana Sari, Pecatu, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": \"05:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Gypsea Bali Hotel & Restaurant\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-04\", \"text\": \"ETD 08.30 to Gili Air by Gili Gili Fast Boat on 04 June\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5123416,'404','Mr. Raguel Martin',30650,208425,'Private Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-06-04','2024-06-07','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',6720000.00,'Each villa embraces calmness, comfort and privacy in a simple and elegant setting. Guests can relax while peacefully sipping drinks in an inviting plunge pool surrounded by a lush tropical garden and at an old-wooden deck terrace where they can have a peaceful siesta on the large-bean bags or day-bed mattress.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5123433,'404','Mr. Raguel Martin',30508,214949,'Padang Bai to Kuta','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-07','2024-06-07','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-07\", \"text\": \"ETA 12.30 from Gili Air by Gili Gili Fast Boat\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-07\", \"text\": \"Jl. Kartika Plaza No.127, Kuta, Kec. Kuta, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Vira Bali Boutique Hotel & Suite\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5123438,'404','Mr. Raguel Martin',30571,202567,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-07','2024-06-08','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',1204000.00,'Located at the Second Floor, 35 sqm comfort living with a touch of Balinese style featuring completed fitting, Cable TV, a fancy bathroom comprises rain shower and good quality amenities. Also dedicated Wi-Fi Access to complete your day.',NULL,'Flight information ETD 01.05 by IB7967 to Doha on 08 June 2024','{\"date\": \"2024-06-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5124635,'378','NIKANOR',30508,202893,'Lempuyang Temple Tour (Lempuyang-Tirta Gangga-Tenganan-Goa Lawah)','Confirmed','C2I-BALI11',1,'2024-05-18','2024-05-18','Norberto','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',1920000.00,'At the agreed time, our guide will pick you up to start the tour in the eastern part of Bali. The first place you will visit is Goa Lawah Temple. Goa Lawah Temple consists of two names, \"Goa\" which means cave and \"Lawah\" which means bat. Several thousand bats are flying in the cave as the name suggests. With the lights fading as you go deeper inside the cave, it gives off a very strange atmosphere. From Goa Lawah, we continue our way to Lempuyang Temple. Upon arrival, the temple will greet you with its gratifying panorama that extends into infinity. On a clear, sunny day, you\'ll be able to gaze out over the mountains, Amlapura city, and Mount Agung, an incredibly magnificent sight that\'s beautiful beyond words. This portrait of heaven is beautifully framed by the Gapura Candi Bentar (the gate of the temple). Our journey continues to visit Tirta Gangga. The site is a paradise surrounded by water, with all the pools decorated with unusual statues. With its seclusion and a view of the surrounding rice paddies, Tirta Gangga is a wonderful place. At the end of the trip we go to Tenganan Village, the most famous Bali Agas (the “original” Bali people) in the city. With its characteristics, the city village is arranged in parallel along the wide main road paved with rows of cobblestones. In Tenganan, women still weave the famous Kamben Geringsing, or \"burnt cloth,\" which has the power to immunize the wearer against evil. We take a close look at what they do in their daily lives in a traditional lifestyle. From Tenganan, we will transfer you to the hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"text\": \"Kajane Mua Ubud Jl. Monkey Forest No.20, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 972877\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"text\": \"Kajane Mua Ubud Jl. Monkey Forest No.20, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 972877\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5124845,'382','JOAQUINA VALDES',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-10','2024-08-10','Jacob','Wiwik',1,'Persons (7-10)',1200000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'Flight Detail: ETA: 17.05 by Lion Air JT910 from Surabaya on 10 August 2024. Drop Off: BERLIMA WOODEN LODGE Singakerta, Ubud, Gianyar Regency, Bali Phone: 0812-3791-7558','{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5125172,'376','Stefano CAVADINI',30508,216952,'Tulamben to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-23','2024-07-23','Rendy','Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',0.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-23\", \"text\": \"MIMPI RESORT BALI TULAMBEN ADDRESS : Banyuwedang, Buleleng 81155 Northwest Bali – Indonesia Mimpi Tulamben : Tel : +62363 21642\\\"\", \"time\": \"13:00\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-23\", \"text\": \"PADANG BAY BY EKA JAYA / PADANG BAI - LEMBONGAN / ETD : 16.00pm ETA : 16.30pm\", \"time\": \"15:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5125312,'407','Kristovel Paino',32825,217132,'Harris Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-17','2024-05-18','Yuli','Febrina',2,'Double',1064000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5126104,'408','Jorge Mario Ferrer',30783,201524,'4D3N Yogyakarta - Mt. Merapi with Jeep / B. Gallery Prawirotaman*4 (Superior Room)','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-06-02','2024-06-05','Guio','Komang',5,'Persons (3 / Double)',22260000.00,'D1 Arrival Yogyakarta International Airport – Transfer to hotel: Welcome to the cradle of Indonesian culture, Yogyakarta. A tourist destination for its ancient palaces, temples, batik workshops, gamelan music orchestras, court dances and wayang puppet shows. Upon your arrival in Yogyakarta a representative of come2indonesia will be waiting for you with a sign indicating your name to take you to your hotel and the rest of the day is for you. D2 Borobudur temple – Candirejo Village Tour by Horse cart / bicycle – Merapi lava tour Including Jeep: You will have your deserved breakfast at the hotel. Today’s tour will make you enjoy the authentic Javanese essence. You will start your route in the direction of with the Borobudur Temple (Candi Borobudur), the great Stupa, the largest Buddhist monument in the world and one of the seven wonders. We will tour around the temple, observe the hundreds and centenary statues of Buddha and witness how dozens of Buddhists come to preach from all over the world. Historically it was established during the relatively brief Sailendra dynasty of Central Java between 778 and 856 BC and is in constant restoration due to the breaks that the tremors of the neighbouring Merapi volcano has been producing during its history. After visiting one of the most important Buddhist temples in Southeast Asia, and in a horse carriage (Andong) we will visit the villages that surround this temple. These are authentic Javanese villages where culture and tradition are the protagonists. As you spend your days in this country and go around the different islands, you will realize how different Indonesians are among them in terms of clothing, food, architecture and even language. Today we will learn about and share these Javanese places. Then we will go to Kaliurang / Kalidalem to see Mount Merapi in constant activity. Here in a 4x4 jeep driven by specialized drivers, we will climb its skirt to see the remains of the 2010 eruption such as houses buried by ashes, a multitude of objects paralyzed by lava, etc. In addition, an open-air tribute museum presided over by the clock that marks the time just when the lava passed through it has been improvised. Accompanied by photos of the rescue, it will make us feel very closely the experiences of that fateful day. After finishing this day full of emotions, we will take you back to your hotel. D3 City Tour Jogjakarta Visit Sultan Palace, Watercastle and Bird Market – Prambanan Temple: After breakfast and at the indicated time we will head towards the heart of the city. We will visit the Keraton known as the Sultan’s Palace. The palace is a complex building two centuries old, located in the heart of the city. You will hear the song of the “freedom” of the birds in the bird market, we will visit the “Water Castle” that occupies the highest part at the northern end of the vast complex of Taman Sari, Malioboro Street, main street of Yogyakarta, with its merchants, horse carriages, taxi-bikes and markets. An incredible experience that will make the hours fly by. After finishing the tour in the center of the city of Yogyakarta, we will go to the northeast direction Candi Prambanan, the temple of the Hinduists and classified as a World Heritage Site by Unesco since 1991. The built of this temple was finished around the year 856 to commemorate the victory of the descendant Sanjaya of Siva, Rikai Pikatan on the last sovereign Sailendra of Central Java. Take your time to enjoy each carving on the rocks and feel the spirituality that each of the stones perched in this set of more than 200 Hindu temples that are dedicated to the Trimurti, the expression of God as the Creator, the Preserver and the Destroyer. After this unforgettable day, we will take you to your hotel. D4 Transfer out Yogyakarta International airport: Today our adventure ends at the cradle of Indonesian culture. Depending on the time of your flight, we will pick you up to take you to the airport and take the flight to your next destination. End of our services. Thank you very much for exploring Yogyakarta by the hand of Come2indonesia.',NULL,'Flights schedule at YIA : ETA : 12.10 by Batik Air ID6344 from Jakarta on 02 June 2024 ETD : 13.05 by Air Asia QZ601 to Denpasar on 05 June 2024','{\"date\": \"2024-06-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5126161,'408','Jorge Mario Ferrer',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-05','2024-06-05','Guio','Komang',6,'Persons (4-6)',4704000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-05\", \"text\": \"ETA : 15.30 byAir Asia QZ601 from Yogyakarta on 05 June 2024\", \"time\": \"15:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai Airport Denpasar\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-05\", \"text\": \"Komaneka Bisma Ubud Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 971933\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5126180,'408','Jorge Mario Ferrer',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Templo Kehen – Pengelipuran – Cascada Tukad Cepung )','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-06','2024-06-06','Guio','Komang',6,'Person (1)',4032000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-06\", \"text\": \"Komaneka Bisma Ubud Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 971933\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-06\", \"text\": \"Komaneka Bisma Ubud Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 971933\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5126187,'408','Jorge Mario Ferrer',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Taman Ayun-Jati Luwih-Bedugul-Tanah Lot)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-07','2024-06-07','Guio','Komang',6,'Person (1)',0.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-07\", \"text\": \"Komaneka Bisma Ubud Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 971933\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-07\", \"text\": \"Komaneka Bisma Ubud Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 971933\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5126222,'408','Jorge Mario Ferrer',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Melukat (proceso de Purification) - Ofrendas – Cascada)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-08','2024-06-08','Guio','Komang',6,'Person (1)',0.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-08\", \"text\": \"Komaneka Bisma Ubud Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 971933\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-08\", \"text\": \"Komaneka Bisma Ubud Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 971933\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5126244,'408','Jorge Mario Ferrer',30508,207262,'Ubud to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-09','2024-06-09','Guio','Komang',6,'Persons (4-6)',4704000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'Please ready on hotel Lobby for pickup at 06.00AM','{\"date\": \"2024-06-09\", \"text\": \"Komaneka Bisma Ubud Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 971933\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-09\", \"text\": \"ETD : 10.00 by Wings Air IW1850 to Lombok on 09 June 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai Airport Denpasar\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5126250,'408','Jorge Mario Ferrer',32147,212187,'Beach Front Villa with Private Pool','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-06-09','2024-06-12','Guio','Komang',3,'Double',34272000.00,'At 205 sqm, overlooking the spectacular views of the Great Lombok Strait, Gili Trawangan island and the coconut trees garden, each room has a connecting between private pool villa. All villa has a comfortable a couple lounge chair with a coffee Table at the terrace. This room have a pool size 3.6m x 6m with wooden pool deck.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5126260,'408','Jorge Mario Ferrer',30728,207488,'Ngonong / Three Gilis Tour','Confirmed','EXC 07',1,'2024-06-10','2024-06-10','Guio','Komang',6,'Persons (6-9)',6632640.00,'This tour is specially designed for those who wish to feel and enjoy the underwater world of Lombok. Your tour guide will take you across the mainland by outrigger boat to the harbor towards Gili Trawangan, Gili Meno and Gili Air waters area. Experience amazing snorkeling among hundreds of tropical fish and beautiful coral. A delicious lunch will be provided at one of local restaurants in the gili island and get busy with tropical island life such as cycling, swimming, sunbathing or even just free at your own leisure. On the way back to your hotel, you may stop by at Malimbu hill for picture taking.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-10\", \"text\": \"The Kayana Beach Lombok\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Senggigi\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-10\", \"text\": \"The Kayana Beach Lombok Jl. Raya Senggigi, Malaka, Kec. Pemenang, Kabupaten Lombok Utara, Nusa Tenggara Bar. 83355\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5126266,'408','Jorge Mario Ferrer',30728,207493,'Bumi Gora / Kuta Tour','Confirmed','EXC 03',1,'2024-06-11','2024-06-11','Guio','Komang',6,'Persons (6-9)',4448640.00,'This tour takes you first to the Pottery Village of Banyumulek. Observe how the local women produce pottery stuffs. Then, visit Sukarare village; renowned for its traditional hand weaving of brightly patterned “songket”, “ikat” and “sarong” cloths. We will observe how the regenerate of weaving tradition goes on in the village. Girl, mother and grandmother even great grandmother do weaving activity together in the village. Next the tour continues to Ende village, featuring the unique traditional houses with its buffalo dung floors. Lunch is served at one of local restaurants in New Kuta Mandalika area. Then, we visit the beautiful beach of Tanjung A’an, one of the most scenic and un-spoilt beaches in this part of Lombok. We may have chance to trek Merese Hills to enjoy magnificent panorama of Indian Ocean.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-11\", \"text\": \"The Kayana Beach Lombok Jl. Raya Senggigi, Malaka, Kec. Pemenang, Kabupaten Lombok Utara, Nusa Tenggara Bar. 83355\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Senggigi\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-11\", \"text\": \"The Kayana Beach Lombok Jl. Raya Senggigi, Malaka, Kec. Pemenang, Kabupaten Lombok Utara, Nusa Tenggara Bar. 83355\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5126274,'408','Jorge Mario Ferrer',30711,200830,'Bisma Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-06-05','2024-06-09','Guio','Komang',3,'Double',37699200.00,'Spacious one-bedroom suite of 88 sqm with private balcony for a sophisticated Ubud getaway. Interiors feature extensive use of wood and fine Indonesian textiles and art, lending an understated elegance to the space. Featuring a private balcony, this room includes a flat-screen TV and an en-suite bathroom with a bathtub and a shower, and many more.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5126304,'408','Jorge Mario Ferrer',30508,212289,'Airport to Nusa Dua','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-12','2024-06-12','Guio','Komang',6,'Persons (4-6)',4032000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-12\", \"text\": \"ETA : 11.50 by Wings Air IW1851 from Lombok\", \"time\": \"11:50\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai Airport Denpasar (Domestic)\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-12\", \"text\": \"Merusaka Nusa Dua Kawasan Wisata Nusa Dua Lot S-3, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80363\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Dua\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5126340,'408','Jorge Mario Ferrer',30508,207268,'Nusa Dua to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-16','2024-06-16','Guio','Komang',6,'Persons (4-6)',4032000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'Please ready on Lobby hotel for pickup at 06.00AM','{\"date\": \"2024-06-16\", \"text\": \"Merusaka Nusa Dua Kawasan Wisata Nusa Dua Lot S-3, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80363\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Dua\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-16\", \"text\": \"ETD : 09.55 by Qatar Airways QR965 to DOHA on 16 June 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"International Ngurah Rai Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5126495,'410','SYLVESTRE Beatrice',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-30','2024-12-01','Ayu','Ayu',3,'Double',2352000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 18:00. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK–IN','{\"date\": \"2024-11-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5126648,'98','Simon Camenzuli',30627,200604,'River Edge Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-06-21','2024-06-25','Ayu','Febrina',1,'Double',21215040.00,'Our Pool Villas are designed in contemporary Balinese style using local stone, bamboo, white washed furniture decorated with woven rattan to blend with nature and create classic yet romantic impression. Featuring bamboo ceiling, comfortable bed with soft cotton linens and mosquito net, classic Balinese Kamasan Ramayana series painting and recycled arts work. Private balcony or terrace and spacious bath with shower and Kayon signature terrazzo bath tub overlook to jungles. Five Luxury Pool Villas hanging along the river edge, surrounded with fascinating ravine and waterfalls, take full advantage of the peace, tranquility of the surroundings. Enjoying the river flowing between the rocks while soak in the infinity pool creates a romantic and blissful feeling.',NULL,'Honeymooners','{\"date\": \"2024-06-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5127609,'412','MR. LUIS ALVARO GARCIA DALFO',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-04','2024-06-05','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',784000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. - Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK–IN FILIGHT: ETA 21:35 BY QR954 FROM DOHA ON 4 JUNE 2024 ETD 06:00 BY ID6202 TO PANGKALAN BUN ON 5 JUNE 2024','{\"date\": \"2024-06-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5127613,'412','MR. LUIS ALVARO GARCIA DALFO',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-06-05','2024-06-07','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',10080000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan isCape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continueto add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board. FLIGHT: ETA 07:15 BY ID6202 FROM JAKARTA ON 5 JUNE 2024 ETD 07:30 BY IN195 TO SEMARANG ON 7 JUNE 2024','{\"date\": \"2024-06-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5127624,'412','MR. LUIS ALVARO GARCIA DALFO',30783,214611,'3D2N Semarang - Yogyakarta / C. Adhisthana*3 (Superior Room)','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-06-07','2024-06-09','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (2 / Double)',3780000.00,'D1 : Arrival at Semarang Airport - Borobudur Temple tour incl. Mendut and Pawon - Transfer to Jogja Welcome to the cradle of Indonesian culture, Yogyakarta. A tourist destination for its ancient palaces, temples, batik workshops, gamelan music orchestras, court dances and wayang puppet shows. Upon your arrival in Semarang airport a representative of come2indonesia will be waiting for you with a sign indicating your name to start exploring this special city. We will start by heading towards Borobudur Temple (Candi Borobudur), the great Stupa, the largest Buddhist monument in the world and one of the seven wonders. We will tour around the temple, observe the hundreds and centenary statues of Buddha and witness how dozens of Buddhists come to preach from all over the world. Historically it was established during the relatively brief Sailendra dynasty of Central Java between 778 and 856 BC and is in constant restoration due to the breaks that the tremors of the neighbouring Merapi volcano has been producing during its history. After visiting one of the most important Buddhist temples in Southeast Asia, we continue our journey to the Mendut temple and Pawon temple. And then, we will take you to Jogjakarta. D2 : Jogjakarta City Tour visit Sultan Palace, Watercastle and Bird Market - Visit Prambanan Temple You will enjoy a well-deserved breakfast at the hotel and we will start by heading towards Keraton known as the Sultan’s Palace. The palace is a complex building two centuries old, located in the heart of the city. You will hear the song of the “freedom” of the birds in the bird market, we will visit the “Water Castle” that occupies the highest part at the northern end of the vast complex of Taman Sari, Malioboro Street, main street of Yogyakarta, with its merchants, horse carriages, taxi-bikes and markets. After this visit we go to Candi Prambanan, the temple of the Hinduists and classified as a World Heritage Site by Unesco since 1991. The built of this temple was finished around the year 856 to commemorate the victory of the descendant Sanjaya of Siva, Rikai Pikatan on the last sovereign Sailendra of Central Java. Take your time to enjoy each carving on the rocks and feel the spirituality that each of the stones perched in this set of more than 200 Hindu temples that are dedicated to the Trimurti, the expression of God as the Creator, the Preserver and the destroyer. An incredible experience that will make the hours fly by. After this unforgettable day, we will take you back to your hotel. D3 : Transfer to Yogyakarta International Airport You will enjoy a well-deserved breakfast at the hotel and according to the time of your flight, we will pick you up to take you to the airport and take the flight to your next destination. End of our services. Thank you very much for exploring Yogyakarta by the hand of Come2indonesia.',NULL,'Flight schedule in Semarang : ETA 08:40 BY IN195 FROM PANGKALAN BUN ON 7 JUNE 2024 flight schedule in YIA : ETD 11:40 BY JT3566 TO DENPASAR ON 9 JUNE 2024','{\"date\": \"2024-06-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5127636,'412','MR. LUIS ALVARO GARCIA DALFO',30708,200935,'UMA KANGIN Mansion (Junior Suite Room)','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-06-09','2024-06-13','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',5174400.00,'At 60 square meters, One Bedroom with no private pool but there is a comfortable public pool available. The concept of Mansion is building with 4th floor’s which each floor consist of few rooms, it’s facing to small river orrice field and bamboo tree.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5127654,'412','MR. LUIS ALVARO GARCIA DALFO',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-09','2024-06-09','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',784000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-09\", \"text\": \"ETA 14:05 BY JT3566 FROM YOGYAKARTA ON 9 JUNE 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"NGURAH RAI INTERNATIONAL AIRPORT\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-09\", \"text\": \"KAJANE YANGLONI Jl. Cok Rai Pudak No.10, Peliatan, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"UBUD\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5127675,'412','MR. LUIS ALVARO GARCIA DALFO',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-10','2024-06-10','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',1747200.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.','1D Tour Fantastica (Taman Ayun-Jati Luwih-Bedugul-Tanah lot)',NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-10\", \"text\": \"KAJANE YANGLONI Jl. Cok Rai Pudak No.10, Peliatan, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"UBUD\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-10\", \"text\": \"KAJANE YANGLONI Jl. Cok Rai Pudak No.10, Peliatan, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"UBUD\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5127694,'413','Isabel Mercado Jaén',30571,202567,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-03','2024-07-04','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',1372000.00,'Located at the Second Floor, 35 sqm comfort living with a touch of Balinese style featuring completed fitting, Cable TV, a fancy bathroom comprises rain shower and good quality amenities. Also dedicated Wi-Fi Access to complete your day.',NULL,'Flight Schedule Arrival on 03 July : ETA : 23.10 by Qatar Airways QR960 from Doha on 03 July 2024 The guest is Honeymooner','{\"date\": \"2024-07-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5127706,'412','MR. LUIS ALVARO GARCIA DALFO',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Custom Itinerary)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-11','2024-06-11','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',1568000.00,NULL,'1D Tour (Kehen Temple-Pengelipuran-Kintamani)','1D Tour (Kehen Temple-Pengelipuran-Kintamani)','{\"date\": \"2024-06-11\", \"text\": \"KAJANE YANGLONI Jl. Cok Rai Pudak No.10, Peliatan, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"UBUD\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-11\", \"text\": \"KAJANE YANGLONI Jl. Cok Rai Pudak No.10, Peliatan, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"UBUD\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5127734,'414','Vik Mohan',30508,212287,'Airport to Sanur','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-19','2024-05-19','Yuli','Febrina',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'Transfer Airport - Sanur Flight detail: ETA 22:45 by Airasia QZ557 from Kuala Lumpur on 19 May','{\"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Prime Plaza Hotel & Suite Sanur\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5127739,'414','Vik Mohan',30508,207269,'Sanur to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-23','2024-05-23','Yuli','Febrina',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'Transfer Sanur - Airport Flight detail: TBA','{\"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Prime Plaza Hotel & Suite Sanur\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5127744,'414','Vik Mohan',32832,217158,'Pool Access Room','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-05-19','2024-05-23','Yuli','Febrina',1,'Double',5443200.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5127761,'413','Isabel Mercado Jaén',32145,212183,'Standard Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-04','2024-07-05','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',1176000.00,'At Lesong Hotel, we offer the perfect blend of comfort and serenity with our double or twin bed with garden view and rice field view rooms. Each room provides a peaceful oasis for our guests, complete with breathtaking views of the surrounding tropical gardens and lush green rice fields. Enjoy the cool mountain breeze as you unwind and relax in the comfort of your twin bed. Our rooms are designed to ensure that you feel right at home. We also have safety deposit box, toilet, sofa, bathtub or shower, hardwood or parquet floors, towels, linens, desk sitting area, mosquito net, hairdryer, fan, electric kettle, wardrobe or closet clothes rack, toilet paper, board games/puzzles, hand sanitizer, air purifiers, yoga met, hot water.',NULL,'The Guest is HONEYMOONER','{\"date\": \"2024-07-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5127765,'412','MR. LUIS ALVARO GARCIA DALFO',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-06-12','2024-06-12','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',952000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-12\", \"text\": \"ETA 08:20 BY THE ANGKAL FAST BOAT FROM KUSAMBA ON 12 JUNE\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"SAMPALAN PORT\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-12\", \"text\": \"ETD 16:00 BY THE ANGKAL FAST BOAT TO KUSAMBA ON 12 JUNE\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"SAMPALAN PORT\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5127775,'413','Isabel Mercado Jaén',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Trekking of Twin Lake Munduk - Ulun Danu - Banyumala Waterfall)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-05','2024-07-05','Guio','Komang',2,'Person (1)',2128000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-05\", \"text\": \"Lesong Hotel Gesing, Kec. Banjar, Kabupaten Buleleng, Bali 81161\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Munduk\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-05\", \"text\": \"Wapa Diume Ubud Jl. Suweta Banjar Bentuyung Ubud, Ubud, Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 973178\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5127790,'413','Isabel Mercado Jaén',30778,201426,'1 Bedroom Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-07-05','2024-07-08','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',10886400.00,'A private individually villa overlooking to rice fields or private natural garden view. A one storey with pool that has a king size bed. The bath room features a sunken bath and the balcony. The villas offers wonderful views of the surrounding countryside ensconced in complete luxury. Complete with daybeds and cushions for luxurious lounging, the villas also offer the wonderful furnishings and bathing facilities that come as standard at this boutique resort. An escape from the world, by reconnecting to it.',NULL,'The guest is Honeymooner','{\"date\": \"2024-07-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5127827,'413','Isabel Mercado Jaén',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour ( Lempuyang Tirta Gangga Taman Sukasada Ujung Virgin Beach)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-07','2024-07-07','Guio','Komang',2,'Person (1)',0.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-07\", \"text\": \"Wapa Diume Ubud Jl. Suweta Banjar Bentuyung Ubud, Ubud, Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 973178\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-07\", \"text\": \"Wapa Diume Ubud Jl. Suweta Banjar Bentuyung Ubud, Ubud, Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 973178\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5127840,'413','Isabel Mercado Jaén',30508,213032,'Ubud to Kusamba','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-08','2024-07-08','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (1-3)',784000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-08\", \"text\": \"Wapa Diume Ubud Jl. Suweta Banjar Bentuyung Ubud, Ubud, Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 973178\", \"time\": \"09:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-08\", \"text\": \"ETD : 11.45 by The Angkal Fasboat from Kusamba to Nusa Penida\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kusamba harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5127841,'412','MR. LUIS ALVARO GARCIA DALFO',30508,207379,'Ubud to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-13','2024-06-13','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (2)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-13\", \"text\": \"KAJANE YANGLONI Jl. Cok Rai Pudak No.10, Peliatan, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"UBUD\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-13\", \"text\": \"ETD 08:30 BY GILI GILI FAST BOAT\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"PADANG BAI PORT\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5127854,'412','MR. LUIS ALVARO GARCIA DALFO',30852,202033,'Villa Surya - One Bedroom Private Pool and Tropical Garden','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-06-13','2024-06-16','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',10080000.00,'Our cozy one bed Villa Surya is perfect for a solo traveler or a romantic getaway at 150 sqm private property. The spacious bedroom features a king-size bed with an extra thick mattress with 100% cotton linen, ensuring a blissful sleep. With high-ceilings, large windows, and a pivoting door onto your patio, the space is able to breathe whilst being basked in a beautiful, natural light. The ensuite bathroom, equipped with a bespoke basin area, rainfall shower, quality toiletries and 100% cotton towels leads out to the real star of this villa, the indulgent open-air bathtub. Large enough for two, with views of your private pool and tropical garden, while away hours in pure relaxation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5127861,'413','Isabel Mercado Jaén',31040,203404,'Ocean View Bungalow Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-07-08','2024-07-10','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',2128000.00,'Room size: 55 sqm. The ocean view bungalow room has 13 units available. The rooms at this Nusa Penida hotel provide guests with high-velocity internet and a flat-screen TV with satellite channels, and comforts such as ironing facilities and air conditioning. The units are designed in a comfortable manner. Offering amenities like hair dryers and bathrobes, the bathrooms also include a walk-in shower, a separate toilet and a sink.',NULL,'The guest is Honeymooner Please consult for transfer out to harbour on 10 July upon check-in','{\"date\": \"2024-07-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5127862,'415','Alejandra Martinez',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-02','2024-06-03','Nicholas','Febrina',1,'Double',840000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Return Airport Transfer Flight details: ETA 18:05 by KL809 from Kuala Lumpur on 02 June ETD 06:00 by Batik Air ID6202 to Pangkalan Bun on 03 June Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. - Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK–IN','{\"date\": \"2024-06-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5127863,'412','MR. LUIS ALVARO GARCIA DALFO',30661,203865,'Deluxe Pool Suite','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-06-16','2024-06-18','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',3366000.00,'Would you love a quiet and peaceful spot to come home to after a day of exploring the surroundings? Then booking one of our pool side suites is the perfect choice for you. Each of these rooms can be made up as a double, twin or triple room so it can host up to three people to indulge in blissful serenity. You’ll be right by the swimming pool for a refreshing dip or to simply relax overlooking the beautiful gardens. The koi fish and guinea fowl will make sure to entertain you while you sit back and our restaurant staff is only a phone call away for room service if you are craving for something delicious to complete your day in paradise. Your Jivana experience will surely make you look back on your holiday with a smile on your face.',NULL,'The original voucher issued by travel agent must back up guest check in. The voucher should clearly specify all instructions and required services.','{\"date\": \"2024-06-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5127873,'415','Alejandra Martinez',30783,213061,'Transfer from Semarang Airport to Yogyakarta Hotel','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-05','2024-06-05','Nicholas','Febrina',1,'Per Car',960000.00,NULL,NULL,'Transfer Semarang Airport - Yogyakarta Flight detail: ETA 11:25 by Batik Air ID6303 from Pangkalan Bun on 05 June','{\"date\": \"2024-06-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Semarang Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-05\", \"text\": \"Timuran Jl. Parangtritis No.103, Brontokusuman, Kec. Mergangsan, Yogyakarta, Daerah Istimewa Yogyakarta 55153 Phone: +62274 373482\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Duta Boutique Villa\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5127879,'415','Alejandra Martinez',30806,208758,'3D2N Shared Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO8',3,'2024-06-03','2024-06-05','Nicholas','Febrina',2,'Person (1)',7840000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.00 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you canhave your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan is Cape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even see crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Shared Klotok Boat *The SHARED klotok will be ready by 10.30 AM and will depart at 12.00 PM sharp. Check-in time: Klotok at 10.30 AM, check-out time: 08.00 AM *If you arrive at the port before 12 PM, you may walk around the area of the port by yourself. Alternatively, when the boat is ready, you can also wait for the other travelers on the boat. Note: The guide may not assist you during the waiting time. *All participants should arrive at the latest 10.30 AM at Pangkalanbun Airport. If you arrive late, you must take the speedboat to join the klotok. The speedboat costs around IDR 600.000/boat/way to be paid directly to the captain. Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continue to add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Shared Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-06-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5127882,'415','Alejandra Martinez',30805,202689,'CGK-PKN','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-03','2024-06-03','Nicholas','Febrina',2,'Person',3520000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5127968,'413','Isabel Mercado Jaén',30649,204187,'One Bedroom Pool Lagoon','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-07-10','2024-07-13','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',4200000.00,'This room is perfect for travelers or business people! With a room area of ​​25m2 and equipped with a double / single bed, air conditioning controller, LED TV and high speed internet access. This modern designed bathroom is also equipped with a shower and toiletries to complete your needs during your stay at our hotel.',NULL,'The guest is Honeymooner','{\"date\": \"2024-07-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5128015,'413','Isabel Mercado Jaén',30661,203865,'Deluxe Pool Suite','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-07-13','2024-07-15','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',3769920.00,'Would you love a quiet and peaceful spot to come home to after a day of exploring the surroundings? Then booking one of our pool side suites is the perfect choice for you. Each of these rooms can be made up as a double, twin or triple room so it can host up to three people to indulge in blissful serenity. You’ll be right by the swimming pool for a refreshing dip or to simply relax overlooking the beautiful gardens. The koi fish and guinea fowl will make sure to entertain you while you sit back and our restaurant staff is only a phone call away for room service if you are craving for something delicious to complete your day in paradise. Your Jivana experience will surely make you look back on your holiday with a smile on your face.',NULL,'The original voucher issued by travel agent must back up guest check in. The voucher should clearly specify all instructions and required services. The guest is Honeymooner','{\"date\": \"2024-07-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5128120,'416','Henry De Broux',30680,200912,'3 unit Superior Room (1 Single room/ 1 Double room/ 1Twin room)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-23','2024-05-24',NULL,'Komang',3,'2 Double + 1 Twin',2520000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. - Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. Name list of room : SGL: Henry De Broux DBL: Marianne Smellinckx / Thierry Degrauwe Twin: Stefanie Klerks / Harry Klerks PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK–IN','{\"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5128217,'412','MR. LUIS ALVARO GARCIA DALFO',30508,213032,'Ubud to Kusamba','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-12','2024-06-12','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',784000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.','Pick Up time 06.00 ETD 08:00 by The Angkal Fast Boat',NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-12\", \"text\": \"KAJANE YANGLONI Jl. Cok Rai Pudak No.10, Peliatan, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"UBUD\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-12\", \"text\": \"ETD 08:00 BY THE ANGKAL FAST BOAT\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"KUSAMBA PORT\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5129396,'417','Mrs. Diana Rollan Gonzalez',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-19','2024-06-19','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-19\", \"text\": \"ETA 16.55 by Iberia IB7968 from Doha on 19 Jun 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-19\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Bisma\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5129401,'417','Mrs. Diana Rollan Gonzalez',30711,200830,'Bisma Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-06-19','2024-06-23','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',14784000.00,'Spacious one-bedroom suite of 88 sqm with private balcony for a sophisticated Ubud getaway. Interiors feature extensive use of wood and fine Indonesian textiles and art, lending an understated elegance to the space. Featuring a private balcony, this room includes a flat-screen TV and an en-suite bathroom with a bathtub and a shower, and many more.',NULL,'Honeymooners','{\"date\": \"2024-06-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5129403,'417','Mrs. Diana Rollan Gonzalez',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-21','2024-06-21','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1747200.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Bisma\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5129433,'417','Mrs. Diana Rollan Gonzalez',30508,213032,'Ubud to Kusamba','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-23','2024-06-23','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-23\", \"text\": \"ETD 08.00 to Nusa Penida by The Angkal Fast Boat\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Bisma\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5129439,'417','Mrs. Diana Rollan Gonzalez',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-06-23','2024-06-23','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',952000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-23\", \"text\": \"ETA 08.30 from Kusamba by The Angkal Fast Boat\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sampalan Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-23\", \"text\": \"Sakti, Nusa Penida, Klungkung Regency, Bali 80771\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Māua Nusa Penida\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5129445,'417','Mrs. Diana Rollan Gonzalez',30582,203387,'One Bedroom Luxury Villas','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-06-23','2024-06-25','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',6988800.00,'Each One Bedroom Luxury Villa is designed with a private infinity pool, scenic view across the Gamat Bay or garden view, and some have a small private garden. Every villas features the following: An integrated universal power outlet, Room safe (suitable for storing laptops), Cable TV with international news and movie channels, Eco-friendly bathroom amenities, Coffee and tea-making facilities.',NULL,'Honeymooners','{\"date\": \"2024-06-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5129452,'417','Mrs. Diana Rollan Gonzalez',30508,207337,'Snorkeling to Nusa Penida (from Nusa Penida) (Sharing Trip)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-24','2024-06-24','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1232000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-24\", \"text\": \"Sakti, Nusa Penida, Klungkung Regency, Bali 80771\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Māua Nusa Penida\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5129471,'417','Mrs. Diana Rollan Gonzalez',30563,216168,'Maua Nusa Penida - Nusa Penida Harbour','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-25','2024-06-25','Guio','Tami',1,'Per Car',375200.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-25\", \"text\": \"Sakti, Nusa Penida, Klungkung Regency, Bali 80771\", \"time\": \"07:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Māua Nusa Penida\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5129512,'417','Mrs. Diana Rollan Gonzalez',30852,202033,'Villa Surya - One Bedroom Private Pool and Tropical Garden','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-06-25','2024-06-29','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',12544000.00,'Our cozy one bed Villa Surya is perfect for a solo traveler or a romantic getaway at 150 sqm private property. The spacious bedroom features a king-size bed with an extra thick mattress with 100% cotton linen, ensuring a blissful sleep. With high-ceilings, large windows, and a pivoting door onto your patio, the space is able to breathe whilst being basked in a beautiful, natural light. The ensuite bathroom, equipped with a bespoke basin area, rainfall shower, quality toiletries and 100% cotton towels leads out to the real star of this villa, the indulgent open-air bathtub. Large enough for two, with views of your private pool and tropical garden, while away hours in pure relaxation.',NULL,'Honeymooners','{\"date\": \"2024-06-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5129524,'417','Mrs. Diana Rollan Gonzalez',30508,207386,'Padang Bai to Seminyak','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-29','2024-06-29','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-29\", \"text\": \"ETA 13.55 from Gili Air by Bluewater Express\", \"time\": \"13:55\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-29\", \"text\": \"Jl. Kayu Aya, Pantai Seminyak, Kuta, Seminyak, Kec. Kuta, Kabupaten Badung, Bali\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Seminyak Beach Resort & Spa\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5129528,'417','Mrs. Diana Rollan Gonzalez',30606,203160,'Beach Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-29','2024-06-30','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',4401600.00,'The Beach Room are a stylish, sleek and serene addition to our hotel on Seminyak Beach. Witness a marriage of contemporary design and Balinese tradition, complete with yielding beds, sunny balconies and lavish en-suite bathrooms with indulgent soaking tubs and powerful rain showers. Hand-carved wooden accents are offset by warm-toned furnishings and fabrics that span the spectrum from burgundy via espresso to cappuccino.',NULL,'Honeymooners','{\"date\": \"2024-06-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5129531,'417','Mrs. Diana Rollan Gonzalez',30508,207270,'Seminyak to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-30','2024-06-30','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-30\", \"text\": \"Jl. Kayu Aya, Pantai Seminyak, Kuta, Seminyak, Kec. Kuta, Kabupaten Badung, Bali\", \"time\": \"14:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Seminyak Beach Resort & Spa\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-30\", \"text\": \"ETD 19.10 by Iberia IB7979 to Doha on 30 Jun 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5129601,'395','Mrs. Clara Puy Rodellar',30508,207262,'Ubud to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-19','2024-06-19','Jacob','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-19\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Tegallalang, Banjar Sapat, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali\", \"time\": \"04:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Tejaprana Resort & Spa\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-19\", \"text\": \"ETD 07.10 by Air Asia QZ644 to Labuan Bajo\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5129665,'395','Mrs. Clara Puy Rodellar',31083,212380,'3D2N LOB Rinca - Padar - Komodo Island Tour (Medium Standard B. - La Cecile)','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-06-19','2024-06-21','Jacob','Tami',2,'Persons (2-3)',24046400.00,'TOUR ITINERARY Highlights: Menjarite, Kelor, Kalong, Rinca, Padar, Komodo island, Pink Beach, Taka Makassar, Manta Point, Kanawa, Batu Cermin Mirror Cave DAY 1 : DENPASAR - LABUAN BAJO - MENJARITE - PADAR - KELOR - KALONG ISLAND Arrival at Komodo Airport in Labuan Bajo west Flores, meeting service with our tour guide and transfer to the pier of Labuan Bajo for Rinca Island. It’s about 2 hours sail to the island of Komodo Dragon, stop at Menjarite island for snorkeling then continue to Rinca island-the Island of Komodo dragon, you will find not just e Dragons but also many wild animals like, deer, wild buffalo, long-tailed macaque and wild pig also numerous of birds. Keep your eyes look up as sometime you will find the young Komodo dragons on the trees. A local ranger will lead you through this natural preservation. Late afternoon sailing directly to Kalong Rinca Island to see the hundreds of fling foxes set out from the mangrove tree at 06-07 pm, the lovely sunset from the boat trip really enjoyable here. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Boat Cabin Air Conditioning DAY 2 : KALONG - PADAR - KOMODO - PINK BEACH - MANTA POINT - TAKA MAKASSAR - LABUAN BAJO After having breakfast in your boat, heading to Padar Island, taking trek to Padar Island until having the top view point to get breathtaking scenery of three bays around, Padar Island hike in Komodo has some of the most amazing views in Indonesia, trek to downhill and back to the Boat for sailing directly to Loh Liang – the Ranger station in Komodo Island. By passing through many small islands, After registering start to take basic trekking to see the GIANT RIZARD / KOMODO DRAGON and other wild animals as: Timor deer, wild pig, wild chicken and many variously of tropical bird. Please keep your look at any directions as sometimes you will also find young Komodo dragon hanging over the trees. A local ranger will be led you during the trek. Return to the boat on to Pink beach for snorkeling, swimming and relaxing. It is really spectacular and unspoiled coral reef and many color fish. This is one of best side for snorkeling diving. Sail toward MANTA POINT to exploring Huge Mantas by snorkeling even watching from your boat trip (can’t be guaranteed if weather is not good, like wave and current are strongly) visit also the taka Makaasar its really tiny island with white sand beach really enjoyable to relaxing or beach walking then heading to Labuan bajo for overnight and dinner at above hotel list option. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner DAY 3 : LABUAN BAJO - DENPASAR After breakfast taking your next excursion with visiting local marke and Batu Cermin (Mirror Stone) Cave. The grotto is 75 by 75 meters large, and contains stalactites and stalagmites. Some tunnels are narrow and dark but in others sunlight falls, then process to the airport for flight to Denpasar or to your next destination. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch Attention: The itinerary is subject to change due to the weather, tide level and operating conditions without prior notice.',NULL,'Honeymooners','{\"date\": \"2024-06-19\", \"text\": \"ETA 08.20 by Air Asia QZ644 from Denpasar on 19 June\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komodo International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-21\", \"text\": \"ETD 09.50 by Batik Air ID6332 to Denpasar on 21 June\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5129683,'395','Mrs. Clara Puy Rodellar',30508,214239,'Airport to Uluwatu','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-21','2024-06-21','Jacob','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-21\", \"text\": \"ETA 11.05 by Batik Air ID6332 from Labuan Bajo on 21 June 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-21\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bangbang Metuug, Pecatu, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Green Escape - Eco Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5129685,'395','Mrs. Clara Puy Rodellar',30930,202592,'One Bedroom Bungalow','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-06-21','2024-06-24','Jacob','Tami',1,'Double',8064000.00,'Room size : 37 sqm. Our One-Bedroom Bungalow is a unique Romantic Eco-Boho Bungalow nestles in Green Escape Resort. You will stay in a sumptuous air-conditioned bungalow that has been handcrafted using recycled wood and tastefully decorated to offer you an authentic Balinese getaway. It\'s the very epitome of a tranquil escape. This Bungalow offers a deluxe king-size bed and a daybed to relax. It offers a comfy mattress, as we know the benefits of a good night’s sleep. The semi-outdoor bathroom with a rain shower will help you revive yourself. Enjoy the comfy sofa on your private terrace which opens onto the exotic garden & pool. The daybed can be used to extend the sleeping capacity of your private bungalow.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5129687,'395','Mrs. Clara Puy Rodellar',30508,212545,'Uluwatu to Sanur','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-24','2024-06-24','Jacob','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-24\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bangbang Metuug, Pecatu, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali\", \"time\": \"05:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Green Escape - Eco Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-24\", \"text\": \"ETD 07.30 to Nusa Penida by Maruti Fast Boat on 24 Jun\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sanur Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5129700,'395','Mrs. Clara Puy Rodellar',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-06-24','2024-06-24','Jacob','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',952000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-24\", \"text\": \"ETA 08.00 from Sanur by Maruti Fast Boat\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Toya Pakeh Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-24\", \"text\": \"ETD 16.00 to Kusamba Harbour by The Angkal Fast Boat\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sampalan Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5129708,'395','Mrs. Clara Puy Rodellar',30508,207384,'Kusamba - Candidasa','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-24','2024-06-24','Jacob','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-24\", \"text\": \"ETA 16.30 from Nusa Penida by The Angkal Fast Boat\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kusamba Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-24\", \"text\": \"Pantai Mendira, Banjar Mendira, Desa Sengkidu, Manggis, Sengkidu, Karangasem\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sea Breeze Candidasa\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5129792,'395','Mrs. Clara Puy Rodellar',30643,217179,'Superior Sea View From Terrace','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-24','2024-06-25','Jacob','Tami',1,'Double',1159200.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5129798,'395','Mrs. Clara Puy Rodellar',30508,202895,'Lahangan Sweet – Tirta Gangga – Virgin Beach','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-25','2024-06-25','Jacob','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',2128000.00,'In this part of the trip, we set off along the East Coast of the island. The first site visit will be the Kusamba Village, a fishing village where colorful Prahu in the black sand beaches. We will announce the salt making process by traditional method. We continue our journey on the east coast to reach Goa Lawah, Gua Lawah or Bat Cave is one of favorite places of interest in Bali and it is located near of hilly bank so it is called reef of Middle hill. We continue our trip to Tenganan Village, Tenganan Village is one of the oldest Balinese Traditional located in Karangasem Regency, east part of Bali. This village is much referred by cultural literature science of Tenganan Pegringsingan, which is very famous in the island. It owns very unique local community life pattern which is one example of Bali Aga Village cultures (Hindu Prehistoric) and different with other countryside in plain of Bali. From here, we go to Amlapura to visit the Royal Palace, The town of Amlapura is the capital of Karangasem (\'East Bali\'). The palace of the former kings of the region is located here, and their descendants have opened parts of the complex to the public. We will finish our trip with visit heaven of Tirta Gangga, Tirta Gangga is a beautiful park with the huge water fountain. At the end of tour we will transfer you back to the hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-25\", \"text\": \"Pantai Mendira, Banjar Mendira, Desa Sengkidu, Manggis, Sengkidu, Karangasem\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sea Breeze Candidasa\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-25\", \"text\": \"Jl. Kayu Aya, Pantai Seminyak, Kuta, Seminyak, Kec. Kuta, Kabupaten Badung, Bali\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Seminyak Beach Resort & Spa\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34'