Rice Field View','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-06','2024-06-07','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',1062880.00,'Total 5 Luxury traditional Rice Fields view villas in Balinese village style, the suite contains an large spacious bathroom and each bathroom has different size, complete with hot and cold shower. Adjoining is a spacious bedroom and living room with complete seating table, mini bar, private coding safety deposit box, large cupboard and satellite TV. Each villa has large verandah with outstanding Rice Fields view where guest can seat and relax or even day dreaming.',NULL,'The guest is Honeymooner','{\"date\": \"2024-06-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5130232,'418','Nuria Perez Gusman',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Trekking Belimbing - Hot Spring Banjar - Budhis Temple)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-07','2024-06-07','Guio','Komang',2,'Person (1)',2128000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-07\", \"text\": \"Cempaka Belimbing Villa Jalan Raya Belimbing, Banjar Suradadi, Belimbing Village, Pupuan, Belimbing, Tabanan, Tabanan Regency, Bali 82163 Telepon: 0851-0045-1178\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pupuan\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-07\", \"text\": \"Puri Bagus Lovina Jl. Seririt- Singaraja No.Desa, Pemaron, Lovina, Kabupaten Buleleng, Bali 81151 Telepon: (0362) 21430\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Lovina\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5130240,'418','Nuria Perez Gusman',30891,202320,'Superior Garden Villa','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-07','2024-06-08','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',1624000.00,'The room is 25 meters square plus a wide verandah complete with balcony chairs and surrounded by a manicured garden. There are several units with connecting doors, perfectly suited for the family. The room size 47 m2 consist of bedroom, bathroom and wide verandah. Bedding setup (double bed : 2,2m x 1,8m) or (twin bed : 2,2m x 1,28m). En suite bathroom with overhead hot & cold rain shower, vanity unit, toilet , bathub and bathroom amenities.',NULL,'The Guest is Honeymooner','{\"date\": \"2024-06-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5130247,'418','Nuria Perez Gusman',30891,202320,'Superior Garden Villa','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-06-07','2024-06-09','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',3248000.00,'The room is 25 meters square plus a wide verandah complete with balcony chairs and surrounded by a manicured garden. There are several units with connecting doors, perfectly suited for the family. The room size 47 m2 consist of bedroom, bathroom and wide verandah. Bedding setup (double bed : 2,2m x 1,8m) or (twin bed : 2,2m x 1,28m). En suite bathroom with overhead hot & cold rain shower, vanity unit, toilet , bathub and bathroom amenities.',NULL,'Thew Guest is Honeymooner','{\"date\": \"2024-06-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5130248,'418','Nuria Perez Gusman',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Visit and Hiking in Sekumpul Waterfall)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-08','2024-06-08','Guio','Komang',2,'Person (1)',2016000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-08\", \"text\": \"Puri Bagus Lovina\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Lovina\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-08\", \"text\": \"Puri Bagus Lovina l. Seririt- Singaraja No.Desa, Pemaron, Lovina, Kabupaten Buleleng, Bali 81151 Telepon: (0362) 21430\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Lovina\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5130257,'418','Nuria Perez Gusman',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Bedji Temple - Kintamani - Besakih Mother Temple)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-09','2024-06-09','Guio','Komang',2,'Person (1)',0.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-09\", \"text\": \"Puri Bagus Lovina Jl. Seririt- Singaraja No.Desa, Pemaron, Lovina, Kabupaten Buleleng, Bali 81151 Telepon: (0362) 21430\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Lovina\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-09\", \"text\": \"Puri Bagus Candidasa Jalan Raya Candidasa, Dusun, Jl. Samuh Desa, Sengkidu, Bugbug, Kabupaten Karangasem, Bali 80801 Telepon: (0363) 41131\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Karangasem\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5130279,'418','Nuria Perez Gusman',30561,202290,'Deluxe Garden Villa','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-09','2024-06-10','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',1456000.00,'A traditional yet luxury room with a touch of a Balinese architecture arranged among manicured green gardens, with a spacious room to ensure your convenience and wide terrace with living chair, each of Deluxe Garden View rooms are set separately in 3 meter space to ensure your privacy.',NULL,'The guest is Honeymooner','{\"date\": \"2024-06-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5130287,'418','Nuria Perez Gusman',30508,213313,'Candidasa to Padangbai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-10','2024-06-10','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (1-3)',784000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-10\", \"text\": \"Puri Bagus Candidasa Jalan Raya Candidasa, Dusun, Jl. Samuh Desa, Sengkidu, Bugbug, Kabupaten Karangasem, Bali 80801 Telepon: (0363) 41131\", \"time\": \"07:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Candidasa\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-10\", \"text\": \"ETD : 08.30 by Gili gili Fastboat from Padangbai to Gili Air\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padangbai\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5130943,'418','Nuria Perez Gusman',30607,217202,'Serai Cottage Hill View','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-06-13','2024-06-15','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',1904000.00,'Located at our Lemongrass Alley, boasting some of the best views at the Resort and surrounded by Lemongrass are our Serai Cottages. Serai in Balinese means Lemongrass.',NULL,'The guest is Honeymooner','{\"date\": \"2024-06-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5130945,'419','Maria Devora Darias Rodriguez',30783,201646,'Borobudur Temple - Yogyakarta City Tour - Prambanan Temple','Confirmed','C2I-JAVA15',1,'2024-09-28','2024-09-28','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',3696000.00,'This excursion will make you lose yourselves in the authentic magic of Yogyakarta. One of the most beautiful and complete routes of the cultural capital of Indonesia. At the scheduled time, your guide will pick you up to begin the tour of Borobudur, the great Stupa, the largest Buddhist monument in the world and one of the seven wonders. Depending on where you stay in the city, the drive can be 1-1,5 hours to the temple. Arrival at the temple, you will walk around the garden area, observe the hundreds and centenary statues of Buddha and witness how dozens of Buddhists come to preach from all over the world. Historically it was established during the relatively brief Sailendra dynasty of Central Java between 778 and 856 BC and is in constant restoration due to the breaks that the tremors of the neighbouring Merapi volcano has been producing during its history. After visiting one of the most important Buddhist temples in Southeast Asia, you will continue the journey to the heart of the city. You will visit the Keraton, or also known as the Sultan’s Palace. The palace is a complex building two centuries old. Next, you will hear the song of the “freedom” of the birds in the bird market, you will visit the “Water Castle” that occupies the highest part at the northern end of the vast complex of Taman Sari. Then, stroll around Malioboro Street, one of the main streets of Yogyakarta, with its merchants, horse carriages, taxi-bikes and markets. An incredible experience that will make the hours fly by. Finishing the tour in the centre of the city of Yogyakarta, you will head northeast towards Prambanan, the temple of Hinduists and classified as a World Heritage Site by UNESCO since 1991. This temple was completed in 856 AD to commemorate the victory of the descendant of Sanjaya dynasty, Rikai Pikatan, against the last Shailendra sovereign of Central Java. Take your time to enjoy each carving on the rocks and feel the spirituality that each of the stones perched in this set of more than 200 Hindu temples that are dedicated to Shiva, one of the Trimurti which is an expression of God as the Creator, the Preserver and the Destroyer. After this unforgettable day, and take you to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-28\", \"text\": \"Yellow Star Ambarukmo Jl. Laksda Adisucipto No.23, Papringan, Caturtunggal, Kec. Depok, Kabupaten Sleman, Daerah Istimewa Yogyakarta 55281 Telepon: (0274) 2800719\", \"time\": \"07:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Yogyakarta\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-28\", \"text\": \"Yellow Star Ambarukmo Jl. Laksda Adisucipto No.23, Papringan, Caturtunggal, Kec. Depok, Kabupaten Sleman, Daerah Istimewa Yogyakarta 55281 Telepon: (0274) 2800719\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Yogyakarta\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5130948,'420','Susanna Hartwig',30508,202897,'Uluwatu Temple and Kecak Dance','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-19','2024-05-19','Melysa','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',2556000.00,'This half-day tour, is an exciting tour package to visit Padang-Padang Beach, Uluwatu Temple, the famous Balinese Hindu Temple in south part of Bali with breathtaking view of sunset and Indian Ocean. Uluwatu Temple is one of Balinese Hindu Temples located right on the petrifying hill with the crevasse exist in the right and left side. Uluwatu Temple is one of Sad Khayangan (6 biggest temple in Bali) owns magnificent view of the Indian Ocean and sunset as a backdrop. This temple is very amazing where the location is right on the narrow peninsula with deep seawater under it. This tour package is combined with the spectacular Balinese traditional dance performance of Kecak Dance. Balinese Kecak Dance is a spectacular traditional dance with the group of people playing this dance with fire game. It is very exciting and unique dance due to the sound of gamelan is not using the normal gamelan but use their mouth. The dancers make the compact choir with the exquisite dance movement that is one of this dance features. After the dance we returned back to the hotel or seafood restaurant in Jimbaran.',NULL,'Include DINNER at Jimbaran','{\"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"text\": \"Apurva Kempinski Nusa Dua Jl. Raya Nusa Dua Selatan lot 4, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361 Telepon: (0361) 2092288\", \"time\": \"15:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Dua\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-19\", \"text\": \"Apurva Kempinski Nusa Dua Jl. Raya Nusa Dua Selatan lot 4, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361 Telepon: (0361) 2092288\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5130949,'420','Susanna Hartwig',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-05-22','2024-05-22','Melysa','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',1020000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"text\": \"ETA : 08.00 by Maruti Fastboat from Sanur on 22 May 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Toya Pakeh harbour Nusa Penida\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"text\": \"ETD : 16.30 by Maruti Fastboat to Sanur on 22 May 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Toya Pakeh harbour Nusa Penida\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5130950,'420','Susanna Hartwig',30508,212475,'Nusa Dua - Sanur - Nusa Dua','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-22','2024-05-22','Melysa','Komang',2,'Persons (1-3)',600000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'Fastboat schedule : ETD : 10.30 by The Angkal Fastboat from Sanur - Nusa Penida on 22 May ETA : 17.00 by The Angkal fastboat from Nusa Penida - Sanur on 22 May','{\"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"text\": \"The Apurva Kempinski Jl. Raya Nusa Dua Selatan lot 4, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361 Telepon: (0361) 2092288\", \"time\": \"08:45\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Dua\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-22\", \"text\": \"The Apurva Kempinski Jl. Raya Nusa Dua Selatan lot 4, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361 Telepon: (0361) 2092288\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5130952,'420','Susanna Hartwig',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route (Taman Ayu-Jati Luwih-Bedugul-Tanah Lot)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-23','2024-05-23','Melysa','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',1872000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"text\": \"Melia Bali l. Kw. Nusa Dua Resort Itdc Lot 1, Jl. Nusa Dua, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Bali, 80363 Telepon: (0361) 771510\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Dua\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-23\", \"text\": \"Melia Bali l. Kw. Nusa Dua Resort Itdc Lot 1, Jl. Nusa Dua, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Bali, 80363 Telepon: (0361) 771510\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5131046,'120','Beatriz Bedizu',31083,212374,'3D2N LOB Rinca - Padar - Komodo Island Tour (Medium Standard Boat)','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-06-05','2024-06-07','Jacob','Komang',2,'Persons (2-3)',29196000.00,'TOUR ITINERARY Highlights: Menjarite, Kelor, Strawberry Rock, Kalong, Rinca, Padar, Komodo Island, Pink Beach, Taka Makassar, Manta Point, Kanawa, B.Cermin Mirror Cave DAY 1 : DENPASAR - LABUAN BAJO - MENJARITE - KELOR - KALONG ISLAND Arrival at Komodo Airport in Labuan Bajo west Flores, meeting service with our tour guide and transfer to the pier of Labuan Bajo for Rinca Island. It’s about 2 hours sail to the island of Komodo Dragon, stop at Menjarite island for snorkeling then continue to Rinca island-the Island of Komodo dragon, you will find not just e Dragons but also many wild animals like, deer, wild buffalo, long-tailed macaque and wild pig also numerous of birds. Keep your eyes look up as sometime you will find the young Komodo dragons on the trees. A local ranger will lead you through this natural preservation. Late afternoon sailing directly to Kalong Rinca Island to see the hundreds of fling foxes set out from the mangrove tree at 06-07pm, the lovely sunset from the boat trip really enjoyable. Lunch and dinner on boat. Meals : Lunch - Dinner DAY 2 : KALONG - PADAR - KOMODO - PINK BEACH - MANTA POINT - TAKA MAKASSAR - SEBAYUR After having breakfast in your boat, heading to Padar Island, taking trek to Padar Island until having the top view point to get breathtaking scenery of three bays around, Padar Island hike in Komodo has some of the most amazing views in Indonesia, trek to downhill and back to the Boat for sailing directly to Loh Liang – the Ranger station in Komodo Island. By passing through many small islands, After registering start to take basic trekking to see the GIANT RIZARD / KOMODO DRAGON and other wild animals as: Timor deer, wild pig, wild chicken and many variously of tropical bird. Please keep your look at any directions as sometimes you will also find young Komodo dragon hanging over the trees. A local ranger will be led you during the trek. Return to the boat on to Pink beach for snorkeling, swimming and relaxing. It is really spectacular and unspoiled coral reef and many color fish. This is one of best side for snorkeling diving. Sail toward MANTA POINT to exploring Huge Mantas by snorkeling even watching from your boat trip (can’t be guaranteed if weather is not good, like wave and current are strongly) visit also the taka Makassar its really tiny island with white sand beach really enjoyable to relaxing or beach walking then heading to Sebayur island, overnight dinner on boat. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner DAY 3 : SEBAYUR - KANAWA ISLANDS - LABUAN BAJO - DENPASAR After breakfast on the boat, taking swimming, snorkeling and relaxing as well at seraya and Kanawa. Then back to Labuan Bajo to continue your next excursion with visiting the Batu Cermin (Mirror Stone) Cave. The grotto is 75 by 75 meters large, and contains stalactites and stalagmites. Some tunnels are narrow and dark but in others sunlight falls. Then local market before taking you to the airport for flight to Denpasar. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch Attention: The itinerary is subject to change due to the weather, tide level and operating conditions without prior notice.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-05\", \"text\": \"ETA : 09.20 by Batik Air ID6333 from Denpasar on 05 June 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komodo Airport, Labuan Bajo\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-07\", \"text\": \"ETD : 17.35 by BAtik Air ID6334 to Denpasar on 07 June 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komodo Airport, Labuan Bajo\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5131164,'422','Merce Bonamusa Ventura',30508,202890,'Mount Batur Sunrise Trekking Tour','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-05-21','2024-05-21','Jacob','Komang',1,'Person (1)',600000.00,'Enjoy trek or climb Mount Batur and see the sunrise from the top of Batur Volcano. The Batur Volcano is one of the sacred mountain according to Hindu believe. We will get in ahead of schedule morning around 02.00 am depend the area of you stay, and afterward we specifically going to Mount Batur starting point. Starting in the dark under starlight sky, you will be guided to ascend the slope of Mount Batur. You will approach the peak of Mount Batur (1717 meters) at about 06.00 am. While waiting for the sunrise you will have a simple breakfast and hot coffee or tea served by your guide in Mount Batur. Witness the breathtaking sunrise overlooking the majestic view of Lake Batur and Mount Rinjani. After witnessing the sunrise, continue for our descent, at about 9 am, you will be arriving at the finishing point.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"text\": \"Purnama homestay Jl. Subak Sok Wayah,Bangkiang Sidem, Ubud, Kec. Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone: 0878-6171-3870\", \"time\": \"02:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-05-21\", \"text\": \"Purnama homestay Jl. Subak Sok Wayah,Bangkiang Sidem, Ubud, Kec. Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone: 0878-6171-3870\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5131678,'424','Mr. Carlos Gutierrez Herreros',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-21','2024-07-22','Jacob','Tami',1,'Double',840000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. - Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK–IN','{\"date\": \"2024-07-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5131685,'424','Mr. Carlos Gutierrez Herreros',30806,208758,'3D2N Shared Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO8',3,'2024-07-22','2024-07-24','Jacob','Tami',2,'Person (1)',7840000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.00 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you canhave your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan is Cape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even see crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Shared Klotok Boat *The SHARED klotok will be ready by 10.30 AM and will depart at 12.00 PM sharp. Check-in time: Klotok at 10.30 AM, check-out time: 08.00 AM *If you arrive at the port before 12 PM, you may walk around the area of the port by yourself. Alternatively, when the boat is ready, you can also wait for the other travelers on the boat. Note: The guide may not assist you during the waiting time. *All participants should arrive at the latest 10.30 AM at Pangkalanbun Airport. If you arrive late, you must take the speedboat to join the klotok. The speedboat costs around IDR 600.000/boat/way to be paid directly to the captain. Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continue to add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Shared Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-07-22\", \"text\": \"ETA 07.15 by Batik Air ID6202 from Jakarta on 22 Jul\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Iskandar Airport Pangkalan Bun\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-24\", \"text\": \"ETD 10.25 by Batik Air ID6303 to Semarang on 24 Jul\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5131716,'424','Mr. Carlos Gutierrez Herreros',30620,211743,'Premier Room','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-07-29','2024-08-02','Jacob','Tami',1,'Double',5280000.00,'8 units of 29 sqm each premier rooms with valley view and garden are modern‐minimalism designed. Advance facilities such as LCD TV, coffee/tea maker, balcony/terrace, safety deposit box, minibar, And complete bathroom facilities.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5131723,'424','Mr. Carlos Gutierrez Herreros',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-31','2024-07-31','Jacob','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1872000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-31\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pertiwi Bisma 2\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5131734,'424','Mr. Carlos Gutierrez Herreros',30508,207379,'Ubud to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-02','2024-08-02','Jacob','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',600000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-02\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pertiwi Bisma 2\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-02\", \"text\": \"ETD 08.30 to Gili Air by Gili Gili Fast Boat\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5131755,'424','Mr. Carlos Gutierrez Herreros',31308,205334,'One-Bedroom Villa with Private Pool','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-08-02','2024-08-04','Jacob','Tami',1,'Double',8040000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5132583,'427','JOSUNE MERAKI',30680,200912,'7 Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-02','2024-06-03','Jacob','Agus',1,'Double',728000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'AIRPORT TRANSFER AS BELOW FLIGHT SCHEDULE : ETA 15.00 BY QR6381 FROM DOHA ON 02 JUN 2024 ETD 06.00 BY BATIK AIR ID6202 TO PANGKALAN BUN ON 03 JUN 2024 Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. - Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK–IN','{\"date\": \"2024-06-02\", \"text\": \"XXX\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5132615,'427','JOSUNE MERAKI',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-06-03','2024-06-05','Jacob','Agus',14,'Persons (2-14)',0.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan isCape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continueto add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'FLIGHTS DETAILS : ETA : 07.15 BY BATIK AIR ID6202 FROM JAKARTA ON 03 JUN 2024 ETD : 08.50 BY BATIK AIR ID6134 TO SURABAYA ON 05 JUN 2024 Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-06-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5132631,'351','Alvaro Gonzalez Gimenez',30582,203388,'One Bedroom Suite Villas','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-29','2024-06-30','Jacob','Tami',1,'Double',4256000.00,'Each One Bedroom Suite Villa is designed with a private infinity pool, scenic view across the Gamat Bay or Mount Agung, some with a small private garden, and air-conditioned lounge area. Every villas features the following: An integrated universal power outlet, Hair dryer, A mini-fridge, Room safe (suitable for storing laptops), Cable TV with international news and movie channels, Individually controlled A/C, Coffee and tea-making facilities, Bathroom with shower, Eco-friendly bathroom amenities, Wi-fi internet.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5132632,'427','JOSUNE MERAKI',31015,216453,'4D3N - Surabaya Madakaripura Mount Bromo Tumpak Sewu Ijen Tour Drop Bali','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-06-05','2024-06-08','Jacob','Agus',14,'Persons (2-14)',0.00,NULL,NULL,'05 JUN : Arrival Surabaya - transfer to Lumajang 06 JUN : Visit Tumpak Sewu Waterfall Driver to Bromo ( Cafe Lava ) 07 JUN : Bromo Sunrise Tour Drive to Ijen( Ketapang Indah ) 08 JUN : Ijen Trekking - Drop Bali ( Sekumpul Area ) Pick up at SURABAYA AIRPORT on 05 JUN 2024 ETA 10.00 by BATIK AIR ID 6134 FROM PANGKALAN BUN Drop off Bali : ROSTIKA HOTEL SEKUMPUL / +62877-6288-7111','{\"date\": \"2024-06-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5132683,'418','Nuria Perez Gusman',30508,207390,'Transfer In Nusa Penida','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-15','2024-06-15','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (1-3)',448000.00,NULL,NULL,'Please ready on hotel lobby for transfer at : 06.00AM','{\"date\": \"2024-06-15\", \"text\": \"The Mesare Resort Dusun, Jalan Batu Guling, Batukandik, Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771 Telepon: (0361) 3350575\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Penida\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-15\", \"text\": \"ETD : 07.30 by Maruti fastboat from Nusa Penida to Sanur\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Toya Pakeh harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5132698,'418','Nuria Perez Gusman',30508,207278,'Full Day Tour Car & Driver (8-10 hours)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-15','2024-06-15','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (1-3)',0.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-15\", \"text\": \"ETA : 08.15 by Maruti Fastboat from Nusa Penida on 15 Jun\", \"time\": \"08:15\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sanur Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-15\", \"text\": \"ETD : 00.05 AM by Emirates Airlines EK399 to Doha on 16 Jun 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5133515,'429','Mrs. Samuela Celestino',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-24','2024-06-24','Melysa','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',420000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-24\", \"text\": \"ETA 11.55 by Singapore Airlines SQ938 from Singapore on 24 Jun\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-24\", \"text\": \"Jl. Hanoman, Ubud, Kec. Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Alaya Resort Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5133518,'429','Mrs. Samuela Celestino',30611,201418,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-06-24','2024-06-27','Melysa','Tami',1,'Double',6804000.00,'The Deluxe Room provides a restful environment to unwind after a busy day spent exploring the sights of Ubud. It is a cozy base featuring clean-line furnishings, a smart en-suite bathroom and a decorative wall that showcases Bali’s creative legacy. A private terrace or balcony blends seamlessly into the outdoors providing extra space to sit and relax.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5133522,'429','Mrs. Samuela Celestino',30508,202881,'Jatiluwih Rice Terrace - Banyumala Twin Waterfall - Wanagiri Hidden Hill','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-25','2024-06-25','Melysa','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1692000.00,'We begin the tour from a beautiful rice terrace of Jatiluwih. Unfolding from the foot of mountain until the coastal side, it is one of places in Bali with the beautiful view, as according to its name “Jati” and “Luwih”, where Jati mean really and Luwih meaning especial, good, and beautiful or the equivalent. The local paddies are planted in this place look typically of the high relative size plant if it is compared with other pre-eminent paddy planted by most farmers in Bali. Stroll around the area for a while and take a nice pictures, before we continue to Banyumala Twin Waterfall. The waterfall is special in that there are two flows of water to be seen, hence the name ‘twin’. Water cascades down steep rocks with gorgeous greenery surrounding them. Here you can take a refreshing dip in the plunge pool at the bottom - dunk your head and listen to the sounds of the water crashing down. After the refreshment, we conclude our day by heading to Wanagiri Hidden Hill. This hill has a charm of beauty that can make anyone who saw her feel hypnotized and fell in love Beautiful natural paintings depicting the beautiful mountains, the beautiful green trees, and the expanse of the lake can be seen clearly from this place. In addition to the panoramic view, cool and fresh air is also an added value that makes this tourist area worth visiting. Take photos and enjoy the scenery and then we head back to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-25\", \"text\": \"Jl. Hanoman, Ubud, Kec. Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Alaya Resort Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5133530,'429','Mrs. Samuela Celestino',30508,207379,'Ubud to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-27','2024-06-27','Melysa','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',600000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-27\", \"text\": \"Jl. Hanoman, Ubud, Kec. Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"10:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Alaya Resort Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-27\", \"text\": \"ETD 12.15 from Padang Bai to Gili Trawangan by Blue Water Express\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5133538,'429','Mrs. Samuela Celestino',30659,203068,'Deluxe Ombak Room','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-06-27','2024-06-30','Melysa','Tami',1,'Double',6300000.00,'The convertible Deluxe Ombak Rooms are perfect for those travelling in groups or families. Each room is equipped with a double bed or twin bed arrangement, an indoor day bed that is easily converted into an extra bed and comes with interconnecting options. The open-air bathroom maintains the unique island feel. - Entrance : 4sqm - Bedroom only : 37sqm - Semi-open Bathroom : 22sqm - Double bed (18rms) : 200 x 200cm - Twin bed (6rms) : 2 x 100 x 200cm',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5133555,'429','Mrs. Samuela Celestino',30698,205187,'Bungalow Room With Ocean View','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-06-30','2024-07-02','Melysa','Tami',1,'Double',4560000.00,'The property is consisted of 6 units of bungalow room ocean view. Each of our bungalows has a spacious private balcony facing to swimming pool, tropical garden and ocean. Each room is facilitated with remote control system, remote control system air conditioner, refrigerator, in-room safe, tea and coffee making facility, spacious bathroom with shower, bath robe. Our Bungalow Room Ocean View has a king bed setup.',NULL,'ETA : 16.55 by BlueWater Express at Buyuk Harbour on 30 June 2024','{\"date\": \"2024-06-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5133561,'429','Mrs. Samuela Celestino',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-07-01','2024-07-01','Melysa','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1020000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-01\", \"text\": \"Jl Toya Pakeh Penida, Nusa Penida island, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sea La Vie Resort - Nusa Penida\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5133573,'429','Mrs. Samuela Celestino',30508,207337,'Snorkeling to Nusa Penida (from Nusa Penida) (Sharing Trip)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-02','2024-07-02','Melysa','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1320000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-02\", \"text\": \"Jl. Toya Pakeh Penida, Nusa Penida Island, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sea La Vie Resort - Nusa Penida\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-02\", \"text\": \"ETD 16.30 from Nusa Penida to Sanur by Maruti Fast Boat\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Toya Pakeh Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5133578,'429','Mrs. Samuela Celestino',30508,212491,'Sanur to Kuta','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-02','2024-07-02','Melysa','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',300000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-02\", \"text\": \"ETA 17.00 from Nusa Penida by Maruti Fast Boat\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sanur Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-02\", \"text\": \"Jl. Kartika Plaza No.127, Kuta, Kec. Kuta, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Vira Bali Boutique Hotel & Suite\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5133579,'429','Mrs. Samuela Celestino',30571,202567,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-02','2024-07-03','Melysa','Tami',1,'Double',1470000.00,'Located at the Second Floor, 35 sqm comfort living with a touch of Balinese style featuring completed fitting, Cable TV, a fancy bathroom comprises rain shower and good quality amenities. Also dedicated Wi-Fi Access to complete your day.',NULL,'Flight information ETD 10.20 by Singapore Airlines SQ935 to Singapore on 03 Jul PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK–IN','{\"date\": \"2024-07-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5133724,'427','JOSUNE MERAKI',31150,204210,'Standard Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-06-11','2024-06-13','Jacob','Agus',1,'Double',1344000.00,'Standard guest rooms are a 12 tropical theme single room accommodation offering a queen-sized bed and twin bed, a coffee maker, mini-refrigerator, a flat-screen TV and all our signature features and amenities. The large bathrooms offer a tropical walk-in shower. Great for couple on romantic escape, our Standard Rooms are the ideal choice for an affordable stay in Gili Air.','These rates are inclusive 10% service charge and tax 11% government tax.',NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5133725,'427','JOSUNE MERAKI',30508,207384,'Padang Bai to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-13','2024-06-13','Jacob','Agus',1,'Persons (14)',0.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'ARRIVAL BY EKAJAYA FASTBOAT ETA 13.30 PM FROM GILI TRAWANGAN DROP OFF : PURI PADI HOSTEL Jalan Raya Pengosekan, Padang Tegal, Ubud +62831-1500-4828','{\"date\": \"2024-06-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5133743,'427','JOSUNE MERAKI',30508,207262,'Ubud to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-14','2024-06-14','Jacob','Agus',2,'Persons (4-6)',1232000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'Pick up Time : 14.00 PM at PURI PADI HOSTEL UBUD Drop Off : Denpasar Airport ( International Departure ) Flight : ETD 18.55 BY QR 963 TO DOHA','{\"date\": \"2024-06-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5133746,'382','JOAQUINA VALDES',30508,202892,'GOA GAJAH-TIRTA EMPUL-TEMPLO GUNUNG KAWI SEBATU-TEGALALANG','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-11','2024-08-11','Jacob','Wiwik',8,'Persons (7-10)',4944000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,'Pick Up Time: 08.30 AM Pick Up/Drop Off: BERLIMA WOODEN LODGE Singakerta, Ubud, Gianyar Regency, Bali Phone: 0812-3791-7558','{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5133749,'382','JOAQUINA VALDES',30508,213032,'Ubud to Kusamba','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-14','2024-08-14','Jacob','Wiwik',1,'Persons (7-10)',1200000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'Pick Up Time: 06.00 AM Pick Up Point: BERLIMA WOODEN LODGE Singakerta, Ubud, Gianyar Regency, Bali Phone: 0812-3791-7558 Drop Off: OFFICE THE ANGKAL FAST BOAT (ETD: 08.00 AM to Nusa Penida)','{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5133757,'382','JOAQUINA VALDES',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BA