\"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5133760,'382','JOAQUINA VALDES',31285,208028,'Suite Room with Ocean View','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-14','2024-08-15','Jacob','Wiwik',4,'Double',7824000.00,'With 100 sqm of space, this suite comfortably accommodates up to 2 adults. It comes with air conditioning, a flat-screen TV with international channels, and a personal safe. The suite has a dining area and coffee/tea making facilities. Bathroom is fitted with separate toilet and shower. Fresh towels and bed linens are provided.',NULL,'Vouchers must be presented upon check-in and the hotel will there for invoice with in the 7 days period if credit facility has been extended by the hotel.','{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5133774,'412','MR. LUIS ALVARO GARCIA DALFO',30728,207493,'Bumi Gora / Kuta Tour','Confirmed','EXC 03',1,'2024-06-17','2024-06-17','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',1776320.00,'This tour takes you first to the Pottery Village of Banyumulek. Observe how the local women produce pottery stuffs. Then, visit Sukarare village; renowned for its traditional hand weaving of brightly patterned “songket”, “ikat” and “sarong” cloths. We will observe how the regenerate of weaving tradition goes on in the village. Girl, mother and grandmother even great grandmother do weaving activity together in the village. Next the tour continues to Ende village, featuring the unique traditional houses with its buffalo dung floors. Lunch is served at one of local restaurants in New Kuta Mandalika area. Then, we visit the beautiful beach of Tanjung A’an, one of the most scenic and un-spoilt beaches in this part of Lombok. We may have chance to trek Merese Hills to enjoy magnificent panorama of Indian Ocean.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-17\", \"text\": \"Jivana Resort Kuta Lombok Jl. Raya Kuta, Kuta, Kec. Pujut, Kabupaten Lombok Tengah, Nusa Tenggara Barat\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"KUTA LOMBOK\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-17\", \"text\": \"Jivana Resort Kuta Lombok Jl. Raya Kuta, Kuta, Kec. Pujut, Kabupaten Lombok Tengah, Nusa Tenggara Barat\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"KUTA LOMBOK\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5133776,'382','JOAQUINA VALDES',32607,215994,'Deluxe Suite','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-08-15','2024-08-18','Jacob','Wiwik',4,'Double',23040000.00,'At 38 m2 room size, welcome to the Deluxe suite with ocean view. Sleep soundly during your trip to one of Gili Islands in Lombok, West Nusa Tenggara, Indonesia in our deluxe suite room, which is designed in a modern style and features a comfortable king bed, spacious, and individually designed.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5133779,'382','JOAQUINA VALDES',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-18','2024-08-19','Jacob','Wiwik',4,'Double',3360000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'FLIGHT DETAIL: ETA: 18.35 by Super Air Jet IU767 from Lombok on 18 August 2