ves off a very strange atmosphere. From Goa Lawah, we continue our way to Lempuyang Temple. Upon arrival, the temple will greet you with its gratifying panorama that extends into infinity. On a clear, sunny day, you\'ll be able to gaze out over the mountains, Amlapura city, and Mount Agung, an incredibly magnificent sight that\'s beautiful beyond words. This portrait of heaven is beautifully framed by the Gapura Candi Bentar (the gate of the temple). Our journey continues to visit Tirta Gangga. The site is a paradise surrounded by water, with all the pools decorated with unusual statues. With its seclusion and a view of the surrounding rice paddies, Tirta Gangga is a wonderful place. At the end of the trip we go to Tenganan Village, the most famous Bali Agas (the “original” Bali people) in the city. With its characteristics, the city village is arranged in parallel along the wide main road paved with rows of cobblestones. In Tenganan, women still weave the famous Kamben Geringsing, or \"burnt cloth,\" which has the power to immunize the wearer against evil. We take a close look at what they do in their daily lives in a traditional lifestyle. From Tenganan, we will transfer you to the hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-31\", \"text\": \"Green Field Resort Ubud Address : Jl. Raya Pengosekan, MAS, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone : (0361) 9085030\\\"\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-31\", \"text\": \"Green Field Resort Ubud Address : Jl. Raya Pengosekan, MAS, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone : (0361) 9085030\\\"\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5136157,'435','MARIA NIEVES TORRECILLA',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route (Taman Ayun-Jati Luwih-Bedugul-Tanah Lot)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-22','2024-06-22','Guio','Komang',5,'Persons (5)',3360000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-22\", \"text\": \"Desa Visesa Ubud, Jl. Suweta, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 2091788\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-22\", \"text\": \"Desa Visesa Ubud, Jl. Suweta, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 2091788\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5136158,'435','MARIA NIEVES TORRECILLA',31285,208028,'Suite Room with Ocean View + Extra Bed','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-06-23','2024-06-25','Guio','Komang',2,'Double',6182400.00,'With 100 sqm of space, this suite comfortably accommodates up to 2 adults. It comes with air conditioning, a flat-screen TV with international channels, and a personal safe. The suite has a dining area and coffee/tea making facilities. Bathroom is fitted with separate toilet and shower. Fresh towels and bed linens are provided.',NULL,'Vouchers must be presented upon check-in and the hotel will there for invoice with in the 7 days period if credit facility has been extended by the hotel.','{\"date\": \"2024-06-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5136159,'435','MARIA NIEVES TORRECILLA',30508,213032,'Ubud to Kusamba','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-23','2024-06-23','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (1-5)',1064000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'Please ready on hotel lobby fro pickup at 07.00','{\"date\": \"2024-06-23\", \"text\": \"Desa Visesa Ubud, Jl. Suweta, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 2091788\", \"time\": \"07:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-23\", \"text\": \"ETD : 09.30 by The Angkal Fastboat to Nusa Penida on 23 Jun\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kusamba Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5136161,'435','MARIA NIEVES TORRECILLA',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-06-23','2024-06-23','Guio','Komang',5,'Persons (5)',0.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-23\", \"text\": \"ETA : 09.45 by The Angkal Fastboat from Kusamba on 23 Jun\", \"time\": \"09:45\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sampalan Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-23\", \"text\": \"The Semabu Hill, Jl. Raya Toya Pakeh – Ped Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771, Indonesia Mobile : +6282339776651 Phone : +623616204400\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Penida\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5136162,'435','MARIA NIEVES TORRECILLA',30508,207337,'Snorkeling to Nusa Penida (from Nusa Penida) (Sharing Trip)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-24','2024-06-24','Guio','Komang',5,'Persons (5)',3640000.00,NULL,NULL,'Please ready on hotel lobby for pickup at 09.00','{\"date\": \"2024-06-24\", \"text\": \"The Semabu Hill, Jl. Raya Toya Pakeh – Ped Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771, Indonesia Mobile : +6282339776651 Phone : +623616204400\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Penida\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-24\", \"text\": \"The Semabu Hill, Jl. Raya Toya Pakeh – Ped Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771, Indonesia Mobile : +6282339776651 Phone : +623616204400\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Penida\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5136163,'435','MARIA NIEVES TORRECILLA',30508,207391,'Transfer Out Nusa Penida','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-25','2024-06-25','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (1-5)',0.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-25\", \"text\": \"The Semabu Hill, Jl. Raya Toya Pakeh – Ped Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771, Indonesia Mobile : +6282339776651 Phone : +623616204400\", \"time\": \"07:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Penida\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-25\", \"text\": \"ETD : 09.15 by Blue Water Express to Gili AIr on 25 Jun\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Buyuk harbour, Nusa Penida\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5136164,'435','MARIA NIEVES TORRECILLA',30650,208425,'Private Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-06-25','2024-06-28','Guio','Komang',2,'Double + Double',0.00,'Each villa embraces calmness, comfort and privacy in a simple and elegant setting. Guests can relax while peacefully sipping drinks in an inviting plunge pool surrounded by a lush tropical garden and at an old-wooden deck. At 85 m2 room size, this villa\'s special feature is the private pool. The air-conditioned villa features 1 bedroom and 1 bathroom with a shower and a hairdryer. The villa provides a mini-bar, a tea and coffee maker, a seating area as well as a terrace with garden views. The unit offers 1 bed.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": 