allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. - Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK–IN','{\"date\": \"2024-11-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5142140,'450','Mr. Peter Kaeferboeck',32281,215532,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-23','2024-11-24','Ayu','Tami',3,'Double',2184000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-11-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5142283,'451','Mr. Fernando Vives Gil',30671,200626,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-30','2024-07-31','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',1120000.00,'Deluxe Room with a room area of 28 square meters each, there are 2 types of bed, king and twin bed with a size of 28 square meters each.',NULL,'Check-in time 14.00 Check-out time 12.00','{\"date\": \"2024-07-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5142352,'447','SANDRA LLANO PAJARES',32766,217612,'3D2N Open Trip Komodo - Maheswari / Signature Cabin','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-06-28','2024-06-30','Jacob','Praba',2,'Per Person (Min. 2 Person)',12720000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-28\", \"text\": \"SUDAMALA RESORT KOMODO Jl. Pantai Pede No.Km. 3, Labuan Bajo, Kabupaten Manggarai Barat, Nusa Tenggara Timur\", \"time\": \"10:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"LABUAN BAJO\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-30\", \"text\": \"ETD 17:35PM BY ID6334 TO DENPASAR\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"BANDARA INTERNATIONAL KOMODO\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5142536,'451','Mr. Fernando Vives Gil',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-07-31','2024-08-02','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',10080000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan isCape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continueto add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-07-31\", \"text\": \"ETA 07.15 by Batik Air ID6202 from Jakarta on 31 Jul\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pangkalan Bun Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-02\", \"text\": \"ETD 08.50 by Batik Air ID6134 to Surabaya on 02 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5142571,'452','Alvaro WINZER',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-11','2024-07-11','Guio','Wiwik',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-11\", \"text\": \"ETA: 20.40 by Singapore Airlines SQ946 from Singapore on 11 July 2024\", \"time\": \"20:40\", \"locality\": \"Airport Ngurah Rai (International)\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-11\", \"text\": \"Kedewatan, Ubud, Gianyar Regency, Bali 80571 Phone: (0361) 980022\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"The Royal Pita Maha\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5142596,'451','Mr. Fernando Vives Gil',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-02','2024-08-02','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',336000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-02\", \"text\": \"ETA 14.00 by Lion Air JT804 from Surabaya on 02 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-02\", \"text\": \"Kedewatan, Ubud, Gianyar Regency, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Royal Pita Maha\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5142616,'451','Mr. Fernando Vives Gil',30974,202964,'Deluxe Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-08-02','2024-08-06','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',23856000.00,'At 340 sqm room size, the Deluxe Pool Villa is encompassed within the secured confines of a private Balinese compound. It commands breathtaking views of the tropical greenery that lines the banks of the Ayung River in rural Ubud. A separate living environment is bathed in sunlight as is the bedroom that comes complete with its own spa-styled Balinese bathroom. A natural stone swimming pool and sun terrace lends itself to pleasurable relaxation time amidst the raw beauty of the Ubud countryside.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-08-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5142628,'451','Mr. Fernando Vives Gil',30508,215968,'Goa Gajah - Tampaksiring - Gunung Kawi Sebatu Temple - Tegalalang','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-03','2024-08-03','Guio','Tami',2,'Person (1)',0.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-03\", \"text\": \"Kedewatan, Ubud, Gianyar Regency, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Royal Pita Maha\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5142634,'451','Mr. Fernando Vives Gil',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-04','2024-08-04','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1747200.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-04\", \"text\": \"Kedewatan, Ubud, Gianyar Regency, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Royal Pita Maha\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5142705,'451','Mr. Fernando Vives Gil',30605,201527,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-07','2024-08-08','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',1512000.00,'Deluxe Room Double Bed carries a compact and Bali-minimalist design, this 43 sqm room is comfortably fresh, neat, and blended with a sleek modern design. The rooms in the five-story building are designed to provide easy motion for a splash of personality. This room features a private balcony and a writing desk which can be used as a working desk in case you want to keep maintaining your work during the holidays. Premium hotel amenities become your companion during your stay in our hotel.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-08-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5142710,'451','Mr. Fernando Vives Gil',30508,212566,'Legian to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-08','2024-08-08','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": \"Jl. Melasti, Legian, Kelod, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": \"07:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Magani Hotel and Spa\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": \"ETD 10.35 by Wings Air IW1832 to Tambolaka on 08 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5142717,'451','Mr. Fernando Vives Gil',31104,203974,'Beachfront One Bedroom Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-08-08','2024-08-11','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',26712000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5142730,'451','Mr. Fernando Vives Gil',30508,212291,'Airport to Jimbaran','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-11','2024-08-11','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": \"ETA 13.55 by Wings Air IW1833 from Tambolaka on 11 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": \"Jl. Karang Mas, Jimbaran, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Vivara Bali Private Pool Villas & Spa Retreat\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5142752,'449','ELIZABET GUTIERREZ CALLEGARIS',30508,216161,'Uluwatu to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-01','2024-07-01','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (1-3)',784000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-01\", \"text\": \"Sal Secret Uluwatu, Gg. Mertasari, Pecatu, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361 Telepon: 0812-3979-9199\", \"time\": \"20:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Uluwatu\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-01\", \"text\": \"ETD : 01.05 by Qatar Airways QR961 on 02 July 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5143855,'451','Mr. Fernando Vives Gil',32896,217674,'One Bedroom Private Pool Villas','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-08-11','2024-08-14','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',0.00,NULL,NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5143875,'451','Mr. Fernando Vives Gil',30508,212571,'Jimbaran to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-14','2024-08-14','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": \"Jl. Karang Mas, Jimbaran, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": \"14:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Vivara Bali Private Pool Villas & Spa Retreat\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": \"ETD 18.55 by IB7979 to Doha on 14 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5144021,'418','Nuria Perez Gusman',32839,217187,'One Bedroom Garden Villa','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-04','2024-06-05','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',2128000.00,'At 100 sqm room size, One Bedroom Garden Villa designed for optimal relaxation, this charming villa is a haven of tropical serenity for those seeking absolute privacy. It is surrounded by the refreshing greenery of a Balinese garden that cocoons guests from the outside world. Elegant furnishings are balanced by classic pieces of local artistry to showcase the warmth of the island and its people. The luxury of a four-poster bed and an indulging outdoor bathroom, with sunken tub built for two, will enrich each and every stay.',NULL,'The Guest is Honeymooner','{\"date\": \"2024-06-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5144063,'453','Mrs. Patricia Cocostegui Garcia',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-10','2024-07-11','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',784000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. - Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK–IN','{\"date\": \"2024-07-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5144071,'453','Mrs. Patricia Cocostegui Garcia',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-07-11','2024-07-13','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',10080000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan isCape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride t