e name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-07-11\", \"text\": \"ETA 07.15 by Batik Air ID6202 from Jakarta on 11 Jul\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pangkalan Bun Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-13\", \"text\": \"ETD 07.30 by Nam Air IN195 to Semarang on 13 Jul\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5144075,'453','Mrs. Patricia Cocostegui Garcia',30783,213435,'2D1N Semarang - Yogyakarta / C. Adhisthana (Superior Room)','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-07-13','2024-07-14','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2 / Double)',6216000.00,'D1 : Arrival Semarang airport - Borobudur Temple tour incl. Mendut and Pawon - overnight in Yogyakarta Welcome to the cradle of Indonesian culture, Yogyakarta. A tourist destination for its ancient palaces, temples, batik workshops, gamelan music orchestras, court dances and wayang puppet shows. Upon your arrival in Semarang airport a representative of come2indonesia will be waiting for you with a sign indicating your name to start exploring this special city. We will start by heading towards Borobudur Temple (Candi Borobudur), the great Stupa, the largest Buddhist monument in the world and one of the seven wonders. We will tour around the temple, observe the hundreds and centenary statues of Buddha and witness how dozens of Buddhists come to preach from all over the world. Historically it was established during the relatively brief Sailendra dynasty of Central Java between 778 and 856 BC and is in constant restoration due to the breaks that the tremors of the neighbouring Merapi volcano has been producing during its history. After visiting one of the most important Buddhist temples in Southeast Asia, we continue our journey to the Mendut temple and Pawon temple. And then, we will take you to your Jogjakarta. D2 : Morning visit Prambanan Temple - City Tour Yogyakarta visit Sultan Palace, Watercastle and Bird Market - Transfer to Yogyakarta International Airport You will enjoy a well-deserved breakfast at the hotel and we will start by heading towards Candi Prambanan, the temple of the Hinduists and classified as a World Heritage Site by Unesco since 1991. The built of this temple was finished around the year 856 to commemorate the victory of the descendant Sanjaya of Siva, Rikai Pikatan on the last sovereign Sailendra of Central Java. Take your time to enjoy each carving on the rocks and feel the spirituality that each of the stones perched in this set of more than 200 Hindu temples that are dedicated to the Trimurti, the expression of God as the Creator, the Preserver and the destroyer. After this visit we go to the Keraton known as the Sultan’s Palace. The palace is a complex building two centuries old, located in the heart of the city. You will hear the song of the “freedom” of the birds in the bird market, we will visit the “Water Castle” that occupies the highest part at the northern end of the vast complex of Taman Sari, Malioboro Street, main street of Yogyakarta, with its merchants, horse carriages, taxi-bikes and markets. An incredible experience that will make the hours fly by. According to the time of your flight, we will pick you up to take you to the airport and take the flight to your next destination. End of our services. Thank you very much for exploring Yogyakarta by the hand of Come2indonesia.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-13\", \"text\": \"ETA 08.40 by Nam Air IN195 from Pangkalan Bun on 13 Jul\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Semarang Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-14\", \"text\": \"ETD 14.00 by Lion Air JT566 to Denpasar on 14 Jul\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Yogyakarta International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5144076,'453','Mrs. Patricia Cocostegui Garcia',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-14','2024-07-14','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',336000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-14\", \"text\": \"ETA 16.25 by Lion Air JT566 from Yogyakarta on 14 Jul\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-14\", \"text\": \"Kelabang Moding, Banjar Bentuyung, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Blue Karma Dijiwa Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5144079,'453','Mrs. Patricia Cocostegui Garcia',30614,201076,'One Bedroom Private Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-07-14','2024-07-18','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',20921600.00,'The One Bedroom Private Pool Villas are sanctuaries of peace and privacy with generous touches of luxury. The airy villas have plush beds, roomy ensuite bathrooms, and huge sliding glass doors that open to tropical gardens with private pools where you can cool off on sunny days and float under the stars at night. The private pool villas are 144 sqm and have a charming rice field view.','Rates will include standard benefit (2 persons per bedroom) and all prices are quoted based on local currency or as stipulated in your contract.',NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5144082,'453','Mrs. Patricia Cocostegui Garcia',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-15','2024-07-15','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1747200.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-15\", \"text\": \"Kelabang Moding, Banjar Bentuyung, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Blue Karma Dijiwa Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5144083,'453','Mrs. Patricia Cocostegui Garcia',30508,202894,'Kehen Temple - Pengelipuran - Kintamani','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-16','2024-07-16','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1568000.00,'Our wonderful tour starts from Kehen Temple. It is an ancient Hindu temple complex boasting unique architectural features. The staircases reaching from the ground to temple courtyard are carved sandstone mythical animal and Balinese folklore figure statues and also the central vestibule. The temple’s walls are also ornate with Chinese porcelain plates, which are a tribute to the historical relations between the local Bali kingdom and China. Afterwards, we continue to Penglipuran, a village that succeeded in preserving its 75-hectare bamboo forest located in the northern part of the village. Members of this village have a strong commitment to the system of \'Ayahan Desa\' - a philosophy committed to respecting the land on which the village stands. To concludes the day, we stop by at Tukad Cepung Waterfall. Well-guarded by the circular cliffs, this waterfall is difficult to locate for the first time visitor. The circular cliffs give you the feeling of being in a cave, while the open sky right from where the waterfall emerges, gives you the most enchanting view. The sunlight falls on the glistering waterfall creating a rainbow, which feels as though it is projected right up to you. If you have never seen water flowing from the sky, then this would be your chance! After spending your time there, we go back to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-16\", \"text\": \"Kelabang Moding, Banjar Bentuyung, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Blue Karma Dijiwa Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5144090,'453','Mrs. Patricia Cocostegui Garcia',30508,207262,'Ubud to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-18','2024-07-18','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',336000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-18\", \"text\": \"Kelabang Moding, Banjar Bentuyung, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"11:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Blue Karma Dijiwa Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-18\", \"text\": \"ETD 15.35 by Batik Air ID6335 to Labuan Bajo on 18 Jul\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5144095,'453','Mrs. Patricia Cocostegui Garcia',30699,203281,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-18','2024-07-19','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',1568000.00,'The hotel offers 92 Deluxe Rooms with 32 square meters of room size overlooking the garden and the beach. This room features stylish furniture, individual controlled air- conditioning, standing shower with hot and cold water, tea and coffee making facilities, safe deposit box, IDD telephone and cable TV, Free Wi-Fi internet in all room categories and hotel\'s public areas.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5144100,'453','Mrs. Patricia Cocostegui Garcia',32766,216810,'3D2N Open Trip Komodo - Lady Grace / Deluxe Cabin','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-07-19','2024-07-21','Guio','Tami',2,'Per Person (Min. 2 Person)',12840000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-19\", \"text\": \"Jl. Pantai Pede, Labuan Bajo, Kec. Komodo, Kabupaten Manggarai Barat, NTT\", \"time\": \"09:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Bintang Flores Hotel\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-21\", \"text\": \"ETD 16.00 by Super Air Jet IU727 to Surabaya on 21 Jul\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Labuan Bajo Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5144106,'453','Mrs. Patricia Cocostegui Garcia',32602,215975,'Single Villa','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-07-21','2024-07-24','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',18312000.00,'Each room offers the same comfort: one or two bedroom villas with terrace, swimming pool, kitchenette and office space, comfortable sunbeds, lovely coconut garden. Particular care to the quality of the beddings, the home stylist Valérie Barkowski has added her touch of originality with a predominant colour selection of orange, grey, red, green, bordeaux or black. Choose your holiday colour!',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5144112,'453','Mrs. Patricia Cocostegui Garcia',30508,207387,'Padang Bai to Sanur','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-24','2024-07-24','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-24\", \"text\": \"ETA 12.30 from Gili Air by Gili Gili Fast Boat\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-24\", \"text\": \"Jl. Danau Tamblingan No.89M, Sanur, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali 80228\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Maya Sanur Resort & Spa\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5144113,'453','Mrs. Patricia Cocostegui Garcia',30587,201629,'Wonderful Room Garden View','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-24','2024-07-25','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',4222400.00,'While each of these spacious rooms offer serene views of manicured gardens, the landscapes are best savoured from the comfort of your private balcony. To customise the space for a family or group stay, choose from either a king-size bed or two doubles, in addition to your room’s daybed. In the mornings, the sun\'s soft rays bathe your room with a dreamlike glow. A connecting door conceals an equally expansive and brightly-lit second room, giving you the option of spreading out your group for added privacy.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5144115,'453','Mrs. Patricia Cocostegui Garcia',30508,207269,'Sanur to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-25','2024-07-25','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-25\", \"text\": \"Jl. Danau Tamblingan No.89M, Sanur, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali 80228\", \"time\": \"15:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Maya Sanur Resort & Spa\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-25\", \"text\": \"ETD 18.55 by Qatar Airways QR963 to Doha on 25 Jul\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5144231,'454','Vanda Locati Ms. / Alessandra Amadei Ms.',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-12','2024-06-13','Ayu','Eddy',1,'Twin',784000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. - Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. ETA 17.00 by Batik Air ID6523 from Labuan Bajo on 12 June 2024 ETD 00.40 by Emirates EK359 to Dubai on 13 June 2024 PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK–IN','{\"date\": \"2024-06-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5144334,'455','Mrs. Katrin Rottmann',30805,212247,'SRG-PKN','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-02','2024-08-02','Yuli','Yuli',4,'Person',6848000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5144354,'455','Mrs. Katrin Rottmann',30805,212272,'PKN-SUB','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-06','2024-08-06','Yuli','Yuli',4,'Person',7276000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5144484,'456','Jairo Cano Valverde / Mireia Lucas Sanchez',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-11','2024-08-11','Guio','Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": \"ETD : 11 AUGUST 2024 / 18:35H / from Singapur / TR286 by Tiger Airways\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"AIRPORT DENPASAR\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": \"ROYAL CASA GANESHA ADDRESS : Jl. A.A. Gede Rai No.88, Lodtunduh, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571, Indonesia Phone : +62361 8493577 | Whatsapp: +62813-3750-4252\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5144600,'456','Jairo Cano Valverde / Mireia Lucas Sanchez',30771,217792,'Residence Room','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-08-11','2024-08-15','Guio','Eddy',1,'Double',5824000.00,NULL,NULL,'HONEY MOON','{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5144607,'456','Jairo Cano Valverde / Mireia Lucas Sanchez',30508,202864,'Goa Gajah – Tampaksiring – Gunung Kawi – Tegalalang','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-12','2024-08-12','Guio','Eddy',2,'Persons (2)',1691200.00,'We will be picking you up from your hotel to enjoy the wealth of art in Ubud. First we will visit Monkey Forest; the Ubud Monkey Forest is a nature reserve and temple complex in Ubud, Bali. It houses approximately 340 Crab-eating Macaque (Macacafas cicularis) monkeys. The Monkey Forest contains the Pura Dalem Agung Padangtegal temple as well as a \"Holy Spring\" bathing temple and another temple used for cremation ceremonies. Next we go to Ubud Traditional Art Market where the existence is not far different from other markets available in the tourism area. This market as a society economics center of Ubud and it is apposite to the existence of Ubud Empire that is called Puri Saren. Our last destination is Gua Gajah (Elephant Cave). This cave is built at crevasse edge from the federation of 2 rills that is called Pangkung River, where the irrigation is mixed with Petanu River flow. The word of Gua Gajah is anticipated coming from the word of Lwa Gajah, the name of Buddhist Temple or hermitage for Buddhist monk. There is a relief which is almost looking like the form of mountain on the entrance of this cave. It was carved many designed on the relief like grove with the stick, close leaf, animal for example forest pig, tortoise and specters. The cave mouth is decorated by the bas-relief with the eye turn around to the right or west side. At the end of tour we will transferred back you to the hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-12\", \"text\": \"ROYAL CASA GANESHA ADDRESS : Jl. A.A. Gede Rai No.88, Lodtunduh, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571, Indonesia Phone : +62361 8493577 | Whatsapp: +62813-3750-4252\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-12\", \"text\": \"ROYAL CASA GANESHA ADDRESS : Jl. A.A. Gede Rai No.88, Lodtunduh, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571, Indonesia Phone : +62361 8493577 | Whatsapp: +62813-3750-4252\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5144659,'456','Jairo Cano Valverde / Mireia Lucas Sanchez',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route (Templo Taman Ayun - Jatiluwih - Templo Ulun Danu Bratan - Tanah Lot )','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-13','2024-08-13','Guio','Eddy',2,'Persons (2)',1747200.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": \"ROYAL CASA GANESHA ADDRESS : Jl. A.A. Gede Rai No.88, Lodtunduh, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571, Indonesia Phone : +62361 8493577 | Whatsapp: +62813-3750-4252\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": \"ROYAL CASA GANESHA ADDRESS : Jl. A.A. Gede Rai No.88, Lodtunduh, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571, Indonesia Phone : +62361 8493577 | Whatsapp: +62813-3750-4252\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5144663,'456','Jairo Cano Valverde / Mireia Lucas Sanchez',30508,212412,'Ubud to Candidasa','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-15','2024-08-15','Guio','Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',616000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": \"ROYAL CASA GANESHA ADDRESS : Jl. A.A. Gede Rai No.88, Lodtunduh, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571, Indonesia Phone : +62361 8493577 | Whatsapp: +62813-3750-4252\", \"time\": \"12:00\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": \"HOTEL GENGGONG BALI ADDRESS : Jl.Puri Bagus, Candidasa, Sengkidu, Kec. Manggis, Kabupaten Karangasem, Bali 80871 Phone : +62 (0363) 4381005\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5144665,'457','Alberto Jose Herrera Martin',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-25','2024-06-25','Jacob','Praba',1,'Persons (2)',420000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-25\", \"text\": \"ETA 19:15pm byTK66 from Istanbul\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-25\", \"text\": \"Pertiwi Resort Ubud Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5144669,'456','Jairo Cano Valverde / Mireia Lucas Sanchez',30554,202023,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-15','2024-08-16','Guio','Eddy',1,'Double',1164800.00,'Ground floor room with modern Balinese interior with sea view. Option of king size bed or twin beds.',NULL,'HONEYMOON','{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5144677,'456','Jairo Cano Valverde / Mireia Lucas Sanchez',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-08-16','2024-08-16','Guio','Eddy',2,'Persons (2)',952000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": \"NUSA PENIDA PORT (departure time, 08.20)\", \"time\": \"08:20\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": \"SEMABU HILLS HOTEL NUSA PENIDA Address : Jl. Raya Toya Pakeh - Ped, Dusun Sebunibus, Sakti, Kec. Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771 Phone : +62 (0361) 6204400\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5144679,'457','Alberto Jose Herrera Martin',30768,201345,'1 Bedroom Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,5,'2024-06-25','2024-06-30','Jacob','Praba',1,'Double',8700000.00,'This spacious villa comes with a private pool with sun loungers and a terrace. With a generous 120 sqm size, guests will be pampered with modern amenities such as air conditioner, a personal safe, a flat-screen TV, electric kettle, and a spacious bath area that is completed with a bath tub and a shower. A perfect choice for honeymoon.',NULL,'Honeymooner','{\"date\": \"2024-06-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5144686,'457','Alberto Jose Herrera Martin',30508,202893,'Lempuyang Temple Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI11',1,'2024-06-26','2024-06-26','Jacob','Praba',2,'Persons (2)',1920000.00,'At the agreed time, our guide will pick you up to start the tour in the eastern part of Bali. The first place you will visit is Goa Lawah Temple. Goa Lawah Temple consists of two names, \"Goa\" which means cave and \"Lawah\" which means bat. Several thousand bats are flying in the cave as the name suggests. With the lights fading as you go deeper inside the cave, it gives off a very strange atmosphere. From Goa Lawah, we continue our way to Lempuyang Temple. Upon arrival, the temple will greet you with its gratifying panorama that extends into infinity. On a clear, sunny day, you\'ll be able to gaze out over the mountains, Amlapura city, and Mount Agung, an incredibly magnificent sight that\'s beautiful beyond words. This portrait of heaven is beautifully framed by the Gapura Candi Bentar (the gate of the temple). Our journey continues to visit Tirta Gangga. The site is a paradise surrounded by water, with all the pools decorated with unusual statues. With its seclusion and a view of the surrounding rice paddies, Tirta Gangga is a wonderful place. At the end of the trip we go to Tenganan Village, the most famous Bali Agas (the “original” Bali people) in the city. With its characteristics, the city village is arranged in parallel along the wide main road paved with rows of cobblestones. In Tenganan, women still weave the famous Kamben Geringsing, or \"burnt cloth,\" which has the power to immunize the wearer against evil. We take a close look at what they do in their daily lives in a traditional lifestyle. From Tenganan, we will transfer you to the hotel.','1D Tour Tenganan – Playa Virgin - Templo Lempuyang','1D Tour Tenganan – Playa Virgin - Templo Lempuyang','{\"date\": \"2024-06-26\", \"text\": \"Pertiwi Resort Ubud Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-26\", \"text\": \"Pertiwi Resort Ubud Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5144690,'456','Jairo Cano Valverde / Mireia Lucas Sanchez',31285,208028,'Suite Room with Ocean View','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-08-16','2024-08-18','Guio','Eddy',1,'Double',3651200.00,'With 100 sqm of space, this suite comfortably accommodates up to 2 adults. It comes with air conditioning, a flat-screen TV with international channels, and a personal safe. The suite has a dining area and coffee/tea making facilities. Bathroom is fitted with separate toilet and shower. Fresh towels and bed linens are provided.',NULL,'Vouchers must be presented upon check-in and the hotel will there for invoice with in the 7 days period if credit facility has been extended by the hotel.','{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5144720,'456','Jairo Cano Valverde / Mireia Lucas Sanchez',30508,207337,'Snorkeling to Nusa Penida (from Nusa Penida) (Sharing Trip)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-17','2024-08-17','Guio','Eddy',2,'Persons (2)',1232000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-17\", \"text\": \"SEMABU HILLS HOTEL NUSA PENIDA Address : Jl. Raya Toya Pakeh - Ped, Dusun Sebunibus, Sakti, Kec. Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771 Phone : +62 (0361) 6204400\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-17\", \"text\": \"SEMABU HILLS HOTEL NUSA PENIDA Address : Jl. Raya Toya Pakeh - Ped, Dusun Sebunibus, Sakti, Kec. Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771 Phone : +62 (0361) 6204400\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5144764,'456','Jairo Cano Valverde / Mireia Lucas Sanchez',30649,204187,'One Bedroom Pool Lagoon','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-08-18','2024-08-21','Guio','Eddy',1,'Double',4200000.00,'This room is perfect for travelers or business people! With a room area of ​​25m2 and equipped with a double / single bed, air conditioning controller, LED TV and high speed internet access. This modern designed bathroom is also equipped with a shower and toiletries to complete your needs during your stay at our hotel.',NULL,'HONEYMOON','{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5145492,'456','Jairo Cano Valverde / Mireia Lucas Sanchez',30508,207386,'Padang Bai to Seminyak','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-21','2024-08-21','Guio','Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": \"Padang Bai (Central Bali) / 12:25 BY BLUE WATER\", \"time\": \"12:25\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": \"KAYUMAS SEMINYAK RESORT ADDRESS : Jl. Pura Telaga Waja No.18a, Kerobokan Kelod, Kec. Kuta Utara, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361, Indonesia P: +62361 9348348\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5145494,'459','Mr. Javier Gil Serrano',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-10','2024-06-10','Jacob','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',420000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-10\", \"text\": \"ETA 08.25 by IB0886 from Doha on 10 Jun 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-10\", \"text\": \"Jl. Suweta Banjar Bentuyung Ubud, Ubud, Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Wapa di Ume Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5145496,'456','Jairo Cano Valverde / Mireia Lucas Sanchez',30798,201630,'One Bedroom Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-21','2024-08-22','Guio','Eddy',1,'Double',1579200.00,'The two-story, 45 sqm One Bedroom Suite features an natural and airy interior, complemented with modern furnishings and views overlooking to the private terrace with a plunge pool. Floor-to-ceiling glass doors provide generous natural lighting and a dynamic ambience. Plush linens and a marble bathroom surround guests in elegance.',NULL,'HONEYMOON','{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5145500,'456','Jairo Cano Valverde / Mireia Lucas Sanchez',30508,207270,'Seminyak to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-22','2024-08-22','Guio','Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-22\", \"text\": \"KAYUMAS SEMINYAK RESORT ADDRESS : Jl. Pura Telaga Waja No.18a, Kerobokan Kelod, Kec. Kuta Utara, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361, Indonesia P: +62361 9348348\", \"time\": \"10:30\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-22\", \"text\": \"ETD : 22 AUGUST 2024 / 14:25H to Singapore / TR285 by Tiger Airways\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"AIRPORT DENPASAR\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5145503,'459','Mr. Javier Gil Serrano',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-11','2024-06-11','Jacob','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1872000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-11\", \"text\": \"Jl. Suweta Banjar Bentuyung Ubud, Ubud, Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Wapa di Ume Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5145504,'459','Mr. Javier Gil Serrano',30508,202894,'Kehen Temple - Pengelipuran - Tukad Cepung Waterfall','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-12','2024-06-12','Jacob','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1680000.00,'Our wonderful tour starts from Kehen Temple. It is an ancient Hindu temple complex boasting unique architectural features. The staircases reaching from the ground to temple courtyard are carved sandstone mythical animal and Balinese folklore figure statues and also the central vestibule. The temple’s walls are also ornate with Chinese porcelain plates, which are a tribute to the historical relations between the local Bali kingdom and China. Afterwards, we continue to Penglipuran, a village that succeeded in preserving its 75-hectare bamboo forest located in the northern part of the village. Members of this village have a strong commitment to the system of \'Ayahan Desa\' - a philosophy committed to respecting the land on which the village stands. To concludes the day, we stop by at Tukad Cepung Waterfall. Well-guarded by the circular cliffs, this waterfall is difficult to locate for the first time visitor. The circular cliffs give you the feeling of being in a cave, while the open sky right from where the waterfall emerges, gives you the most enchanting view. The sunlight falls on the glistering waterfall creating a rainbow, which feels as though it is projected right up to you. If you have never seen water flowing from the sky, then this would be your chance! After spending your time there, we go back to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-12\", \"text\": \"Jl. Suweta Banjar Bentuyung Ubud, Ubud, Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Wapa di Ume Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5145505,'457','Alberto Jose Herrera Martin',30508,202864,'Ubud and Surrounding Tour','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-27','2024-06-27','Jacob','Praba',2,'Persons (2)',1812000.00,'We will be picking you up from your hotel to enjoy the wealth of art in Ubud. First we will visit Monkey Forest; the Ubud Monkey Forest is a nature reserve and temple complex in Ubud, Bali. It houses approximately 340 Crab-eating Macaque (Macacafas cicularis) monkeys. The Monkey Forest contains the Pura Dalem Agung Padangtegal temple as well as a \"Holy Spring\" bathing temple and another temple used for cremation ceremonies. Next we go to Ubud Traditional Art Market where the existence is not far different from other markets available in the tourism area. This market as a society economics center of Ubud and it is apposite to the existence of Ubud Empire that is called Puri Saren. Our last destination is Gua Gajah (Elephant Cave). This cave is built at crevasse edge from the federation of 2 rills that is called Pangkung River, where the irrigation is mixed with Petanu River flow. The word of Gua Gajah is anticipated coming from the word of Lwa Gajah, the name of Buddhist Temple or hermitage for Buddhist monk. There is a relief which is almost looking like the form of mountain on the entrance of this cave. It was carved many designed on the relief like grove with the stick, close leaf, animal for example forest pig, tortoise and specters. The cave mouth is decorated by the bas-relief with the eye turn around to the right or west side. At the end of tour we will transferred back you to the hotel.',NULL,'1D Tour Tegalalang – Swing - Tirta Empul – Templo Gunung Kawi','{\"date\": \"2024-06-27\", \"text\": \"Pertiwi Resort Ubud Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-27\", \"text\": \"Pertiwi Resort Ubud Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5145506,'459','Mr. Javier Gil Serrano',30508,207262,'Ubud to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-15','2024-06-15','Jacob','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',360000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-15\", \"text\": \"Jl. Suweta, Bentuyung Sakti, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"07:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Adiwana Suweta\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-15\", \"text\": \"ETD 10.35 by Wings Air IW1832 to Tambolaka on 15 Jun\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5145508,'457','Alberto Jose Herrera Martin',30508,202882,'The Mother Temple Besakih and Surrounding','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-28','2024-06-28','Jacob','Praba',2,'Persons (2)',1848000.00,'The first destination is Kusamba Beach, it is one of the favorite places of interest in Bali which is famous with the beautiful beach, we can also meet a fish market in this place which is usually held between 10 am until 4 pm. Then we go to Goa Lawah, this is one of the favourite place to be visited, because here is a nature cave dwelt by thousands of tail bat located at north side from Jeroan/center of Goa Lawah Temple. Next we go to Bukit Jambul, it is strategically located beside of the main road from Denpasar to Besakih Temple and it is one of the tourist destinations that visited on Besakih Tour. It is situated in the plateau area which is blessed with the beautiful panorama of rice terrace and green coconuts three unfolding to the sea. After visit Bukit Jambul, we’ll continue to Besakih Temple is the biggest Hindu temple in Bali which the local people call Pura Besakih. It owns beautiful view from the top of temple area where we can see the wide nature panorama until to the ocean so that’s why this temple is many visited by tourists from all over the world. Then go to Kertagosa, This place also owns Taman Gili, a building floating or sees like floating because it is intentionally founded in the middle of a fish pond.',NULL,'1D tour Templo Besakih - Templo Kehen – Penglipuran Village','{\"date\": \"2024-06-28\", \"text\": \"Pertiwi Resort Ubud Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-28\", \"text\": \"Pertiwi Resort Ubud Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5145511,'457','Alberto Jose Herrera Martin',30508,207379,'Ubud to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-30','2024-06-30','Jacob','Praba',1,'Persons (2)',600000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-30\", \"text\": \"Pertiwi Resort Ubud Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-30\", \"text\": \"ETD 08:30am to Gili Trawangan by Gili Gili Fast Boat\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5145512,'456','Jairo Cano Valverde / Mireia Lucas Sanchez',30508,217820,'Candidasa to Kusamba','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-16','2024-08-16','Guio','Eddy',2,'Person (1)',600000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": \"HOTEL GENGGONG BALI ADDRESS : Jl.Puri Bagus, Candidasa, Sengkidu, Kec. Manggis, Kabupaten Karangasem, Bali 80871 Phone : +62 (0363) 4381005\", \"time\": \"06:30\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": \"KUSAMBA Kusamba - Nusa Penida (departure time, 08.00) BY THE ANGKAL\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5145514,'459','Mr. Javier Gil Serrano',32859,217252,'Studio Room','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-06-15','2024-06-18','Jacob','Tami',1,'Double',0.00,NULL,NULL,'Honeymooners','{\"date\": \"2024-06-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5145517,'459','Mr. Javier Gil Serrano',30528,215614,'Weekuri Lake - Mandorak Beach - Ratenggaro Village - Sunset in Pero Beach','Confirmed','SW1.1FD',1,'2024-06-16','2024-06-16','Jacob','Tami',2,'Persons (2-3)',3480000.00,'Pick Up Time : 09.00 AM Pick Up / Drop Off Place : Hotel in South-West Sumba (Mario Hotel, Ella Hotel, Maringi Eco Resort, Sinar Tambolaka Hotel, Cap Karoso Resort, The Sima Hotel) *Other places or hotel, please contact us. You will begin our journey at Mandorak Beach. The beach will provide a great and peaceful stay with nice spots. The big opening between two rock ridges will let the clear blue water pass through the beach and also let you look far into the ocean. When you are there, you can also take the higher ground, which will give you a view of the coastline and the rocky cliffs. After Mandorak Beach, you will go to Weekuri Lake. This saltwater lake is located southwest of Sumba. You can go diving to experience the blue and clear water of Weekuri as well as to cool off. Ratenggaro Village will be up next. Here, you will see the traditional high-roofed houses (actually the highest rooftops in all of Sumba), made all by hand and traditionally. This village is the only one of a few traditional villages left in the area, and while the village is just a compound of some houses, each house can accommodate up to 50 family members. During the harvesting season, however, most of the villagers will stay in their fields to work and only leave the elders and children in the village. This village is beautiful because it is built in front of the beach. After visiting the village, you will go to Pero Beach to enjoy the sunset. Meals : Lunch Box',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-16\", \"text\": \"Pantai Karoso, Ate Dalo, Kec. Kodi, Kabupaten Sumba Barat Daya, Nusa Tenggara Tim\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Resort Cap Karoso\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5145518,'459','Mr. Javier Gil Serrano',30528,215622,'Praijing Village - Lapopu Waterfall','Confirmed','WS1.2HD',1,'2024-06-17','2024-06-17','Jacob','Tami',2,'Persons (2-3)',3420000.00,'Pick Up Time : 09.00 AM Pick Up / Drop Off Place : Waikabubak, Lamboya, Wanokaka Area (West Sumba) - Sumba Nautil Resort, Nihiwatu Resort, Lelewatu Resort, Rua Beach Resort, Alamayah Resort, The Sanubari Resort, Morika Hotel, Manandang Hotel, La Casa de Luna. *Other places or hotel, please contact us. After your breakfast at the hotel, you will be heading to another beautiful village, Praijing village. This village is built on top of a hill, and if you want to walk through the entire village, you actually have to walk down the hill. You will have an overview of the entire village at the entrance. On top of that, the inhabitants of the village built a spot where you can have a panoramic view of the village and beyond. The village is also surrounded by the beautiful nature of Sumba. Next on your adventure will be the Lapopu Waterfall. After a drive through the endless hilly and green landscape of Sumba, you will arrive near the waterfall. To visit the waterfall, you will need to do a short hike of approximately 15 minutes and cross a bamboo bridge to get there. There is a nice spot to sit down where you can watch the water find its way down the hill. You can also bring your swimming clothes to take a dive in the water just in front of the big waterfall. Meals : No Meals',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-17\", \"text\": \"Pantai Karoso, Ate Dalo, Kec. Kodi, Kabupaten Sumba Barat Daya, Nusa Tenggara Tim.\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Resort Cap Karoso\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5145520,'459','Mr. Javier Gil Serrano',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-18','2024-06-19','Jacob','Tami',1,'Double',840000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. - Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK–IN','{\"date\": \"2024-06-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5145522,'459','Mr. Javier Gil Serrano',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-06-19','2024-06-21','Jacob','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',10800000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan isCape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continueto add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-06-19\", \"text\": \"ETA 07.15 by Batik Air ID6202 from Jakarta on 19 Jun\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pangkalan Bun Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-21\", \"text\": \"ETD 08.50 by Batik Air ID6134 to Surabaya on 21 Jun\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5145529,'459','Mr. Javier Gil Serrano',30508,216161,'Uluwatu to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-23','2024-06-23','Jacob','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',420000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-23\", \"text\": \"Jl. Pura Kulat, Pecatu, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80362\", \"time\": \"05:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Grün Resort Uluwatu\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-23\", \"text\": \"ETD 09.55 by IB887 to Doha on 23 Jun\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5145543,'457','Alberto Jose Herrera Martin',30647,203898,'One Bedroom Villa','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-30','2024-07-01','Jacob','Praba',1,'Double',1848000.00,'Experience your own tranquil retreat in our 60 sqm One Bedroom Villa, tastefully furnished and featuring all the best facilities and amenities you would expect from an ASTON hotel. Laze, sunbathe or take a dip in your own private pool enclosed for your privacy. With a king-size bed and plush bedding, these villas are perfect for honeymooners or couples looking for a romantic escape.',NULL,'A valid voucher is required prior to guest\'s arrival or upon guest\'s check in. Failure to provide a valid voucher before guest\'s departure will be automatically switched to normal published rate and payment will be on guest personal account.','{\"date\": \"2024-06-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5145545,'457','Alberto Jose Herrera Martin',30647,203898,'One Bedroom Villa','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-07-01','2024-07-03','Jacob','Praba',1,'Double',4536000.00,'Experience your own tranquil retreat in our 60 sqm One Bedroom Villa, tastefully furnished and featuring all the best facilities and amenities you would expect from an ASTON hotel. Laze, sunbathe or take a dip in your own private pool enclosed for your privacy. With a king-size bed and plush bedding, these villas are perfect for honeymooners or couples looking for a romantic escape.',NULL,'A valid voucher is required prior to guest\'s arrival or upon guest\'s check in. Failure to provide a valid voucher before guest\'s departure will be automatically switched to normal published rate and payment will be on guest personal account.','{\"date\": \"2024-07-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5145547,'457','Alberto Jose Herrera Martin',30508,207385,'Padang Bai to Nusa Dua','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-03','2024-07-03','Jacob','Praba',1,'Persons (2)',600000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-03\", \"text\": \"ETA 12:30PM by Gili Gili Fast Boat from Gili Trawangan\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-03\", \"text\": \"Merusaka Nusa Dua Kawasan Wisata Nusa Dua Lot S-3, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Dua\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5145551,'457','Alberto Jose Herrera Martin',30914,202449,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,5,'2024-07-03','2024-07-08','Jacob','Praba',1,'Double',11700000.00,'The room is spacious at 48 sqm with king and twin size beds capacity of 2 (two) adults and 2 (two) child below 12 years old, decked with combination of Balinese-modern contemporary elements, immaculately designed to characterize each of Seven Balinese Goddesses. Located on a higher level of each Puri, the room is equipped with every amenity that could possibly be required, making it ideal for a single traveler or couples.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5145553,'457','Alberto Jose Herrera Martin',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-04','2024-07-04','Jacob','Praba',2,'Persons (2)',1872000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-04\", \"text\": \"Merusaka Nusa Dua Kawasan Wisata Nusa Dua Lot S-3, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Dua\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-04\", \"text\": \"Merusaka Nusa Dua Kawasan Wisata Nusa Dua Lot S-3, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Dua\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5145558,'457','Alberto Jose Herrera Martin',30508,202897,'Uluwatu Temple and Kecak Dance','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-05','2024-07-05','Jacob','Praba',2,'Persons (2)',2556000.00,'This half-day tour, is an exciting tour package to visit Padang-Padang Beach, Uluwatu Temple, the famous Balinese Hindu Temple in south part of Bali with breathtaking view of sunset and Indian Ocean. Uluwatu Temple is one of Balinese Hindu Temples located right on the petrifying hill with the crevasse exist in the right and left side. Uluwatu Temple is one of Sad Khayangan (6 biggest temple in Bali) owns magnificent view of the Indian Ocean and sunset as a backdrop. This temple is very amazing where the location is right on the narrow peninsula with deep seawater under it. This tour package is combined with the spectacular Balinese traditional dance performance of Kecak Dance. Balinese Kecak Dance is a spectacular traditional dance with the group of people playing this dance with fire game. It is very exciting and unique dance due to the sound of gamelan is not using the normal gamelan but use their mouth. The dancers make the compact choir with the exquisite dance movement that is one of this dance features. After the dance we returned back to the hotel or seafood restaurant in Jimbaran.',NULL,'Include Dinner Jimbaran','{\"date\": \"2024-07-05\", \"text\": \"Merusaka Nusa Dua Kawasan Wisata Nusa Dua Lot S-3, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung\", \"time\": \"15:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Dua\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-05\", \"text\": \"Merusaka Nusa Dua Kawasan Wisata Nusa Dua Lot S-3, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Dua\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5145572,'457','Alberto Jose Herrera Martin',30508,212475,'Nusa Dua to Sanur','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-06','2024-07-06','Jacob','Praba',1,'Persons (2)',300000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-06\", \"text\": \"Merusaka Nusa Dua Kawasan Wisata Nusa Dua Lot S-3, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Dua\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-06\", \"text\": \"ETD 08:15AM by The Angkal Fast Boat to Nusa Penida\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sanur Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5145577,'462','Pascal Gerard Alain HEINTZ',30671,200626,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-10','2024-09-11','Ayu','Ayu',1,'Double',1120000.00,'Deluxe Room with a room area of 28 square meters each, there are 2 types of bed, king and twin bed with a size of 28 square meters each.',NULL,'Check-in time 14.00 Check-out time 12.00','{\"date\": \"2024-09-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5145579,'457','Alberto Jose Herrera Martin',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-07-06','2024-07-06','Jacob','Praba',2,'Persons (2)',1020000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-06\", \"text\": \"ETA 09:15AM by The Angkal Fast Boat from Sanur\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sanur Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-06\", \"text\": \"ETD 16:30PM by The Angkal Fast Boat to Sanur\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Banjar Nyuh Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5145581,'462','Pascal Gerard Alain HEINTZ',31158,204266,'Meet & Greet International Flight Departure - for CGK','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-11','2024-09-11','Ayu','Ayu',1,'Person (1)',280000.00,'Meet and greet service specializes in pick-up services for flight arrivals which includes arranging a meeting between the customer and the Hotel Representative / Hotel Transportation Staff./Pick-Up. For international departure. Meet & Greet International Airport: - Meet guests at the specified location at the entrance to the area Departure - Greet by using the guests name board. - Accompanying guests through security checks at the entrance. - Accompanying and assisting in the process of validating vaccine certificate documents and checking other documents needed at the airport. - Accompany and help for the Check-in process. - Accompanying and assisting guests for Airport Tax / Passenger Service Fee payments. - Accompanying and assisting guests to the departure lounge determined.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5145583,'461','IVANA MORILLAS',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-13','2024-07-13','Nicholas','Komang',1,'Persons (1-4)',420000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-13\", \"text\": \"ETD : 14.35 by Lion Air JT922 from Surabaya on 13 July 2024\", \"time\": \"14:35\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-13\", \"text\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud, Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 972385\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5145609,'461','IVANA MORILLAS',30508,202883,'Ubud Electric Bike Tour','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-15','2024-07-15','Nicholas','Komang',4,'Persons (4)',2649600.00,'We offer the best way to experience a bike tour Ubud. Electric bike! A mix between riding a motorcycle and a bicycle, the electric bicycle is the best of both worlds. easily while pedaling through the hills, magnificent rice terraces and villages. Our local guides will give you knowledge of Bali more than just landscapes. We will have 2 hours of cycling trip out of the busy center of Ubud through the village of Mambal, where you can see the unique Subak at work and stroll around the rustic and lush surroundings. While you ride your bike you will see beautiful rice fields, dams and waterfalls, we make a stop on the Ayung River, go through the Bali Green School and go through small villages. Our local guides have an intimate knowledge about the entire route. After your bike ride, a healthy lunch is served in a traditional Balinese house.',NULL,'Please ready on hotel lobby at 08.00 schedule to maximize everyone\'s enjoyment, it\'s important to note : cannot keep other participants waiting for late arrivals. please well prepare & early breakfast in the hotel.','{\"date\": \"2024-07-15\", \"text\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud, Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 972385\", \"time\": \"08:15\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-15\", \"text\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud, Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 972385\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5145649,'461','IVANA MORILLAS',30508,207278,'Full Day Tour Car & Driver (8-10 hours)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-16','2024-07-16','Nicholas','Komang',1,'Persons (4)',900000.00,NULL,NULL,'Not include Entrance fee, Ticket, parking','{\"date\": \"2024-07-16\", \"text\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud, Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 972385\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-16\", \"text\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud, Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 972385\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07