 solo traveler or a romantic getaway at 150 sqm private property. The spacious bedroom features a king-size bed with an extra thick mattress with 100% cotton linen, ensuring a blissful sleep. With high-ceilings, large windows, and a pivoting door onto your patio, the space is able to breathe whilst being basked in a beautiful, natural light. The ensuite bathroom, equipped with a bespoke basin area, rainfall shower, quality toiletries and 100% cotton towels leads out to the real star of this villa, the indulgent open-air bathtub. Large enough for two, with views of your private pool and tropical garden, while away hours in pure relaxation.',NULL,'Honeymooners','{\"date\": \"2024-07-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5147003,'468','Daniel Wollaston Mclean',31703,208681,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-23','2024-06-24','Melysa','Komang',1,'Single',1119600.00,'We offer 42 cozy superior rooms with a floor area of 25 square meters. Choose from double bed or twin single beds, with maximum capacity for 2 adults and 1 child. In-room dining is available round the clock. This room are equipped with individually controlled air-conditioning, IDD telephone, LCD TV with international channels, high-speed internet access, personal in-room safety box, coffee and tea making facilities, mini-bar, hairdryer, shower, and many more.',NULL,'please consult your departure time upon check-in','{\"date\": \"2024-06-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5147035,'467','Mrs. Susana Vierimaa Cestino',30508,212301,'Padang Bai to Uluwatu','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-15','2024-07-15','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',5