and luxurious fittings create an oasis of calm and privacy.','These rates are applicable for the capacity specified, non-commissionable and inclusive of breakfast, 10% service charge and 11% government tax.',NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5147144,'465','Mr. Cesar Lledo & pty',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-13','2024-08-13','Nicholas','Febrina',4,'Persons (4)',2832000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,'FD Tour Taman Ayun - Jatiluwih - Ulun Danu Bratan Temple - Tanah Lot, with Spanish speaking guide','{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": \"Br. Tanggayuda, Kedewatan, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali 80571. Phone:+62361 978123\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Tanggayuda\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": \"Br. Tanggayuda, Kedewatan, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali 80571. Phone:+62361 978123\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Tanggayuda\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5147152,'465','Mr. Cesar Lledo & pty',30508,202896,'Transfer Airport - Ubud','Confirmed','C2I-BALI05',1,'2024-08-12','2024-08-12','Nicholas','Febrina',4,'Persons (4)',4320000.00,'At 08.00 am, we pick you up from your hotel and start our journey to Tunjuk Village in Tabanan district. Upon arrival, you will be greeted with open arms and with the warm smiles of the locals you meet along the way. You\'ll meet in the outer courtyard of the village temple and meet your local guides. Throughout the hike you will meet people from the village involved in the tasks that keep their lives busy day in and day out. You can choose to observe or participate in them to gain a better understanding of village life. The mighty water buffalo is still used to drag the plough through the muddy rice paddies and prepare the land for planting. Or maybe you want to help with planting or harvesting, depending on the time of year. When you complete the tour in the rice paddies, you\'ll follow your guide on a path through lush gardens where villagers go about their daily chores. There are women who beat the rice with heavy mallets to remove the hooves. After lunch we leave Tunjuk Village and continue our journey to visit THE TANAH LOT. We\'ll close the visit by watching the sunset at the most famous and photographed temple in Bali. Torn from the earth on a stone pedestal sculpted by the incoming tides, the solitary black towers of Tanah Lot and the plumes of foliage spilling over the precipices, recall the delicacy of Chinese painting. The Pura Tanah Lot or the Earth Temple in the middle of the sea was built in the 16th century. At the end of the day, you\'ll be transferred to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-12\", \"text\": \"ETA 14:00 from Surabaya by Lion Air JT804 on 12 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Denpasar Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-12\", \"text\": \"Br. Tanggayuda, Kedewatan, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali 80571. Phone:+62361 978123\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Tanggayuda\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5147158,'465','Mr. Cesar Lledo & pty',30508,207262,'Ubud to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-16','2024-08-16','Nicholas','Febrina',4,'Persons (1-4)',3360000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": \"Br. Tanggayuda, Kedewatan, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali 80571. Phone:+62361 978123\", \"time\": \"04:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Tanggayuda\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": \"ETD 08:00 to Labuan Bajo by Batik Air ID6333\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Denpasar Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5147357,'396','JOSE ANGEL RECIO SACRISTA',30771,213054,'Deluxe Garden View','Confirmed',NULL,5,'2024-07-31','2024-08-05','Jacob','Eddy',2,'Double + Twin',15600000.00,'At 34 m2 room size, a room with a balcony overlooking lush greenery. It features a seating area and a private bathroom with a shower and complimentary bathroom amenities. This will be the place where you come home after an exciting day in Ubud and where you rest after a fun day swimming in the pool.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5147715,'470','Eric LE C