cation\": \"ARTOTEL Sanur - Bali\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5148542,'469','Mr. Miguel Ignacio Porto Requena',30508,207269,'Sanur to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-06','2024-07-06','Igo','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-06\", \"text\": \"Jl. Kusuma Sari No.1, Sanur, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali 80227\", \"time\": \"15:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"ARTOTEL Sanur - Bali\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-06\", \"text\": \"ETD 18.55 by Qatar Airways QR963 to Doha on 06 Jul\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5148665,'472','Cyril STEINER',30508,207278,'CAR TRANSFER HOTEL - EBIKE - HOTEL','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-05','2024-09-05','Ayu','Wiwik',1,'Persons (2)',560000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-05\", \"text\": \"Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar\", \"time\": \"07:30\", \"locality\": \"Cendana Resort & Spa Ubud\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-05\", \"text\": \"Jalan Tirta Tawar, Kutuh Kaja, Ubud\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"eBikes Bali\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5148979,'473','Alessia Atzori & Charlon Tabone',30654,203007,'Premier Beachfront Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-09-19','2024-09-21','Ayu','Eddy',1,'Double',4144000.00,'Overlooking the pristine beach of Gili Trawangan island, this room offers 75 square meters space with a mini living room. The room features an attached bathroom with a bathtub, hairdryer, shower and free toiletries are provided in the semi open private bathroom. Complementary facilities and amenities including a hi-speed Wi-Fi Connection, LCD TV with International channels, coffee and tea maker, and personal safe deposit box.',NULL,'HONEYMOON','{\"date\": \"2024-09-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5149006,'332','Xpert Holidays Group 12-13 July',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-12','2024-07-13','Rendy','Eddy',1,'Single',784000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. Flight details: ETA 13.10 by Cathay Pacific CX777 from Hong Kong on 12 July 2024 ETD 10.00 by Batik Air ID6674 to Tarakan on 13 July 2024','{\"date\": \"2024-07-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5149023,'473','Alessia Atzori & Charlon Tabone',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-09-16','2024-09-16','Ayu','Eddy',2,'Persons (2)',952000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-16\", \"text\": \"ETA : Nusa Penida, ETA 08.20 BY THE ANGKAL\", \"time\": \"08:20\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-16\", \"text\": \"ETD : Nusa Penida, ETD 16.00 BY THE ANGKAL \\\"Note: 16.00 is last departure time\\\"\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5149120,'458','Fran Zarnitzky',30620,211743,'Premier Room','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-08-06','2024-08-09','Nicholas','Febrina',1,'Twin',3960000.00,'8 units of 29 sqm each premier rooms with valley view and garden are modern‐minimalism designed. Advance facilities such as LCD TV, coffee/tea maker, balcony/terrace, safety deposit box, minibar, And complete bathroom facilities.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5149134,'474','Emilio Spreafico',31106,203998,'Premium Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-26','2024-06-27','Ayu','Eddy',1,'Double',868000.00,'With a lot of style and floor-to-ceiling windows, enjoy a dream stay in a room full of comforts, including a king-size bed, desk, armchair and an attractive marble bathroom with an open shower. A room designed to inspire maximum well-being. Inside the room have flat-screen TV, high-speed Wi-Fi, refrigerator.',NULL,'Flight Information: ETA 11.55 by JT891 from Gorontalo on 26 June 2024 ETD 09.05 by JT742 to Manado on 27 June 2024','{\"date\": \"2024-06-26\", \"text\": \"ETA 11.55 by JT891 from Gorontalo on 26 June 2024\", \"time\": \"11:55\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-27\", \"text\": \"ETD 09.05 by JT742 to Manado on 27 June 2024\", \"time\": \"07:05\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5149189,'458','Fran Zarnitzky',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-06','2024-08-06','Nicholas','Febrina',2,'Persons (1-3)',840000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-06\", \"text\": \"ETA 17:45 by Lion Air JT920 from Surabaya on 06 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Denpasar Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pertiwi Bisma 2 Hotel Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5149242,'458','Fran Zarnitzky',30596,201103,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-08-09','2024-08-11','Nicholas','Febrina',1,'Twin',6000000.00,'Experience timeless elegance in our Deluxe Room. Perfect for couples or solo travelers seeking a spacious single/double bed. Our room offers premium linens, plush pillows, and a peaceful ambiance. Enjoy high-speed internet, a flat-screen TV, coffee and tea-making facilities, and an in-room safe deposit box, ensuring a convenient and enjoyable stay. Unwind on the balcony overlooking the pool, to recharge after a day of activities.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5149246,'458','Fran Zarnitzky',30508,207270,'Seminyak to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-11','2024-08-11','Nicholas','Febrina',1,'Persons (1-3)',300000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'Flight details: Fran: ETD 12:55 by Malaysia Airlines MH714 to Kuala Lumpur on 11 Aug Natasha: ETD 11:55 by Jetstar JQ40 to Sydney on 11 Aug','{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Bali Niksoma Beach Boutique Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Denpasar Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5149314,'469','Mr. Miguel Ignacio Porto Requena',30672,200747,'Studio 30 (Deluxe) Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-24','2024-06-25','Igo','Tami',1,'Double + Double',750400.00,'Studio 30 (Deluxe) room with 25 sqm sized room, and exclusive ARTOTEL bedding collection, with facilities 43\" inch lcd tv, 24 hours in-room service, high speed internet wi-fi, safety deposit box, hair dryer.',NULL,NULL,'{\