tures a modern shower cubicle enclosed in glass together with a marble vanity.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5149389,'469','Mr. Miguel Ignacio Porto Requena',30705,201148,'Premier Room Rice Field View','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-06-29','2024-07-02','Igo','Tami',2,'Double + Double',8568000.00,'Gaze out at rippling rice fields as you let your stress slip away in one of our Premier Ricefield View suites. Inside you have smooth tiles, warm wooden accents, and all the modern comforts you could ask for. Step onto the balcony and you have an airy nook where you can witness life unfold in the Balinese countryside.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5149393,'469','Mr. Miguel Ignacio Porto Requena',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-30','2024-06-30','Igo','Tami',3,'Persons (3)',2016000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-30\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5149820,'469','Mr. Miguel Ignacio Porto Requena',30649,204187,'One Bedroom Pool Lagoon','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-07-02','2024-07-05','Igo','Tami',2,'Double + Twin',8400000.00,'This room is perfect for travelers or business people! With a room area of ​​25m2 and equipped with a double / single bed, air conditioning controller, LED TV and high speed internet access. This modern designed bathroom is also equipped with a shower and toiletries to complete your needs during your stay at our hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5149821,'473','Alessia Atzori & Charlon Tabone',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-15','2024-09-15','Ayu','Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-15\", \"text\": \"ETA 19.15 by Turkish TK66 from Istanbul on 15 September 2024\", \"time\": \"19:15\", \"locality\": \"AIPORT DENPASAR\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-15\", \"text\": \"Tejaprana Resort & Spa Address : Jl. Raya Tegallalang, Banjar Sapat, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80561 Phone: (0361) 9080939\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5149823,'469','Mr. Miguel Ignacio Porto Requena',31024,203296,'Studio 30 Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-05','2024-07-06','Igo','Tami',1,'Double',1400000.00,'Our 81 units Studio 30 Room with 30 sqm of room area, adopts kites as it\'s main concept. This room is a canvas that showcases thought-provoking artworks by some of the most relevant Bali-based contemporary artists. This air-conditioned studio features a 49\" inch LED TV, high speed internet Wi-Fi, 24 hours in-room service, iPod dock, dolce gusto coffee maker, a minibar, en-suite bathroom comes with a shower, a hairdryer, free toiletries, and many more.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5149825,'472','Cyril STEINER',30508,202890,'Mount Batur Sunrise Trekking Tour','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-06','2024-09-06','Ayu','Wiwik',2,'Persons (2)',1120000.00,'Enjoy trek or climb Mount Batur and see the sunrise from the top of Batur Volcano. The Batur Volcano is one of the sacred mountain according to Hindu believe. We will get in ahead of schedule morning around 02.00 am depend the area of you stay, and afterward we specifically going to Mount Batur starting point. Starting in the dark under starlight sky, you will be guided to ascend the slope of Mount Batur. You will approach the peak of Mount Batur (1717 meters) at about 06.00 am. While waiting for the sunrise you will have a simple breakfast and hot coffee or tea served by your guide in Mount Batur. Witness the breathtaking sunrise overlooking the majestic view of Lake Batur and Mount Rinjani. After witnessing the sunrise, continue for our descent, at about 9 am, you will be arriving at the finishing point.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5149826,'473','Alessia Atzori & Charlon Tabone',30508,213032,'Ubud to Kusamba','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-16','2024-09-16','Ayu','Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-16\", \"text\": \"Tejaprana Resort & Spa Address : Jl. Raya Tegallalang, Banjar Sapat, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80561 Phone: (0361) 9080939\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": \"MEET AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-16\", \"text\": \"ETD : Kusamba - Nusa Penida, ETD 08.00 by the angkal\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"KUSAMBA PORT\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5149827,'472','Cyril STEINER',30508,212535,'PRIVATE CAR TRANSFER TO BATUR TREKKING','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-06','2024-09-06','Ayu','Wiwik',1,'Persons (1-3)',616000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-06\", \"text\": \"Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar\", \"time\": \"02:00\", \"locality\": \"Cendana Resort & Spa Ubud\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Cendana Resort & Spa Ubud\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5149834,'473','Alessia Atzori & Charlon Tabone',30508,207379,'Ubud to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-