KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-05\", \"text\": \"ETA 10.20 by Nam Air IN196 from Semarang on 05 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pangkalan Bun Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-07\", \"text\": \"ETD 10.50 by Nam Air IN193 to Surabaya on 07 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5154234,'484','Ms. Lidia Margalef Garcia',31015,203232,'3D2N - Surabaya Mount Bromo Ijen Tour Package drop Bali','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-09-07','2024-09-09','Nicholas','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',8880000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-07\", \"text\": \"ETA 12.00 by Nam Air IN193 from Pangkalan Bun on 07 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Juanda International Airport Surabaya\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-09\", \"text\": \"Jl. Banjar Penestanan Kaja, Sayan, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud Heaven Penestanan Villas Bali\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5154242,'484','Ms. Lidia Margalef Garcia',30673,200559,'Deluxe Double Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-07','2024-09-08','Nicholas','Tami',1,'Double',1260000.00,'Designed to capture nature vibes. Slide open the door to your private terrace to 