t time is 12:00. - Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK–IN','{\"date\": \"2024-07-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5154414,'485','Mr. Roberto Saenz',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-07-31','2024-08-02','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',10080000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan isCape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continueto add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-07-31\", \"text\": \"ETA 07.15 by Batik Air ID6202 from Jakarta on 31 Jul\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pangkalan Bun Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-02\", \"text\": \"ETD 08.50 by Batik Air ID6134 to Surabaya on 02 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5154426,'485','Mr. Roberto Saenz',30728,207487,'Exploring North Lombok (Beaches, Mountain, Waterfalls, Sembalun)','Confirmed','EXC 11',1,'2024-08-03','2024-08-03','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',2072000.00,'This journey will impress you from the start, driving through many kinds the vegetation such as rice fields, villages, rice terraces, forest and hills before reach flat valley of Sembalun, surrounded by the massive of the great Rinjani volcano. Pusuk Pass is a viewpoint elevated more than 1000m above sea level and overseeing Sembalun Village. Monkeys from the nearby Forest also love the views, but more the views of your bags, food and belongings. Please be very aware! Passing by Sasak villages, Lawang & Bumbung. We may have chance to visit Beleq Village, an abandoned traditional Sasak Village and trek Selong Hill to enjoy unique panorama of plantations. Local people here work as farmers who used to plant, many kinds of vegetables and fruits. If you are lucky you may pick strawberry in the season. Next destination is the Sendang Gile Waterfall (125m), set among tranquil lush surroundings. A lunch will be served at local restaurant. On the way back to your hotel, you will pass by the northern coastline which dominated the beautiful black sands and stop by at Malimbu hill for picture taking.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-03\", \"text\": \"Jalan Pantai Senggigi, Senggigi, Kec. Batu Layar, Kabupaten Lombok Barat\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Merumatta Senggigi Lombok\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5154432,'485','Mr. Roberto Saenz',32920,218074,'Seaview Bungalow','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-08-02','2024-08-04','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',4278400.00,NULL,NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-08-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5154435,'485','Mr. Roberto Saenz',30852,202033,'Villa Surya - One Bedroom Private Pool and Tropical Garden','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-08-04','2024-08-06','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',8736000.00,'Our cozy one bed Villa Surya is perfect for a solo traveler or a romantic getaway at 150 sqm private property. The spacious bedroom features a king-size bed with an extra thick mattress with 100% cotton linen, ensuring a blissful sleep. With high-ceilings, large windows, and a pivoting door onto your patio, the space is able to breathe whilst being basked in a beautiful, natural light. The ensuite bathroom, equipped with a bespoke basin area, rainfall shower, quality toiletries and 100% cotton towels leads out to the real star of this villa, the indulgent open-air bathtub. Large enough for two, with views of your private pool and tropical garden, while away hours in pure relaxation.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-08-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5154437,'485','Mr. Roberto Saenz',30508,207384,'Padang Bai to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-06','2024-08-06','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-06\", \"text\": \"ETA 12.30 from Gili Air by Gili Gili Fast Boat on 06 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-06\", \"text\": \"Jl. Suweta, Bentuyung Sakti, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5154485,'455','Mrs. Katrin Rottmann',31196,204663,'President Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-08-06','2024-08-08','Yuli','Yuli',1,'Double + Twin',9720000.00,'Room type president suite, with spacious room 5,15 m x 7,20 m and have type bed king size and twin. This type of room is available on the 5th floors and has jacuzzi for 4 - 5 persons, living room, and hills view.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5154496,'455','Mrs. Katrin Rottmann',30714,200733,'Villa Menteng','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-08-08','2024-08-10','Yuli','Yuli',1,'Double + Twin',8568000.00,'This villa features air conditioning and flat-screen TV with maximum 4 pax for this villa. Non smoking room with garden view from the balcony. Telephone, wardrobe and desk available inside the villa. Free toiletries, towels, and shower for private bathroom.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5154502,'455','Mrs. Katrin Rottmann',30679,200609,'Deluxe Ocean Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-08-10','2024-08-12','Yuli','Yuli',2,'Double + Twin',8329664.00,'Wake up to stunning beach and ocean views, featuring a spacious open-concept bedroom and bathroom, extending out to a private balcony with daybed. Room includes a desk and a small sofa.',NULL,'Deluxe Ocean View Room - Connecting Room if possible / Side by side','{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5154511,'485','Mr. Roberto Saenz',30985,203053,'One Bedroom Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-08-06','2024-08-09','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',13104000.00,'Offering terraced areas equipped with sunbeds and umbrellas with views on the jungle. Guests enjoy a private pool. The villa is fitted with a flat-screen cable TV, an iPod dock, a minibar, a coffee machine and a personal safe. It has a seating area, a dining room and a bathroom with a bath and a shower. Extras include a hairdryer, robes, slippers and free toiletries. Guests enjoy free daily permaculture course of making soil bed, composting and planting. Guests enjoy 30% discount on spa treatments',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5154526,'485','Mr. Roberto Saenz',30508,215968,'Goa Gajah - Tampaksiring - Gunung Kawi Sebatu Temple - Tegalalang','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-07','2024-08-07','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',2128000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-07\", \"text\": \"Jl. Suweta, Bentuyung Sakti, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5154533,'485','Mr. Roberto Saenz',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-08','2024-08-08','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1747200.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": \"Jl. Suweta, Bentuyung Sakti, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5154541,'485','Mr. Roberto Saenz',30508,207262,'Ubud to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-09','2024-08-09','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-09\", \"text\": \"Jl. Suweta, Bentuyung Sakti, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"06:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-09\", \"text\": \"ETD 10.35 by Wings Air IW1832 to Tambolaka on 09 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5154562,'485','Mr. Roberto Saenz',32859,217252,'Studio Room','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-08-09','2024-08-13','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',36512000.00,NULL,NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-08-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5154574,'485','Mr. Roberto Saenz',30508,212290,'Airport to Legian','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-13','2024-08-13','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": \"ETA 13.55 by Wings Air IW1833 from Tambolaka on 13 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": \"Jl. Padma Utara Jl. Raya Legian, Legian, Kec. Kuta, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Bali Niksoma Boutique Beach Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5154577,'485','Mr. Roberto Saenz',30596,201103,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-13','2024-08-14','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',2800000.00,'Experience timeless elegance in our Deluxe Room. Perfect for couples or solo travelers seeking a spacious single/double bed. Our room offers premium linens, plush pillows, and a peaceful ambiance. Enjoy high-speed internet, a flat-screen TV, coffee and tea-making facilities, and an in-room safe deposit box, ensuring a convenient and enjoyable stay. Unwind on the balcony overlooking the pool, to recharge after a day of activities.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5154580,'485','Mr. Roberto Saenz',30508,212566,'Legian to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-14','2024-08-14','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": \"Jl. Padma Utara Jl. Raya Legian, Legian, Kec. Kuta, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": \"20:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Bali Niksoma Boutique Beach Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": \"ETD 01.05 by Qatar Airways QR0961 to Doha on 15 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5154704,'452','Alvaro WINZER',30974,202964,'Deluxe Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-07-11','2024-07-15','Guio','Wiwik',1,'Double',23856000.00,'At 340 sqm room size, the Deluxe Pool Villa is encompassed within the secured confines of a private Balinese compound. It commands breathtaking views of the tropical greenery that lines the banks of the Ayung River in rural Ubud. A separate living environment is bathed in sunlight as is the bedroom that comes complete with its own spa-styled Balinese bathroom. A natural stone swimming pool and sun terrace lends itself to pleasurable relaxation time amidst the raw beauty of the Ubud countryside.',NULL,'\"PLEASE NOTE THEY\'RE HONEYMOONER\"','{\"date\": \"2024-07-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5154707,'452','Alvaro WINZER',30508,202882,'The Mother Temple Besakih - Bulit Jambul - Goa Gajah','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-12','2024-07-12','Guio','Wiwik',2,'Persons (2)',1724800.00,'The first destination is Kusamba Beach, it is one of the favorite places of interest in Bali which is famous with the beautiful beach, we can also meet a fish market in this place which is usually held between 10 am until 4 pm. Then we go to Goa Lawah, this is one of the favourite place to be visited, because here is a nature cave dwelt by thousands of tail bat located at north side from Jeroan/center of Goa Lawah Temple. Next we go to Bukit Jambul, it is strategically located beside of the main road from Denpasar to Besakih Temple and it is one of the tourist destinations that visited on Besakih Tour. It is situated in the plateau area which is blessed with the beautiful panorama of rice terrace and green coconuts three unfolding to the sea. After visit Bukit Jambul, we’ll continue to Besakih Temple is the biggest Hindu temple in Bali which the local people call Pura Besakih. It owns beautiful view from the top of temple area where we can see the wide nature panorama until to the ocean so that’s why this temple is many visited by tourists from all over the world. Then go to Kertagosa, This place also owns Taman Gili, a building floating or sees like floating because it is intentionally founded in the middle of a fish pond.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-12\", \"text\": \"Kedewatan, Ubud, Gianyar Regency, Bali 80571 Phone: (0361) 980022\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"The Royal Pita Maha Ubud\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"The Royal Pita Maha Ubud\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5154712,'452','Alvaro WINZER',30508,202892,'PURA SADA - ANGSERI - BATUKARU Y JATILUWIH','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-13','2024-07-13','Guio','Wiwik',2,'Persons (2)',1747200.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-13\", \"text\": \"Kedewatan, Ubud, Gianyar Regency, Bali 80571, Phone: (0361) 980022\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"The Royal Pita Maha Ubud\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-13\", \"text\": \"Kedewatan, Ubud, Gianyar Regency, Bali 80571, Phone: (0361) 980022\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"The Royal Pita Maha Ubud\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5154718,'452','Alvaro WINZER',30508,202894,'GUNUNG KAWI - TIRTA EMPUL - KINTAMANI','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-14','2024-07-14','Guio','Wiwik',2,'Persons (2)',1568000.00,'Our wonderful tour starts from Kehen Temple. It is an ancient Hindu temple complex boasting unique architectural features. The staircases reaching from the ground to temple courtyard are carved sandstone mythical animal and Balinese folklore figure statues and also the central vestibule. The temple’s walls are also ornate with Chinese porcelain plates, which are a tribute to the historical relations between the local Bali kingdom and China. Afterwards, we continue to Penglipuran, a village that succeeded in preserving its 75-hectare bamboo forest located in the northern part of the village. Members of this village have a strong commitment to the system of \'Ayahan Desa\' - a philosophy committed to respecting the land on which the village stands. To concludes the day, we stop by at Tukad Cepung Waterfall. Well-guarded by the circular cliffs, this waterfall is difficult to locate for the first time visitor. The circular cliffs give you the feeling of being in a cave, while the open sky right from where the waterfall emerges, gives you the most enchanting view. The sunlight falls on the glistering waterfall creating a rainbow, which feels as though it is projected right up to you. If you have never seen water flowing from the sky, then this would be your chance! After spending your time there, we go back to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-14\", \"text\": \"Kedewatan, Ubud, Gianyar Regency, Bali 80571, Phone: (0361) 980022\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"The Royal Pita Maha Ubud\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-14\", \"text\": \"Kedewatan, Ubud, Gianyar Regency, Bali 80571, Phone: (0361) 980022\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"The Royal Pita Maha Ubud\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5154721,'452','Alvaro WINZER',30508,202896,'TAMAN AYUN-ALAS KEDATON-TANAH LOT-ULUWATU TEMPLE-DINNER JIMBARAN','Confirmed','C2I-BALI05',1,'2024-07-15','2024-07-15','Guio','Wiwik',2,'Persons (2)',2441600.00,'At 08.00 am, we pick you up from your hotel and start our journey to Tunjuk Village in Tabanan district. Upon arrival, you will be greeted with open arms and with the warm smiles of the locals you meet along the way. You\'ll meet in the outer courtyard of the village temple and meet your local guides. Throughout the hike you will meet people from the village involved in the tasks that keep their lives busy day in and day out. You can choose to observe or participate in them to gain a better understanding of village life. The mighty water buffalo is still used to drag the plough through the muddy rice paddies and prepare the land for planting. Or maybe you want to help with planting or harvesting, depending on the time of year. When you complete the tour in the rice paddies, you\'ll follow your guide on a path through lush gardens where villagers go about their daily chores. There are women who beat the rice with heavy mallets to remove the hooves. After lunch we leave Tunjuk Village and continue our journey to visit THE TANAH LOT. We\'ll close the visit by watching the sunset at the most famous and photographed temple in Bali. Torn from the earth on a stone pedestal sculpted by the incoming tides, the solitary black towers of Tanah Lot and the plumes of foliage spilling over the precipices, recall the delicacy of Chinese painting. The Pura Tanah Lot or the Earth Temple in the middle of the sea was built in the 16th century. At the end of the day, you\'ll be transferred to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-15\", \"text\": \"Kedewatan, Ubud, Gianyar Regency, Bali 80571 Phone: (0361) 980022\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": \"The Royal Pita Maha\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-15\", \"text\": \"Jl. Buana Sari, Pecatu, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361, Phone: 0813-5302-5682\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Gypsea Bali Pecatu\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5155436,'166','Solitude Adventures Group',32922,218094,'The Signature Sea View','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-10','2024-09-11','Ayu','Tami',1,'Single',2884000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5155618,'166','Solitude Adventures Group',32922,218095,'Airport Transfer','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-10','2024-09-10','Ayu','Tami',1,'Per Car',252000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5155646,'452','Alvaro WINZER',31174,218096,'Bungalow With Private Pool','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-07-15','2024-07-17','Guio','Wiwik',1,'Double',7857920.00,NULL,NULL,'\"PLEASE NOTED THEY\'RE HONEYMOONER\"','{\"date\": \"2024-07-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5155671,'452','Alvaro WINZER',31595,207432,'Package E - Snorkeling with Manta Rays & Mangrove Tour','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-16','2024-07-16','Guio','Wiwik',2,'Person (1)',1008000.00,'This package its the best way to enjoy the snorkeling around the 3 island of Paradise and also to explore the beautiful of Lembongan island. We provide you the best program for the day Snorkeling the boat around beautiful 3 island. Snorkeling is included as part of each Lembongan day trip and we have full time snorkeling guides who will help you with your equipment. In the water, we have full time supervision by our trained staff; we also have life jackets and flotation devices for those that are not so comfortable in the water. Additional information : If you haven\'t paid for retribution on your arrival to the island, please add retribution during check-out on the purchasing page. - For pick-up service on same day only available for booking before 6am - Please note that the itinerary may be adjusted at the last minute in order to keep you safe from the strong swells of the Indian Ocean. If this happens, we will go to Crystal bay, Toyapakeh wall bay and Mangrove point. - Please note that seeing or snorkeling with the manta rays is not always guaranteed on every tour, as it depends on weather and water conditions','Duration : 3 hour (approx) Min. Order : 2 person Location : Lembongan, Bali, Indonesia',NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-16\", \"text\": \"ETA: 09.00 by Glory Fast Boat from Sanur\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": \"Jungut Batu Harbour\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-16\", \"text\": \"ETD: 16.00 by Glory Fast Boat to Sanur\", \"time\": \"15:30\", \"locality\": \"Jungut Batu Harbour\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5155748,'452','Alvaro WINZER',30508,212545,'Pecatu to Sanur','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-16','2024-07-16','Guio','Wiwik',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-16\", \"text\": \"Jl. Buana Sari, Pecatu, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361 Phone: 0813-5302-5682\", \"time\": \"05:30\", \"locality\": \"Gypsea Bali Hotel\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-16\", \"text\": \"ETD Fast Boat 08.30 by Glory Fast Boat to Nusa Lembongan\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Sanur Harbour\", \"location\": null}','2026-0