 sleeps 3 guests with a queen size bed and an extra bed. The interior design borrows elements of the South East Asian and colonial styles. The en-suite bathroom is a voluminous outdoor space with coconut trees and stars in lieu of a roof. Some of the facilities available for this type of villa are: Privare swimming pool, double sunbed, living room area, air-conditioning, fully-stocked fridge, coffee table and chairs, luxurious furniture, tea and coffee making facilities, sofa bed, wardrobe, En-suite outdoor bathroom with freshwater showers, daily complimentary breakfast, and complimentary drinking water.',NULL,'\"PLEASE NOTED THEY\'RE HONEYMOONER\"','{\"date\": \"2024-07-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5155813,'452','Alvaro WINZER',30508,212287,'Airport to Sanur','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-19','2024-07-19','Guio','Wiwik',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-19\", \"text\": \"ETA: 14.50 by Wings Air IW1859 from Lombok on 19 July 2024\", \"time\": \"14:50\", \"locality\": \"Airport Ngurah Rai (Domestic)\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-19\", \"text\": \"Jl. Pantai Sindhu, Sanur, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali 80228, Phone: (0361) 286222\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Villa Mahapala\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5155835,'452','Alvaro WINZER',30508,207269,'Sanur to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-20','2024-07-20','Guio','Wiwik',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-20\", \"text\": \"Jl. Pantai Sindhu, Sanur, Denpas