n\": \"Padang Bai Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5156008,'489','Mrs. Ana Moraleda Torres',32607,215994,'Deluxe Suite','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-07-19','2024-07-22','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',5376000.00,'At 38 m2 room size, welcome to the Deluxe suite with ocean view. Sleep soundly during your trip to one of Gili Islands in Lombok, West Nusa Tenggara, Indonesia in our deluxe suite room, which is designed in a modern style and features a comfortable king bed, spacious, and individually designed.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-07-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5156023,'489','Mrs. Ana Moraleda Torres',30508,207386,'Padang Bai to Seminyak','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-22','2024-07-22','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-22\", \"text\": \"ETA 12.30 from Gili Air by Gili Gili Fast Boat\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-22\", \"text\": \"Jl. Pura Telaga Waja No.18A, Kerobokan Kelod, Kec. Kuta Utara, Kabupaten Badung\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kayumas Seminyak Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5156027,'489','Mrs. Ana Moraleda Torres',30798,201630,'One Bedroom Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-22','2024-07-23','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',1579200.00,'The two-story, 45 sqm One Bedroom Suite features an natural and airy interior, complemented with modern furnishings and views overlooking to the private terrace with a plunge pool. Floor-to-ceiling glass doors provide generous natural lighting and a dynamic ambience. Plush linens and a marble bathroom surround guests in elegance.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-07-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5156029,'489','Mrs. Ana Moraleda Torres',30508,207270,'Seminyak to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-23','2024-07-23','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',224000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-23\", \"text\": \"Jl. Pura Telaga Waja No.18A, Kerobokan Kelod, Kec. Kuta Utara, Kabupaten Badung\", \"time\": \"11:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kayumas Seminyak Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-23\", \"text\": \"ETD 16.00 by Cathay Pacific CX784 to Hong Kong on 23 Jul\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5156052,'490','RUBEN PEREZ ARIAS',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Taman Ayun-Bedugul-Twin Lake-Danu Beratan-Munduk Waterfall)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-27','2024-06-27','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (2)',1064.00,NULL,NULL,'Please ready on hotel Lobby for pickup at 08.00','{\"date\": \"2024-06-27\", \"text\": \"Grand Bali Nusa Dua, Jalan Raya Nusa Dua Selatan, Jl. Nusa Dua No.8, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80363 Telepon: (0361) 776688\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Dua\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-27\", \"text\": \"Cempaka Belimbing Villas, Jalan Raya Belimbing, Banjar Suradadi, Belimbing Village, Pupuan, Belimbing, Tabanan, Tabanan Regency, Bali 82163 Telepon: 0851-0045-1178\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pupuan\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5156065,'490','RUBEN PEREZ ARIAS',32587,215893,'Deluxe Rice Field View','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-27','2024-06-28','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',1062880.00,'Total 5 Luxury traditional Rice Fields view villas in Balinese village style, the suite contains an large spacious bathroom and each bathroom has different size, complete with hot and cold shower. Adjoining is a spacious bedroom and living room with complete seating table, mini bar, private coding safety deposit box, large cupboard and satellite TV. Each villa has large verandah with outstanding Rice Fields view where guest can seat and relax or even day dreaming.',NULL,'\"HONEYMOONER\"','{\"date\": \"2024-06-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5156066,'436','SERGIO SHOR JINICH',31083,212380,'3D2N LOB Rinca - Padar - Komodo Island Tour (Medium Standard B. - Purisari, etc)','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-08-04','2024-08-06','Nicholas','Eddy',3,'Persons (2-3)',38646000.00,'TOUR ITINERARY Highlights: Menjarite, Kelor, Kalong, Rinca, Padar, Komodo island, Pink Beach, Taka Makassar, Manta Point, Kanawa, Batu Cermin Mirror Cave DAY 1 : DENPASAR - LABUAN BAJO - MENJARITE - PADAR - KELOR - KALONG ISLAND Arrival at Komodo Airport in Labuan Bajo west Flores, meeting service with our tour guide and transfer to the pier of Labuan Bajo for Rinca Island. It’s about 2 hours sail to the island of Komodo Dragon, stop at Menjarite island for snorkeling then continue to Rinca island-the Island of Komodo dragon, you will find not just e Dragons but also many wild animals like, deer, wild buffalo, long-tailed macaque and wild pig also numerous of birds. Keep your eyes look up as sometime you will find the young Komodo dragons on the trees. A local ranger will lead you through this natural preservation. Late afternoon sailing directly to Kalong Rinca Island to see the hundreds of fling foxes set out from the mangrove tree at 06-07 pm, the lovely sunset from the boat trip really enjoyable here. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Boat Cabin Air Conditioning DAY 2 : KALONG - PADAR - KOMODO - PINK BEACH - MANTA POINT - TAKA MAKASSAR - LABUAN BAJO After having breakfast in your boat, heading to Padar Island, taking trek to Padar Island until having the top view point to get breathtaking scenery of three bays around, Padar Island hike in Komodo has some of the most amazing views in Indonesia, trek to downhill and back to the Boat for sailing directly to Loh Liang – the Ranger station in Komodo Island. By passing through many small islands, After registering start to take basic trekking to see the GIANT RIZARD / KOMODO DRAGON and other wild animals as: Timor deer, wild pig, wild chicken and many variously of tropical bird. Please keep your look at any directions as sometimes you will also find young Komodo dragon hanging over the trees. A local ranger will be led you during the trek. Return to the boat on to Pink beach for snorkeling, swimming and relaxing. It is really spectacular and unspoiled coral reef and many color fish. This is one of best side for snorkeling diving. Sail toward MANTA POINT to exploring Huge Mantas by snorkeling even watching from your boat trip (can’t be guaranteed if weather is not good, like wave and current are strongly) visit also the taka Makaasar its really tiny island with white sand beach really enjoyable to relaxing or beach walking then heading to Labuan bajo for overnight and dinner at above hotel list option. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner DAY 3 : LABUAN BAJO - DENPASAR After breakfast taking your next excursion with visiting local marke and Batu Cermin (Mirror Stone) Cave. The grotto is 75 by 75 meters large, and contains stalactites and stalagmites. Some tunnels are narrow and dark but in others sunlight falls, then process to the airport for flight to Denpasar or to your next destination. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch Attention: The itinerary is subject to change due to the weather, tide level and operating conditions without prior notice.',NULL,'ETA : 04AUG - 0910 From Denpasar ID6333 by Batik Air ETD : 06AUG - 1335 to Denpasar ID6330 by Batik Air','{\"date\": \"2024-08-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5156083,'490','RUBEN PEREZ ARIAS',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Trekking Belimbing - Hot Spring Banjar - Budhis Temple )','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-28','2024-06-28','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (2)',0.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-28\", \"text\": \"Cempaka Belimbing Villas, Jalan Raya Belimbing, Banjar Suradadi, Belimbing Village, Pupuan, Belimbing, Tabanan, Tabanan Regency, Bali 82163 Telepon: 0851-0045-1178\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pupuan\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-28\", \"text\": \"Aneka Lovina Villas & Spa, Jl. Raya Kalibukbuk Lovina Beach Anturan, Anturan, Kec. Banjar, Kabupaten Buleleng, Bali 81151 Telepon: (0362) 41121\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Lovina\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5156120,'490','RUBEN PEREZ ARIAS',31181,204546,'Cottage Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-28','2024-06-29','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',784000.00,'28 Cottage Rooms, designed with tropical Balinese style with western comfort, this room is spacious and features a private balcony. Also comes with a TV, minibar and safety deposit box. Private bathrooms provide shower facilities and hairdryers.','Contract Rates are based on per room per night including of 21% government tax & service charge.','\"HONEYMOONER\"','{\"date\": \"2024-06-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5156772,'490','RUBEN PEREZ ARIAS',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Taman Bedji Temple