om gives you a modern look with a warm Balinese ambiance that makes it even more inviting and comfortable.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5156944,'491','Fanny Tonello',30508,212289,'Airport to Nusa Dua','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-26','2024-09-26','Ayu','Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-26\", \"text\": \"ETA 08.35 from Bima IW1827 by Wings Air\", \"time\": \"08:35\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-26\", \"text\": \"Hotel Nikko Bali Benoa Beach Address: Jl. Pratama No.68X, Tanjung, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80363 Phone : (0361) 773577\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5156945,'491','Fanny Tonello',30508,207268,'Nusa Dua to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-26','2024-09-26','Ayu','Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-26\", \"text\": \"ETD 21.20 by Turkish Airlines TK67 to Istanbul\", \"time\": \"18:00\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5156951,'492','Eduardo Gregorio Sainz',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-19','2024-07-19','Jacob','Wiwik',1,'Persons (4-6)',840000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-19\", \"text\": \"ETA: 22.05 by QZ810 from Jakarta on 19 July 2024\", \"time\": \"22:05\", \"locality\": \"Airport Ngurah rai (Domestic)\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-19\", \"text\": \"Address: Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571, Phone: (0361) 972385\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5156958,'492','Eduardo Gregorio Sainz',30705,201147,'Premier Room Garden View','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-07-19','2024-07-23','Jacob','Wiwik',2,'Double',13104000.00,'Get back to nature in one of our Premier Garden View suites. These spacious, light-filled rooms have beautiful Balinese double doors that can be closed to create a cool air-conditioned space or opened to merge indoor and outdoor living. The balconies overlook the resort’s lush gardens, which are awash in tropical flowers and foliage.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5156962,'492','Eduardo Gregorio Sainz',30508,202882,'Cascada Tegenungan-Tirta Empul-Kintamani-Templo Besakih','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-20','2024-07-20','Jacob','Wiwik',4,'Persons (4)',2784000.00,'The first destination is Kusamba Beach, it is one of the favorite places of interest in Bali which is famous with the beautiful beach, we can also meet a fish market in this place which is usually held between 10 am until 4 pm. Then we go to Goa Lawah, this is one of the favourite place to be visited, because here is a nature cave dwelt by thousands of tail bat located at north side from Jeroan/center of Goa Lawah Temple. Next we go to Bukit Jambul, it is strategically located beside of the main road from Denpasar to Besakih Temple and it is one of the tourist destinations that visited on Besakih Tour. It is situated in the plateau area which is blessed with the beautiful panorama of rice terrace and green coconuts three unfolding to the sea. After visit Bukit Jambul, we’ll continue to Besakih Temple is the biggest Hindu temple in Bali which the local people call Pura Besakih. It owns beautiful view from the top of temple area where we can see the wide nature panorama until to the ocean so that’s why this temple is many visited by tourists from all over the world. Then go to Kertagosa, This place also owns Taman Gili, a building floating or sees like floating because it is intentionally founded in the middle of a fish pond.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-20\", \"text\": \"Address: Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571, Phone: (0361) 972385\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-20\", \"text\": \"Address: Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571, Phone: (0361) 972385\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5156965,'492','Eduardo Gregorio Sainz',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route (Taman Ayun-Jatiluwih-Ulundanu Beratan-Tanah Lot)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-21','2024-07-21','Jacob','Wiwik',4,'Persons (4)',2832000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-21\", \"text\": \"Address: Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571, Phone: (0361) 972385\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-21\", \"text\": \"Address: Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571, Phone: (0361) 972385\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5156973,'492','Eduardo Gregorio Sainz',30508,202882,'Tenganan – Templo Lempuyang – Tirta Gangga','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-23','2024-07-23','Jacob','Wiwik',4,'Persons (4)',2784000.00,'The first destination is Kusamba Beach, it is one of the favorite places of interest in Bali which is famous with the beautiful beach, we can also meet a fish market in this place which is usually held between 10 am until 4 pm. Then we go to Goa Lawah, this is one of the favourite place to be visited, because here is a nature cave dwelt by thousands of tail bat located at north side from Jeroan/center of Goa Lawah Temple. Next we go to Bukit Jambul, it is strategically located beside of the main road from Denpasar to Besakih Temple and it is one of the tourist destinations that visited on Besakih Tour. It is situated in the plateau area which is blessed with the beautiful panorama of rice terrace and green coconuts three unfolding to the sea. After visit Bukit Jambul, we’ll continue to Besakih Temple is the biggest Hindu temple in Bali which the local people call Pura Besakih. It owns beautiful view from the top of temple area where we can see the wide nature panorama until to the ocean so that’s why this temple is many visited by tourists from all over the world. Then go to Kertagosa, This place also owns Taman Gili, a building floating or sees like floating because it is intentionally founded in the middle of a fish pond.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-23\", \"text\": \"Address: Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571, Phone: (0361) 972385\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-23\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Bunutan Amed Ababi Abang Karangasem Bali, Jl. Raya Lipah, Bunutan, Kec. Abang, Kabupaten Karangasem, Bali 80852, Phone: 0813-3840-5335\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Puri Wirata Dive Resort and Spa\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5156975,'492','Eduardo Gregorio Sainz',31677,218118,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-07-23','2024-07-27','Jacob','Wiwik',2,'Double',7680000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5156978,'492','Eduardo Gregorio Sainz',30508,213365,'Amed to Kusamba','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-24','2024-07-24','Jacob','Wiwik',1,'Persons (4-6)',1680000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-24\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Bunutan Amed Ababi Abang Karangasem Bali, Phone: 0813-3840-5335\", \"time\": \"05:00\", \"locality\": \"Puri Wirata Dive Resort and Spa\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-24\", \"text\": \"ETD Fast Boat 08.00 AM by The Angkal fast boat to Nusa Penida.\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Kusamba Harbour\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5156983,'492','Eduardo Gregorio Sainz',30508,207337,'Snorkeling in Nusa Penida','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-24','2024-07-24','Jacob','Wiwik',4,'Persons (4)',2160000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-24\", \"text\": \"by The Angkal fast Boat from Kusamba\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"Sampalan Harbour\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-24\", \"text\": \"ETD Fast Boat 16.00 by The Angkal to Kusamba.\", \"time\": \"15:00\", \"locality\": \"Sampalan Harbour\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5157013,'492','Eduardo Gregorio Sainz',30508,212301,'Kusamba to Amed','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-24','2024-07-24','Jacob','Wiwik',1,'Persons (4-6)',1140000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-24\", \"text\": \"By The Angkal Fast Boat from Nusa Penida\", \"time\": \"16:30\", \"locality\": \"Kusamba Harbour\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-24\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Bunutan Amed Ababi Abang Karangasem Bali, Phone: 0813-3840-5335\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Puri Wirata Dive Resort and Spa\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5157033,'492','Eduardo Gregorio Sainz',31661,208444,'Snorkeling in Amed','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-25','2024-07-25','Jacob','Wiwik',4,'Per Person (Min. 2 Person)',3456000.00,'Amed 1 Day SCUBA Diving Trips Amed is located 30 minutes south of Tulamben, on Bali’s north east coast. Because Amed has dive sites for both recreational SCUBA diving and muck diving (for those interested in macro photography), please be sure to let us know what you are most interested in seeing! With its variety of sites and both shore and boat diving, Amed is a great area for a One Day Dive Trip. Conditions here are very calm, thus Amed is great for children, snorkelers, and guests doing Discover Scuba Diving. Amed itself is lovely and quiet for those looking for a relaxing day out. The reefs just offshore from the quiet fishing and salt-panning village of Amed yield many unexpected treasures. Due to the easy conditions at Amed, it is suitable both for novice and experienced divers. The water temperature can be affected by thermoclines, and the visibility is usually 14-22M. The better known sites in the area are Amed Wall, Amed Reef and Lipah Bay which is 3km to the southeast of Amed and has a 20m coral-encrusted wreck of a steel freighter.',NULL,'Please be ready at the lobby on 09: 00 AM - 09.15 AM Pick up/Drop Off Point: Puri Wirata Dive Resort and Spa Jl. Raya Bunutan Amed Ababi Abang Karangasem Bali Phone: 0813-3840-5335','{\"date\": \"2024-07-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5157056,'492','Eduardo Gregorio Sainz',30508,213365,'Amed to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-27','2024-07-27','Jacob','Wiwik',1,'Persons (4-6)',1680000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-27\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Bunutan Amed Ababi Abang Karangasem Bali, Phone: 0813-3840-5335\", \"time\": \"10:00\", \"locality\": \"Puri Wirata Dive Resort and Spa\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-27\", \"text\": \"ETD fast Boat 13.30 by Gili Gili Fast Boat to Gili Air\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Padang Bai Harbour\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5157091,'492','Eduardo Gregorio Sainz',31150,204228,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-07-27','2024-07-31','Jacob','Wiwik',2,'Double',8640000.00,'Standard guest rooms are a 12 tropical theme single room accommodation offering a queen-sized bed and twin bed, a coffee maker, mini-refrigerator, a flat-screen TV and all our signature features and amenities. The large bathrooms offer a tropical walk-in shower. Great for couple on romantic escape, our Standard Rooms are the ideal choice for an affordable stay in Gili Air.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5157098,'492','Eduardo Gregorio Sainz',30728,207377,'The Southern Gilis Tour (Nanggu, Sudak, Kedis)','Confirmed','EXC 09',1,'2024-07-28','2024-07-28','Jacob','Wiwik',4,'Persons (3-5)',4512000.00,'Discover the beauty of the New Generation of Gili islands in development. We sail from Batu Kijuk harbor, by traditional motorized outriggers to pristine islands and beaches, amazing snorkeling and no mass tourism on these pearls of islands. On your way to the islands we stop off at the village of Banyumulek to see the Sasak women producing earthenware pottery, as they have done for generations. We then reach the harbor for the trip to Gili Nanggu, an exotic small island with the turquoise water and magnificent aquatic life. We do some island hopping to Gili Sudak where a delicious lunch awaits you in Nirvana Gili Sudak and free at own your leisure. Then, continue to Gili Kedis, a tiny island with the white sand beach where you can get absolute relaxation of the day. On the way back to your hotel, you may stop by at Mareje hill for picture taking.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-28\", \"text\": \"Dusun Gili Air, Desa Gili Indah, Lombok, Gili Indah, Pemenang, North Lombok Regency, West Nusa Tenggara 83352 Phone: +6287728432363\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"Royal Regantris Villa Karang\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-28\", \"text\": \"Dusun Gili Air, Desa Gili Indah, Lombok, Gili Indah, Pemenang, North Lombok Regency, West Nusa Tenggara 83352 Phone: +6287728432363\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Royal Regantris Villa Karang\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5157115,'492','Eduardo Gregorio Sainz',30508,212301,'Padang Bai to Uluwatu','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-31','2024-07-31','Jacob','Wiwik',1,'Persons (4-6)',1140000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-31\", \"text\": \"By GiliGili Fast Boat from Gili Air\", \"time\": \"12:30\", \"locality\": \"Padang Bai Harbour\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-31\", \"text\": \"Uluwatu, Jl. Pantai Bingin, Pecatu, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80362 Phone: 0812-3773-3887\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Sal Central Uluwatu\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5157132,'492','Eduardo Gregorio Sainz',30508,216161,'Uluwatu to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-03','2024-08-03','Jacob','Wiwik',1,'Persons (4-6)',840000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-03\", \"text\": \"Uluwatu, Jl. Pantai Bingin, Pecatu, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80362. Phone: 0812-3773-3887\", \"time\": \"06:30\", \"locality\": \"Sal Central Uluwatu\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-03\", \"text\": \"ETD: 10.15 by Super Air Jet IU757 to Jakarta on 03 August 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Airport Ngurah Rai (Domestic)\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5157135,'492','Eduardo Gregorio Sainz',31361,217922,'Batur Sunrise Trekking (Sharing Guide)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-01','2024-08-01','Jacob','Wiwik',4,'Person (1)',1680000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-01\", \"text\": \"Uluwatu, Jl. Pantai Bingin, Pecatu, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80362. Phone: 0812-3773-3887\", \"time\": \"01:00\", \"locality\": \"Sal Central Uluwatu\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-01\", \"text\": \"Uluwatu, Jl. Pantai Bingin, Pecatu, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80362. Phone: 0812-3773-3887\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Sal Central Uluwatu\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5157137,'492','Eduardo Gregorio Sainz',30508,202897,'Uluwatu Temple and Kecak Dance','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-02','2024-08-02','Jacob','Wiwik',4,'Persons (4)',2760000.00,'This half-day tour, is an exciting tour package to visit Padang-Padang Beach, Uluwatu Temple, the famous Balinese Hindu Temple in south part of Bali with breathtaking view of sunset and Indian Ocean. Uluwatu Temple is one of Balinese Hindu Temples located right on the petrifying hill with the crevasse exist in the right and left side. Uluwatu Temple is one of Sad Khayangan (6 biggest temple in Bali) owns magnificent view of the Indian Ocean and sunset as a backdrop. This temple is very amazing where the location is right on the narrow peninsula with deep seawater under it. This tour package is combined with the spectacular Balinese traditional dance performance of Kecak Dance. Balinese Kecak Dance is a spectacular traditional dance with the group of people playing this dance with fire game. It is very exciting and unique dance due to the sound of gamelan is not using the normal gamelan but use their mouth. The dancers make the compact choir with the exquisite dance movement that is one of this dance features. After the dance we returned back to the hotel or seafood restaurant in Jimbaran.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-02\", \"text\": \"Uluwatu, Jl. Pantai Bingin, Pecatu, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80362 Phone: 0812-3773-3887\", \"time\": \"15:00\", \"locality\": \"Sal Central Uluwatu\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-02\", \"text\": \"Uluwatu, Jl. Pantai Bingin, Pecatu, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80362 Phone: 0812-3773-3887\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Sal Central Uluwatu\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5157163,'493','Ms. Laura Borrajo Brunete',30508,212292,'Airport to Munduk','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-28','2024-07-28','Jacob','Tami',8,'Persons (7-10)',15360000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-28\", \"text\": \"ETA 15.45 by Lion Air JT804 from Surabaya on 28 Jul\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-28\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bhuana Sari, Wanagiri, Kec. Sukasada, Kabupaten Buleleng, Bali 81161\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Giriwood Hotel & Villa\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5157197,'493','Ms. Laura Borrajo Brunete',32677,216345,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-07-28','2024-07-31','Jacob','Tami',4,'2 Double + 2 Twin',20160000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5157205,'493','Ms. Laura Borrajo Brunete',30508,202889,'Tamblingan Jungle Trek - Ulun Danu Temple','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-29','2024-07-29','Jacob','Tami',8,'Persons (7-10)',6480000.00,'Today we will explore the nature of Buyan and Tamblingan lake in our lovely village, it will help you to escape from the crowds and fell the Nature atmosphere of the real jungle of Bali. We will pick you at your hotel at 07:30 AM and we drive to Tamblingan lake. Arrive in the trekking start point, we will have an explanation about the trekking. We will start the trek by entering a lush protected rain-forest area with giant old tress, animal such as macaque, black giant squirrel, birds and old legend temple inside in the Jungle. You will then walk along the shore of this lake situated in the caldera of an extinct Jungle Mountain. Our trekking guide will explain more detail about plants and living creatures in the jungle. This tour also combine with a session of thirty five minutes exploring the Tamblingan lake by dugout canoe to finishing point. Finish with trekking we will drop you to your hotel but we will make a stop at Ulun Danu Temple. Ulun Danu Temple Bratan, the famous temple stands on a small promontory located in the shore of Lake Bratan and has beautiful scenery with this lake and the mountains as backdrop sight.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-29\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bhuana Sari, Wanagiri, Kec. Sukasada, Kabupaten Buleleng, Bali 81161\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Giriwood Hotel & Villa\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5157217,'493','Ms. Laura Borrajo Brunete',30508,202891,'Contact with Nature Tour','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-30','2024-07-30','Jacob','Tami',8,'Persons (7-10)',4896000.00,'Deferent than the other tours! This tour will quietly finding you in the fullness of nature. First we will explore Pura Luhur Batukaru. Pura Luhur Batukaru Temple is one of the six directional temples on Bali that are believed to protect the island and its people from evil spirits. Pura Luhur Batukaru protects Bali from the West and was originally built in the 11th century. Pura Luhur Batukaru is one of Bali’s biggest Hindu temples, but because it is off the main tourist trail, sees fewer visitors than many of the other temples. Its peaceful setting amid rainforest at the foot of Mount Batukaru enhances its stunning Balinese architecture. We continue to reach the terrace rice fields Jatiluwih. Jatiluwih is a favorite tourist destination in Bali famous with the beautiful rice terrace unfolding from the foot of mountain until the coastal side. With the beautiful view as according to its name from Jati and Luwih, where Jati mean really and Luwih meaning especial, good, and beautiful or the equivalent. The local paddies are planted in this place look typically of the high relative size plant if it is compared with other pre-eminent paddy planted by most farmers in Bali. You’ll get to explore different parts of the terraces, jump over rivers. We continue our way to the Lake Buyan. We will see one of the most beautiful nature and vegetation scenery on the island. Buyan Lake is a smallest lake in Bali located in the plateau area with cool weather covers it. It is situated in the high land with hill and rain forest surrounds it. Since the location in the plateau area, the fog is usually blanketing the area. This lake can be seen from the top of hill which is called Asah Gobleg. The western end of Lake Buyan, we will start to see the sister lake of Buyan, the Lake Tamblingan. If we follow the road it will bring us closer and closer to Lake Tamblingan, or if we take direction to the right at the following junction at the end of the road, we will arrive in Munduk village, a village rich with coffee plantations. And our final destination is Munduk Waterfalls. This waterfall is a beautiful tourist destination in north part of Bali. Waterfall voice around the charming nature was amazing and it was the separate attraction which can be enjoyed by each visitor who comes to visit. In order to visit the waterfall, all visitors will follow the walkway down until the spot point.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-30\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bhuana Sari, Wanagiri, Kec. Sukasada, Kabupaten Buleleng, Bali 81161\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Giriwood Hotel & Villa\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5157248,'494','Roger Chubb',30671,200626,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-22','2024-09-23','Ayu','Wiwik',2,'Single',2400000.00,'Deluxe Room with a room area of 28 square meters each, there are 2 types of bed, king and twin bed with a size of 28 square meters each.',NULL,'Check-in time 14.00 Check-out time 12.00','{\"date\": \"2024-09-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5157276,'494','Roger Chubb',31426,206241,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-23','2024-09-24','Ayu','Wiwik',1,'Single',930000.00,'Our comfortable packages start with our deluxe rooms, measuring 22 square meters and decorated in a chic contemporary style. Choose from rooms with either a queen-sized bed or twin single beds. Room is equipped with a cable TV, air conditioning and a minibar. It comes with private bathroom facilities, a seating area and a work desk. A hairdryer and tea/coffee maker are available, and many more.',NULL,'Flight Detail: ETA: 15.15 by Garuda Indonesia GA646 from Jakarta on 23 September 2024','{\"date\": \"2024-09-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5157823,'495','Katherine Hill',32201,214478,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-31','2024-09-01','Ayu','Tami',1,'Double',1814400.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5158072,'493','Ms. Laura Borrajo Brunete',30508,215968,'Banyumala Twin Waterfall - Wanagiri Hidden Hills','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-31','2024-07-31','Jacob','Tami',8,'Persons (8)',4224000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-31\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bhuana Sari, Wanagiri, Kec. Sukasada, Kabupaten Buleleng, Bali 81161\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Giriwood Hotel & Villa\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-31\", \"text\": \"Jl. Kartika Plaza No.127, Kuta, Kec. Kuta, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Vira Bali Boutique Hotel & Suite\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5158073,'493','Ms. Laura Borrajo Brunete',30571,202567,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-31','2024-08-01','Jacob','Tami',4,'Double',5880000.00,'Located at the Second Floor, 35 sqm comfort living with a touch of Balinese style featuring completed fitting, Cable TV, a fancy bathroom comprises rain shower and good quality amenities. Also dedicated Wi-Fi Access to complete your day.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5158188,'357','Maria Dolors Martí Fernández & Josep Cunillera Sentís',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-05','2024-08-06','Guio','Eddy',1,'Double',784000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. - Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. ETA : 05 AUG 07:40 QR958 by Qatar Airlines from Doha ETD : 06AUG 0600 ID6202 by Batik Air To Pangkalanbun PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK–IN','{\"date\": \"2024-08-05\", \"text\": \"05 AUG: 07:40 QR958 by Qatar Airlines from Doha\", \"time\": \"07:40\", \"locality\": \"AIRPORT JAKARTA\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-06\", \"text\": \"ETD : 06AUG 0600 ID6202 by Batik Air To Pangkalanbun\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"AIRPORT JAKARTA\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5158207,'357','Maria Dolors Martí Fernández & Josep Cunillera Sentís',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-08-06','2024-08-08','Guio','Eddy',2,'Persons (2)',10080000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan isCape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continueto add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board. ETA : 06AUG / 0715 From Jakarta ID6202 by Batik Air ETD : 08AUG / 0730 to Semarang IN195 by Nam Air','{\"date\": \"2024-08-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5158211,'357','Maria Dolors Martí Fernández & Josep Cunillera Sentís',30783,218028,'5D4N Jogja-Bromo-Ijen-Bali Incl. Train / B. Gallery Prawirotaman (Superior) & Lereng Bromo (Deluxe)','Confirmed',NULL,5,'2024-08-08','2024-08-12','Guio','Eddy',2,'Persons (2 / Double)',20692000.00,'D1 Arrival at Yogyakarta International Airport - Borobudur temple tour Incl.Mendut and Pawon D2 Yogyakarta City tour visit Sultan Palace, Wateracastle and Bird Market, Visit Prambanan temple D3 Jogja - Mojokerto by train - drive to Bromo - overnight in Bromo D4 Mt. Bromo Sunrise tour incl. Jeep - Transfer to Ijen for overnight D5 Mt. Ijen crater tour - transfer to Bali across Ketapang - Gilimanuk harbour - drop at your hotel in Bali',NULL,'5D4N Yogya Bromo Ijen Bali include Train for 2 Pax (1 DBL Room) Option B Pick up Semarang (Gallery Prawirotaman, Lereng Bromo Hotel, Jiwa Jawa Ijen) 0808 : Semarang – Templo Borobudur – Yogyakarta 0809 : Yogyakarta Tour – Templo Prambanan 0810 : Yogyakarta – Bromo ( Con Tren ) 0811 : Bromo Tour – Ijen 0812 : Trekking Ijen – Bali (Fin De Aventura)','{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": \"ETA : 08AUG | 0840 to Semarang IN195 by Nam Air\", \"time\": \"08:40\", \"locality\": \"AIRPORT SEMARANG\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-12\", \"text\": \"Mimpi Resort Menjangan Address : Gerokgak, Batu Ampar, Pejarakan, Kec. Gerokgak, Kabupaten Buleleng, Bali 81155 Phone : (0362) 94497\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5158213,'496','ALBERT CASTELLS GUILLEN',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-09','2024-08-09','Guio','Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-09\", \"text\": \"ETA : 09 AUG 18:35H FROM SINGAPORE TR286 BY Tiger Airways\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"AIPORT DENPASAR\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-09\", \"text\": \"ROYAL CASA GANESHA ADDRESS : Jl. A.A. Gede Rai No.88, Lodtunduh, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571, Indonesia Phone : +62361 8493577 | Whatsapp: +62813-3750-4252\\\"\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5158214,'496','ALBERT CASTELLS GUILLEN',30771,201364,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-08-09','2024-08-13','Guio','Eddy',1,'Double',5824000.00,'At 34 m2 room size, a room with a balcony overlooking lush greenery. It features a seating area and a private bathroom with a shower and complimentary bathroom amenities. This will be the place where you come home after an exciting day in Ubud and where you rest after a fun day swimming in the pool.',NULL,'HOMEYMOON','{\"date\": \"2024-08-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5158227,'496','ALBERT CASTELLS GUILLEN',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Tirta Empul–Besakih–Lempuyang)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-10','2024-08-10','Guio','Eddy',2,'Person (1)',2128000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": \"ROYAL CASA GANESHA ADDRESS : Jl. A.A. Gede Rai No.88, Lodtunduh, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571, Indonesia Phone : +62361 8493577 | Whatsapp: +62813-3750-4252\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"MEET AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": \"ROYAL CASA GANESHA ADDRESS : Jl. A.A. Gede Rai No.88, Lodtunduh, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571, Indonesia Phone : +62361 8493577 | Whatsapp: +62813-3750-4252\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5158231,'496','ALBERT CASTELLS GUILLEN',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Tanah Lot – Uluwatu – Kecak)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-11','2024-08-11','Guio','Eddy',2,'Person (1)',2128000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": \"ROYAL CASA GANESHA ADDRESS : Jl. A.A. Gede Rai No.88, Lodtunduh, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571, Indonesia Phone : +62361 8493577 | Whatsapp: +62813-3750-4252\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"MEET AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": \"ROYAL CASA GANESHA ADDRESS : Jl. A.A. Gede Rai No.88, Lodtunduh, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571, Indonesia Phone : +62361 8493577 | Whatsapp: +62813-3750-4252\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5158234,'496','ALBERT CASTELLS GUILLEN',30508,212412,'Ubud to Candidasa','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-13','2024-08-13','Guio','Eddy',2,'Persons (1-3)',1232000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": \"ROYAL CASA GANESHA ADDRESS : Jl. A.A. Gede Rai No.88, Lodtunduh, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571, Indonesia Phone : +62361 8493577 | Whatsapp: +62813-3750-4252\", \"time\": \"12:00\", \"locality\": \"MEET AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": \"HOTEL GENGGONG BALI ADDRESS : Jl.Puri Bagus, Candidasa, Sengkidu, Kec. Manggis, Kabupaten Karangasem, Bali 80871 Phone : +62 (0363) 4381005\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5158236,'496','ALBERT CASTELLS GUILLEN',30508,217820,'Candidasa to Kusamba','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-14','2024-08-14','Guio','Eddy',1,'Persons (2)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": \"HOTEL GENGGONG BALI \\\"ADDRESS : Jl.Puri Bagus, Candidasa, Sengkidu, Kec. Manggis, Kabupaten Karangasem, Bali 80871 Phone : +62 (0363) 4381005\\\"\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": \"MEET AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": \"The Angkal Fast Boat Program : One Way Kusamba - Nusa Penida (departure time, 08.00)\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"KUSAMBA PORT\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5158238,'496','ALBERT CASTELLS GUILLEN',30554,202023,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-13','2024-08-14','Guio','Eddy',1,'Double',1164800.00,'Ground floor room with modern Balinese interior with sea view. Option of king size bed or twin beds.',NULL,'HONEYMOON','{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5158243,'496','ALBERT CASTELLS GUILLEN',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-08-14','2024-08-14','Guio','Eddy',2,'Persons (2)',952000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": \"ETD : 08.00 Nusa Penida BY The Angkal\", \"time\": \"08:20\", \"locality\": \"PENIDA PORT\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": \"SEMABU HILLS HOTEL NUSA PENIDA Address : Jl. Raya Toya Pakeh - Ped, Dusun Sebunibus, Sakti, Kec. Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771 Phone : +62 (0361) 6204400\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5158244,'496','ALBERT CASTELLS GUILLEN',31285,212748,'Grand Deluxe Room Garden View','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-08-14','2024-08-16','Guio','Eddy',1,'Double',3136000.00,'The Grand Deluxe Room with King Beds is a luxurious and spacious option for guests seeking a comfortable stay. Featuring modern amenities and contemporary decor, this room is designed to offer the ultimate relaxation experience. Guests can also enjoy stunning views of the surrounding city or the hotel’s gardens, making the Grand Deluxe Room with King or Twin Beds a perfect choice for those seeking an upscale and luxurious experience.',NULL,'Vouchers must be presented upon check-in and the hotel will there for invoice with in the 7 days period if credit facility has been extended by the hotel. HONEYMOON','{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5158245,'496','ALBERT CASTELLS GUILLEN',30508,207337,'Snorkeling to Nusa Penida (from Nusa Penida) (Sharing Trip)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-15','2024-08-15','Guio','Eddy',2,'Persons (2)',1232000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": \"SEMABU HILLS HOTEL NUSA PENIDA Address : Jl. Raya Toya Pakeh - Ped, Dusun Sebunibus, Sakti, Kec. Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771 Phone : +62 (0361) 6204400\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": \"MEET AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": \"SEMABU HILLS HOTEL NUSA PENIDA Address : Jl. Raya Toya Pakeh - Ped, Dusun Sebunibus, Sakti, Kec. Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771 Phone : +62 (0361) 6204400\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5158247,'496','ALBERT CASTELLS GUILLEN',32607,215996,'Lumbung Suite','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-08-16','2024-08-19','Guio','Eddy',1,'Double',6552000.00,'At 64 m2 room size, welcome to the Lumbung suite with ocean view. Sleep soundly during your trip to one of Gili Islands in Lombok, West Nusa Tenggara, Indonesia in our Lumbung Suite Room, which is designed in a traditional style, two stories and features a king bed with comfortable bedding, spacious, and individually designed.',NULL,'HONEYMOON','{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5158249,'496','ALBERT CASTELLS GUILLEN',30508,207386,'Padang Bai to Seminyak','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-19','2024-08-19','Guio','Eddy',2,'Persons (1-3)',1120000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-19\", \"text\": \"19 Aug 2024 / Padang Bai (Central Bali) (12:25) BY BLUE WATER\", \"time\": \"12:25\", \"locality\": \"P BAY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-19\", \"text\": \"KAYUMAS SEMINYAK RESORT ADDRESS : Jl. Pura Telaga Waja No.18A, Kerobokan Kelod, Kec. Kuta Utara, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361 Phone : (0361) 9348348\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5158250,'496','ALBERT CASTELLS GUILLEN',30798,201630,'One Bedroom Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-19','2024-08-20','Guio','Eddy',1,'Double',1579200.00,'The two-story, 45 sqm One Bedroom Suite features an natural and airy interior, complemented with modern furnishings and views overlooking to the private terrace with a plunge pool. Floor-to-ceiling glass doors provide generous natural lighting and a dynamic ambience. Plush linens and a marble bathroom surround guests in elegance.',NULL,'HONEYMOON','{\"date\": \"2024-08-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5158251,'496','ALBERT CASTELLS GUILLEN',30508,207270,'Seminyak to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-20','2024-08-20','Guio','Eddy',2,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-20\", \"text\": \"KAYUMAS SEMINYAK RESORT ADDRESS : Jl. Pura Telaga Waja No.18A, Kerobokan Kelod, Kec. Kuta Utara, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361 Phone : (0361) 9348348\", \"time\": \"07:00\", \"locality\": \"MEET AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-20\", \"text\": \"ETD : 20 AUG 10:50H TO SINGAPORE (SIN) / TR281 BY Tiger Airways\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5158371,'497','Marc Balsebre Pueyo',30680,200919,'Premier Family Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-02','2024-07-03','Melysa','Tami',1,'Single + Double',1440000.00,'The most important things in this world is family. Thoughtfully designed with families in mind, our Family Premier Room includes everything needed for you and your family to feel comfortable during your stay. At 43 m2 pf room size with 1 king size and 1 twin size, this room equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, hot and cold shower, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer. Free access to our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. - Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK–IN','{\"date\": \"2024-07-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5158398,'497','Marc Balsebre Pueyo',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-07-03','2024-07-05','Melysa','Tami',4,'Persons (4)',14880000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan isCape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continueto add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-07-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5158446,'497','Marc Balsebre Pueyo',30783,218000,'4D3N Jogja-Bromo-Surabaya Incl. Train / KJ Hotel (Family Room) - Lava View Lodge (Family Room)','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-07-05','2024-07-08','Melysa','Tami',4,'Persons (4)',31680000.00,'D1 : Arrival Yogyakarta International Airport – Visit Prambanan Temple – Transfer to hotel D2 : Borobudur temple incl. Mendut and Pawon ,Yogyakarta City Tour Visit Sultan Palace, Watercastle and Bird/Traditional Market D3 : Jogja – Mojokerto by Train then continue drive to Bromo – overnight in Bromo D4 : Sunrise and Mt. Bromo crater tour incl. Jeep ( Horse rise Exclude ) – Transfer to Surabaya airport',NULL,'Flight information ETA 11.25 by Batik Air ID6303 from Pangkalan Bun on 05 Jul ETD 12.45 Citilink QG668 to Denpasar on 08 Jul','{\"date\": \"2024-07-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5158477,'497','Marc Balsebre Pueyo',30508,212292,'Airport to Munduk','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-08','2024-07-08','Melysa','Tami',1,'Persons (4-6)',1320000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-08\", \"text\": \"ETA 14.40 by Citilink QG668 from Surabaya on 08 Jul\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-08\", \"text\": \"Dinas Taman, Jalan Raya, Desa, Munduk, Kec. Banjar, Kabupaten Buleleng, Bali 81152\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Puri Lumbung Cottages\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5158483,'497','Marc Balsebre Pueyo',30722,203495,'Alam Dewata Villa','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-07-08','2024-07-11','Melysa','Tami',2,'Double',9475200.00,'The Deluxe Alam Dewata Villa features one bedroom upstairs with a lovely balcony and a twin bedroom downstairs. An additional bedroom is available downstairs to accommodate a family of six people. Bathroom with hot shower. This new villa is designed using typical Balinese-style architecture and is surrounded by landscapes of lush green clove plantations, gardens and ponds.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5158557,'497','Marc Balsebre Pueyo',30508,202889,'Tamblingan Jungle Trek - Banyumala Waterfall','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-09','2024-07-09','Melysa','Tami',4,'Persons (4)',3600000.00,'Today we will explore the nature of Buyan and Tamblingan lake in our lovely village, it will help you to escape from the crowds and fell the Nature atmosphere of the real jungle of Bali. We will pick you at your hotel at 07:30 AM and we drive to Tamblingan lake. Arrive in the trekking start point, we will have an explanation about the trekking. We will start the trek by entering a lush protected rain-forest area with giant old tress, animal such as macaque, black giant squirrel, birds and old legend temple inside in the Jungle. You will then walk along the shore of this lake situated in the caldera of an extinct Jungle Mountain. Our trekking guide will explain more detail about plants and living creatures in the jungle. This tour also combine with a session of thirty five minutes exploring the Tamblingan lake by dugout canoe to finishing point. Finish with trekking we will drop you to your hotel but we will make a stop at Ulun Danu Temple. Ulun Danu Temple Bratan, the famous temple stands on a small promontory located in the shore of Lake Bratan and has beautiful scenery with this lake and the mountains as backdrop sight.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-09\", \"text\": \"Dinas Taman, Jalan Raya, Desa, Munduk, Kec. Banjar, Kabupaten Buleleng, Bali 81152\", \"time\": \"07:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Puri Lumbung Cottages\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5158561,'497','Marc Balsebre Pueyo',30508,215968,'Ulun Danu Temple','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-11','2024-07-11','Melysa','Tami',4,'Person (1)',2880000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-11\", \"text\": \"Dinas Taman, Jalan Raya, Desa, Munduk, Kec. Banjar, Kabupaten Buleleng, Bali 81152\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Puri Lumbung Cottages\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-11\", \"text\": \"Banjar Apuh, Lodtunduh, Ubud, Bali 80571, Indonesia\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Villa Taman Kanti\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5158567,'413','Isabel Mercado Jaén',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-07-09','2024-07-09','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',952000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-09\", \"text\": \"The Angkal Bungalow, Banjar Angkal, Suana, Kec. Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771 Telepon: (0366) 5582389\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Penida\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-09\", \"text\": \"The Angkal Bungalow, Banjar Angkal, Suana, Kec. Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771 Telepon: (0366) 5582389\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Penida\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5158572,'497','Marc Balsebre Pueyo',30508,215968,'Goa Gajah - Tampaksiring - Gunung Kawi Sebatu Temple - Tegalalang','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-12','2024-07-12','Melysa','Tami',4,'Person (1)',3600000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-12\", \"text\": \"Banjar Apuh, Lodtunduh, Ubud, Bali 80571, Indonesia\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Villa Taman Kanti\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5158581,'497','Marc Balsebre Pueyo',31315,218139,'2 Bedrooms Private Villa With Pool','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-07-11','2024-07-14','Melysa','Tami',1,'Double + Twin',0.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5158634,'497','Marc Balsebre Pueyo',30508,207277,'Ubud to Sanur','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-14','2024-07-14','Melysa','Tami',1,'Persons (4-6)',660000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-14\", \"text\": \"Banjar Apuh, Lodtunduh, Ubud, Bali 80571, Indonesia\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Villa Taman Kanti\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-14\", \"text\": \"ETD 11.00 by Glory Express to Nusa Lembongan\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sanur Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5158656,'498','JENIFER MONTEZDEOCA CRUZ',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-21','2024-06-21','Jacob','Komang',2,'Persons (1-3)',840000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-21\", \"text\": \"ETA : 22.40 by Qatar Airways QR960 on 21 June 2024\", \"time\": \"22:40\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"International Ngurah Rai Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-21\", \"text\": \"Komaneka Rasa Sayang, Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 975491\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5158687,'498','JENIFER MONTEZDEOCA CRUZ',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (JATILUWIH RICE TERRACE – BANYUMALA TWIN WATERFALL – WANAGIRI HIDDEN HILL )','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-22','2024-06-22','Jacob','Komang',2,'Person (1)',0.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-22\", \"text\": \"Komaneka Rasa Sayang, Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 975491\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-22\", \"text\": \"Komaneka Rasa Sayang, Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 975491\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5158691,'497','Marc Balsebre Pueyo',31314,218140,'Villa Beachfront','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-07-14','2024-07-16','Melysa','Tami',1,'Double',7728000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5158695,'498','JENIFER MONTEZDEOCA CRUZ',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Melukat (proceso de Purification) - Ofrendas – Cascada)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-24','2024-06-24','Jacob','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',1920000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-24\", \"text\": \"Komaneka Rasa Sayang, Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 975491\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-24\", \"text\": \"Komaneka Rasa Sayang, Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 975491\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5158696,'498','JENIFER MONTEZDEOCA CRUZ',30508,202890,'Mount Batur Sunrise Trekking Tour','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-25','2024-06-25','Jacob','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',1200000.00,'Enjoy trek or climb Mount Batur and see the sunrise from the top of Batur Volcano. The Batur Volcano is one of the sacred mountain according to Hindu believe. We will get in ahead of schedule morning around 02.00 am depend the area of you stay, and afterward we specifically going to Mount Batur starting point. Starting in the dark under starlight sky, you will be guided to ascend the slope of Mount Batur. You will approach the peak of Mount Batur (1717 meters) at about 06.00 am. While waiting for the sunrise you will have a simple breakfast and hot coffee or tea served by your guide in Mount Batur. Witness the breathtaking sunrise overlooking the majestic view of Lake Batur and Mount Rinjani. After witnessing the sunrise, continue for our descent, at about 9 am, you will be arriving at the finishing point.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-25\", \"text\": \"Komaneka Rasa Sayang, Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 975491\", \"time\": \"02:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-25\", \"text\": \"Komaneka Rasa Sayang, Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 975491\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5158697,'497','Marc Balsebre Pueyo',30508,212455,'Sanur to Sanur','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-16','2024-07-16','Melysa','Tami',1,'Persons (4-6)',720000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-16\", \"text\": \"ETA 13.00 from Nusa Lembongan by Glory Express\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sanur Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-16\", \"text\": \"Jl. Danau Tamblingan No.192, Sanur, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali 80229\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Abian Harmony Hotel Restaurant & Spa\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5158699,'497','Marc Balsebre Pueyo',31023,203283,'Family Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-16','2024-07-17','Melysa','Tami',1,'Double + Twin',1320000.00,'Featuring warm décor, the comfortable rooms at Abian Harmony Hotel are all air-conditioned. The rooms are also fitted with a flat-screen cable TV, a refrigerator with a minibar and wardrobe. En suite bathroom comes with a shower and slippers. Some room offers a bathtub. Guests enjoy garden and pool views from the room. Satellite/cable channels, DVD/CD player, Air conditioning',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5158700,'497','Marc Balsebre Pueyo',30508,207269,'Sanur to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-17','2024-07-17','Melysa','Tami',1,'Persons (4-6)',720000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-17\", \"text\": \"Jl. Danau Tamblingan No.192, Sanur, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali 80229\", \"time\": \"05:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Abian Harmony Hotel Restaurant & Spa\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-17\", \"text\": \"ETD 08.00 by Batik Air ID6333 to Labuan Bajo on 17 Jul\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5158701,'498','JENIFER MONTEZDEOCA CRUZ',30508,207278,'Full Day Tour Car & Driver (8-10 hours)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-26','2024-06-26','Jacob','Komang',2,'Persons (1-3)',1200000.00,NULL,NULL,'Not Include : Entrance fee Parking Ticket','{\"date\": \"2024-06-26\", \"text\": \"Komaneka Rasa Sayang, Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 975491\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-26\", \"text\": \"Komaneka Rasa Sayang, Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 975491\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5158702,'498','JENIFER MONTEZDEOCA CRUZ',30508,207262,'Ubud to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-27','2024-06-27','Jacob','Komang',2,'Persons (1-3)',840000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-27\", \"text\": \"Komaneka Rasa Sayang, Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 975491\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-27\", \"text\": \"ETD : 14.20 by Wings Air IW1964 to Lombok on 27 Jun 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5158705,'498','JENIFER MONTEZDEOCA CRUZ',30728,207493,'Bumi Gora / Kuta Tour','Confirmed','EXC 03',1,'2024-06-28','2024-06-28','Jacob','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',1903200.00,'This tour takes you first to the Pottery Village of Banyumulek. Observe how the local women produce pottery stuffs. Then, visit Sukarare village; renowned for its traditional hand weaving of brightly patterned “songket”, “ikat” and “sarong” cloths. We will observe how the regenerate of weaving tradition goes on in the village. Girl, mother and grandmother even great grandmother do weaving activity together in the village. Next the tour continues to Ende village, featuring the unique traditional houses with its buffalo dung floors. Lunch is served at one of local restaurants in New Kuta Mandalika area. Then, we visit the beautiful beach of Tanjung A’an, one of the most scenic and un-spoilt beaches in this part of Lombok. We may have chance to trek Merese Hills to enjoy magnificent panorama of Indian Ocean.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-28\", \"text\": \"Living Asia Resort, Jl. Raya Senggigi Jl. Dusun Lendang Luar, Malaka, Kec. Pemenang, Kabupaten Lombok Utara, Nusa Tenggara Bar. 83352\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Senggigi\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-28\", \"text\": \"Living Asia Resort, Jl. Raya Senggigi Jl. Dusun Lendang Luar, Malaka, Kec. Pemenang, Kabupaten Lombok Utara, Nusa Tenggara Bar. 83352\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Senggigi\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5158709,'498','JENIFER MONTEZDEOCA CRUZ',30728,207488,'Ngonong / Three Gilis Tour','Confirmed','EXC 07',1,'2024-06-29','2024-06-29','Jacob','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',3806400.00,'This tour is specially designed for those who wish to feel and enjoy the underwater world of Lombok. Your tour guide will take you across the mainland by outrigger boat to the harbor towards Gili Trawangan, Gili Meno and Gili Air waters area. Experience amazing snorkeling among hundreds of tropical fish and beautiful coral. A delicious lunch will be provided at one of local restaurants in the gili island and get busy with tropical island life such as cycling, swimming, sunbathing or even just free at your own leisure. On the way back to your hotel, you may stop by at Malimbu hill for picture taking.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-29\", \"text\": \"Living Asia Resort, Jl. Raya Senggigi Jl. Dusun Lendang Luar, Malaka, Kec. Pemenang, Kabupaten Lombok Utara, Nusa Tenggara Bar. 83352\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Senggigi\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-29\", \"text\": \"Living Asia Resort, Jl. Raya Senggigi Jl. Dusun Lendang Luar, Malaka, Kec. Pemenang, Kabupaten Lombok Utara, Nusa Tenggara Bar. 83352\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Senggigi\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5158711,'497','Marc Balsebre Pueyo',31658,208111,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-18','2024-07-19','Melysa','Tami',2,'Double + Twin',1680000.00,'This room featured Air Conditioning, telephone, hot and cold water, satellite TV on 32 LCD screen. Bathroom amenities; Hair dryer, Bathrobe, Towels, Free toiletries, Guest toilet, Cleaning products, Body soap, Hair conditioner, Shampoo, Tooth brush, Toilet paper. Facilities inside the room are coffee/tea maker, mini bar, wake up service.',NULL,'Flight information ETD 09.50 by Batik Air ID6332 to Denpasar on 19 Jul','{\"date\": \"2024-07-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5158720,'498','JENIFER MONTEZDEOCA CRUZ',30508,212289,'Airport to Nusa Dua','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-01','2024-07-01','Jacob','Komang',2,'Persons (1-3)',600000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-01\", \"text\": \"ETA : 14.20 by Wings Air IW1963 from Lombok on 01 Jul 2024\", \"time\": \"14:20\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-01\", \"text\": \"Sadara Boutique Hotel Nusa Dua, Tanjung Benoa, Jl. Pratama, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80363 Telepon: (0361) 772010\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Dua\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5158723,'498','JENIFER MONTEZDEOCA CRUZ',30580,202387,'Sadara Premier Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-07-01','2024-07-03','Jacob','Komang',1,'Double',3960000.00,'One bedroom SADARA Premier offers pleasant experience. Decorated with a modern interior which brings the comfort and style at the same time. With 42 square meters size, this air-conditioned room has its own private balcony or terrace overlooking the boasting garden and overviewing the tranquil blue ocean. The complete room facilities of a minibar, coffee and tea maker, hairdryer, 2 mineral bottles and safety box, Free win, will make your stay conveniently.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5158735,'498','JENIFER MONTEZDEOCA CRUZ',30508,202897,'Uluwatu Temple and Kecak Dance','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-02','2024-07-02','Jacob','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',2556000.00,'This half-day tour, is an exciting tour package to visit Padang-Padang Beach, Uluwatu Temple, the famous Balinese Hindu Temple in south part of Bali with breathtaking view of sunset and Indian Ocean. Uluwatu Temple is one of Balinese Hindu Temples located right on the petrifying hill with the crevasse exist in the right and left side. Uluwatu Temple is one of Sad Khayangan (6 biggest temple in Bali) owns magnificent view of the Indian Ocean and sunset as a backdrop. This temple is very amazing where the location is right on the narrow peninsula with deep seawater under it. This tour package is combined with the spectacular Balinese traditional dance performance of Kecak Dance. Balinese Kecak Dance is a spectacular traditional dance with the group of people playing this dance with fire game. It is very exciting and unique dance due to the sound of gamelan is not using the normal gamelan but use their mouth. The dancers make the compact choir with the exquisite dance movement that is one of this dance features. After the dance we returned back to the hotel or seafood restaurant in Jimbaran.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-02\", \"text\": \"Sadara Boutique Hotel, Tanjung Benoa, Jl. Pratama, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80363 Telepon: (0361) 772010\", \"time\": \"14:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Dua\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-02\", \"text\": \"Sadara Boutique Hotel, Tanjung Benoa, Jl. Pratama, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80363 Telepon: (0361) 772010\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Dua\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5158737,'498','JENIFER MONTEZDEOCA CRUZ',30508,207268,'Nusa Dua to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-03','2024-07-03','Jacob','Komang',2,'Persons (1-3)',600000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-03\", \"text\": \"Sadara Boutique Hotel Nusa Dua, Tanjung Benoa, Jl. Pratama, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80363 Telepon: (0361) 772010\", \"time\": \"20:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Dua\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-03\", \"text\": \"ETD : 01.05 by Qatar Airways QR961 on 04 July 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"International Ngurah Rai Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5158746,'497','Marc Balsebre Pueyo',30689,203017,'Hilltop Villas Kecil','Confirmed',NULL,6,'2024-07-19','2024-07-25','Melysa','Tami',1,'Double',18144000.00,'Hilltop Villa Kecil is 12m long and 6m wide with an elevated 3 x 6m deck with jacuzzi to sit and enjoy a morning coffee or evening cocktails, while taking in gorgeous ocean views, with a combined living and bedroom area of 9x6m and a 4.5m open vaulted ceiling, include a Super King bed and a luxurious but cool and funky sitting area, complete with a 40” television and entertainment system. The semi open Balinese style bathrooms are 3 x 7m and combine marble and granite to a sleek, elegant finish with German taps, Swiss (Geberit) wall-hung toilets and your choice of both an indoor and outdoor shower. This hilltop villa is just a short walk through our tropical gardens to all the main facilities of the resort.',NULL,'Flight information ETA 13.25 by Wings Air IW1848 from Denpasar on 19 Jul ETD 11.15 by Garuda Indonesia GA0431 to Jakarta on 25 Jul','{\"date\": \"2024-07-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5160126,'501','María Mercedes',30508,212292,'Airport to Munduk','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-05','2024-07-05','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (1-3)',1232000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-05\", \"text\": \"ETA : 11.35 by Etihad EY76 from Madrid on 05 July 2024\", \"time\": \"11:35\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"International Ngurah Rai Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-05\", \"text\": \"Puri Lumbung Cottage Munduk, Dinas Taman, Jalan Raya, Desa, Munduk, Kec. Banjar, Kabupaten Buleleng, Bali 81152 Telepon: 0812-3874-042\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Munduk\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5160142,'501','María Mercedes',30722,203490,'Puri Lumbung Cottages - Standard Cottage','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-07-05','2024-07-07','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',2477440.00,'Room size: 20 sqm. The Puri Lumbung Standard Cottages are renovations of original Balinese lumbung (rice barns). All twelve cottages have a bedroom with an attached balcony made from hardwood, perched on stilts. Stairs leads down to a large dressing room and garden bathroom with shower and hot water. The cottages are surrounded by lush, tropical gardens and ponds with views over the green rice paddy valleys, the Java Sea coastline in the distance, and dramatic mountain peaks. The 3D room pictures available.',NULL,'\"HONEYMOONER\"','{\"date\": \"2024-07-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5160448,'501','María Mercedes',30508,215968,'Taman Ayun-Batukaru - Jati Luwih - Tanah Lot','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-08','2024-07-08','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',1568000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-08\", \"text\": \"Artini Dijiwa Ubud, Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 972385\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-08\", \"text\": \"Artini Dijiwa Ubud, Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 972385\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5160454,'501','María Mercedes',30508,215968,'Goa Gajah -Tampak Siring -Gunung Kawi-Tegalalang','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-09','2024-07-09','Guio','Komang',2,'Person (1)',0.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-09\", \"text\": \"Artini Dijiwa Ubud, Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 972385\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-09\", \"text\": \"Artini Dijiwa Ubud, Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 972385\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5160458,'501','María Mercedes',30508,215968,'Lempuyang-Tirta Gangga-Virgin Beach - Tenganan','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-10','2024-07-10','Guio','Komang',2,'Person (1)',0.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-10\", \"text\": \"Artini Dijiwa Ubud, Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 972385\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-10\", \"text\": \"Artini Dijiwa Ubud, Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 972385\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5160500,'501','María Mercedes',30508,212408,'Ubud to Uluwatu','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-11','2024-07-11','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (1-3)',784000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-11\", \"text\": \"Artini Dijiwa Ubud, Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 972385\", \"time\": \"12:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-11\", \"text\": \"Airis Luxury Villa, Jl. Raya Uluwatu No.Km. 23, Ungasan, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361 Telepon: (0361) 4725377\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Uluwatu\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5160535,'501','María Mercedes',30508,212545,'Uluwatu to Sanur','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-12','2024-07-12','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-12\", \"text\": \"Airis Luxury Villa Uluwatu, Jl. Raya Uluwatu No.Km. 23, Ungasan, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361 Telepon: (0361) 4725377\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Uluwatu\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-12\", \"text\": \"ETD : 07.30 AM by Maruti Fastboat to Nusa Penida on 12 July 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sanur harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5160549,'501','María Mercedes',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-07-12','2024-07-12','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',952000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-12\", \"text\": \"ETA : 08.15 by Maruti Fastboat from Sanur on 12 July 2024\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Banjar Nyuh Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-12\", \"text\": \"Adiwana Warnakali Nusa Penida, Sakti, Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771 Telepon: (0361) 6207000\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Penida\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5160553,'501','María Mercedes',30547,200475,'Ocean View Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-12','2024-07-13','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',2856000.00,'Adiwana Warnakali boasts a collection of 12 Ocean View suites, all situated on the lower level, have a room size 56 sqm and the type bed single or double. Each of these suites offers a generously-sized balcony that unveils breathtaking vistas of the vast, cerulean expanse of the Nusa Lembongan ocean and the majestic presence of Mount Agung. Here, your mornings resemble scenes from a captivating movie, with the invigorating scent of the sea and the soothing melody of waves crashing against the rugged cliffs. The spacious rooms are designed for your utmost comfort, sporting a nautical theme that incorporates oars as charming decorative elements. The bathrooms are adorned with striking blue tiles, adding to the overall maritime charm. Immerse yourself in an unforgettable and idyllic stay at Adiwana Warnakali.',NULL,'\"HONYMOONER\"','{\"date\": \"2024-07-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5160556,'501','María Mercedes',30508,207390,'Transfer In Nusa Penida','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-13','2024-07-13','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (1-3)',224000.00,NULL,NULL,'Please ready on hotel lobby for pickup at 07.00 AM','{\"date\": \"2024-07-13\", \"text\": \"Adiwana Warnakali Resort, Sakti, Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771 Telepon: (0361) 6207000\", \"time\": \"07:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Penida\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-13\", \"text\": \"ETD : 09.15 by Bluewater Express to Gili Trawangan on 13 July 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Buyuk Harbour Nusa Penida\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5160626,'501','María Mercedes',31242,205019,'One-Bedroom Villa with Private Pool','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-07-13','2024-07-16','Guio','Komang',2,'Double',22276800.00,'Majo Private Villas is a resort ideally located on the island of Gili Trawangan. We offer high-end luxury accommodation and fine food in our on-site restaurant. Our private villas can accommodate 2 to 3 persons, and offer a fusion between top french design and traditional balinese style. Each of our 9 villas is around 125 sqm, has a private swimming pool, a comfortable outside area, outdoor shower and is designed with a particular attention to detail. We pride ourselves to offer an excellent guest service, and the whole concept of Majo Private villas has been entirely built about offering all of our guests an experience they will never forget, both through the details of the infrastructure and the quality of service. We can organize snorkelling trips, boat trips, massages and much more, please do not hesitate to ask us for any quotation if you require a service not mentioned in this contract.',NULL,'\"HONEYMOONER\"','{\"date\": \"2024-07-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5160855,'498','JENIFER MONTEZDEOCA CRUZ',30768,201344,'Premier Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-24','2024-06-25','Jacob','Komang',1,'Double',1380000.00,'This 40 sqm room comes with air conditioning, a personal safe, a flat-screen TV and an electric kettle. Bathroom comes with a bath and a walk-in shower with free toiletries. Completed with a private seating area on the terrace, guests can enjoy an ultimate leisure time.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5160867,'498','JENIFER MONTEZDEOCA CRUZ',30712,200856,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-06-21','2024-06-24','Jacob','Komang',1,'Double',8109000.00,'Spacious home-like rooms of 65 sqm furnished with modern Indonesian art and beautiful Indonesian textiles. The large private balcony or terrace looks out onto the garden or tropical mini-forest in the midst of the resort. Features a private balcony with a day bed. A TV is provided. Attached bathrooms provide shower facilities.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5160882,'498','JENIFER MONTEZDEOCA CRUZ',30712,200856,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-06-25','2024-06-27','Jacob','Komang',1,'Double',5406000.00,'Spacious home-like rooms of 65 sqm furnished with modern Indonesian art and beautiful Indonesian textiles. The large private balcony or terrace looks out onto the garden or tropical mini-forest in the midst of the resort. Features a private balcony with a day bed. A TV is provided. Attached bathrooms provide shower facilities.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5160884,'498','JENIFER MONTEZDEOCA CRUZ',31215,204841,'Garden View Room','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-06-27','2024-07-01','Jacob','Komang',1,'Double',4560000.00,'Garden View Room offering views of the resort\'s lush tropical landscaping and grounds includes a comforting king bed swathed with fine linens, well-appointed with modern and minimalist furniture, and a luxurious array of amenities. Equipped with a casual but elegant chair and table, the private balcony or terrace is an impeccable point to unwind while sipping a cup of morning tea.',NULL,'An original voucher issued by tour operator must back up every guest when check in. The voucher should clearly specify the room category, occupancy, check in/check out dates and all instructions and required additional services the guest is entitled to base on their booking and rate. Living Asia Resort and Spa must receive a copy of such voucher from the client upon check in, if not previously sent by the Supplier/Partner.','{\"date\": \"2024-06-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5161482,'459','Mr. Javier Gil Serrano',30508,207278,'Full Day Tour Car & Driver (8-10 hours)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-21','2024-06-21','Jacob','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',600000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-21\", \"text\": \"ETA 14.35 by Lion Air JT922 from Surabaya on 21 Jun\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-21\", \"text\": \"Jl. Pura Kulat, Pecatu, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80362\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Grün Resort Uluwatu\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5161640,'475','BLANCA LLES BARUQUER',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-24','2024-07-25','Jacob','Komang',1,'Double',840000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. - Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK–IN','{\"date\": \"2024-07-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5162220,'501','María Mercedes',30705,201148,'Premier Room Rice Field View','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-07-07','2024-07-11','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',6832000.00,'Gaze out at rippling rice fields as you let your stress slip away in one of our Premier Ricefield View suites. Inside you have smooth tiles, warm wooden accents, and all the modern comforts you could ask for. Step onto the balcony and you have an airy nook where you can witness life unfold in the Balinese countryside.',NULL,'\"HONEYMOONER\"','{\"date\": \"2024-07-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5162224,'501','María Mercedes',31214,216723,'One Bedroom Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-11','2024-07-12','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',2867.20,'Villa features a private pool and gazebo. It comes with a 42-inch flat-screen cable TV with DVD player. An en suite bathroom has a Jacuzzi bathtub and separate shower. Villa Facilities: Pool View, Terrace, DVD Player, Video, Cable Channels, Plat-screen TV, Safe, Air Conditioning, Desk, Sitting Area, Private entrance, Sofa, Title/Marble Floor, Private Pool, Wardrobe/Closet, Clothes rack, Hairdryer, Free Toiletries, Toilet Bathroom, Slippers, Bathtub or Shower, Refrigerator, Dining Area, Electric Kettle, Outdoor Dining Area, Wake-up Service, Entire Unit Located on Ground Floor.',NULL,'\"HONEYMOONER\"','{\"date\": \"2024-07-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5162900,'504','Mireia Arino',30684,200640,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-15','2024-07-16','Jacob','Eddy',1,'Double',1890000.00,'Designed to embody fresher and younger ambience, our Deluxe Room is a convenient stay for those who plan a relatively shorter stay in Semarang. The room is provided with either a king size or deluxe twin beds.',NULL,'Please send the guarantee letter/voucher following procedure below: - 30 (thirty) days reservation notice prior to the arrival date for Normal Period. - 45 (forty-five) days reservation notice prior to the arrival date for High Season (June 1th to August 31st) and Peak Season (D-3 to D+4 Idul Fitri (April 18 - 25th, 2023 and December 21st, 2023 to January 5th, 2024) period. - Otherwise, the cancellation policy will be applied.','{\"date\": \"2024-07-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5162902,'504','Mireia Arino',30682,200893,'Villa\'s Deluxe','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-16','2024-07-17','Jacob','Eddy',1,'Double',2778000.00,'Villa Deluxe with 42 sqm room area. 23 rooms available (13 double + 10 twin), single and twin beds available with a capacity of 2 people per room. see the greatest view in Ijen Mountain. See the magic of the blue fire at night. Sophisticated design in Ijen Resort and Villas, in Banyuwangi, East Java. You can see the best view from your room, the rice field, mountains.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5163059,'488','Juan Pedro Peñalver Ferrer',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-24','2024-08-24','Guio','Eddy',1,'Persons (4-6)',784000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-24\", \"text\": \"ETA : 24 Aug 2024 - 17:20H From Jakarta / ID 6518 By Batik Air Indonesia\", \"time\": \"17:20\", \"locality\": \"AIRPORT DENPASAR\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-24\", \"text\": \"THE ARTINI DIJIWA UBUD ADDRESS : Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone : (0361) 972385\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5163079,'488','Juan Pedro Peñalver Ferrer',30705,201148,'Premier Room Rice Field View','Confirmed',NULL,5,'2024-08-24','2024-08-29','Guio','Eddy',2,'Double',17080000.00,'Gaze out at rippling rice fields as you let your stress slip away in one of our Premier Ricefield View suites. Inside you have smooth tiles, warm wooden accents, and all the modern comforts you could ask for. Step onto the balcony and you have an airy nook where you can witness life unfold in the Balinese countryside.',NULL,'2 (DBL) PREMIER ROOM RICE FIELD VIEW + 1 EXTRA BED','{\"date\": \"2024-08-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5163082,'488','Juan Pedro Peñalver Ferrer',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route (Templo Taman Ayun - Jatiluwih - Templo Ulun Danu Bratan - Tanah Lot )','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-25','2024-08-25','Guio','Eddy',5,'Persons (5-6)',3248000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-25\", \"text\": \"THE ARTINI DIJIWA UBUD ADDRESS : Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone : (0361) 972385\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"MEET AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-25\", \"text\": \"THE ARTINI DIJIWA UBUD ADDRESS : Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone : (0361) 972385\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5163084,'488','Juan Pedro Peñalver Ferrer',30508,202894,'Tegalalang – Tirta Empul – Templo Kehen – Penglipuran Village','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-26','2024-08-26','Guio','Eddy',5,'Persons (5-6)',2800000.00,'Our wonderful tour starts from Kehen Temple. It is an ancient Hindu temple complex boasting unique architectural features. The staircases reaching from the ground to temple courtyard are carved sandstone mythical animal and Balinese folklore figure statues and also the central vestibule. The temple’s walls are also ornate with Chinese porcelain plates, which are a tribute to the historical relations between the local Bali kingdom and China. Afterwards, we continue to Penglipuran, a village that succeeded in preserving its 75-hectare bamboo forest located in the northern part of the village. Members of this village have a strong commitment to the system of \'Ayahan Desa\' - a philosophy committed to respecting the land on which the village stands. To concludes the day, we stop by at Tukad Cepung Waterfall. Well-guarded by the circular cliffs, this waterfall is difficult to locate for the first time visitor. The circular cliffs give you the feeling of being in a cave, while the open sky right from where the waterfall emerges, gives you the most enchanting view. The sunlight falls on the glistering waterfall creating a rainbow, which feels as though it is projected right up to you. If you have never seen water flowing from the sky, then this would be your chance! After spending your time there, we go back to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-26\", \"text\": \"THE ARTINI DIJIWA UBUD ADDRESS : Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone : (0361) 972385\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"MEET AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-26\", \"text\": \"THE ARTINI DIJIWA UBUD ADDRESS : Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone : (0361) 972385\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5163109,'488','Juan Pedro Peñalver Ferrer',30508,202882,'The Mother Temple Besakih and Surrounding','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-27','2024-08-27','Guio','Eddy',5,'Persons (5-6)',3192000.00,'The first destination is Kusamba Beach, it is one of the favorite places of interest in Bali which is famous with the beautiful beach, we can also meet a fish market in this place which is usually held between 10 am until 4 pm. Then we go to Goa Lawah, this is one of the favourite place to be visited, because here is a nature cave dwelt by thousands of tail bat located at north side from Jeroan/center of Goa Lawah Temple. Next we go to Bukit Jambul, it is strategically located beside of the main road from Denpasar to Besakih Temple and it is one of the tourist destinations that visited on Besakih Tour. It is situated in the plateau area which is blessed with the beautiful panorama of rice terrace and green coconuts three unfolding to the sea. After visit Bukit Jambul, we’ll continue to Besakih Temple is the biggest Hindu temple in Bali which the local people call Pura Besakih. It owns beautiful view from the top of temple area where we can see the wide nature panorama until to the ocean so that’s why this temple is many visited by tourists from all over the world. Then go to Kertagosa, This place also owns Taman Gili, a building floating or sees like floating because it is intentionally founded in the middle of a fish pond.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-27\", \"text\": \"THE ARTINI DIJIWA UBUD ADDRESS : Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone : (0361) 972385\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"MEET AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-27\", \"text\": \"THE ARTINI DIJIWA UBUD ADDRESS : Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone : (0361) 972385\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5163115,'488','Juan Pedro Peñalver Ferrer',30508,207379,'Ubud to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-29','2024-08-29','Guio','Eddy',1,'Persons (4-6)',1064000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-29\", \"text\": \"THE ARTINI DIJIWA UBUD ADDRESS : Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone : (0361) 972385\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": \"MEET AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-29\", \"text\": \"ETD : 29 August 2024 / by Giligili FastBoat Padang Bai (PDB) - 08:30\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5163151,'488','Juan Pedro Peñalver Ferrer',30650,208425,'Private Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-08-29','2024-09-01','Guio','Eddy',2,'Double',20160000.00,'Each villa embraces calmness, comfort and privacy in a simple and elegant setting. Guests can relax while peacefully sipping drinks in an inviting plunge pool surrounded by a lush tropical garden and at an old-wooden deck. At 85 m2 room size, this villa\'s special feature is the private pool. The air-conditioned villa features 1 bedroom and 1 bathroom with a shower and a hairdryer. The villa provides a mini-bar, a tea and coffee maker, a seating area as well as a terrace with garden views. The unit offers 1 bed.',NULL,'2 (DBL) PRIVATE POOL VILLA + 1 EXTRA BED','{\"date\": \"2024-08-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5163159,'488','Juan Pedro Peñalver Ferrer',30508,207386,'Padang Bai to Seminyak','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-01','2024-09-01','Guio','Eddy',1,'Persons (4-6)',1064000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \