After the dance we returned back to the hotel or seafood restaurant in Jimbaran.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-18\", \"text\": \"Amarterra Villa & Resort Nusa Dua, Kawasan Pariwisata Nusa Dua ITDC Resort Lot Block B, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80363 Telepon: (0361) 776400\", \"time\": \"15:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Dua\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-18\", \"text\": \"Amarterra Villa & Resort Nusa Dua, Kawasan Pariwisata Nusa Dua ITDC Resort Lot Block B, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80363 Telepon: (0361) 776400\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Dua\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5163890,'505','LILIANA',30508,207268,'Nusa Dua to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-19','2024-07-19','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (4-6)',672000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'Please ready on hotel lobby for pickup at 17.00','{\"date\": \"2024-07-19\", \"text\": \"Amarterra Villa & Resort Nusa Dua, Kawasan Pariwisata Nusa Dua ITDC Resort Lot Block B, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80363 Telepon: (0361) 776400\", \"time\": \"17:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Dua\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-19\", \"text\": \"ETD : 21.20 by Turkish Airlines TK67 to Istanbul on 19 July 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"International Ngurah Rai Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5163911,'469','Mr. Miguel Ignacio Porto Requena',30680,200914,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-23','2024-06-24','Igo','Tami',1,'Double',840000.00,'Enjoy our spacious elegant deluxe room with 40 m2 of room size. Enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, hot and cold shower, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. - Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK–IN','{\"date\": \"2024-06-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5164016,'498','JENIFER MONTEZDEOCA CRUZ',30712,200856,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-06-24','2024-06-25','Jacob','Komang',1,'Double',2703000.00,'Spacious home-like rooms of 65 sqm furnished with modern Indonesian art and beautiful Indonesian textiles. The large private balcony or terrace looks out onto the garden or tropical mini-forest in the midst of the resort. Features a private balcony with a day bed. A TV is provided. Attached bathrooms provide shower facilities.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-06-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-06-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5164168,'461','IVANA MORILLAS',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Balinese Cooking Class - Offering Making, Dance & Gamelan)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-14','2024-07-14','Nicholas','Komang',4,'Persons (4)',4800000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-14\", \"text\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud, Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 972385\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-14\", \"text\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud, Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 972385\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5164262,'507','SIMON WYNDHAM GRIFFIN',30508,213032,'Ubud to Kusamba','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-11','2024-07-11','Ayu','Eddy',4,'Persons (4-6)',3360000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-11\", \"text\": \"TEJAPRANA RESORT & SPA Address : Jl. Raya Tegallalang, Banjar Sapat, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80561 Phone: (0361) 9080939\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"READY AT LOBBY\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-11\", \"text\": \"ETD: 08.00 by The Angkal / One way transfer Kusamba to Sampalan\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"KUSAMBA PORT\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5164264,'507','SIMON WYNDHAM GRIFFIN',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-07-11','2024-07-11','Ayu','Eddy',4,'Persons (4)',1200000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-11\", \"text\": \"ETA: 08.20 by The Angkal / One way transfer Kusamba to Nusa Penida\", \"time\": \"08:20\", \"locality\": \"PENIDA PORT\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-11\", \"text\": \"Adiwana Warnakali Resort - Nusa Penida / Address: Sakti, Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771 / Phone: (0361) 6207000\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5164265,'507','SIMON WYNDHAM GRIFFIN',30508,207337,'Snorkeling to Nusa Penida (from Nusa Penida) (Sharing Trip)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-12','2024-07-12','Ayu','Eddy',4,'Persons (4)',2160000.00,NULL,NULL,'fin size: 2 x size 39 1x size 38 1x size 42','{\"date\": \"2024-07-12\", \"text\": \"Adiwana Warnakali Resort - Nusa Penida Address : Sakti, Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771 Phone: (0361) 6207000\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": \"MEET AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-12\", \"text\": \"Adiwana Warnakali Resort - Nusa Penida Address : Sakti, Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771 Phone: (0361) 6207000\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5164268,'507','SIMON WYNDHAM GRIFFIN',30547,200475,'Ocean View Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-07-11','2024-07-13','Ayu','Eddy',2,'Double + Twin',10800000.00,'Adiwana Warnakali boasts a collection of 12 Ocean View suites, all situated on the lower level, have a room size 56 sqm and the type bed single or double. Each of these suites offers a generously-sized balcony that unveils breathtaking vistas of the vast, cerulean expanse of the Nusa Lembongan ocean and the majestic presence of Mount Agung. Here, your mornings resemble scenes from a captivating movie, with the invigorating scent of the sea and the soothing melody of waves crashing against the rugged cliffs. The spacious rooms are designed for your utmost comfort, sporting a nautical theme that incorporates oars as charming decorative elements. The bathrooms are adorned with striking blue tiles, adding to the overall maritime charm. Immerse yourself in an unforgettable and idyllic stay at Adiwana Warnakali.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5164270,'507','SIMON WYNDHAM GRIFFIN',32607,215996,'Lumbung Suite','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-07-13','2024-07-15','Ayu','Eddy',2,'Double + Twin',9360000.00,'At 64 m2 room size, welcome to the Lumbung suite with ocean view. Sleep soundly during your trip to one of Gili Islands in Lombok, West Nusa Tenggara, Indonesia in our Lumbung Suite Room, which is designed in a traditional style, two stories and features a king bed with comfortable bedding, spacious, and individually designed.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5164336,'461','IVANA MORILLAS',32766,216809,'3D2N Open Trip Komodo - Lady Grace / Full Oce