"location\": \"International Airport Ngurah Rai\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5177405,'548','Maria De Las Nieves Garcia De La Rosa Torrens',32650,218435,'Pyramid Bamboo House','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-08-09','2024-08-11','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',9676800.00,NULL,NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-08-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5177520,'548','Maria De Las Nieves Garcia De La Rosa Torrens',32859,218440,'Terrace Studio','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-08-11','2024-08-15','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',43680000.00,'The spacious terrace leads into a 40-square-meter room that’s decked in local artifacts, artwork, and bespoke ceramics. The interior of the bedroom is dominated by a hand-carved wood panel inspired by Sumba Ikat. A super-king bed and spacious bathroom with a walk-in shower and double vanity are sure to inspire moments of utter relaxation.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5177525,'548','Maria De Las Nieves Garcia De La Rosa Torrens',30528,215622,'Praijing Village - Lapopu Waterfall','Confirmed','WS1.2HD',1,'2024-08-12','2024-08-12','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2-3)',3192000.00,'Pick Up Time : 09.00 AM Pick Up / Drop Off Place : Waikabubak, Lamboya, Wanokaka Area (West Sumba) - Sumba Nautil Resort, Nihiwatu Resort, Lelewatu Resort, Rua Beach Resort, Alamayah Resort, The Sanubari Resort, Morika Hotel, Manandang Hotel, La Casa de Luna. *Other places or hotel, please contact us. After your breakfast at the hotel, you will be heading to another beautiful village, Praijing village. This village is built on top of a hill, and if you want to walk through the entire village, you actually have to walk down the hill. You will have an overview of the entire village at the entrance. On top of that, the inhabitants of the village built a spot where you can have a panoramic view of the village and beyond. The village is also surrounded by the beautiful nature of Sumba. Next on your adventure will be the Lapopu Waterfall. After a drive through the endless hilly and green landscape of Sumba, you will arrive near the waterfall. To visit the waterfall, you will need to do a short hike of approximately 15 minutes and cross a bamboo bridge to get there. There is a nice spot to sit down where you can watch the water find its way down the hill. You can also bring your swimming clothes to take a dive in the water just in front of the big waterfall. Meals : No Meals',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-12\", \"text\": \"Pantai Karoso, Ate Dalo, Kec. Kodi, Kabupaten Sumba Barat Daya, Nusa Tenggara Tim.\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Resort Cap Karoso\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5177535,'476','Mr. Alberto Trujillo Cuesta',30508,202864,'Ubud and Surrounding Tour','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-15','2024-08-15','Melysa','Febrina',3,'Persons (3)',2070000.00,'We will be picking you up from your hotel to enjoy the wealth of art in Ubud. First we will visit Monkey Forest; the Ubud Monkey Forest is a nature reserve and temple complex in Ubud, Bali. It houses approximately 340 Crab-eating Macaque (Macacafas cicularis) monkeys. The Monkey Forest contains the Pura Dalem Agung Padangtegal temple as well as a \"Holy Spring\" bathing temple and another temple used for cremation ceremonies. Next we go to Ubud Traditional Art Market where the existence is not far different from other markets available in the tourism area. This market as a society economics center of Ubud and it is apposite to the existence of Ubud Empire that is called Puri Saren. Our last destination is Gua Gajah (Elephant Cave). This cave is built at crevasse edge from the federation of 2 rills that is called Pangkung River, where the irrigation is mixed with Petanu River flow. The word of Gua Gajah is anticipated coming from the word of Lwa Gajah, the name of Buddhist Temple or hermitage for Buddhist monk. There is a relief which is almost looking like the form of mountain on the entrance of this cave. It was carved many designed on the relief like grove with the stick, close leaf, animal for example forest pig, tortoise and specters. The cave mouth is decorated by the bas-relief with the eye turn around to the right or west side. At the end of tour we will transferred back you to the hotel.',NULL,'FD Tour Monkey Forest - Goa Gajah - Tirta Empul - Tegalalang, with Spanish speaking guide','{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Pengosekan, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali Phone: +62361 972385 / +62812-3900-9373\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Pengosekan, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali Phone: +62361 972385 / +62812-3900-9373\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5177540,'548','Maria De Las Nieves Garcia De La Rosa Torrens',30508,212291,'Airport to Jimbaran','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-15','2024-08-15','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": \"ETA 17.30 by Wings Air IW1835 from Tambolaka on 15 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": \"Jl. Karang Mas Sejahtera, Jimbaran, Kuta Selatan, Jimbaran Kuta Selatan, Jimbaran, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80364\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"AYANA Villas Bali\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5177568,'548','Maria De Las Nieves Garcia De La Rosa Torrens',31450,218443,'One Bedroom Ocean View Villa','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-08-15','2024-08-17','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',28056000.00,'Our 298sqm 1BR Ocean View Villa enjoys an exclusive location overlooking the resort’s lavish, landscaped gardens and out to the Indian Ocean beyond. Generous interiors are appointed with premium textiles, custom artworks and opulent furnishings. The tranquil marble bathroom invites you to experience moments of leisure, while five-star amenities enhance your holiday with personalized butler service, VIP check-in and preferred access to Rock Bar.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5177573,'548','Maria De Las Nieves Garcia De La Rosa Torrens',30508,212571,'Jimbaran to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-17','2024-08-17','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-17\", \"text\": \"Jl. Karang Mas Sejahtera, Jimbaran, Kuta Selatan, Jimbaran Kuta Selatan, Jimbaran, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80364\", \"time\": \"19:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"AYANA Villas Bali\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-17\", \"text\": \"ETD 00.05 by Emirates EK399 to Dubai on 18 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5177620,'548','Maria De Las Nieves Garcia De La Rosa Torrens',30805,212248,'DPS-TMC','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-11','2024-08-11','Guio','Tami',2,'Person',5992000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5177624,'548','Maria De Las Nieves Garcia De La Rosa Torrens',30805,212249,'TMC-DPS','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-15','2024-08-15','Guio','Tami',2,'Person',5992000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5177700,'549','Isabel Infante Barrero',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-31','2024-07-31','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',336000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-31\", \"text\": \"ETA 18.35 by Tiger Airways TR286 from Singapore on 31 Jul\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-31\", \"text\": \"Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Rasa Sayang\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5177708,'549','Isabel Infante Barrero',30712,200856,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,5,'2024-07-31','2024-08-05','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',14994000.00,'Spacious home-like rooms of 65 sqm furnished with modern Indonesian art and beautiful Indonesian textiles. The large private balcony or terrace looks out onto the garden or tropical mini-forest in the midst of the resort. Features a private balcony with a day bed. A TV is provided. Attached bathrooms provide shower facilities.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5177734,'549','Isabel Infante Barrero',30508,215968,'Leke leke Waterfall - Ulun Danu Bratan Temple - Tanah Lot Temple','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-02','2024-08-02','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1792000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-02\", \"text\": \"Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Rasa Sayang\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5177736,'549','Isabel Infante Barrero',30508,215968,'Goa Lawah - Lempuyang Temple - Kanto Lampo Waterfall','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-03','2024-08-03','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1792000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Rasa Sayang\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5177742,'549','Isabel Infante Barrero',30508,207379,'Ubud to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-05','2024-08-05','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-05\", \"text\": \"Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"10:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Rasa Sayang\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-05\", \"text\": \"ETD 13.30 to Gili Air by Gili Gili Fast Boat\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5178171,'550','Matthias Rosenkranz',30680,200914,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-25','2024-07-26','Melysa','Komang',2,'Double + Twin',1792000.00,'Enjoy our spacious elegant deluxe room with 40 m2 of room size. Enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, hot and cold shower, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. - Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK–IN','{\"date\": \"2024-07-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5178174,'550','Matthias Rosenkranz',30806,202002,'4D3N Borneo Orangutan & Reforestation Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO7',4,'2024-07-26','2024-07-29','Melysa','Komang',4,'Persons (4)',17696000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN – KUMAI PORT – TANJUNG HARAPAN Your “Orangutan & Reforestation Tour” begins upon arrival at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan is Cape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch – Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : TANJUNG HARAPAN VILLAGE – PROBOSCIS TOUR – CAMP LEAKEY After an extraordinary breakfast, you go to visit the village inside the national park, named Tanjung Harapan Village. Here you will see the activities of the locals. After the visit, you will return to the klotok cruise up to the Sekonyer River. You will see nice vegetation around the river bank, including Nipa Palm, Pandanus, and some kinds of trees that are growing up around the river. See some wildlifes such as birds, Macaques, Proboscis Monkeys and Orangutans. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large monitor lizards. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. Note: The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. Meals : Breakfast – Lunch – Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : PONDOK TANGGUI – CAMP LEAKEY – BOAT After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continue to add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After lunch, you will have the opportunity to repeat feeding camp at Camp Leaky. It is a unique opportunity to dedicate more time to your observation and to discover more wild animals, along with the Orangutans. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note: If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast – Lunch – Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 4 : KUMAI PORT – PANGKALAN BUN Today we end our stay in the jungles of Borneo. Our “Orangutan & Reforestation Tour” is about to finish. In the early morning we will have breakfast on the boat, to then go to the port and in turn, be transferred to the airport. The boat departure will be at the latest at 10am, but we adapt to your flights if your flight leaves earlier in the morning. If you decide to take an afternoon flight, we can take you directly to the airport at 10 or if you want a city tour in the Arut village to drop you off at the airport later, it could be arranged at extra cost. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-07-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5178176,'550','Matthias Rosenkranz',30679,200582,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-30','2024-07-31','Melysa','Komang',2,'Double + Twin',3847036.48,'Stylish, spacious and bright with an open-concept bedroom and bathroom, and a private balcony with daybed. Room includes a desk, a small sofa and a floor-to-ceiling window for maximum natural light.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5178179,'550','Matthias Rosenkranz',30684,200640,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-29','2024-07-30','Melysa','Komang',2,'Double + Twin',3780000.00,'Designed to embody fresher and younger ambience, our Deluxe Room is a convenient stay for those who plan a relatively shorter stay in Semarang. The room is provided with either a king size or deluxe twin beds.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5178198,'550','Matthias Rosenkranz',31015,214685,'3D2N Surabaya - Bromo - Ijen - Bali / A. Jiwa Jawa Bromo (Deluxe Room) & Dialoog Banyuwangi(Deluxe r','Confirmed','C2I-JAVA10',3,'2024-07-29','2024-07-31','Melysa','Komang',1,'Persons (4-5 / Single)',7173600.00,'Day 1 : Surabaya - Bromo Volcano Skirts Upon arrival at Surabaya airport, our representative will be waiting for you with a sign indicating your name to begin the journey of about 4 hours to your hotel on the slopes of the majestic Bromo Volcano. Check-in at your hotel for deserved rest after so many hours traveling. Meals : - Accommodation : A. Jiwa Jawa Bromo - Deluxe Room Day 2 : Bromo Tour, The Dawn - Fumaroles - Ijen Very early, your guide and a jeep driver will be waiting for you at the hotel to attend one of the most spectacular sunrises in Indonesia. Even though you have to get up early, it will be worth it. You will climb to a high point first in full darkness and, little by little the first rays of sun are giving way to a huge and indescribable caldera that makes up the entire view of the Bromo and Semeru Natural Park. With Bromo, a volcano of great fumaroles and behind it, the Semeru Volcano with explosions every 20 minutes exactly, will make you have one of the most rewarding experiences ever. After enjoying the sunrise, by jeep, you will descend to the sea of sand. You can walk across the sand dune and go to Bromo volcano. After climbing some stairs you can reach the very edge of its crater and see the impressive activity it has. You return to the hotel to cool off and enjoy your breakfast. At the agreed time, you will leave for our next destination, the Ijen volcano. This section lasts about 7-8 hours by car where you will make a stop to eat. Take this trip to rest. You will arrive at the appointed hotel near Ijen crater, where you will check in and enjoy your well-deserved rest. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : A. Ijen Resort - Villa’s Deluxe Day 3 : Trekking Ijen - Bali The day has finally come to visit one of the most attractive volcanoes in Indonesia! One of the last open pit sulfur mines that survive on the planet. For this climb you can choose between two schedules; leave very early at 1 AM to see the blue fire (please note that it is not always visible, for example during rainy days) or leave more quietly at 4 AM only for the sunrise. You can decide later when you meet the guide. Once you pick you up at your hotel, you will head towards the village of Licin to reach the slope of the volcano to begin the steep climb to the crater of the volcano. During this trek, your guide will give you double filter masks to protect you from the natural chemicals of sulfur. At an altitude of 2883 meters and when dawn begins, an incredible contrast of colors will open before your eyes. A yellow earth scene and a large turquoise blue lake inside the crater that contrast with a suspended white cloud that is continuously expelling the volcano. In turn, among so much beauty you will see the local miners do what is said to be one of the toughest jobs in the world. These miners go down to the crater of the volcano to load 80 to 100 kilos of sulfur on their shoulders and then sell it. After this amazing experience on the edge of Ijen volcano crater, you will begin the descent with an incredible panoramic view of the mountains that make up the national park. You will be taken you to your hotel to cool off and have breakfast and you will start the journey to Bali for about 5 hours at least, depending on where you stay in Bali. To do this, you will go first to the port of Banyuwangi where you will take the ferry to cross to Bali. It is a journey of only 30 minutes, but remember to adjust your watch by an hour due to the time zone change. Welcome to the island of the Gods. End of service. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Schedule Flight Arrival in Surabaya : ETA : 10.00 by Batik Air ID6134 from Pangkalan Bun on 29 July 202 Hotel in Bromo : Jiwa Jawa Bromo Hotel in Banyuwangi : Dialoog Banyuwangi Dropoff Bali (Ubud) Hotel : The Westin Resort & Spa Ubud','{\"date\": \"2024-07-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5178208,'551','Juan Pereyra',30508,212289,'Airport to Nusa Dua','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-19','2024-07-19','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (4-6)',672000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-19\", \"text\": \"ETA : 22.20h by Emirates EK398 from Dubai on 19 July 2024\", \"time\": \"22:20\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-19\", \"text\": \"Sadara Boutique Hotel, Tanjung Benoa, Jl. Pratama, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80363 Telepon: (0361) 772010\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Benoa, Nusa Dua\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5178212,'551','Juan Pereyra',30580,202387,'Sadara Premier Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-19','2024-07-20','Guio','Komang',2,'Double + Twin',3696000.00,'One bedroom SADARA Premier offers pleasant experience. Decorated with a modern interior which brings the comfort and style at the same time. With 42 square meters size, this air-conditioned room has its own private balcony or terrace overlooking the boasting garden and overviewing the tranquil blue ocean. The complete room facilities of a minibar, coffee and tea maker, hairdryer, 2 mineral bottles and safety box, Free win, will make your stay conveniently.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5178214,'551','Juan Pereyra',30914,202449,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-07-27','2024-07-29','Guio','Komang',2,'Double + Twin',8736000.00,'The room is spacious at 48 sqm with king and twin size beds capacity of 2 (two) adults and 2 (two) child below 12 years old, decked with combination of Balinese-modern contemporary elements, immaculately designed to characterize each of Seven Balinese Goddesses. Located on a higher level of each Puri, the room is equipped with every amenity that could possibly be required, making it ideal for a single traveler or couples.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5178217,'551','Juan Pereyra',30508,207268,'Nusa Dua to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-29','2024-07-29','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (4-6)',672000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-29\", \"text\": \"Merusaka Nusa Dua, Kawasan Wisata Nusa Dua Lot S-3, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80363 Telepon: (0361) 2002900\", \"time\": \"15:45\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Dua\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-29\", \"text\": \"ETD: 19.49h by emirates EK369 to Dubai on 29 July 2024\", \"t