usa Penida','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-15','2024-08-15','Ayu','Tami',2,'Persons (1-3)',448000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"07:30\", \"locality\": \"Māua Nusa Penida\", \"location\": \"Sakti, Nusa Penida, Klungkung Regency\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"BlueWater Express office at Buyuk harbour Nusa Penida\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5178250,'552','Nicoletta Mammucari',30508,207264,'Candidasa to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-24','2024-08-24','Ayu','Tami',2,'Persons (4-6)',2464000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-24\", \"text\": \"Jl. Mendira, Sengkidu, Kec. Manggis, Kabupaten Karangasem\", \"time\": \"20:00\", \"locality\": \"Candi Beach Resort and Spa\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-24\", \"text\": \"ETD 01.05 by QR961 to Doha on 25 August 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Ngurah Rai Airport\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5178555,'553','Eduard Arnau',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-04','2024-08-05','Guio','Komang',2,'Double',1680000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. - Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK–IN','{\"date\": \"2024-08-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5178556,'553','Eduard Arnau',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-08-05','2024-08-07','Guio','Komang',4,'Persons (4)',14880000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan isCape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continueto add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-08-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5178557,'553','Eduard Arnau',30783,214611,'3D2N Semarang - Yogyakarta / C. Adhisthana (Superior Room)','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-08-07','2024-08-09','Guio','Komang',4,'Persons (2 / Double)',16200000.00,'D1 : Arrival at Semarang Airport - Borobudur Temple tour incl. Mendut and Pawon - Transfer to Jogja Welcome to the cradle of Indonesian culture, Yogyakarta. A tourist destination for its ancient palaces, temples, batik workshops, gamelan music orchestras, court dances and wayang puppet shows. Upon your arrival in Semarang airport a representative of come2indonesia will be waiting for you with a sign indicating your name to start exploring this special city. We will start by heading towards Borobudur Temple (Candi Borobudur), the great Stupa, the largest Buddhist monument in the world and one of the seven wonders. We will tour around the temple, observe the hundreds and centenary statues of Buddha and witness how dozens of Buddhists come to preach from all over the world. Historically it was established during the relatively brief Sailendra dynasty of Central Java between 778 and 856 BC and is in constant restoration due to the breaks that the tremors of the neighbouring Merapi volcano has been producing during its history. After visiting one of the most important Buddhist temples in Southeast Asia, we continue our journey to the Mendut temple and Pawon temple. And then, we will take you to Jogjakarta. D2 : Jogjakarta City Tour visit Sultan Palace, Watercastle and Bird Market - Visit Prambanan Temple You will enjoy a well-deserved breakfast at the hotel and we will start by heading towards Keraton known as the Sultan’s Palace. The palace is a complex building two centuries old, located in the heart of the city. You will hear the song of the “freedom” of the birds in the bird market, we will visit the “Water Castle” that occupies the highest part at the northern end of the vast complex of Taman Sari, Malioboro Street, main street of Yogyakarta, with its merchants, horse carriages, taxi-bikes and markets. After this visit we go to Candi Prambanan, the temple of the Hinduists and classified as a World Heritage Site by Unesco since 1991. The built of this temple was finished around the year 856 to commemorate the victory of the descendant Sanjaya of Siva, Rikai Pikatan on the last sovereign Sailendra of Central Java. Take your time to enjoy each carving on the rocks and feel the spirituality that each of the stones perched in this set of more than 200 Hindu temples that are dedicated to the Trimurti, the expression of God as the Creator, the Preserver and the destroyer. An incredible experience that will make the hours fly by. After this unforgettable day, we will take you back to your hotel. D3 : Transfer to Yogyakarta International Airport You will enjoy a well-deserved breakfast at the hotel and according to the time of your flight, we will pick you up to take you to the airport and take the flight to your next destination. End of our services. Thank you very much for exploring Yogyakarta by the hand of Come2indonesia.',NULL,'D1/07 Aug : Arrival Semarang - Prambanan - Yogyakarta D2/08 Aug : Yogyakarta City Tour - Borobudur D3/09 Aug : Out - YIA Based on Adhistana Hotel - Deluxe room 1 Double + 1 Twin room','{\"date\": \"2024-08-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5178558,'553','Eduard Arnau',31106,203994,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-09','2024-08-10','Guio','Komang',2,'Double + Twin',1620000.00,'Discover Makassar from a very comfortable room with a king-size bed (or two single beds), a practical desk with an executive chair, and a modern bathroom with an open shower. You will also really like the welcome minibar to start your stay as you deserve. Inside the room has flat-screen TV, high speed Wi-Fi, and refrigerator.',NULL,'Return Transfer by INNOVA CAR Please ready on hotel lobby for transfer at 06.15 AM','{\"date\": \"2024-08-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5178559,'553','Eduard Arnau',30644,201464,'4D3N Toraja Package (3N Toraja)','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-08-10','2024-08-13','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (4)',15000000.00,NULL,NULL,'4D3N Toraja Tour - based on Heritage Toraja (Superior room) note : Double bedroom subject to availability','{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5178563,'554','Vicente Garcia',30508,212287,'Airport to Sanur','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-08','2024-07-08','Norberto','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',300000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-08\", \"text\": \"ETA 10.55 by Citilink QG682 from Jakarta on 08 Jul\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-08\", \"text\": \"Jl. Cemara No.35, Sanur, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali 80228\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Puri Santrian\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5178565,'549','Isabel Infante Barrero',32502,215362,'The Tide Room','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-08-05','2024-08-08','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',11491200.00,'Experience a romantic getaway with The Tide, an exquisite suite designed to cater two couples or small families. Nestled under a majestic bamboo ceiling, our king-sized bedroom leads you straight into your private infinity pool. Unwind in your secluded garden and soak in the tranquility that surrounds you. With accomodation size 80 m2, garden size 50 m2, and the bed type kingsize bed + sofa bed.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5178567,'549','Isabel Infante Barrero',30508,212301,'Padang Bai to Uluwatu','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-08','2024-08-08','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": \"ETA 17.30 by Gili Gili Fast Boat from Gili Air\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": \"Jl. Pantai Balangan, Jimbaran, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"La Joya Balangan Beach Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5178568,'549','Isabel Infante Barrero',30913,202439,'Standard Bungalow Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-08-08','2024-08-10','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',4191264.00,'All Bungalows in La Joya Balangan Resort have been designed to combine traditional Balinese elegance with a rustic interior. Each Standard Bungalow sits on an open lush garden and features a mini outdoor lounging deck. Part of the room is made up of either wood-framed glass panels or sliding glass doors, which allows natural light to flood through the room. On top of the king-sized bed, all bungalows come in with a side lounge space which can be used as an extra bed for a young child. Mosquito netted beds lets you to have the bungalow open, allowing fresh air in, from the lush garden at night.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5178569,'549','Isabel Infante Barrero',30508,212571,'Jimbaran to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-10','2024-08-10','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": \"Jl. Pantai Balangan, Jimbaran, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"La Joya Balangan Beach Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": \"ETD 12.45 by Batik Air OD158 to Kuala Lumpur on 10 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5178701,'536','Elio Vazquez Ambrosio',30769,201348,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-07-06','2024-07-09','Guio','Komang',2,'Double',6840000.00,'20 units of 35 sqm each Deluxe rooms are modern‐minimalism designed. Advance facilities such as TV, coffee/tea maker, balcony/terrace, safety deposit box, minibar, and complete bathroom facilities, this room type is a value for money choice.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5178720,'555','Marie Louise Dieringer (September-October 2024)',30508,212287,'Airport to Sanur','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-24','2024-09-24','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Persons (1-3)',300000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-24\", \"text\": \"ETA: 14.35 by Garuda Indonesia GA407 from Jakarta on 24 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Denpasar Airport\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Puri Santrian Resort Sanur\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5178779,'555','Marie Louise Dieringer (September-October 2024)',30720,202970,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-09-24','2024-09-26','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Single',4800000.00,'Styled for personal comfort and convenience, the Superior room category is an inviting space that captures the essence of Bali. At 35 sqm of room area, with double / twin bed capacity of 2A 1C or 3A with extra bed. Set amidst tropical landscape, this air-conditioned room comes with a private balcony, flat-screen cable TV and a safety deposit box. En suite bathroom comes with bath and shower facilities.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5178796,'557','Maria Luisa Serrano Garcia',30680,200919,'Premier Family Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-14','2024-09-15','Jacob','Tami',1,'Single + Double',1440000.00,'The most important things in this world is family. Thoughtfully designed with families in mind, our Family Premier Room includes everything needed for you and your family to feel comfortable during your stay. At 43 m2 pf room size with 1 king size and 1 twin size, this room equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, hot and cold shower, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer. Free access to our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers.',NULL,'Maria Luisa is allergy to all kinds of peppers.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5178798,'557','Maria Luisa Serrano Garcia',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-09-15','2024-09-17','Jacob','Tami',3,'Persons (3)',12600000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan isCape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continueto add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Maria Luisa is allergy to all kinds of peppers Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-15\", \"text\": \"ETA 07.15 by Batik Air ID6202 from Jakarta on 15 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pangkalan Bun Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-17\", \"text\": \"ETD 14.10 by Nam Air IN191 to Jakarta on 17 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5178806,'557','Maria Luisa Serrano Garcia',30680,200919,'Premier Family Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-17','2024-09-18','Jacob','Tami',1,'Single + Double',1440000.00,'The most important things in this world is family. Thoughtfully designed with families in mind, our Family Premier Room includes everything needed for you and your family to feel comfortable during your stay. At 43 m2 pf room size with 1 king size and 1 twin size, this room equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, hot and cold shower, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer. Free access to our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers.',NULL,'Maria Luisa is allergy to all kinds of peppers.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5178810,'557','Maria Luisa Serrano Garcia',31591,207373,'3D2N Tangkoko','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-09-18','2024-09-20','Jacob','Tami',3,'Persons (3)',11700000.00,'Day 1 : MANADO - TANGKOKO - The expedition begins The adventure begins with meeting your guide at the Manado airport. Then you will start the journey of about 2 and a half hours by car to the Tangkoko Forest where you will do the check in at your Homestay or Lodge. Upon arrival, you will have a talk about what you will see and preparations for the trekking. Meals : Dinner Accommodation : Bird House Homestay or Similar Days 02 : Tangkoko Nature Reserve These days will be dedicated to exploring the jungle in search of animals and bird watching. You will start the trekking that will take you to Tangkok National Park. In just 40 minutes by boat, you will reach the Batuangus beach where you will then climb Mount Tangkoko (1500 m). The dense and virgin jungle is home to some unique animal species in North Sulawesi such as the crested black macaque and the tarsier spectrum that has become known as \"the smallest primate in the world\". As you will be trekking through the lush jungle, you will probably see and hear the red gnarled hornbill as well as the Maleo which is a Megapod Bird that lays eggs on large mounds it builds on the black sand. You can also find couscous, which is a relative of the Australian koala. The forest ranger will accompany you all the way to the top of Tangkoko Mountain. In the afternoon you will return to the station. Alternatively, you can have three hours of trekking in the lowland jungle or swimming on the black sand beach of Tangkoko Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Bird House Homestay or Similar Day 03 : Tangkoko - Manado After breakfast, you can spend the morning in the surroundings of the National Park and at the agreed time, with your guide, you will have the transfer to Manado. Thank you for exploring this unique jungle with us. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Maria Luisa is allergy to all kinds of peppers.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-18\", \"text\": \"ETA 12.25 by Batik Air ID6280 from Jakarta on 18 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Manado International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-20\", \"text\": \"ETD 11.00 by Lion Air JT743 to Denpasar on 20 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5178836,'265','Elizabeth Jane Carter',30700,204108,'Deluxe Double Sea View Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-16','2024-08-17','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Double',1200000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5178838,'265','Elizabeth Jane Carter',30700,212943,'One-Way Airport Transfer (Shared)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-17','2024-08-17','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Per Car',120000.00,NULL,'Capacity for 14 Adults',NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5178851,'557','Maria Luisa Serrano Garcia',30571,202567,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-20','2024-09-21','Jacob','Tami',1,'Double',1470000.00,'Located at the Second Floor, 35 sqm comfort living with a touch of Balinese style featuring completed fitting, Cable TV, a fancy bathroom comprises rain shower and good quality amenities. Also dedicated Wi-Fi Access to complete your day.',NULL,'Maria Luisa is allergy to all kinds of peppers.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5178863,'557','Maria Luisa Serrano Garcia',31083,212380,'3D2N LOB Rinca - Padar - Komodo Island Tour (Medium Standard B. - Purisari, etc)','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-09-21','2024-09-23','Jacob','Tami',3,'Persons (2-3)',39996000.00,'TOUR ITINERARY Highlights: Menjarite, Kelor, Kalong, Rinca, Padar, Komodo island, Pink Beach, Taka Makassar, Manta Point, Kanawa, Batu Cermin Mirror Cave DAY 1 : DENPASAR - LABUAN BAJO - MENJARITE - PADAR - KELOR - KALONG ISLAND Arrival at Komodo Airport in Labuan Bajo west Flores, meeting service with our tour guide and transfer to the pier of Labuan Bajo for Rinca Island. It’s about 2 hours sail to the island of Komodo Dragon, stop at Menjarite island for snorkeling then continue to Rinca island-the Island of Komodo dragon, you will find not just e Dragons but also many wild animals like, deer, wild buffalo, long-tailed macaque and wild pig also numerous of birds. Keep your eyes look up as sometime you will find the young Komodo dragons on the trees. A local ranger will lead you through this natural preservation. Late afternoon sailing directly to Kalong Rinca Island to see the hundreds of fling foxes set out from the mangrove tree at 06-07 pm, the lovely sunset from the boat trip really enjoyable here. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Boat Cabin Air Conditioning DAY 2 : KALONG - PADAR - KOMODO - PINK BEACH - MANTA POINT - TAKA MAKASSAR - LABUAN BAJO After having breakfast in your boat, heading to Padar Island, taking trek to Padar Island until having the top view point to get breathtaking scenery of three bays around, Padar Island hike in Komodo has some of the most amazing views in Indonesia, trek to downhill and back to the Boat for sailing directly to Loh Liang – the Ranger station in Komodo Island. By passing through many small islands, After registering start to take basic trekking to see the GIANT RIZARD / KOMODO DRAGON and other wild animals as: Timor deer, wild pig, wild chicken and many variously of tropical bird. Please keep your look at any directions as sometimes you will also find young Komodo dragon hanging over the trees. A local ranger will be led you during the trek. Return to the boat on to Pink beach for snorkeling, swimming and relaxing. It is really spectacular and unspoiled coral reef and many color fish. This is one of best side for snorkeling diving. Sail toward MANTA POINT to exploring Huge Mantas by snorkeling even watching from your boat trip (can’t be guaranteed if weather is not good, like wave and current are strongly) visit also the taka Makaasar its really tiny island with white sand beach really enjoyable to relaxing or beach walking then heading to Labuan bajo for overnight and dinner at above hotel list option. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner DAY 3 : LABUAN BAJO - DENPASAR After breakfast taking your next excursion with visiting local marke and Batu Cermin (Mirror Stone) Cave. The grotto is 75 by 75 meters large, and contains stalactites and stalagmites. Some tunnels are narrow and dark but in others sunlight falls, then process to the airport for flight to Denpasar or to your next destination. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch Attention: The itinerary is subject to change due to the weather, tide level and operating conditions without prior notice.',NULL,'Maria Luisa is allergy to all kinds of peppers.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-21\", \"text\": \"ETA 09.10 by Batik Air ID6333 from Denpasar on 21 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komodo International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-23\", \"text\": \"ETD 08.50 by Air Asia QZ645 to Denpasar on 23 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5178871,'557','Maria Luisa Serrano Garcia',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-23','2024-09-23','Jacob','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',360000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-23\", \"text\": \"ETA 10.10 by Air Asia QZ645 from Labuan Bajo on 23 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-23\", \"text\": \"Jl. Suweta, Bentuyung Sakti, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5178873,'557','Maria Luisa Serrano Garcia',30985,212179,'Jungle Suite Room with Private Balcony','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-09-23','2024-09-25','Jacob','Tami',1,'Double',4680000.00,'Escape the hustle and bustle of everyday life and immerse yourself in the beauty of nature with our Jungle Suite with Private Balcony. Located in the heart of the lush tropical rainforest, this Suite offers a unique opportunity to immerse yourself in nature while still enjoying all the comforts of modern living. The real highlight of this room category is the private balcony overlooking the jungle canopy. Relax in your own personal paradise as you listen to the sounds of nature, watch the birds playing in the trees, and breathe in the fresh air while taking in the breathtaking views.',NULL,'Maria Luisa is allergy to all kinds of peppers.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5178879,'557','Maria Luisa Serrano Garcia',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-24','2024-09-24','Jacob','Tami',3,'Persons (3)',2160000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-24\", \"text\": \"Jl. Suweta, Bentuyung Sakti, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5178880,'557','Maria Luisa Serrano Garcia',30508,213032,'Ubud to Kusamba','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-25','2024-09-25','Jacob','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',420000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-25\", \"text\": \"Jl. Suweta, Bentuyung Sakti, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-25\", \"text\": \"ETD 08.00 to Nusa Penida by The Angkal Fast Boat\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kusamba Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5178904,'557','Maria Luisa Serrano Garcia',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-09-25','2024-09-25','Jacob','Tami',3,'Persons (3)',1080000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,'Maria Luisa is allergy to all kinds of peppers.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-25\", \"text\": \"ETA in between 08.30 - 08.45 from Kusamba by The Angkal Fast Boat\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sampalan Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-25\", \"text\": \"Sakti, Nusa Penida, Klungkung Regency, Bali 80771\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Adiwana Warnakali Resort - Nusa Penida\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5178913,'557','Maria Luisa Serrano Garcia',30547,200475,'Ocean View Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-09-25','2024-09-27','Jacob','Tami',1,'Double',4800000.00,'Adiwana Warnakali boasts a collection of 12 Ocean View suites, all situated on the lower level, have a room size 56 sqm and the type bed single or double. Each of these suites offers a generously-sized balcony that unveils breathtaking vistas of the vast, cerulean expanse of the Nusa Lembongan ocean and the majestic presence of Mount Agung. Here, your mornings resemble scenes from a captivating movie, with the invigorating scent of the sea and the soothing melody of waves crashing against the rugged cliffs. The spacious rooms are designed for your utmost comfort, sporting a nautical theme that incorporates oars as charming decorative elements. The bathrooms are adorned with striking blue tiles, adding to the overall maritime charm. Immerse yourself in an unforgettable and idyllic stay at Adiwana Warnakali.',NULL,'Maria Luisa is allergy to all kinds of peppers.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5178917,'557','Maria Luisa Serrano Garcia',30508,207337,'Snorkeling at Nusa Penida (Sharing Trip)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-26','2024-09-26','Jacob','Tami',3,'Persons (3)',1620000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-26\", \"text\": \"Sakti, Nusa Penida, Klungkung Regency, Bali 80771\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Adiwana Warnakali Resort - Nusa Penida\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5178956,'557','Maria Luisa Serrano Garcia',30508,212455,'Sanur to Sanur','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-27','2024-09-27','Jacob','Tami',3,'Persons (1-3)',900000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-27\", \"text\": \"ETA 13.00 from Nusa Penida by Maruti Fast Boat\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sanur Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-27\", \"text\": \"Jl. Cemara No.35, Sanur, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali 80228\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Puri Santrian\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5178961,'557','Maria Luisa Serrano Garcia',30720,202970,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-27','2024-09-28','Jacob','Tami',1,'Double',2220000.00,'Styled for personal comfort and convenience, the Superior room category is an inviting space that captures the essence of Bali. At 35 sqm of room area, with double / twin bed capacity of 2A 1C or 3A with extra bed. Set amidst tropical landscape, this air-conditioned room comes with a private balcony, flat-screen cable TV and a safety deposit box. En suite bathroom comes with bath and shower facilities.',NULL,'Maria Luisa is allergy to all kinds of peppers.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5178973,'557','Maria Luisa Serrano Garcia',30508,207269,'Sanur to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-28','2024-09-28','Jacob','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',300000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-28\", \"text\": \"Jl. Cemara No.35, Sanur, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali 80228\", \"time\": \"15:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Puri Santrian\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-28\", \"text\": \"ETD 19.10 by Qatar Airways QR963 to Doha on 28 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5179023,'553','Eduard Arnau',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-13','2024-08-13','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (4-6)',840000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": \"ETA : 15.40 by Lion Air JT745 from Ujung Pandang on 13 August 2024\", \"time\": \"15:40\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": \"Pertiwi Bisma 1 Ubud, Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kec. Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 978018\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5179049,'552','Nicoletta Mammucari',30508,218455,'Padang Bai to Candidasa','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-20','2024-08-20','Ayu','Tami',2,'Persons (1-3)',1232000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"12:25\", \"locality\": \"Blue Water Express Padang Bai Harbor\", \"location\": \"Jl. Silayukti, Padangbai, Kec. Manggis, Kabupaten Karangasem\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Candi Beach Resort & Spa\", \"location\": \"Jl. Mendira, Sengkidu, Kec. Manggis, Kabupaten Karangasem\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5179083,'558','EDOARDO INGRASSIA',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-05','2024-08-05','Ayu','Wiwik',4,'Persons (4-6)',3136000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-05\", \"text\": \"ETA: 23.50 by Korean Air KE629 from Seoul on 05 August 2024\", \"time\": \"23:50\", \"locality\": \"Ngurah Rai Airport (International)\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Alaya Resort Ubud\", \"location\": \"Jl. Hanoman, Ubud, Kec. Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Phone: (0361) 972200\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5179087,'558','EDOARDO INGRASSIA',30508,202896,'Bali Village Life - Tanah Lot Temple','Confirmed','C2I-BALI05',1,'2024-08-06','2024-08-06','Ayu','Wiwik',4,'Persons (4)',4032000.00,'At 08.00 am, we pick you up from your hotel and start our journey to Tunjuk Village in Tabanan district. Upon arrival, you will be greeted with open arms and with the warm smiles of the locals you meet along the way. You\'ll meet in the outer courtyard of the village temple and meet your local guides. Throughout the hike you will meet people from the village involved in the tasks that keep their lives busy day in and day out. You can choose to observe or participate in them to gain a better understanding of village life. The mighty water buffalo is still used to drag the plough through the muddy rice paddies and prepare the land for planting. Or maybe you want to help with planting or harvesting, depending on the time of year. When you complete the tour in the rice paddies, you\'ll follow your guide on a path through lush gardens where villagers go about their daily chores. There are women who beat the rice with heavy mallets to remove the hooves. After lunch we leave Tunjuk Village and continue our journey to visit THE TANAH LOT. We\'ll close the visit by watching the sunset at the most famous and photographed temple in Bali. Torn from the earth on a stone pedestal sculpted by the incoming tides, the solitary black towers of Tanah Lot and the plumes of foliage spilling over the precipices, recall the delicacy of Chinese painting. The Pura Tanah Lot or the Earth Temple in the middle of the sea was built in the 16th century. At the end of the day, you\'ll be transferred to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": \"Alaya Resort Ubud\", \"location\": \"Jl. Hanoman, Ubud, Kec. Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Phone: (0361) 972200\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Alaya Resort Ubud\", \"location\": \"Jl. Hanoman, Ubud, Kec. Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5179380,'556','Mary Osterday Griffin',32660,216225,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-08-31','2024-09-02','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Single',1560000.00,'Rooms with international standard quality facilities. Modern and elegant design provides unforgettable comfort. Equipped with facilities such as: Hot and Cool Water, Coffee and Tea Maker, Amenities, Linen and Bed with star hotel standard quality.',NULL,'Check-in time 12.00 Check-out time 14.00','{\"date\": \"2024-08-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5179387,'558','EDOARDO INGRASSIA',30508,213032,'Ubud to Kusamba','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-08','2024-08-08','Ayu','Wiwik',4,'Persons (4-6)',3136000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"07:00\", \"locality\": \"ALAYA RESORT UBUD\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": \"ETD FAST BOAT 09.30 TO NUSA PENIDA (SAMPALAN HARBOUR)\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"OFFICE THE ANGKAL FAST BOAT\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5179394,'558','EDOARDO INGRASSIA',30728,207493,'Bumi Gora / Kuta Tour','Confirmed','EXC 03',1,'2024-08-13','2024-08-13','Ayu','Wiwik',4,'Persons (3-5)',3248000.00,'This tour takes you first to the Pottery Village of Banyumulek. Observe how the local women produce pottery stuffs. Then, visit Sukarare village; renowned for its traditional hand weaving of brightly patterned “songket”, “ikat” and “sarong” cloths. We will observe how the regenerate of weaving tradition goes on in the village. Girl, mother and grandmother even great grandmother do weaving activity together in the village. Next the tour continues to Ende village, featuring the unique traditional houses with its buffalo dung floors. Lunch is served at one of local restaurants in New Kuta Mandalika area. Then, we visit the beautiful beach of Tanjung A’an, one of the most scenic and un-spoilt beaches in this part of Lombok. We may have chance to trek Merese Hills to enjoy magnificent panorama of Indian Ocean.',NULL,'Program: Banyumelek Village - Sukarare Village - Ende Village - Tanjung A\'AN','{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"Katamaran Resort Senggigi\", \"location\": \"Jl. Raya Senggigi, Senggigi, Kec. Batu Layar, Kabupaten Lombok Barat\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Katamaran Resort Senggigi\", \"location\": \"Jl. Raya Senggigi, Senggigi, Kec. Batu Layar, Kabupaten Lombok Barat\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5179395,'558','EDOARDO INGRASSIA',30825,217370,'Jakarta City Tour','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-29','2024-08-29','Ayu','Wiwik',4,'Persons (2-4)',4032000.00,NULL,NULL,'FD Tour Jakarta City Tour visiting Sunda Kelapa, Fatahillah Square, Puppet Museum and National Monument (incl. lunch) with English speaking guide Flight information: ETA 12.45 by ID6525 from Labuan Bajo on 29 August 2024 ETD 21.50 by KE628 to Seoul on 29 August 2024','{\"date\": \"2024-08-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5179396,'558','EDOARDO INGRASSIA',30508,202890,'Mount Batur Sunrise Trekking Tour','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-18','2024-08-18','Ayu','Wiwik',4,'Persons (4)',2240000.00,'Enjoy trek or climb Mount Batur and see the sunrise from the top of Batur Volcano. The Batur Volcano is one of the sacred mountain according to Hindu believe. We will get in ahead of schedule morning around 02.00 am depend the area of you stay, and afterward we specifically going to Mount Batur starting point. Starting in the dark under starlight sky, you will be guided to ascend the slope of Mount Batur. You will approach the peak of Mount Batur (1717 meters) at about 06.00 am. While waiting for the sunrise you will have a simple breakfast and hot coffee or tea served by your guide in Mount Batur. Witness the breathtaking sunrise overlooking the majestic view of Lake Batur and Mount Rinjani. After witnessing the sunrise, continue for our descent, at about 9 am, you will be arriving at the finishing point.',NULL,'Private Mount Batur Sunrise Trekking Tour with Black Lava Jeep','{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"02:00\", \"locality\": \"Siddhartha Oceanfront Resort & Spa Tulamben\", \"location\": \"Jl. Amlapura-Singaraja, Kubu, Karangasem Regency. Phone: (0363) 23034\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Siddhartha Oceanfront Resort & Spa Tulamben\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5179412,'558','EDOARDO INGRASSIA',30508,202895,'East Bali Tour','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-17','2024-08-17','Ayu','Wiwik',4,'Persons (4)',2800000.00,'In this part of the trip, we set off along the East Coast of the island. The first site visit will be the Kusamba Village, a fishing village where colorful Prahu in the black sand beaches. We will announce the salt making process by traditional method. We continue our journey on the east coast to reach Goa Lawah, Gua Lawah or Bat Cave is one of favorite places of interest in Bali and it is located near of hilly bank so it is called reef of Middle hill. We continue our trip to Tenganan Village, Tenganan Village is one of the oldest Balinese Traditional located in Karangasem Regency, east part of Bali. This village is much referred by cultural literature science of Tenganan Pegringsingan, which is very famous in the island. It owns very unique local community life pattern which is one example of Bali Aga Village cultures (Hindu Prehistoric) and different with other countryside in plain of Bali. From here, we go to Amlapura to visit the Royal Palace, The town of Amlapura is the capital of Karangasem (\'East Bali\'). The palace of the former kings of the region is located here, and their descendants have opened parts of the complex to the public. We will finish our trip with visit heaven of Tirta Gangga, Tirta Gangga is a beautiful park with the huge water fountain. At the end of tour we will transfer you back to the hotel.',NULL,'Program: Tirta Gangga - Taman Ujung','{\"date\": \"2024-08-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"13:00\", \"locality\": \"Padang Bai Harbour (Eka Jaya Fast Boat)\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Siddhartha Resort Tulamben\", \"location\": \"Jl. Amlapura-Singaraja, Kubu, Karangasem Regency, Phone: (0363) 23034\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5179423,'553','Eduard Arnau',30769,201351,'Joglo Villa Pool View','Confirmed',NULL,5,'2024-08-13','2024-08-18','Guio','Komang',2,'Double + Twin',18600000.00,'6 units of Joglo Villa Pool View is designed in a traditional Joglo house with a high quality of woods materials. The villas are sized 40 sqm each set on the Campuhan riverbank overlooking valley and main pool. Advance facilities yet functionally placed and layout to ensure total guests’ privacy and comfort.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5179440,'553','Eduard Arnau',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route (Taman Ayun-Jati Luwih-Bedugul-Tanah Lot)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-14','2024-08-14','Guio','Komang',4,'Persons (4)',2832000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": \"Pertiwi Bisma 1 Ubud, Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kec. Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 978018\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": \"Pertiwi Bisma 1 Ubud, Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kec. Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 978018\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5179450,'553','Eduard Arnau',30508,202882,'The Mother Temple Besakih and Surrounding (Goa Lawah-Kusamba-Kerta Gosa-Besakih-Bukit Jambul)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-15','2024-08-15','Guio','Komang',4,'Persons (4)',2784000.00,'The first destination is Kusamba Beach, it is one of the favorite places of interest in Bali which is famous with the beautiful beach, we can also meet a fish market in this place which is usually held between 10 am until 4 pm. Then we go to Goa Lawah, this is one of the favourite place to be visited, because here is a nature cave dwelt by thousands of tail bat located at north side from Jeroan/center of Goa Lawah Temple. Next we go to Bukit Jambul, it is strategically located beside of the main road from Denpasar to Besakih Temple and it is one of the tourist destinations that visited on Besakih Tour. It is situated in the plateau area which is blessed with the beautiful panorama of rice terrace and green coconuts three unfolding to the sea. After visit Bukit Jambul, we’ll continue to Besakih Temple is the biggest Hindu temple in Bali which the local people call Pura Besakih. It owns beautiful view from the top of temple area where we can see the wide nature panorama until to the ocean so that’s why this temple is many visited by tourists from all over the world. Then go to Kertagosa, This place also owns Taman Gili, a building floating or sees like floating because it is intentionally founded in the middle of a fish pond.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": \"Pertiwi Bisma 1 Ubud, Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kec. Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 978018\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": \"Pertiwi Bisma 1 Ubud, Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kec. Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 978018\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5179459,'553','Eduard Arnau',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (TEGALALANG – TIRTA EMPUL – PENGELIPURAN – KINTAMANI - TEMPLO KEHEN )','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-16','2024-08-16','Guio','Komang',4,'Persons (4)',2880000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": \"Pertiwi Bisma 1 Ubud, Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kec. Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 978018\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": \"Pertiwi Bisma 1 Ubud, Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kec. Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 978018\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5179486,'553','Eduard Arnau',30508,213032,'Ubud to Kusamba','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-18','2024-08-18','Guio','Komang',4,'Persons (4-6)',3360000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": \"Pertiwi Bisma 1 Ubud, Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kec. Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 978018\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": \"ETD : 08.00 by The Angkal Fastboat to Nusa Penida on 18 August 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kusamba Port\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5179501,'553','Eduard Arnau',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-08-18','2024-08-18','Guio','Komang',4,'Persons (4)',1200000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": \"ETA : 08.20 by The Angkal Fastboat from Kusamba to Nusa Penida on 18 August 2024\", \"time\": \"08:20\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sampalan Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": \"Semabu Hills Resort, Jl. Raya Toya Pakeh - Ped, Dusun Sebunibus, Sakti, Kec. Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771 Telepon: (0361) 6204400\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Penida\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5179526,'553','Eduard Arnau',30508,202884,'1D Snorkeling Nusa Penida','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-19','2024-08-19','Guio','Komang',4,'Persons (4)',0.00,'At the agreed time, we will pick you up at your hotel in Bali and transfer to Sanur harbor where we will embark on speedboats to neighboring Nusa Lembongan, which together with Nusa Penida has one of the most complete reefs on the planet. After about 30 minutes at high speed we will arrive at this small paradise island in the Southeast of Bali where you will enjoy snorkeling on beaches with crystal clear waters and the marine life of the inhabitants of the area. The guide will take you to places incredibly covered with corals and where the amount of reef fish will leave you speechless. The guides in the area are very professional and fun, which will make the trip a safe and enjoyable trip. We will also visit the most representative places on the island such as the Devil Tears, the seaweed, Dream Beach and Yelow Bridge. If you want to take advantage of the day doing only snorkeling and leave the island for another occasion, we can go to another point different from the many on the island to continue enjoying the seabed. After spending the day in Nusa Lembongan, we will transfer you to the port to take the boat back to Bali and transfer to the hotel.',NULL,'Please ready on hotel lobby for pickup at 09.00AM','{\"date\": \"2024-08-19\", \"text\": \"Semabu Hill Hotel Nusa Penida, Jl. Raya Toya Pakeh - Ped, Dusun Sebunibus, Sakti, Kec. Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771 Telepon: (0361) 6204400\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Penida\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-19\", \"text\": \"Semabu Hill Hotel Nusa Penida, Jl. Raya Toya Pakeh - Ped, Dusun Sebunibus, Sakti, Kec. Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771 Telepon: (0361) 6204400\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Penida\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5179818,'553','Eduard Arnau',30508,202884,'1D Tour to Nusa Lembongan','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-20','2024-08-20','Guio','Komang',4,'Persons (4-5)',4320000.00,'At the agreed time, we will pick you up at your hotel in Bali and transfer to Sanur harbor where we will embark on speedboats to neighboring Nusa Lembongan, which together with Nusa Penida has one of the most complete reefs on the planet. After about 30 minutes at high speed we will arrive at this small paradise island in the Southeast of Bali where you will enjoy snorkeling on beaches with crystal clear waters and the marine life of the inhabitants of the area. The guide will take you to places incredibly covered with corals and where the amount of reef fish will leave you speechless. The guides in the area are very professional and fun, which will make the trip a safe and enjoyable trip. We will also visit the most representative places on the island such as the Devil Tears, the seaweed, Dream Beach and Yelow Bridge. If you want to take advantage of the day doing only snorkeling and leave the island for another occasion, we can go to another point different from the many on the island to continue enjoying the seabed. After spending the day in Nusa Lembongan, we will transfer you to the port to take the boat back to Bali and transfer to the hotel.',NULL,'Please ready on hotel Lobby for pickup at 07.00AM','{\"date\": \"2024-08-20\", \"text\": \"Semabu Hill Hotel Nusa Penida, Jl. Raya Toya Pakeh - Ped, Dusun Sebunibus, Sakti, Kec. Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771 Telepon: (0361) 6204400\", \"time\": \"07:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Penida\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-20\", \"text\": \"Semabu Hill Hotel Nusa Penida, Jl. Raya Toya Pakeh - Ped, Dusun Sebunibus, Sakti, Kec. Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771 Telepon: (0361) 6204400\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Penida\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5179867,'553','Eduard Arnau',31285,212748,'Grand Deluxe Room Garden View','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-08-18','2024-08-21','Guio','Komang',2,'Double + Twin',10080000.00,'The Grand Deluxe Room with King Beds is a luxurious and spacious option for guests seeking a comfortable stay. Featuring modern amenities and contemporary decor, this room is designed to offer the ultimate relaxation experience. Guests can also enjoy stunning views of the surrounding city or the hotel’s gardens, making the Grand Deluxe Room with King or Twin Beds a perfect choice for those seeking an upscale and luxurious experience.',NULL,'Vouchers must be presented upon check-in and the hotel will there for invoice with in the 7 days period if credit facility has been extended by the hotel. PLEASE READY ON HOTEL LOBBY FOR TRANSFER TO HARBOUR AT 11.30 AM Fastboat Schedule on 21 August ETD : 12.30 by Maruti Fastboat to Sanur / check-in time 12.00','{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5179906,'553','Eduard Arnau',30508,212457,'Sanur to Nusa Dua','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-21','2024-08-21','Guio','Komang',4,'Persons (4-6)',2880000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": \"ETA : 13.00 from Nusa Penida by Maruti Fastboat on 21 August\", \"time\": \"13:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sanur\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": \"Sol By Melia Benoa, Jl. Pratama, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361 Telepon: (0361) 771714\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Benoa, Nusa Dua\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5179922,'553','Eduard Arnau',30508,202897,'Uluwatu Temple and Kecak Dance','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-22','2024-08-22','Guio','Komang',4,'Persons (4)',2760000.00,'This half-day tour, is an exciting tour package to visit Padang-Padang Beach, Uluwatu Temple, the famous Balinese Hindu Temple in south part of Bali with breathtaking view of sunset and Indian Ocean. Uluwatu Temple is one of Balinese Hindu Temples located right on the petrifying hill with the crevasse exist in the right and left side. Uluwatu Temple is one of Sad Khayangan (6 biggest temple in Bali) owns magnificent view of the Indian Ocean and sunset as a backdrop. This temple is very amazing where the location is right on the narrow peninsula with deep seawater under it. This tour package is combined with the spectacular Balinese traditional dance performance of Kecak Dance. Balinese Kecak Dance is a spectacular traditional dance with the group of people playing this dance with fire game. It is very exciting and unique dance due to the sound of gamelan is not using the normal gamelan but use their mouth. The dancers make the compact choir with the exquisite dance movement that is one of this dance features. After the dance we returned back to the hotel or seafood restaurant in Jimbaran.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-22\", \"text\": \"Sol By Melia Nusa Dua, Jl. Pratama, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361 Telepon: (0361) 771714\", \"time\": \"15:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Benoa, Nusa Dua\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-22\", \"text\": \"Sol By Melia Nusa Dua, Jl. Pratama, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361 Telepon: (0361) 771714\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Benoa, Nusa Dua\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5179930,'553','Eduard Arnau',30508,207268,'Nusa Dua to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-24','2024-08-24','Guio','Komang',4,'Persons (4-6)',2880000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'Please ready on Hotel lobby for pickup at 07.00AM','{\"date\": \"2024-08-24\", \"text\": \"Sol By Melia Nusa Dua, Jl. Pratama, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361 Telepon: (0361) 771714\", \"time\": \"07:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Benoa, Nusa Dua\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-24\", \"text\": \"ETD : 10.50 by Scoot TR281 to Singapore on 24 August 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"International Ngurah Rai Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5179944,'559','Christian Lorente Family',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-06','2024-08-07','Guio','Komang',2,'Double + Twin',1680000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. - Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK–IN','{\"date\": \"2024-08-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5179945,'559','Christian Lorente Family',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-08-07','2024-08-09','Guio','Komang',4,'Persons (4)',14880000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan isCape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continueto add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-08-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5179946,'559','Christian Lorente Family',30665,200975,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-09','2024-08-10','Guio','Komang',2,'Double',7368000.00,'A wonderful accommodation for a luxurious stay with an area of 30 sqm, magnificent view and features one king-sized bed with a capacity of 2 adults, private bathroom with shower room and access to sharing living room.',NULL,'- Contract rates are applicable on your Company’s account against the authorized Travel Agent Voucher. - No Show must be paid without reliance on billed vouchers since the guests did not arrive in the Resort, no voucher will be submitted.','{\"date\": \"2024-08-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5179964,'559','Christian Lorente Family',31015,203230,'2D1N - Surabaya Mount Bromo Tour','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-08-09','2024-08-10','Guio','Komang',4,'Persons (4)',6840000.00,NULL,NULL,'Hotel in Bromo : Plataran Bromo, Wonopolo, Ngadiwono, Kec. Tosari, Pasuruan, Jawa Timur 67177 Provinsi: Jawa Timur Telepon: 0812-3587-9673','{\"date\": \"2024-08-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5179966,'559','Christian Lorente Family',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-10','2024-08-10','Guio','Komang',4,'Persons (4-6)',3360000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": \"ETA : 17.25 by Lion Air JT920 from Surabaya on 10 August 2024\", \"time\": \"17:25\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": \"Komaneka at Tanggyuda, Br. Tanggayuda, Kedewatan, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 978123\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5179968,'559','Christian Lorente Family',30710,200846,'Courtyard Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,5,'2024-08-10','2024-08-15','Guio','Komang',2,'Double',47940000.00,'Courtyard Pool Villa is tasteful villa overlooking a tropical garden with plenty space to relax. The villa room that built in 144 sqm area, oozes with peace and charm that comes from nature that surrounds. Featuring a plunge pool, this villa is fitted with air conditioning, a flat-screen TV, a safety deposit box, slippers, bathrobes, free toiletries are provided, and many more.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5180253,'559','Christian Lorente Family',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (GOA GAJAH – TAMPAK SIRING – GUNUNG KAWI – TEGALALANG)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-11','2024-08-11','Guio','Komang',4,'Persons (4)',3000000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": \"Komaneka at Tanggayuda,Br. Tanggayuda, Kedewatan, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 978123\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": \"Komaneka at Tanggayuda,Br. Tanggayuda, Kedewatan, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 978123\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5180279,'553','Eduard Arnau',30640,218460,'SOL Room','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-08-21','2024-08-24','Guio','Komang',2,'Double',14400000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5180282,'558','EDOARDO INGRASSIA',30508,202892,'PENGLIPURAN VILLAGE - GOA RAJA WATERFALL - TIRTA EMPUL - GUNUNG KAWI SEBATU - TEGALLALANG','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-07','2024-08-07','Ayu','Wiwik',4,'Persons (4)',2643200.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"ALAYA RESORT UBUD\", \"location\": \"Jl. Hanoman, Ubud, Kec. Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571, Phone: (0361) 972200\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"ALAYA RESORT UBUD\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5180449,'544','Abyssworld Group 04-15 November 202420234949',30680,200916,'Deluxe Plus Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-11-02','2024-11-04','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Double',2352000.00,'Enjoy a spacious king bed featuring a comfortable pillow-top mattress and luxurious bedding at 40 m2 of room area . Relax in the bathtub at our Deluxe Plus Room with a beautiful interior and peaceful atmosphere. Free access to our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, hot and cold shower, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. - Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK–IN','{\"date\": \"2024-11-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5180462,'544','Abyssworld Group 04-15 November 202420234949',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-10-31','2024-11-04','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Twin',3136000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this ro