ality\": null, \"location\": \"Sanur\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5180898,'559','Christian Lorente Family',30587,201629,'Wonderful Room Garden View','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-19','2024-08-20','Guio','Komang',2,'Double',9048000.00,'While each of these spacious rooms offer serene views of manicured gardens, the landscapes are best savoured from the comfort of your private balcony. To customise the space for a family or group stay, choose from either a king-size bed or two doubles, in addition to your room’s daybed. In the mornings, the sun\'s soft rays bathe your room with a dreamlike glow. A connecting door conceals an equally expansive and brightly-lit second room, giving you the option of spreading out your group for added privacy.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5180911,'559','Christian Lorente Family',30508,207269,'Sanur to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-20','2024-08-20','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (4-6)',720000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-20\", \"text\": \"Maya Sanur Resort, Jl. Danau Tamblingan No.89M, Sanur, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali 80228 Telepon: (0361) 8497800\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sanur\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-20\", \"text\": \"ETD : 11.45 by Batik Air ID6331 to Labuan Bajo on 20 August 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5181245,'559','Christian Lorente Family',32959,218214,'3 Fun Dives','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-08-21','2024-08-22','Guio','Komang',4,'Person (1)',24000000.00,NULL,NULL,'standby at Dive Centre at 07.00 finish Diving at 16.30 - 17.00','{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5181250,'559','Christian Lorente Family',30668,218482,'Exclusive Modern Residence','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-08-20','2024-08-24','Guio','Komang',2,'Double',66528000.00,NULL,NULL,'Return pickup & dropoff Transfer Airport with 2 unit Cars note : please stop in the NEREN DIVE CENTRE for Registration Diving while pickup in Airport on 20 August 2024.','{\"date\": \"2024-08-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5181253,'559','Christian Lorente Family',31083,203792,'Komodo Island Full Day Tour (Fast Boat - Pick Up/Drop Off Labuan Bajo)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-23','2024-08-23','Guio','Komang',4,'Persons (4-5)',16104000.00,'TOUR ITINERARY Highlights: Padar Island, Komodo Island, Long beach, Pink Beach, Manta Point & Kanawa. PICK UP / ARRIVE LABUAN BAJO - PADAR - KOMODO - PINK BEACH - MANTA POINT - LABUAHAN BAJO Pick up & meeting service with our tour guide and transfer to the pier of Labuan Bajo for sailing directly to Loh Liang – the Ranger station in Komodo Island. By passing through many small islands, it will be 3 hours with slow wooden boat and 1.50 hours by speed boat to reach the pier of Komodo island. After registering start to take basic trekking to see the GIANT RIZARD / KOMODO DRAGON and other wild animals as: Timor deer, wild pig, wild chicken and many variously of tropical bird. Please keep your look at any directions as sometimes you will also find young Komodo dragon hanging over the trees. A local ranger will be led you during the trek. Return to the boat on to Pink beach for snorkeling, swimming and relaxing. It is really spectacular and unspoiled coral reef and many color fish. Sail toward MANTA POINT to exploring Huge Mantas by snorkeling even watching from your boat trip (can’t be guaranteed if weather is not good, like wave and current are strongly). Lunch will be provided on board. Late in the afternoon back to Labuan Bajo harbor and transfer to your prefer Hotel for overnight and Dinner. Meals : Lunch Attention: The itinerary is subject to change due to the weather, tide level and operating conditions without prior notice.',NULL,'21 & 22 Aug : 2 days Return Transfer Dive Centre 06.30 pickup at Plataran Komodo dropoff Neren Dive Centre Between 16.30 - 17.00 pickup at Neren Dive Centre dropoff Plataran Komodo','{\"date\": \"2024-08-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5181258,'559','Christian Lorente Family',30852,202639,'Villa Kayu - Two Bedroom Private Pool and Tropical Garden','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-08-24','2024-08-26','Guio','Komang',1,'Double + Double',11040000.00,'Our two-bed private villa gets its name from its abundant use of wood. With its design similar to a traditional Javanese house and Javanese-inspired, yet minimalistic interior features, Villa Kayu finds a perfect balance between traditional and modern. The upper-floor master bedroom boasts a large ensuite with views over the garden and a balcony from which to relax and watch the sunset. The ground-floor bedroom has folding doors that open entirely onto the sundeck, allowing a gentle breeze in, as well as an open-air ensuite. Both bedrooms have king-size beds, extra thick mattresses, quality linens and air conditioning to ensure optimal comfort. Both bathrooms have a bespoke basin, hot rainfall shower, quality toiletries and soft, 100% cotton towels. Villa Kayu’s pool and private tropical garden are carefully maintained and spacious, allowing room to fully switch off in tranquility, or entertain friends. With work desks in both bedrooms, international sockets, strong WIFI, several seating areas, and a fully equipped kitchen, Kayu is a luxurious home away from home.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5181578,'476','Mr. Alberto Trujillo Cuesta',30624,216261,'Triangle Room + 1 Extra Bed','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-08-19','2024-08-23','Melysa','Febrina',1,'Double',9072000.00,'Enjoy a restful night’s sleep in the queen size bed, made with our luxurious organic cotton linens. Need a little extra warmth? Just ask for a duvet and we’ll be happy to provide one for you. Take in the stunning garden and sea views from your front terrace while sipping a cup of tea or coffee from the complimentary set provided in the room.Fully equipped with modern amenities, including a mini fridge, kettle, air conditioning, and wardrobe, the Triangel ensures that your stay is both comfortable and convenient. The fully set-up bathroom boasts complimentary natural toiletries, adding an extra touch of luxury to your stay. Immerse yourself in the cozy decor and warm ambiance of this charming bungalow. With high ceilings and an abundance of natural sunlight, this room offers the perfect sanctuary for relaxation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5181620,'561','RICARD CREUS PEREZ',30508,207379,'Ubud to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-17','2024-07-17','Melysa','Komang',1,'Persons (1-3)',600000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-17\", \"text\": \"Pertiwi Bisma 1 Ubud, Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kec. Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 978018\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-17\", \"text\": \"ETD : 08.30 by Gili Gili Fastboat from Ubud to Padang Bay on 17 July 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bay Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5181637,'562','Eva Fernandez',30673,200559,'Deluxe Double Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-08','2024-08-09','Jacob','Praba',1,'Double',1380000.00,'Designed to capture nature vibes. Slide open the door to your private terrace to let in the fresh mountain air and relax.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5181644,'562','Eva Fernandez',30682,200893,'Villa\'s Deluxe','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-09','2024-08-10','Jacob','Praba',1,'Double',2778000.00,'Villa Deluxe with 42 sqm room area. 23 rooms available (13 double + 10 twin), single and twin beds available with a capacity of 2 people per room. see the greatest view in Ijen Mountain. See the magic of the blue fire at night. Sophisticated design in Ijen Resort and Villas, in Banyuwangi, East Java. You can see the best view from your room, the rice field, mountains.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5181645,'561','RICARD CREUS PEREZ',31308,205333,'One-Bedroom Signature Villa with Private Pool','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-07-17','2024-07-19','Melysa','Komang',1,'Double',5760000.00