.','All quoted rates and prices are non-commissionable and already net of 21% tax and service charge.',NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5182154,'567','Mrs. Esther Roldan Rios',30705,201147,'Premier Room Garden View','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-09-13','2024-09-16','Jacob','Praba',1,'Double',4914000.00,'Get back to nature in one of our Premier Garden View suites. These spacious, light-filled rooms have beautiful Balinese double doors that can be closed to create a cool air-conditioned space or opened to merge indoor and outdoor living. The balconies overlook the resort’s lush gardens, which are awash in tropical flowers and foliage.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5182166,'567','Mrs. Esther Roldan Rios',30508,212541,'Ubud to Amed','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-16','2024-09-16','Jacob','Praba',2,'Persons (2)',1680000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-16\", \"text\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar\", \"time\": \"12:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-16\", \"text\": \"Arya Amed Beach Resort Jl. Raya Amed Bunutan, Bunutan, Abang, Bunutan, Abang, Bunutan, Kec. Abang, Kabupaten Karangasem\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Amed, Karangasem\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5182179,'566','Mar Freire',30508,212571,'Jimbaran to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-11','2024-08-11','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (4-6)',720000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": \"Lumbini Luxury Resort, Jl. Raya Uluwatu No.38, Jimbaran, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361 Telepon: (0361) 704338\", \"time\": \"15:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Jimbaran\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": \"ETD : 19.40 by Emirates EK369 to Dubai on 11 August 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"International Airport Ngurah Rai\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5182195,'465','Mr. Cesar Lledo & pty',30672,200737,'1 Studio 25 (Superior) Room + 1 Studio 30 (Deluxe) Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-09','2024-08-10','Nicholas','Febrina',1,'Double',684000.00,'Studio 25 (Superior) room with 25 sqm sized room and with exclusive ARTOTEL bedding collection, some facilities in this room is 43\" inch lcd tv, 24 hours in-room service, high speed internet wi-fi, safety deposit box and hair dryer.',NULL,'10 Aug 2024 / Oneway Transfer Hotel - Airport Flight detail: ETD 09:10 to Pangkalan Bun by Nam Air IN196 on 10 Aug','{\"date\": \"2024-08-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5182201,'567','Mrs. Esther Roldan Rios',30646,204896,'Suite Sea View Bungalows','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-09-16','2024-09-18','Jacob','Praba',1,'Double',2800000.00,'Arya Amed has 3 Suite Bungalows with Sea View. Each Suite Bungalow is fully air-conditioned with hot and cold water and a luxurious bathroom with large bathtub and open shower. The room includes a combination safe, hair dryer, extra liquid soap and shampoo. You will find an elegance and beauty that reflects the Balinese way of life here in Arya Amed. The rooms are tastefully spare surrounded by flowering trees and plants – and each has its own beautifully covered veranda or shaded terrace. Enjoy the stunning view from your room whether of the blue ocean, neighboring hills or lush tropical gardens.',NULL,'Exchange vouchers will be honored only if booking agent has established and maintain approved credit facilities with the Arya Amed Beach resort.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5182207,'465','Mr. Cesar Lledo & pty',30672,200747,'Studio 30 (Deluxe) Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-09','2024-08-10','Nicholas','Febrina',1,'Twin',804000.00,'Studio 30 (Deluxe) room with 25 sqm sized room, and exclusive ARTOTEL bedding collection, with facilities 43\" inch lcd tv, 24 hours in-room service, high speed internet wi-fi, safety deposit box, hair dryer.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5182551,'567','Mrs. Esther Roldan Rios',30508,207261,'Amed to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-18','2024-09-18','Jacob','Praba',1,'Persons (2)',784000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-18\", \"text\": \"Arya Amed Beach Resort Jl. Raya Amed Bunutan, Bunutan, Abang, Bunutan, Abang, Bunutan, Kec. Abang, Kabupaten Karangasem\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Amed, Karangasem\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-18\", \"text\": \"ETD 08:30AM by Gili Gili Fastboat to Bangsal Lombok\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5182561,'567','Mrs. Esther Roldan Rios',30649,204187,'One Bedroom Pool Lagoon','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-09-21','2024-09-24','Jacob','Praba',1,'Double',3150000.00,'This room is perfect for travelers or business people! With a room area of ​​25m2 and equipped with a double / single bed, air conditioning controller, LED TV and high speed internet access. This modern designed bathroom is also equipped with a shower and toiletries to complete your needs during your stay at our hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5182563,'567','Mrs. Esther Roldan Rios',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-24','2024-09-25','Jacob','Praba',1,'Double',840000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Flight Details 24 Sep : ETA 15:30 by Super Air Jet IU765 from Lombok 25 Sep: ETD 18:20PM by Qatar Airways QR6380 to Doha Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. - Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK–IN','{\"date\": \"2024-09-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5182842,'570','David Nogal Montenegro / Iván Tomé Fernandez',30783,218071,'5D4N Jogja-Bromo-Ijen-Bali Incl. Train / C. Adhisthana (Deluxe) & Bromo Terrace (Deluxe) & Ketapang','Confirmed',NULL,5,'2024-08-21','2024-08-25','Jacob','Eddy',2,'Persons (2 / Double)',20580000.00,'D1 Arrival at Yogyakarta International Airport - Borobudur temple tour Incl.Mendut and Pawon D2 Yogyakarta City tour visit Sultan Palace, Wateracastle and Bird Market, Visit Prambanan temple D3 Jogja - Mojokerto by train - drive to Bromo - overnight in Bromo D4 Mt. Bromo Sunrise tour incl. Jeep - Transfer to Ijen for overnight D5 Mt. Ijen crater tour - transfer to Bali across Ketapang - Gilimanuk harbour - drop at your hotel in Bali',NULL,'5 Days 4 Nights Jogja Bromo Ijen Bali incl. Train D1 Arrival at Yogyakarta International airport – Borobudur temple tour Incl.Mendut and Pawon D2 Yogyakarta City tour visit Sultan Palace, Wateracstle and Bird Market, Visit Prambanan temple D3 Jogja – Mojokerto by train – drive to Bromo-overnight in Bromo D4 Mt. Bromo Sunrise tour incl. Jeep – Transfer to Ijen for overnight D5 Mt. Ijen crater tour – transfer to Bali accross Ketapang – Gilimanuk harbour – drop at your hotel in Bali -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- Hotel Confirm : 21-23 Aug: Adhisthana (Twn Deluxe) 23-24 Aug: Lereng Bromo(Twn Deluxe) 25-25 Aug: Ketapang Indah (Twn Superior) -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- Guide Confirm Spanish Speaking with a note 21-22 Aug : Guide Spanish A 23-25 Aug : Guide Spanish B','{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": \"ETA: 21 AUG 10:50 ID6378 to Yogyaarta by Batik Air\", \"time\": \"10:50\", \"locality\": \"AIRPORT YOGYAKARTA\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-25\", \"text\": \"Nami House Address: Jl. Sugriwa No.16, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone: 0819-3614-4406\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"UBUD HOTEL (BALI)\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5182893,'465','Mr. Cesar Lledo & pty',30805,218337,'PKN-SUB-DPS','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-12','2024-08-12','Nicholas','Febrina',4,'Person',10120000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5182926,'571','Maria Jesus Febrero',30783,213061,'Transfer from Semarang Airport to Yogyakarta Hotel','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-31','2024-07-31','Jacob','Eddy',1,'Per Car',960000.00,NULL,NULL,'One-Way Transfer Service from Semarang Airport to Yogyakarta Hotel BY HI ACE (9 PERSON)','{\"date\": \"2024-07-31\", \"text\": \"ETA: 31 JUL 11:25 IN195 by Batik Air / From Pangkalanbun\", \"time\": \"11:25\", \"locality\": \"AIRPORT SEMARANG\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-31\", \"text\": \"Villa Ruang Rindu Malioboro Address: Jalan Gajah Mada Purwokinanti PA 1/223 RT26/RW5, Kota Yogyakarta, Daerah Istimewa Yogyakarta 55112 Phone: 0813-2904-0856\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5182939,'465','Mr. Cesar Lledo & pty',30508,202894,'Kehen Temple - Pengelipuran - Kintamani','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-14','2024-08-14','Nicholas','Febrina',4,'Persons (4)',2448000.00,'Our wonderful tour starts from Kehen Temple. It is an ancient Hindu temple complex boasting unique architectural features. The staircases reaching from the ground to temple courtyard are carved sandstone mythical animal and Balinese folklore figure statues and also the central vestibule. The temple’s walls are also ornate with Chinese porcelain plates, which are a tribute to the historical relations between the local Bali kingdom and China. Afterwards, we continue to Penglipuran, a village that succeeded in preserving its 75-hectare bamboo forest located in the northern part of the village. Members of this village have a strong commitment to the system of \'Ayahan Desa\' - a philosophy committed to respecting the land on which the village stands. To concludes the day, we stop by at Tukad Cepung Waterfall. Well-guarded by the circular cliffs, this waterfall is difficult to locate for the first time visitor. The circular cliffs give you the feeling of being in a cave, while the open sky right from where the waterfall emerges, gives you the most enchanting view. The sunlight falls on the glistering waterfall creating a rainbow, which feels as though it is projected right up to you. If you have never seen water flowing from the sky, then this would be your chance! After spending your time there, we go back to your hotel.',NULL,'FD Tour Kehen Temple - Penglipuran Village - Kintamani, with Spanish speaking guide','{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": \"Br. Tanggayuda, Kedewatan, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali 80571. Phone:+62361 978123\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Tanggayuda\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": \"Br. Tanggayuda, Kedewatan, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali 80571. Phone:+62361 978123\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Tanggayuda\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5182969,'465','Mr. Cesar Lledo & pty',31083,212384,'3D2N LOB Rinca - Padar - Komodo Island Tour (1N Private Superior Boat + 1N Bintang Flores Hotel)','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-08-16','2024-08-18','Nicholas','Febrina',4,'Persons (4-5)',57576000.00,'TOUR ITINERARY Highlights: Menjarite, Kelor, Kalong, Rinca, Padar, Komodo Island, Pink Beach, Taka Makassar, Manta Point, Kanawa, Batu Cermin Mirror Cave DAY 1 : DENPASAR - LABUAN BAJO - MENJARITE - PADAR - KELOR - KALONG ISLAND Arrival at Komodo Airport in Labuan Bajo west Flores, meeting service with our tour guide and transfer to the pier of Labuan Bajo for Rinca Island. It’s about 2 hours sail to the island of Komodo Dragon, stop at Menjarite island for snorkeling then continue to Rinca island-the Island of Komodo dragon, you will find not just e Dragons but also many wild animals like, deer, wild buffalo, long-tailed macaque and wild pig also numerous of birds. Keep your eyes look up as sometime you will find the young Komodo dragons on the trees. A local ranger will lead you through this natural preservation. Late afternoon sailing directly to Kalong Rinca Island to see the hundreds of fling foxes set out from the mangrove tree at 06-07 pm, the lovely sunset from the boat trip really enjoyable here. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Boat Cabin Air Conditioning DAY 2 : KALONG - PADAR - KOMODO - PINK BEACH - MANTA POINT - TAKA MAKASSAR - LABUAN BAJO After having breakfast in your boat, heading to Padar Island, taking trek to Padar Island until having the top view point to get breathtaking scenery of three bays around, Padar Island hike in Komodo has some of the most amazing views in Indonesia, trek to downhill and back to the Boat for sailing directly to Loh Liang – the Ranger station in Komodo Island. By passing through many small islands, After registering start to take basic trekking to see the GIANT RIZARD / KOMODO DRAGON and other wild animals as: Timor deer, wild pig, wild chicken and many variously of tropical bird. Please keep your look at any directions as sometimes you will also find young Komodo dragon hanging over the trees. A local ranger will be led you during the trek. Return to the boat on to Pink beach for snorkeling, swimming and relaxing. It is really spectacular and unspoiled coral reef and many color fish. This is one of best side for snorkeling diving. Sail toward MANTA POINT to exploring Huge Mantas by snorkeling even watching from your boat trip (can’t be guaranteed if weather is not good, like wave and current are strongly) visit also the taka Makaasar its really tiny island with white sand beach really enjoyable to relaxing or beach walking then heading to Labuan bajo for overnight and dinner at above hotel list option. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner DAY 3 : LABUAN BAJO - DENPASAR After breakfast taking your next excursion with visiting local marke and Batu Cermin (Mirror Stone) Cave. The grotto is 75 by 75 meters large, and contains stalactites and stalagmites. Some tunnels are narrow and dark but in others sunlight falls, then process to the airport for flight to Denpasar or to your next destination. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch Attention: The itinerary is subject to change due to the weather, tide level and operating conditions without prior notice.',NULL,'3D2N Komodo Tour based on 1 Night on Boat + 1 Night at Hotel, with English speaking guide Accommodation : 16-17 Aug 2024 / Private Superior Standard Boat - Private Cabin with AC 17-18 Aug 2024 / Bintang Flores Hotel - 2 Deluxe Room (Double + Twin Bed) D1/16 Aug 2024: Arrival in Labuan Bajo Airport - Menjarite - Kalong Island (L/D) D2/17 Aug 2024: Padar Island - Komodo Island - Pink Beach - Labuan Bajo - Check in hotel (B/L/D) D3/18 Aug 2024: Transfer out to Labuan Bajo Airport (B) Flight details: ETA 09:10 from Denpasar by Batik Air ID6333 on 16 Aug ETD 09:50 to Denpasar by Batik Air ID6332 on 18 Aug','{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5182981,'465','Mr. Cesar Lledo & pty',30805,212441,'LBJ-DPS-LOP','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-18','2024-08-18','Nicholas','Febrina',4,'Person',11000000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5182997,'572','Elizabeth Ann Baker',32766,216809,'3D2N Open Trip Komodo - Lady Grace / Full Ocean','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-08-09','2024-08-11','Ayu','Tami',4,'Per Person (Min. 2 Person)',30480000.00,'DAY 1 : Kelor Island - Manjerite Island - Kalong Island DAY 2 : Padar Island - Long / Pick Beach - Komodo Island - Manta Point - Taka Makasar DAY 3 : Kanawa Island',NULL,'Mrs. Elizabeth Ann Baker is allergic to mushrooms.','{\"date\": \"2024-08-09\", \"text\": \"Batu Cermin, Komodo, West Manggarai Regency, East Nusa Tenggara\", \"time\": \"09:30\", \"locality\": \"Danke Lodge\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": \"Batu Cermin, Komodo, West Manggarai Regency, East Nusa Tenggara\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Danke Lodge\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5182998,'465','Mr. Cesar Lledo & pty',31694,217865,'Two Bedroom Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-08-18','2024-08-21','Nicholas','Febrina',1,'Double + Double',13680000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5183011,'566','Mar Freire',31242,205019,'One-Bedroom Villa with Private Pool','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-08-06','2024-08-08','Guio','Komang',2,'Double',14851200.00,'Our villas feels like that warm feeling you get when you rediscover a fond lost memory of home. More than that, it feels authentic, featuring wood that’s over 100 years old. More than a simple luxurious experience, it is a journey through history with all of the modern comforts. Discover an old culture fused with modern lifestyle. You’ll never want to leave.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5183227,'532','Amelio Barbero Garcia / Maria Carmen Romero Moreno',30571,202567,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-12','2024-08-13','Guio','Eddy',1,'Double',1372000.00,'Located at the Second Floor, 35 sqm comfort living with a touch of Balinese style featuring completed fitting, Cable TV, a fancy bathroom comprises rain shower and good quality amenities. Also dedicated Wi-Fi Access to complete your day.',NULL,'HONEYMOON','{\"date\": \"2024-08-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5183254,'532','Amelio Barbero Garcia / Maria Carmen Romero Moreno',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Goa Gajah – Tampaksiring – Gunung Kawi – Tegalalang )','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-13','2024-08-13','Guio','Eddy',2,'Person (1)',0.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": \"THE VIRA BALI BOUTIQUE HOTEL & SUITES \\\"ADDRESS :Jl. Kartika Plaza No. 127 Kuta, Bali 80361 Phone: (0361) 765700 Whatsapp: +6287851156682\\\"\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": \"THE ARTINI DIJIWA UBUD \\\"ADDRESS : Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone (0361) 972385\\\"\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5183261,'532','Amelio Barbero Garcia / Maria Carmen Romero Moreno',30705,201148,'Premier Room Rice Field View','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-08-13','2024-08-15','Guio','Eddy',1,'Double',3416000.00,'Gaze out at rippling rice fields as you let your stress slip away in one of our Premier Ricefield View suites. Inside you have smooth tiles, warm wooden accents, and all the modern comforts you could ask for. Step onto the balcony and you have an airy nook where you can witness life unfold in the Balinese countryside.',NULL,'HONEYMOON','{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5183275,'532','Amelio Barbero Garcia / Maria Carmen Romero Moreno',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route (Templo Taman Ayun - Jatiluwih - Templo Ulun Danu Bratan - Tanah Lot )','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-14','2024-08-14','Guio','Eddy',2,'Persons (2)',1747200.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": \"THE ARTINI DIJIWA UBUD \\\"ADDRESS : Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone (0361) 972385\\\"\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": \"THE ARTINI DIJIWA UBUD \\\"ADDRESS : Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone (0361) 972385\\\"\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5183291,'532','Amelio Barbero Garcia / Maria Carmen Romero Moreno',30508,213032,'Ubud to Kusamba','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-15','2024-08-15','Guio','Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": \"ETD : One way transfer Kusamba - Nusa Penida at 08.00 AM By The Angkal Fast Boat.\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5183295,'532','Amelio Barbero Garcia / Maria Carmen Romero Moreno',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-08-15','2024-08-15','Guio','Eddy',1,'Persons (2)',476000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": \"ETA: Kusamba - Nusa Penida at 08.20 AM By The Angkal Fast Boat.\", \"time\": \"08:20\", \"locality\": \"NUSA PENIDA PORT\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": \"La Roja Bungalows Address : Kutapang Kangin, Batununggul, Kec. Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771 Phone : 0821-4659-4481\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5183307,'532','Amelio Barbero Garcia / Maria Carmen Romero Moreno',30508,207337,'Snorkeling to Nusa Penida (from Nusa Penida) (Sharing Trip)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-16','2024-08-16','Guio','Eddy',2,'Persons (2)',1232000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": \"La Roja Bungalows Address : Kutapang Kangin, Batununggul, Kec. Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771 Phone : 0821-4659-4481\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": \"La Roja Bungalows Address : Kutapang Kangin, Batununggul, Kec. Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771 Phone : 0821-4659-4481\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5183315,'532','Amelio Barbero Garcia / Maria Carmen Romero Moreno',32488,215280,'Superior room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-08-15','2024-08-17','Guio','Eddy',1,'Double',1904000.00,'Type room Deluxe with Pool View, and the bed type double or twin bed.',NULL,'Fast boat Schedule (By Eka Jaya) Nusa Penida (ETD : 09.00am) – Gili Air ( ETA :13.15pm)','{\"date\": \"2024-08-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"07:30\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-17\", \"text\": \"Fast boat Schedule (By Eka Jaya) Banjar Nyuh Harbour - Nusa Penida (ETD : 09.00am)\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Banjar Nyuh\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5183778,'573','Elena María Duran Agosto 2024',30571,202572,'The Junior Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-12','2024-08-13','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',3024000.00,'Located at the First & Second Floor, 47 sqm luxury living comfort with a touch of Balinese style featuring exclusive fitting, Cable TV , a fancy bathroom comprises rain shower, bathtub, and good quality amenities. Also dedicated WiFi Access to complete your day.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5184083,'575','Marina Costa Martinez',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-17','2024-08-18','Jacob','Komang',1,'Double',840000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. -Early check in at 07:40am PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK–IN','{\"date\": \"2024-08-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5184086,'532','Amelio Barbero Garcia / Maria Carmen Romero Moreno',32607,215991,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-08-17','2024-08-20','Guio','Eddy',1,'Double',4032000.00,'At 30 m2 room size, welcome to Deluxe Room with garden view. Sleep soundly during your trip to one of Gili Islands in Lombok, West Nusa Tenggara, Indonesia in our Deluxe Room, with its comfortable twin bed or double bed.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5184124,'532','Amelio Barbero Garcia / Maria Carmen Romero Moreno',30508,207386,'Padang Bai to Seminyak','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-20','2024-08-20','Guio','Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-20\", \"text\": \"Padang Bai (ETA :13.30pm) by Eka Jaya\", \"time\": \"13:30\", \"locality\": \"PADANG BAI\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-20\", \"text\": \"\\\"KAYUMAS SEMINYAK RESORT \\\" \\\"ADDRESS : Jl. Pura Telaga Waja No.18a, Kerobokan Kelod, Kec. Kuta Utara, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361, Indonesia P: +62361 9348348\\\"\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5184131,'532','Amelio Barbero Garcia / Maria Carmen Romero Moreno',30798,201630,'One Bedroom Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-20','2024-08-21','Guio','Eddy',1,'Double',1579200.00,'The two-story, 45 sqm One Bedroom Suite features an natural and airy interior, complemented with modern furnishings and views overlooking to the private terrace with a plunge pool. Floor-to-ceiling glass doors provide generous natural lighting and a dynamic ambience. Plush linens and a marble bathroom surround guests in elegance.',NULL,'HONEYMOON','{\"date\": \"2024-08-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5184143,'532','Amelio Barbero Garcia / Maria Carmen Romero Moreno',30508,207270,'Seminyak to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-21','2024-08-21','Guio','Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": \"\\\"KAYUMAS SEMINYAK RESORT \\\" \\\"ADDRESS : Jl. Pura Telaga Waja No.18a, Kerobokan Kelod, Kec. Kuta Utara, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361, Indonesia P: +62361 9348348\\\"\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": \"ETD : 21 de agosto de 2024 - 09:55H - 14:30H / Denpasar (DPS), Qatar (DOH), Iberia IB 887 (Operado por Qatar Airways, QR965)\", \"time\": \"09:55\", \"locality\": \"AIRPORT DENPASAR\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5184175,'575','Marina Costa Martinez',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-08-18','2024-08-20','Jacob','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',10800000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan isCape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continueto add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5184181,'577','Gabino Roldan Moreno',32766,218321,'3D2N Open Trip Komodo - Gamala / Deluxe Full Ocean','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-07-19','2024-07-21','Nicholas','Tami',4,'Per Person (Min. 2 Person)',21840000.00,'DAY 1 : Kelor Island - Manjerite Island - Kalong Island DAY 2 : Padar Island - Long / Pick Beach - Komodo Island - Manta Point - Taka Makasar DAY 3 : Kanawa Island',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-19\", \"text\": \"Jl. Pantai Pede, Labuan Bajo, Kec. Komodo, Kabupaten Manggarai Barat\", \"time\": \"09:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Puri Sari Beach Hotel\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5184188,'576','Mrs. Gloria Durany Boixados',30683,203331,'Executive Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-11','2024-08-12','Melysa','Praba',1,'Twin',1182000.00,'Open the door to one of our Executive Rooms and feel like home in this modern and light-flooded ambience overlooking Jakarta’s renowned International Airport. Spacious 24 square meters with a king or twin beds offering comfortable stay equipped with modern facilities such as air conditioning, arm chair, work desk & chair, flat screen TV with cable and satellite channels, free access internet & Wi-Fi, in room safe, coffee/tea maker, mini cooler, private bathroom with shower and hair dryer, and many more',NULL,'Flight details: 11 Aug 2024 - ETA 21:35PM by Qatar Airways QR954 from Doha 12 Aug 2024 - ETD 11:00AM by Batik Airlines ID6344 to Yogyakarta Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel.','{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": \"ETA 21:35PM by Qatar Airways QR954 from Doha\", \"time\": \"21:35\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"So