e upper-floor master bedroom boasts a large ensuite with views over the garden and a balcony from which to relax and watch the sunset. The ground-floor bedroom has folding doors that open entirely onto the sundeck, allowing a gentle breeze in, as well as an open-air ensuite. Both bedrooms have king-size beds, extra thick mattresses, quality linens and air conditioning to ensure optimal comfort. Both bathrooms have a bespoke basin, hot rainfall shower, quality toiletries and soft, 100% cotton towels. Villa Kayu’s pool and private tropical garden are carefully maintained and spacious, allowing room to fully switch off in tranquility, or entertain friends. With work desks in both bedrooms, international sockets, strong WIFI, several seating areas, and a fully equipped kitchen, Kayu is a luxurious home away from home.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5184631,'573','Elena María Duran Agosto 2024',30508,213316,'Munduk to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-14','2024-08-14','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (1-3)',616000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": \"Munduk Tentrem, Jl. Raya Asah Gobleg, Br. Dinas Asah Desa Gobleg, Buleleng, Munduk, Kec. Banjar, Bali 81152 Telepon: 0812-3788-7877\", \"time\": \"12:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Munduk\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": \"Royal Casa Ganesha, Jl. A.A. Gede Rai No.88, Lodtunduh, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 8493577\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5184642,'579','Jose Riba Ciurana',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-04','2024-08-05','Jacob','Praba',2,'Double + Twin',1680000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Flight details: 4 Aug 2024: ETA 22:15PM by Emirates EK358 from Dubai 5 Aug 2024: ETD 11:00AM by Batik Airlines ID6344 to Yogyakarta Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. - Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK–IN','{\"date\": \"2024-08-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5184651,'573','Elena María Duran Agosto 2024',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Taman Ayun - Batukaru Temple - Jatiluwih - Tanah Lot))','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-15','2024-08-15','Guio','Komang',2,'Person (1)',1904000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": \"Royal Casa Ganesha, Jl. A.A. Gede Rai No.88, Lodtunduh, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 8493577\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": \"Royal Casa Ganesha, Jl. A.A. Gede Rai No.88, Lodtunduh, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 8493577\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5184655,'573','Elena María Duran Agosto 2024',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Ulun Danu - Trekking Twin Lake -Munduk)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-13','2024-08-13','Guio','Komang',2,'Person (1)',1904000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": \"The Vira Boutique Hotel Kuta, Jl. Kartika Plaza No.127, Kuta, Kec. Kuta, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361 Telepon: (0361) 765700\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kuta\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": \"Munduk Tentrem,Jl. Raya Asah Gobleg, Br. Dinas Asah Desa Gobleg, Buleleng, Munduk, Kec. Banjar, Bali 81152 Telepon: 0812-3788-7877\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Munduk\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5184657,'579','Jose Riba Ciurana',30783,201486,'3D2N Best of Yogyakarta City Tour / A. The Phoenix (Superior Room)','Confirmed','JS-Java01',3,'2024-08-05','2024-08-07','Jacob','Praba',4,'Persons (4)',20040000.00,'Day 1 : Arrival at Yogyakarta Welcome to the cradle of Indonesian culture, Yogyakarta. A tourist destination for its ancient palaces, temples, batik workshops, gamelan music orchestras, court dances and wayang puppet shows. Upon your arrival in Yogyakarta a representative of Come2Indonesia will be waiting for you with a sign indicating your name to take you to your hotel and the rest of the day is free for you. Meals : - Accommodation : A. The Phoenix - Deluxe Legacy Room Day 2 : Yogyakarta City Tour - Prambanan and Borobodur You will start your day with breakfast at the hotel. Today’s excursion will make us get lost in the authentic magic of Yogyakarta. One of the most beautiful and complete routes of the cultural capital of Indonesia. At the scheduled time, your guide will pick you up to begin your tour to Borobudur Temple (Candi Borobudur), the great Stupa, the largest Buddhist monument in the world and one of the seven wonders. We will tour around the temple, observe the hundreds and centenary statues of Buddha and witness how dozens of Buddhists come to preach from all over the world. Historically it was established during the relatively brief Sailendra dynasty of Central Java between 778 and 856 BC and is in constant restoration due to the breaks that the tremors of the neighbouring Merapi volcano have been producing during its history. After visiting one of the most important Buddhist temples in Southeast Asia, we continue our journey to the heart of the city. We will visit the Keraton, known as the Sultan’s Palace. The palace is a complex building two centuries old, located in the heart of the city. You will hear the song of “freedom” in the bird market. We will visit the “Water Castle” that occupies the highest part at the northern end of the vast complex of Taman Sari. Then we continue to Malioboro Street, main street of Yogyakarta, with its merchants, horse carriages, taxi-bikes and markets. An incredible experience that will make hours fly by. Finishing the tour in the centre of the city of Yogyakarta, we will head northeast towards Candi Prambanan, the temple of Hinduists which have been classified as a World Heritage Site by UNESCO since 1991. It was finished around the year 856 to commemorate the victory of the descendant Sanjaya of Siva, Rikai Pikatan on the last sovereign Sailendra of Central Java. Take your time to enjoy each carving on the rocks and feel the spirituality that each of the stones perched in this set of more than 200 Hindu temples that are dedicated to the Trimurti, the expression of God as the Creator, the Preserver and the Destroyer. After this unforgettable day, we will take you back to your hotel. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : A. The Phoenix - Deluxe Legacy Room Day 3 : Hotel - Airport You will enjoy a well-deserved breakfast at the hotel and according to the time of your flight, we will pick you up to take you to the airport and take the flight to your next destination. End of our services. Thank you very much for exploring Yogyakarta with Come2indonesia. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-05\", \"text\": \"ETA 12:10PM by Batik Airlines ID6344 from Jakarta\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Yogyakarta International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-07\", \"text\": \"ETD 07:00AM by Lion Air JT560 from Yogyakarta\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Yogyakarta International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5184674,'573','Elena María Duran Agosto 2024',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Ubud Market-Goa Gajah-Tampak Siring-Gunung Kawi - Tegalalang)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-16','2024-08-16','Guio','Komang',2,'Person (1)',1904000.00,NULL,NULL,'Note : dropoff point Monkey Forest Area, guest will back to hotel by own.','{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": \"Royal Casa Ganesha, Jl. A.A. Gede Rai No.88, Lodtunduh, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 8493577\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": \"Monkey Forest Ubud\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5184700,'573','Elena María Duran Agosto 2024',30508,202893,'Lempuyang Temple Tour (Lempuyang - Virgin Beach- Tenganan','Confirmed','C2I-BALI11',1,'2024-08-17','2024-08-17','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',1792000.00,'At the agreed time, our guide will pick you up to start the tour in the eastern part of Bali. The first place you will visit is Goa Lawah Temple. Goa Lawah Temple consists of two names, \"Goa\" which means cave and \"Lawah\" which means bat. Several thousand bats are flying in the cave as the name suggests. With the lights fading as you go deeper inside the cave, it gives off a very strange atmosphere. From Goa Lawah, we continue our way to Lempuyang Temple. Upon arrival, the temple will greet you with its gratifying panorama that extends into infinity. On a clear, sunny day, you\'ll be able to gaze out over the mountains, Amlapura city, and Mount Agung, an incredibly magnificent sight that\'s beautiful beyond words. This portrait of heaven is beautifully framed by the Gapura Candi Bentar (the gate of the temple). Our journey continues to visit Tirta Gangga. The site is a paradise surrounded by water, with all the pools decorated with unusual statues. With its seclusion and a view of the surrounding rice paddies, Tirta Gangga is a wonderful place. At the end of the trip we go to Tenganan Village, the most famous Bali Agas (the “original” Bali people) in the city. With its characteristics, the city village is arranged in parallel along the wide main road paved with rows of cobblestones. In Tenganan, women still weave the famous Kamben Geringsing, or \"burnt cloth,\" which has the power to immunize the wearer against evil. We take a close look at what they do in their daily lives in a traditional lifestyle. From Tenganan, we will transfer you to the hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-17\", \"text\": \"Royal Casa Ganesha, Jl. A.A. Gede Rai No.88, Lodtunduh, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 8493577\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-17\", \"text\": \"Royal Casa Ganesha, Jl. A.A. Gede Rai No.88, Lodtunduh, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 8493577\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5184708,'579','Jose Riba Ciurana',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-07','2024-08-07','Jacob','Praba',1,'Persons (4-6)',840000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-07\", \"text\": \"ETA 09:25AM by Lion Air JT560 from Yogyakarta\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-07\", \"text\": \"Alila Ubud Desa, Melinggih Kelod, Payangan, Gianyar Regency\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5184712,'573','Elena María Duran Agosto 2024',30508,213032,'Ubud to Kusamba','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-18','2024-08-18','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (1-3)',784000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'Please ready on hotel lobby for pickup at 06.00','{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": \"Royal Casa Ganesha, Jl. A.A. Gede Rai No.88, Lodtunduh, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 8493577\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": \"ETD : 08.00 by The Angkal Fastboat to Nusa Penida\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kusamba\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5184713,'579','Jose Riba Ciurana',30851,218551,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,7,'2024-08-07','2024-08-14','Jacob','Praba',2,'Double + Twin',49274400.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5184722,'579','Jose Riba Ciurana',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route (Taman Ayun-Jatiluwih-Ulundanu-Tanah Lot)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-08','2024-08-08','Jacob','Praba',4,'Persons (4)',2832000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": \"Alila Ubud Desa, Melinggih Kelod, Payangan, Gianyar Regency\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": \"Alila Ubud Desa, Melinggih Kelod, Payangan, Gianyar Regency\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5184730,'582','GERARD BALLESTA LUENGO',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-07','2024-08-07','Guio','Wiwik',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-07\", \"text\": \"ETA: 22.40 by QR960 from Doha on 07 August 2024.\", \"time\": \"22:40\", \"locality\": \"Aiport Ngurah Rai (International)\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"The Sankara Resort\", \"location\": \"Jl. Cempaka, Kumbuh, Jl. Cempaka, MAS, Ubud, Gianyar Regency, Bali 80571. Phone: (0361) 8493515\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5184731,'530','Marta Rey',30783,201524,'4D3N Semarang - Yogyakarta - Mt. Merapi with Jeep / B. Gallery Prawirotaman (Superior Room)','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-08-18','2024-08-21','Jacob','Febrina',2,'Persons (2 / Double)',11220000.00,'D1 Arrival Yogyakarta International Airport – Transfer to hotel: Welcome to the cradle of Indonesian culture, Yogyakarta. A tourist destination for its ancient palaces, temples, batik workshops, gamelan music orchestras, court dances and wayang puppet shows. Upon your arrival in Yogyakarta a representative of come2indonesia will be waiting for you with a sign indicating your name to take you to your hotel and the rest of the day is for you. D2 Borobudur temple – Candirejo Village Tour by Horse cart / bicycle – Merapi lava tour Including Jeep: You will have your deserved breakfast at the hotel. Today’s tour will make you enjoy the authentic Javanese essence. You will start your route in the direction of with the Borobudur Temple (Candi Borobudur), the great Stupa, the largest Buddhist monument in the world and one of the seven wonders. We will tour around the temple, observe the hundreds and centenary statues of Buddha and witness how dozens of Buddhists come to preach from all over the world. Historically it was established during the relatively brief Sailendra dynasty of Central Java between 778 and 856 BC and is in constant restoration due to the breaks that the tremors of the neighbouring Merapi volcano has been producing during its history. After visiting one of the most important Buddhist temples in Southeast Asia, and in a horse carriage (Andong) we will visit the villages that surround this temple. These are authentic Javanese villages where culture and tradition are the protagonists. As you spend your days in this country and go around the different islands, you will realize how different Indonesians are among them in terms of clothing, food, architecture and even language. Today we will learn about and share these Javanese places. Then we will go to Kaliurang / Kalidalem to see Mount Merapi in constant activity. Here in a 4x4 jeep driven by specialized drivers, we will climb its skirt to see the remains of the 2010 eruption such as houses buried by ashes, a multitude of objects paralyzed by lava, etc. In addition, an open-air tribute museum presided over by the clock that marks the time just when the lava passed through it has been improvised. Accompanied by photos of the rescue, it will make us feel very closely the experiences of that fateful day. After finishing this day full of emotions, we will take you back to your hotel. D3 City Tour Jogjakarta Visit Sultan Palace, Watercastle and Bird Market – Prambanan Temple: After breakfast and at the indicated time we will head towards the heart of the city. We will visit the Keraton known as the Sultan’s Palace. The palace is a complex building two centuries old, located in the heart of the city. You will hear the song of the “freedom” of the birds in the bird market, we will visit the “Water Castle” that occupies the highest part at the northern end of the vast complex of Taman Sari, Malioboro Street, main street of Yogyakarta, with its merchants, horse carriages, taxi-bikes and markets. An incredible experience that will make the hours fly by. After finishing the tour in the center of the city of Yogyakarta, we will go to the northeast direction Candi Prambanan, the temple of the Hinduists and classified as a World Heritage Site by Unesco since 1991. The built of this temple was finished around the year 856 to commemorate the victory of the descendant Sanjaya of Siva, Rikai Pikatan on the last sovereign Sailendra of Central Java. Take your time to enjoy each carving on the rocks and feel the spirituality that each of the stones perched in this set of more than 200 Hindu temples that are dedicated to the Trimurti, the expression of God as the Creator, the Preserver and the Destroyer. After this unforgettable day, we will take you to your hotel. D4 Transfer out Yogyakarta International airport: Today our adventure ends at the cradle of Indonesian culture. Depending on the time of your flight, we will pick you up to take you to the airport and take the flight to your next destination. End of our services. Thank you very much for exploring Yogyakarta by the hand of Come2indonesia.',NULL,'4D3N Semarang - Yogyakarta - Merapi Tour by Jeep, with Spanish speaking guide D1/18 Aug 2024: Arrival in Semarang - Prambanan temple - Transfer to the hotel D2/19 Aug 2024: Bird Market - Tamansari - Merapi lava tour by Jeep (B) D3/20 Aug 2024: Keraton - Candirejo Village Tour - Borobudur Temple (B) D4/21 Aug 2024: Departure from Yogyakarta (B) Flight details: ETA in Semarang at 11:25 from Pangkalan Bun by Batik Air ID6303 on 18 Aug ETD from Yogyakarta at 09:50 to Denpasar by Lion Air JT560 on 21 Aug','{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5184735,'573','Elena María Duran Agosto 2024',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-08-18','2024-08-18','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',952000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,'Pickup point : Sampalan harbour ETA : 08.20 by The Angkal Fastboat from Kusamba Dropoff point : Semabu Hill Hotel Nusa Penida Jl. Raya Toya Pakeh - Ped, Dusun Sebunibus, Sakti, Kec. Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771 Telepon: (0361) 6204400','{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": \"ETA : 08.20 by The Angkal Fastboat from Kusamba\", \"time\": \"08:20\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sampalan harbour, Nusa Penida\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5184737,'582','GERARD BALLESTA LUENGO',30762,201268,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-08-07','2024-08-11','Guio','Wiwik',1,'Double',7436800.00,'The suites are housed in a two stories building, over viewing to arrays of coconut trees and rice field. It features white-washed wood finishing, wooden floor and high quality king size bed with mosquito net, 29’ LED TV, DVD player, soft elegant cotton linen, and spacious bathroom featuring marble bathtub, shower room and guest amenities.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5184739,'579','Jose Riba Ciurana',30508,212412,'Ubud to Candidasa','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-14','2024-08-14','Jacob','Praba',1,'Persons (4)',1320000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": \"Alila Ubud Desa, Melinggih Kelod, Payangan, Gianyar Regency\", \"time\": \"12:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": \"Candi Beach Resort & Spa Jl. Mendira, Sengkidu, Kec. Manggis, Kabupaten Karangasem\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Candidasa\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5184740,'582','GERARD BALLESTA LUENGO',30508,202892,'GOA GAJAH-TAMPAKSIRING-GUNUNG KAWI SEBATU-TEGALALANG','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-08','2024-08-08','Guio','Wiwik',2,'Persons (2)',1747200.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"The Sankara Resort\", \"location\": \"Jl. Cempaka, Kumbuh, Jl. Cempaka, MAS, Ubud, Gianyar Regency, Bali 80571. Phone: (0361) 8493515\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"The Sankara Resort\", \"location\": \"Jl. Cempaka, Kumbuh, Jl. Cempaka, MAS, Ubud, Gianyar Regency, Bali 80571. Phone: (0361) 8493515\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5184742,'582','GERARD BALLESTA LUENGO',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route (Taman Ayun-Jatiluwih-Ulundanu Beratan-Tanah Lot)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-09','2024-08-09','Guio','Wiwik',2,'Persons (2)',1747200.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"The Sankara Resort\", \"location\": \"Jl. Cempaka, Kumbuh, Jl. Cempaka, MAS, Ubud, Gianyar Regency, Bali 80571. Phone: (0361) 8493515\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"The Sankara Resort\", \"location\": \"Jl. Cempaka, Kumbuh, Jl. Cempaka, MAS, Ubud, Gianyar Regency, Bali 80571. Phone: (0361) 8493515\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5184743,'573','Elena María Duran Agosto 2024',31285,212748,'Grand Deluxe Room Garden View','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-18','2024-08-19','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',1568000.00,'The Grand Deluxe Room with King Beds is a luxurious and spacious option for guests seeking a comfortable stay. Featuring modern amenities and contemporary decor, this room is designed to offer the ultimate relaxation experience. Guests can also enjoy stunning views of the surrounding city or the hotel’s gardens, making the Grand Deluxe Room with King or Twin Beds a perfect choice for those seeking an upscale and luxurious experience.',NULL,'Include Oneway Transfer to Buyuk harbour on 19 Aug ETD : 09.15 by Blue Water express to Gili Air Please ready on hotel lobby for transfer at 08.00AM Vouchers must be presented upon check-in and the hotel will there for invoice with in the 7 days period if credit facility has been extended by the hotel.','{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5184746,'582','GERARD BALLESTA LUENGO',31361,217922,'Batur Sunrise Trekking (Sharing Guide)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-10','2024-08-10','Guio','Wiwik',2,'Person (1)',784000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5184760,'530','Marta Rey',30508,202894,'Ubud - Kehen Temple - Pengelipuran - Kintamani - Uluwatu•','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-23','2024-08-23','Jacob','Febrina',2,'Persons (2)',1680000.00,'Our wonderful tour starts from Kehen Temple. It is an ancient Hindu temple complex boasting unique architectural features. The staircases reaching from the ground to temple courtyard are carved sandstone mythical animal and Balinese folklore figure statues and also the central vestibule. The temple’s walls are also ornate with Chinese porcelain plates, which are a tribute to the historical relations between the local Bali kingdom and China. Afterwards, we continue to Penglipuran, a village that succeeded in preserving its 75-hectare bamboo forest located in the northern part of the village. Members of this village have a strong commitment to the system of \'Ayahan Desa\' - a philosophy committed to respecting the land on which the village stands. To concludes the day, we stop by at Tukad Cepung Waterfall. Well-guarded by the circular cliffs, this waterfall is difficult to locate for the first time visitor. The circular cliffs give you the feeling of being in a cave, while the open sky right from where the waterfall emerges, gives you the most enchanting view. The sunlight falls on the glistering waterfall creating a rainbow, which feels as though it is projected right up to you. If you have never seen water flowing from the sky, then this would be your chance! After spending your time there, we go back to your hotel.',NULL,'FD Tour Kehen Temple - Penglipuran - Kintamani with Spanish speaking guide','{\"date\": \"2024-08-23\", \"text\": \"Jl. Suweta, Banjar Bentuyung Sakti, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali. Phone: +62361 2091788\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Desa Visesa Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-23\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bangbang Metuug, Bingin, Pecatu, Kuta Selatan, Badung, Bali. Phone: +62811 3997903\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Green Escape Eco & Boutique Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5184761,'576','Mrs. Gloria Durany Boixados',30805,212255,'CGK-YIA','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-12','2024-08-12','Melysa','Praba',2,'Person',2552836.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5184789,'573','Elena María Duran Agosto 2024',30649,204187,'One Bedroom Pool Lagoon','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-08-19','2024-08-22','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',4200000.00,'This room is perfect for travelers or business people! With a room area of ​​25m2 and equipped with a double / single bed, air conditioning controller, LED TV and high speed internet access. This modern designed bathroom is also equipped with a shower and toiletries to complete your needs during your stay at our hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5184792,'576','Mrs. Gloria Durany Boixados',30805,202685,'SUB-DPS','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-16','2024-08-16','Melysa','Praba',2,'Person',1730656.40,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5184803,'5