to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-11','2024-08-11','Ayu','Tami',2,'Persons (1-3)',840000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": \"ETA 16.35 by Garuda GA7037 from Labuan Bajo on 11 August 2024\", \"time\": \"16:35\", \"locality\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": \"Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Monkey Forest\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5185829,'579','Jose Riba Ciurana',30689,215499,'Hilltop Pool Suites','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-08-15','2024-08-19','Jacob','Praba',2,'Double + Twin',22848000.00,'They are located on a hillside with 180 degree magnificent ocean views showcasing several beautiful small islands in the distance as well as the spectacular Rinjani volcano. Each pool suite is fully air-conditioned with a luxury bedroom adjoining the living area on the ground floor and a marvellous rooftop plunge pool facing the ocean with an open sunbathing area showcasing the stunning ocean views. The bedroom sized 4 x 5 metres. Each bedroom is provided with king-size beds, air conditioning as well as ceiling fans, a fridge, a safe, satellite flat screen TV and Hard Drive that has 100’s of TV Shows and Movies. Each pool suites have modern fully marbled bathrooms with hot and cold fresh water showers and all fittings are European made. Wifi & Internet Service are accessible throughout the suites.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5185837,'587','Beatrice Tedeschi',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Custom Itinerary)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-12','2024-08-12','Ayu','Tami',2,