\"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5185853,'587','Beatrice Tedeschi',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-08-13','2024-08-13','Ayu','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1020000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,'Fasboat schedule: ETA 09.30 by Maruti Express from Sanur on 13 August 2024 ETD 16.30 by Maruti Express to Sanur on 13 August 2024 Check in time: 16.00 Visiting: Angel\'s Billabong - Broken Beach - Kelingking Beach - Crystal Beach','{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"09:30\", \"locality\": \"Banjar Nyuh Harbour ( Maruti Express )\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"16:00\", \"locality\": \"Banjar Nyuh Harbour ( Maruti Express )\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5185854,'588','Agustin Ruiz Coca',32575,215841,'The Apartement Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-02','2024-08-03','Jacob','Tami',2,'Double + Twin',8040000.00,'Bring the whole family along for the ride and stay in the spacious two bedroom, two bathroom apartments at Morrissey. Everyone can enjoy group activities in the common areas while still having their own personal space to retreat to. What’s more, the sunken shower tub is perfect for soaking the day away ! Morrissey likes getting everyone together in one place–the more the merrier! 88 m2 (948 Sq ft).',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5185865,'587','Beatrice Tedeschi',30508,207388,'Sanur to Seminyak','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-13','2024-08-13','Ayu','Tami',2,'Persons (1-3)',600000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'Fastboat schedule: ETA 17.00 by Maruti Express from Nusa Penida on 13 August 2024','{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"17:00\", \"locality\": \"Sanur Harbour\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Indigo Hotel Seminyak\", \"location\": \"Jl. Camplung Tanduk No.10, Seminyak\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5185868,'587','Beatrice Tedeschi',31242,205019,'One-Bedroom Villa with Private Pool','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-08-14','2024-08-16','Ayu','Tami',1,'Double',7956000.00,'Our villas feels like that warm feeling you get when you rediscover a fond lost memory of home. More than that, it feels authentic, featuring wood that’s over 100 years old. More than a simple luxurious experience, it is a journey through history with all of the modern comforts. Discover an old culture fused with modern lifestyle. You’ll never want to leave.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5185869,'588','Agustin Ruiz Coca',30805,216895,'CGK-SRG','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-03','2024-08-03','Jacob','Tami',10,'Person',12100000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5185870,'588','Agustin Ruiz Coca',30681,207525,'Grand Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-03','2024-08-04','Jacob','Tami',4,'2 Double + 2 Twin',7920000.00,'Spacious 40 square meter of luxury with an elegant touch, understated modern design features, and full of comfort, located at 15th floor with amazing view of Semarang city. Along with subtle hues of natural color enhanced with black marble and accent of luxurious walnut wood. The Grand Deluxe Room is designed with business needs in mind and fully equipped with a functional work station with ergonomic executive chair, enjoy the plush comfort of bed, with luxury bed linens, cover and duvet, a high definition 42″ LED interactive TV and high speed internet access up to 400 Mbps, international power outlet, spa-inspired bathroom with separate rain shower and deep-soaking bath areas and 12