{\"date\": \"2024-08-19\", \"text\": \"Br. Tanggayuda, Kedewatan, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"10:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Tanggayuda\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-19\", \"text\": \"ETD 13.00 to Gili Air by BlueWater Express on 19 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5188545,'595','Elena Jalon Sebastian',32602,215975,'Single Villa','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-08-19','2024-08-22','Jacob','Tami',1,'Double',18312000.00,'Each room offers the same comfort: one bedroom villas with terrace, swimming pool, kitchenette and office space, comfortable sunbeds, lovely coconut garden. Particular care to the quality of the beddings, the home stylist Valérie Barkowski has added her touch of originality with a predominant colour selection of orange, grey, red, green, bordeaux or black. Choose your holiday colour!',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5188556,'595','Elena Jalon Sebastian',31285,208028,'Suite Room with Ocean View','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-08-22','2024-08-24','Jacob','Tami',1,'Double',3651200.00,'With 100 sqm of space, this suite comfortably accommodates up to 2 adults. It comes with air conditioning, a flat-screen TV with international channels, and a personal safe. The suite has a dining area and coffee/tea making facilities. Bathroom is fitted with separate toilet and shower. Fresh towels and bed linens are provided.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5188572,'595','Elena Jalon Sebastian',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-08-23','2024-08-23','Jacob','Tami',3,'Persons (3)',1008000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-23\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Toya Pakeh - Ped, Dusun Sebunibus, Sakti, Kec. Nusa Penida, Kab. Klungkung\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Semabu Hills Hotel Nusa Penida\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5188577,'594','VANESA PEREZ LAMPON',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-08-28','2024-08-28','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',952000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-28\", \"text\": \"ETA : 08.20 by The Angkal Fastboat from Kusamba on 28 Aug\", \"time\": \"08:20\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sampalan harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-28\", \"text\": \"The Angkal Resort, Banjar Angkal, Suana, Kec. Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771 Telepon: (0366) 5582389\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Penida\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5188580,'594','VANESA PEREZ LAMPON',31040,203404,'Ocean View Bungalow Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-28','2024-08-29','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',1064000.00,'Room size: 55 sqm. The ocean view bungalow room has 13 units available. The rooms at this Nusa Penida hotel provide guests with high-velocity internet and a flat-screen TV with satellite channels, and comforts such as ironing facilities and air conditioning. The units are designed in a comfortable manner. Offering amenities like hair dryers and bathrobes, the bathrooms also include a walk-in shower, a separate toilet and a sink.',NULL,'Please ready on hotel lobby for transfer to harbour between at 07.45 - 08.00','{\"date\": \"2024-08-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5188581,'595','Elena Jalon Sebastian',30508,212456,'Sanur to Uluwatu','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-24','2024-08-24','Jacob','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-24\", \"text\": \"ETA 13.00 from Nusa Penida by Maruti Fast Boat\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sanur Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-24\", \"text\": \"Jl. Pemutih Jl. Labuansait, Pecatu, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Radisson Blu Resort, Bali Uluwatu\"}