NULL,5,'2024-08-23','2024-08-28','Jacob','Komang',1,'Double',9150000.00,'Gaze out at rippling rice fields as you let your stress slip away in one of our Premier Ricefield View suites. Inside you have smooth tiles, warm wooden accents, and all the modern comforts you could ask for. Step onto the balcony and you have an airy nook where you can witness life unfold in the Balinese countryside.',NULL,'\"Honeymooner\"','{\"date\": \"2024-08-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5193698,'590','Marta Vara Espuga',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-05','2024-08-05','Melysa','Febrina',1,'Persons (4-6)',784000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'Transfer Airport - Ubud, with Driver only','{\"date\": \"2024-08-05\", \"text\": \"ETA 11:15 by Super Air Jet IU732 from Jakarta on 05 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Denpasar Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-05\", \"text\": \"Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali 80571. Phone: +62361 975394 / +62821 46869599\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sri Aksata Ubud Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5193754,'590','Marta Vara Espuga',31294,218734,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-08-05','2024-08-07','Melysa','Febrina',2,'Double + Twin',4928000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5193759,'590','Marta Vara Espuga',30508,202894,'Ubud Palace - Kintamani - Tegalalang - Tirta Empul - Tegenungan Waterfall','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-06','2024-08-06','Melysa','Febrina',4,'Persons (4)',2284800.00,'Our wonderful tour starts from Kehen Temple. It is an ancient Hindu temple complex boasting unique architectural features. The staircases reaching from the ground to temple courtyard are carved sandstone mythical animal and Balinese folklore figure statues and also the central vestibule. The temple’s walls are also ornate with Chinese porcelain plates, which are a tribute to the historical relations between the local Bali kingdom and China. Afterwards, we continue to Penglipuran, a village that succeeded in preserving its 75-hectare bamboo forest located in the northern part of the village. Members of this village have a strong commitment to the system of \'Ayahan Desa\' - a philosophy committed to respecting the land on which the village stands. To concludes the day, we stop by at Tukad Cepung Waterfall. Well-guarded by the circular cliffs, this waterfall is difficult to locate for the first time visitor. The circular cliffs give you the feeling of being in a cave, while the open sky right from where the waterfall emerges, gives you the most enchanting view. The sunlight falls on the glistering waterfall creating a rainbow, which feels as though it is projected right up to you. If you have never seen water flowing from the sky, then this would be your chance! After spending your time there, we go back to your hotel.',NULL,'FD Tour Ubud Palace - Kintamani - Tegalalang - Tirta Empul - Tegenungan Waterfall, with Spanish speaking guide','{\"date\": \"2024-08-06\", \"text\": \"Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali 80571. Phone: +62361 975394 / +62821 46869599\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sri Aksata Ubud Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-06\", \"text\": \"Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali 80571. Phone: +62361 975394 / +62821 46869599\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sri Aksata Ubud Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5193763,'590','Marta Vara Espuga',30508,202893,'Lempuyang Temple Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI11',1,'2024-08-07','2024-08-07','Melysa','Febrina',4,'Persons (4)',2732800.00,'At the agreed time, our guide will pick you up to start the tour in the eastern part of Bali. The first place you will visit is Goa Lawah Temple. Goa Lawah Temple consists of two names, \"Goa\" which means cave and \"Lawah\" which means bat. Several thousand bats are flying in the cave as the name suggests. With the lights fading as you go deeper inside the cave, it gives off a very strange atmosphere. From Goa Lawah, we continue our way to Lempuyang Temple. Upon arrival, the temple will greet you with its gratifying panorama that extends into infinity. On a clear, sunny day, you\'ll be able to gaze out over the mountains, Amlapura city, and Mount Agung, an incredibly magnificent sight that\'s beautiful beyond words. This portrait of heaven is beautifully framed by the Gapura Candi Bentar (the gate of the temple). Our journey continues to visit Tirta Gangga. The site is a paradise surrounded by water, with all the pools decorated with unusual statues. With its seclusion and a view of the surrounding rice paddies, Tirta Gangga is a wonderful place. At the end of the trip we go to Tenganan Village, the most famous Bali Agas (the “original” Bali people) in the city. With its characteristics, the city village is arranged in parallel along the wide main road paved with rows of cobblestones. In Tenganan, women still weave the famous Kamben Geringsing, or \"burnt cloth,\" which has the power to immunize the wearer against evil. We take a close look at what they do in their daily lives in a traditional lifestyle. From Tenganan, we will transfer you to the hotel.',NULL,'FD Tour Lempuyang Temple - Tirta Gangga - Taman Ujung - Besakih Temple - Sidemen, with Spanish speaking guide','{\"date\": \"2024-08-07\", \"text\": \"Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali 80571. Phone: +62361 975394 / +62821 46869599\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sri Aksata Ubud Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-07\", \"text\": \"Jero Tumbuk Private Villa. Jl. Baledan, Selat, Kec. Selat, Kabupaten Karangasem, Bali 80862 Phone: +62813 81303696\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Jero Tumbuk Culture & Retreat\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5193771,'590','Marta Vara Espuga',31424,218735,'Two-Bedroom Villa Kayu with Pool','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-08-07','2024-08-10','Melysa','Febrina',1,'Double + Twin',8064000.00,NULL,NULL,'08 Aug 2024: Village Walking Tour - Morning trip 1 Hour Traditional Massage for 4 pax.','{\"date\": \"2024-08-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5193787,'590','Marta Vara Espuga',30508,218455,'Sidemen to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-10','2024-08-10','Melysa','Febrina',1,'Persons (4-6)',1232000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'Transfer Sidemen - Padang Bai Harbor, with Driver only','{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": \"Jero Tumbuk Private Villa. Jl. Baledan, Selat, Kec. Selat, Kabupaten Karangasem, Bali 80862. Phone: +62813 81303696\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Jero Tumbuk Culture & Retreat\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": \"ETD 08:30 by Gili Gili Fast Boat on 10 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbor\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5193797,'628','Rebeca Bastida Torre',30680,200919,'Premier Family Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-13','2024-08-14','Melysa','Tami',1,'Single + Double',1344000.00,'The most important things in this world is family. Thoughtfully designed with families in mind, our Family Premier Room includes everything needed for you and your family to feel comfortable during your stay. At 43 m2 pf room size with 1 king size and 1 twin size, this room equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, hot and cold shower, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer. Free access to our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK-IN. FM7 Hotel Airport Pickup Service: +62811-8815-053 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5193800,'590','Marta Vara Espuga',30919,218733,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-08-10','2024-08-14','Melysa','Febrina',2,'Double + Twin',12096000.00,'Well furnished with double beds comprising high-quality spring mattresses, Superior Rooms at Natya Hotel Gili Trawangan ensure guests enjoy a tropical island getaway but with modern comforts and conveniences at hand. Rooms also feature en suite bathrooms with hot and cold water showers, as well as in-room entertainment through the large screen, LED TV, and complimentary internet connectivity.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5193801,'628','Rebeca Bastida Torre',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-08-14','2024-08-16','Melysa','Tami',3,'Persons (3)',11760000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan isCape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continueto add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": \"ETA 07.15 by Batik Air ID6202 from Jakarta on 14 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pangkalan Bun Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": \"ETD 10.25 by Batik Air ID6303 to Semarang on 16 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5193802,'628','Rebeca Bastida Torre',30783,201490,'3D2N Semarang - Yogyakarta / B. Gallery Prawirotaman (Superior Room)','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-08-16','2024-08-18','Melysa','Tami',3,'Persons (3 / Triple-extra bed)',10920000.00,'D1 : Arrival at Semarang Airport - Borobudur Temple tour incl. Mendut and Pawon - Transfer to Jogja Welcome to the cradle of Indonesian culture, Yogyakarta. A tourist destination for its ancient palaces, temples, batik workshops, gamelan music orchestras, court dances and wayang puppet shows. Upon your arrival in Semarang airport a representative of come2indonesia will be waiting for you with a sign indicating your name to start exploring this special city. We will start by heading towards Borobudur Temple (Candi Borobudur), the great Stupa, the largest Buddhist monument in the world and one of the seven wonders. We will tour around the temple, observe the hundreds and centenary statues of Buddha and witness how dozens of Buddhists come to preach from all over the world. Historically it was established during the relatively brief Sailendra dynasty of Central Java between 778 and 856 BC and is in constant restoration due to the breaks that the tremors of the neighbouring Merapi volcano has been producing during its history. After visiting one of the most important Buddhist temples in Southeast Asia, we continue our journey to the Mendut temple and Pawon temple. And then, we will take you to Jogjakarta. D2 : Jogjakarta City Tour visit Sultan Palace, Watercastle and Bird Market - Visit Prambanan Temple You will enjoy a well-deserved breakfast at the hotel and we will start by heading towards Keraton known as the Sultan’s Palace. The palace is a complex building two centuries old, located in the heart of the city. You will hear the song of the “freedom” of the birds in the bird market, we will visit the “Water Castle” that occupies the highest part at the northern end of the vast complex of Taman Sari, Malioboro Street, main street of Yogyakarta, with its merchants, horse carriages, taxi-bikes and markets. After this visit we go to Candi Prambanan, the temple of the Hinduists and classified as a World Heritage Site by Unesco since 1991. The built of this temple was finished around the year 856 to commemorate the victory of the descendant Sanjaya of Siva, Rikai Pikatan on the last sovereign Sailendra of Central Java. Take your time to enjoy each carving on the rocks and feel the spirituality that each of the stones perched in this set of more than 200 Hindu temples that are dedicated to the Trimurti, the expression of God as the Creator, the Preserver and the destroyer. An incredible experience that will make the hours fly by. After this unforgettable day, we will take you back to your hotel. D3 : Transfer to Yogyakarta International Airport You will enjoy a well-deserved breakfast at the hotel and according to the time of your flight, we will pick you up to take you to the airport and take the flight to your next destination. End of our services. Thank you very much for exploring Yogyakarta by the hand of Come2indonesia.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": \"ETA 11.25 by Batik Air ID6303 from Pangkalan Bun on 16 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Semarang International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": \"ETD 14.55 by Lion Air JT644 to Makassar on 18 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Yogyakarta International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5193806,'629','SANDRA TEIXIDOR',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-10','2024-08-10','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (1-3)',420000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": \"ETA : 14.35 by Garuda Indonesia GA408 from Jakarta on 10 August 2024\", \"time\": \"14:35\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": \"Puri Sebali Resort, Jl. Raya Sebali, Kelusa, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 4792644\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5193811,'590','Marta Vara Espuga',31424,218739,'Village Walking Tour','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-08','2024-08-08','Melysa','Febrina',4,'Person (1)',672000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5193812,'590','Marta Vara Espuga',31424,218740,'1 Hour Traditional Massage','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-08','2024-08-08','Melysa','Febrina',4,'Person (1)',896000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5193814,'590','Marta Vara Espuga',30728,208158,'Additional charge for guide in Gili Trawangan','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-12','2024-08-12','Melysa','Febrina',1,'Persons (4)',280000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5193822,'628','Rebeca Bastida Torre',31106,203994,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-18','2024-08-19','Melysa','Tami',1,'Double',756000.00,'Discover Makassar from a very comfortable room with a king-size bed (or two single beds), a practical desk with an executive chair, and a modern bathroom with an open shower. You will also really like the welcome minibar to start your stay as you deserve. Inside the room has flat-screen TV, high speed Wi-Fi, and refrigerator.',NULL,'Flight information ETA 17.50 by Lion Air JT644 from Yogyakarta on 18 Aug ETD 08.00 by Wings Air IW1350 to Palopo on 19 Aug','{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5193827,'628','Rebeca Bastida Torre',31106,216964,'Pick up at Airport by Avanza','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-18','2024-08-18','Melysa','Tami',1,'Per Car',336000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5193828,'628','Rebeca Bastida Torre',31106,216968,'Drop off at Airport by Avanza','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-19','2024-08-19','Melysa','Tami',1,'Per Car',336000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5193831,'628','Rebeca Bastida Torre',30644,201464,'4D3N Toraja Package (3N Toraja)','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-08-19','2024-08-22','Melysa','Tami',3,'Persons (3 / Double)',17606400.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-19\", \"text\": \"ETA 09.00 by Wings Air IW1350 from Makassar on 19 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Lagaligo Bua Airport (Palopo)\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-22\", \"text\": \"ETD 09.30 by Wings Air IW1351 to Makassar on 22 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5193833,'628','Rebeca Bastida Torre',30571,202567,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-22','2024-08-23','Melysa','Tami',1,'Double',1372000.00,'Located at the Second Floor, 35 sqm comfort living with a touch of Balinese style featuring completed fitting, Cable TV, a fancy bathroom comprises rain shower and good quality amenities. Also dedicated Wi-Fi Access to complete your day.',NULL,'Flight information ETA 15.40 by Lion Air JT745 from Makassar on 22 Aug ETD 10.35 by Wings Air IW1832 to Tambolaka on 23 Aug','{\"date\": \"2024-08-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5193836,'628','Rebeca Bastida Torre',30528,215500,'4D3N Explore Sumba Special Experience, Culture & Adventure Trip / A. Mario Hotel - Rua Beach Hotel','Confirmed','4DSW-S',4,'2024-08-23','2024-08-26','Melysa','Tami',3,'Persons (3-4 / Triple-extra bed)',24360000.00,'DAY 1 : ARRIVAL TMC - BONDO KAPUMBU VILLAGE - SALT FARMERS VISIT - LENDONGARA HILL SUNSET Meet and greet with our guide at the Tambolaka airport in south-west Sumba.After that, we go to a local restaurant for lunch. Then we will start our journey by visiting Bondo Kapumbu Village, a hidden traditional village in south-west Sumba. Continuing to Ketewel Beach, you can visit the salt farmers, where you can see how they make the salt in a traditional way. Then we head to Lendongara to watch the sunset over the hills and the Sumba landscape. Then we go to your hotel to check in and rest. Meals : Lunch Accomodation : A. Mario Hotel (Deluxe Jineng Room) DAY 2 : SUMBA CASHEW FARM & PRODUCTION - WAIKACURA RICE FIELD - WATUBELA BEACH After breakfast, we will go to Talasi to see the cashew farm and production. Here you will get a chance to try their original cashew milk. After that, we go to the Waikacura area, where you can go trekking to the rice fields. Get a chance to see the local farmers do their activities, and at the end of the trek you will see the stunning river in the middle of the rice field. Next, after trekking, we go to West Sumba and have lunch at a local restaurant. After lunch, we go to visit the beautiful hidden beach of Watubela. On the way, you will pass a small village and palm garden to get to the beach. Relax on the beach, and we\'ll go to your hotel after that. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch Accomodation : A. Rua Beach Hotel (Deluxe Room) DAY 3 : SUMBANESE COOKING & ACTIVITIES EXPERIENCE - LAPOPU WATERFALL Breakfast at the hotel, then we go to the traditional village in West Sumba, where you will be warmly welcomed by the locals. Talking with them and listening to the story of the village and the island. After engaging with them, they will invite you to join them in cooking Sumba\'s traditional foods. Once the foods are ready, have lunch together. Have coffee or tea after lunch, sit with them for a while, then say goodbye. Our trip is continuing to Lapopu Waterfall. After a drive through the endless hilly and green landscape of Sumba, you will arrive near the waterfall. To visit the waterfall, you will need to do a short hike of approximately 15 minutes and cross a bamboo bridge to get there. There is a nice spot to sit down where you can watch the water find its way down the hill. After the visits, go back to the hotel to rest. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch Accomodation : A. Rua Beach Hotel (Deluxe Room) DAY 4 : PRAIJING VILLAGE - OUT TMC AIRPORT After breakfast and checking out of the hotel, we will go to visit the village of Praijing, a traditional village uphill surrounded by lots of greenery. This is one of the few villages where we can actually have a beautiful overview of the entire village and get an idea of how the village is conducted. Take some time to walk around the village, the elders occupy most of the houses, and kids are always around to share their smiles. And then go to the airport to catch a flight to your next destination. Meals : Breakfast Accomodation : -',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-23\", \"text\": \"ETA 12.00 by Wings Air IW1832 from Denpasar on 23 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Tambolaka Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-26\", \"text\": \"ETD 12.25 by Wings Air IW1833 to Denpasar on 26 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5193843,'628','Rebeca Bastida Torre',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-26','2024-08-26','Melysa','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-26\", \"text\": \"ETA 13.55 by Wings Air IW1833 from Tambolaka on 26 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-26\", \"text\": \"Jl. Suweta, Bentuyung Sakti, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5193847,'628','Rebeca Bastida Torre',30985,212179,'Jungle Suite Room with Private Balcony','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-08-26','2024-08-30','Melysa','Tami',1,'Double',10080000.00,'Escape the hustle and bustle of everyday life and immerse yourself in the beauty of nature with our Jungle Suite with Private Balcony. Located in the heart of the lush tropical rainforest, this Suite offers a unique opportunity to immerse yourself in nature while still enjoying all the comforts of modern living. The real highlight of this room category is the private balcony overlooking the jungle canopy. Relax in your own personal paradise as you listen to the sounds of nature, watch the birds playing in the trees, and breathe in the fresh air while taking in the breathtaking views.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5193863,'628','Rebeca Bastida Torre',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-27','2024-08-27','Melysa','Tami',3,'Persons (3)',2016000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-27\", \"text\": \"Jl. Suweta, Bentuyung Sakti, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5193872,'628','Rebeca Bastida Torre',30508,215968,'Besakih Temple – Tukad Cepung Waterfall – Pengelipuran Village','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-28','2024-08-28','Melysa','Tami',3,'Person (1)',0.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-28\", \"text\": \"Jl. Suweta, Bentuyung Sakti, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5193889,'628','Rebeca Bastida Torre',30508,207262,'Ubud to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-30','2024-08-30','Melysa','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-30\", \"text\": \"Jl. Suweta, Bentuyung Sakti, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-30\", \"text\": \"ETD 12.55 by Qatar QR5396 to Kuala Lumpur on 30 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5193928,'499','MARIA DEL PILAR FRETES BIZARRO',30508,207379,'Ubud to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-10','2024-10-10','Guio','Eddy',4,'Persons (4)',2400000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-10\", \"text\": \"Chai House (Book By Guest) T House Klod, Banjar Abian Semal Kaja Kauh, Lodtunduh, 80571 Ubud, Indonesia\", \"time\": \"10:00\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-10\", \"text\": \"PADANG BAY (Central Bali) 12:15PM\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"PADANG BAI PORT\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5193930,'590','Marta Vara Espuga',31285,208028,'Suite Room with Ocean View','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-14','2024-08-15','Melysa','Febrina',2,'Double + Twin',3651200.00,'With 100 sqm of space, this suite comfortably accommodates up to 2 adults. It comes with air conditioning, a flat-screen TV with international channels, and a personal safe. The suite has a dining area and coffee/tea making facilities. Bathroom is fitted with separate toilet and shower. Fresh towels and bed linens are provided.',NULL,'14 Aug 2024: Oneway transfer Banjar Nyuh Harbor - Hotel with 2 cars. Boat detail: ETA 16:50 by Ekajaya Fast Ferry on 14 Aug.','{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5193948,'590','Marta Vara Espuga',30508,207112,'Snorkeling and Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-08-15','2024-08-15','Melysa','Febrina',4,'Persons (4)',3046400.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,'FD Tour Snorkeling and Nusa Penida Tour (Kelingking, Angel Billabong, Broken Beach), with Driver only','{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Toya Pakeh - Ped, Nusa Penida, Klungkung, Bali 80771. Phone: +62361 6204400 / +62823 39776651\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Semabu Hills Nusa Penida\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": \"ETD 16:30 by Maruti Fast Boat on 15 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Banjar Nyuh Harbor Nusa Penida\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5193960,'590','Marta Vara Espuga',30596,201103,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-08-15','2024-08-18','Melysa','Febrina',2,'Double + Twin',16800000.00,'Experience timeless elegance in our Deluxe Room. Perfect for couples or solo travelers seeking a spacious single/double bed. Our room offers premium linens, plush pillows, and a peaceful ambiance. Enjoy high-speed internet, a flat-screen TV, coffee and tea-making facilities, and an in-room safe deposit box, ensuring a convenient and enjoyable stay. Unwind on the balcony overlooking the pool, to recharge after a day of activities.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5193971,'590','Marta Vara Espuga',30508,207388,'Sanur to Legian','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-15','2024-08-15','Melysa','Febrina',1,'Persons (4-6)',672000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'Transfer Sanur Harbor - Legian, with Driver only','{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": \"ETA 17:00 by Maruti Fast Boat on 15 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sanur Harbor\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": \"Jl. Padma Utara, Legian Kaja, Kuta, Badung, Bali 80361. Phone: +62361 757688\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Bali Niiksoma Boutique Beach Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5193985,'590','Marta Vara Espuga',30508,202897,'Uluwatu Temple and Kecak Dance with Dinner in Jimbaran','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-16','2024-08-16','Melysa','Febrina',4,'Persons (4)',4200000.00,'This half-day tour, is an exciting tour package to visit Padang-Padang Beach, Uluwatu Temple, the famous Balinese Hindu Temple in south part of Bali with breathtaking view of sunset and Indian Ocean. Uluwatu Temple is one of Balinese Hindu Temples located right on the petrifying hill with the crevasse exist in the right and left side. Uluwatu Temple is one of Sad Khayangan (6 biggest temple in Bali) owns magnificent view of the Indian Ocean and sunset as a backdrop. This temple is very amazing where the location is right on the narrow peninsula with deep seawater under it. This tour package is combined with the spectacular Balinese traditional dance performance of Kecak Dance. Balinese Kecak Dance is a spectacular traditional dance with the group of people playing this dance with fire game. It is very exciting and unique dance due to the sound of gamelan is not using the normal gamelan but use their mouth. The dancers make the compact choir with the exquisite dance movement that is one of this dance features. After the dance we returned back to the hotel or seafood restaurant in Jimbaran.',NULL,'HD Tour GWK - Uluwatu Temple - Kecak Dance - Dinner in Jimbaran, with Spanish speaking guide','{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": \"Jl. Padma Utara, Legian Kaja, Kuta, Badung, Bali 80361. Phone: +62361 757688\", \"time\": \"10:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Bali Niksoma Boutique Beach Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": \"Jl. Padma Utara, Legian Kaja, Kuta, Badung, Bali 80361. Phone: +62361 757688\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Bali Niksoma Boutique Beach Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5193989,'590','Marta Vara Espuga',30508,207270,'Legian to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-18','2024-08-18','Melysa','Febrina',1,'Persons (4-6)',672000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'Transfer Legian - Airport, with Driver only','{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": \"Jl. Padma Utara, Legian Kaja, Kuta, Badung, Bali 80361. Phone: +62361 757688\", \"time\": \"09:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Bali Niksoma Boutique Beach Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": \"ETD 13:55 by Citilink QG683 to Jakarta on 18 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Denpasar Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5193994,'590','Marta Vara Espuga',30805,212256,'CGK-DPS','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-05','2024-08-05','Melysa','Febrina',4,'Person',8132000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','202