,0.00,NULL,NULL,'check-in Time 14.00 WIT 1 Deluxe Room Double Bed Include brakfast Included one way Transfer from Hotel to Airport on 01 September ETD 10.40 by Wings Air IW1557 to Manokwari on 01 September 2024','{\"date\": \"2024-08-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5194024,'629','SANDRA TEIXIDOR',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Pengelipuran Village-Tukad Cepung-Kanto Lampo','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-12','2024-08-12','Guio','Komang',4,'Person (1)',0.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-12\", \"text\": \"Puri Sebali Resort, Jl. Raya Sebali, Kelusa, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 4792644\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-12\", \"text\": \"Puri Sebali Resort, Jl. Raya Sebali, Kelusa, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 4792644\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5194032,'629','SANDRA TEIXIDOR',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route (Taman Ayun-Jati Luwih-Bedugul-Tanah Lot)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-13','2024-08-13','Guio','Komang',4,'Persons (4)',2832000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": \"Puri Sebali Resort, Jl. Raya Sebali, Kelusa, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 4792644\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": \"Puri Sebali Resort, Jl. Raya Sebali, Kelusa, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 4792644\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5194037,'629','SANDRA TEIXIDOR',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Goa Gajah-Tampak Siring-Gunung Kawi-Tegalalang)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-14','2024-08-14','Guio','Komang',4,'Person (1)',3600000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": \"Puri Sebali Resort, Jl. Raya Sebali, Kelusa, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 4792644\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": \"Puri Sebali Resort, Jl. Raya Sebali, Kelusa, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 4792644\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5194061,'629','SANDRA TEIXIDOR',30508,207379,'Ubud to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-15','2024-08-15','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (4-6)',1140000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'Please ready on hotel lobby for transfer at 06.00','{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": \"Puri Sebali Resort, Jl. Raya Sebali, Kelusa, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 4792644\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": \"ETD : 08.30 by Gili Gili Fastboat from Padangbai to Gili Air on 15 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padangbay harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5194099,'629','SANDRA TEIXIDOR',30649,204187,'One Bedroom Pool Lagoon','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-08-15','2024-08-18','Guio','Komang',2,'Double + Twin',9000000.00,'This room is perfect for travelers or business people! With a room area of ​​25m2 and equipped with a double / single bed, air conditioning controller, LED TV and high speed internet access. This modern designed bathroom is also equipped with a shower and toiletries to complete your needs during your stay at our hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5194722,'631','Rachael Purchase',31365,216725,'Standard Room (Room Breakfast)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-26','2024-07-27','Rendy','Tami',1,'Double',576000.00,'This twin or double room has air conditioning, desk and a flat-screen cable TV. Private bathroom comes with a shower and free toiletries.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5194736,'631','Rachael Purchase',30806,202002,'4D3N Borneo Orangutan & Reforestation Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO7',4,'2024-07-27','2024-07-30','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Persons (2)',14040000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN – KUMAI PORT – TANJUNG HARAPAN Your “Orangutan & Reforestation Tour” begins upon arrival at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan is Cape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch – Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : TANJUNG HARAPAN VILLAGE – PROBOSCIS TOUR – CAMP LEAKEY After an extraordinary breakfast, you go to visit the village inside the national park, named Tanjung Harapan Village. Here you will see the activities of the locals. After the visit, you will return to the klotok cruise up to the Sekonyer River. You will see nice vegetation around the river bank, including Nipa Palm, Pandanus, and some kinds of trees that are growing up around the river. See some wildlifes such as birds, Macaques, Proboscis Monkeys and Orangutans. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large monitor lizards. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. Note: The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. Meals : Breakfast – Lunch – Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : PONDOK TANGGUI – CAMP LEAKEY – BOAT After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continue to add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After lunch, you will have the opportunity to repeat feeding camp at Camp Leaky. It is a unique opportunity to dedicate more time to your observation and to discover more wild animals, along with the Orangutans. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note: If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast – Lunch – Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 4 : KUMAI PORT – PANGKALAN BUN Today we end our stay in the jungles of Borneo. Our “Orangutan & Reforestation Tour” is about to finish. In the early morning we will have breakfast on the boat, to then go to the port and in turn, be transferred to the airport. The boat departure will be at the latest at 10am, but we adapt to your flights if your flight leaves earlier in the morning. If you decide to take an afternoon flight, we can take you directly to the airport at 10 or if you want a city tour in the Arut village to drop you off at the airport later, it could be arranged at extra cost. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board. Special note: Client Rachael Purchase is anaphylactic (severe allergy) to nuts','{\"date\": \"2024-07-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5194769,'632','Mr. Aitor Nava',30783,218071,'5D4N Jogja-Bromo-Ijen-Bali Incl. Train / C. Adhisthana (Superior) & Bromo Terrace (Deluxe) & Ketapan','Confirmed',NULL,5,'2024-09-08','2024-09-12','Jacob','Praba',2,'Persons (2 / Double)',20580000.00,'D1 Arrival at Yogyakarta International Airport - Borobudur temple tour Incl.Mendut and Pawon D2 Yogyakarta City tour visit Sultan Palace, Wateracastle and Bird Market, Visit Prambanan temple D3 Jogja - Mojokerto by train - drive to Bromo - overnight in Bromo D4 Mt. Bromo Sunrise tour incl. Jeep - Transfer to Ijen for overnight D5 Mt. Ijen crater tour - transfer to Bali across Ketapang - Gilimanuk harbour - drop at your hotel in Bali',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-08\", \"text\": \"Adhisthana Hotel Jl. Prawirotaman 2 No.613, Brontokusuman, Kec. Mergangsan, Kota Yogyakarta, Daerah Istimewa Yogyakarta\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Yogyakarta\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-12\", \"text\": \"Padma Ubud Retreat Jl. Kajeng No.13, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud, Bali\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5194773,'629','SANDRA TEIXIDOR',31980,218800,'Try Scuba Diving','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-16','2024-08-16','Guio','Komang',4,'Persons (4)',4536000.00,NULL,NULL,'Not include Return Transfer to Dive Centre For all guests, please come for registration the day before between 5pm and 6.30pm. Also, please check the following medical document and ask them to make sure they do not fail for any reason.','{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5194785,'629','SANDRA TEIXIDOR',31040,203404,'Ocean View Bungalow Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-08-18','2024-08-20','Guio','Komang',2,'Double + Twin',4560000.00,'Room size: 55 sqm. The ocean view bungalow room has 13 units available. The rooms at this Nusa Penida hotel provide guests with high-velocity internet and a flat-screen TV with satellite channels, and comforts such as ironing facilities and air conditioning. The units are designed in a comfortable manner. Offering amenities like hair dryers and bathrobes, the bathrooms also include a walk-in shower, a separate toilet and a sink.',NULL,'Please consult for transfer to harbour when check-in','{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5194791,'633','Emerita Adela Baez Hernandez',30680,200914,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-15','2024-08-16','Melysa','Tami',1,'Double',960000.00,'Enjoy our spacious elegant deluxe room with 40 m2 of room size. Enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, hot and cold shower, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK-IN. FM7 Hotel Airport Pickup Service: +62811-8815-053 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5194794,'633','Emerita Adela Baez Hernandez',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-08-16','2024-08-18','Melysa','Tami',3,'Persons (3)',12600000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan isCape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continueto add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": \"ETA 07.15 by Batik Air ID6202 from Jakarta on 16 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pangkalan Bun Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": \"ETD 08.50 by Batik Air ID6134 to Surabaya on 18 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5194798,'633','Emerita Adela Baez Hernandez',31015,216453,'4D3N - Surabaya Mount Bromo Tumpak Sewu Ijen Tour Drop Bali','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-08-18','2024-08-21','Melysa','Tami',3,'Persons (3)',12600000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": \"ETA 10.00 by Batik Air ID6134 from Pangkalan Bun on 18 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Surabaya International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": \"Gerokgak, Batu Ampar, Pejarakan, Kec. Gerokgak, Kabupaten Buleleng, Bali 81155\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Mimpi Resort Menjangan\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5194802,'629','SANDRA TEIXIDOR',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-08-19','2024-08-19','Guio','Komang',4,'Persons (4)',1200000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,'Please ready on hotel lobby for pickup at 09.00','{\"date\": \"2024-08-19\", \"text\": \"The Angkal Resort, Banjar Angkal, Suana, Kec. Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771 Telepon: (0366) 5582389\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Penida\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-19\", \"text\": \"The Angkal Resort, Banjar Angkal, Suana, Kec. Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771 Telepon: (0366) 5582389\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Penida\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5194815,'633','Emerita Adela Baez Hernandez',30673,200562,'Deluxe Double Room Hill View','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-18','2024-08-19','Melysa','Tami',1,'Double',1500000.00,'Overlooking the hills and plantations, deluxe hill view offering breathtaking views of nature. Just relax on the terrace, laze away the hours with a good book and hot coffee.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5194820,'629','SANDRA TEIXIDOR',30508,212455,'Sanur to Sanur','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-20','2024-08-20','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (4-6)',720000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-20\", \"text\": \"ETD : 13.00 by Maruti Fastboat from Nusa Penida on 20 August 2024\", \"time\": \"13:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sanur harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-20\", \"text\": \"Artotel Sanur, Jl. Kusuma Sari No.1, Sanur, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali 80227 Telepon: (0361) 4721000\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sanur\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5194823,'633','Emerita Adela Baez Hernandez',30803,202852,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-20','2024-08-21','Melysa','Tami',1,'Double',840000.00,'At 25 sqm of room size with 46 rooms available. This smart room category is more contemporary in appearance and comes with its own terrace or balcony. Minimalist furnishings are balanced by a neutral decor to soothe the senses and ensure restful slumber. Including a double bed (king or queen) or 2 single beds (twin) with maximum capacity of 2 adults + 1 child or 3 adults. The en-suite bathroom features a modern shower cubicle enclosed in glass together with a marble vanity.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5194827,'633','Emerita Adela Baez Hernandez',30576,202365,'Patio Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-08-21','2024-08-23','Melysa','Tami',1,'Double',2464000.00,'This cozy and comfortable room blends the island’s unique style with the tropical nature and elegant wood furnishings. Each room comes with a spacious porch for you to lounge and relax.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5194831,'633','Emerita Adela Baez Hernandez',30508,213348,'Menjangan to Munduk','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-23','2024-08-23','Melysa','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',990000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-23\", \"text\": \"Gerokgak, Batu Ampar, Pejarakan, Kec. Gerokgak, Kabupaten Buleleng, Bali 81155\", \"time\": \"12:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Mimpi Resort Menjangan\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-23\", \"text\": \"Gesing, Banjar, Buleleng Regency, Bali 81161\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Lesong Hotel and Restaurant\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5194832,'629','SANDRA TEIXIDOR',31024,203296,'Studio 30 Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-20','2024-08-21','Guio','Komang',2,'Double',3000000.00,'Our 81 units Studio 30 Room with 30 sqm of room area, adopts kites as it\'s main concept. This room is a canvas that showcases thought-provoking artworks by some of the most relevant Bali-based contemporary artists. This air-conditioned studio features a 49\" inch LED TV, high speed internet Wi-Fi, 24 hours in-room service, iPod dock, dolce gusto coffee maker, a minibar, en-suite bathroom comes with a shower, a hairdryer, free toiletries, and many more.',NULL,'Twin room : subject to availability','{\"date\": \"2024-08-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5194875,'629','SANDRA TEIXIDOR',30508,207388,'Sanur to Seminyak','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-21','2024-08-21','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (4-6)',720000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": \"Artotel Sanur, Jl. Kusuma Sari No.1, Sanur, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali 80227 Telepon: (0361) 4721000\", \"time\": \"12:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sanur\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": \"Bali Niksoma Resort, Jl. Padma Utara Jl. Raya Legian, Legian, Kec. Kuta, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361 Telepon: (0361) 751946\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Seminyak\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5194884,'629','SANDRA TEIXIDOR',30596,201103,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-08-21','2024-08-23','Guio','Komang',2,'Double + Twin',12000000.00,'Experience timeless elegance in our Deluxe Room. Perfect for couples or solo travelers seeking a spacious single/double bed. Our room offers premium linens, plush pillows, and a peaceful ambiance. Enjoy high-speed internet, a flat-screen TV, coffee and tea-making facilities, and an in-room safe deposit box, ensuring a convenient and enjoyable stay. Unwind on the balcony overlooking the pool, to recharge after a day of activities.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5194984,'633','Emerita Adela Baez Hernandez',32145,212672,'Family Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-08-23','2024-08-25','Melysa','Tami',1,'Double + Double',3600000.00,'At Lesong Hotel, we offer the perfect blend of comfort and serenity with our Family Suite with garden view and rice field view rooms. Each room provides a peaceful oasis for our guests, complete with breathtaking views of the surrounding tropical gardens and lush green rice fields. Enjoy the cool mountain breeze as you unwind and relax in the comfort of your twin bed. Our rooms are designed to ensure that you feel right at home. We also have safety deposit box, toilet, sofa, bathtub or shower, hardwood or parquet floors, towels, linens, desk sitting area, mosquito net, hairdryer, fan, electric kettle, wardrobe or closet clothes rack, toilet paper, board games/puzzles, hand sanitizer, air purifiers, yoga met, hot water.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5194986,'633','Emerita Adela Baez Hernandez',30508,202881,'Banyumala Twin Waterfall - Wanagiri Hidden Hill','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-24','2024-08-24','Melysa','Tami',3,'Persons (3)',1890000.00,'We begin the tour from a beautiful rice terrace of Jatiluwih. Unfolding from the foot of mountain until the coastal side, it is one of places in Bali with the beautiful view, as according to its name “Jati” and “Luwih”, where Jati mean really and Luwih meaning especial, good, and beautiful or the equivalent. The local paddies are planted in this place look typically of the high relative size plant if it is compared with other pre-eminent paddy planted by most farmers in Bali. Stroll around the area for a while and take a nice pictures, before we continue to Banyumala Twin Waterfall. The waterfall is special in that there are two flows of water to be seen, hence the name ‘twin’. Water cascades down steep rocks with gorgeous greenery surrounding them. Here you can take a refreshing dip in the plunge pool at the bottom - dunk your head and listen to the sounds of the water crashing down. After the refreshment, we conclude our day by heading to Wanagiri Hidden Hill. This hill has a charm of beauty that can make anyone who saw her feel hypnotized and fell in love Beautiful natural paintings depicting the beautiful mountains, the beautiful green trees, and the expanse of the lake can be seen clearly from this place. In addition to the panoramic view, cool and fresh air is also an added value that makes this tourist area worth visiting. Take photos and enjoy the scenery and then we head back to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-24\", \"text\": \"Gesing, Banjar, Buleleng Regency, Bali 81161\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Lesong Hotel and Restaurant\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5194988,'633','Emerita Adela Baez Hernandez',30508,202889,'Tamblingan Jungle Trek - Ulun Danu Temple','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-25','2024-08-25','Melysa','Tami',3,'Persons (3)',2736000.00,'Today we will explore the nature of Buyan and Tamblingan lake in our lovely village, it will help you to escape from the crowds and fell the Nature atmosphere of the real jungle of Bali. We will pick you at your hotel at 07:30 AM and we drive to Tamblingan lake. Arrive in the trekking start point, we will have an explanation about the trekking. We will start the trek by entering a lush protected rain-forest area with giant old tress, animal such as macaque, black giant squirrel, birds and old legend temple inside in the Jungle. You will then walk along the shore of this lake situated in the caldera of an extinct Jungle Mountain. Our trekking guide will explain more detail about plants and living creatures in the jungle. This tour also combine with a session of thirty five minutes exploring the Tamblingan lake by dugout canoe to finishing point. Finish with trekking we will drop you to your hotel but we will make a stop at Ulun Danu Temple. Ulun Danu Temple Bratan, the famous temple stands on a small promontory located in the shore of Lake Bratan and has beautiful scenery with this lake and the mountains as backdrop sight.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"07:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Lesong Hotel and Restaurant\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-25\", \"text\": \"Jl. Danau Tamblingan No.192, Sanur, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali 80229\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Abian Harmony Hotel Restaurant & Spa\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5194990,'633','Emerita Adela Baez Hernandez',31023,203283,'Family Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-25','2024-08-26','Melysa','Tami',1,'Double + Twin',1320000.00,'Featuring warm décor, the comfortable rooms at Abian Harmony Hotel are all air-conditioned. The rooms are also fitted with a flat-screen cable TV, a refrigerator with a minibar and wardrobe. En suite bathroom comes with a shower and slippers. Some room offers a bathtub. Guests enjoy garden and pool views from the room. Satellite/cable channels, DVD/CD player, Air conditioning',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5194991,'633','Emerita Adela Baez Hernandez',30508,207269,'Sanur to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-26','2024-08-26','Melysa','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',300000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-26\", \"text\": \"Jl. Danau Tamblingan No.192, Sanur, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali 80229\", \"time\": \"05:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Abian Harmony Hotel Restaurant & Spa\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-26\", \"text\": \"ETD 08.00 by Batik Air ID6333 to Labuan Bajo on 26 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5195137,'633','Emerita Adela Baez Hernandez',32766,218811,'2D1N Private Trip Komodo - La Dyana','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-08-26','2024-08-27','Melysa','Tami',1,'(1-6 Persons) /boat',35598000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-26\", \"text\": \"ETA 09.10 by Batik Air ID6333 from Denpasar on 26 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Labuan Bajo Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-27\", \"text\": \"Jl. Pantai Pede, Labuan Bajo, Kec. Komodo, Kabupaten Manggarai Barat\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Puri Sari Beach Hotel\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5195146,'633','Emerita Adela Baez Hernandez',30701,207546,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-27','2024-08-28','Melysa','Tami',1,'Double',1020000.00,'Our Superior Room at 38 sqm of room area, equipped with AC, Western toilet and shower with hot & cold water, desk, seating area, and many more. Breakfast is included in the room rate. Featuring a balcony or terrace, guests can enjoy spectacular views of the garden, pool or the sea.',NULL,'Flight information ETD 09.50 by Batik Air ID6332 to Denpasar on 28 Aug','{\"date\": \"2024-08-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5195155,'633','Emerita Adela Baez Hernandez',30692,204752,'Family Room','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-08-28','2024-08-31','Melysa','Tami',1,'Single + Double',3420000.00,'This 42sqm room has a refrigerator, coffee/tea maker, air conditioning, desk, in-room safety, television, complimentary bottled water. Bathroom amenities such as; shower, free toiletries, private bathroom and hot water. The bedroom is a queen bed and twin bed type. Guest can view a garden from the terrace.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5195220,'634','David Alegrete Bernal',30783,201646,'Borobudur Temple - Yogyakarta City Tour - Prambanan Temple','Confirmed','C2I-JAVA15',1,'2024-08-03','2024-08-03','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Persons (2)',3960000.00,'This excursion will make you lose yourselves in the authentic magic of Yogyakarta. One of the most beautiful and complete routes of the cultural capital of Indonesia. At the scheduled time, your guide will pick you up to begin the tour of Borobudur, the great Stupa, the largest Buddhist monument in the world and one of the seven wonders. Depending on where you stay in the city, the drive can be 1-1,5 hours to the temple. Arrival at the temple, you will walk around the garden area, observe the hundreds and centenary statues of Buddha and witness how dozens of Buddhists come to preach from all over the world. Historically it was established during the relatively brief Sailendra dynasty of Central Java between 778 and 856 BC and is in constant restoration due to the breaks that the tremors of the neighbouring Merapi volcano has been producing during its history. After visiting one of the most important Buddhist temples in Southeast Asia, you will continue the journey to the heart of the city. You will visit the Keraton, or also known as the Sultan’s Palace. The palace is a complex building two centuries old. Next, you will hear the song of the “freedom” of the birds in the bird market, you will visit the “Water Castle” that occupies the highest part at the northern end of the vast complex of Taman Sari. Then, stroll around Malioboro Street, one of the main streets of Yogyakarta, with its merchants, horse carriages, taxi-bikes and markets. An incredible experience that will make the hours fly by. Finishing the tour in the centre of the city of Yogyakarta, you will head northeast towards Prambanan, the temple of Hinduists and classified as a World Heritage Site by UNESCO since 1991. This temple was completed in 856 AD to commemorate the victory of the descendant of Sanjaya dynasty, Rikai Pikatan, against the last Shailendra sovereign of Central Java. Take your time to enjoy each carving on the rocks and feel the spirituality that each of the stones perched in this set of more than 200 Hindu temples that are dedicated to Shiva, one of the Trimurti which is an expression of God as the Creator, the Preserver and the Destroyer. After this unforgettable day, and take you to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-03\", \"text\": \"Please be ready in hotel lobby at the mentioned time.\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": \"Melia Purosani Yogyakarta\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Melia Purosani Yogyakarta\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5195625,'635','Mrs. Patricia Arevalo',31015,203230,'2D1N - Surabaya Mount Bromo Tour','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-07-26','2024-07-27','Jacob','Praba',2,'Persons (2)',4800000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-26\", \"text\": \"ETA 15:30 by KA Sancaka from Yogyakarta\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Surabaya Gubeng Train Station\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-27\", \"text\": \"Andita Syariah Hotel Surabaya Jl. Cokroaminoto No.2, DR. Soetomo, Kec. Tegalsari, Surabaya, Jawa Timur\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Surabaya\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5195627,'635','Mrs. Patricia Arevalo',31196,204658,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-07-26','2024-07-27','Jacob','Praba',1,'Double',1428000.00,'Room type deluxe, with spacious room 3,41 m x 6,09 m and have type bed king size or twin bed. This type of room is available on the 2nd, 3rd and 4th floors and has of the hills view.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-07-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5195895,'636','WINSTON PAUL JEUNE',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-06','2024-08-06','Nicholas','Wiwik',1,'Persons (1-3)',420000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-06\", \"text\": \"ETA: 17.25 by Lion Air JT920 from Surabaya on 06 August 2024.\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Airport Ngurah Rai (Domestic)\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Best Western Premier Agung Resort Ubud\", \"location\": \"Jl. Sri Wedari No.99, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar. Phone: (0361) 2091700\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5195897,'636','WINSTON PAUL JEUNE',32683,216360,'Deluxe Room with Green View (Double + Extra Bed)','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-08-06','2024-08-09','Nicholas','Wiwik',1,'Double',4294800.00,'The spacious double room offers air conditioning, a mini-bar, a terrace with garden views as well as a private bathroom featuring a walk-in shower. The unit offers 1 bed double or twin bed.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5195902,'636','WINSTON PAUL JEUNE',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route (Taman Ayun-Jatiluwih-Ulundanu Beratan-Tanah Lot)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-07','2024-08-07','Nicholas','Wiwik',3,'Persons (3)',2160000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"Best Western Premier Agung Resort Ubud\", \"location\": \"Jl. Sri Wedari No.99, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar. Phone: (0361) 2091700\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Best Western Premier Agung Resort Ubud\", \"location\": \"Jl. Sri Wedari No.99, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar. Phone: (0361) 2091700\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5195904,'636','WINSTON PAUL JEUNE',30508,202864,'Ubud and Surrounding Tour (Monkey Forest - Tirta Empul - Goa Gajah)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-08','2024-08-08','Nicholas','Wiwik',3,'Persons (3)',2070000.00,'We will be picking you up from your hotel to enjoy the wealth of art in Ubud. First we will visit Monkey Forest; the Ubud Monkey Forest is a nature reserve and temple complex in Ubud, Bali. It houses approximately 340 Crab-eating Macaque (Macacafas cicularis) monkeys. The Monkey Forest contains the Pura Dalem Agung Padangtegal temple as well as a \"Holy Spring\" bathing temple and another temple used for cremation ceremonies. Next we go to Ubud Traditional Art Market where the existence is not far different from other markets available in the tourism area. This market as a society economics center of Ubud and it is apposite to the existence of Ubud Empire that is called Puri Saren. Our last destination is Gua Gajah (Elephant Cave). This cave is built at crevasse edge from the federation of 2 rills that is called Pangkung River, where the irrigation is mixed with Petanu River flow. The word of Gua Gajah is anticipated coming from the word of Lwa Gajah, the name of Buddhist Temple or hermitage for Buddhist monk. There is a relief which is almost looking like the form of mountain on the entrance of this cave. It was carved many designed on the relief like grove with the stick, close leaf, animal for example forest pig, tortoise and specters. The cave mouth is decorated by the bas-relief with the eye turn around to the right or west side. At the end of tour we will transferred back you to the hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": \"Best Western Premier Agung Resort Ubud\", \"location\": \"Jl. Sri Wedari No.99, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar. Phone: (0361) 2091700\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Best Western Premier Agung Resort Ubud\", \"location\": \"Jl. Sri Wedari No.99, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar. Phone: (0361) 2091700\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5195905,'636','WINSTON PAUL JEUNE',30508,202892,'TANAH LOT TEMPLE','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-09','2024-08-09','Nicholas','Wiwik',3,'Persons (3)',2160000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"13:00\", \"locality\": \"Best Western Premier Agung Resort Ubud\", \"location\": \"Jl. Sri Wedari No.99, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar. Phone: (0361) 2091700\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Prama Sanur Beach Bali\", \"location\": \"Jalan Cemara Sanur, Sanur Kauh, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali. Phone: (0361) 288011\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5195906,'636','WINSTON PAUL JEUNE',30590,205583,'Deluxe Garden View Room (Double + Extra Bed)','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-08-09','2024-08-11','Nicholas','Wiwik',1,'Double',5760000.00,'Deluxe Garden View Room with 32 sqm of room area, with a choice of a double or twin bed, these comfortable and luxurious air-conditioned rooms , provide attractive views over the lush tropical gardens. Each of the rooms provides facilities including a flat-screen TV with local and international channels, telephone, complimentary 2 bottle mineral water, tea and coffee-maker, safety box, free Wi-Fi, minibar, balcony and bathroom with shower, and many more.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5195907,'636','WINSTON PAUL JEUNE',30508,207269,'Sanur to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-11','2024-08-11','Nicholas','Wiwik',1,'Persons (1-3)',300000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"12:00\", \"locality\": \"Prama Sanur Beach Bali\", \"location\": \"Jalan Cemara Sanur, Sanur Kauh, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali. Phone: (0361) 288011\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": \"ETD: 15.50 by Citilink QG689 to Jakarta on 11 August 2024.\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Airport Ngurah Rai (Domestic)\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5196026,'637','CARLOS PEREZ MARTINEZ',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-16','2024-08-16','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (1-3)',784000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": \"ETA : 11.35 by ETIHAD EY476 from Abu Dhabi on 16 August 2024\", \"time\": \"11:35\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"International Ngurah Rai Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": \"Kamandalu Ubud, Jl. Raya Andong, Banjar Nagi, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 975825\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5196037,'637','CARLOS PEREZ MARTINEZ',30983,203019,'Garden Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,5,'2024-08-16','2024-08-21','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',37800000.00,'Nestled in a beautiful open-air lawn bordered by lush tropical gardens, each of the distinctive designed Garden Pool Villa comprises a spacious bedroom, which centers on a handsome four-post king-size bed. Following a good night’s rest, wake to the gentle sounds of tropical birds and wildlife while relaxing in the comfort of your private freeform pool or the traditionally crafted wood-and-thatch Bale Bengong (Balinese daybed) that complements each villa. Bathe in comfort in the villa’s luxurious marble-tiled bathroom with its indoor sunken bath and outdoor shower. Round your day off with a romantic in-villa dinner under the stars.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5196083,'637','CARLOS PEREZ MARTINEZ',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Tegalalang – Tirta Empul – Kintamani – Besakih – Tukad Cepung )','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-18','2024-08-18','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',1747.20,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": \"Kamandalu Ubud, Jl. Raya Andong, Banjar Nagi, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 975825\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": \"Kamandalu Ubud, Jl. Raya Andong, Banjar Nagi, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 975825\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5196097,'637','CARLOS PEREZ MARTINEZ',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route (Templo Taman Ayun – Jatiluwih - Templo Ulun Danu Bratan - Tanah Lot)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-19','2024-08-19','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',1747200.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-19\", \"text\": \"Kamandalu Ubud, Jl. Raya Andong, Banjar Nagi, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 975825\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-19\", \"text\": \"Kamandalu Ubud, Jl. Raya Andong, Banjar Nagi, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 975825\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5196107,'637','CARLOS PEREZ MARTINEZ',30508,202893,'Lempuyang Temple Tour (Tenganan - Virgin Beach - Templo Lempuyang)','Confirmed','C2I-BALI11',1,'2024-08-20','2024-08-20','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',1792000.00,'At the agreed time, our guide will pick you up to start the tour in the eastern part of Bali. The first place you will visit is Goa Lawah Temple. Goa Lawah Temple consists of two names, \"Goa\" which means cave and \"Lawah\" which means bat. Several thousand bats are flying in the cave as the name suggests. With the lights fading as you go deeper inside the cave, it gives off a very strange atmosphere. From Goa Lawah, we continue our way to Lempuyang Temple. Upon arrival, the temple will greet you with its gratifying panorama that extends into infinity. On a clear, sunny day, you\'ll be able to gaze out over the mountains, Amlapura city, and Mount Agung, an incredibly magnificent sight that\'s beautiful beyond words. This portrait of heaven is beautifully framed by the Gapura Candi Bentar (the gate of the temple). Our journey continues to visit Tirta Gangga. The site is a paradise surrounded by water, with all the pools decorated with unusual statues. With its seclusion and a view of the surrounding rice paddies, Tirta Gangga is a wonderful place. At the end of the trip we go to Tenganan Village, the most famous Bali Agas (the “original” Bali people) in the city. With its characteristics, the city village is arranged in parallel along the wide main road paved with rows of cobblestones. In Tenganan, women still weave the famous Kamben Geringsing, or \"burnt cloth,\" which has the power to immunize the wearer against evil. We take a close look at what they do in their daily lives in a traditional lifestyle. From Tenganan, we will transfer you to the hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-20\", \"text\": \"Kamandalu Ubud, Jl. Raya Andong, Banjar Nagi, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 975825\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-20\", \"text\": \"Kamandalu Ubud, Jl. Raya Andong, Banjar Nagi, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 975825\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5196109,'637','CARLOS PEREZ MARTINEZ',30508,207262,'Ubud to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-21','2024-08-21','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (1-3)',784000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'Please ready on hotel lobby for transfer at 11.30','{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": \"Kamandalu Ubud, Jl. Raya Andong, Banjar Nagi, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 975825\", \"time\": \"11:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": \"ETD : 15.35 by Batik Air ID6335 to Labuan Bajo on 21 August 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5196135,'637','CARLOS PEREZ MARTINEZ',30696,206418,'Manggarai One Bedroom Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-08-21','2024-08-24','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',23184000.00,'Our Manggarai One Bedroom Pool Villa has 16 units of 112 sqm. A relaxing retreat for solitude aficionados. Quite simply the most indulgent space in Sudamala Resort, Komodo, Labuan Bajo. Secluded from the rest of the property, the villas naturally provide peace, comfort and the ultimate privacy for our guests. Take a plunge into your private pool when the sun is at its most demanding or late at night to cool down before bed. Grab the latest bestseller and settle at the pavilion. Order room service and indulge in breakfast in bed. It’s all here waiting for you. This suite is equipped with luxurious king-sized bed, efficient and sustainable air-conditioning, separate living area, 43\" smart TV, complimentary wireless internet, safe deposit box, water heater, private open-air bathroom with luxurious rain shower and bathtub, luxurious bathroom amenities, hairdryer, bathrobe, daily turndown service, and many more.',NULL,'Flight Schedule : ETA : 16.50 by Batik Air ID6335 from Denpasar on 21 Aug 2024 ETD : 09.50 by Batik Air ID6332 to Denpasar on 24 Aug 2024','{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5196150,'637','CARLOS PEREZ MARTINEZ',31083,218824,'Komodo Island Full Day Tour (Fast Boat - Drop Off Labuan Bajo)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-22','2024-08-22','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2-3)',12622400.00,'TOUR ITINERARY Highlights: Padar Island, Komodo Island, Long beach, Pink Beach, Manta Point & Kanawa. PICK UP / ARRIVE LABUAN BAJO - PADAR - KOMODO - PINK BEACH - MANTA POINT - LABUAHAN BAJO Pick up & meeting service with our tour guide and transfer to the pier of Labuan Bajo for sailing directly to Loh Liang – the Ranger station in Komodo Island. By passing through many small islands, it will be 3 hours with slow wooden boat and 1.50 hours by speed boat to reach the pier of Komodo island. After registering start to take basic trekking to see the GIANT RIZARD / KOMODO DRAGON and other wild animals as: Timor deer, wild pig, wild chicken and many variously of tropical bird. Please keep your look at any directions as sometimes you will also find young Komodo dragon hanging over the trees. A local ranger will be led you during the trek. Return to the boat on to Pink beach for snorkeling, swimming and relaxing. It is really spectacular and unspoiled coral reef and many color fish. Sail toward MANTA POINT to exploring Huge Mantas by snorkeling even watching from your boat trip (can’t be guaranteed if weather is not good, like wave and current are strongly). Lunch will be provided on board. Late in the afternoon back to Labuan Bajo harbor and transfer to your prefer Hotel for overnight and Dinner. Meals : Lunch Attention: The itinerary is subject to change due to the weather, tide level and operating conditions without prior notice.',NULL,'Pickup & Dropoff point in Labuan Bajo : SUDAMALA RESORT KOMODO, Jl. Pantai Pede No.Km. 3, Labuan Bajo, Kabupaten Manggarai Barat, Nusa Tenggara Tim. 86554 Telepon: (0385) 2385555 Pickup time between 07.30 - 08.00','{\"date\": \"2024-08-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5196168,'638','Ana Nieto',30620,200813,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-09-24','2024-09-28','Guio','Febrina',1,'Double',3808000.00,'24 units (10 twin bed and 14 double bed) of 35 sqm each deluxe rooms with garden view are modern‐minimalism designed. Advance, facilities such as LCD TV, coffee/tea maker, balcony/terrace, safety deposit box, minibar, and complete bathroom facilities.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5196176,'638','Ana Nieto',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-24','2024-09-24','Guio','Febrina',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-24\", \"text\": \"ETA 16:55 by IB7968 from Doha on 24 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Denpasar Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-24\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali 80571. Phone: +62361 981386\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pertiwi Bisma Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5196183,'638','Ana Nieto',30508,202881,'Tegallalang- Tirta Empul - Luwak Coffee - Kintamani - Besakit Temple','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-25','2024-09-25','Guio','Febrina',2,'Persons (2)',1579200.00,'We begin the tour from a beautiful rice terrace of Jatiluwih. Unfolding from the foot of mountain until the coastal side, it is one of places in Bali with the beautiful view, as according to its name “Jati” and “Luwih”, where Jati mean really and Luwih meaning especial, good, and beautiful or the equivalent. The local paddies are planted in this place look typically of the high relative size plant if it is compared with other pre-eminent paddy planted by most farmers in Bali. Stroll around the area for a while and take a nice pictures, before we continue to Banyumala Twin Waterfall. The waterfall is special in that there are two flows of water to be seen, hence the name ‘twin’. Water cascades down steep rocks with gorgeous greenery surrounding them. Here you can take a refreshing dip in the plunge pool at the bottom - dunk your head and listen to the sounds of the water crashing down. After the refreshment, we conclude our day by heading to Wanagiri Hidden Hill. This hill has a charm of beauty that can make anyone who saw her feel hypnotized and fell in love Beautiful natural paintings depicting the beautiful mountains, the beautiful green trees, and the expanse of the lake can be seen clearly from this place. In addition to the panoramic view, cool and fresh air is also an added value that makes this tourist area worth visiting. Take photos and enjoy the scenery and then we head back to your hotel.',NULL,'FD Tour Tegallalang - Tirta Empul - Luwak Coffee - Kintamani - Besakih Temple, with Spanish speaking guide','{\"date\": \"2024-09-25\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali 80571. Phone: +62361 981386\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pertiwi Bisma Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-25\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali 80571. Phone: +62361 981386\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pertiwi Bisma Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5196186,'638','Ana Nieto',30508,202889,'Ulun Danu Bratan Temple - Leke Leke Waterfall - Tanah Lot','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-26','2024-09-26','Guio','Febrina',2,'Persons (2)',2105600.00,'Today we will explore the nature of Buyan and Tamblingan lake in our lovely village, it will help you to escape from the crowds and fell the Nature atmosphere of the real jungle of Bali. We will pick you at your hotel at 07:30 AM and we drive to Tamblingan lake. Arrive in the trekking start point, we will have an explanation about the trekking. We will start the trek by entering a lush protected rain-forest area with giant old tress, animal such as macaque, black giant squirrel, birds and old legend temple inside in the Jungle. You will then walk along the shore of this lake situated in the caldera of an extinct Jungle Mountain. Our trekking guide will explain more detail about plants and living creatures in the jungle. This tour also combine with a session of thirty five minutes exploring the Tamblingan lake by dugout canoe to finishing point. Finish with trekking we will drop you to your hotel but we will make a stop at Ulun Danu Temple. Ulun Danu Temple Bratan, the famous temple stands on a small promontory located in the shore of Lake Bratan and has beautiful scenery with this lake and the mountains as backdrop sight.',NULL,'FD Tour Ulun Danu Bratan Temple - Leke Leke Waterfall - Tanah Lot, with Spanish speaking guide','{\"date\": \"2024-09-26\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali 80571. Phone: +62361 981386\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pertiwi Bisma Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-26\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali 80571. Phone: +62361 981386\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pertiwi Bisma Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5196196,'638','Ana Nieto',30508,207379,'Transfer Ubud - Padang Bai Harbor','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-28','2024-09-28','Guio','Febrina',1,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-28\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali 80571. Phone: +62361 981386\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pertiwi Bisma Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-28\", \"text\": \"ETD 08:30 to Gili Air by Gili Gili Fast Boat on 28 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbor / https://goo.gl/maps/qRvTJixStazBCLAu8 (close to Serangan 1 Homestay Padangbai)\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5196202,'637','CARLOS PEREZ MARTINEZ',30508,207385,'Padang Bai to Nusa Dua','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-27','2024-08-27','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (1-3)',1120000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-27\", \"text\": \"ETA : 12.30 by Gili Gili Fastboat from Gili Air on 27 August 2024\", \"time\": \"12:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-27\", \"text\": \"Melia Bali Hotel Nusa Dua, Jl. Kw. Nusa Dua Resort Itdc Lot 1, Jl. Nusa Dua, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Bali, 80363 Telepon: (0361) 771510\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nusa Dua\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5196206,'638','Ana Nieto',32180,216348,'Deluxe Bungalow','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-09-28','2024-10-01','Guio','Febrina',1,'Double',3696000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5196210,'637','CARLOS PEREZ MARTINEZ',30579,212708,'Premium Room Garden View','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-27','2024-08-28','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',3690000.00,'Tropical accommodation to enhance the enjoyment of a Balinese paradise experience. With a double four-poster bed, a desk in polished wood and a full bathroom with a bathtub or shower. Enjoy the garden views from your furnished terrace.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5196211,'638','Ana Nieto',30930,202592,'One Bedroom Bungalow','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-10-01','2024-10-03','Guio','Febrina',1,'Double',5376000.00,'Room size : 37 sqm. Our One-Bedroom Bungalow is a unique Romantic Eco-Boho Bungalow nestles in Green Escape Resort. You will stay in a sumptuous air-conditioned bungalow that has been handcrafted using recycled wood and tastefully decorated to offer you an authentic Balinese getaway. It\'s the very epitome of a tranquil escape. This Bungalow offers a deluxe king-size bed and a daybed to relax. It offers a comfy mattress, as we know the benefits of a good night’s sleep. The semi-outdoor bathroom with a rain shower will help you revive yourself. Enjoy the comfy sofa on your private terrace which opens onto the exotic garden & pool. The daybed can be used to extend the sleeping capacity of your private bungalow.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5196235,'637','CARLOS PEREZ MARTINEZ',32602,215975,'One Bedroom Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-08-24','2024-08-27','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',18312000.00,'Each room offers the same comfort: one bedroom villas with terrace, swimming pool, kitchenette and office space, comfortable sunbeds, lovely coconut garden. Particular care to the quality of the beddings, the home stylist Valérie Barkowski has added her touch of originality with a predominant colour selection of orange, grey, red, green, bordeaux or black. Choose your holiday colour!',NULL,'Schedule Fastboat : ETD : 10.45 by Gili Gili Fastboat from Gili Air to Padangbai on 27 Aug Pickup time to harbour : 09.45 Am','{\"date\": \"2024-08-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5196236,'556','Mary Osterday Griffin',31426,206241,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-23','2024-09-24','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Single',930000.00,'Our comfortable packages start with our deluxe rooms, measuring 22 square meters and decorated in a chic contemporary style. Choose from rooms with either a queen-sized bed or twin single beds. Room is equipped with a cable TV, air conditioning and a minibar. It comes with private bathroom facilities, a seating area and a work desk. A hairdryer and tea/coffee maker are available, and many more.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5196241,'639','Martina Vill Kreikenbaum',31797,216721,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-30','2024-08-31','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Double',950000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5196324,'354','CATIA CANCIALLI',31106,203994,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-08','2024-08-09','Rendy','Komang',1,'Double',756000.00,'Discover Makassar from a very comfortable room with a king-size bed (or two single beds), a practical desk with an executive chair, and a modern bathroom with an open shower. You will also really like the welcome minibar to start your stay as you deserve. Inside the room has flat-screen TV, high speed Wi-Fi, and refrigerator.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5197253,'634','David Alegrete Bernal',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-04','2024-08-04','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Persons (1-3)',360000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-04\", \"text\": \"ETA: 17.35 by Garuda Indonesia GA252 from Yogyakarta on 04 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Denpasar Airport\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-04\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Kedewatan, Kedewatan, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Kupu Kupu Barong Villas Ubud\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5197272,'634','David Alegrete Bernal',33136,218842,'Duplex Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-08-04','2024-08-08','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Double',20460000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5197276,'634','David Alegrete Bernal',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-05','2024-08-05','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Persons (2)',1872000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-05\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Kedewatan, Kedewatan, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": \"Kupu Kupu Barong Villas Ubud\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-05\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Kedewatan, Kedewatan, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Kupu Kupu Barong Villas Ubud\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5197286,'634','David Alegrete Bernal',30508,207379,'Ubud to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-08','2024-08-08','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Persons (1-3)',600000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Kedewatan, Kedewatan, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": \"Kupu Kupu Barong Villas Ubud\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": \"ETD 08:30AM by Gili Gili Fastboat\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Padang Bay Harbour\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31');
INSERT INTO `booked_products` VALUES (5197292,'634','David Alegrete Bernal',30650,208425,'Private Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-08-08','2024-08-10','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Double',7200000.00,'Each villa embraces calmness, comfort and privacy in a simple and elegant setting. Guests can relax while peacefully sipping drinks in an inviting plunge pool surrounded by a lush tropical garden and at an old-wooden deck. At 85 m2 room size, this villa\'s special feature is the private pool. The air-conditioned villa features 1 bedroom and 1 bathroom with a shower and a hairdryer. The villa provides a mini-bar, a tea and coffee maker, a seating area as well as a terrace with garden views. The unit offers 1 bed.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5197301,'634','David Alegrete Bernal',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-08-11','2024-08-11','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Persons (2)',1020000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": \"Banjar Penage, Sakti, Kec. Nusa Penida\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": \"BB Resort Villa and Spa Nusa Penida\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": \"Banjar Penage, Sakti, Kec. Nusa Penida\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"BB Resort Villa and Spa Nusa Penida\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5197302,'634','David Alegrete Bernal',30508,202884,'1D Snorkeling to Nusa Lembongan','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-12','2024-08-12','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Persons (2)',2340000.00,'At the agreed time, we will pick you up at your hotel in Bali and transfer to Sanur harbor where we will embark on speedboats to neighboring Nusa Lembongan, which together with Nusa Penida has one of the most complete reefs on the planet. After about 30 minutes at high speed we will arrive at this small paradise island in the Southeast of Bali where you will enjoy snorkeling on beaches with crystal clear waters and the marine life of the inhabitants of the area. The guide will take you to places incredibly covered with corals and where the amount of reef fish will leave you speechless. The guides in the area are very professional and fun, which will make the trip a safe and enjoyable trip. We will also visit the most representative places on the island such as the Devil Tears, the seaweed, Dream Beach and Yelow Bridge. If you want to take advantage of the day doing only snorkeling and leave the island for another occasion, we can go to another point different from the many on the island to continue enjoying the seabed. After spending the day in Nusa Lembongan, we will transfer you to the port to take the boat back to Bali and transfer to the hotel.',NULL,'Pickup point: Nusa Penida Dropoff point: Mahagiri Resort Lembongan','{\"date\": \"2024-08-12\", \"text\": \"Please be ready in hotel lobby at the mentioned time.\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": \"BB Resort and Villa Nusa Penida\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-12\", \"text\": \"Address: Banjar Kaja Desa Jungutbatu, Nusa Lembongan\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Mahagiri Resort Lembongan\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5197303,'634','David Alegrete Bernal',30837,201923,'Garden View Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-12','2024-08-13','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Double',1464000.00,'Our beach front, garden view rooms all have double bed configuration at 31 square meters of room size with 14 rooms available, subject to your request and availability. Every room has a 32 inch LED TV with international and local channels, free internet access with a speed of 15 mbps. You will also find tea and coffee available in the room, plus a secure safety deposit box, mini fridge and hair dryer. Every room has air-conditioning and we provide accessories such as soap, shampoo, conditioner, moisturiser, tooth brush, shower cap, vanity kit, comb and slippers.',NULL,'Transfer instruction on 13 August 2024 Fastboat from Nusa Lembongan to Sanur ETD 12:15PM by Glory Express please check in at least 30 minutes before departure','{\"date\": \"2024-08-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5197308,'634','David Alegrete Bernal',30508,212457,'Sanur to Nusa Dua','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-13','2024-08-13','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Persons (1-3)',300000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": \"ETA: 12.45 by Glory Express from Nusa Lembongan\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Sanur Harbor\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": \"Kawasan Wisata Nusa Dua Lot S-3, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Merusaka Nusa Dua\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5197311,'634','David Alegrete Bernal',30508,207268,'Nusa Dua to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-14','2024-08-14','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Persons (1-3)',300000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": \"Please be ready in hotel lobby at the mentioned time.\", \"time\": \"14:00\", \"locality\": \"Merusaka Nusa Dua\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": \"ETD: 19.15 by JetStar 3K 246 to Singapore on 14 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5197316,'640','Ms. Federica Cantu',30528,215500,'4D3N Southwest Sumba: Most Photogenic Villages & Beaches','Confirmed','4DSW-S',4,'2024-08-11','2024-08-14','Ayu','Ayu',2,'Persons (2 / Double)',20040000.00,'DAY 1 : ARRIVAL TMC - BONDO KAPUMBU VILLAGE - SALT FARMERS VISIT - LENDONGARA HILL SUNSET Meet and greet with our guide at the Tambolaka airport in south-west Sumba.After that, we go to a local restaurant for lunch. Then we will start our journey by visiting Bondo Kapumbu Village, a hidden traditional village in south-west Sumba. Continuing to Ketewel Beach, you can visit the salt farmers, where you can see how they make the salt in a traditional way. Then we head to Lendongara to watch the sunset over the hills and the Sumba landscape. Then we go to your hotel to check in and rest. Meals : Lunch Accomodation : A. Mario Hotel (Deluxe Jineng Room) DAY 2 : SUMBA CASHEW FARM & PRODUCTION - WAIKACURA RICE FIELD - WATUBELA BEACH After breakfast, we will go to Talasi to see the cashew farm and production. Here you will get a chance to try their original cashew milk. After that, we go to the Waikacura area, where you can go trekking to the rice fields. Get a chance to see the local farmers do their activities, and at the end of the trek you will see the stunning river in the middle of the rice field. Next, after trekking, we go to West Sumba and have lunch at a local restaurant. After lunch, we go to visit the beautiful hidden beach of Watubela. On the way, you will pass a small village and palm garden to get to the beach. Relax on the beach, and we\'ll go to your hotel after that. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch Accomodation : A. Rua Beach Hotel (Deluxe Room) DAY 3 : SUMBANESE COOKING & ACTIVITIES EXPERIENCE - LAPOPU WATERFALL Breakfast at the hotel, then we go to the traditional village in West Sumba, where you will be warmly welcomed by the locals. Talking with them and listening to the story of the village and the island. After engaging with them, they will invite you to join them in cooking Sumba\'s traditional foods. Once the foods are ready, have lunch together. Have coffee or tea after lunch, sit with them for a while, then say goodbye. Our trip is continuing to Lapopu Waterfall. After a drive through the endless hilly and green landscape of Sumba, you will arrive near the waterfall. To visit the waterfall, you will need to do a short hike of approximately 15 minutes and cross a bamboo bridge to get there. There is a nice spot to sit down where you can watch the water find its way down the hill. After the visits, go back to the hotel to rest. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch Accomodation : A. Rua Beach Hotel (Deluxe Room) DAY 4 : PRAIJING VILLAGE - OUT TMC AIRPORT After breakfast and checking out of the hotel, we will go to visit the village of Praijing, a traditional village uphill surrounded by lots of greenery. This is one of the few villages where we can actually have a beautiful overview of the entire village and get an idea of how the village is conducted. Take some time to walk around the village, the elders occupy most of the houses, and kids are always around to share their smiles. And then go to the airport to catch a flight to your next destination. Meals : Breakfast Accomodation : -',NULL,'Hotels: 11 - 12 August 2024: Lelewatu Resort (booked by client) 12 - 14 August 2024: Mario Hotel at Deluxe Jineng Beachfront Program: 11 Aug. Arrive Tambolaka Airport - Transfer to Lelewatu by driver (no meals) 12 Aug. Pick up at 10.00 AM - Visiting Lapopu Waterfall - Praijing Village - Waikelo Sawah - Waikacura Ricefield (Lunch) 13 Aug. Weekuri Lake - Mandorak Beach - Ratenggaro Village - Pero Beach Sunset (Breakfast and Lunch box) 14 Aug. Lendongara Hill - Sumba Cultural House - Departure Tambolaka (Breakfast and Lunch) Flight information: ETA 10.00 by Nam Air IN280 from Denpasar on 11 August 2024 ETD 16.30 by Nam Air IN281 to Denpasar on 14 August 2024 Food preference: Federica cannot eat spicy food.','{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5197416,'623','Anna Arago & Party (4)',30650,208425,'Private Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-08-30','2024-09-02','Jacob','Eddy',2,'Double',21600000.00,'Each villa embraces calmness, comfort and privacy in a simple and elegant setting. Guests can relax while peacefully sipping drinks in an inviting plunge pool surrounded by a lush tropical garden and at an old-wooden deck. At 85 m2 room size, this villa\'s special feature is the private pool. The air-conditioned villa features 1 bedroom and 1 bathroom with a shower and a hairdryer. The villa provides a mini-bar, a tea and coffee maker, a seating area as well as a terrace with garden views. The unit offers 1 bed.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5197918,'645','COMPANY CASTELLO / ANNA',30571,202567,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-15','2024-08-16','Guio','Komang',2,'Double + Twin',2856000.00,'Located at the Second Floor, 35 sqm comfort living with a touch of Balinese style featuring completed fitting, Cable TV, a fancy bathroom comprises rain shower and good quality amenities. Also dedicated Wi-Fi Access to complete your day.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5197923,'645','COMPANY CASTELLO / ANNA',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (BEDUGUL – TWIN LAKE - GITGIT – BUDHIS TEMPLE-LOVINA/)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-16','2024-08-16','Guio','Komang',5,'Persons (5)',5320000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": \"The Vira Boutique Hotel, Jl. Kartika Plaza No.127, Kuta, Kec. Kuta, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361 Telepon: (0361) 765700\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kuta\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": \"Lovina Beach Club & Resort, Jl. Seririt- Singaraja, Tukadmungga, Kec. Buleleng, Kabupaten Buleleng, Bali 81119 Telepon: 0811-3812-658\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Lovina\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5198308,'646','Marco Weber',31083,207351,'5D4N Flores Tour','Confirmed',NULL,5,'2024-08-23','2024-08-27','Ayu','Eddy',2,'Persons (1-3)',0.00,'DAY 1 : MAUMERE - MONI You will arrive in Maumere, the cultural capital of the Island of Flores. In the first part of the trip, we will cross the island of Flores, from East to West. We will journey along the famous and unique road that crosses the island, known among the locals as the Transflores. At the Wai Oti airport, our native Flores guide will be waiting for you. With him and a driver, we will drive to Moni by private car. It will be about four hours, but we can make some stops on the way in the towns of Ledadero, Sikka and other interesting places. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Kelimutu Ecolodge or similar DAY 2 : MONI - VOLCANO KELIMUTU - BAJAWA Today we will get up early to be able to see sunrise on top of the Kelimutu. The Kelimutu is a large volcano, which is easily accessible by car, until the last 20 minutes, which we will walk by foot. When we have reached the top, we will see 3 craters which have become three lakes with each its own different colour. One black, one yellow and one a little purple, but the great thing is that they change of colour in the moments of dawn! Bring a coat, because sometimes it can be somewhat cold during the sunrise. After admiring this miracle of nature, we move forward to Bajawa. In the vicinity of our hotel in Moni, we can stop by some villages where we can see how most women produce sarongs manufactured by using looms in a traditional way. In addition, we will have the possibility to look around in the surroundings of the town. On the way to Bajawa we will stop in the political capital of Flores, located in the immense bay open to the Indian Ocean, called the city of Ende. Here we will have lunch and visit the Market and some other highlights. On the outskirts of Ende, we will make a stop to see a cove, called the beach of the blue stones (although the stones are actually green). We will witness dozens of workers collecting stones and classifying them to be exported, due to the beauty they represent in some of the most famous gardens of Hong Kong and Singapore. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Virgo Hotel or similar DAY 3 : BAJAWA - BENA - RUTENG Today in the morning we can visit the volcano Wawo Muda. We will reach the volcano by a walk of one hour, in an easy way of trekking. We will see a great volcano with lakes, that form different colours, similarly to those of their big brother Kelimutu. In addition, we will enjoy views of impressive volcanoes such as the Inerie and Ebulobo. After witnessing the sun rise, we return to the hotel to have our well-deserved breakfast, and then, we go to Bena. This is one of the traditional, best-known villages of Flores, which belongs to the Ngadas tribes. This is a tribe that, despite being Christianized, still maintain their animist beliefs. After lunch in Bajawa, we take off on a new and long journey by car, which takes about another 4-5 hours until we reach Ruteng. We will stop in a traditional village called Aimere, where we will learn how they distil the liquor of Palma, called Arak. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Spring Hill Hotel or similar DAY 4 : RUTENG - LABUAN BAJO Today, we will pay visits to gigantic rice fields and witness the sunset in the harbour of the sea gypsies. Your day will end in Labuhan Bajo (Breakfast, Lunch and Dinner). After breakfast, we head uphill to Golo Curu, an esplanade at the top of the city, where we will reach the city of Ruteng with a bird’s-eye view. We will see the fortified city naturally thanks to the adjacent volcanoes. On the way to Labuhan Bajo, we will stop at Golo Cara to see the giant rice pits, the only ones in the world in the shape of a spider’s web. It is definitely a marvel to behold. Upon arrival in Labuan Bajo, we will enjoy the sunset in the harbour, with views of the dozens of islands that dot the Komodo Sea. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Puri Sari Hotel or similar DAY 5 : LABUAN BAJO - AIRPORT Today your tour ends in this Komodian land. You will have your breakfast first. At the indicated time we transfer you to the airport, but before we will go through the famous Batu Cermin (depends on your flight itinerary). Afterwards, we transfer you back to the airport. Thank you for booking your journey with Come2indoensia. We will await you in another adventure. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -','What to bring : sweater / jacket, sunblock, hat, sun glasses, trekking shoes (sport shoes), torch, change of clothes, swimming suit, cash money for personal expenses, etc.','Program: 23Aug. Arrive Ende - Moni - Staying at Kelimutu Ecolodge (L/D) 24Aug. Moni - Kelimutu Volcano - Bajawa - Staying at Manulalu Jungle Villa (B/L/D) 25Aug. Bajawa - Ruteng - Staying at Spring Hill Hotel (B/L/D) 26Aug. Ruteng - Labuan Bajo - Staying at Puri Sari Hotel (B/L/D) 27Aug. Labuan Bajo - Drop off Sylvia Hotel & Resort Komodo (B) Food allergy for Oliver Leupi: Lactose Intolerance (cannot eat milk, butter, cheese, yogurt etc) Flight information: Arrive Ende: ETA 11.20 by Wings Air IW1957 from Kupang on 23 August 2024 Drop off Labuan Bajo: Drop off at Sylvia Hotel & Resort Komodo on 27 August 2024','{\"date\": \"2024-08-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"11:20\", \"locality\": \"H. Hasan Aroeboesman Airport of Ende\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Sylvia Hotel & Resort Komodo\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5198329,'601','Mr. Ancor Sanchez Suarez',30783,213061,'Transfer from Yogyakarta Hotel to Semarang Hotel with Visit Borobudur','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-28','2024-08-28','Guio','Komang',1,'Per Car',960000.00,NULL,NULL,'Pickup point in Yogyakarta : Omah Manis Yogyakart