from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-08-29\", \"text\": \"ETA 07.15 by Batik Air ID6202 from Jakarta on 29 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pangkalan Bun Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-31\", \"text\": \"ETD 08.50 by Batik Air ID6134 to Surabaya on 31 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5201035,'662','Celtia Carneiro Rey',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-31','2024-08-31','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',336000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-31\", \"text\": \"ETA 14.00 by Lion Air JT804 from Surabaya on 31 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-31\", \"text\": \"Jl. Hanoman, Ubud, Kec. Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Alaya Resort Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5201036,'662','Celtia Carneiro Rey',30611,201418,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-08-31','2024-09-04','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',10035200.00,'The Deluxe Room provides a restful environment to unwind after a busy day spent exploring the sights of Ubud. It is a cozy base featuring clean-line furnishings, a smart en-suite bathroom and a decorative wall that showcases Bali’s creative legacy. A private terrace or balcony blends seamlessly into the outdoors providing extra space to sit and relax.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5201040,'662','Celtia Carneiro Rey',30508,215968,'Tegalalang (coffee luwak) - Tirta Empul - Kintamani - Besakih Temple','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-01','2024-09-01','Guio','Tami',2,'Person (1)',2352000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-01\", \"text\": \"Jl. Hanoman, Ubud, Kec. Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Alaya Resort Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5201045,'662','Celtia Carneiro Rey',30508,215968,'Leke leke Waterfall - Ulun Danu Bratan Temple - Tanah Lot Temple','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-02','2024-09-02','Guio','Tami',2,'Person (1)',1792000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-02\", \"text\": \"Jl. Hanoman, Ubud, Kec. Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Alaya Resort Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5201047,'662','Celtia Carneiro Rey',30508,207262,'Ubud to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-04','2024-09-04','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',336000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-04\", \"text\": \"Jl. Hanoman, Ubud, Kec. Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Alaya Resort Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-04\", \"text\": \"ETD 10.35 by Wings Air IW1832 to Tambolaka on 04 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5201068,'662','Celtia Carneiro Rey',31104,203972,'Beachfront Studio Villa (no pool)','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-09-04','2024-09-06','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',12656000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5201069,'662','Celtia Carneiro Rey',30528,215622,'Praijing Village - Lapopu Waterfall','Confirmed','WS1.2HD',1,'2024-09-06','2024-09-06','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2-3)',3192000.00,'Pick Up Time : 09.00 AM Pick Up / Drop Off Place : Waikabubak, Lamboya, Wanokaka Area (West Sumba) - Sumba Nautil Resort, Nihiwatu Resort, Lelewatu Resort, Rua Beach Resort, Alamayah Resort, The Sanubari Resort, Morika Hotel, Manandang Hotel, La Casa de Luna. *Other places or hotel, please contact us. After your breakfast at the hotel, you will be heading to another beautiful village, Praijing village. This village is built on top of a hill, and if you want to walk through the entire village, you actually have to walk down the hill. You will have an overview of the entire village at the entrance. On top of that, the inhabitants of the village built a spot where you can have a panoramic view of the village and beyond. The village is also surrounded by the beautiful nature of Sumba. Next on your adventure will be the Lapopu Waterfall. After a drive through the endless hilly and green landscape of Sumba, you will arrive near the waterfall. To visit the waterfall, you will need to do a short hike of approximately 15 minutes and cross a bamboo bridge to get there. There is a nice spot to sit down where you can watch the water find its way down the hill. You can also bring your swimming clothes to take a dive in the water just in front of the big waterfall. Meals : No Meals',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-06\", \"text\": \"Pantai Dasang, Harona Kala, Laboya Barat, West Sumba Regency, East Nusa Tenggara\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Sanubari\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-06\", \"text\": \"Pantai Karoso, Ate Dalo, Kec. Kodi, Kabupaten Sumba Barat Daya, Nusa Tenggara Tim.\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Resort Cap Karoso\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5201073,'662','Celtia Carneiro Rey',32859,217252,'Studio Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-09-06','2024-09-08','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',18256000.00,'Studios are located on upper and ground floors of our Main building, offering stunning sea views. The interior of the bedroom is dominated by a hand-carved wood panel inspired by Sumba Ikat. Artwork, bespoke ceramics, and local artifacts fill the space with the spirit of Sumba. Plus, a super-king bed and spacious bathroom with a walk-in shower and double vanity are sure to inspire moments of utter relaxation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5201083,'662','Celtia Carneiro Rey',30508,212291,'Airport to Jimbaran','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-08','2024-09-08','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-08\", \"text\": \"ETA 13.55 by Wings Air IW1833 from Tambolaka on 08 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-08\", \"text\": \"Jl. Pantai Balangan, Jimbaran, South Kuta, Badung Regency, Bali 80361\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"La Joya Biu Biu Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5201087,'662','Celtia Carneiro Rey',30915,202457,'Gardenside Lodge Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-09-08','2024-09-10','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',5741344.00,'At 32 m2 room size, the Garden-side Lodge known for its rustic interior has its own outdoor terrace, which extends out to a private garden. Guests choose this room to wind down to the greener pastures and to take a break from the beach or the sunny outdoors. The lodge offers additional lounging space with a two-seat sofa settee on the side of the room. Wood-framed glass patio entrance connects this rustic room to its exclusive outdoor garden.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5201089,'662','Celtia Carneiro Rey',30508,212571,'Jimbaran to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-10','2024-09-10','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-10\", \"text\": \"Jl. Pantai Balangan, Jimbaran, South Kuta, Badung Regency, Bali 80361\", \"time\": \"14:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"La Joya Biu Biu Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-10\", \"text\": \"ETD 18.55 by Qatar QR963 to Doha on 10 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5201092,'479','MR. SERGIO APARICIO COBO',30783,201525,'4D3N Yogyakarta – Selogriyo – Drop Semarang / A. The Phoenix (Deluxe Legacy Room)','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-10-01','2024-10-04','Guio','Eddy',2,'Persons (2 / Double)',12660000.00,'D1 Arrival Yogyakarta International Airport – Transfer to hotel: Welcome to the cradle of Indonesian culture, Yogyakarta. A tourist destination for its ancient palaces, temples, batik workshops, gamelan music orchestras, court dances and wayang puppet shows. Upon your arrival in Yogyakarta a representative of come2indonesia will be waiting for you with a sign indicating your name to take you to your hotel and the rest of the day is for you. D2 Borobudur temple – Candirejo Village Tour by Horse cart / bicycle – Merapi lava tour Including Jeep: You will have your deserved breakfast at the hotel. Today’s tour will make you enjoy the authentic Javanese essence. You will start your route in the direction of with the Borobudur Temple (Candi Borobudur), the great Stupa, the largest Buddhist monument in the world and one of the seven wonders. We will tour around the temple, observe the hundreds and centenary statues of Buddha and witness how dozens of Buddhists come to preach from all over the world. Historically it was established during the relatively brief Sailendra dynasty of Central Java between 778 and 856 BC and is in constant restoration due to the breaks that the tremors of the neighbouring Merapi volcano has been producing during its history. After visiting one of the most important Buddhist temples in Southeast Asia, and in a horse carriage (Andong) we will visit the villages that surround this temple. These are authentic Javanese villages where culture and tradition are the protagonists. As you spend your days in this country and go around the different islands, you will realize how different Indonesians are among them in terms of clothing, food, architecture and even language. Today we will learn about and share these Javanese places. Then we will go to Kaliurang / Kalidalem to see Mount Merapi in constant activity. Here in a 4x4 jeep driven by specialized drivers, we will climb its skirt to see the remains of the 2010 eruption such as houses buried by ashes, a multitude of objects paralyzed by lava, etc. In addition, an open-air tribute museum presided over by the clock that marks the time just when the lava passed through it has been improvised. Accompanied by photos of the rescue, it will make us feel very closely the experiences of that fateful day. After finishing this day full of emotions, we will take you back to your hotel. D3 City Tour Jogjakarta Visit Sultan Palace, Watercastle and Bird Market – Prambanan Temple: After breakfast and at the indicated time we will head towards the heart of the city. We will visit the Keraton known as the Sultan’s Palace. The palace is a complex building two centuries old, located in the heart of the city. You will hear the song of the “freedom” of the birds in the bird market, we will visit the “Water Castle” that occupies the highest part at the northern end of the vast complex of Taman Sari, Malioboro Street, main street of Yogyakarta, with its merchants, horse carriages, taxi-bikes and markets. An incredible experience that will make the hours fly by. After finishing the tour in the center of the city of Yogyakarta, we will go to the northeast direction Candi Prambanan, the temple of the Hinduists and classified as a World Heritage Site by Unesco since 1991. The built of this temple was finished around the year 856 to commemorate the victory of the descendant Sanjaya of Siva, Rikai Pikatan on the last sovereign Sailendra of Central Java. Take your time to enjoy each carving on the rocks and feel the spirituality that each of the stones perched in this set of more than 200 Hindu temples that are dedicated to the Trimurti, the expression of God as the Creator, the Preserver and the Destroyer. After this unforgettable day, we will take you to your hotel. D4 Transfer out Yogyakarta International airport: Today our adventure ends at the cradle of Indonesian culture. Depending on the time of your flight, we will pick you up to take you to the airport and take the flight to your next destination. End of our services. Thank you very much for exploring Yogyakarta by the hand of Come2indonesia.',NULL,'HONEYMOON 1001 Día 01: Llegada A Jakarta – Yogyakarta 1002 Día 02: Yogyakarta Tour – Templo Prambanan 1003 Día 03: Borobudur Temple Incl. Mendut And Pawon - Selogriyo Temple 1004 Día 04: Yogyakarta – Semarang','{\"date\": \"2024-10-01\", \"text\": \"ETA : 01OCT 2015 GA206 By Garuda From (CGK) Jakarta\", \"time\": \"20:15\", \"locality\": \"JOGJA APT\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-04\", \"text\": \"ARTOTEL Gajahmada Semarang Address : Jl. Gajahmada No.101, Miroto, Kec. Semarang Tengah, Kota Semarang, Jawa Tengah 50134 Phone : (024) 86405777\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"SEMARANG HOTEL\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5201098,'643','MRS COVO FRANCOISE',30671,200626,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-24','2024-11-25','Ayu','Ayu',1,'Double',1120000.00,'Deluxe Room with a room area of 28 square meters each, there are 2 types of bed, king and twin bed with a size of 28 square meters each.',NULL,'Check-in time 14.00 Check-out time 12.00','{\"date\": \"2024-11-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5201100,'643','MRS COVO FRANCOISE',30671,200626,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-24','2024-11-25','Ayu','Ayu',1,'Double',1120000.00,'Deluxe Room with a room area of 28 square meters each, there are 2 types of bed, king and twin bed with a size of 28 square meters each.',NULL,'Check-in time 14.00 Check-out time 12.00','{\"date\": \"2024-11-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5201102,'643','MRS COVO FRANCOISE',30671,200626,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-24','2024-11-25','Ayu','Ayu',1,'Double',1120000.00,'Deluxe Room with a room area of 28 square meters each, there are 2 types of bed, king and twin bed with a size of 28 square meters each.',NULL,'Check-in time 14.00 Check-out time 12.00','{\"date\": \"2024-11-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5201286,'664','Mirian Valerio Mateo',30528,215524,'5D4N Explore Sumba (East - West - South West Sumba) / C. Padadita Hotel - Ella Hotel','Confirmed',NULL,5,'2024-08-19','2024-08-23','Nicholas','Tami',2,'Persons (2 / Double)',15480000.00,'START : WAINGAPU AIRPORT (WGP) FINISH : TAMBOLAKA AIRPORT (TMC) DAY 1 : ARRIVAL WAINGAPU AIRPORT - HOTEL Upon your arrival at Waingapu Airport in East Sumba, you will be warmly welcomed by our guide. We will then provide transportation to your hotel where you can check-in and relax before your upcoming day trip. Meals : - Accomodation : C. Padadita Hotel (Superior Room) DAY 2 : IKAT TENUN VILLAGE - TANGGEDU WATERFALL - PURU KAMBERA BEACH & SAVANAH After enjoying breakfast at the hotel and taking some time to rest, we will embark on an adventure to visit a traditional village. Here, you will have the opportunity to witness the process of creating Ikat Tenun, the traditional clothing of the Sumbanese people. Next, we will explore the natural beauty of the waterfall and savannah in East Sumba. You will see horses and cows roaming freely as they search for food and space. Along the way to Tanggedu waterfall, we will stop at Puru Kambera Savannah, where you can take a break and soak up the atmosphere. Tanggedu is a stunning waterfall in East Sumba that requires a flat 20-minute trek and a 15-minute climb up some stairs to reach. However, the breathtaking views along the way make it well worth the effort. Your lunch box will be prepared for you. After trekking, we will visit Puru Kambera beach, where you can relax until you are ready to return to the hotel. Alternatively, we can visit Walakiri Beach (also known as Mangrove Beach) if you would prefer. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch Box Accomodation : C. Padadita Hotel (Superior Room) DAY 3 : WARINDING HILL - LAPOPU WATERFALL - PRAIJING VILLAGE Today, we will be traveling from East to West Sumba. Our first stop will be at \"Bukit Wairinding,\" which translates to \"the Hills of Wairinding.\" There is a stunning viewpoint from which you can admire the beautiful, endless green hills. Take a seat in the grass and enjoy the serene moment. Our next destination is the Lai Popu Waterfall after a scenic drive through Sumba\'s endless hills and green landscapes. To reach the waterfall, you will need to hike for approximately 15 minutes and cross a bamboo bridge. Once you reach the waterfall, there is a beautiful spot where you can relax and observe the water cascading down the hill. After visiting the waterfall, we will visit the the traditional village of Praijing, situated uphill and surrounded by lush greenery. This village provides a unique opportunity to observe the entire village and understand how it operates. Take a walk around the village, and don\'t forget to share some candies with the friendly locals, including the elders and children who will be happy to greet you with a smile. Lunch box will be provided. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch Accomodation : C. Ella Hotel (Deluxe Room) DAY 4 : RATENGGARO VILLAGE - WEEKURI LAKE - MANDORAK BEACH - LENDONGARA HILL SUNSET After enjoying breakfast, we will head to the village of Ratenggaro in the Kodi area. This village boasts the highest traditional rooftops in all of Sumba, which are handmade using traditional techniques. While this village may only consist of a few houses, each one can accommodate up to 50 family members. During the harvesting season, most of the villagers will work in the fields and leave only the elders and children in the village. We will then proceed to Weekuri Lake, a stunningly clear lake that provides an excellent opportunity to swim and relax. Take some time to dip in the water and walk around the rocks and reef for a view of the ocean from one side. A lunch box will be prepared for you. Next to Weekuri Lake is Mandorak Beach, flanked by two massive rock ridges that point towards the middle of the beach and crystal-clear waters. We will return to your hotel and visit Lendongara Hill to witness the sunset. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch Box Accomodation : C. Ella Hotel (Deluxe Room) DAY 5 : OUT TAMBOLAKA AIRPORT After breakfast, our guide will be ready to pick you up and transfer you to Tambolaka airport, depending on your flight schedule. Meals : Breakfast Accomodation : -',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-19\", \"text\": \"ETA 16.25 by Wings Air IW1884 from Denpasar on 19 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Waingapu Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-23\", \"text\": \"ETD 16.30 by Sriwijaya Air SJ281 to Denpasar on 23 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Tambolaka Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5201292,'663','Didac Campanals',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-11','2024-09-12','Jacob','Febrina',1,'Double',840000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Roundtrip Airport Transfer Flight details: ETA 17:35 by Turkish Airlines TK56 from Istanbul on 11 Sep ETD 06:00 by Batik Air ID6202 to Pangkalan Bun on 12 Sep Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK-IN. FM7 Hotel Airport Pickup Service: +62811-8815-053 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-09-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5201299,'663','Didac Campanals',30805,202689,'CGK-PKN','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-12','2024-09-12','Jacob','Febrina',2,'Person',3520000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5201301,'663','Didac Campanals',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-09-12','2024-09-14','Jacob','Febrina',2,'Persons (2)',10800000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan isCape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continueto add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'3D2N Borneo Orangutan Tour based on Private Standard Klotok, with Spanish speaking guide Flight details: ETA 07:15 by Batik Air ID6202 from Jakarta on 12 Sep ETD 10:25 by Batik Air ID6303 to Semarang on 14 Sep Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5201313,'663','Didac Campanals',30805,212246,'PKN-SRG','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-14','2024-09-14','Jacob','Febrina',2,'Person',5720000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5201314,'663','Didac Campanals',30688,201332,'Deluxe Legacy Room','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-09-14','2024-09-17','Jacob','Febrina',1,'Double',5040000.00,'Enjoying city view from a private balcony in room area of 377sq ft (35 m²) with a king bed and 2 twin beds capacity of 3 persons. Equipped with unlimited complimentary WIFI Internet connection, accessible room, 32\" flat-screen TV, safe deposit box, en suite bathroom with rain shower, and minibar with additional charge.1 extra bed possible, non-smoking rooms available upon request and daily turndown service is available.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5201326,'663','Didac Campanals',30783,213061,'Transfer from Semarang Airport to Yogyakarta Hotel','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-14','2024-09-14','Jacob','Febrina',1,'Per Car',960000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-14\", \"text\": \"ETA 11:25 by Batik Air ID6303 from Pangkalan Bun on 14 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Semarang Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-14\", \"text\": \"Jl. Jend Sudirman No. 9 Yogyakarta 55233. Phone: +62274 566617\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Phoenix Hotel\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5201336,'317','Donovan CLEUET',31158,204472,'VIP Service Fast Track International Arrival by Galih','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-10','2024-08-10','Rendy','Rendy',10,'Person (1)',18144000.00,'Arrival International: Pick up at before immigration area.',NULL,'MEETING POINT Your personal assistant will be waiting for you before the Visa-on-Arrival desk and the immigration area (near transfer desk/duty-free plaza), holding a sign of your name. They will assist you with during all arrival processes, including handling your visas and other essential documents as well as VoA (if prepaid), fast assistance at immigration counters, assistance through customs clearance, and help with the luggage. Lastly, the assistant will take you to meet the person who will pick you up at the airport, or help you find a taxi.','{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5201382,'663','Didac Campanals',30783,213061,'Transfer from Yogyakarta Hotel - Yogyakarta Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-17','2024-09-17','Jacob','Febrina',1,'Per Car',960000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-17\", \"text\": \"Jl. Jend Sudirman No. 9 Yogyakarta 55233. Phone: +62274 566617\", \"time\": \"10:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Phoenix Hotel\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-17\", \"text\": \"ETD 13:30 by Garuda GA252 to Denpasar on 17 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Yogyakarta Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5201400,'663','Didac Campanals',30711,200830,'Bisma Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,5,'2024-09-17','2024-09-22','Jacob','Febrina',1,'Double',16830000.00,'Spacious one-bedroom suite of 88 sqm with private balcony for a sophisticated Ubud getaway. Interiors feature extensive use of wood and fine Indonesian textiles and art, lending an understated elegance to the space. Featuring a private balcony, this room includes a flat-screen TV and an en-suite bathroom with a bathtub and a shower, and many more.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5202044,'665','ANA-MARÍA RODRÍGUEZ',30768,201345,'1 Bedroom Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,5,'2024-09-13','2024-09-18','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',8700000.00,'This spacious villa comes with a private pool with sun loungers and a terrace. With a generous 120 sqm size, guests will be pampered with modern amenities such as air conditioner, a personal safe, a flat-screen TV, electric kettle, and a spacious bath area that is completed with a bath tub and a shower. A perfect choice for honeymoon.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5202049,'665','ANA-MARÍA RODRÍGUEZ',30508,207262,'Ubud to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-18','2024-09-18','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-18\", \"text\": \"Pertiwi Resort Ubud, Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 975236\", \"time\": \"20:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-18\", \"text\": \"ETD :01.05 by Qatar Airways IB7967 on 19 September 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"International Airport Ngurah Rai\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5202090,'470','Eric LE COEDIC',30671,200626,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-01','2024-11-02','Ayu','Ayu',1,'Double',1120000.00,'Deluxe Room with a room area of 28 square meters each, there are 2 types of bed, king and twin bed with a size of 28 square meters each.',NULL,'Check-in time 14.00 Check-out time 12.00','{\"date\": \"2024-11-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5202120,'479','MR. SERGIO APARICIO COBO',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-08','2024-10-08','Guio','Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',420000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-08\", \"text\": \"ETA : 08OCT 1725 From (SUB) Surabaya JT920 By Lion Air\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"AIRPORT DENPASAR\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-08\", \"text\": \"KOMANEKA AT BISMA \\\"Address: Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone: (0361) 971933\\\"\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5202141,'479','MR. SERGIO APARICIO COBO',30508,215968,'Cascada Kanto Lampo – Tibumana – Tirta Empul – Templo Gunung Kawi','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-10','2024-10-10','Guio','Eddy',2,'Person (1)',1920000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-10\", \"text\": \"KOMANEKA AT BISMA \\\"Address: Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone: (0361) 971933\\\"\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-10\", \"text\": \"KOMANEKA AT BISMA \\\"Address: Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone: (0361) 971933\\\"\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5202150,'479','MR. SERGIO APARICIO COBO',30508,202881,'Ubud - Jatiluwih Rice Terrace - Banyumala Twin Waterfall - Wanagiri Hidden Hill - Munduk','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-12','2024-10-12','Guio','Eddy',2,'Persons (2)',1692000.00,'We begin the tour from a beautiful rice terrace of Jatiluwih. Unfolding from the foot of mountain until the coastal side, it is one of places in Bali with the beautiful view, as according to its name “Jati” and “Luwih”, where Jati mean really and Luwih meaning especial, good, and beautiful or the equivalent. The local paddies are planted in this place look typically of the high relative size plant if it is compared with other pre-eminent paddy planted by most farmers in Bali. Stroll around the area for a while and take a nice pictures, before we continue to Banyumala Twin Waterfall. The waterfall is special in that there are two flows of water to be seen, hence the name ‘twin’. Water cascades down steep rocks with gorgeous greenery surrounding them. Here you can take a refreshing dip in the plunge pool at the bottom - dunk your head and listen to the sounds of the water crashing down. After the refreshment, we conclude our day by heading to Wanagiri Hidden Hill. This hill has a charm of beauty that can make anyone who saw her feel hypnotized and fell in love Beautiful natural paintings depicting the beautiful mountains, the beautiful green trees, and the expanse of the lake can be seen clearly from this place. In addition to the panoramic view, cool and fresh air is also an added value that makes this tourist area worth visiting. Take photos and enjoy the scenery and then we head back to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-12\", \"text\": \"KOMANEKA AT BISMA \\\"Address: Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone: (0361) 971933\\\"\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-12\", \"text\": \"MUNDUK MODING PLANTATION NATURE RESORT \\\"Address: Jl. Asah Gobleg, Gobleg, Kec. Banjar, Kabupaten Buleleng, Bali 81152 Phone: (0368) 2080123\\\"\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5202158,'479','MR. SERGIO APARICIO COBO',30508,202882,'Munduk – Kintami – El Templo Madre Besakih Y Alrededores – Candidasa','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-14','2024-10-14','Guio','Eddy',2,'Persons (2)',1848000.00,'The first destination is Kusamba Beach, it is one of the favorite places of interest in Bali which is famous with the beautiful beach, we can also meet a fish market in this place which is usually held between 10 am until 4 pm. Then we go to Goa Lawah, this is one of the favourite place to be visited, because here is a nature cave dwelt by thousands of tail bat located at north side from Jeroan/center of Goa Lawah Temple. Next we go to Bukit Jambul, it is strategically located beside of the main road from Denpasar to Besakih Temple and it is one of the tourist destinations that visited on Besakih Tour. It is situated in the plateau area which is blessed with the beautiful panorama of rice terrace and green coconuts three unfolding to the sea. After visit Bukit Jambul, we’ll continue to Besakih Temple is the biggest Hindu temple in Bali which the local people call Pura Besakih. It owns beautiful view from the top of temple area where we can see the wide nature panorama until to the ocean so that’s why this temple is many visited by tourists from all over the world. Then go to Kertagosa, This place also owns Taman Gili, a building floating or sees like floating because it is intentionally founded in the middle of a fish pond.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-14\", \"text\": \"MUNDUK MODING PLANTATION NATURE RESORT \\\"Address: Jl. Asah Gobleg, Gobleg, Kec. Banjar, Kabupaten Buleleng, Bali 81152 Phone: (0368) 2080123\\\"\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-14\", \"text\": \"CANDI BEACH RESORT & SPA BALI Address: Jl. Mendira, Sengkidu, Kec. Manggis, Kabupaten Karangasem, Bali 80871 Phone: (0363) 41234\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5202250,'666','Morgan BUSCHMANN',30671,200626,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-04','2024-10-05','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Double',1120000.00,'Deluxe Room with a room area of 28 square meters each, there are 2 types of bed, king and twin bed with a size of 28 square meters each.',NULL,'Check-in time 14.00 Check-out time 12.00 Flights information ETA: 15.25 by Qatar Airways QR956 from Doha on 04 Oct ETD: 00.10 by Garuda Indonesia GA682 to Sorong on 05 Oct','{\"date\": \"2024-10-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5202361,'656','Vinay Nagarajan',30783,212807,'2D1N Yogyakarta / B. Gallery Prawirotaman (Deluxe Room)','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-09-15','2024-09-16','Rendy','Rendy',4,'Persons (4-6 / Double)',14160000.00,'D1 : Arrival Yogyakarta International Airport - Visit Borobudur Temple incl. Mendut and Pawon - check in hotel Welcome to the cradle of Indonesian culture, Yogyakarta. A tourist destination for its ancient palaces, temples, batik workshops, gamelan music orchestras, court dances and wayang puppet shows. Upon your arrival in Yogyakarta a representative of come2indonesia will be waiting for you with a sign indicating your name to start exploring this special city. We will start by heading towards Borobudur Temple (Candi Borobudur), the great Stupa, the largest Buddhist monument in the world and one of the seven wonders. We will tour around the temple, observe the hundreds and centenary statues of Buddha and witness how dozens of Buddhists come to preach from all over the world. Historically it was established during the relatively brief Sailendra dynasty of Central Java between 778 and 856 BC and is in constant restoration due to the breaks that the tremors of the neighbouring Merapi volcano has been producing during its history. After visiting one of the most important Buddhist temples in Southeast Asia, we continue our journey to the Mendut temple and Pawon temple. D2 : Morning visit Prambanan Temple - City Tour Yogyakarta visit Sultan Palace, Watercastle and Bird Market - Transfer to Yogyakarta International Airport You will enjoy a well-deserved breakfast at the hotel and we will start by heading towards Candi Prambanan, the temple of the Hinduists and classified as a World Heritage Site by Unesco since 1991. The built of this temple was finished around the year 856 to commemorate the victory of the descendant Sanjaya of Siva, Rikai Pikatan on the last sovereign Sailendra of Central Java. Take your time to enjoy each carving on the rocks and feel the spirituality that each of the stones perched in this set of more than 200 Hindu temples that are dedicated to the Trimurti, the expression of God as the Creator, the Preserver and the destroyer. After this visit we go to the Keraton known as the Sultan’s Palace. The palace is a complex building two centuries old, located in the heart of the city. You will hear the song of the “freedom” of the birds in the bird market, we will visit the “Water Castle” that occupies the highest part at the northern end of the vast complex of Taman Sari, Malioboro Street, main street of Yogyakarta, with its merchants, horse carriages, taxi-bikes and markets. An incredible experience that will make the hours fly by. According to the time of your flight, we will pick you up to take you to the airport and take the flight to your next destination. End of our services. Thank you very much for exploring Yogyakarta by the hand of Come2indonesia.',NULL,'IMPORTANT: “Pure vegetarian- can’t eat meat, eggs, mushroom” Hotel in Yogyakarta - Based on Gallery Prawirotaman - 2 Units Deluxe Room (Double) D1/15 Sep: Arrival Yogyakarta - Keraton - Borobudur Temple - Prambanan Temple D1/16 Sep: City Tour - Candirejo - Transfer to Semarang','{\"date\": \"2024-09-15\", \"text\": \"ETA: 07.10 by Batik Air ID6368 from Jakarta on 15 Sep 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Yogyakarta Airport YIA\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"ARTOTEL GAJAHMADA SEMARANG\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5202490,'663','Didac Campanals',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-17','2024-09-17','Jacob','Febrina',1,'Persons (1-3)',420000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-17\", \"text\": \"ETA 16:05 by Garuda GA252 from Yogyakarta on 17 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Denpasar Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-17\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali 80571. Phone: +62361 971933\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Bisma\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5202497,'663','Didac Campanals',30508,207379,'Ubud to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-22','2024-09-22','Jacob','Febrina',1,'Persons (1-3)',600000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-22\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali 80571. Phone: +62361 971933\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Bisma\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-22\", \"text\": \"ETD 08:30 to Gili Air by Gili Gili Fast Boat on 22 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbor https://goo.gl/maps/qRvTJixStazBCLAu8 (close to Serangan 1 Homestay Padangbai)\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5202504,'663','Didac Campanals',30852,202033,'Villa Surya - One Bedroom Private Pool and Tropical Garden','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-09-22','2024-09-25','Jacob','Febrina',1,'Double',12600000.00,'Our cozy one bed Villa Surya is perfect for a solo traveler or a romantic getaway at 150 sqm private property. The spacious bedroom features a king-size bed with an extra thick mattress with 100% cotton linen, ensuring a blissful sleep. With high-ceilings, large windows, and a pivoting door onto your patio, the space is able to breathe whilst being basked in a beautiful, natural light. The ensuite bathroom, equipped with a bespoke basin area, rainfall shower, quality toiletries and 100% cotton towels leads out to the real star of this villa, the indulgent open-air bathtub. Large enough for two, with views of your private pool and tropical garden, while away hours in pure relaxation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5202505,'317','Donovan CLEUET',31158,204270,'Meet & Greet Domestic Flight Departure - for CGK','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-10','2024-08-10','Rendy','Rendy',10,'Person (1)',3068800.00,'Departure Domestic: Service start from meet clients at departure hall until client boarding.',NULL,'MEETING POINT Your personal assistant will be waiting for you at the entrance of departure hall holding a sign of your name. They will assist you to check in counter and the security check point at entrance then to boarding gate.','{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5202514,'663','Didac Campanals',30805,208054,'LOP-CGK','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-25','2024-09-25','Jacob','Febrina',2,'Person',3960000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5203047,'667','Mrs. Francoise Barrier',31119,214054,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-08-11','2024-08-14','Ayu','Ayu',1,'Twin',6660000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\",