commodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-15\", \"text\": \"ETA : 11.35 by ETIHAD EY476 from Abu Dhabi on 15 Sept 2024\", \"time\": \"11:35\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"International Airport Ngurah Rai\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-15\", \"text\": \"Jl. Monkey Forest No.20, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 972877\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kajane Mua Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5204048,'671','Maria Del Carmen',30617,200918,'LOJI Mansion (Suite Room)','Confirmed',NULL,5,'2024-09-15','2024-09-20','Guio','Komang',2,'Twin',22288000.00,'Luxurious one bedroom equipped by Mosquito net located at west area of KajaNe. A lovely room located in a compund of two rooms facilitated by a swimming pool and kitchen. A fully private room with private bathroom. Book all rooms in a compound means booking our Loji 2 Bedroom Villa with a private swimming pool.',NULL,'Note : This friends, please set up Twin Bed','{\"date\": \"2024-09-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5204049,'671','Maria Del Carmen',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Tegalalang - Tirta Empul - Kintamani - Besakih)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-16','2024-09-16','Guio','Komang',4,'Persons (4)',3091200.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-16\", \"text\": \"Jl. Monkey Forest No.20, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 972877\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kajane Mua Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-16\", \"text\": \"Jl. Monkey Forest No.20, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 972877\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kajane Mua Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5204052,'671','Maria Del Carmen',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Leke Leke Waterfall - Ulun Danu Beratan - Tanah Lot )','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-17','2024-09-17','Guio','Komang',4,'Persons (4)',3136000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-17\", \"text\": \"Jl. Monkey Forest No.20, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 972877\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kajane Mua Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-17\", \"text\": \"Jl. Monkey Forest No.20, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 972877\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kajane Mua Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5204053,'671','Maria Del Carmen',30508,202890,'Mount Batur Sunrise Trekking Tour','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-18','2024-09-18','Guio','Komang',4,'Persons (4)',2240000.00,'Enjoy trek or climb Mount Batur and see the sunrise from the top of Batur Volcano. The Batur Volcano is one of the sacred mountain according to Hindu believe. We will get in ahead of schedule morning around 02.00 am depend the area of you stay, and afterward we specifically going to Mount Batur starting point. Starting in the dark under starlight sky, you will be guided to ascend the slope of Mount Batur. You will approach the peak of Mount Batur (1717 meters) at about 06.00 am. While waiting for the sunrise you will have a simple breakfast and hot coffee or tea served by your guide in Mount Batur. Witness the breathtaking sunrise overlooking the majestic view of Lake Batur and Mount Rinjani. After witnessing the sunrise, continue for our descent, at about 9 am, you will be arriving at the finishing point.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-18\", \"text\": \"Jl. Monkey Forest No.20, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 972877\", \"time\": \"02:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kajane Mua Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-18\", \"text\": \"Jl. Monkey Forest No.20, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 972877\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kajane Mua Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5204054,'671','Maria Del Carmen',30508,207379,'Ubud to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-20','2024-09-20','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (4-6)',1064000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-20\", \"text\": \"Jl. Monkey Forest No.20, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 972877\", \"time\": \"07:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kajane Mua Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-20\", \"text\": \"ETD : 10.30 by Ekajaya Fastboat from Padangbai to Gili Trawangan on 20 Sept 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padangbai Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5204057,'671','Maria Del Carmen',31007,203161,'Premier Room With Terrace','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-09-20','2024-09-22','Guio','Komang',2,'Twin',5600000.00,'This twin/double room at 30 square meters with 9 units available, features a patio, pool view and tea/coffee maker.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5204059,'671','Maria Del Carmen',31040,203404,'Ocean View Bungalow Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-09-22','2024-09-24','Guio','Komang',2,'Double + Twin',4256000.00,'Room size: 55 sqm. The ocean view bungalow room has 13 units available. The rooms at this Nusa Penida hotel provide guests with high-velocity internet and a flat-screen TV with satellite channels, and comforts such as ironing facilities and air conditioning. The units are designed in a comfortable manner. Offering amenities like hair dryers and bathrobes, the bathrooms also include a walk-in shower, a separate toilet and a sink.',NULL,'\"please consult time transfer to harbour upon checkin\"','{\"date\": \"2024-09-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5204060,'671','Maria Del Carmen',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-09-23','2024-09-23','Guio','Komang',4,'Persons (4)',1120000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-23\", \"text\": \"Banjar Angkal, Suana, Kec. Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771 Telepon: (0366) 5582389\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Angkal Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-23\", \"text\": \"Banjar Angkal, Suana, Kec. Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771 Telepon: (0366) 5582389\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Angkal Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5204062,'671','Maria Del Carmen',30508,212456,'Sanur to Uluwatu','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-24','2024-09-24','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (4-6)',672000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-24\", \"text\": \"ETA : 13.00 by Maruti Fastboat from Nusa Penida on 24 Sept 2024\", \"time\": \"13:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sanur Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-24\", \"text\": \"Gg. Mertasari, Pecatu, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361 Telepon: 0812-3979-9199\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sal Secret Uluwatu\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5204063,'671','Maria Del Carmen',30621,212116,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-24','2024-09-25','Guio','Komang',2,'Twin',3880800.00,'The Superior rooms in main Sal building will provide you the extra space and comfort that you aim for after a day surfing or simply enjoying the beach. With an Island chic design features these rooms represent the extra pamper that you deserve it. Room Amenities; Balcony, Wireless Internet Access, Air-conditioning, Mini Bar, Safety Box. Located in the stunning Bukit region, this intimate eco boutique resort is one of the best kept secrets in Bali, offering you the best service and beautiful amenities such as our gorgeous swimming pools.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5204064,'671','Maria Del Carmen',30508,216161,'Uluwatu to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-25','2024-09-25','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (4-6)',784000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-25\", \"text\": \"Gg. Mertasari, Pecatu, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361 Telepon: 0812-3979-9199\", \"time\": \"14:45\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sal Secret Uluwatu\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-25\", \"text\": \"ETD : 18.45 by ETIHAD EY477 to Abu Dhabi on 25 Sept 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"International Airport Ngurah Rai\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5204065,'451','Mr. Fernando Vives Gil',30508,213032,'Ubud to Kusamba','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-06','2024-08-06','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-06\", \"text\": \"Kedewatan, Ubud, Gianyar Regency, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Royal Pita Maha\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-06\", \"text\": \"ETD 08.00 to Nusa Penida by The Angkal Fast Boat\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kusamba Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5204067,'451','Mr. Fernando Vives Gil',30508,207337,'Snorkeling at Nusa Penida (from Nusa Penida) (Sharing Trip)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-06','2024-08-06','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1232000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-06\", \"text\": \"ETD 08.30 from Kusamba by The Angkal Fast Boat\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sampalan Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-06\", \"text\": \"Sakti, Nusa Penida, Klungkung Regency, Bali 80771\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Māua Nusa Penida\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5204068,'451','Mr. Fernando Vives Gil',30582,203387,'One Bedroom Luxury Villas','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-06','2024-08-07','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',3942400.00,'Each One Bedroom Luxury Villa is designed with a private infinity pool, scenic view across the Gamat Bay or garden view, and some have a small private garden. Every villas features the following: An integrated universal power outlet, Room safe (suitable for storing laptops), Cable TV with international news and movie channels, Eco-friendly bathroom amenities, Coffee and tea-making facilities.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-08-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5204071,'451','Mr. Fernando Vives Gil',30508,207388,'Sanur to Legian','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-07','2024-08-07','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-07\", \"text\": \"ETA 13.00 from Nusa Penida by Maruti Fast Boat\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sanur Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-07\", \"text\": \"Jl. Melasti, Legian, Kelod, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Magani Hotel and Spa\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5204537,'672','Raquel Ventura Brito',32920,218671,'1 (TWN) Superior Garden Room + 1 Extra Bed','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-08-18','2024-08-21','Jacob','Eddy',1,'Twin',4572000.00,'Superior Garden View Room is a longhouse with 2 stories building with a tropical garden view. There are eight (08) rooms in one block with configuration 04 rooms up-stair and 04 rooms downstairs. All rooms have a balcony, mostly the room has a twin bed with garden view.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5204540,'672','Raquel Ventura Brito',30728,207487,'Exploring North Lombok (Beaches, Mountain, Waterfalls, Sembalun)','Confirmed','EXC 11',1,'2024-08-19','2024-08-19','Jacob','Eddy',3,'Persons (3-5)',2854800.00,'This journey will impress you from the start, driving through many kinds the vegetation such as rice fields, villages, rice terraces, forest and hills before reach flat valley of Sembalun, surrounded by the massive of the great Rinjani volcano. Pusuk Pass is a viewpoint elevated more than 1000m above sea level and overseeing Sembalun Village. Monkeys from the nearby Forest also love the views, but more the views of your bags, food and belongings. Please be very aware! Passing by Sasak villages, Lawang & Bumbung. We may have chance to visit Beleq Village, an abandoned traditional Sasak Village and trek Selong Hill to enjoy unique panorama of plantations. Local people here work as farmers who used to plant, many kinds of vegetables and fruits. If you are lucky you may pick strawberry in the season. Next destination is the Sendang Gile Waterfall (125m), set among tranquil lush surroundings. A lunch will be served at local restaurant. On the way back to your hotel, you will pass by the northern coastline which dominated the beautiful black sands and stop by at Malimbu hill for picture taking.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-19\", \"text\": \"Merumatta Senggigi Lombok Address: Jalan Pantai Senggigi, Senggigi, Kec. Batu Layar, Kabupaten Lombok Barat, Nusa Tenggara Bar. 83355 Phone: (0370) 693210\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-19\", \"text\": \"Merumatta Senggigi Lombok Address: Jalan Pantai Senggigi, Senggigi, Kec. Batu Layar, Kabupaten Lombok Barat, Nusa Tenggara Bar. 83355 Phone: (0370) 693210\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5204541,'672','Raquel Ventura Brito',30728,207493,'Bumi Gora / Kuta Tour','Confirmed','EXC 03',1,'2024-08-20','2024-08-20','Jacob','Eddy',3,'Persons (3-5)',2610000.00,'This tour takes you first to the Pottery Village of Banyumulek. Observe how the local women produce pottery stuffs. Then, visit Sukarare village; renowned for its traditional hand weaving of brightly patterned “songket”, “ikat” and “sarong” cloths. We will observe how the regenerate of weaving tradition goes on in the village. Girl, mother and grandmother even great grandmother do weaving activity together in the village. Next the tour continues to Ende village, featuring the unique traditional houses with its buffalo dung floors. Lunch is served at one of local restaurants in New Kuta Mandalika area. Then, we visit the beautiful beach of Tanjung A’an, one of the most scenic and un-spoilt beaches in this part of Lombok. We may have chance to trek Merese Hills to enjoy magnificent panorama of Indian Ocean.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-20\", \"text\": \"Merumatta Senggigi Lombok Address: Jalan Pantai Senggigi, Senggigi, Kec. Batu Layar, Kabupaten Lombok Barat, Nusa Tenggara Bar. 83355 Phone: (0370) 693210\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-20\", \"text\": \"Merumatta Senggigi Lombok Address: Jalan Pantai Senggigi, Senggigi, Kec. Batu Layar, Kabupaten Lombok Barat, Nusa Tenggara Bar. 83355 Phone: (0370) 693210\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5204542,'638','Ana Nieto',30508,212301,'Padang Bai to Pecatu','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-01','2024-10-01','Guio','Febrina',1,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-01\", \"text\": \"ETA 12:30 from Gili Air by Gili Gili Fast Boat on 01 Oct\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbor\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-01\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bangbang Metuug, Bingin, Pecatu, Kuta Selatan, Bali 80361. WhatsApp: +62811 3997903\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Green Escape Eco & Boutique Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5204543,'638','Ana Nieto',30508,216161,'Pecatu to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-03','2024-10-03','Guio','Febrina',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-03\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bangbang Metuug, Bingin, Pecatu, Kuta Selatan, Bali 80361. WhatsApp: +62811 3997903\", \"time\": \"13:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Green Escape Eco & Boutique Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-03\", \"text\": \"ETD 18:55 by IB7979 to Doha on 03 Oct\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Denpasar Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5205266,'673','Marta Campoy Seron',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-10','2024-09-10','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',336000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-10\", \"text\": \"ETA 22.40 by Qatar QR960 from Doha on 10 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-10\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Bisma\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5205281,'673','Marta Campoy Seron',30711,200830,'Bisma Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-09-10','2024-09-13','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',9424800.00,'Spacious one-bedroom suite of 88 sqm with private balcony for a sophisticated Ubud getaway. Interiors feature extensive use of wood and fine Indonesian textiles and art, lending an understated elegance to the space. Featuring a private balcony, this room includes a flat-screen TV and an en-suite bathroom with a bathtub and a shower, and many more.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5205285,'673','Marta Campoy Seron',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-11','2024-09-11','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1747200.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-11\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Bisma\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5205291,'673','Marta Campoy Seron',30508,207379,'Ubud to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-13','2024-09-13','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-13\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Bisma\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-13\", \"text\": \"ETD 08.00 to Gili Air by Blue Water Express\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5205313,'673','Marta Campoy Seron',30852,202033,'Villa Surya - One Bedroom Private Pool and Tropical Garden','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-09-13','2024-09-16','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',11760000.00,'Our cozy one bed Villa Surya is perfect for a solo traveler or a romantic getaway at 150 sqm private property. The spacious bedroom features a king-size bed with an extra thick mattress with 100% cotton linen, ensuring a blissful sleep. With high-ceilings, large windows, and a pivoting door onto your patio, the space is able to breathe whilst being basked in a beautiful, natural light. The ensuite bathroom, equipped with a bespoke basin area, rainfall shower, quality toiletries and 100% cotton towels leads out to the real star of this villa, the indulgent open-air bathtub. Large enough for two, with views of your private pool and tropical garden, while away hours in pure relaxation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5205327,'532','Amelio Barbero Garcia / Maria Carmen Romero Moreno',30508,207250,'Airport to Kuta','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-12','2024-08-12','Guio','Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'ETA : 12 AUG 2024 - 22:40H From Doha IB7970 by Qatar (Operate by Qatar Airways, QR960)','{\"date\": \"2024-08-12\", \"text\": \"ETA : 12 AUG 2024 - 22:40H From Doha IB7970 by Qatar (Operate by Qatar Airways, QR960)\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"AIRPORT DENPASAR\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-12\", \"text\": \"THE VIRA BALI BOUTIQUE HOTEL & SUITES \\\"ADDRESS :Jl. Kartika Plaza No. 127 Kuta, Bali 80361 Phone: (0361) 765700 Whatsapp: +6287851156682\\\"\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5205332,'673','Marta Campoy Seron',30728,208199,'2x Fun Diving','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-14','2024-09-14','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',4816000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-14\", \"text\": \"Gili Air, Gili Indah, Pemenang, North Lombok Regency, West Nusa Tenggara\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Rimba Villas Gili Air\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5205393,'673','Marta Campoy Seron',30582,203387,'One Bedroom Luxury Villas','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-09-16','2024-09-19','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',10483200.00,'Each One Bedroom Luxury Villa is designed with a private infinity pool, scenic view across the Gamat Bay or garden view, and some have a small private garden. Every villas features the following: An integrated universal power outlet, Room safe (suitable for storing laptops), Cable TV with international news and movie channels, Eco-friendly bathroom amenities, Coffee and tea-making facilities.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5205492,'673','Marta Campoy Seron',30508,207269,'Sanur to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-19','2024-09-19','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-19\", \"text\": \"ETA 10.00 from Nusa Penida by The Angkal Fast Boat\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sanur Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-19\", \"text\": \"ETD 18.55 by Qatar QR963 to Doha on 19 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5205523,'673','Marta Campoy Seron',33160,218970,'Fun Dives (2 Dives)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-17','2024-09-17','Guio','Tami',2,'Person (1)',3920000.00,NULL,NULL,'Meeting time 7:00 / 7:10 AM at the dive center.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5205563,'674','Judit Anton',33161,218971,'5D4N Labengki - Sombori Islands Tours (Cottage LBH)','Confirmed',NULL,5,'2024-09-08','2024-09-12','Jacob','Eddy',2,'Person (1)',0.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-08\", \"text\": \"Sahid Azizah Syariah Hotel & Convention Kendari Address : JI. DI Panjaitan, Kec. Baruga, Kab. Undudopi, Baruga, Kendari, Sulawesi Tenggara, Indonesia, 93117 Phone : +624013198888\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-12\", \"text\": \"ETA : 12 SEP | 14:50 to Surabaya (SUB) IU 587 by Superairjet\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"AIRPORT KENDARI\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5205712,'675','Marta Gomez Cortijo',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-27','2024-09-28','Jacob','Febrina',1,'Double',840000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS Roundtrip Airport Transfer Flight details: ETA 07:40 by Qatar Airways QR958 from Doha on 27 Sep ETD 07:55 by Garuda Indonesia GA204 to Yogyakarta on 28 Sep Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK-IN. FM7 Hotel Airport Pickup Service: +62811-8815-053 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-09-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5205729,'382','JOAQUINA VALDES',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-07','2024-08-08','Jacob','Tami',4,'Double',3360000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK-IN. FM7 Hotel Airport Pickup Service: +62811-8815-053 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-08-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5205731,'675','Marta Gomez Cortijo',30805,212255,'CGK-YIA','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-28','2024-09-28','Jacob','Febrina',2,'Person',2860000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5205743,'675','Marta Gomez Cortijo',30783,213432,'2D1N Yogyakarta - Semarang/ C. Adhisthana (Superior Room)','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-09-28','2024-09-29','Jacob','Febrina',2,'Persons (2)',7020000.00,'D1 : Arrival Yogyakarta International Airport - Visit Borobudur Temple incl. Mendut and Pawon - check in hotel Welcome to the cradle of Indonesian culture, Yogyakarta. A tourist destination for its ancient palaces, temples, batik workshops, gamelan music orchestras, court dances and wayang puppet shows. Upon your arrival in Yogyakarta a representative of come2indonesia will be waiting for you with a sign indicating your name to start exploring this special city. We will start by heading towards Borobudur Temple (Candi Borobudur), the great Stupa, the largest Buddhist monument in the world and one of the seven wonders. We will tour around the temple, observe the hundreds and centenary statues of Buddha and witness how dozens of Buddhists come to preach from all over the world. Historically it was established during the relatively brief Sailendra dynasty of Central Java between 778 and 856 BC and is in constant restoration due to the breaks that the tremors of the neighbouring Merapi volcano has been producing during its history. After visiting one of the most important Buddhist temples in Southeast Asia, we continue our journey to the Mendut temple and Pawon temple. D2 : Morning visit Prambanan Temple - City Tour Yogyakarta visit Sultan Palace, Watercastle and Bird Market - Transfer to Yogyakarta International Airport You will enjoy a well-deserved breakfast at the hotel and we will start by heading towards Candi Prambanan, the temple of the Hinduists and classified as a World Heritage Site by Unesco since 1991. The built of this temple was finished around the year 856 to commemorate the victory of the descendant Sanjaya of Siva, Rikai Pikatan on the last sovereign Sailendra of Central Java. Take your time to enjoy each carving on the rocks and feel the spirituality that each of the stones perched in this set of more than 200 Hindu temples that are dedicated to the Trimurti, the expression of God as the Creator, the Preserver and the destroyer. After this visit we go to the Keraton known as the Sultan’s Palace. The palace is a complex building two centuries old, located in the heart of the city. You will hear the song of the “freedom” of the birds in the bird market, we will visit the “Water Castle” that occupies the highest part at the northern end of the vast complex of Taman Sari, Malioboro Street, main street of Yogyakarta, with its merchants, horse carriages, taxi-bikes and markets. An incredible experience that will make the hours fly by. According to the time of your flight, we will pick you up to take you to the airport and take the flight to your next destination. End of our services. Thank you very much for exploring Yogyakarta by the hand of Come2indonesia.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS 2D1N Yogyakarta - Semarang Tour with Spanish speaking guide Accommodation: Adhisthana Hotel - 1 Double Superior Room D1/28 Sep 2024: Arrival in Yogyakarta - Prambanan Temple D2/29 Sep 2024: Yogyakarta City Tour - Borobudur Temple - Drop off in Semarang (B) Flight details on 28 Sep 2024: ETA 09:15 by Garuda Indonesia GA204 from Jakarta Drop off in Semarang on 29 Sep 2024: Artotel Gajahmada Semarang Jl. Gajahmada No. 101, Semarang. Phone: +6224 86405777 / +628569 1999577','{\"date\": \"2024-09-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5205776,'675','Marta Gomez Cortijo',30672,200737,'Studio 25 (Superior) Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-29','2024-09-30','Jacob','Febrina',1,'Double',684000.00,'Studio 25 (Superior) room with 25 sqm sized room and with exclusive ARTOTEL bedding collection, some facilities in this room is 43\" inch lcd tv, 24 hours in-room service, high speed internet wi-fi, safety deposit box and hair dryer.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS Oneway Transfer Hotel - Airport on 30 Sep 2024 Flight detail: ETD 08:30 by Batik Air ID6302 to Pangkalan Bun on 30 Sep','{\"date\": \"2024-09-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5205786,'675','Marta Gomez Cortijo',30805,212247,'SRG-PKN','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-30','2024-09-30','Jacob','Febrina',2,'Person',3520000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5205792,'675','Marta Gomez Cortijo',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-09-30','2024-10-02','Jacob','Febrina',2,'Persons (2)',10800000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan isCape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continueto add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS 3D2N Borneo Orangutan Tour (OT3), with Spanish speaking guide Flight details: ETA 09:30 by Batik Air ID6302 from Semarang on 30 Sep ETD 08:50 by Batik Air ID6134 to Surabaya on 02 Oct Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5206521,'675','Marta Gomez Cortijo',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-02','2024-10-02','Jacob','Febrina',2,'Persons (2)',840000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-02\", \"text\": \"ETA 14.00 by Lion Air JT804 from Surabaya on 02 Oct\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Denpasar Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-02\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Pengosekan, Mas, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali. Phone: +62361 9085030 / +62877 47926655\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Green Field Resort Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5206545,'675','Marta Gomez Cortijo',30508,202892,'Tour Taman Ayun - Jatiluwih - Ulun Danu Beratan Temple - Tanah Lot','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-03','2024-10-03','Jacob','Febrina',2,'Persons (2)',1872000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,'FD Tour Taman Ayun - Jatiluwih - Ulun Danu Beratan Temple - Tanah Lot, with Spanish speaking guide','{\"date\": \"2024-10-03\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Pengosekan, Mas, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali. Phone: +62361 9085030 / +62877 47926655\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Green Field Resort Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-03\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Pengosekan, Mas, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali. Phone: +62361 9085030 / +62877 47926655\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Green Field Resort Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5206551,'675','Marta Gomez Cortijo',30508,202894,'Tour Pengelipuran - Besakih Temple - Kerta Gosa','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-04','2024-10-04','Jacob','Febrina',2,'Persons (2)',1680000.00,'Our wonderful tour starts from Kehen Temple. It is an ancient Hindu temple complex boasting unique architectural features. The staircases reaching from the ground to temple courtyard are carved sandstone mythical animal and Balinese folklore figure statues and also the central vestibule. The temple’s walls are also ornate with Chinese porcelain plates, which are a tribute to the historical relations between the local Bali kingdom and China. Afterwards, we continue to Penglipuran, a village that succeeded in preserving its 75-hectare bamboo forest located in the northern part of the village. Members of this village have a strong commitment to the system of \'Ayahan Desa\' - a philosophy committed to respecting the land on which the village stands. To concludes the day, we stop by at Tukad Cepung Waterfall. Well-guarded by the circular cliffs, this waterfall is difficult to locate for the first time visitor. The circular cliffs give you the feeling of being in a cave, while the open sky right from where the waterfall emerges, gives you the most enchanting view. The sunlight falls on the glistering waterfall creating a rainbow, which feels as though it is projected right up to you. If you have never seen water flowing from the sky, then this would be your chance! After spending your time there, we go back to your hotel.',NULL,'FD Tour Pengelipuran - Besakih Temple - Kerta Gosa, with Spanish speaking guide','{\"date\": \"2024-10-04\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Pengosekan, Mas, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali. Phone: +62361 9085030 / +62877 47926655\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Green Field Resort Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-04\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Pengosekan, Mas, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali. Phone: +62361 9085030 / +62877 47926655\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Green Field Resort Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5206557,'675','Marta Gomez Cortijo',30508,202894,'Melukat in Taman Beji Griya','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-06','2024-10-06','Jacob','Febrina',2,'Persons (2)',1680000.00,'Our wonderful tour starts from Kehen Temple. It is an ancient Hindu temple complex boasting unique architectural features. The staircases reaching from the ground to temple courtyard are carved sandstone mythical animal and Balinese folklore figure statues and also the central vestibule. The temple’s walls are also ornate with Chinese porcelain plates, which are a tribute to the historical relations between the local Bali kingdom and China. Afterwards, we continue to Penglipuran, a village that succeeded in preserving its 75-hectare bamboo forest located in the northern part of the village. Members of this village have a strong commitment to the system of \'Ayahan Desa\' - a philosophy committed to respecting the land on which the village stands. To concludes the day, we stop by at Tukad Cepung Waterfall. Well-guarded by the circular cliffs, this waterfall is difficult to locate for the first time visitor. The circular cliffs give you the feeling of being in a cave, while the open sky right from where the waterfall emerges, gives you the most enchanting view. The sunlight falls on the glistering waterfall creating a rainbow, which feels as though it is projected right up to you. If you have never seen water flowing from the sky, then this would be your chance! After spending your time there, we go back to your hotel.',NULL,'Melukat in Taman Beji Griya, with Spanish speaking guide','{\"date\": \"2024-10-06\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Pengosekan, Mas, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali. Phone: +62361 9085030 / +62877 47926655\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Green Field Resort Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-06\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Pengosekan, Mas, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali. Phone: +62361 9085030 / +62877 47926655\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Green Field Resort Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5206568,'675','Marta Gomez Cortijo',30508,202881,'Tour Kanto Lampo Waterfall - Tibumana Waterfall - Tirta Empul - Gunung Kawi','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-07','2024-10-07','Jacob','Febrina',2,'Persons (2)',1692000.00,'We begin the tour from a beautiful rice terrace of Jatiluwih. Unfolding from the foot of mountain until the coastal side, it is one of places in Bali with the beautiful view, as according to its name “Jati” and “Luwih”, where Jati mean really and Luwih meaning especial, good, and beautiful or the equivalent. The local paddies are planted in this place look typically of the high relative size plant if it is compared with other pre-eminent paddy planted by most farmers in Bali. Stroll around the area for a while and take a nice pictures, before we continue to Banyumala Twin Waterfall. The waterfall is special in that there are two flows of water to be seen, hence the name ‘twin’. Water cascades down steep rocks with gorgeous greenery surrounding them. Here you can take a refreshing dip in the plunge pool at the bottom - dunk your head and listen to the sounds of the water crashing down. After the refreshment, we conclude our day by heading to Wanagiri Hidden Hill. This hill has a charm of beauty that can make anyone who saw her feel hypnotized and fell in love Beautiful natural paintings depicting the beautiful mountains, the beautiful green trees, and the expanse of the lake can be seen clearly from this place. In addition to the panoramic view, cool and fresh air is also an added value that makes this tourist area worth visiting. Take photos and enjoy the scenery and then we head back to your hotel.',NULL,'FD Tour Kanto Lampo Waterfall - Tibumana Waterfall - Tirta Empul - Gunung Kawi, with Spanish speaking guide','{\"date\": \"2024-10-07\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Pengosekan, Mas, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali. Phone: +62361 9085030 / +62877 47926655\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Green Field Resort Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-07\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Pengosekan, Mas, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali. Phone: +62361 9085030 / +62877 47926655\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Green Field Resort Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5206573,'675','Marta Gomez Cortijo',30508,202892,'Tour Goa Lawah - Lempuyang Temple - Tirta Gangga - Tenganan Village','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-09','2024-10-09','Jacob','Febrina',2,'Persons (2)',1872000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,'FD Tour Goa Lawah - Lempuyang Temple - Tirta Gangga - Tenganan Village, with Spanish speaking guide','{\"date\": \"2024-10-09\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Pengosekan, Mas, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali. Phone: +62361 9085030 / +62877 47926655\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Green Field Resort Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-09\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Pengosekan, Mas, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali. Phone: +62361 9085030 / +62877 47926655\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Green Field Resort Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5206579,'675','Marta Gomez Cortijo',30508,207379,'Ubud to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-10','2024-10-10','Jacob','Febrina',2,'Persons (2)',1200000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-10\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Pengosekan, Mas, Ubud, Gianyar, Bali. Phone: +62361 9085030 / +62877 47926655\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Green Field Resort Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-10\", \"text\": \"ETD 08:30 by Gili Gili Fast Boat to Gili Air.\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbor / https://goo.gl/maps/qRvTJixStazBCLAu8 (close to Serangan 1 Homestay Padangbai)\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5206592,'675','Marta Gomez Cortijo',32502,215361,'The Leaf Room','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-10-10','2024-10-14','Jacob','Febrina',1,'Double',26112000.00,'Experience the pinnacle of luxury and romance at The Leaf, Villa Tokay\'s enchanting honeymoon destination. With its stunning aerial architecture, meticulous attention to detail, and a warm, inviting ambiance, this breathtaking luxury villa promises an unforgettable experience for couples. With the accomodation size 150 m2, garden size 600 m2, and the bed type king size bed.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-10-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5206602,'675','Marta Gomez Cortijo',30805,208054,'LOP-CGK','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-14','2024-10-14','Jacob','Febrina',2,'Person',3960000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5206603,'675','Marta Gomez Cortijo',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-14','2024-10-15','Jacob','Febrina',1,'Double',840000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS Roundtrip Airport Transfer Flight details: ETA 18:35 by Super Air Jet IU767 from Lombok on 14 Oct ETD 18:30 by Qatar Airways QR957 to Doha on 15 Oct Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK-IN. FM7 Hotel Airport Pickup Service: +62811-8815-053 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-10-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5206655,'677','Mr. Craig Milwain',31024,203296,'Studio 30 Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-18','2024-09-19','Ayu','Eddy',1,'Single',1064000.00,'Our 81 units Studio 30 Room with 30 sqm of room area, adopts kites as it\'s main concept. This room is a canvas that showcases thought-provoking artworks by some of the most relevant Bali-based contemporary artists. This air-conditioned studio features a 49\" inch LED TV, high speed internet Wi-Fi, 24 hours in-room service, iPod dock, dolce gusto coffee maker, a minibar, en-suite bathroom comes with a shower, a hairdryer, free toiletries, and many more.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5206656,'677','Mr. Craig Milwain',30508,212287,'Airport to Sanur','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-18','2024-09-18','Ayu','Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-18\", \"text\": \"Flight information: ETA 17.35 by Qatar QR962 from Doha on 18 Sept 2024\", \"time\": \"17:35\", \"locality\": \"Ngurah Rai Airport\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-18\", \"text\": \"ARTOTEL Sanur - Bali Address: Jl. Kusuma Sari No.1, Sanur, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali 80227 Phone: (0361) 4721000\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5206686,'678','Javier Alarcos',30508,202890,'Mount Batur Sunrise Trekking Tour','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-11','2024-09-11','Nicholas','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',1200000.00,'Enjoy trek or climb Mount Batur and see the sunrise from the top of Batur Volcano. The Batur Volcano is one of the sacred mountain according to Hindu believe. We will get in ahead of schedule morning around 02.00 am depend the area of you stay, and afterward we specifically going to Mount Batur starting point. Starting in the dark under starlight sky, you will be guided to ascend the slope of Mount Batur. You will approach the peak of Mount Batur (1717 meters) at about 06.00 am. While waiting for the sunrise you will have a simple breakfast and hot coffee or tea served by your guide in Mount Batur. Witness the breathtaking sunrise overlooking the majestic view of Lake Batur and Mount Rinjani. After witnessing the sunrise, continue for our descent, at about 9 am, you will be arriving at the finishing point.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-11\", \"text\": \"Jalan Raya Ubud, ung Sari Gallery and Homestay, di depan Griya Restauran, 80571 Ubud, Indonesia) [Phone: +62812 36701297)].\", \"time\": \"02:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kampung Sari Homestay, Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-11\", \"text\": \"Jalan Raya Ubud, ung Sari Gallery and Homestay, di depan Griya Restauran, 80571 Ubud, Indonesia) [Phone: +62812 36701297)].\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kampung Sari Homestay, Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5206694,'679','Victor Pradas',30508,202890,'Mount Batur Sunrise Trekking Tour','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-16','2024-08-16','Nicholas','Komang',4,'Persons (4)',2400000.00,'Enjoy trek or climb Mount Batur and see the sunrise from the top of Batur Volcano. The Batur Volcano is one of the sacred mountain according to Hindu believe. We will get in ahead of schedule morning around 02.00 am depend the area of you stay, and afterward we specifically going to Mount Batur starting point. Starting in the dark under starlight sky, you will be guided to ascend the slope of Mount Batur. You will approach the peak of Mount Batur (1717 meters) at about 06.00 am. While waiting for the sunrise you will have a simple breakfast and hot coffee or tea served by your guide in Mount Batur. Witness the breathtaking sunrise overlooking the majestic view of Lake Batur and Mount Rinjani. After witnessing the sunrise, continue for our descent, at about 9 am, you will be arriving at the finishing point.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": \"Address: Jl. Raya Mas No.180, MAS, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"02:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Griya Bramasa,Ubud.\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": \"Address: Jl. Raya Mas No.180, MAS, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Griya Bramasa,Ubud.\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5206746,'679','Victor Pradas',30508,213032,'Ubud to Kusamba','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-17','2024-08-17','Nicholas','Komang',4,'Persons (4-6)',3360000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-17\", \"text\": \"Address: Jl. Raya Mas No.180, MAS, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Griya Bramasa,Ubud.\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-17\", \"text\": \"ETD : 08.00 by The Angkal Fastboat from Kusamba to Nusa Penida on 17 Aug 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kusamba Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5206762,'679','Victor Pradas',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-08-17','2024-08-17','Nicholas','Komang',4,'Persons (4)',1200000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-17\", \"text\": \"ETA : 08.20 by The Angkal Fastboat from Kusamba on 17 Aug\", \"time\": \"08:20\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sampalan Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-17\", \"text\": \"ETD : 16.00 by The Angkal Fastboat to Kusamba on 17 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sampalan Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5206765,'680','Mrs. Marta Sgroi',30783,201660,'[1D Yogyakarta Tour] Borobudur Temple - Prambanan Temple','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-10','2024-09-10','Jacob','Praba',2,'Persons (2)',3060000.00,'At the scheduled time, your guide will pick you up to begin your tour to the Borobudur Temple (Candi Borobudur) the great Stupa, the largest Buddhist monument in the world and one of the seven wonders. We will tour around the temple, observe the hundreds and centenary statues of Buddha and witness how dozens of Buddhists come to preach from all over the world. Historically, it was built during the relatively brief Sailendra dynasty of Central Java between 778 and 856 BC and is in constant restoration due to the breaks that the tremors of the neighbouring Merapi volcano has been producing during its history. After visiting the most important Buddhist temple in Southeast Asia, you continue our journey to the heart of the city. You will visit the Keraton known as the Sultan’s Palace. The palace is a complex building two centuries old, located in the heart of the city. You will hear the song of the “freedom” of the birds in the bird market, you will visit the “Water Castle” that occupies the highest part at the northern end of the vast complex of Taman Sari and Malioboro Street, main street of Yogyakarta, with its merchants, horse carriages, taxi-bikes and markets. An incredible experience that will make the hours fly by. After this unforgettable day and take to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-10\", \"text\": \"Jl. Prawirotaman 2 No.839 B, Brontokusuman, Kec. Mergangsan, Kota Yogyakarta, Daerah Istimewa Yogyakarta\", \"time\": \"07:00\", \"locality\": \"Gallery Prawirotaman Hotel\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-10\", \"text\": \"ETD 18:10PM\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Yogyakarta International Airport\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5206830,'682','Francisco Lopez Noguera',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-16','2024-09-16','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-16\", \"text\": \"ETA 22.40 by Qatar QR960 from Doha on 16 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-16\", \"text\": \"Br. Tanggayuda, Kedewatan, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Tanggayuda\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5206843,'682','Francisco Lopez Noguera',30710,200849,'Premiere Valley Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-09-16','2024-09-20','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',20372800.00,'Private one-bedroom pavilion with spectacular views of the Oos River’s valley. In the 196 sq-meters area, recharged and refreshed within the villa’s intimate setting and understated interiors.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-09-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5206845,'682','Francisco Lopez Noguera',30508,215968,'Tegalalang - Luwak Coffee - Tirta Empul - Kintamani - Besakih Temple','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-17','2024-09-17','Guio','Tami',2,'Person (1)',2128000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-17\", \"text\": \"Br. Tanggayuda, Kedewatan, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Tanggayuda\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5206847,'682','Francisco Lopez Noguera',30508,215968,'Leke leke Waterfall - Ulun Danu Bratan Temple - Munduk Waterfall','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-18','2024-09-18','Guio','Tami',2,'Person (1)',1904000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-18\", \"text\": \"Br. Tanggayuda, Kedewatan, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Tanggayuda\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5206850,'682','Francisco Lopez Noguera',30508,207379,'Ubud to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-20','2024-09-20','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-20\", \"text\": \"Br. Tanggayuda, Kedewatan, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Tanggayuda\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-20\", \"text\": \"ETD 08.00 to Gili Air by Blue Water Express on 20 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5206861,'681','Mrs. Mary Ann Stanger',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-10','2024-09-11','Nicholas','Praba',1,'Double',882000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Flight Details: 10 September 2024 ETA 15:40PM by Garuda Indonesia GA879 from Seoul 11 September 2025 ETD 06:00AM by Batik Air ID6202 to Pangkalan Bun Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK-IN. FM7 Hotel Airport Pickup Service: +62811-8815-053 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-09-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5206863,'682','Francisco Lopez Noguera',32602,215975,'One Bedroom Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-09-20','2024-09-24','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',24416000.00,'Each room offers the same comfort: one bedroom villas with terrace, swimming pool, kitchenette and office space, comfortable sunbeds, lovely coconut garden. Particular care to the quality of the beddings, the home stylist Valérie Barkowski has added her touch of originality with a predominant colour selection of orange, grey, red, green, bordeaux or black. Choose your holiday colour!',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-09-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5206865,'683','Ana Garcia Balcazar',31196,204658,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-24','2024-08-25','Melysa','Komang',2,'Double + Twin',3690000.00,'Room type deluxe, with spacious room 3,41 m x 6,09 m and have type bed king size or twin bed. This type of room is available on the 2nd, 3rd and 4th floors and has of the hills view.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5206876,'681','Mrs. Mary Ann Stanger',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-09-11','2024-09-13','Nicholas','Praba',2,'Persons (2)',10800000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan isCape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continueto add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-11\", \"text\": \"ETA 07:15AM by Batik Air ID6202 from Jakarta\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Bandar Udara Iskandar Pangkalan Bun\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-13\", \"text\": \"ETD 10:25AM by Batik Air ID6303 to Semarang\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Bandar Udara Iskandar Pangkalan Bun\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5206880,'683','Ana Garcia Balcazar',30714,200657,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-25','2024-08-26','Melysa','Komang',2,'Double + Twin',3326400.00,'Room area : 24 square meters. Our Deluxe Rooms are designed for modern travellers who seek comfort on a short stay in Ijen area. With its spacious rooms of 24 meters square with either a king size or deluxe twin beds, maximum occupancy is 2 adults. Equipped with one shower bathroom, LED TV 32\" with satelite channel, and air conditioning.',NULL,'Please send the guarantee letter/voucher following procedure below: - 30 (thirty) days reservation notice prior to the arrival date for Normal Period. - 45 (forty-five) days reservation notice prior to the arrival date for High Season (June 1th to August 31st) and Peak Season (D-3 to D+4 Idul Fitri (April 18 - 25th, 2023 and December 21st, 2023 to January 5th, 2024) period. - Otherwise, the cancellation policy will be applied.','{\"date\": \"2024-08-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5206891,'681','Mrs. Mary Ann Stanger',30783,201525,'4D3N Semarang - Yogyakarta City Tour - Borobudur - Prambanan - Candirejo - Mt. Merapi with Jeep / A.','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-09-13','2024-09-16','Nicholas','Praba',2,'Persons (2 / Double)',13890000.00,'D1 Arrival Yogyakarta International Airport – Transfer to hotel: Welcome to the cradle of Indonesian culture, Yogyakarta. A tourist destination for its ancient palaces, temples, batik workshops, gamelan music orchestras, court dances and wayang puppet shows. Upon your arrival in Yogyakarta a representative of come2indonesia will be waiting for you with a sign indicating your name to take you to your hotel and the rest of the day is for you. D2 Borobudur temple – Candirejo Village Tour by Horse cart / bicycle – Merapi lava tour Including Jeep: You will have your deserved breakfast at the hotel. Today’s tour will make you enjoy the authentic Javanese essence. You will start your route in the direction of with the Borobudur Temple (Candi Borobudur), the great Stupa, the largest Buddhist monument in the world and one of the seven wonders. We will tour around the temple, observe the hundreds and centenary statues of Buddha and witness how dozens of Buddhists come to preach from all over the world. Historically it was established during the relatively brief Sailendra dynasty of Central Java between 778 and 856 BC and is in constant restoration due to the breaks that the tremors of the neighbouring Merapi volcano has been producing during its history. After visiting one of the most important Buddhist temples in Southeast Asia, and in a horse carriage (Andong) we will visit the villages that surround this temple. These are authentic Javanese villages where culture and tradition are the protagonists. As you spend your days in this country and go around the different islands, you will realize how different Indonesians are among them in terms of clothing, food, architecture and even language. Today we will learn about and share these Javanese places. Then we will go to Kaliurang / Kalidalem to see Mount Merapi in constant activity. Here in a 4x4 jeep driven by specialized drivers, we will climb its skirt to see the remains of the 2010 eruption such as houses buried by ashes, a multitude of objects paralyzed by lava, etc. In addition, an open-air tribute museum presided over by the clock that marks the time just when the lava passed through it has been improvised. Accompanied by photos of the rescue, it will make us feel very closely the experiences of that fateful day. After finishing this day full of emotions, we will take you back to your hotel. D3 City Tour Jogjakarta Visit Sultan Palace, Watercastle and Bird Market – Prambanan Temple: After breakfast and at the indicated time we will head towards the heart of the city. We will visit the Keraton known as the Sultan’s Palace. The palace is a complex building two centuries old, located in the heart of the city. You will hear the song of the “freedom” of the birds in the bird market, we will visit the “Water Castle” that occupies the highest part at the northern end of the vast complex of Taman Sari, Malioboro Street, main street of Yogyakarta, with its merchants, horse carriages, taxi-bikes and markets. An incredible experience that will make the hours fly by. After finishing the tour in the center of the city of Yogyakarta, we will go to the northeast direction Candi Prambanan, the temple of the Hinduists and classified as a World Heritage Site by Unesco since 1991. The built of this temple was finished around the year 856 to commemorate the victory of the descendant Sanjaya of Siva, Rikai Pikatan on the last sovereign Sailendra of Central Java. Take your time to enjoy each carving on the rocks and feel the spirituality that each of the stones perched in this set of more than 200 Hindu temples that are dedicated to the Trimurti, the expression of God as the Creator, the Preserver and the Destroyer. After this unforgettable day, we will take you to your hotel. D4 Transfer out Yogyakarta International airport: Today our adventure ends at the cradle of Indonesian culture. Depending on the time of your flight, we will pick you up to take you to the airport and take the flight to your next destination. End of our services. Thank you very much for exploring Yogyakarta by the hand of Come2indonesia.',NULL,'1309/Day 01: Arrival Yogyakarta via Semarang 1409/Day 02: Borobudur - Candirejo - Merapi Tour 1509/Day 03: Yogyakarta City Tour - Prambanan 1609/Day 04: Transfer out YIA','{\"date\": \"2024-09-13\", \"text\": \"ETA 11:25AM by Batik Air ID6303 from Pangkalan Bun\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Bandar Udara Jendral Ahmad Yani Semarang\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-16\", \"text\": \"ETD15:00PM by Garuda Indonesia GA252 to Denpasar\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Yogyakarta International Airport\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5206900,'683','Ana Garcia Balcazar',31015,203232,'3D2N - Surabaya Mount Bromo Ijen Tour Package drop Bali','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-08-24','2024-08-26','Melysa','Komang',4,'Persons (4)',11520000.00,NULL,NULL,'Hotel in Bromo : Lereng Bromo Hotel Hotel in Ijen : Jiwa Jawa Ijen Hotel in Bali : Sapodilla Ubud','{\"date\": \"2024-08-24\", \"text\": \"ETA : 10.00 by Batik Air ID6134 from Pangkalan Bun on 24 Aug 2024\", \"time\": \"10:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Juanda Airport, Surabaya\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-26\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, MAS, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: 0821-4607-7477\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sapodilla Ubud, Bali\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5206905,'681','Mrs. Mary Ann Stanger',30696,202104,'Kelimutu Deluxe Suite + One Way Airport Transfer','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-19','2024-09-20','Nicholas','Praba',1,'Double',3720000.00,'Opening the aura of relaxation while connecting with the beauty of nature. Restoring a sense of longing for a soul-soothing green landscape is the main reason this suite was built. A rustic themed room with a minimalist touch. Aura of relaxation is felt once you first open the two-panel wooden door wide enough to let that tropical wind roll into the room. Directly facing the opposite of the wide balcony, the green landscape is ready to calm your soul. Our Kelimutu Deluxe Suite has 32 units, 16 lower level suites (44 sqm), overlooking to the garden from private terrace and 16 upper level suite (40 sqm) with private balcony and tropical garden view. This suite is equipped with luxurious king-sized and twin bed, efficient and sustainable air-conditioning, 43\" smart TV, complimentary wireless internet, safe deposit box, water heater, private bathroom with bathroom amenities, hairdryer, bathrobe, daily turndown service, and many more.',NULL,'Airport Transfer on 19 September 2024 ETA 13:10 by Batik Air ID6331 from Denpasar','{\"date\": \"2024-09-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5206926,'681','Mrs. Mary Ann Stanger',31083,212374,'3D2N LOB Rinca - Padar - Komodo Island Tour (Medium Standard Boat)','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-09-20','2024-09-22','Nicholas','Praba',2,'Persons (2)',29196000.00,'TOUR ITINERARY Highlights: Menjarite, Kelor, Strawberry Rock, Kalong, Rinca, Padar, Komodo Island, Pink Beach, Taka Makassar, Manta Point, Kanawa, B.Cermin Mirror Cave DAY 1 : DENPASAR - LABUAN BAJO - MENJARITE - KELOR - KALONG ISLAND Arrival at Komodo Airport in Labuan Bajo west Flores, meeting service with our tour guide and transfer to the pier of Labuan Bajo for Rinca Island. It’s about 2 hours sail to the island of Komodo Dragon, stop at Menjarite island for snorkeling then continue to Rinca island-the Island of Komodo dragon, you will find not just e Dragons but also many wild animals like, deer, wild buffalo, long-tailed macaque and wild pig also numerous of birds. Keep your eyes look up as sometime you will find the young Komodo dragons on the trees. A local ranger will lead you through this natural preservation. Late afternoon sailing directly to Kalong Rinca Island to see the hundreds of fling foxes set out from the mangrove tree at 06-07pm, the lovely sunset from the boat trip really enjoyable. Lunch and dinner on boat. Meals : Lunch - Dinner DAY 2 : KALONG - PADAR - KOMODO - PINK BEACH - MANTA POINT - TAKA MAKASSAR - SEBAYUR After having breakfast in your boat, heading to Padar Island, taking trek to Padar Island until having the top view point to get breathtaking scenery of three bays around, Padar Island hike in Komodo has some of the most amazing views in Indonesia, trek to downhill and back to the Boat for sailing directly to Loh Liang – the Ranger station in Komodo Island. By passing through many small islands, After registering start to take basic trekking to see the GIANT RIZARD / KOMODO DRAGON and other wild animals as: Timor deer, wild pig, wild chicken and many variously of tropical bird. Please keep your look at any directions as sometimes you will also find young Komodo dragon hanging over the trees. A local ranger will be led you during the trek. Return to the boat on to Pink beach for snorkeling, swimming and relaxing. It is really spectacular and unspoiled coral reef and many color fish. This is one of best side for snorkeling diving. Sail toward MANTA POINT to exploring Huge Mantas by snorkeling even watching from your boat trip (can’t be guaranteed if weather is not good, like wave and current are strongly) visit also the taka Makassar its really tiny island with white sand beach really enjoyable to relaxing or beach walking then heading to Sebayur island, overnight dinner on boat. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner DAY 3 : SEBAYUR - KANAWA ISLANDS - LABUAN BAJO - DENPASAR After breakfast on the boat, taking swimming, snorkeling and relaxing as well at seraya and Kanawa. Then back to Labuan Bajo to continue your next excursion with visiting the Batu Cermin (Mirror Stone) Cave. The grotto is 75 by 75 meters large, and contains stalactites and stalagmites. Some tunnels are narrow and dark but in others sunlight falls. Then local market before taking you to the airport for flight to Denpasar. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch Attention: The itinerary is subject to change due to the weather, tide level and operating conditions without prior notice.',NULL,'Connecting flight to International ETD 21:50PM by KE628 to Seoul 2009/ Day 01: Labuan Bajo – Menjarite – Kelor – Kalong Island 2109/ Day 02: Padar – Komodo - Pink Beach – Manta Point – Sebayur Island 2209/ Day 03: Sebayur – Kanawa - Labuan Bajo – Airport','{\"date\": \"2024-09-20\", \"text\": \"Jl. Pantai Pede No.Km. 3, Labuan Bajo, Kabupaten Manggarai Barat\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": \"Sudamala Resort Komodo\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-22\", \"text\": \"ETD 15:25PM by Garuda Indonesia GA453 to Jakarta\", \"time\": null, \"