'Double',6120000.00,'Enjoying courtyard and city view from a private balcony in room area of 270 sq ft (25 m²) with a queen bed and 2 twin beds with a capacity of 2 persons. Equipped with unlimited complimentary WIFI Internet connection, 32\" flat-screen TV, air conditioning, safe deposit box, and minibar with additional charge. Enjoy an en suite marble bathroom with a walk-in rain shower, bathrobe, slippers, and free toiletries are provided for your comfort. Non-smoking rooms available upon request and daily turndown service is available.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5207625,'684','Maria Cruz',30665,200975,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-11','2024-08-12','Rendy','Tami',2,'Double',7368000.00,'A wonderful accommodation for a luxurious stay with an area of 30 sqm, magnificent view and features one king-sized bed with a capacity of 2 adults, private bathroom with shower room and access to sharing living room.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5207626,'684','Maria Cruz',30682,200893,'Villa\'s Deluxe','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-12','2024-08-13','Rendy','Tami',2,'Double',5556000.00,'Villa Deluxe with 42 sqm room area. 23 rooms available (13 double + 10 twin), single and twin beds available with a capacity of 2 people per room. see the greatest view in Ijen Mountain. See the magic of the blue fire at night. Sophisticated design in Ijen Resort and Villas, in Banyuwangi, East Java. You can see the best view from your room, the rice field, mountains.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5207673,'686','Mr. Sebastian Saorin Boti',30783,201478,'3D2N Best of Yogyakarta City Tour / Land Arrangement only','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-09-24','2024-09-26','Jacob','Praba',2,'Persons (2)',6480000.00,'D1 : Arrival Yogyakarta International Airport - Prambanan Temple Welcome to the cradle of Indonesian culture, Yogyakarta. A tourist destination for its ancient palaces, temples, batik workshops, gamelan music orchestras, court dances and wayang puppet shows. Upon your arrival in Yogyakarta a representative of come2indonesia will be waiting for you with a sign indicating your name to take you to your hotel and the rest of the day is for you. We will head northeast towards Candi Prambanan, the temple of the Hinduists and classified as a World Heritage Site by Unesco since 1991. The built of this temple was finished around the year 856 to commemorate the victory of the descendant Sanjaya of Siva, Rikai Pikatan on the last sovereign Sailendra of Central Java. Take your time to enjoy each carving on the rocks and feel the spirituality that each of the stones perched in this set of more than 200 Hindu temples that are dedicated to the Trimurti, the expression of God as the Creator, the Preserver and the Destroyer. D2 : Borobudur Temple include Mendut and Pawon - City Tour visit Sultan Palace, Watercastle and Bird Market At the scheduled time, your guide will pick you up to begin your tour to the Borobudur Temple (Candi Borobudur), the great Stupa, the largest Buddhist monument in the world and one of the seven wonders. We will tour around the temple, observe the hundreds and centenary statues of Buddha and witness how dozens of Buddhists come to preach from all over the world. Historically it was established during the relatively brief Sailendra dynasty of Central Java between 778 and 856 BC and is in constant restoration due to the breaks that the tremors of the neighbouring Merapi volcano has been producing during its history. After visiting one of the most important Buddhist temples in Southeast Asia, we continue our journey to the heart of the city. We will visit the Keraton known as the Sultan’s Palace. The palace is a complex building two centuries old, located in the heart of the city. You will hear the song of the “freedom” of the birds in the bird market, we will visit the “Water Castle” that occupies the highest part at the northern end of the vast complex of Taman Sari, Malioboro Street, main street of Yogyakarta, with its merchants, horse carriages, taxi-bikes and markets. An incredible experience that will make the hours fly by. D3 : Transfer Out Yogyakarta International Airport We will pick you up to take you to the airport and take the flight to your next destination. End of our services. Thank you very much for exploring Yogyakarta by the hand of Come2indonesia.',NULL,'24 Sep 2024: Transfer from Semarang to Hotel Melia Purosani Yogyakarta (driver only) 25 Sep 2024: Borobudur - City Tour - Prambanan (with Spanish Speaking Guide) 26 Sep 2024: Transfer from Melia Purosani to YIA (driver only)','{\"date\": \"2024-09-24\", \"text\": \"ETA 11:25 by Batik Air ID6303 from Pangkalan Bun\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Bandar Udara Ahmad Yani Semarang\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-26\", \"text\": \"ETD 12:15 by Lion Air JT3560 to Denpasar\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Yogyakarta International Airport\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5207698,'685','Paul Mistler',31175,219000,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-13','2024-09-14','Purnomo','Komang',1,'Double',728000.00,NULL,NULL,'Flight Schedule : ETD: 09:40 from Saumlaki by Wings Air IW1515 on 14 Sep.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-14\"