ea maker, hair dryer, safe and an iron/ironing board to make you feel at home.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5208728,'694','Fernando Clark',30562,213407,'Guest Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-13','2024-08-14','Melysa','Tami',4,'2 Double + 2 Twin',4256000.00,'40-inch HDTV, complimentary WiFi, desk with ergonomic chair, mini-fridge Relax in this spacious and stylish 30 sq. m./322 sq. ft. guest room. Enjoy a restful night\'s sleep in one of the two twin Perfect Sleeper by Serta® beds which provide the perfect balance between comfort and support. Work in comfort at the spacious desk with ergonomic chair. Relax and watch a program on the 40-inch HDTV or surf the web with complimentary standard WiFi. This room also features a mini-fridge, adjustable air-conditioning, coffee/tea maker, hair dryer, safe and an iron/ironing board to make you feel at home.',NULL,'Bed type and any other request will be determined based on subject to availability on arrival','{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5208772,'694','Fernando Clark',30508,207254,'Kuta to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-11','2024-08-11','Melysa','Tami',2,'Persons (4-6)',1568000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": \"Jl. Airport Ngurah Rai No.7, Tuban, Kec. Kuta, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": \"12:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Hilton Garden Inn Bali Ngurah Rai Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Tegallalang, Br. Tengah, Kec. Tegallalang, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80561\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sanna Ubud A Pramana Experience\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5208779,'694','Fernando Clark',30508,207262,'Ubud to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-14','2024-08-14','Melysa','Tami',3,'Persons (4-6)',2352000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Tegallalang, Br. Tengah, Kec. Tegallalang, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80561\", \"time\": \"04:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sanna Ubud A Pramana Experience\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": \"ETD 08.00 by Batik Air ID6333 to Labuan Bajo on 14 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5208838,'694','Fernando Clark',30508,212289,'Airport to Nusa Dua','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-20','2024-08-20','Melysa','Tami',3,'Persons (4-6)',2016000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-20\", \"text\": \"ETA 11.05 by Batik Air ID6332 from Labuan Bajo on 20 Aug\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-20\", \"text\": \"Kawasan Wisata Nusa Dua Lot S-3, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Merusaka Nusa Dua\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5208872,'694','Fernando Clark',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-21','2024-08-21','Melysa','Tami',14,'Persons (7-10)',8075200.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": \"Kawasan Wisata Nusa Dua Lot S-3, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Merusaka Nusa Dua\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5208892,'694','Fernando Clark',30508,218203,'Nusa Dua to Serangan','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-24','2024-08-24','Melysa','Tami',2,'Persons (4-6)',1344000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"07:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Merusaka Nusa Dua\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-24\", \"text\": \"08.30AM Arrive at Serangan harbor for registration before sailing\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Serangan Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5208900,'696','Trung Doan',30508,202864,'Ubud and Surrounding Tour','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-10','2024-08-10','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Persons (2)',1691200.00,'We will be picking you up from your hotel to enjoy the wealth of art in Ubud. First we will visit Monkey Forest; the Ubud Monkey Forest is a nature reserve and temple complex in Ubud, Bali. It houses approximately 340 Crab-eating Macaque (Macacafas cicularis) monkeys. The Monkey Forest contains the Pura Dalem Agung Padangtegal temple as well as a \"Holy Spring\" bathing temple and another temple used for cremation ceremonies. Next we go to Ubud Traditional Art Market where the existence is not far different from other markets available in the tourism area. This market as a society economics center of Ubud and it is apposite to the existence of Ubud Empire that is called Puri Saren. Our last destination is Gua Gajah (Elephant Cave). This cave is built at crevasse edge from the federation of 2 rills that is called Pangkung River, where the irrigation is mixed with Petanu River flow. The word of Gua Gajah is anticipated coming from the word of Lwa Gajah, the name of Buddhist Temple or hermitage for Buddhist monk. There is a relief which is almost looking like the form of mountain on the entrance of this cave. It was carved many designed on the relief like grove with the stick, close leaf, animal for example forest pig, tortoise and specters. The cave mouth is decorated by the bas-relief with the eye turn around to the right or west side. At the end of tour we will transferred back you to the hotel.',NULL,'ITINERARY: MONKEY FOREST - UBUD TRADITIONAL MARKET - GOA GAJAH','{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": \"Please be ready in hotel lobby at the mentioned time.\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"Bali Beach Hotel Sanur\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Bali Beach Hotel Sanur\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5208962,'694','Fernando Clark',33174,219070,'Lembongan/Penida Day Cruise','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-24','2024-08-24','Melysa','Tami',1,'Persons (14)',22176000.00,NULL,NULL,'Program: Day Trip Nusa Lembongan Time: 08.30 am - 05.00 pm','{\"date\": \"2024-08-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5208971,'694','Fernando Clark',30914,202451,'Deluxe Pool Access','Confirmed',NULL,6,'2024-08-20','2024-08-26','Melysa','Tami',4,'Double',63168000.00,'At 51 sqm with king and twin size beds capacity of 2 (two) adults and 2 (two) child below 12 years old. Ideal for family or group of friends traveling together, the Deluxe Pool Access rooms allows guests a direct access from a private balcony to a communal pool shared with several other Deluxe Pool Access rooms, making it easy to have a refreshing swim.',NULL,'Bed type and any other request will be determined based on subject to availability on arrival','{\"date\": \"2024-08-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5208972,'559','Christian Lorente Family',31158,204473,'VIP Service Fast Track International Arrival by Galih (Not Inc. VOA)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-10','2024-08-10','Guio','Febrina',1,'Person (1)',1080000.00,'Arrival International: Pick up at before immigration area.',NULL,'Flight detail: ETA: 17.35h by Turkish Airlines TK56 from Istanbul on 10 Aug Fast Track International Arrival Your personal assistant will be waiting for you before the Visa-on-Arrival desk and the immigration area (near transfer desk/duty-free plaza), holding a sign of your name. They will assist you with during all arriva