ONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-09-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5211325,'708','Pablo Alvarez Gonzalez',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-30','2024-09-30','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1747200.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-30\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Bisma\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5211329,'708','Pablo Alvarez Gonzalez',30508,207379,'Ubud to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-01','2024-10-01','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-01\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Bisma\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-01\", \"text\": \"ETD 08.30 by Gili Gili Fast Boat to Gili Air on 01 Oct\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5211353,'708','Pablo Alvarez Gonzalez',30852,202033,'Villa Surya - One Bedroom Private Pool and Tropical Garden','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-10-01','2024-10-04','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',9072000.00,'Our cozy one bed Villa Surya is perfect for a solo traveler or a romantic getaway at 150 sqm private property. The spacious bedroom features a king-size bed with an extra thick mattress with 100% cotton linen, ensuring a blissful sleep. With high-ceilings, large windows, and a pivoting door onto your patio, the space is able to breathe whilst being basked in a beautiful, natural light. The ensuite bathroom, equipped with a bespoke basin area, rainfall shower, quality toiletries and 100% cotton towels leads out to the real star of this villa, the indulgent open-air bathtub. Large enough for two, with views of your private pool and tropical garden, while away hours in pure relaxation.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-10-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5211393,'708','Pablo Alvarez Gonzalez',30508,207386,'Padang Bai to Seminyak','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-04','2024-10-04','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-04\", \"text\": \"ETA 12.30 by Gili Gili Fast Boat from Gili Air on 04 Oct\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-04\", \"text\": \"Jl. Camplung Tanduk No.10, Seminyak, Kec. Kuta, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Hotel Indigo Bali Seminyak Beach\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5211403,'708','Pablo Alvarez Gonzalez',30597,201143,'Standard Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-04','2024-10-05','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',3584000.00,'At 50 sqm room size, Standard Room an inviting hideaway in the heart of Seminyak. Tucked at the side of the resort building, this room is the perfect choice for a quiet hideaway in the heart of Seminyak. Providing an ample daylight from the private balcony with daybed, this room is eclectically designed, featuring a spa inspired ensuite bathroom. Treat your loved one to an unforgettable stay at one of the finest Seminyak beachfront resorts.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-10-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5211406,'708','Pablo Alvarez Gonzalez',30508,207270,'Seminyak to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-05','2024-10-05','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',224000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-05\", \"text\": \"Jl. Camplung Tanduk No.10, Seminyak, Kec. Kuta, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": \"14:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Hotel Indigo Bali Seminyak Beach\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-05\", \"text\": \"ETD 18.55 by IB79