in',1560000.00,'At 25 sqm of room size with 46 rooms available. This smart room category is more contemporary in appearance and comes with its own terrace or balcony. Minimalist furnishings are balanced by a neutral decor to soothe the senses and ensure restful slumber. Including a double bed (king or queen) or 2 single beds (twin) with maximum capacity of 2 adults + 1 child or 3 adults. The en-suite bathroom features a modern shower cubicle enclosed in glass together with a marble vanity.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5212340,'567','Mrs. Esther Roldan Rios',31139,219137,'Deluxe Pool View Room','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-09-18','2024-09-21','Jacob','Praba',1,'Double',2856000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5212540,'712','William Gnacek',31426,206252,'Private transfer from Airport Ambon to Swiss Bel Hotel Ambon','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-23','2024-09-23','Ayu','Ayu',1,'Person',0.00,NULL,NULL,'Private transfer from Airport Ambon to Swiss Bel Hotel Ambon on 23 September 2024 Flight information: ETA: 15.35 by Garuda Indonesia GA646 from Jakarta on 23 Sep','{\"date\": \"2024-09-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"15:35\", \"locality\": \"Pattimura Airport Ambon\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Swiss Bel Hotel Ambon\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5213612,'711','Seydou Sy',30508,212455,'Sanur to Sanur','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-16','2024-08-16','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": \"Please be ready in hotel lobby at the mentioned time.\", \"time\": \"07:00\", \"locality\": \"The Kanjeng Suites & Villas Sanur\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Sanur Harbor (D\'Camel Fast Ferry)\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5214142,'535','Enric Rovira',31015,211903,'3D2N - Bromo - drop Aiport Surabaya (Pick up Aiport Surabaya)','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-08-26','2024-08-29','Jacob','Eddy',3,'Persons (3)',5760000.00,NULL,NULL,'BROMO PTOGRAM: ETA: 26 AUG 17:35 IU725 By Super Air Jet DROP OFF : Kontena Hotel Address: Jl.KH Agus Salim No.106 Batu Malang, 65315 Batu, Indonesia Phone: +62341 5107888 ================================================ 27 august free ================================================ 28 AUGUST BORMO SUNRISE TOUR PICK UP : Kontena Hotel Address: Jl.KH Agus Salim No.106 Batu Malang, 65315 Batu, Indonesia Phone: +62341 5107888 DROP OFF :Premier Place Surabaya Airport Address: Jl. Raya Juanda No. 73, 61254 Sidoarjo, Indonesia Phone: +6231 8685555','{\"date\": \"2024-08-26\", \"text\": \"ETA: 26 AUG 17:35 IU725 By Super Air Jet\", \"time\": \"17:35\", \"locality\": \"AIRPORT SURABAYA\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-28\", \"text\": \"Premier Place Surabaya Airport Address: Jl. Raya Juanda No. 73, 61254 Sidoarjo, Indonesia Phone: +6231 8685555\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"SURABAYA HOTEL\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5214152,'166','Solitude Adventures Group',32922,218094,'The Signature Sea View','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-10','2024-09-11','Ayu','Tami',1,'Single',0.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5214157,'166','Solitude Adventures Group',32201,214478,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-10','2024-09-11','Ayu','Tami',1,'Single',1848000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5214159,'166','Solitude Adventures Group',32201,214478,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-10','2024-09-11','Ayu','Tami',1,'Single',1680000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5214190,'421','Scuba Point Travel Group',30508,202893,'Lempuyang Temple Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI11',1,'2024-08-29','2024-08-29','Ayu','Wiwik',1,'Person (1)',1512000.00,'At the agreed time, our guide will pick you up to start the tour in the eastern part of Bali. The first place you will visit is Goa Lawah Temple. Goa Lawah Temple consists of two names, \"Goa\" which means cave and \"Lawah\" which means bat. Several thousand bats are flying in the cave as the name suggests. With the lights fading as you go deeper inside the cave, it gives off a very strange atmosphere. From Goa Lawah, we continue our way to Lempuyang Temple. Upon arrival, the temple will greet you with its gratifying panorama that extends into infinity. On a clear, sunny day, you\'ll be able to gaze out over the mountains, Amlapura city, and Mount Agung, an incredibly magnificent sight that\'s beautiful beyond words. This portrait of heaven is beautifully framed by the Gapura Candi Bentar (the gate of the temple). Our journey continues to visit Tirta Gangga. The site is a paradise surrounded by water, with all the pools decorated with unusual statues. With its seclusion and a view of the surrounding rice paddies, Tirta Gangga is a wonderful place. At the end of the trip we go to Tenganan Village, the most famous Bali Agas (the “original” Bali people) in the city. With its characteristics, the city village is arranged in parallel along the wide main road paved with rows of cobblestones. In Tenganan, women still weave the famous Kamben Geringsing, or \"burnt cloth,\" which has the power to immunize the wearer against evil. We take a close look at what they do in their daily lives in a traditional lifestyle. From Tenganan, we will transfer you to the hotel.',NULL,'Lempuyang Temple Tour with English speaking guide Visiting: Goa Lawah - Lempuyang Temple - Tirta Gangga - Tenganan','{\"date\": \"2024-08-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": \"Holiday Inn Resort Baruna\", \"location\": \"Jl. Wana Segara No.33, Tuban, Kec. Kuta, Kabupaten Badung. Phone: (0361) 755577\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Holiday Inn Resort Baruna\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5214196,'421','Scuba Point Travel Group',30508,202890,'Mount Batur Sunrise Trekking Tour','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-30','2024-08-30','Ayu','Wiwik',1,'Person (1)',560000.00,'Enjoy trek or climb Mount Batur and see the sunrise from the top of Batur Volcano. The Batur Volcano is one of the sacred mountain according to Hindu believe. We will get in ahead of schedule morning around 02.00 am depend the area of you stay, and afterward we specifically going to Mount Batur starting point. Starting in the dark under starlight sky, you will be guided to ascend the slope of Mount Batur. You will approach the peak of Mount Batur (1717 meters) at about 06.00 am. While waiting for the sunrise you will have a simple breakfast and hot coffee or tea served by your guide in Mount Batur. Witness the breathtaking sunrise overlooking the majestic view of Lake Batur and Mount Rinjani. After witnessing the sunrise, continue for our descent, at about 9 am, you will be arriving at the finishing point.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"02:00\", \"locality\": \"Holiday Inn Resort Baruna\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Holiday Inn Resort Baruna\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5214200,'421','Scuba Point Travel Group',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-08-31','2024-08-31','Ayu','Wiwik',4,'Persons (1-5)',3584000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-31\", \"text\": \"Fast boat by Maruti from Sanur\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": \"Toya Pakeh Port, Nusa Penida\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-31\", \"text\": \"ETD Fast Boat 16.30 by Maruti to Sanur\", \"time\": \"16:00\", \"locality\": \"Toya Pakeh Port, Nusa Penida\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5214205,'421','Scuba Point Travel Group',30508,212305,'Kuta to Sanur','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-31','2024-08-31','Ayu','Wiwik',4,'Persons (1-4)',1120000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": \"Holiday Inn Resort Baruna\", \"location\": \"Jl. Wana Segara No.33, Tuban, Kec. Kuta, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361. Phone: (0361) 755577\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Sanur Port (Maruti Fastboat)\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5214210,'421','Scuba Point Travel Group',30508,212491,'Sanur to Kuta','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-31','2024-08-31','Ayu','Wiwik',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"17:00\", \"locality\": \"Sanur Port (Maruti Fasboat) from Nusa Penida\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Holiday Inn Resort Baruna\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5214218,'421','Scuba Point Travel Group',30508,202897,'Uluwatu Temple and Kecak Dance','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-31','2024-08-31','Ayu','Wiwik',4,'Persons (4)',2576000.00,'This half-day tour, is an exciting tour package to visit Padang-Padang Beach, Uluwatu Temple, the famous Balinese Hindu Temple in south part of Bali with breathtaking view of sunset and Indian Ocean. Uluwatu Temple is one of Balinese Hindu Temples located right on the petrifying hill with the crevasse exist in the right and left side. Uluwatu Temple is one of Sad Khayangan (6 biggest temple in Bali) owns magnificent view of the Indian Ocean and sunset as a backdrop. This temple is very amazing where the location is right on the narrow peninsula with deep seawater under it. This tour package is combined with the spectacular Balinese traditional dance performance of Kecak Dance. Balinese Kecak Dance is a spectacular traditional dance with the group of people playing this dance with fire game. It is very exciting and unique dance due to the sound of gamelan is not using the normal gamelan but use their mouth. The dancers make the compact choir with the exquisite dance movement that is one of this dance features. After the dance we returned back to the hotel or seafood restaurant in Jimbaran.',NULL,'Uluwatu Temple and Kecak Dance Visiting: Padang Padang - Uluwatu Temple - Kecak Dance Performance with English speaking guide','{\"date\": \"2024-08-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"14:00\", \"locality\": \"Holiday Inn Resort Baruna\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Holiday Inn Resort Baruna\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5214228,'421','Scuba Point Travel Group',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-01','2024-09-01','Ayu','Wiwik',8,'Persons (8)',5196800.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,'Bali Fantastic Route Tour with English speaking guide Visiting: Taman Ayun Temple - Jatiluwih - Ulun Danu Bratan Temple - Tanah Lot Temple','{\"date\": \"2024-09-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"Holiday Inn Resort Baruna\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Holiday Inn Resort Baruna\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5214367,'716','Ruben Lago Vazquez',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-11','2024-09-11','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-11\", \"text\": \"ETA 17.35 by IB7968 from Doha on 11 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-11\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5214394,'716','Ruben Lago Vazquez',30705,201148,'Premier Room Rice Field View','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-09-11','2024-09-15','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',6832000.00,'Gaze out at rippling rice fields as you let your stress slip away in one of our Premier Ricefield View suites. Inside you have smooth tiles, warm wooden accents, and all the modern comforts you could ask for. Step onto the balcony and you have an airy nook where you can witness life unfold in the Balinese countryside.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-09-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5214403,'716','Ruben Lago Vazquez',30508,215968,'Goa Gajah - Tampaksiring - Gunung Kawi Sebatu - Temple - Tegalalang','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-12','2024-09-12','Guio','Tami',2,'Person (1)',2128000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-12\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5214409,'716','Ruben Lago Vazquez',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-13','2024-09-13','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1747200.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on