Vazquez',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-09-15','2024-09-15','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',952000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-15\", \"text\": \"ETA 08.30 from Kusamba by The Angkal Fast Boat\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sampalan Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-15\", \"text\": \"Banjar Angkal, Suana, Kec. Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Angkal Resort Nusa Penida Bali\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5214434,'716','Ruben Lago Vazquez',31040,203404,'Ocean View Bungalow Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-09-15','2024-09-17','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',2128000.00,'Room size: 55 sqm. The ocean view bungalow room has 13 units available. The rooms at this Nusa Penida hotel provide guests with high-velocity internet and a flat-screen TV with satellite channels, and comforts such as ironing facilities and air conditioning. The units are designed in a comfortable manner. Offering amenities like hair dryers and bathrobes, the bathrooms also include a walk-in shower, a separate toilet and a sink.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-09-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5214445,'716','Ruben Lago Vazquez',30508,207337,'Snorkeling Nusa Penida (Sharing Trip)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-16','2024-09-16','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1232000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-16\", \"text\": \"Banjar Angkal, Suana, Kec. Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Angkal Resort Nusa Penida Bali\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5214454,'716','Ruben Lago Vazquez',30563,216169,'The Angkal Resort Nusa Penida Bali - Nusa Penida Harbour','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-17','2024-09-17','Guio','Tami',1,'Per Car',375200.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-17\", \"text\": \"Banjar Angkal, Suana, Kec. Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771\", \"time\": \"07:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Angkal Resort Nusa Penida Bali\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-17\", \"text\": \"ETD 09.15 by Blue Water Express to Gili Air\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Buyuk Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5214493,'716','Ruben Lago Vazquez',30649,204187,'One Bedroom Pool Lagoon','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-09-17','2024-09-20','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',2940000.00,'This room is perfect for travelers or business people! With a room area of ​​25m2 and equipped with a double / single bed, air conditioning controller, LED TV and high speed internet access. This modern designed bathroom is also equipped with a shower and toiletries to complete your needs during your stay at our hotel.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-09-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5214524,'717','Ms.Noelia Membrilla Rubio',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-25','2024-09-25','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (2)',336000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-25\", \"text\": \"ETA 17:35pm by Iberia Airlines IB7968 from Doha on 25 Sept 2024\", \"time\": \"17:35\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-25\", \"text\": \"Pertiwi Bisma Ubud (formerly Pertiwi Bisma 2) Jl. Bisma, P.O. Box 80571 ubud, Gianyar, Bali Phone: +62361 981386,\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5214551,'716','Ruben Lago Vazquez',30508,207386,'Padang Bai to Seminyak','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-20','2024-09-20','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-20\", \"text\": \"ETA 12.25 from Gili Air by Blue Water Express\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-20\", \"text\": \"Jl. Pura Telaga Waja No.18A, Kerobokan Kelod, Kec. Kuta Utara\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kayumas Seminyak Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5214566,'716','Ruben Lago Vazquez',30798,201630,'One Bedroom Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-20','2024-09-21','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',1299200.00,'The two-story, 45 sqm One Bedroom Suite features an natural and airy interior, complemented with modern furnishings and views overlooking to the private terrace with a plunge pool. Floor-to-ceiling glass doors provide generous natural lighting and a dynamic ambience. Plush linens and a marble bathroom surround guests in elegance.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-09-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5214572,'716','Ruben Lago Vazquez',30508,207270,'Seminyak to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-21','2024-09-21','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-21\", \"text\": \"Jl. Pura Telaga Waja No.18A, Kerobokan Kelod, Kec. Kuta Utara\", \"time\": \"20:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kayumas Seminyak Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-21\", \"text\": \"ETD 01.05 by IB7967 to Doha on 22 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5214592,'718','MARINA VIDAL FAUNDEZ',32766,216809,'3D2N Open Trip Komodo - Lady Grace / Full Ocean','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-09-20','2024-09-22','Jacob','Eddy',2,'Per Person (Min. 2 Person)',15240000.00,'DAY 1 : Kelor Island - Manjerite Island - Kalong Island DAY 2 : Padar Island - Long / Pick Beach - Komodo Island - Manta Point - Taka Makasar DAY 3 : Kanawa Island',NULL,'Excluded - Local donation, Komodo National Park Fees & Rangee Fees Local/Domestic guest : IDR 250.000/person/trips Foreign/KITAS guest : IDR 600.000/person/trips','{\"date\": \"2024-09-20\", \"text\": \"Pick up time between 09.00-10.00 ETA: hotel Parlezo en Labuan Bajo ( dirección:Jalan Alo Tanis, Lingkungan V, Labuan Bajo, Komodo, West Manggarai Regency, East Nusa Tenggara, 83763 Labuan Bajo,\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-22\", \"text\": \"ETD: 22 de sepTEMBER AT 17:10 TO SURABAYA\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"AIRPORT LABUAN BAJO\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5215649,'717','Ms.Noelia Membrilla Rubio',30620,200813,'Super Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-09-25','2024-09-29','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',3808000.00,'24 units (10 twin bed and 14 double bed) of 35 sqm each deluxe rooms with garden view are modern‐minimalism designed. Advance, facilities such as LCD TV, coffee/tea maker, balcony/terrace, safety deposit box, minibar, and complete bathroom facilities.',NULL,'\"Honeymooner\"','{\"date\": \"2024-09-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5215650,'717','Ms.Noelia Membrilla Rubio',30508,202882,'Tegalalang – 1D Tirta Empul – Kintamani – Besakih – Tukad Cepung','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-26','2024-09-26','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',1724800.00,'The first destination is Kusamba Beach, it is one of the favorite places of interest in Bali which is famous with the beautiful beach, we can also meet a fish market in this place which is usually held between 10 am until 4 pm. Then we go to Goa Lawah, this is one of the favourite place to be visited, because here is a nature cave dwelt by thousands of tail bat located at north side from Jeroan/center of Goa Lawah Temple. Next we go to Bukit Jambul, it is strategically located beside of the main road from Denpasar to Besakih Temple and it is one of the tourist destinations that visited on Besakih Tour. It is situated in the plateau area which is blessed with the beautiful panorama of rice terrace and green coconuts three unfolding to the sea. After visit Bukit Jambul, we’ll continue to Besakih Temple is the biggest Hindu temple in Bali which the local people call Pura Besakih. It owns beautiful view from the top of temple area where we can see the wide nature panorama until to the ocean so that’s why this temple is many visited by tourists from all over the world. Then go to Kertagosa, This place also owns Taman Gili, a building floating or sees like floating because it is intentionally founded in the middle of a fish pond.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-26\", \"text\": \"Pertiwi Bisma Ubud (formerly Pertiwi Bisma 2) Jl. Bisma, P.O. Box 80571 ubud, Gianyar, Bali Phone: +62361 981386,\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-26\", \"text\": \"Pertiwi Bisma Ubud (formerly Pertiwi Bisma 2) Jl. Bisma, P.O. Box 80571 ubud, Gianyar, Bali Phone: +62361 981386,\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5215651,'717','Ms.Noelia Membrilla Rubio',30508,202892,'Ubud - Ulun Danu Beratan - Cascada Leke Leke - Tanah Lot','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-27','2024-09-27','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',1747200.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-27\", \"text\": \"Pertiwi Bisma Ubud (formerly Pertiwi Bisma 2) Jl. Bisma, P.O. Box 80571 ubud, Gianyar, Bali Phone: +62361 981386,\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-27\", \"text\": \"Pertiwi Bisma Ubud (formerly Pertiwi Bisma 2) Jl. Bisma, P.O. Box 80571 ubud, Gianyar, Bali Phone: +62361 981386,\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5215652,'717','Ms.Noelia Membrilla Rubio',30508,202893,'Lempuyang Temple Tour (Tenganan-Playa Virgin-Templo Lempuyang-Tirta Gangga)','Confirmed','C2I-BALI11',1,'2024-09-28','2024-09-28','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',1792000.00,'At the agreed time, our guide will pick you up to start the tour in the eastern part of Bali. The first place you will visit is Goa Lawah Temple. Goa Lawah Temple consists of two names, \"Goa\" which means cave and \"Lawah\" which means bat. Several thousand bats are flying in the cave as the name suggests. With the lights fading as you go deeper inside the cave, it gives off a very strange atmosphere. From Goa Lawah, we continue our way to Lempuyang Temple. Upon arrival, the temple will greet you with its gratifying panorama that extends into infinity. On a clear, sunny day, you\'ll be able to gaze out over the mountains, Amlapura city, and Mount Agung, an incredibly magnificent sight that\'s beautiful beyond words. This portrait of heaven is beautifully framed by the Gapura Candi Bentar (the gate of the temple). Our journey continues to visit Tirta Gangga. The site is a paradise surrounded by water, with all the pools decorated with unusual statues. With its seclusion and a view of the surrounding rice paddies, Tirta Gangga is a wonderful place. At the end of the trip we go to Tenganan Village, the most famous Bali Agas (the “original” Bali people) in the city. With its characteristics, the city village is arranged in parallel along the wide main road paved with rows of cobblestones. In Tenganan, women still weave the famous Kamben Geringsing, or \"burnt cloth,\" which has the power to immunize the wearer against evil. We take a close look at what they do in their daily lives in a traditional lifestyle. From Tenganan, we will transfer you to the hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-28\", \"text\": \"Pertiwi Bisma Ubud (formerly Pertiwi Bisma 2) Jl. Bisma, P.O. Box 80571 ubud, Gianyar, Bali Phone: +62361 981386,\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-28\", \"text\": \"Pertiwi Bisma Ubud (formerly Pertiwi Bisma 2) Jl. Bisma, P.O. Box 80571 ubud, Gianyar, Bali Phone: +62361 981386,\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5215653,'717','Ms.Noelia Membrilla Rubio',30508,207379,'Ubud to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-29','2024-09-29','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (2)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-29\", \"text\": \"Pertiwi Bisma Ubud (formerly Pertiwi Bisma 2) Jl. Bisma, P.O. Box 80571 ubud, Gianyar, Bali Phone: +62361 981386,\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-29\", \"text\": \"ETD : 08.30 by Gili Gili Fastboat to Gili Air\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbor\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5215657,'717','Ms.Noelia Membrilla Rubio',31070,215981,'Villa 1 Bedroom with Private Pool - N3','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-09-29','2024-10-02','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',4536000.00,'This stunning villa boasts two gorgeous and private air-conditioned bedrooms, each equipped with a luxurious king size bed (180x200) complete with a mosquito net, a comfortable single bed, and a spacious bathroom with hot water. For your peace of mind, we also provide a safety box and a fan. Linens and toiletries are included, as well as daily room service, maintenance, and cleaning. The villa also features a cozy living room with a TV and satellite, unlimited Wi-Fi, and a fun Darts game. Plus, there\'s a fully equipped kitchen with a hob, blender, water cooler, dishes, and complimentary tea and coffee. Enjoy a delicious breakfast included for each guest, featuring refreshing fresh juices like lime, watermelon, pineapple, dragon fruit, and papaya. You\'ll also get to choose from a variety of tasty breakfast options, including nasi goreng or pancakes with honey and jam, fried eggs with beef sausage and toast, or scrambled eggs with tomato, onions, and toast. To top it off, a fresh fruit platter will be served to start your day off right!',NULL,'\" Honeymooner\"','{\"date\": \"2024-09-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5215659,'717','Ms.Noelia Membrilla Rubio',30547,200475,'Ocean View Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-10-02','2024-10-04','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',4480000.00,'Adiwana Warnakali boasts a collection of 12 Ocean View suites, all situated on the lower level, have a room size 56 sqm and the type bed single or double. Each of these suites offers a generously-sized balcony that unveils breathtaking vistas of the vast, cerulean expanse of the Nusa Lembongan ocean and the majestic presence of Mount Agung. Here, your mornings resemble scenes from a captivating movie, with the invigorating scent of the sea and the soothing melody of waves crashing against the rugged cliffs. The spacious rooms are designed for your utmost comfort, sporting a nautical theme that incorporates oars as charming decorative elements. The bathrooms are adorned with striking blue tiles, adding to the overall maritime charm. Immerse yourself in an unforgettable and idyllic stay at Adiwana Warnakali.',NULL,'\"Honeymooner\" Include Oneway Transfer to Banjar Nyuh harbour on 04 Oct ETD : 12.30 by Maruti Fastboat to Sanur','{\"date\": \"2024-10-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5215661,'717','Ms.Noelia Membrilla Rubio',30508,207388,'Sanur to Seminyak','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-04','2024-10-04','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (2)',224000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-04\", \"text\": \"ETA : 13.00 from Penida by Maruti Fastboat\", \"time\": \"13:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sanur Harbor\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-04\", \"text\": \"The Kayana Seminyak Jl. Petitenget, Kerobokan Kelod, Kec. Kuta Utara, Kabupaten Badung\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Seminyak\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5215662,'717','Ms.Noelia Membrilla Rubio',31003,203146,'Deluxe Villa (One Bedroom Villa with Plunge Pool)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-04','2024-10-05','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',3640000.00,'At 180 sqm villa size, these Twelve intimate Deluxe Villas with a Plunge Pool and a Balinese joglo for dine and relax, unwind in the deep soak bath and enjoy the rain shower or recline in sun loungers with pristine gardens surrounding the villa offering seclusion and tranquility.',NULL,'\"Honeymooner\"','{\"date\": \"2024-10-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5215663,'717','Ms.Noelia Membrilla Rubio',30508,207270,'Seminyak to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-05','2024-10-05','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (2)',300000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-05\", \"text\": \"The Kayana Seminyak Jl. Petitenget, Kerobokan Kelod, Kec. Kuta Utara, Kabupaten Badung\", \"time\": \"21:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Seminyak\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-05\", \"text\": \"ETD 01:05AM on 06 October by Iberia Airlines IB 7967 to Doha\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5215717,'720','Kimberly Cohen',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-14','2024-09-15','Ayu','Eddy',1,'Single',0.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK-IN. FM7 Hotel Airport Pickup Service: +62811-8815-053 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-09-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5215719,'720','Kimberly Cohen',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-09-15','2024-09-17','Ayu','Eddy',1,'Person (1)',0.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan isCape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continueto add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board. Note: The client prefers not to eat octopus, but no allergies or special diet. Flight Information: ETA 07.15 by Batik Air ID6202 from Jakarta on 15 September 2024 ETD 08.50 by Batik Air ID6134 to Surabaya on 17 September 2024','{\"date\": \"2024-09-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5215720,'720','Kimberly Cohen',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-17','2024-09-17','Ayu','Eddy',1,'Person (1)',0.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'Flight information: ETA 14.00 by Lion Air JT804 from Surabaya on 17 September 2024','{\"date\": \"2024-09-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"14:00\", \"locality\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport Bali\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Komaneka at Tanggayuda\", \"location\": \"Br. Tanggayuda, Kedewatan, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5215721,'720','Kimberly Cohen',30710,200846,'Courtyard Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-09-17','2024-09-19','Ayu','Eddy',1,'Single',8568000.00,'Courtyard Pool Villa is tasteful villa overlooking a tropical garden with plenty space to relax. The villa room that built in 144 sqm area, oozes with peace and charm that comes from nature that surrounds. Featuring a plunge pool, this villa is fitted with air conditioning, a flat-screen TV, a safety deposit box, slippers, bathrobes, free toiletries are provided, and many more.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5215724,'720','Kimberly Cohen',30508,215968,'1 DAY TOUR: GOA GAJAH – TAMPAKSIRING TIRTA EMPUL – GUNUNG KAWI','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-19','2024-09-19','Ayu','Eddy',1,'Person (1)',0.00,NULL,NULL,'1 DAY BALI TOUR VISITING: GOA GAJAH – TAMPAKSIRING TIRTA EMPUL – GUNUNG KAWI WITH ENGLISH SPEAKING GUIDE','{\"date\": \"2024-09-19\", \"text\": \"Komaneka at Tanggayuda Br. Tanggayuda, Kedewatan, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-19\", \"text\": \"Sea Breeze Candidasa Pantai Mendira, Banjar Mendira, Desa Sengkidu, Manggis, Sengkidu, Kec. Karangasem\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5215727,'720','Kimberly Cohen',30643,217181,'Deluxe Ocean Front','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-09-19','2024-09-21','Ayu','Eddy',1,'Single',0.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5215728,'720','Kimberly Cohen',31661,208436,'Tulamben Bay/USAT Liberty Shipwreck - All Level Divers (for Diving) SHARED TRIP','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-20','2024-09-20','Ayu','Eddy',1,'Person (1)',3628800.00,'Tulamben 1 Day SCUBA Diving Trips Our Day Trips and Dive Safaris to Tulamben on Bali’s north east coast are enormously popular with visitors to Bali due to the wide variety of sites in the area. This includes the world-renowned 120 metre USAT Liberty Shipwreck. Upon arrival in Tulamben, as you settle into our base for the day, the Tulamben porters will unload the dive gear, tanks, etc. You will then listen to the dive briefing from your AquaMarine dive guide. Third Day Dives on a Tulamben dive trip are almost always possible but must be booked in advance. If you’d like to do a Night Dive in Tulamben Bay, we can arrange an overnight stay for you in one of our Suggested Hotels. Tulamben Bay Our dive base is located right on the water. It couldn’t be more convenient for the USAT Liberty Shipwreck! Tulamben Bay offers three main dive sites: The 120m USAT Liberty Shipwreck, The Coral Garden and The Wall/Drop-off. It is an excellent dive location for divers of all levels, from novice to experienced. Tulamben Bay is also ideal for snorkelers. We recommend you do two dives on the USAT Liberty Shipwreck. It is a fascinating site and would take weeks to explore (if you had time!). Make the most of your Tulamben Dive Trip and enjoy two (or more) dives on this world-famous wreck. For those who are not certified, Tulamben Bay is an ideal location to join Discover Scuba Diving. Non-divers may enjoy snorkeling above the wreck.',NULL,'Note: The client prefers not to eat octopus, but no allergies or special diet. Sharing Pick up time at 08.15 -08.30am','{\"date\": \"2024-09-20\", \"text\": \"Sea Breeze Candidasa Pantai Mendira, Banjar Mendira, Desa Sengkidu, Manggis, Sengkidu, Kec. Karangasem\", \"time\": \"08:15\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-20\", \"text\": \"Sea Breeze Candidasa Pantai Mendira, Banjar Mendira, Desa Sengkidu, Manggis, Sengkidu, Kec. Karangasem\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5215729,'720','Kimberly Cohen',30508,213312,'Candidasa to Seminyak','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-21','2024-09-21','Ayu','Eddy',1,'Person (1)',0.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-21\", \"text\": \"Sea Breeze Candidasa Pantai Mendira, Banjar Mendira, Desa Sengkidu, Manggis, Sengkidu, Kec. Karangasem\", \"time\": \"12:00\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-21\", \"text\": \"Kayumas Seminyak Resort Jl. Pura Telaga Waja No.18A, Kerobokan Kelod\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5215730,'720','Kimberly Cohen',30798,201630,'One Bedroom Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-09-21','2024-09-23','Ayu','Eddy',1,'Single',2784000.00,'The two-story, 45 sqm One Bedroom Suite features an natural and airy interior, complemented with modern furnishings and views overlooking to the private terrace with a plunge pool. Floor-to-ceiling glass doors provide generous natural lighting and a dynamic ambience. Plush linens and a marble bathroom surround guests in elegance.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5215731,'720','Kimberly Cohen',30508,207270,'Seminyak to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-23','2024-09-23','Ayu','Eddy',1,'Person (1)',0.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'Flight information: ETD 07.00 by Garuda GA401 to Jakarta on 23 September 2024','{\"date\": \"2024-09-23\", \"text\": \"Kayumas Seminyak Resort Jl. Pura Telaga Waja No.18A, Kerobokan Kelod\", \"time\": \"04:30\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport Bali\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5215732,'720','Kimberly Cohen',31426,206241,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-23','2024-09-24','Ayu','Eddy',1,'Single',0.00,'Our comfortable packages start with our deluxe rooms, measuring 22 square meters and decorated in a chic contemporary style. Choose from rooms with either a queen-sized bed or twin single beds. Room is equipped with a cable TV, air conditioning and a minibar. It comes with private bathroom facilities, a seating area and a work desk. A hairdryer and tea/coffee maker are available, and many more.',NULL,'Check-in time: 14.00 Check-out time: 12.00 Early check-in is subject to availability upon arrival and may be charged additional cost by the hotel.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5215836,'721','Alain Remi NAOURI',30680,200919,'Premier Family Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-05','2024-10-06','Ayu','Eddy',1,'Single + Double',1344000.00,'The most important things in this world is family. Thoughtfully designed with families in mind, our Family Premier Room includes everything needed for you and your family to feel comfortable during your stay. At 43 m2 pf room size with 1 king size and 1 twin size, this room equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, hot and cold shower, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer. Free access to our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK-IN. FM7 Hotel Airport Pickup Service: +62811-8815-053 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-10-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5215983,'722','Marta Cardona Colomina',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-23','2024-09-24','Jacob','Wiwik',1,'Single',840000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'FLIGHT DETAIL: ETA: 15.25 by QR956 from Doha on 23 September 2024. ETD: 06.00 by ID6202 to Pangkalan Bun on 24 September 2024. Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK-IN. FM7 Hotel A