\"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5216405,'694','Fernando Clark',30562,213407,'Guest Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-20','2024-08-21','Melysa','Tami',1,'Double',1064000.00,'40-inch HDTV, complimentary WiFi, desk with ergonomic chair, mini-fridge Relax in this spacious and stylish 30 sq. m./322 sq. ft. guest room. Enjoy a restful night\'s sleep in one of the two twin Perfect Sleeper by Serta® beds which provide the perfect balance between comfort and support. Work in comfort at the spacious desk with ergonomic chair. Relax and watch a program on the 40-inch HDTV or surf the web with complimentary standard WiFi. This room also features a mini-fridge, adjustable air-conditioning, coffee/tea maker, hair dryer, safe and an iron/ironing board to make you feel at home.',NULL,'Bed type and any other request subject to availability upon check in PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK-IN.','{\"date\": \"2024-08-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5217170,'365','Kenneth Vella',30783,201655,'Half Day Yogyakarta City Tour','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-20','2024-08-20','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Persons (2)',1456000.00,'At the scheduled time, your guide will pick you up at your hotel so you can walk to the heart of the city. You will visit the Keraton known as the Sultan’s Palace. The palace is a complex building of two centuries old, located in the heart of the city. You will hear the song of the “freedom” of the birds in the bird market, you will visit the “Water Castle” that occupies the highest part at the northern end of the vast complex of Taman Sari and Malioboro Street, main street of Yogyakarta, with its merchants, horse carriages, taxi-bikes and markets. An incredible experience that will make the hours fly by. Finishing the tour in the centre of the city of Yogyakarta, you will head northeast towards Candi Prambanan, the Hindu temple and classified as a World Heritage Site by UNESCO since 1991. This temple was finished building towards the year 856 to commemorate the victory of the descendant Sanjaya of Siva, Rikai Pikatan over the last Sailendra sovereign of Central Java. Take your time to enjoy each carving on the rocks and feel the spirituality that each of the stones perched in this set of more than 200 Hindu temples that are dedicated to the Trimurti, the expression of God as the Creator, the Preserver and the Destroyer. After this day you will never forget, you will take you to your hotel.',NULL,'ITINERARY Keraton Sultan Palace, Tamansari Water Castle, and bird/traditional market','{\"date\": \"2024-08-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5217185,'725','Sonia Alessandra Gossi',30665,201009,'Premier Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-09-06','2024-09-08','Melysa','Tami',1,'Double',15120000.00,'Premier Suites with an area of 66,7 sqm are capture the spirit of a luxurious mountain residence with cozy modern interiors complete with in-room living and dining quarters with a king-size bed with a capacity of 2 persons, a private bathtub, and stunning panoramic views of the surrounding mountains.',NULL,'No Show must be paid without reliance on billed vouchers since the guests did not arrive in the Resort, no voucher will be submitted.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5217233,'725','Sonia Alessandra Gossi',30508,207266,'Kuta to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-10','2024-09-10','Melysa','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',300000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver will wait up to 30 minutes after your scheduled pickup time. - Please keep in mind that any further delay could affect your timely arrival at the airport for your flight. - For any changes in flight departure time, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available). - Requests for pickup time earlier than originally booked are subject to availability.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-10\", \"text\": \"Jl. Kartika Plaza, Tuban, Kec. Kuta, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Anvaya Beach Resort Bali\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-10\", \"text\": \"ETD 08.00 by Batik Air ID6333 to Labuan Bajo on 10 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5217400,'726','Mr. VALENTIN PLAMENOV TZANEV',30508,207254,'Airport to Abiansemal + Luggage Van','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-30','2024-08-30','Jacob','Praba',1,'Persons (10)',1456000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting at the arrival hall exit, holding a signboard of your name/group name. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 3 hours after the flight’s estimated arrival time (ETA). - For any flight delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-08-30\", \"text\": \"ETA 19:25 by KLM KL835 from Singapore\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-30\", \"text\": \"Sharma Springs House Green Village Jl. Tanah Ayu, Sibang Gede, Abiansemal – Badung phone: +62-8113922254\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sibang Gede Abiansemal\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5217407,'726','Mr. VALENTIN PLAMENOV TZANEV',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-08-31','2024-08-31','Jacob','Praba',10,'Persons (10)',3192000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-08-31\", \"text\": \"ETA 08:00 by The Angkal Fastboat from Sanur\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Banjar Nyuh Port Nusa Penida\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-31\", \"text\": \"ETD 17:00 by The Angkal Fastboat to Sanur\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Banjar Nyuh Port Nusa Penida\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5217414,'726','Mr. VALENTIN PLAMENOV TZANEV',30508,207277,'Abiansemal to Sanur','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-31','2024-08-31','Jacob','Praba',1,'Persons (10)',1120000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-08-31\", \"text\": \"Sharma Springs House Green Village Jl. Tanah Ayu, Sibang Gede, Abiansemal – Badung phone: +62-8113922254\", \"time\": \"05:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sibang Gede Abiansemal\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-31\", \"text\": \"ETD 07:30 by The Angkal Fastboat to Nusa Penida\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sanur Harbor\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5217437,'726','Mr. VALENTIN PLAMENOV TZANEV',30508,207389,'Sanur to Abiansemal','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-31','2024-08-31','Jacob','Praba',1