on\": \"Sibang Gede Abiansemal\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5217446,'726','Mr. VALENTIN PLAMENOV TZANEV',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route (Taman Ayun – Jatiluwih – Ulun Danu Bratan – Tanah Lot)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-02','2024-09-02','Jacob','Praba',10,'Persons (10)',5768000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-02\", \"text\": \"Sharma Springs House Green Village Jl. Tanah Ayu, Sibang Gede, Abiansemal – Badung phone: +62-8113922254\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sibang Gede, Abiansemal\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-02\", \"text\": \"Sharma Springs House Green Village Jl. Tanah Ayu, Sibang Gede, Abiansemal – Badung phone: +62-8113922254\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sibang Gede, Abiansemal\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5217447,'726','Mr. VALENTIN PLAMENOV TZANEV',30508,207262,'Abiansemal to Airport + Luggage Van','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-03','2024-09-03','Jacob','Praba',1,'Persons (10)',1456000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver will wait up to 30 minutes after your scheduled pickup time. - Please keep in mind that any further delay could affect your timely arrival at the airport for your flight. - For any changes in flight departure time, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available). - Requests for pickup time earlier than originally booked are subject to availability.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-03\", \"text\": \"Sharma Springs House Green Village Jl. Tanah Ayu, Sibang Gede, Abiansemal – Badung phone: +62-8113922254\", \"time\": \"07:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sibang Gede, Abiansemal\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-03\", \"text\": \"ETD 12:05 Garuda Indonesia GA253 to Yogyakarta\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Domestic Departure Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5217452,'725','Sonia Alessandra Gossi',30805,212255,'CGK-YIA','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-04','2024-09-04','Melysa','Tami',1,'Person',1430000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5217453,'725','Sonia Alessandra Gossi',30805,202739,'DPS-LBJ','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-10','2024-09-10','Melysa','Tami',1,'Person',1760000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5217490,'726','Mr. VALENTIN PLAMENOV TZANEV',30783,201525,'4D3N Yogyakarta - Mt. Merapi with Jeep / A. The Phoenix (Deluxe Legacy Room)','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-09-03','2024-09-06','Jacob','Praba',10,'Persons (10)',54460000.00,'D1 Arrival Yogyakarta International Airport – Transfer to hotel: Welcome to the cradle of Indonesian culture, Yogyakarta. A tourist destination for its ancient palaces, temples, batik workshops, gamelan music orchestras, court dances and wayang puppet shows. Upon your arrival in Yogyakarta a representative of come2indonesia will be waiting for you with a sign indicating your name to take you to your hotel and the rest of the day is for you. D2 Borobudur temple – Candirejo Village Tour by Horse cart / bicycle – Merapi lava tour Including Jeep: You will have your deserved breakfast at the hotel. Today’s tour will make you enjoy the authentic Javanese essence. You will start your route in the direction of with the Borobudur Temple (Candi Borobudur), the great Stupa, the largest Buddhist monument in the world and one of the seven wonders. We will tour around the temple, observe the hundreds and centenary statues of Buddha and witness how dozens of Buddhists come to preach from all over the world. Historically it was established during the relatively brief Sailendra dynasty of Central Java between 778 and 856 BC and is in constant restoration due to the breaks that the tremors of the neighbouring Merapi volcano has been producing during its history. After visiting one of the most important Buddhist temples in Southeast Asia, and in a horse carriage (Andong) we will visit the villages that surround this temple. These are authentic Javanese villages where culture and tradition are the protagonists. As you spend your days in this country and go around the different islands, you will realize how different Indonesians are among them in terms of clothing, food, architecture and even language. Today we will learn about and share these Javanese places. Then we will go to Kaliurang / Kalidalem to see Mount Merapi in constant activity. Here in a 4x4 jeep driven by specialized drivers, we will climb its skirt to see the remains of the 2010 eruption such as houses buried by ashes, a multitude of objects paralyzed by lava, etc. In addition, an open-air tribute museum presided over by the clock that marks the time just when the lava passed through it has been improvised. Accompanied by photos of the rescue, it will make us feel very closely the experiences of that fateful day. After finishing this day full of emotions, we will take you back to your hotel. D3 City Tour Jogjakarta Visit Sultan Palace, Watercastle and Bird Market – Prambanan Temple: After breakfast and at the indicated time we will head towards the heart of the city. We will visit the Keraton known as the Sultan’s Palace. The palace is a complex building two centuries old, located in the heart of the city. You will hear the song of the “freedom” of the birds in the bird market, we will visit the “Water Castle” that occupies the highest part at the northern end of the vast complex of Taman Sari, Malioboro Street, main street of Yogyakarta, with its merchants, horse carriages, taxi-bikes and markets. An incredible experience that will make the hours fly by. After finishing the tour in the center of the city of Yogyakarta, we will go to the northeast direction Candi Prambanan, the temple of the Hinduists and classified as a World Heritage Site by Unesco since 1991. The built of this temple was finished around the year 856 to commemorate the victory of the descendant Sanjaya of Siva, Rikai Pikatan on the last sovereign Sailendra of Central Java. Take your time to enjoy each carving on the rocks and feel the spirituality that each of the stones perched in this set of more than 200 Hindu temples that are dedicated to the Trimurti, the expression of God as the Creator, the Preserver and the Destroyer. After this unforgettable day, we will take you to your hotel. D4 Transfer out Yogyakarta International airport: Today our adventure ends at the cradle of Indonesian culture. Depending on the time of your flight, we will pick you up to take you to the airport and take the flight to your next destination. End of our services. Thank you very much for exploring Yogyakarta by the hand of Come2indonesia.',NULL,'D1/3 Sep: Arrival YIA - Candirejo Village tour by horsecart- check in hotel Doman Borobudur D2/4 Sep: Dieng Plateau tour and Borobudur temple (VIP Access via Manohara) - transfer to Yogyakarta overnight at The Phoenix Yogyakarta (Deluxe Legacy Room 2 Double + 3 Twin) D3/5 Sep: City Tour visit Sultan Palace and Tamansari - Lava Tour Jeep Merapi - Prambanan temple - back to hotel D4/6 Sep: Transfer out YIA','{\"date\": \"2024-09-03\", \"text\": \"ETA 12:45 by Garuda Indonesia GA253 from Denpasar\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Yogyakarta International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-06\", \"text\": \"ETD 10:00 by Garuda Indonesia GA205 to Jakarta\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Yogyakarta International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5217654,'728','Mr. Jack Kelly',30671,200626,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-11','2024-09-12','Ayu','Eddy',1,'Single',1120000.00,'Deluxe Room with a room area of 28 square meters each, there are 2 types of bed, king and twin bed with a size of 28 square meters each.',NULL,'Check-in t