Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 972385\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5219807,'434','Jeffrey John Koch',33196,219235,'Standard Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-14','2024-09-15','Ayu','Rendy',1,'Double',515200.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5219810,'734','Noelia Vieites Parada',30705,201148,'Premier Room Rice Field View','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-09-20','2024-09-24','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',6832000.00,'Gaze out at rippling rice fields as you let your stress slip away in one of our Premier Ricefield View suites. Inside you have smooth tiles, warm wooden accents, and all the modern comforts you could ask for. Step onto the balcony and you have an airy nook where you can witness life unfold in the Balinese countryside.',NULL,'Note : 1X ROMANTIC DINNER on 22 Sept 2024 at 20.30 PM','{\"date\": \"2024-09-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5219813,'734','Noelia Vieites Parada',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Kantolampo- besakih-kintamani-tirta empul-tegalalangng)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-21','2024-09-21','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',1904000.00,NULL,NULL,'note : Guide dropoff Cretya and not Waiting The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-21\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 972385\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Artini Dijiwa\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-21\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Tegallalang, Tegallalang, Kec. Tegallalang, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80561 Telepon: 0812-3802-1174\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Cretya Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5219821,'734','Noelia Vieites Parada',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Jati Luwih-Ulun Danu Beratan-Leke2 Waterfall- Tanah Lot)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-22','2024-09-22','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',1904000.00,NULL,NULL,'Note : After Tour Guest will Romantic Dinner at the Hotel at 20.30 The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-22\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 972385\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Artini Dijiwa\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-22\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 972385\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Artini Dijiwa\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5219830,'734','Noelia Vieites Parada',30508,202893,'Lempuyang Temple Tour/ Tenganan-Virgin Beach-Lempuyang-Tirta Gangga','Confirmed','C2I-BALI11',1,'2024-09-23','2024-09-23','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',1792000.00,'At the agreed time, our guide will pick you up to start the tour in the eastern part of Bali. The first place you will visit is Goa Lawah Temple. Goa Lawah Temple consists of two names, \"Goa\" which means cave and \"Lawah\" which means bat. Several thousand bats are flying in the cave as the name suggests. With the lights fading as you go deeper inside the cave, it gives off a very strange atmosphere. From Goa Lawah, we continue our way to Lempuyang Temple. Upon arrival, the temple will greet you with its gratifying panorama that extends into infinity. On a clear, sunny day, you\'ll be able to gaze out over the mountains, Amlapura city, and Mount Agung, an incredibly magnificent sight that\'s beautiful beyond words. This portrait of heaven is beautifully framed by the Gapura Candi Bentar (the gate of the temple). Our journey continues to visit Tirta Gangga. The site is a paradise surrounded by water, with all the pools decorated with unusual statues. With its seclusion and a view of the surrounding rice paddies, Tirta Gangga is a wonderful place. At the end of the trip we go to Tenganan Village, the most famous Bali Agas (the “original” Bali people) in the city. With its characteristics, the city village is arranged in parallel along the wide main road paved with rows of cobblestones. In Tenganan, women still weave the famous Kamben Geringsing, or \"burnt cloth,\" which has the power to immunize the wearer against evil. We take a close look at what they do in their daily lives in a traditional lifestyle. From Tenganan, we will transfer you to the hotel.',NULL,'Note : The Guide dropoff in Monkey Forest not Waiting The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-23\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 972385\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-23\", \"text\": \"Monkey Forest Ubud\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5219858,'734','Noelia Vieites Parada',30508,213032,'Ubud to Kusamba','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-24','2024-09-24','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-24\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 972385\", \"time\": \"09:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-24\", \"text\": \"ETD : 11.45 by The Angkal Fastboat to Nusa Penida\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kusamba Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5219864,'734','Noelia Vieites Parada',30547,200475,'Ocean View Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-09-24','2024-09-26','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',4592000.00,'Adiwana Warnakali boasts a collection of 12 Ocean View suites, all situated on the lower level, have a room size 56 sqm and the type bed single or double. Each of these suites offers a generously-sized balcony that unveils breathtaking vistas of the vast, cerulean expanse of the Nusa Lembongan ocean and the majestic presence of Mount Agung. Here, your mornings resemble scenes from a captivating movie, with the invigorating scent of the sea and the soothing melody of waves crashing against the rugged cliffs. The spacious rooms are designed for your utmost comfort, sporting a nautical theme that incorporates oars as charming decorative elements. The bathrooms are adorned with striking blue tiles, adding to the overall maritime charm. Immerse yourself in an unforgettable and idyllic stay at Adiwana Warnakali.',NULL,'Include One-way Transfer to Buyuk Harbour on 26 Sept ETD : 09.15 by Bluewater Express to Gili Air Please consult time to transfer upon check-in','{\"date\": \"2024-09-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5219869,'734','Noelia Vieites Parada',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West and East Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-09-25','2024-09-25','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',1456000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-25\", \"text\": \"Sakti, Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771 Telepon: (0361) 6207000\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Adiwana Warnnakali Nusa Penida\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-25\", \"text\": \"Sakti, Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771 Telepon: (0361) 6207000\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Adiwana Warnnakali Nusa Penida\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5219914,'734','Noelia Vieites Parada',30649,204187,'One Bedroom Pool Lagoon','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-09-26','2024-09-29','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',2940000.00,'This room is perfect for travelers or business people! With a room area of ​​25m2 and equipped with a double / single bed, air conditioning controller, LED TV and high speed internet access. This modern designed bathroom is also equipped with a shower and toiletries to complete your needs during your stay at our hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": nul