R. ADRIAN ENRIQUE RAGA GIL',31322,219241,'Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-10-18','2024-10-21','Guio','Praba',1,'Double',9000000.00,'These room have commanding views over the natural forest, with ocean views in the distance. Guest will enjoy the tranquility of the location and be mesmerized by the radiant sunsets. Private decks with private dip pool are included in these villas. This villa can accommodate up to 3 guests with additional 1 extra bed. This room also has a TV and jogging track.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-10-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5221043,'743','MR. ADRIAN ENRIQUE RAGA GIL',30508,202889,'Tamblingan Jungle Trek - Ulun Danu Temple - Banyumala Waterfall','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-19','2024-10-19','Guio','Praba',2,'Persons (2)',2256000.00,'Today we will explore the nature of Buyan and Tamblingan lake in our lovely village, it will help you to escape from the crowds and fell the Nature atmosphere of the real jungle of Bali. We will pick you at your hotel at 07:30 AM and we drive to Tamblingan lake. Arrive in the trekking start point, we will have an explanation about the trekking. We will start the trek by entering a lush protected rain-forest area with giant old tress, animal such as macaque, black giant squirrel, birds and old legend temple inside in the Jungle. You will then walk along the shore of this lake situated in the caldera of an extinct Jungle Mountain. Our trekking guide will explain more detail about plants and living creatures in the jungle. This tour also combine with a session of thirty five minutes exploring the Tamblingan lake by dugout canoe to finishing point. Finish with trekking we will drop you to your hotel but we will make a stop at Ulun Danu Temple. Ulun Danu Temple Bratan, the famous temple stands on a small promontory located in the shore of Lake Bratan and has beautiful scenery with this lake and the mountains as backdrop sight.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-19\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Asah Gobleg, Br. Dinas Asah Desa Gobleg, Buleleng, Munduk, Kec. Banjar, Singaraja Telephone :+6281237887877\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Munduk Tentrem Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-19\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Asah Gobleg, Br. Dinas Asah Desa Gobleg, Buleleng, Munduk, Kec. Banjar, Singaraja Telephone :+6281237887877\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Munduk Tentrem Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5221050,'743','MR. ADRIAN ENRIQUE RAGA GIL',30508,213320,'Munduk to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-21','2024-10-21','Guio','Praba',1,'Persons (2)',660000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver will wait up to 30 minutes after your scheduled pickup time. - Please keep in mind that any further delay could affect your timely arrival at the airport for your flight. - For any changes in flight departure time, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available). - Requests for pickup time earlier than originally booked are subject to availability.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-21\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Asah Gobleg, Br. Dinas Asah Desa Gobleg, Buleleng, Munduk, Kec. Banjar, Singaraja Telephone :+6281237887877\", \"time\": \"07:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Munduk Tentrem Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-21\", \"text\": \"Domestic Departure ETD 12:25 by Wings Air IW1848 to Lombok\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5221054,'743','MR. ADRIAN ENRIQUE RAGA GIL',30832,213477,'1 Bedroom Garden View Villa','Confirmed',NULL,5,'2024-10-21','2024-10-26','Guio','Praba',1,'Double',10200000.00,'Inspired by the traditional construction of Lombok, this 1 Bedroom Garden View Villa (VILLA SULTAN AND VILLA PANGERAN) are built in bamboo and alang-alang and furnished with Chinese and colonial elements, and the size of villa is 45 m2. The en-suite bathrooms are a large and tastefully decorated outdoor shower space. The terraces offer beautiful garden views from antique Javanese furniture. The villas sleep 3 guests each with a queen size bed and an extra bed. Some of the facilities available for this type of villa are: lounge area, air-conditioning, fully-stocked fridge, coffee table and chairs, luxurious furniture, tea and coffee making facilities, sofa bed, wardrobe, en-suite outdoor bathroom with freshwater showers, daily complimentary breakfast, complimentary drinking water.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS Flight details: 21 October 2024 ETA 13:05 by Wings Air IW1848 from Denpasar 26 October 2024 ETD 14:50 by Garuda Indonesia GA433 to Jakarta (Guest have connecting flight international ETD 21:00 by Turkish Airlines TK57 to Istanbul)','{\"date\": \"2024-10-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5221091,'740','Alicia Morato Gonzalez',30783,218071,'5D4N Jogja-Bromo-Ijen Incl. Train - Drop Bali','Confirmed',NULL,5,'2024-09-07','2024-09-11','Jacob','Wiwik',2,'Persons (2 / Double)',19208000.00,'D1 Arrival at Yogyakarta International Airport - Borobudur temple tour Incl.Mendut and Pawon D2 Yogyakarta City tour visit Sultan Palace, Wateracastle and Bird Market, Visit Prambanan temple D3 Jogja - Mojokerto by train - drive to Bromo - overnight in Bromo D4 Mt. Bromo Sunrise tour incl. Jeep - Transfer to Ijen for overnight D5 Mt. Ijen crater tour - transfer to Bali across Ketapang - Gilimanuk harbour - drop at your hotel in Bali',NULL,'Program: D1. Arrive Semarang - Prambanan Temple - Yogyakarta D2. Yogyakarta City Tour - Borobudur Temple D3. Yogyakarta - Bromo con Tren D4. Bromo - Ijen D5. Ijen - Drop Off Bali Hotels: Adisthana Hotel – Superior Room Bromo Terrace - Deluxe room Ketapang Indah Hotel – Superior room','{\"date\": \"2024-09-07\", \"text\": \"ETA: 11.25 by Batik Air ID6303 from Pangkalan Bun on 07 Sept 2024.\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Semarang Airport (Terminal Domestic)\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud\", \"location\": \"Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar. Phone: (0361) 972385\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5221101,'740','Alicia Morato Gonzalez',30705,201148,'Premier Room Rice Field View','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-09-11','2024-09-15','Jacob','Wiwik',1,'Double',6832000.00,'Gaze out at rippling rice fields as you let your stress slip away in one of our Premier Ricefield View suites. Inside you have smooth tiles, warm wooden accents, and all the modern comforts you could ask for. Step onto the balcony and you have an airy nook where you can witness life unfold in the Balinese countryside.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5221105,'740','Alicia Morato Gonzalez',30508,207262,'Ubud to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-15','2024-09-15','Jacob','Wiwik',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver will wait up to 30 minutes after your scheduled pickup time. - Please keep in mind that any further delay could affect your timely arrival at the airport for your flight. - For any changes in flight departure time, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available). - Requests for pickup time earlier than originally booked are subject to availability.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"17:00\", \"locality\": \"THE ARTINI DIJIWA\", \"location\": \"Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar. Phone: (0361) 972385\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-15\", \"text\": \"ETD:21.30 by batik Air ID6760 to makassar on 15 Sept 2024.\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"AIRPORT NGURAH RAI (TERMINAL DOMESTIC)\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5221172,'744','Barbara Little',30783,201486,'3D2N Best of Yogyakarta City Tour / A. The Phoenix (Deluxe Legacy Room)','Confirmed','JS-Java01',3,'2024-10-05','2024-10-07','Melysa','Komang',2,'Persons (4-6 / Double)',9240000.00,'Day 1 : Arrival at Yogyakarta Welcome to the cradle of Indonesian culture, Yogyakarta. A tourist destination for its ancient palaces, temples, batik workshops, gamelan music orchestras, court dances and wayang puppet shows. Upon your arrival in Yogyakarta a representative of Come2Indonesia will be waiting for you with a sign indicating your name to take you to your hotel and the rest of the day is free for you. Meals : - Accommodation : A. The Phoenix - Deluxe Legacy Room Day 2 : Yogyakarta City Tour - Prambanan and Borobodur You will start your day with breakfast at the hotel. Today’s excursion will make us get lost in the authentic magic of Yogyakarta. One of the most beautiful and complete routes of the cultural capital of Indonesia. At the scheduled time, your guide will pick you up to begin your tour to Borobudur Temple (Candi Borobudur), the great Stupa, the largest Buddhist monument in the world and one of the seven wonders. We will tour around the temple, observe the hundreds and centenary statues of Buddha and witness how dozens of Buddhists come to preach from all over the world. Historically it was established during the relatively brief Sailendra dynasty of Central Java between 778 and 856 BC and is in constant restoration due to the breaks that the tremors of the neighbouring Merapi volcano have been producing during its history. After visiting one of the most important Buddhist temples in Southeast Asia, we continue our journey to the heart of the city. We will visit the Keraton, known as the Sultan’s Palace. The palace is a complex building two centuries old, located in the heart of the city. You will hear the song of “freedom” in the bird market. We will visit the “Water Castle” that occupies the highest part at the northern end of the vast complex of Taman Sari. Then we continue to Malioboro Street, main street of Yogyakarta, with its merchants, horse carriages, taxi-bikes and markets. An incredible experience that will make hours fly by. Finishing the tour in the centre of the city of Yogyakarta, we will head northeast towards Candi Prambanan, the temple of Hinduists which have been classified as a World Heritage Site by UNESCO since 1991. It was finished around the year 856 to commemorate the victory of the descendant Sanjaya of Siva, Rikai Pikatan on the last sovereign Sailendra of Central Java. Take your time to enjoy each carving on the rocks and feel the spirituality that each of the stones perched in this set of more than 200 Hindu temples that are dedicated to the Trimurti, the expression of God as the Creator, the Preserver and the Destroyer. After this unforgettable day, we will take you back to your hotel. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : A. The Phoenix - Deluxe Legacy Room Day 3 : Hotel - Airport You will enjoy a well-deserved breakfast at the hotel and according to the time of your flight, we will pick you up to take you to the airport and take the flight to your next destination. End of our services. Thank you very much for exploring Yogyakarta with Come2indonesia. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Schedule flights detail in YIA : ETA : 18.15 by Batik Air ID6374 from Jakarta on 05 Oct 2024 Dropoff point in Semarang : ARTOTEL SEMARANG Jl. Gajahmada No.101, Miroto, Kec. Semarang Tengah, Kota Semarang, Jawa Tengah 50134 Telepon: (024) 86405777 Day 1 / 5 oct : Ariival Yogyakarta - Hotel Day 2 / 6 oct : Borobudur temple - Kraton - Prambanan Day 3 / 7 oct : Tamansari, Bird/traditional market - Candirejo village - Transfer to Semarang Hotel in Yogyakarta : The Phoenix Hotel - 2 Unit Double Deluxe Legacy room','{\"date\": \"2024-10-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5221182,'744','Barbara Little',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-04','2024-10-05','Melysa','Komang',1,'Single',882000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-i