,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-18','2024-09-18','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting at the arrival hall exit, holding a signboard of your name/group name. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 3 hours after the flight’s estimated arrival time (ETA). - For any flight delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-09-18\", \"text\": \"ETA 18.30 by Malaysia Airlines MH853 from Kuala Lumpur on 18 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-18\", \"text\": \"Jl. Tirta Tawar Br Kutuh Kaja No.105, Petulu, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Calma Ubud Suite & Villas\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5222997,'749','Mercedes Tate & PARTY',30508,202891,'Contact with Nature Tour','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-19','2024-09-19','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1736000.00,'Deferent than the other tours! This tour will quietly finding you in the fullness of nature. First we will explore Pura Luhur Batukaru. Pura Luhur Batukaru Temple is one of the six directional temples on Bali that are believed to protect the island and its people from evil spirits. Pura Luhur Batukaru protects Bali from the West and was originally built in the 11th century. Pura Luhur Batukaru is one of Bali’s biggest Hindu temples, but because it is off the main tourist trail, sees fewer visitors than many of the other temples. Its peaceful setting amid rainforest at the foot of Mount Batukaru enhances its stunning Balinese architecture. We continue to reach the terrace rice fields Jatiluwih. Jatiluwih is a favorite tourist destination in Bali famous with the beautiful rice terrace unfolding from the foot of mountain until the coastal side. With the beautiful view as according to its name from Jati and Luwih, where Jati mean really and Luwih meaning especial, good, and beautiful or the equivalent. The local paddies are planted in this place look typically of the high relative size plant if it is compared with other pre-eminent paddy planted by most farmers in Bali. You’ll get to explore different parts of the terraces, jump over rivers. We continue our way to the Lake Buyan. We will see one of the most beautiful nature and vegetation scenery on the island. Buyan Lake is a smallest lake in Bali located in the plateau area with cool weather covers it. It is situated in the high land with hill and rain forest surrounds it. Since the location in the plateau area, the fog is usually blanketing the area. This lake can be seen from the top of hill which is called Asah Gobleg. The western end of Lake Buyan, we will start to see the sister lake of Buyan, the Lake Tamblingan. If we follow the road it will bring us closer and closer to Lake Tamblingan, or if we take direction to the right at the following junction at the end of the road, we will arrive in Munduk village, a village rich with coffee plantations. And our final destination is Munduk Waterfalls. This waterfall is a beautiful tourist destination in north part of Bali. Waterfall voice around the charming nature was amazing and it was the separate attraction which can be enjoyed by each visitor who comes to visit. In order to visit the waterfall, all visitors will follow the walkway down until the spot point.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-19\", \"text\": \"Jl. Tirta Tawar Br Kutuh Kaja No.105, Petulu, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Calma Ubud Suite & Villas\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5223011,'749','Mercedes Tate & PARTY',30508,212408,'Ubud to Uluwatu','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-20','2024-09-20','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-20\", \"text\": \"Jl. Tirta Tawar Br Kutuh Kaja No.105, Petulu, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali\", \"time\": \"12:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Calma Ubud Suite & Villas\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-20\", \"text\": \"Gg. Pande No.7, Pecatu, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Lulu’s Villas\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5223018,'749','Mercedes Tate & PARTY',30508,216161,'Uluwatu to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-23','2024-09-23','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver will wait up to 30 minutes after your scheduled pickup time. - Please keep in mind that any further delay could affect your timely arrival at the airport for your flight. - For any changes in