d pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-19\", \"text\": \"ETA 12.30 by Gili Gili Fast Boat from Gili Air on 19 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-19\", \"text\": \"Jl. Kartika Plaza No.127, Kuta, Kec. Kuta, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Vira Bali Boutique Hotel & Suite\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5226389,'758','Ana Maria Hernandez Martinez',30571,202567,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-19','2024-09-20','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',1204000.00,'Located at the Second Floor, 35 sqm comfort living with a touch of Balinese style featuring completed fitting, Cable TV, a fancy bathroom comprises rain shower and good quality amenities. Also dedicated Wi-Fi Access to complete your day.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-09-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5226453,'759','Marta Rodriguez Garcia',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-01','2024-10-01','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting at the arrival hall exit, holding a signboard of your name/group name. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 3 hours after the flight’s estimated arrival time (ETA). - For any flight delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-10-01\", \"text\": \"ETA 16.55 by IB7968 from Doha on 01 Oct\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-01\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Tegallalang, Banjar Sapat, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80561\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Tejaprana Resort & Spa\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5226460,'759','Marta Rodriguez Garcia',30527,200122,'Terrace Villa','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-10-01','2024-10-05','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',10304000.00,'After a day of adventure exploring the culture of Ubud and its surroundings, the Terrace View Villas offer a perfect retreat. These one-bedroom villas offer a spacious floor area of 70 m2, with a King-sized bed, air conditioning, private bathroom with bathtub, and a beautiful view of the nature surrounding the resort. Unwind in the private outdoor space in the gazebo on the personal terrace, laze in the infinity plunge pool, or simply lay back in the outdoor natural stone bathtub.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5226467,'759','Marta Rodriguez Garcia',30508,215968,'Goa Gajah - Tirtaempul - Gunung Kawi Sebatu - Tegalalang','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-02','2024-10-02','Guio','Tami',2,'Person (1)',1904000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-02\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Tegallalang, Banjar Sapat, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80561\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Tejaprana Resort & Spa\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5226473,'759','Marta Rodriguez Garcia',30508,202894,'Kehen Temple - Pengelipuran - Tukad Cepung Waterfall','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-03','2024-10-03','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1568000.00,'Our wonderful tour starts from Kehen Temple. It is an ancient Hindu temple complex boasting unique architectural features. The staircases reaching from the ground to temple courtyard are carved sandstone mythical animal and Balinese folklore figure statues and also the central vestibule. The temple’s walls are also ornate with Chinese porcelain plates, which are a tribute to the historical relations between the local Bali kingdom and China. Afterwards, we continue to Penglipuran, a village that succeeded in preserving its 75-hectare bamboo forest located in the northern part of the village. Members of this village have a strong commitment to the system of \'Ayahan Desa\' - a philosophy committed to respecting the land on which the village stands. To concludes the day, we stop by at Tukad Cepung Waterfall. Well-guarded by the circular cliffs, this waterfall is difficult to locate for the first time visitor. The circular cliffs give you the feeling of being in a cave, while the open sky right from where the waterfall emerges, gives you the most enchanting view. The sunlight falls on the glistering waterfall creating a rainbow, which feels as though it is projected right up to you. If you have never seen water flowing from the sky, then this would be your chance! After spending your time there, we go back to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-03\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Tegallalang, Banjar Sapat, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80561\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Tejaprana Resort & Spa\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5226475,'759','Marta Rodriguez Garcia',30508,202889,'Tamblingan Jungle Trek - Ulun Danu Temple','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-05','2024-10-05','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',2105600.00,'Today we will explore the nature of Buyan and Tamblingan lake in our lovely village, it will help you to escape from the crowds and fell the Nature atmosphere of the real jungle of Bali. We will pick you at your hotel at 07:30 AM and we drive to Tamblingan lake. Arrive in the trekking start point, we will have an explanation about the trekking. We will start the trek by entering a lush protected rain-forest area with giant old tress, animal such as macaque, black giant squirrel, birds and old legend temple inside in the Jungle. You will then walk along the shore of this lake situated in the caldera of an extinct Jungle Mountain. Our trekking guide will explain more detail about plants and living creatures in the jungle. This tour also combine with a session of thirty five minutes exploring the Tamblingan lake by dugout canoe to finishing point. Finish with trekking we will drop you to your hotel but we will make a stop at Ulun Danu Temple. Ulun Danu Temple Bratan, the famous temple stands on a small promontory located in the shore of Lake Bratan and has beautiful scenery with this lake and the mountains as backdrop sight.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-05\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Tegallalang, Banjar Sapat, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80561\", \"time\": \"07:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Tejaprana Resort & Spa\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-05\", \"text\": \"Jl. Asah Gobleg, Gobleg, Kec. Banjar, Kabupaten Buleleng, Bali 81152\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Munduk Moding Plantation Nature Resort, Bali\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5226490,'759','Marta Rodriguez Garcia',30578,203473,'One Bedroom Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-05','2024-10-06','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',6812736.00,'The One Bedroom Pool Villas comprise a generous living and dining room, a separate bedroom as well as a heated swimming pool and a jacuzzi with a palimanan stone terrace set in a separate compound with its own collection of flowers and indigenous plants and waited upon by a private butler. The views from the villa, the terrace and pool are of the rolling hills and the Java sea – they are unsurpassed. You will have 100 m2 of private living space made of noble and natural materials: merbau parquet flooring, a bathroom executed in Sulawesi cream marble, a polished terrazo stand alone bathtub and local art throughout the compound. There is a small private library, your own dining area and all conceivable mod cons. The one bedroom pool villas are the most private and luxurious place to stay at Munduk Moding Plantation, for couples who are looking for a truly tranquil treat in absolute privacy. You can relax with your loved one at your private pool while enjoying the sunset and the sounds and smells of nature. Breakfast (and any other meal should you so wish) will be served in the dining room with stunning view of mountains, volcanoes, orchards and the skyline and private butler service is available throughout your stay.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5226567,'759','Marta Rodriguez Garcia',30508,213318,'Munduk to Uluwatu','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-06','2024-10-06','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',616000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-06\", \"text\": \"Jl. Asah Gobleg, Gobleg, Kec. Banjar, Kabupaten Buleleng, Bali 81152\", \"time\": \"11:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Munduk Moding Plantation Nature Resort, Bali\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-06\", \"text\": \"Uluwatu Surf Villas, Pantai Suluban St, Pecatu, South Kuta, Badung Regency, Bali 80361\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Uluwatu Surf Villas\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5226639,'759','Marta Rodriguez Garcia',30508,216161,'Uluwatu to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-08','2024-10-08','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver will wait up to 30 minutes after your scheduled pickup time. - Please keep in mind that any further delay could affect your timely arrival at the airport for your flight. - For any changes in flight departure time, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available). - Requests for pickup time earlier than originally booked are subject to availability.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-08\", \"text\": \"Pantai Suluban St, Pecatu, South Kuta, Badung Regency, Bali 80361\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Uluwatu Surf Villas\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-08\", \"text\": \"ETD 09.10 by Wings Air IW1832 to Tambolaka on 08 Oct\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5226648,'759','Marta Rodriguez Garcia',30805,212248,'DPS-TMC','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-08','2024-10-08','Guio','Tami',2,'Person',5992000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5226697,'759','Marta Rodriguez Garcia',32859,219352,'Beach Suite','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-10-08','2024-10-10','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',25424000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5226702,'760','MARIO ALBERTO HERNANDEZ GARZA',30806,213012,'3D2N Borneo Orangutan Tour / Super Deluxe II, III, IV, V','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-11-10','2024-11-12','Igo','Igo',2,'Persons (2)',21033840.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN – KUMAI PORT – TANJUNG HARAPAN – PROBOSCIS TOUR Upon your arrival at Pangkalan Bun Airport, meet and greet with our staff and guide, then direct transfer to Kumai. It will take about 15–20 minutes by car. Upon your arrival in Kumai, you will be transferred directly to the houseboat. Lunch will be provided on board. Afterward, boating down the Kumai River. It takes approximately 15 minutes to reach the Seikonyer River, the main river in Tanjung Puting National Park. As you cruise up the Seikonyer River, you will see nice vegetation around the river bank: Nipa palm, Pandanus, and some kinds of trees that are growing up around the river. See some wildlife, such as birds, macaques, Proboscis monkeys, and orangutans. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. Then at 16.00, return back to the boat and continue boating up to observe and learn more about Proboscis monkeys along the river banks. Proboscis monkeys are an endemic animal that can be seen only in Borneo. Dinner and overnight on the Super Deluxe Houseboat Meals : Lunch – Dinner Accommodation : Super Deluxe Houseboat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY – CAMP LEAKEY After breakfast, you boat up to Pondok Tanggui, the second rehabilitation center for orangutans. Visit the orangutan feeding at 09.00 AM. Enjoy your time while taking some pictures. Then, at 10 a.m., return back to the houseboat and continue boating up to Camp Leakey. Camp Leakey is the highlight of the National Park. You will be passing by the Black River, which is full of wildlife, such as many kinds of birds, primates, fish, and crocodiles. Lunch will be served by our own cook with a variety of special food. On arrival in Camp Leakey, you will visit small museum to see all the work of Dr. Birute Galdikas, who studied the orangutan here from 1971 until today. Enjoy your time until 14.00, when you trek up into the forest to see orangutans feeding. Enjoy the time until 16.00, when you return to the boat and boat down directly to the Nipa Palm area to see thousands of fireflies. Dinner and overnight in the houseboat. Note : The Birute Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. Meals : Breakfast – Lunch – Dinner Accommodation : Super Deluxe Houseboat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT – PANGKALAN BUN After breakfast on board, you will boat down directly to Kumai and then have a direct transfer to Pangkalan Bun airport for your next destination. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board. ETA at 07.20 by Batik Air ID6202 from CGK ETD at 07.30 by Batik Air ID6203 to CGK','{\"date\": \"2024-11-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5226732,'759','Marta Rodriguez Garcia',30528,215622,'Lapopu Waterfall','Confirmed','WS1.2HD',1,'2024-10-10','2024-10-10','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2-3)',3192000.00,'Pick Up Time : 09.00 AM Pick Up / Drop Off Place : Waikabubak, Lamboya, Wanokaka Area (West Sumba) - Sumba Nautil Resort, Nihiwatu Resort, Lelewatu Resort, Rua Beach Resort, Alamayah Resort, The Sanubari Resort, Morika Hotel, Manandang Hotel, La Casa de Luna. *Other places or hotel, please contact us. After your breakfast at the hotel, you will be heading to another beautiful village, Praijing village. This village is built on top of a hill, and if you want to walk through the entire village, you actually have to walk down the hill. You will have an overview of the entire village at the entrance. On top of that, the inhabitants of the village built a spot where you can have a panoramic view of the village and beyond. The village is also surrounded by the beautiful nature of Sumba. Next on your adventure will be the Lapopu Waterfall. After a drive through the endless hilly and green landscape of Sumba, you will arrive near the waterfall. To visit the waterfall, you will need to do a short hike of approximately 15 minutes and cross a bamboo bridge to get there. There is a nice spot to sit down where you can watch the water find its way down the hill. You can also bring your swimming clothes to take a dive in the water just in front of the big waterfall. Meals : No Meals',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-10\", \"text\": \"Pantai Karoso, Ate Dalo, Kec. Kodi, Kabupaten Sumba Barat Daya, Nusa Tenggara Tim.\", \"time\": \"11:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Resort Cap Karoso\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-10\", \"text\": \"Pantai Dasang, Harona Kala, Laboya Barat, West Sumba Regency, East Nusa Tenggara\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Sanubari\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5226764,'759','Marta Rodriguez Garcia',31104,216820,'Garden Studio Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-10-10','2024-10-12','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',8904000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5227616,'761','Molly Armpriest',30508,202893,'Lempuyang Temple Tour (Goa Lawah - Lempuyang - Tirta Gangga - Tenganan)','Confirmed','C2I-BALI11',1,'2024-09-06','2024-09-06','Nicholas','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',1920000.00,'At the agreed time, our guide will pick you up to start the tour in the eastern part of Bali. The first place you will visit is Goa Lawah Temple. Goa Lawah Temple consists of two names, \"Goa\" which means cave and \"Lawah\" which means bat. Several thousand bats are flying in the cave as the name suggests. With the lights fading as you go deeper inside the cave, it gives off a very strange atmosphere. From Goa Lawah, we continue our way to Lempuyang Temple. Upon arrival, the temple will greet you with its gratifying panorama that extends into infinity. On a clear, sunny day, you\'ll be able to gaze out over the mountains, Amlapura city, and Mount Agung, an incredibly magnificent sight that\'s beautiful beyond words. This portrait of heaven is beautifully framed by the Gapura Candi Bentar (the gate of the temple). Our journey continues to visit Tirta Gangga. The site is a paradise surrounded by water, with all the pools decorated with unusual statues. With its seclusion and a view of the surrounding rice paddies, Tirta Gangga is a wonderful place. At the end of the trip we go to Tenganan Village, the most famous Bali Agas (the “original” Bali people) in the city. With its characteristics, the city village is arranged in parallel along the wide main road paved with rows of cobblestones. In Tenganan, women still weave the famous Kamben Geringsing, or \"burnt cloth,\" which has the power to immunize the wearer against evil. We take a close look at what they do in their daily lives in a traditional lifestyle. From Tenganan, we will transfer you to the hotel.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-06\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Pengosekan, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 972090\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Rama Phala Resort Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-06\", \"text\": \"TBA\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5227679,'759','Marta Rodriguez Garcia',30571,202567,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-12','2024-10-13','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',1204000.00,'Located at the Second Floor, 35 sqm comfort living with a touch of Balinese style featuring completed fitting, Cable TV, a fancy bathroom comprises rain shower and good quality amenities. Also dedicated Wi-Fi Access to complete your day.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5227821,'762','Laura De Santiago',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-20','2024-09-20','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (1-3)',420000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting at the arrival hall exit, holding a signboard of your name/group name. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 3 hours after the flight’s estimated arrival time (ETA). - For any flight delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-09-20\", \"text\": \"ETA : 23.59 by Philippine Airlines PR537 from Manila on 20 September 2024\", \"time\": \"23:59\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"International Airport Ngurah Rai\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-20\", \"text\": \"Jl. Suweta Banjar Bentuyung Ubud, Ubud, Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 973178\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Wapa Diume Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5227840,'762','Laura De Santiago',30778,201426,'1 Bedroom Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-09-20','2024-09-23','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',7938000.00,'A private individually villa overlooking to rice fields or private natural garden view. A one storey with pool that has a king size bed. The bath room features a sunken bath and the balcony. The villas offers wonderful views of the surrounding countryside ensconced in complete luxury. Complete with daybeds and cushions for luxurious lounging, the villas also offer the wonderful furnishings and bathing facilities that come as standard at this boutique resort. An escape from the world, by reconnecting to it.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5227845,'762','Laura De Santiago',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Goa Gajah – Tampaksiring - Gunung Kawi – Tegalalangy)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-22','2024-09-22','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',1792000.00,NULL,NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-22\", \"text\": \"Jl. Suweta Banjar Bentuyung Ubud, Ubud, Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 973178\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Wapa Diume Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-22\", \"text\": \"Jl. Suweta Banjar Bentuyung Ubud, Ubud, Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 973178\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Wapa Diume Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5227877,'762','Laura De Santiago',30508,202881,'1D Bali Tour (Bedugul - Jati Luwih - Cascada Leke Leke – Tanah Lot)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-23','2024-09-23','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',1579200.00,'We begin the tour from a beautiful rice terrace of Jatiluwih. Unfolding from the foot of mountain until the coastal side, it is one of places in Bali with the beautiful view, as according to its name “Jati” and “Luwih”, where Jati mean really and Luwih meaning especial, good, and beautiful or the equivalent. The local paddies are planted in this place look typically of the high relative size plant if it is compared with other pre-eminent paddy planted by most farmers in Bali. Stroll around the area for a while and take a nice pictures, before we continue to Banyumala Twin Waterfall. The waterfall is special in that there are two flows of water to be seen, hence the name ‘twin’. Water cascades down steep rocks with gorgeous greenery surrounding them. Here you can take a refreshing dip in the plunge pool at the bottom - dunk your head and listen to the sounds of the water crashing down. After the refreshment, we conclude our day by heading to Wanagiri Hidden Hill. This hill has a charm of beauty that can make anyone who saw her feel hypnotized and fell in love Beautiful natural paintings depicting the beautiful mountains, the beautiful green trees, and the expanse of the lake can be seen clearly from this place. In addition to the panoramic view, cool and fresh air is also an added value that makes this tourist area worth visiting. Take photos and enjoy the scenery and then we head back to your hotel.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-23\", \"text\": \"Jl. Suweta Banjar Bentuyung Ubud, Ubud, Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 973178\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Wapa Diume Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-23\", \"text\": \"Jl. Pemutih, Jl. Labuansait, Pecatu, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361 Telepon: (0361) 8957555\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Anantara Uluwatu\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5227931,'762','Laura De Santiago',32958,218210,'Fun Diving - Qualified Divers','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-09-24','2024-09-25','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',3360000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5227948,'762','Laura De Santiago',30508,212545,'Uluwatu to Sanur','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-24','2024-09-24','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (1-3)