22:40 from Doha by Iberia Air IB7970\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-27\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar Telepon: (0361) 975976\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Bucu View Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5228123,'675','Marta Gomez Cortijo',30707,200971,'Suite Pool View without Balcony','Confirmed',NULL,8,'2024-10-02','2024-10-10','Jacob','Febrina',1,'Double',12480000.00,'The view from the various rooms is stunning and will take your breath away every day. The suite features a living room, minibar, telephone, TV, electric kettle, bathtub, standing shower, toilet amenities, hairdryer, hot & cold water, writing table, dining table, sofa, and private balcony.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-10-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5228124,'764','Mrs. Laura Cuoto Ramon',30615,201042,'River Pool Villa with Breakfast','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-09-27','2024-09-29','Guio','Praba',1,'Double',4080000.00,'Dive into your private swimming pool after a long day in the River Pool Villa. Furthermore, the villa offers a bathtub and private balcony with a beautiful view of Ubud. This air-conditioned room comes with a TV, mosquito nets, and a fridge with minibar. The private bathroom offers hot water.',NULL,'- HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-09-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5228130,'764','Mrs. Laura Cuoto Ramon',30615,201040,'Valley Suite Room with Breakfast','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-09-29','2024-10-02','Guio','Praba',1,'Double',3960000.00,'Relax after a long day in our bathtub with river view in the Valley suite. This air-conditioned room comes with a TV, mosquito nets, and a fridge with minibar. The private bathroom offers hot water.',NULL,'- HONEYMOONERS - Please noted that guest have to move room on last night 1 - 2 Oct 2024, can\'t stay on same Valley Suite Room','{\"date\": \"2024-09-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5228137,'764','Mrs. Laura Cuoto Ramon',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route (Ulun danu Beratan – Casada Leke – Leke – Tanah Lot)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-29','2024-09-29','Guio','Praba',2,'Persons (2)',1872000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-29\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar Telepon: (0361) 975976\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Bucu View Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-29\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar Telepon: (0361) 975976\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Bucu View Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5228173,'764','Mrs. Laura Cuoto Ramon',30508,202893,'Lempuyang Temple Tour (Tenganan - Virgin Beach - Lempuyang Temple - Tirta Gangga)','Confirmed','C2I-BALI11',1,'2024-09-30','2024-09-30','Guio','Praba',2,'Persons (2)',1920000.00,'At the agreed time, our guide will pick you up to start the tour in the eastern part of Bali. The first place you will visit is Goa Lawah Temple. Goa Lawah Temple consists of two names, \"Goa\" which means cave and \"Lawah\" which means bat. Several thousand bats are flying in the cave as the name suggests. With the lights fading as you go deeper inside the cave, it gives off a very strange atmosphere. From Goa Lawah, we continue our way to Lempuyang Temple. Upon arrival, the temple will greet you with its gratifying panorama that extends into infinity. On a clear, sunny day, you\'ll be able to gaze out over the mountains, Amlapura city, and Mount Agung, an incredibly magnificent sight that\'s beautiful beyond words. This portrait of heaven is beautifully framed by the Gapura Candi Bentar (the gate of the temple). Our journey continues to visit Tirta Gangga. The site is a paradise surrounded by water, with all the pools decorated with unusual statues. With its seclusion and a view of the surrounding rice paddies, Tirta Gangga is a wonderful place. At the end of the trip we go to Tenganan Village, the most famous Bali Agas (the “original” Bali people) in the city. With its characteristics, the city village is arranged in parallel along the wide main road paved with rows of cobblestones. In Tenganan, women still weave the famous Kamben Geringsing, or \"burnt cloth,\" which has the power to immunize the wearer against evil. We take a close look at what they do in their daily lives in a traditional lifestyle. From Tenganan, we will transfer you to the hotel.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-30\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar Telepon: (0361) 975976\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Bucu View Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-30\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar Telepon: (0361) 975976\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Bucu View Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5228199,'766','Wojciech Maga',31591,207372,'4D3N Tangkoko','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-09-02','2024-09-05','Ayu','Tami',2,'Persons (1-3)',9240000.00,'Day 1 : MANADO - TANGKOKO - The expedition begins The adventure begins with meeting your guide at the Manado airport. Then you will start the journey of about 2 and a half hours by car to the Tangkoko Forest where you will do the check in at your Homestay or Lodge. Upon arrival, you will have a talk about what you will see and preparations for the trekking. Meals : Dinner Accommodation : Bird House Homestay or Similar Days 02 - 03 : Tangkoko Nature Reserve These days will be dedicated to exploring the jungle in search of animals and bird watching. You will start the trekking that will take you to Tangkok National Park. In just 40 minutes by boat, you will reach the Batuangus beach where you will then climb Mount Tangkoko (1500 m). The dense and virgin jungle is home to some unique animal species in North Sulawesi such as the crested black macaque and the tarsier spectrum that has become known as \"the smallest primate in the world\". As you will be trekking through the lush jungle, you will probably see and hear the red gnarled hornbill as well as the Maleo which is a Megapod Bird that lays eggs on large mounds it builds on the black sand. You can also find couscous, which is a relative of the Australian koala. The forest ranger will accompany you all the way to the top of Tangkoko Mountain. In the afternoon you will return to the station. Alternatively, you can have three hours of trekking in the lowland jungle or swimming on the black sand beach of Tangkoko. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Bird House Homestay or Similar Day 04 : Tangkoko - Manado After breakfast, you can spend the morning in the surroundings of the National Park and at the agreed time, with your guide, you will have the transfer to Manado. Thank you for exploring this unique jungle with us. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Flight details ETA 12.25 by Batik Air ID6280 from Jakarta on 02 Sept 2024 ETD 17.00 by Batik Air ID6275 to Jakarta on 05 Sept 2024','{\"date\": \"2024-09-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5228203,'764','Mrs. Laura Cuoto Ramon',30508,202882,'Tegalalang – Tirta Empul – Tukad Cepung – Kintamani - Besakih Temple','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-01','2024-10-01','Guio','Praba',2,'Persons (2)',1848000.00,'The first destination is Kusamba Beach, it is one of the favorite places of interest in Bali which is famous with the beautiful beach, we can also meet a fish market in this place which is usually held between 10 am until 4 pm. Then we go to Goa Lawah, this is one of the favourite place to be visited, because here is a nature cave dwelt by thousands of tail bat located at north side from Jeroan/center of Goa Lawah Temple. Next we go to Bukit Jambul, it is strategically located beside of the main road from Denpasar to Besakih Temple and it is one of the tourist destinations that visited on Besakih Tour. It is situated in the plateau area which is blessed with the beautiful panorama of rice terrace and green coconuts three unfolding to the sea. After visit Bukit Jambul, we’ll continue to Besakih Temple is the biggest Hindu temple in Bali which the local people call Pura Besakih. It owns beautiful view from the top of temple area where we can see the wide nature panorama until to the ocean so that’s why this temple is many visited by tourists from all over the world. Then go to Kertagosa, This place also owns Taman Gili, a building floating or sees like floating because it is intentionally founded in the middle of a fish pond.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-01\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar Telepon: (0361) 975976\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Bucu View Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-01\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar Tele