ur Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-24\", \"text\": \"Jl. Pemutih, Jl. Labuansait, Pecatu, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361 Telepon: (0361) 8957555\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Anantara Uluwatu\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5228239,'764','Mrs. Laura Cuoto Ramon',31040,203404,'Ocean View Bungalow Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-02','2024-10-03','Guio','Praba',1,'Double',1140000.00,'Room size: 55 sqm. The ocean view bungalow room has 13 units available. The rooms at this Nusa Penida hotel provide guests with high-velocity internet and a flat-screen TV with satellite channels, and comforts such as ironing facilities and air conditioning. The units are designed in a comfortable manner. Offering amenities like hair dryers and bathrobes, the bathrooms also include a walk-in shower, a separate toilet and a sink.',NULL,'- HONEYMOONERS - Transfer from Hotel to Harbor on 3 October 2024 BlueWater Express office at Buyuk harbour Nusa Penida Fastboat ETD 09:00AM to Gili Air','{\"date\": \"2024-10-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5228265,'762','Laura De Santiago',33210,219366,'Ocean Front Suite','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-09-23','2024-09-25','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',13876800.00,'Ocean Front Suites are located near the cliff\'s edge, affording uninterrupted views of the ocean and tiered resort pool below. Floor-to-ceiling windows at our Bali cliff resort make the most of the surreal setting, paired with contemporary tropical design imparting a sense of the destination.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5228278,