ber of stairs that lead to and from the building this accommodation it is not recommended for guests with small children (children are not allowed in the deluxe rooms and below 5 years old are not allowed in the apartment) or with mobility difficulties.',NULL,'- HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-10-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5228320,'764','Mrs. Laura Cuoto Ramon',30508,216161,'Uluwatu to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-07','2024-10-07','Guio','Praba',1,'Persons (2)',420000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver will wait up to 30 minutes after your scheduled pickup time. - Please keep in mind that any further delay could affect your timely arrival at the airport for your flight. - For any changes in flight departure time, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available). - Requests for pickup time earlier than originally booked are subject to availability.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-07\", \"text\": \"Gg. Mertasari, Pecatu, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali Telepon: 0812-3979-9199\", \"time\": \"20:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sal Secret Spot\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-07\", \"text\": \"International Departure ETD 01:05 by Iberia IB7967 to Doha\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5229215,'725','Sonia Alessandra Gossi',32589,215931,'Beach Front Private Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-09-08','2024-09-10','Melysa','Tami',1,'Double',13560000.00,'These elegantly appointed 95 square meters private beachfront suites are warm, inviting and extremely comfortable, with custom-designed interiors commemorating Modern Bali blended with contemporary luxury and hi-tech functionality. The soothing simplicity of the décor creates a calm haven that is the perfect antidote to the hustle and bustle of the city. Wake up to stunning views of the majestic Indian Ocean, transform your private 1.5-m deep plunge pool and its gorgeous deck area into your own private dining venue – these suites are perfect for romantic getaways. Each elegantly appointed suite is furnished with dual rain showers, separate bath and private access to the beach and finest Sensatia Botanicals amenities. A separate serviced lounge features a splendid pool affording spectacular ocean views also daily refreshment for mini bar.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5229216,'725','Sonia Alessandra Gossi',30508,207250,'Airport to Kuta','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-08','2024-09-08','Melysa','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',300000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting at the arrival hall exit, holding a signboard of your name/group name. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 3 hours after the flight’s estimated arrival time (ETA). - For any flight delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-09-08\", \"text\": \"ETA 15.25 by Citilink QG668 from Surabaya on 08 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-08\", \"text\": \"Jl. Kartika Plaza, Tuban, Kec. Kuta, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Anvaya Beach Resort Bali\"}','2026-08-28 07: