26-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5229243,'725','Sonia Alessandra Gossi',30783,217507,'5D4N Yogyakarta Bromo By Train / Land Arrangement only','Confirmed',NULL,5,'2024-09-04','2024-09-08','Melysa','Tami',1,'Person (1)',14580000.00,'D1. Pick Up Semarang - Yogyakarta D2. Borobudur - Village tour with Batik - Merapi D3. Jogja City Tour - Prambanan D4. Jogja - Bromo by Train D5. Bromo Tour - Surabaya Airport',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-04\", \"text\": \"ETA 12.10 by Batik Air ID6344 from Jakarta on 04 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Yogyakarta International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-08\", \"text\": \"ETD 13.30 by Citilink QG668 to Denpasar on 08 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Surabaya International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5229525,'768','MARIA PILAR SANTAMARIA ESQUINAS',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-12','2024-10-13','Nicholas','Eddy',1,'Double',840000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'HONEYMOON Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK-IN. FM7 Hotel Airport Pickup Service: +62811-8815-053 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-10-12\", \"text\": \"ETA:12 OCT 17:35 TK56 by Turkish Airlines\", \"time\": \"17:35\", \"locality\": \"AIRPORT JAKARTA\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-13\", \"text\": \"ETD:13 OCT 0600 ID6368 to (YIA ) Yogyakarta by Batik Airlines\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"AIRPORT JAKARTA\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5229531,'263','Danny Van Belle 20235019',30683,203329,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-28','2024-11-29','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Double',980000.00,'Feel at home in one of our Superior Rooms - warm colors giving an inviting feel and ambiance. Although you are in the heart of Soekarno - Hatta Airport you can find a small oasis of relaxation where you will leave the hustle and bustle of traveling far behind spacious 24 square meters. Superior room with a king or twin beds offering comfortable stay equipped with modern facilities such as air conditioning, arm chair, work desk & chair, flat screen TV with cable and satellite channels, free access internet & Wi-Fi, in room safe, coffee/tea maker, mini cooler, private bathroom with shower and hair dryer, and many more.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5229548,'768','MARIA PILAR SANTAMARIA ESQUINAS',30783,201474,'2D1N Semarang - Yogyakarta / B. Gallery Prawirotaman (Superior Room)','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-10-13','2024-10-14','Nicholas','Eddy',2,'Persons (2)',10200000.00,'D1 : Arrival Semarang airport - Borobudur Temple tour incl. Mendut and Pawon - overnight in Yogyakarta Welcome to the cradle of Indonesian culture, Yogyakarta. A tourist destination for its ancient palaces, temples, batik workshops, gamelan music orchestras, court dances and wayang puppet shows. Upon your arrival in Semarang airport a representative of come2indonesia will be waiting for you with a sign indicating your name to start exploring this special city. We will start by heading towards Borobudur Temple (Candi Borobudur), the great Stupa, the largest Buddhist monument in the world and one of the seven wonders. We will tour around the temple, observe the hundreds and centenary statues of Buddha and witness how dozens of Buddhists come to preach from all over the world. Historically it was established during the relatively brief Sailendra dynasty of Central Java between 778 and 856 BC and is in constant restoration due to the breaks that the tremors of the neighbouring Merapi volcano has been producing during its history. After visiting one of the most important Buddhist temples in Southeast Asia, we continue our journey to the Mendut temple and Pawon temple. And then, we will take you to your Jogjakarta. D2 : Morning visit Prambanan Temple - City Tour Yogyakarta visit Sultan Palace, Watercastle and Bird Market - Transfer to Yogyakarta International Airport You will enjoy a well-deserved breakfast at the hotel and we will start by heading towards Candi Prambanan, the temple of the Hinduists and classified as a World Heritage Site by Unesco since 1991. The built of this temple was finished around the year 856 to commemorate the victory of the descendant Sanjaya of Siva, Rikai Pikatan on the last sovereign Sailendra of Central Java. Take your time to enjoy each carving on the rocks and feel the spirituality that each of the stones perched in this set of more than 200 Hindu temples that are dedicated to the Trimurti, the expression of God as the Creator, the Preserver and the destroyer. After this visit we go to the Keraton known as the Sultan’s Palace. The palace is a complex building two centuries old, located in the heart of the city. You will hear the song of the “freedom” of the birds in the bird market, we will visit the “Water Castle” that occupies the highest part at the northern end of the vast complex of Taman Sari, Malioboro Street, main street of Yogyakarta, with its merchants, horse carriages, taxi-bikes and markets. An incredible experience that will make the hours fly by. According to the time of your flight, we will pick you up to take you to the airport and take the flight to your next destination. End of our services. Thank you very much for exploring Yogyakarta by the hand of Come2indonesia.',NULL,'HONEYMOON 1013 Día 02: Yogyakarta – Templo Prambanan – Templo Borobudur – Keraton 1014 Día 03: Yogyakarta City Tour – Semarang','{\"date\": \"2024-10-13\", \"text\": \"ETA:13 OCT 0710 ID6368 From (CGK) Jakarta by Batik Airlines\", \"time\": \"07:10\", \"locality\": \"AIPORT YOGYAKARTA\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-14\", \"text\": \"Address : Jl. Gajahmada No.101, Miroto, Kec. Semarang Tengah, Kota Semarang, Jawa Tengah 50134 Phone : (024) 86405777\\\"\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"ARTOTEL GAJAHMADA SEMARANG\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5229553,'769','Victor Manuel Salgado Navarro',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-02','2024-10-02','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',336000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting at the arrival hall exit, holding a signboard of your name/group name. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 3 hours after the flight’s estimated arrival time (ETA). - For any flight delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-10-02\", \"text\": \"ETA 16.40 by Vietjet Air VJ897 from Ho Chi Minh on 02 Oct\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-02\", \"text\": \"Banjar Nagi, Desa Petulu, Ubud, Bali, 80571 Indonesia\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Kayon Valley Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5229554,'769','Victor Manuel Salgado Navarro',31351,205522,'Kayon Valley Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-10-02','2024-10-05','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',16396800.00,'This villa\'s special feature is the pool with a view. The air-conditioned villa features 1 bedroom and 1 bathroom with a walk-in shower and a bath. Featuring a terrace with garden views, this villa also provides a mini-bar and a flat-screen TV with satellite channels. The unit offers 1 bed.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5229556,'768','MARIA PILAR SANTAMARIA ESQUINAS',30672,200737,'Studio 25 (Superior) Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-14','2024-10-15','Nicholas','Eddy',1,'Double',684000.00,'Studio 25 (Superior) room with 25 sqm sized room and with exclusive ARTOTEL bedding collection, some facilities in this room is 43\" inch lcd tv, 24 hours in-room service, high speed internet wi-fi, safety deposit box and hair dryer.',NULL,'HONEYMOON Include One Way Transfer AT 15 OCT from HOTEL TO AIRPORT SEMARANG','{\"date\": \"2024-10-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-15\", \"text\": \"ETD:15 OCT 0830 ID6302 To (PKN) Pangkalan Bun by Batik Airlines\", \"time\": \"06:30\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5229557,'769','Victor Manuel Salgado Navarro',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-04','2024-10-04','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1747200.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-04\", \"text\": \"Br. Nagi, Petulu, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Kayon Valley Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5229561,'769','Victor Manuel Salgado Navarro',30508,207262,'Ubud to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-05','2024-10-05','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver will wait up to 30 minutes after your scheduled pickup time. - Please keep in mind that any further delay could affect your timely arrival at the airport for your flight. - For any changes in flight departure time, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available). - Requests for pickup time earlier than originally booked are subject to availability.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"04:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Kayon Valley Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-05\", \"text\": \"ETD 08.00 by Batik Air ID6333 to Labuan Bajo on 05 Oct\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5229565,'769','Victor Manuel Salgado Navarro',30508,212288,'Airport to Seminyak','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-08','2024-10-08','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting at the arrival hall exit, holding a signboard of your name/group name. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 3 hours after the flight’s estimated arrival time (ETA). - For any flight delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-10-08\", \"text\": \"ETA 14.55 by Batik Air ID6330 from Labuan Bajo on 08 Oct\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-08\", \"text\": \"Jl. Camplung Tanduk No.10, Seminyak, Kec. Kuta, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Hotel Indigo Bali Seminyak Beach\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5229572,'769','Victor Manuel Salgado Navarro',30597,201143,'Standard Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-08','2024-10-09','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',3584000.00,'At 50 sqm room size, Standard Room an inviting hideaway in the heart of Seminyak. Tucked at the side of the resort building, this room is the perfect choice for a quiet hideaway in the heart of Seminyak. Providing an ample daylight from the private balcony with daybed, this room is eclectically designed, featuring a spa inspired ensuite bathroom. Treat your loved one to an unforgettable stay at one of the finest Seminyak beachfront resorts.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5229576,'768','MARIA PILAR SANTAMARIA ESQUINAS',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-10-15','2024-10-17','Nicholas','Eddy',2,'Persons (2)',10800000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan isCape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continueto add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-15\", \"text\": \"ETA:15 OCT 0930 ID6302 From (SRG) Semarang by Batik Airlines\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-17\", \"text\": \"ETD:17 OCT 0850 ID6134 To (SUB) Surabaya by Batik Airlines\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5229577,'555','Marie Louise Dieringer (September-October 2024)',30914,202451,'Deluxe Pool Access','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-10-13','2024-10-16','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Single',7380000.00,'At 51 sqm with king and twin size beds capacity of 2 (two) adults and 2 (two) child below 12 years old. Ideal for family or group of friends traveling together, the Deluxe Pool Access rooms allows guests a direct access from a private balcony to a communal pool shared with several other Deluxe Pool Access rooms, making it easy to have a refreshing swim.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-16\",