ture. Restoring a sense of longing for a soul-soothing green landscape is the main reason this suite was built. A rustic themed room with a minimalist touch. Aura of relaxation is felt once you first open the two-panel wooden door wide enough to let that tropical wind roll into the room. Directly facing the opposite of the wide balcony, the green landscape is ready to calm your soul. Our Kelimutu Deluxe Suite has 32 units, 16 lower level suites (44 sqm), overlooking to the garden from private terrace and 16 upper level suite (40 sqm) with private balcony and tropical garden view. This suite is equipped with luxurious king-sized and twin bed, efficient and sustainable air-conditioning, 43\" smart TV, complimentary wireless internet, safe deposit box, water heater, private bathroom with bathroom amenities, hairdryer, bathrobe, daily turndown service, and many more.',NULL,'Include Oneway Airport Transfer (Private) / flight schedule : ETA : 16.30 by Super Airjet IU726 from Surabaya on 11 Oct 2024','{\"date\": \"2024-10-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5230089,'768','MARIA PILAR SANTAMARIA ESQUINAS',30508,202892,'Templo Taman Ayun - Jatiluwih - Templo Ulun Danu Bratan - Pura Tanah Lot','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-20','2024-10-20','Nicholas','Eddy',2,'Persons (2)',1872000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-20\", \"text\": \"UBUD VILLAGE HOTEL at Monkey Forest Address: Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone: (0361) 975571\\\"\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-20\", \"text\": \"UBUD VILLAGE HOTEL at Monkey Forest Address: Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone: (0361) 975571\\\"\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5230104,'744','Barbara Little',30805,212510,'LBJ-CGK','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-15','2024-10-15','Melysa','Komang',4,'Person',10120000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \