\": \"2024-09-19\", \"text\": \"ETD 12.05 by Garuda GA253 to Yogyakarta on 19 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5231338,'773','Julia Valero',30783,201516,'3D2N Yogya-Bromo / Land Arrangement only','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-09-19','2024-09-21','Nicholas','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',13140000.00,'D1 Pick up at hotel in Jogja. By Train to Mojokerto then continue drive to Bromo: Welcome to the cradle of Indonesian culture, Yogyakarta. A tourist destination for its ancient palaces, temples, batik workshops, gamelan music orchestras, court dances and wayang puppet shows. You will enjoy your breakfast at the hotel, and at the indicated time, with your guide, you will travel to Jombang / Mojokerta by train. Then by private car you will go to your hotel located on the slopes of the Bromo volcano. In total it will be about 8 hours of travel. Upon arrival, you check-in at The hotel and enjoy your deserved rest. D2 Mt. Penanjakan Sunrise and Bromo crater tour including Jeep – Transfer to Ijen: Very early, your guide and a jeep driver will be waiting for you at the hotel to attend one of the most spectacular sunrises in Indonesia. Even though you have to get up early, it will be worth it. You will climb to a high point first in full darkness and, little by little the first rays of sun are giving way to a huge and indescribable caldera that makes up the entire view of the Bromo and Semeru Natural Park. With Bromo, a volcano of great fumaroles and behind it, the Semeru Volcano with explosions every 20 minutes exactly, will make you have one of the most rewarding experiences ever. After enjoying the sunset, by jeep, we will go to the slopes of the volcano where you can go to the Bromo volcano and after climbing some stairs you can reach the very edge of its crater and see the impressive activity it has. We return to the hotel to cool off and enjoy your breakfast. At the agreed time, we will leave for our next destination, the Ijen volcano. This section lasts about 7-8 hours by car where we will make a stop to eat. Take this trip to rest. Arriving in Ijen, we will leave you at your hotel, where you will check in and enjoy your well-deserved rest. D3 Mt. Ijen crater tour – Drop at hotel in Bali: The day has finally come to visit one of the most attractive volcanoes in Indonesia! One of the last open pit sulfur mines that survive on the planet. For this climb you can choose between two schedules. Or leave very early to see the blue lava (leaving the hotel about 1.30am) or leave more quietly only for sunrise (about 4am). Depending on how tired you are of the trip from Bromo to Ijen, you can decide the day before with your guide. Once we pick you up at your hotel, you will head towards the village of Licin to reach the slope of the volcano to begin the steep climb to the crater of the volcano. During this trek, your guide will give you double filter masks to protect you from the natural chemicals of sulfur. Once above, at an altitude of 2883 meters and when dawn begins, your eyes will open before your eyes an incredible contrast of colors. A yellow earth scene and a large turquoise blue lake inside the crater that contrast with a suspended white cloud that is continuously expelling the volcano. In turn, among so much beauty you will see the locals work where it is said, it is one of the toughest jobs in the world. These miners go down to the crater of the volcano to load 80 to 100 kilos of sulfur on their shoulders and then sell it. After this amazing experience on the edge of the Ijen volcano crater, we begin the descent with an incredible panoramic view of the mountains that make up the national park. We will take you to your hotel to cool off and have breakfast and we start the road to Bali for about 5 hours. To do this, we will go first to the port of Banyuwangui where we will take the ferry to cross to Bali. It is a journey of only 30 minutes where you must remember to add an hour to your watch, because we change the time slot. Welcome to the island of the Gods.',NULL,'Accommodation Yogyakarta : Melia Purosani Bromo : ARTOTEL Cabin Bromo','{\"date\": \"2024-09-19\", \"text\": \"ETA 12.45 by Garuda GA253 from Denpasar on 19 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Yogyakarta International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-21\", \"text\": \"ETD 14.00 by Hahn Air X16440 to Lombok on 21 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Surabaya International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5231375,'775','Dmitry Komissarchik',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-19','2024-12-20','Nicholas','Wiwik',2,'Double + Twin',1680000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'FLIGTH DETAIL: ETA: 21.25 by QR954 from DOHA on 19 December 2024. ETD: 06.00 by Batik Air ID6202 to Pangkalan Bun on 20 December 2024. Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK-IN. FM7 Hotel Airport Pickup Service: +62811-8815-053 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-12-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5231409,'773','Julia Valero',30508,207383,'Padang Bai to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-25','2024-09-25','Nicholas','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',600000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver will wait up to 30 minutes after your scheduled pickup time. - Please keep in mind that any further delay could affect your timely arrival at the airport for your flight. - For any changes in flight departure time, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available). - Requests for pickup time earlier than originally booked are subject to availability.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"13:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbour by Wahana Virendra Fastboat from Gili Trawangan\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-25\", \"text\": \"ETD: 19.10 by QR963 to Doha on 25 September 2024.\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"AIRPORT NGURAH RAI (TERMINAL INTERNATIONAL)\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5231450,'775','Dmitry Komissarchik',30806,213012,'3D2N Borneo Orangutan Tour / Super Deluxe','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-12-20','2024-12-22','Nicholas','Wiwik',4,'Persons (3-4)',37972080.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN – KUMAI PORT – TANJUNG HARAPAN – PROBOSCIS TOUR Upon your arrival at Pangkalan Bun Airport, meet and greet with our staff and guide, then direct transfer to Kumai. It will take about 15–20 minutes by car. Upon your arrival in Kumai, you will be transferred directly to the houseboat. Lunch will be provided on board. Afterward, boating down the Kumai River. It takes approximately 15 minutes to reach the Seikonyer River, the main river in Tanjung Puting National Park. As you cruise up the Seikonyer River, you will see nice vegetation around the river bank: Nipa palm, Pandanus, and some kinds of trees that are growing up around the river. See some wildlife, such as birds, macaques, Proboscis monkeys, and orangutans. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. Then at 16.00, return back to the boat and continue boating up to observe and learn more about Proboscis monkeys along the river banks. Proboscis monkeys are an endemic animal that can be seen only in Borneo. Dinner and overnight on the Super Deluxe Houseboat Meals : Lunch – Dinner Accommodation : Super Deluxe Houseboat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY – CAMP LEAKEY After breakfast, you boat up to Pondok Tanggui, the second rehabilitation center for orangutans. Visit the orangutan feeding at 09.00 AM. Enjoy your time while taking some pictures. Then, at 10 a.m., return back to the houseboat and continue boating up to Camp Leakey. Camp Leakey is the highlight of the National Park. You will be passing by the Black River, which is full of wildlife, such as many kinds of birds, primates, fish, and crocodiles. Lunch will be served by our own cook with a variety of special food. On arrival in Camp Leakey, you will visit small museum to see all the work of Dr. Birute Galdikas, who studied the orangutan here from 1971 until today. Enjoy your time until 14.00, when you trek up into the forest to see orangutans feeding. Enjoy the time until 16.00, when you return to the boat and boat down directly to the Nipa Palm area to see thousands of fireflies. Dinner and overnight in the houseboat. Note : The Birute Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. Meals : Breakfast – Lunch – Dinner Accommodation : Super Deluxe Houseboat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT – PANGKALAN BUN After breakfast on board, you will boat down directly to Kumai and then have a direct transfer to Pangkalan Bun airport for your next destination. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'FLIGHT DETAIL: ETA: 07.15 by Batik Air ID6202 from Jakarta on 20 December 2024. ETD: 10.25 by Batik Air ID6303 to Semarang on 22 December 2024. Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-12-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5231466,'777','Ms. LISARD BARCELO',31015,203232,'3D2N - Bali Ijen Mount Bromo Tour Package drop Surabaya','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-09-30','2024-10-02','Jacob','Praba',2,'Persons (2)',8880000.00,NULL,NULL,'Details: 30 Sep : Pick up at Nivaluma Ubud (10:00am) - Ketapang - Ijen Resort 1 Oct : Ijen Crater Tour - Bromo hotel 2 Oct : Bromo Sunrise Tour - drop Surabaya (please reconfirm hotel name to guest)','{\"date\": \"2024-09-30\", \"text\": \"Mas Village, Jl. Rapuan, MAS, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571, Indonesia, 80571 Ubud, Indonesia\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nivaluma Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-02\", \"text\": \"Jl. Kp. Baru, Kp. Baru, Tambakoso, Waru, Surabaya, 61256 Surabaya, Indonesia\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Surabaya\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5231470,'778','Bernd Renzer 20235114',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Custom Itinerary)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-20','2024-10-20','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Person (1)',2918720.00,NULL,NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified 