 in a simple and elegant setting. Guests can relax while peacefully sipping drinks in an inviting plunge pool surrounded by a lush tropical garden and at an old-wooden deck. At 85 m2 room size, this villa\'s special feature is the private pool. The air-conditioned villa features 1 bedroom and 1 bathroom with a shower and a hairdryer. The villa provides a mini-bar, a tea and coffee maker, a seating area as well as a terrace with garden views. The unit offers 1 bed.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-12-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5235307,'786','AITOR MORELL GOLFE',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-24','2024-09-24','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (1-3)',672000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting at the arrival hall exit, holding a signboard of your name/group name. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 3 hours after the flight’s estimated arrival time (ETA). - For any flight delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-09-24\", \"text\": \"ETA : 19.15 by Turkish Airlines TK66 from Istanbul on 24 September 2024\", \"time\": \"19:15\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"International Ngurah Rai Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-24\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Andong, Banjar Nagi, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 975825\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kamandalu Resort Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5235328,'786','AITOR MORELL GOLFE',30983,203012,'Garden Villa','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-24','2024-09-25','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',5292000.00,'Recharge in one of our newly refurbished Garden Villas whose sophisticated interiors are a blend of warm tones and bright accents. Each of our individually designed Garden Villas offer plenty of space to unwind. Make the most of our traditional Balinese village atmosphere by relaxing in the shade of the villa’s handcrafted wooden Bale Bengong (daybed), privately cocooned within a landscaped tropical garden. You can even have an intimate dinner without going anywhere at all, set-up by one of our expert staff so that you may enjoy a stunning sunset from the comfort of your villa. Each villa has either a four-post king-size bed or twin beds, a newly fitted semi-outdoor standing bathtub and our signature outdoor shower.',NULL,'The guest is Honeymooner','{\"date\": \"2024-09-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5235352,'786','AITOR MORELL GOLFE',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Barong Dance - Tegalalang - Gunung Kawi - Taman Ayun - Tanah Lot)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-25','2024-09-25','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',2128000.00,NULL,NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-25\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Andong, Banjar Nagi, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 975825\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kamandalu Resort Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-25\", \"text\": \"Jl. Yeh Gangga I, Sudimara, Kec. Tabanan, Bali 82115 Telepon: 0877-5786-2341\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Waka Gangga Tabanan\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(