l Rice Fields view villas in Balinese village style, the suite contains an large spacious bathroom and each bathroom has different size, complete with hot and cold shower. Adjoining is a spacious bedroom and living room with complete seating table, mini bar, private coding safety deposit box, large cupboard and satellite TV. Each villa has large verandah with outstanding Rice Fields view where guest can seat and relax or even day dreaming.',NULL,'Include 1X Balinese Massage 1X Trekking in Belimbing','{\"date\": \"2024-09-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5235435,'786','AITOR MORELL GOLFE',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Trekking Belimbing - Budhis Temple - Banjar Village - Lovina)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-27','2024-09-27','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',2128000.00,NULL,NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-27\", \"text\": \"Jalan Raya Belimbing, Banjar Suradadi, Belimbing Village, Pupuan, Belimbing, Tabanan, Tabanan Regency, Bali 82163 Telepon: 0851-0045-1178\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Cempaka Belimbing Villas\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-27\", \"text\": \"Jl. Mas Lovina, Kalibukbuk, Kabupaten Buleleng, Bali 81151 Telepon: (0362) 3435800\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Lovina Bali\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5235445,'787','Rosa Maria Ruiz Prieto',30662,203733,'09 DAYS/08 NIGHTS WONDERS NATURE OF NORTH SUMATERA','Confirmed','09 Days North RV',9,'2024-09-07','2024-09-15','Jacob','Eddy',2,'Persons (2-3 / Double)',26040000.00,'DAY 1 : ARRIVAL IN CITY OF MEDAN Upon your arrival at the new Kuala Namu International Airport, Medan, your guide will be waiting for you with a sign with your name to take you to your hotel in an air-conditioned car. Welcome to the sixth largest island in the world famous for its rugged tropical terrain, wildlife and fiery volcanoes. The rest of the day will be free to visit the center of Medan on your own or rest at your hotel. Meals : - Accommodation : Le Polonia Hotel or similar DAY 2 : MEDAN - CITY TOUR - TANGKAHAN After enjoying your breakfast, your guide will pick you up to head towards Tangkahan. But before, we will take advantage of the morning to see the most important places in Medan such as the Grand Mosque, the Sultan’s Palace and the Chinese temple. Then we continue our tour to Tangkahan through Binjai and Batang Serangan. It will be a journey of about 4 hours because although we are only 156 km away, some sections of road are dirt. Along the way, you will already begin to feel the local life of the North of Sumatra and its nature. Upon arrival in Tangkahan, you will check in at the Lodge and you will have your well-deserved rest. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : Mega Inn Lodge DAY 3 : TANGKAHAN – ELEPHANT SAFARI AND SAFARI RIVER (TUBING) As soon as we finish our breakfast, our adventure begins. You can join the Mahout (the elephant tamer) as he washes the elephants in the river. You can try to feed the elephant as well. After feeding the elephant, continue down the river and enjoy tubing through the river. Stop will be made at fantastic Buluh Waterfall where you can take your natural shower. Enjoy sun bathing and swimming on the river and have picnic lunch on the beach of the river. In the afternoon, we will arrival at the village where you can get in touch with local people, see the daily activities. You will then return to guest house by walking. Arrival at guest house, you can take a rest or visit hot springs and waterfall near the guest house at your own leisure. * Note: The river rafting in Tangkahan is wider and the water is clearer than in Bukti Lawang, it also has a stop at the waterfalls, Bukit Lawang does not have waterfalls. * Note: There is no elephant activity in Tangkahan on Friday. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch Accommodation : Mega Inn Lodge DAY 4 : TANGKAHAN - BUKIT LAWANG WITH JEEP After breakfast, we leave Tangkahan and head towards Bukit Lawang in a Jeep4x4 and we will pass through the plantations of Palm. On the way to the jungle, we will make a stop at various places of interest, such as the school, the palm oil factory and to enjoy the panorama, witnessing the activities of the local population. Upon arrival at Bukit Lawang check in at the hotel. (Duration until Bukit Lawang: 3 Hours, 60 KM.) Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : Bukit Lawang Cottage or similar DAY 5 : BUKIT LAWANG - TREKKING IN GUNUNG LEUSER PARK Today after breakfast, we will start our trekking to the jungle to explore the nature of Gunung Leuser National Park and see the orangutans in the wild. We will be in the place that houses more amount of tropical Flora and Fauna than in any other place in Indonesia such as Thomas leaf monkeys, long-tailed macaques, gibbons, black gibbons and other types of flora and fauna of the rain forest. After a further trekking further into the jungle, we returned to the hotel. (Total duration of the trekking is about 3 hours). The rest of the afternoon will be free for you and you can take advantage to enjoy the nature of Bukit Lawang or go visit the town. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : Bukit Lawang Cottage or similar DAY 6 : BUKIT LAWANG - BRASTAGI Our adventure continues. After breakfast, our compass heads towards Brastagi, a city and sub-district of Karo located at the junction of the main route linking the Karo Highlands of North Sumatra to the coastal city of Medan. You will pass by several village such as Namu Ukur, Rumah Galuh and Simpang Kuta Buluh. On the way you can enjoy the panorama of Sinabung Volcano. Afternoon arrival in Brastagi, we will be visiting Lhumbini Park with its duplicate of Shwedagon pagoda of Myanmar, fruit market, and Gundaling hill. We will check in to the hotel afterwards. Meals : Breakfast Accomodation : Sinabung Hills Hotel or similar DAY 7 : BRASTAGI - SAMOSIR - LAKE TOBA After breakfast, we drive for Samosir Island in Lake Toba via Tele, and making stops at impressive places: - Dokan (to see the traditional village of the Batak Karo tribe) - Sipisopiso Waterfall (from here you can admire the scenic view of the Lake Toba from its northern tip combined with the slender 90 meters high waterfall) - Tele (a nice place for over-viewing the lake from its western part) - Efrata (another beautiful waterfall found on the way to Samosir Island) - Lumban Suhi-suhi (to see the Tobanese traditional houses where we can observe the women doing the weaving) In midafternoon arriving at Tuktuk area on Samosir, where we will check-in to hotel. Note: Up to 6 people, we will cross to Samosir by car. More than 6 people by ferry. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : Toledo Inn or similar DAY 8 : SAMOSIR – EXCURSION BY CAR As always, before we start our visits, we have breakfast. We will visit the numerous traditional towns of Batak Toba. The first one is the town of Ambarita. In Ambarita, we find the stone chairs and tables of the old palace of King Sialagan (they used them to execute the criminals at that time). The next town is Aek Natonang. Here we can see the small lake found of the top of Samosir Island and its panorama view. After that is visiting Tomok village. In Tomok you can find the ancient tomb of King Sidabutar. In the afternoon we return to the hotel. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : Toledo Inn or similar DÍA 9 : SAMOSIR - MEDAN - AIRPORT After breakfast, we will cross back to Parapat (a small town on the shore of Lake Toba in North Sumatra Province) for about 1 hour and continue our journey to Medan via Pematang Siantar and Tebing Tinggi. During the 5-hour trip, we can stop at the rubber, cocoa and palm oil plantations. Arrival in Medan, we will take you directly to the airport. We are waiting for you on an upcoming adventure in Indonesia. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-07\", \"text\": \"ETA : 7SEP 13:15 JT302 by Lion Airlines\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"AIRPORT\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-15\", \"text\": \"ETD: TBA\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5235468,'788','MYRIAM VIGNERON 20234667',30508,207259,'Airport to Tulamben','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-29','2024-09-29','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Persons (1-3)',784000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting at the arrival hall exit, holding a signboard of your name/group name. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 3 hours after the flight’s estimated arrival time (ETA). - For any flight delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-09-29\", \"text\": \"ETA: 11.35 by Etihad Airways EY476 from Abu Dhabi on 29 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Denpasar Airport\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Villa Markisa Tulamben\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5235475,'788','MYRIAM VIGNERON 20234667',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Custom Itinerary)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-03','2024-10-03','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Person (1)',2310000.00,NULL,NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities.