ndidasa)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-28','2024-09-28','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',2016000.00,NULL,NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-28\", \"text\": \"Jl. Mas Lovina, Kalibukbuk, Kabupaten Buleleng, Bali 81151 Telepon: (0362) 3435800\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Lovina Bali, Singaraja\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-28\", \"text\": \"Desa Buitan, Manggis, Karangasem Regency, Bali 80871 Telepon: (0363) 41011\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Alila Manggis, Karangasem\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5235536,'786','AITOR MORELL GOLFE',30583,216422,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-28','2024-09-29','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',0.00,NULL,NULL,'The Guest is Honeymooner','{\"date\": \"2024-09-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5235537,'764','Mrs. Laura Cuoto Ramon',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-10-02','2024-10-02','Guio','Praba',2,'Persons (2)',952000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-02\", \"text\": \"ETA 08:30 by The Angkal Fast Boat from Kusamba\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sampalan Harbor Nusa Penida\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-02\", \"text\": \"Banjar Angkal, Suana, Kec. Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771 Telepon: (0366) 5582389\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Angkal Resort Nusa Penida\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5235538,'786','AITOR MORELL GOLFE',30659,203065,'Tradisional Lumbung Hut Room','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-09-29','2024-10-02','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',5544000.00,'At 28 sqm of room area with double bed, The Traditional Lumbung Hut is the epitome of island life for couples seeking a romantic, yet exotic island experience. The Hut takes it’s architectural inspiration for the traditional Sasak rice barns, with open air living areas, and skillfully crafted curved roof. Each two-storey hut features an outdoor tropical bathroom, furnished Bale (day bed) and a hammock downstairs and the cozy bedroom upstairs.',NULL,'The original voucher issued by travel agent must back up guest check in. The voucher should clearly specify all instructions and required services.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5235553,'786','AITOR MORELL GOLFE',30508,218202,'Serangan to Nusa Dua','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-02','2024-10-02','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-02\", \"text\": \"ETA : 17.55 by Bluewater Express from Gili Trawangan on 02 Oct\", \"time\": \"17:55\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Serangan Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-02\", \"text\": \"Jl. Kw. Nusa Dua Resort Itdc Lot 1, Jl. Nusa Dua, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Bali, 8036