ss: Echo Beach, Jl. Pantai Batu Mejan, Canggu, Kec. Kuta Utara, Kabupaten Badung. Phone: (0361) 6202228\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5235746,'717','Ms.Noelia Membrilla Rubio',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West + East Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-10-03','2024-10-03','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',1456000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-03\", \"text\": \"Sakti, Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771 Telepon: (0361) 6207000\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Adiwana Warnakali Resort Nusa Penida\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-03\", \"text\": \"Sakti, Nusa Penida, Kabupaten Klungkung, Bali 80771 Telepon: (0361) 6207000\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Adiwana Warnakali Resort Nusa Penida\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5236694,'790','Luca MACCHI',30683,203336,'Mini-stay Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-27','2024-09-27','Ayu','Praba',1,'Double',504000.00,'Step into one of our comfortable and spacious Deluxe Rooms. Here you can kick back and relax at ease and prepare for your next flight or meeting. Spacious 24 square meters deluxe room with a king or twin beds offering comfortable stay equipped with modern facilities such as air conditioning, arm chair, work desk & chair, flat screen TV with cable and satellite channels, free access internet & Wi-Fi, in room safe, coffee/tea maker, mini cooler, private bathroom with shower and hair dryer, and many more.','Room usage for up to 6 hours Earliest check-in time 09.00 Latest check-out time 23.00 Including transfer between terminals',NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5236695,'790','Luca MACCHI',30683,203336,'Mini-stay Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-10','2024-10-10','Ayu','Praba',