national: Service start from meet clients at departure hall until client boarding.',NULL,'Flight details: ETA: 13.45 by Air Asia QZ805 from Denpasar on 11 Sep ETD: 18.30 by Qatar Airways QR957 to Doha on 11 Sep (4 pax) Meet our assistance, who will be waiting for you at the end of the aviobridge and then escort and assist you to the conveyor belt to collect their luggage (if any). Then escort you to international departure gate for the check in and fast assistance at immigration counters, assistance through customs clearance waiting until boarding time. Please be informed that our Airport Representative will bring a paging board with your name “Maite Uribarri\" on it.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5239536,'802','Mrs Thania Miranda Fernandez',32766,219543,'3D2N Open Trip Komodo - Yumana / Deluxe Cabin','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-10-18','2024-10-20','Guio','Praba',2,'Per Person (Min. 2 Person)',15600000.00,'DAY 1 : Kelor Island - Manjerite Island - Kalong Island DAY 2 : Padar Island - Long / Pick Beach - Komodo Island - Manta Point - Taka Makasar DAY 3 : Kanawa Island',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-18\", \"text\": \"Macang Tanggar, Kec. Komodo, Kabupaten Manggarai Barat, Nusa Tenggara Tim. Telepon: (0385) 244\", \"time\": \"10:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Luwansa Beach Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-20\", \"text\": \"They will go to Le Pirate Island by own arrangement\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Labuan Bajo Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5240311,'803','ARIADNA CAMPDEPADROS RUIZ / KEVIN MOMPO FERNANDEZ',30672,200737,'Studio 25 (Superior) Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-07','2024-10-08','Guio','Eddy',1,'Double',638400.00,'Studio 25 (Superior) room with 25 sqm sized room and with exclusive ARTOTEL bedding collection, some facilities in this room is 43\" inch lcd tv, 24 hours in-room service, high speed internet wi-fi, safety deposit box and hair dryer.',NULL,'Include One Way Transfer AT 08 OCT from HOTEL TO AIRPORT SEMARANG','{\"date\": \"2024-10-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-08\", \"text\": \"ETD : 08OCT 0830 TO (PKN) Pangkalanbun ID6302 BY Batik Air\", \"time\": \"06:30\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5240324,'803','ARIADNA CAMPDEPADROS RUIZ / KEVIN MOMPO FERNANDEZ',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-10-08','2024-10-10','Guio','Eddy',2,'Persons (2)',10080000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan isCape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continueto add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-08\", \"text\": \"ETA : 08OCT 0930 FROM (SRG) Semarang ID6302 BY Batik Air\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"AIRPORT PANGKALANBUN\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-10\", \"text\": \"ETD : 10OCT 0850 TO (DPS) Denpasar ID6134 BY Batik Air\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"AIRPORT PANGKALANBUN\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5240338,'803','ARIADNA CAMPDEPADROS RUIZ / KEVIN MOMPO FERNANDEZ',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-10','2024-10-10','Guio','Eddy',2,'Persons (2)',784000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting at the arrival hall exit, holding a signboard of your name/group name. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 3 hours after the flight’s estimated arrival time (ETA). - For any flight delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-10-10\", \"text\": \"ETD : 10OCT 1400 FROM (PKN) Pangkalanbun JT804 BY Lion Air\", \"time\": \"14:00\", \"locality\": \"AIPORT DENPASAR\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"HOTEL : TBA (Book By Guest)\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5240396,'803','ARIADNA CAMPDEPADROS RUIZ / KEVIN MOMPO FERNANDEZ',30508,207379,'Ubud to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-18','2024-10-18','Guio','Eddy',2,'Persons (2)',1120000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. 18 Oct 2024, Padang Bai (12:15) ~ Gili Trawangan (13:45) IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-18\", \"text\": \"HOTEL : TBA\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5240411,'803','ARIADNA CAMPDEPADROS RUIZ / KEVIN MOMPO FERNANDEZ',30692,204751,'Double Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-22','2024-10-23','Guio','Eddy',1,'Double',840000.00,'This 36sqm room features refrigerator, coffee/tea maker, air conditioning, desk, in-room safety, television, complimentary bottled water. Bathroom amenities such as; shower, free toiletries, private bathroom and hot water. The bedroom is a double room with queen bed type. Guest can see pool from the terrace.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5240506,'804','Judit Sancho',31015,214881,'3D2N Surabaya - Bromo - Ijen - Bali / C. Bromo Terrace (Deluxe Room) & Ketapang Indah (Superior Room','Confirmed','C2I-JAVA10',3,'2024-09-16','2024-09-18','Nicholas','Komang',1,'Persons (2 / Single)',6600000.00,'Day 1 : Surabaya - Bromo Volcano Skirts Upon arrival at Surabaya airport, our representative will be waiting for you with a sign indicating your name to begin the journey of about 4 hours to your hotel on the slopes of the majestic Bromo Volcano. Check-in at your hotel for deserved rest after so many hours traveling. Meals : - Accommodation : C. Bromo Terrace - Deluxe Room Day 2 : Bromo Tour, The Dawn - Fumaroles - Ijen Very early, your guide and a jeep driver will be waiting for you at the hotel to attend one of the most spectacular sunrises in Indonesia. Even though you have to get up early, it will be worth it. You will climb to a high point first in full darkness and, little by little the first rays of sun are giving way to a huge and indescribable caldera that makes up the entire view of the Bromo and Semeru Natural Park. With Bromo, a volcano of great fumaroles and behind it, the Semeru Volcano with explosions every 20 minutes exactly, will make you have one of the most rewarding experiences ever. After enjoying the sunrise, by jeep, you will descend to the sea of sand. You can walk across the sand dune and go to Bromo volcano. After climbing some stairs you can reach the very edge of its crater and see the impressive activity it has. You return to the hotel to cool off and enjoy your breakfast. At the agreed time, you will leave for our next destination, the Ijen volcano. This section lasts about 7-8 hours by car where you will make a stop to eat. Take this trip to rest. You will arrive at the appointed hotel near Ijen crater, where you will check in and enjoy your well-deserved rest. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : C. Ketapang Indah - Superior Room Day 3 : Trekking Ijen - Bali The day has finally come to visit one of the most attractive volcanoes in Indonesia! One of the last open pit sulfur mines that survive on the planet. For this climb you can choose between two schedules; leave very early at 1 AM to see the blue fire (please note that it is not always visible, for example during rainy days) or leave more quietly at 4 AM only for the sunrise. You can decide later when you meet the guide. Once you pick you up at your hotel, you will head towards the village of Licin to reach the slope of the volcano to begin the steep climb to the crater of the volcano. During this trek, your guide will give you double filter masks to protect you from the natural chemicals of sulfur. At an altitude of 2883 meters and when dawn begins, an incredible contrast of colors will open before your eyes. A yellow earth scene and a large turquoise blue lake inside the crater that contrast with a suspended white cloud that is continuously expelling the volcano. In turn, among so much beauty you will see the local miners do what is said to be one of the toughest jobs in the world. These miners go down to the crater of the volcano to load 80 to 100 kilos of sulfur on their shoulders and then sell it. After this amazing experience on the edge of Ijen volcano crater, you will begin the descent with an incredible panoramic view of the mountains that make up the national park. You will be taken you to your hotel to cool off and have breakfast and you will start the journey to Bali for about 5 hours at least, depending on where you stay in Bali. To do this, you will go first to the port of Banyuwangi where you will take the ferry to cross to Bali. It is a journey of only 30 minutes, but remember to adjust your watch by an hour due to the time zone change. Welcome to the island of the Gods. End of service. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Pickup point : 15.20 at Terminal 1 Juanda Airport Surabaya by Bus Daytrans Guest Contact Number : +34662201825 Dropoff point : MANDARA CHICO BUNGALOW, LOVINA Jl. Kubu Cembong, Anturan, Lovina, Kabupaten Buleleng, Bali 80361 Telepon: 0812-3603-268','{\"date\": \"2024-09-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5240512,'804','Judit Sancho',30673,200584,'Deluxe Twin Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-16','2024-09-17','Nicholas','Komang',1,'Twin',1320000.00,'Escape the nature with family, friends, colleague and just relax.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5240524,'804','Judit Sancho',30803,202853,'Garden Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-17','2024-09-18','Nicholas','Komang',1,'Twin',840000.00,'At 25 sqm of room size with 23 rooms available, including a double bed (king or queen) or 2 single beds (twin) with maximum capacity of 2 adults + 1 child or 3 adults. Fresh and inviting, this room category promises total relaxation with its stylish timber furnishings and uplifting garden views. Full length glass doors reveal a private terrace or balcony with the effect of merging seamlessly into the outdoors. The modern en-suite bathroom comes with a glass-enclosed shower and a clean-line vanity.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5240687,'805','Andrea Picon Manzanal',30852,202033,'Villa Surya - One Bedroom Private Pool and Tropical Garden','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-10-09','2024-10-12','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',9072000.00,'Our cozy one bed Villa Surya is perfect for a solo traveler or a romantic getaway at 150 sqm private property. The spacious bedroom features a king-size bed with an extra thick mattress with 100% cotton linen, ensuring a blissful sleep. With high-ceilings, large windows, and a pivoting door onto your patio, the space is able to breathe whilst being basked in a beautiful, natural light. The ensuite bathroom, equipped with a bespoke basin area, rainfall shower, quality toiletries and 100% cotton towels leads out to the real star of this villa, the indulgent open-air bathtub. Large enough for two, with views of your private pool and tropical garden, while away hours in pure relaxation.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5240703,'805','Andrea Picon Manzanal',30508,207386,'Padang Bai to Seminyak','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-12','2024-10-12','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-12\", \"text\": \"ETA 13.55 by Bluewater Express from Gili Air on 12 Oct\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-12\", \"text\": \"Jl. Kayu Aya, Pantai Seminyak, Kuta, Seminyak, Kec. Kuta, Kabupaten Badung\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Seminyak Beach Resort & Spa\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5240709,'805','Andrea Picon Manzanal',30606,203160,'Beach Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-12','2024-10-13','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',4401600.00,'The Beach Room are a stylish, sleek and serene addition to our hotel on Seminyak Beach. Witness a marriage of contemporary design and Balinese tradition, complete with yielding beds, sunny balconies and lavish en-suite bathrooms with indulgent soaking tubs and powerful rain showers. Hand-carved wooden accents are offset by warm-toned furnishings and fabrics that span the spectrum from burgundy via espresso to cappuccino.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5240711,'805','Andrea Picon Manzanal',30508,207270,'Seminyak to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-13','2024-10-13','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver will wait up to 30 minutes after your scheduled pickup time. - Please keep in mind that any further delay could affect your timely arrival at the airport for your flight. - For any changes in flight departure time, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available). - Requests for pickup time earlier than originally booked are subject to availability.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-13\", \"text\": \"Jl. Kayu Aya, Pantai Seminyak, Kuta, Seminyak, Kec. Kuta, Kabupaten Badung\", \"time\": \"15:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Seminyak Beach Resort & Spa\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-13\", \"text\": \"ETD 18.55 by IB7979 to Doha on 13 Oct\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5240714,'768','MARIA PILAR SANTAMARIA ESQUINAS',30508,207387,'Padang Bai to Sanur','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-25','2024-10-25','Nicholas','Eddy',2,'Persons (2)',1200000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-25\", \"text\": \"ETA : Padang Bai (13:55) By Blue Water\", \"time\": \"13:55\", \"locality\": \"P BAY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-25\", \"text\": \"PURI SANTRIAN \\\"Address: Jl. Cemara No.35, Sanur, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali 80228 Phone: (0361) 288009\\\"\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5240723,'768','MARIA PILAR SANTAMARIA ESQUINAS',30720,202974,'Santrian Club Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-25','2024-10-26','Nicholas','Eddy',1,'Double',2580000.00,'The Santrian Club room embodies the understated simplicity of Balinese elegance, at 49 sqm with double / twin bed, designed for adults only, maximum of 2 persons, Santrian Club room features separate pool access. Set amidst tropical landscape, this air-conditioned room comes with a flat-screen cable TV and a safety deposit box. En suite bathroom comes with shower facilities.',NULL,'HONEYMOON','{\"date\": \"2024-10-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5240751,'768','MARIA PILAR SANTAMARIA ESQUINAS',30508,212541,'Ubud to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-22','2024-10-22','Nicholas','Eddy',2,'Persons (2)',1200000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'The