,'806','Mauricio Zendron',33248,219570,'Premium Ocean View','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-14','2024-09-15','Ayu','Ayu',1,'Double',2744000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5240908,'806','Mauricio Zendron',33248,219570,'Premium Ocean View with Late Check out until 18.00 PM','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-14','2024-09-15','Ayu','Ayu',1,'Double',0.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5242026,'520','ANA MIGUEZ X2',30927,202538,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-20','2024-10-21','Guio','Eddy',1,'Double',672000.00,'At 20 m2 room size, this bungalow-style room features a terrace overlooking the garden. It comes with a personal safe and mini-bar, and includes a private bathroom with an open-air shower.',NULL,'HONEYMOON 21 OCT  Dolphine Tour will be arrange by hotel, Please Be Ready On Lobby at 06:00 AM','{\"date\": \"2024-10-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5242055,'520','ANA MIGUEZ X2',30508,202882,'Lovina - Klntamanl - Templo Besaklh - Candldasa','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-21','2024-10-21','Guio','Eddy',2,'Persons (2)',1724800.00,'The first destination is Kusamba Beach, it is one of the favorite places of interest in Bali which is famous with the beautiful beach, we can also meet a fish market in this place which is usually held between 10 am until 4 pm. Then we go to Goa Lawah, this is one of the favourite place to be visited, because here is a nature cave dwelt by thousands of tail bat located at north side from Jeroan/center of Goa Lawah Temple. Next we go to Bukit Jambul, it is strategically located beside of the main road from Denpasar to Besakih Temple and it is one of the tourist destinations that visited on Besakih Tour. It is situated in the plateau area which is blessed with the beautiful panorama of rice terrace and green coconuts three unfolding to the sea. After visit Bukit Jambul, we’ll continue to Besakih Temple is the biggest Hindu temple in Bali which the local people call Pura Besakih. It owns beautiful view from the top of temple area where we can see the wide nature panorama until to the ocean so that’s why this temple is many visited by tourists from all over the world. Then go to Kertagosa, This place also owns Taman Gili, a building floating or sees like floating because it is intentionally founded in the middle of a fish pond.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-21\", \"text\": \"FRANGIPANI BEACH HOTEL \\\"Address: Jl. Kartika 99, Kalibukbuk, Anturan, Kec. Buleleng, Singaraja, Bali 81151 Phone: (0362) 3435764\\\"\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": \"MEET AT LOBBY\", \"location\": \"After Finish Dolphine Tour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-21\", \"text\": \"HOTEL GENGGONG BALI \\\"ADDRESS : Jl.Puri Bagus, Candidasa, Sengkidu, Kec. Manggis, Kabupaten Karangasem, Bali 80871 Phone : +62 (0363) 4381005\\\"\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5242124,'808','Hugo Caballero Lopez De Orozco',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-07','2024-10-07','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting at the arrival hall exit, holding a signboard of your name/group name. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 3 hours after the flight’s estimated arrival time (ETA). - For any flight delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-10-07\", \"text\": \"ETA 17.35 by Qatar QR962 from Doha on 7 Oct\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-07\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Adiwana Bisma\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5242137,'808','Hugo Caballero Lopez De Orozco',30538,201914,'Adiwana Rice Field Room','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-10-07','2024-10-11','Guio','Tami',1,'Twin',11872000.00,'Come face to face with nature from a luxuriously sophisticated abode. Our beautifully designed Rice Field View gives you front-row seats to a beloved icon of Ubud – a flourishing, productive rice field. Just steps away from your bed, lush stalks of paddy wave in the breeze. Relax on your spacious private terrace and watch the farmers at work or the ducks as they frolic and play. Reflecting the island’s unique heritage and Ubud’s reputation as the center of arts and culture, the room is appointed with a natural woven headboard, creating beautiful depth and texture against the cool of the marble floor enhanced with premium stones and hardwood furnishing. Behind a door, in the all-marble bathroom, there is a bathtub that overlooks the outdoors from behind wooden slats. His and hers vanity offers much-needed space and a standing rain shower is illuminated by soft yellow lighting.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5242145,'808','Hugo Caballero Lopez De Orozco',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Custom Itinerary)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-08','2024-10-08','Guio','Tami',2,'Person (1)',2128000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Adiwana Bisma\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5242147,'808','Hugo Caballero Lopez De Orozco',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Custom Itinerary)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-09','2024-10-09','Guio','Tami',2,'Person (1)',1904000.00,NULL,NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Adiwana Bisma\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5242160,'808','Hugo Caballero Lopez De Orozco',30508,207379,'Ubud to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-11','2024-10-11','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-11\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"05:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Adiwana Bisma\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-11\", \"text\": \"ETD 08.30 to Gili Air by Gili Gili Fast Boat on 11 Oct\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Gili Gili Fast Boat Office Padang Bai (close to Serangan 1 Homestay Padangbai)\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5242660,'808','Hugo Caballero Lopez De Orozco',32602,215975,'One Bedroom Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-10-11','2024-10-14','Guio','Tami',1,'Twin',12600000.00,'Each room offers the same comfort: one bedroom villas with terrace, swimming pool, kitchenette and office space, comfortable sunbeds, lovely coconut garden. Particular care to the quality of the beddings, the home stylist Valérie Barkowski has added her touch of originality with a predominant colour selection of orange, grey, red, green, bordeaux or black. Choose your holiday colour!',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5242669,'808','Hugo Caballero Lopez De Orozco',30508,212301,'Padang Bai to Uluwatu','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-14','2024-10-14','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-14\", \"text\": \"ETA 12.30 from Gili Air by Gili Gili Fast Boat on 14 Oct\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-14\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bangbang Metuug, Pecatu, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Green Escape - Eco Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5242674,'808','Hugo Caballero Lopez De Orozco',30930,202595,'Two Bedroom Bungalow','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-10-14','2024-10-16','Guio','Tami',1,'Double + Double',7504000.00,'Our Two-Bedroom Bungalow is a unique Eco-Boho Bungalow nestles in Green Escape Resort. You will stay in a sumptuous & elegant air-conditioned bungalow that has been handcrafted using recycled wood and tastefully decorated to offer you an authentic Balinese getaway. It\'s the very epitome of a tranquil escape. This Bungalow has a main bedroom with a deluxe king-size bed and a second bedroom, which is smaller, with a deluxe queen bed. Both rooms are air-conditioned and offers a comfy mattress, as we know the benefits of a good night\'s sleep. The semi-outdoor bathroom with a rain shower will help you revive yourself after a hot sunny day. Enjoy your comfy sofas on your private terrace which opens onto the exotic garden & pool. This bungalow is perfect for a family of 4 or a group of friends travelling together. It\'s possible to add an extra mattress in the main bedroom to extend the sleeping capacity to 5 People (extra charge)',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5242678,'808','Hugo Caballero Lopez De Orozco',30508,216161,'Uluwatu to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-16','2024-10-16','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver will wait up to 30 minutes after your scheduled pickup time. - Please keep in mind that any further delay could affect your timely arrival at the airport for your flight. - For any changes in flight departure time, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available). - Requests for pickup time earlier than originally booked are subject to availability.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-16\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bangbang Metuug, Pecatu, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": \"15:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Green Escape - Eco Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-16\", \"text\": \"ETD 19.10 by Qatar QR963 to Doha on 16 Oct\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5243003,'809','Coral Penalver Campos',30508,214239,'Airport to Uluwatu','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-23','2024-09-23','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting at the arrival hall exit, holding a signboard of your name/group name. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 3 hours after the flight’s estimated arrival time (ETA). - For any flight delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-09-23\", \"text\": \"ETD 22.40 by Qatar QR960 from Doha on 23 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-23\", \"text\": \"Banjar Dinas Kangin Jalan Goa Lempeh Jalan Raya Uluwatu, Kabupaten Badung\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Bvlgari Resort Bali\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5243021,'809','Coral Penalver Campos',30508,212545,'Uluwatu to Sanur','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-27','2024-09-27','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-27\", \"text\": \"Banjar Dinas Kangin Jalan Goa Lempeh Jalan Raya Uluwatu, Kabupaten Badung\", \"time\": \"12:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Bvlgari Resort Bali\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-27\", \"text\": \"ETD 15.00 to Nusa Penida by Maruti Fast Boat on 27 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sanur Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5243100,'809','Coral Penalver Campos',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-09-27','2024-09-27','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',952000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-27\", \"text\": \"ETA 08.00 from Sanur by Maruti Express on 27 Sep\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Toya Pakeh Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-27\", \"text\": \"Sakti, Nusa Penida, Klungkung Regency, Bali 80771\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Māua Nusa Penida\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5243102,'809','Coral Penalver Campos',30582,203387,'One Bedroom Luxury Villas','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-09-27','2024-09-29','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',6988800.00,'Each One Bedroom Luxury Villa is designed with a private infinity pool, scenic view across the Gamat Bay or garden view, and some have a small private garden. Every villas features the following: An integrated universal power outlet, Room safe (suitable for storing laptops), Cable TV with international news and movie channels, Eco-friendly bathroom amenities, Coffee and tea-making facilities.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-09-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5243117,'809','Coral Penalver Campos',30508,207384,'Kusamba to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-29','2024-09-29','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-29\", \"text\": \"ETA 13.15 from Nusa Penida by The Angkal Fast Boat\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kusamba Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-29\", \"text\": \"Jalan Cinta, Tegallalang, Kec. Tegallalang, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80561\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kuwarasan A Pramana Experience\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5243118,'809','Coral Penalver Campos',30875,202233,'Suite Paddies View','Confirmed',NULL,5,'2024-09-29','2024-10-03','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',14000000.00,'Enjoy the expansive rice field view from this bright 65 sqm suite. This simple elegant suite is a perfect combination of indulgent romance and relaxing serenity. The suite features private veranda, mini bar, safe deposit box, LED cable TV, free wireless internet connection, IDD telephone, hot & cold shower, and elegant bathroom amenities.','All rates are inclusive of 21% Service & Tax','HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-09-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5243121,'809','Coral Penalver Campos',30508,202864,'Ubud and Surrounding Tour','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-30','2024-09-30','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1691200.00,'We will be picking you up from your hotel to enjoy the wealth of art in Ubud. First we will visit Monkey Forest; the Ubud Monkey Forest is a nature reserve and temple complex in Ubud, Bali. It houses approximately 340 Crab-eating Macaque (Macacafas cicularis) monkeys. The Monkey Forest contains the Pura Dalem Agung Padangtegal temple as well as a \"Holy Spring\" bathing temple and another temple used for cremation ceremonies. Next we go to Ubud Traditional Art Market where the existence is not far different from other markets available in the tourism area. This market as a society economics center of Ubud and it is apposite to the existence of Ubud Empire that is called Puri Saren. Our last destination is Gua Gajah (Elephant Cave). This cave is built at crevasse edge from the federation of 2 rills that is called Pangkung River, where the irrigation is mixed with Petanu River flow. The word of Gua Gajah is anticipated coming from the word of Lwa Gajah, the name of Buddhist Temple or hermitage for Buddhist monk. There is a relief which is almost looking like the form of mountain on the entrance of this cave. It was carved many designed on the relief like grove with the stick, close leaf, animal for example forest pig, tortoise and specters. The cave mouth is decorated by the bas-relief with the eye turn around to the right or west side. At the end of tour we will transferred back you to the hotel.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-30\", \"text\": \"Jalan Cinta, Tegallalang, Kec. Tegallalang, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80561\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kuwarasan A Pramana Experience\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5243124,'809','Coral Penalver Campos',30508,207262,'Ubud to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-03','2024-10-03','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver will wait up to 30 minutes after your scheduled pickup time. - Please keep in mind that any further delay could affect your timely arrival at the airport for your flight. - For any changes in flight departure time, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available). - Requests for pickup time earlier than originally booked are subject to availability.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-03\", \"text\": \"Please be ready at hotel\'s lobby\", \"time\": \"16:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kuwarasan A Pramana Experience\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-03\", \"text\": \"ETD 21.20 by Air Asia AK371 to Kuala Lumpur on 03 Oct\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5244004,'738','J.V. Tolsá & Party (2pax)',30803,202852,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-19','2024-10-20','Jacob','Eddy',1,'Double',780000.00,'At 25 sqm of room size with 46 rooms available. This smart room category is more contemporary in appearance and comes with its own terrace or balcony. Minimalist furnishings are balanced by a neutral decor to soothe the senses and ensure restful slumber. Including a double bed (king or queen) or 2 single beds (twin) with maximum capacity of 2 adults + 1 child or 3 adults. The en-suite bathroom features a modern shower cubicle enclosed in glass together with a marble vanity.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5244028,'811','Kevin Kingma',31137,213557,'8D7N Mahakam - Kutai Park - Balikpapan / B. Standard Houseboat with AC','Confirmed',NULL,8,'2024-09-15','2024-09-22','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Persons (2-3 / Double)',46080000.00,'DAY 1 : BALIKPAPAN - SAMARINDA - MAHAKAM Pick up at hotel Balikpapan at 10:00 am meeting service and transfer to Loa Janan, to board houseboat for exciting adventure on Mahakam river. Meals provided and overnight on houseboat. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Standard Houseboat Air Conditioning DAY 2 : MUARA MUNTAI - MANCONG - TANJUNG ISUY - MUARA PAHU Short sight seeing at Muara Muntai Wooden village, then crossing Jempang Lake by motor canoe to Mancong. During the cruise you could see Rain forest and wildlife at Ohong creek like monkey’s and birds, Upon arrival at Mancong, welcomed with a traditional ceremony by the Dayaq Benuaq, one of the Oldest Dayak Longhouse of East Kalimantan can be found here, Late afternoon by motor canoe to Tanjung Isuy for sight seeing and continue to Houseboat for dinner and overnight. Houseboat will cruise up to Muara Pahu. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Standard Houseboat Air Conditioning DAY 3 : MUARA PAHU - KEDANG PAHU RIVER - MOUNT BAYAN - TERBISAK - DOWNSTREAM Arrive at Muara Pahu, cruise upstream the Kedang Pahu River by canoe for more then one hour by canoe to Mount Bayan to visit Terbisak Dayak village known of it’s Longhouse of the Benauq Dayak tribe which is still habituated by about 100 Dayak people living in their community house, and traditions of dry rise fielding and hunting. Continue downstream by canoe, along the river bank, we will enjoy the exotic nature, and wildlife as otters, leave monkeys, endangered proboscis monkeys and birds. Before we move to the delta of the Belowan river as a black water peat swamp forest land, with opportunities to spot the fresh water dolphins in the the Kedang Pahu and the Bolowan River. After that return to houseboat for upstream to Melak. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Standard Houseboat Air Conditioning DAY 4 : MELAK - EHENG - OMBAU ASA Arrive in Melak then drive to Eheng by Jeep / Minibus passing beautiful highland to reach the old longhouse of Dayak Tunjung. Afterwards visit Kersik Luway and explore the forest, if lucky the famous black orchid can be seen. Afternoon to Ombau Asa waterfall, an exciting place for swimming. Return to Melak then board to the houseboat and downstream to Tenggarong. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Standard Houseboat Air Conditioning DAY 5 : TENGGARONG - KUTAI NATIONAL PARK Arrive at Tenggarong, breakfast, and direct by car transfer of about eight hours to Sangatta, passing hilly forest highlands and plantations, villages, and pass the Equator to Sangatta harbor to cruise by motor canoe upstream Sangatta River into the jungle of Kutai National Park Reserve. Lunch enroute, dinner at and overnight at Kutai park lodge, possibility for night trek. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Jungle Camp Kutai Park DAY 6 : KUTAI NATIONAL PARK Simple Breakfast, before starting to explore the jungle by hiking into the forest, looking for wildlife and Orangutans, which are completely wild. Afternoon return to camp station Lunch and rest, late afternoon another forest trek searching for wild and experience the beauty of the Rainforest flora and Fauna here. Dinner and overnight at Morio jungle camp. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Jungle Camp Kutai Park DAY 7 : KUTAI RESERVE - DELTA SANGATTA RIVER - SAMARINDA After Breakfast we can do another trek, before we catch the canoe to the mangrove forest at the Delta of the Sangatta River to spot Longnose Monkeys, Birds, Crocodiles and other wild in the Mangrove Forest. Return to Sangatta for transfer by car to Samarinda hotel, dinner en route and overnight at hotel. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Hotel Samarinda DAY 8 : SAMARINDA - BALIKPAPAN Breakfast, free at leisure, and enjoy the hotel atmosphere. Until departure transfer to Balikpapan airport for your flight to your next destination. Meals : Breakfast',NULL,'Guide contact: Mr Rema +62831-4101-9476 (WhatsApp available) ITINERARY: 15 SEP, DAY 1: BALIKPAPAN - SANGATTA (L, D) 16 SEP, DAY 2: SANGATTA - KUTAI NATIONAL PARK (B, L, D) 17 SEP, DAY 3: KUTAI NATIONAL PARK - DELTA SANGATTA RIVER - SAMARINDA (B, L, D) 18 SEP, DAY 4: SAMARINDA - LOA JANAN - MAHAKAM RIVER (B, L, D) 19 SEP, DAY 5: MUARA MUNTAI, MANCONG, TANJUNG ISUY, MUARA PAHU (B, L, D) 20 SEP, DAY 6: MUARA PAHU, KEDANG PAHU RIVER, MOUNT BAYAN, TERBISAK, DOWNSTREAM (B, L, D) 21 SEP, DAY 7: MELAK, EHENG, OMBAU ASA - TENGGARONG (B, L, D) 22 SEP, DAY 8: TENGGARONG - BALIKPAPAN (B)','{\"date\": \"2024-09-15\", \"text\": \"Jalan Pelita No.19, Kecamatan Balikpapan Selatan, Kalimantan Timur 76115\", \"time\": \"10:30\", \"locality\": \"Tamansari Skylounge Balikpapan\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Jalan Prona III, Kecamatan Balikpapan Selatan, Kalimantan Timur 76115\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5244080,'730','Paul Mistler',30680,200916,'Deluxe Plus Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-13','2024-08-14','Purnomo','Komang',1,'Double',1176000.00,'Enjoy a spacious king bed featuring a comfortable pillow-top mattress and luxurious bedding at 40 m2 of room area . Relax in the bathtub at our Deluxe Plus Room with a beautiful interior and peaceful atmosphere. Free access to our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, hot and cold shower, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK-IN. FM7 Hotel Airport Pickup Service: +62811-8815-053 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-08-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5244345,'803','ARIADNA CAMPDEPADROS RUIZ / KEVIN MOMPO FERNANDEZ',30783,212807,'2D1N Yogyakarta Package Drop Semarang','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-10-06','2024-10-07','Guio','Eddy',2,'Persons (2)',8904000.00,'D1 : Arrival Yogyakarta International Airport - Visit Borobudur Temple incl. Mendut and Pawon - check in hotel Welcome to the cradle of Indonesian culture, Yogyakarta. A tourist destination for its ancient palaces, temples, batik workshops, gamelan music orchestras, court dances and wayang puppet shows. Upon your arrival in Yogyakarta a representative of come2indonesia will be waiting for you with a sign indicating your name to start exploring this special city. We will start by heading towards Borobudur Temple (Candi Borobudur), the great Stupa, the largest Buddhist monument in the world and one of the seven wonders. We will tour around the temple, observe the hundreds and centenary statues of Buddha and witness how dozens of Buddhists come to preach from all over the world. Historically it was established during the relatively brief Sailendra dynasty of Central Java between 778 and 856 BC and is in constant restoration due to the breaks that the tremors of the neighbouring Merapi volcano has been producing during its history. After visiting one of the most important Buddhist temples in Southeast Asia, we continue our journey to the Mendut temple and Pawon temple. D2 : Morning visit Prambanan Temple - City Tour Yogyakarta visit Sultan Palace, Watercastle and Bird Market - Transfer to Yogyakarta International Airport You will enjoy a well-deserved breakfast at the hotel and we will start by heading towards Candi Prambanan, the temple of the Hinduists and classified as a World Heritage Site by Unesco since 1991. The built of this temple was finished around the year 856 to commemorate the victory of the descendant Sanjaya of Siva, Rikai Pikatan on the last sovereign Sailendra of Central Java. Take your time to enjoy each carving on the rocks and feel the spirituality that each of the stones perched in this set of more than 200 Hindu temples that are dedicated to the Trimurti, the expression of God as the Creator, the Preserver and the destroyer. After this visit we go to the Keraton known as the Sultan’s Palace. The palace is a complex building two centuries old, located in the heart of the city. You will hear the song of the “freedom” of the birds in the bird market, we will visit the “Water Castle” that occupies the highest part at the northern end of the vast complex of Taman Sari, Malioboro Street, main street of Yogyakarta, with its merchants, horse carriages, taxi-bikes and markets. An incredible experience that will make the hours fly by. According to the time of your flight, we will pick you up to take you to the airport and take the flight to your next destination. End of our services. Thank you very much for exploring Yogyakarta by the hand of Come2indonesia.',NULL,'06 Oct: Yogyakarta – Templo Prambanan – Keraton (If time is Possible) Templo Borobudur 07 Oct: Yogyakarta City Tour – Semarang 06 - 07 OCT OPT A. The Phoenix Hotel - Deluxe Legacy Room','{\"date\": \"2024-10-06\", \"text\": \"ETA : INTERNATIONAL ETA : 06 Oct 202409:45 TR 200 by Scoot From Singapore (SIN)\", \"time\": \"09:45\", \"locality\": \"AIRPORT YOGYAKARTA\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-07\", \"text\": \"ARTOTEL GAJAHMADA SEMARANG \\\"Address : Jl. Gajahmada No.101, Miroto, Kec. Semarang Tengah, Kota Semarang, Jawa Tengah 50134 Phone : (024) 86405777\\\"\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5245180,'814','Mr. Jorge Ferran Carmona',30805,215676,'SOQ-DPS','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-25','2024-10-25','Guio','Praba',4,'Person',14080000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5245181,'814','Mr. Jorge Ferran Carmona',30769,201350,'Joglo Villa Garden View','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-10-25','2024-10-29','Guio','Praba',2,'Double',11520000.00,'6 units of Joglo Villa Garden View is designed in a traditional Joglo house with a high quality of woods materials. The villas are sized 40 sqm each set on the Campuhan riverbank overlooking valley and main pool. Advance facilities yet functionally placed and layout to ensure total guests’ privacy and comfort.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5245191,'814','Mr. Jorge Ferran Carmona',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-25','2024-10-25','Guio','Praba',1,'Persons (4)',840000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting at the arrival hall exit, holding a signboard of your name/group name. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 3 hours after the flight’s estimated arrival time (ETA). - For any flight delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-10-25\", \"text\": \"Domestic Arrival: ETA 18:50 by Lion Air JT747 from Ujung Pandang\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-25\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kec. Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar Phone: +62361 978018\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pertiwi Bisma 1 Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5245243,'814','Mr. Jorge Ferran Carmona',30508,202864,'Ubud and Surrounding Tour (Monkey Forest-Tegalalang Rice Terrace-Goa Gajah)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-26','2024-10-26','Guio','Praba',4,'Persons (4)',2712000.00,'We will be picking you up from your hotel to enjoy the wealth of art in Ubud. First we will visit Monkey Forest; the Ubud Monkey Forest is a nature reserve and temple complex in Ubud, Bali. It houses approximately 340 Crab-eating Macaque (Macacafas cicularis) monkeys. The Monkey Forest contains the Pura Dalem Agung Padangtegal temple as well as a \"Holy Spring\" bathing temple and another temple used for cremation ceremonies. Next we go to Ubud Traditional Art Market where the existence is not far different from other markets available in the tourism area. This market as a society economics center of Ubud and it is apposite to the existence of Ubud Empire that is called Puri Saren. Our last destination is Gua Gajah (Elephant Cave). This cave is built at crevasse edge from the federation of 2 rills that is called Pangkung River, where the irrigation is mixed with Petanu River flow. The word of Gua Gajah is anticipated coming from the word of Lwa Gajah, the name of Buddhist Temple or hermitage for Buddhist monk. There is a relief which is almost looking like the form of mountain on the entrance of this cave. It was carved many designed on the relief like grove with the stick, close leaf, animal for example forest pig, tortoise and specters. The cave mouth is decorated by the bas-relief with the eye turn around to the right or west side. At the end of tour we will transferred back you to the hotel.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-26\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kec. Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar Phone: +62361 978018\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pertiwi Bisma 1 Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-26\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kec. Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar Phone: +62361 978018\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pertiwi Bisma 1 Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5245257,'803','ARIADNA CAMPDEPADROS RUIZ / KEVIN MOMPO FERNANDEZ',30649,204187,'One Bedroom Pool Lagoon','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-10-20','2024-10-22','Guio','Eddy',1,'Double',1960000.00,'This room is perfect for travelers or business people! With a room area of ​​25m2 and equipped with a double / single bed, air conditioning controller, LED TV and high speed internet access. This modern designed bathroom is also equipped with a shower and toiletries to complete your needs during your stay at our hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5246418,'812','Chevreau Alexandre',30508,207278,'CAR TRANSFER UBUD - SOBEK ADVENTURE - UBUD','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-27','2024-09-27','Ayu','Wiwik',1,'Persons (2)',600000.00,NULL,NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": \"Yuni’s House Bungalows & Fine Art Gallery\", \"location\": \"Jl. Karna No.4, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar (0361) 975701\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Kuber BALI ADVENTURE (FOR ATV)\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5246456,'814','Mr. Jorge Ferran Carmona',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route (Taman Ayun-Jatiluwih- Ulun Danu Bratan-Tanah Lot)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-29','2024-10-29','Guio','Praba',4,'Persons (4)',2832000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-29\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kec. Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar Phone: +62361 978018\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pertiwi Bisma 1 Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-29\", \"text\": \"l. Pura Telaga Waja No.18A, Kerobokan Kelod, Kec. Kuta Utara, Kabupaten Badung Telepon: (0361) 9348348\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kayumas Seminyak Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5246461,'814','Mr. Jorge Ferran Carmona',30508,202897,'Uluwatu Temple and Kecak Dance','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-30','2024-10-30','Guio','Praba',4,'Persons (4)',4200000.00,'This half-day tour, is an exciting tour package to visit Padang-Padang Beach, Uluwatu Temple, the famous Balinese Hindu Temple in south part of Bali with breathtaking view of sunset and Indian Ocean. Uluwatu Temple is one of Balinese Hindu Temples located right on the petrifying hill with the crevasse exist in the right and left side. Uluwatu Temple is one of Sad Khayangan (6 biggest temple in Bali) owns magnificent view of the Indian Ocean and sunset as a backdrop. This temple is very amazing where the location is right on the narrow peninsula with deep seawater under it. This tour package is combined with the spectacular Balinese traditional dance performance of Kecak Dance. Balinese Kecak Dance is a spectacular traditional dance with the group of people playing this dance with fire game. It is very exciting and unique dance due to the sound of gamelan is not using the normal gamelan but use their mouth. The dancers make the compact choir with the exquisite dance movement that is one of this dance features. After the dance we returned back to the hotel or seafood restaurant in Jimbaran.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-30\", \"text\": \"Jl. Pura Telaga Waja No.18A, Kerobokan Kelod, Kec. Kuta Utara, Kabupaten Badung Telepon: (0361) 9348348\", \"time\": \"13:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kayumas Seminyak Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-30\", \"text\": \"Jl. Pura Telaga Waja No.18A, Kerobokan Kelod, Kec. Kuta Utara, Kabupaten Badung Telepon: (0361) 9348348\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kayumas Seminyak Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5246462,'814','Mr. Jorge Ferran Carmona',30798,201644,'One Bedroom Deluxe Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-10-29','2024-10-31','Guio','Praba',2,'Double',5808000.00,'The two-story, 45sqm One Bedroom Deluxe Suite features an natural and airy interior, complemented with modern furnishings and views overlooking to the private terrace with a plunge pool. Floor-to-ceiling glass doors provide generous natural lighting and a dynamic ambience. Plush linens and a marble bathroom surround guests in elegance.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5246466,'814','Mr. Jorge Ferran Carmona',30508,207270,'Seminyak to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-31','2024-10-31','Guio','Praba',1,'Persons (4)',480000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver will wait up to 30 minutes after your scheduled pickup time. - Please keep in mind that any further delay could affect your timely arrival at the airport for your flight. - For any changes in flight departure time, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available). - Requests for pickup time earlier than originally booked are subject to availability.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-31\", \"text\": \"Jl. Pura Telaga Waja No.18A, Kerobokan Kelod, Kec. Kuta Utara, Kabupaten Badung Telepon: (0361) 9348348\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kayumas Seminyak Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-31\", \"text\": \"International Departure ETD 09:40 by Qatar Air QR965 to Doha\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5246508,'814','Mr. Jorge Ferran Carmona',31973,218244,'Balinese Cooking Experience (Mebat)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-27','2024-10-27','Guio','Praba',4,'Persons (4)',1920000.00,'Experiencing first hand cooking Balinese cuisine will be a memory that is hard to forget. You will be introduced in detail to a variety or ingredients and how to cook them. You will then cook some traditional Balinese dishes, such as sate lilit, lawar, pepes tum, etc.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-27\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kec. Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar Phone: +62361 978018\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pertiwi Bisma 1 Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-27\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kec. Gianyar, Kabupaten Gianyar Phone: +62361 978018\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pertiwi Bisma 1 Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5246522,'768','MARIA PILAR SANTAMARIA ESQUINAS',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route (Templo Taman Ayun - Jatiluwih - Templo Ulun Danu Bratan - Tanah Lot )','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-20','2024-10-20','Nicholas','Eddy',2,'Persons (2)',1872000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-20\", \"text\": \"UBUD VILLAGE HOTEL at Monkey Forest Address: Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone: (0361) 975571\\\"\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-20\", \"text\": \"UBUD VILLAGE HOTEL at Monkey Forest Address: Jl. Monkey Forest, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone: (0361) 975571\\\"\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5246665,'816','Miguel Renon Gonzalez',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-15','2024-10-16','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',784000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK-IN. FM7 Hotel Airport Pickup Service: +62811-8815-053 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-10-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5246755,'816','Miguel Renon Gonzalez',30783,201474,'2D1N Yogyakarta - Semarang / B. Gallery Prawirotaman (Superior Room)','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-10-16','2024-10-17','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2 / Double)',6328000.00,'D1 : Arrival Semarang airport - Borobudur Temple tour incl. Mendut and Pawon - overnight in Yogyakarta Welcome to the cradle of Indonesian culture, Yogyakarta. A tourist destination for its ancient palaces, temples, batik workshops, gamelan music orchestras, court dances and wayang puppet shows. Upon your arrival in Semarang airport a representative of come2indonesia will be waiting for you with a sign indicating your name to start exploring this special city. We will start by heading towards Borobudur Temple (Candi Borobudur), the great Stupa, the largest Buddhist monument in the world and one of the seven wonders. We will tour around the temple, observe the hundreds and centenary statues of Buddha and witness how dozens of Buddhists come to preach from all over the world. Historically it was established during the relatively brief Sailendra dynasty of Central Java between 778 and 856 BC and is in constant restoration due to the breaks that the tremors of the neighbouring Merapi volcano has been producing during its history. After visiting one of the most important Buddhist temples in Southeast Asia, we continue our journey to the Mendut temple and Pawon temple. And then, we will take you to your Jogjakarta. D2 : Morning visit Prambanan Temple - City Tour Yogyakarta visit Sultan Palace, Watercastle and Bird Market - Transfer to Yogyakarta International Airport You will enjoy a well-deserved breakfast at the hotel and we will start by heading towards Candi Prambanan, the temple of the Hinduists and classified as a World Heritage Site by Unesco since 1991. The built of this temple was finished around the year 856 to commemorate the victory of the descendant Sanjaya of Siva, Rikai Pikatan on the last sovereign Sailendra of Central Java. Take your time to enjoy each carving on the rocks and feel the spirituality that each of the stones perched in this set of more than 200 Hindu temples that are dedicated to the Trimurti, the expression of God as the Creator, the Preserver and the destroyer. After this visit we go to the Keraton known as the Sultan’s Palace. The palace is a complex building two centuries old, located in the heart of the city. You will hear the song of the “freedom” of the birds in the bird market, we will visit the “Water Castle” that occupies the highest part at the northern end of the vast complex of Taman Sari, Malioboro Street, main street of Yogyakarta, with its merchants, horse carriages, taxi-bikes and markets. An incredible experience that will make the hours fly by. According to the time of your flight, we will pick you up to take you to the airport and take the flight to your next destination. End of our services. Thank you very much for exploring Yogyakarta by the hand of Come2indonesia.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-10-16\", \"text\": \"ETA 10.50 by Batik Air ID6378 from Jakarta on 16 Oct\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Yogyakarta International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-17\", \"text\": \"Jl. Gajahmada No.101, Miroto, Kec. Semarang Tengah, Kota Semarang, Jawa Tengah\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"ARTOTEL Gajahmada Semarang\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5246757,'816','Miguel Renon Gonzalez',30672,200747,'Studio 30 (Deluxe) Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-17','2024-10-18','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',750400.00,'Studio 30 (Deluxe) room with 25 sqm sized room, and exclusive ARTOTEL bedding collection, with facilities 43\" inch lcd tv, 24 hours in-room service, high speed internet wi-fi, safety deposit box, hair dryer.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5246759,'816','Miguel Renon Gonzalez',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-10-18','2024-10-20','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',10080000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan isCape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continueto add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-18\", \"text\": \"ETA 09.30 by Batik Air ID6302 from Semarang on 18 Oct\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pangkalan Bun Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-20\", \"text\": \"ETD 08.50 by Batik Air ID6134 to Surabaya on 20 Oct\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5246760,'816','Miguel Renon Gonzalez',31015,211901,'3D2N - Malang Mount Bromo Ijen Tour Package drop Bali','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-10-20','2024-10-22','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',8288000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-20\", \"text\": \"ETA 10.00 by Batik Air ID6134 from Pangkalan Bun on 20 Oct\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Surabaya International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-22\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Bisma\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5246761,'816','Miguel Renon Gonzalez',30673,200559,'Deluxe Double Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-20','2024-10-21','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',1176000.00,'Designed to capture nature vibes. Slide open the door to your private terrace to let in the fresh mountain air and relax.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-10-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5246778,'816','Miguel Renon Gonzalez',30682,200893,'Villa\'s Deluxe','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-21','2024-10-22','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',2256800.00,'Villa Deluxe with 42 sqm room area. 23 rooms available (13 double + 10 twin), single and twin beds available with a capacity of 2 people per room. see the greatest view in Ijen Mountain. See the magic of the blue fire at night. Sophisticated design in Ijen Resort and Villas, in Banyuwangi, East Java. You can see the best view from your room, the rice field, mountains.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-10-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5246783,'816','Miguel Renon Gonzalez',30711,200830,'Bisma Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-10-22','2024-10-25','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',9424800.00,'Spacious one-bedroom suite of 88 sqm with private balcony for a sophisticated Ubud getaway. Interiors feature extensive use of wood and fine Indonesian textiles and art, lending an understated elegance to the space. Featuring a private balcony, this room includes a flat-screen TV and an en-suite bathroom with a bathtub and a shower, and many more.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-10-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5246786,'816','Miguel Renon Gonzalez',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-23','2024-10-23','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1747200.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Bisma\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5246790,'816','Miguel Renon Gonzalez',30508,202893,'Lempuyang Temple Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI11',1,'2024-10-25','2024-10-25','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1792000.00,'At the agreed time, our guide will pick you up to start the tour in the eastern part of Bali. The first place you will visit is Goa Lawah Temple. Goa Lawah Temple consists of two names, \"Goa\" which means cave and \"Lawah\" which means bat. Several thousand bats are flying in the cave as the name suggests. With the lights fading as you go deeper inside the cave, it gives off a very strange atmosphere. From Goa Lawah, we continue our way to Lempuyang Temple. Upon arrival, the temple will greet you with its gratifying panorama that extends into infinity. On a clear, sunny day, you\'ll be able to gaze out over the mountains, Amlapura city, and Mount Agung, an incredibly magnificent sight that\'s beautiful beyond words. This portrait of heaven is beautifully framed by the Gapura Candi Bentar (the gate of the temple). Our journey continues to visit Tirta Gangga. The site is a paradise surrounded by water, with all the pools decorated with unusual statues. With its seclusion and a view of the surrounding rice paddies, Tirta Gangga is a wonderful place. At the end of the trip we go to Tenganan Village, the most famous Bali Agas (the “original” Bali people) in the city. With its characteristics, the city village is arranged in parallel along the wide main road paved with rows of cobblestones. In Tenganan, women still weave the famous Kamben Geringsing, or \"burnt cloth,\" which has the power to immunize the wearer against evil. We take a close look at what they do in their daily lives in a traditional lifestyle. From Tenganan, we will transfer you to the hotel.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Bisma\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-25\", \"text\": \"Amed St, Bunutan, Abang, Karangasem Regency, Bali 80852\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Santai Hotel Bali\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5246830,'348','Frederick Mason MORGAN JR',32532,215488,'1D Sorong Birding Tour','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-28','2024-10-28','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Persons (2)',2800000.00,NULL,NULL,'Guide contact: +62813-3224-5180 (Mr. Charles)','{\"date\": \"2024-10-28\", \"text\": \"Please be ready in hotel lobby at the mentioned time.\", \"time\": \"05:30\", \"locality\": \"Aston Hotel Sorong\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Aston Hotel Sorong\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5247011,'816','Miguel Renon Gonzalez',30639,204935,'Ocean View Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-25','2024-10-26','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',1097600.00,'Open the typical Balinese double door and enter a large open space that holds a very comfortable Double Queen Size bed with mosquito net, under a beautiful bamboo and wooden high ceiling. The air-conditioned suite offers a large wooden wardrobe with plenty of space for you to comfortably store away your clothes and personal belongings. A safety box is conveniently tucked away in the wardrobe. And a minibar is also available in the suite, allowing you to enjoy chilled water and drinks at all times. Behind the main room you will find the open-air bathroom with shower. Available amenities are shampoo, conditioner, soap and bottled drinking water. Each suite offers a spacious patio where comfy bamboo sofas and a daybed await you. Upon awakening, you will find your morning coffee and tea tray on your patio. Start your day in the most relaxed way, enjoying stunning sunrises. The suite accommodates a maximum of two guests.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-10-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5247019,'816','Miguel Renon Gonzalez',30508,219495,'Amed to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-26','2024-10-26','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',784000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver will wait up to 30 minutes after your scheduled pickup time. - Please keep in mind that any further delay could affect your timely arrival at the airport for your flight. - For any changes in flight departure time, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available). - Requests for pickup time earlier than originally booked are subject to availability.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-26\", \"text\": \"Please be ready at hotel\'s lobby\", \"time\": \"09:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Santai Hotel Bali\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-26\", \"text\": \"ETD 12.15 by Bluewater Express to Gili Air on 26 Oct\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5247032,'816','Miguel Renon Gonzalez',30852,202033,'Villa Surya - One Bedroom Private Pool and Tropical Garden','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-10-26','2024-10-30','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',12096000.00,'Our cozy one bed Villa Surya is perfect for a solo traveler or a romantic getaway at 150 sqm private property. The spacious bedroom features a king-size bed with an extra thick mattress with 100% cotton linen, ensuring a blissful sleep. With high-ceilings, large windows, and a pivoting door onto your patio, the space is able to breathe whilst being basked in a beautiful, natural light. The ensuite bathroom, equipped with a bespoke basin area, rainfall shower, quality toiletries and 100% cotton towels leads out to the real star of this villa, the indulgent open-air bathtub. Large enough for two, with views of your private pool and tropical garden, while away hours in pure relaxation.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-10-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5247039,'816','Miguel Renon Gonzalez',30508,207387,'Padang Bai to Sanur','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-30','2024-10-30','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-30\", \"text\": \"ETA 12.30 from Gili Air by Gili Gili Fast Boat\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-30\", \"text\": \"Jl. Kusuma Sari No.1, Sanur, Denpasar Selatan, Kota Denpasar, Bali 80227\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"ARTOTEL Sanur - Bali\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5247040,'816','Miguel Renon Gonzalez',31024,203296,'Studio 30 Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-30','2024-10-31','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',1064000.00,'Our 81 units Studio 30 Room with 30 sqm of room area, adopts kites as it\'s main concept. This room is a canvas that showcases thought-provoking artworks by some of the most relevant Bali-based contemporary artists. This air-conditioned studio features a 49\" inch LED TV, high speed internet Wi-Fi, 24 hours in-room service, iPod dock, dolce gusto coffee maker, a minibar, en-suite bathroom comes with a shower, a hairdryer, free toiletries, and many more.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-10-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08