": null, \"locality\": \"Episode Hotel Kuta Bali\", \"location\": \"Jl. Bypass Ngurah Rai No.99, Kuta, Kec. Kuta, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80362\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5249961,'824','Mr. Diego Baron Cano',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-31','2024-11-01','Jacob','Praba',1,'Double',840000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Flight information: 31 October 2024 ETA 15:10 by Iberia Airlines IB6283 from Doha 1 November 2024 ETD 06:00 by Batik Air ID6202 to Pangkalan Bun Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK-IN. FM7 Hotel Airport Pickup Service: +62811-8815-053 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-10-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5249963,'825','Jose Manuel HURTADO',30508,212289,'Airport to Nusa Dua','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-11','2024-10-11','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting at the arrival hall exit, holding a signboard of your name/group name. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 3 hours after the flight’s estimated arrival time (ETA). - For any flight delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-10-11\", \"text\": \"ETA: 18.35 by Scoot Airlines TR286 from Singapore on 11 Oct\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Denpasar Airport\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"The Royal Santrian Nusa Dua\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5249964,'825','Jose Manuel HURTADO',30508,207268,'Nusa Dua to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-15','2024-10-15','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver will wait up to 30 minutes after your scheduled pickup time. - Please keep in mind that any further delay could affect your timely arrival at the airport for your flight. - For any changes in flight departure time, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available). - Requests for pickup time earlier than originally booked are subject to availability.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-15\", \"text\": \"Please be ready in hotel lobby at the mentioned time.\", \"time\": \"17:30\", \"locality\": \"The Royal Santrian Nusa Dua\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-15\", \"text\": \"ETD: 21.20 by Turkish Airlines TK67 to Istanbul on 15 Oct\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Denpasar Airport\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5250009,'824','Mr. Diego Baron Cano',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-11-01','2024-11-03','Jacob','Praba',1,'Person (1)',8520000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan isCape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continueto add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-01\", \"text\": \"ETA 07:15 by Batik Air ID6202 from Jakarta\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Bandar Udara Iskandar Pangkalan Bun\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-03\", \"text\": \"ETD 10:25 by Batik Air ID6303 to Semarang\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Bandar Udara Iskandar Pangkalan Bun\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5250013,'824','Mr. Diego Baron Cano',30783,217450,'5D4N Yogyakarta Bromo By Train / B. Gallery Prawirotaman (Superior) & Lereng Bromo (Deluxe)','Confirmed',NULL,5,'2024-11-03','2024-11-07','Jacob','Praba',1,'Person (1)',18270000.00,'D1. Pick Up Semarang - Yogyakarta D2. Borobudur - Village tour with Batik - Merapi D3. Jogja City Tour - Prambanan D4. Jogja - Bromo by Train D5. Bromo Tour - Surabaya Airport',NULL,'Details: 0311/D1 Arrival Semarang from Pangkalan Bun - Yogyakarta 0411/D2 Merapi Tour with Jeep - Water Castle - Bird Market 0511/D3 Prambanan Temple - Sultan Palace - Candirejo Village Tour - Borobudur temple 0611/D4 Yogyakarta - Bromo by Train 0711/D5 Bromo Sunrise Tour with Jeep - Surabaya Airport','{\"date\": \"2024-11-03\", \"text\": \"ETA 11:25 by Batik Air ID 6303 from Pangkalan Bun\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ahmad Yani Airport Semarang\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-07\", \"text\": \"ETD 14:25 by Lion Air JT910 to Denpasar\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Juanda International Airport Surabaya\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5250016,'824','Mr. Diego Baron Cano',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-07','2024-11-07','Jacob','Praba',1,'Person (1)',420000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting at the arrival hall exit, holding a signboard of your name/group name. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 3 hours after the flight’s estimated arrival time (ETA). - For any flight delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-11-07\", \"text\": \"Domestic Arrival ETA 16:25 by Lion Air JT910 from Surabaya\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-07\", \"text\": \"Jalan Suweta, Banjar Bentuyung Sakti, Ubud – Gianyar Phone: +62361 2091788\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5250020,'826','Esteban Borrell Bardaji',30508,212288,'Airport to Seminyak','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-14','2024-10-14','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting at the arrival hall exit, holding a signboard of your name/group name. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 3 hours after the flight’s estimated arrival time (ETA). - For any flight delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-10-14\", \"text\": \"ETA 22.20 by Emirates EK398 from Dubai on 14 Oct\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-14\", \"text\": \"Jl. Kayu Aya, Pantai Seminyak, Kuta, Seminyak, Kec. Kuta, Kabupaten Badung\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Seminyak Beach Resort & Spa\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5250021,'824','Mr. Diego Baron Cano',30985,212179,'Jungle Suite Room with Private Balcony','Confirmed',NULL,7,'2024-11-07','2024-11-14','Jacob','Praba',1,'Double',16380000.00,'Escape the hustle and bustle of everyday life and immerse yourself in the beauty of nature with our Jungle Suite with Private Balcony. Located in the heart of the lush tropical rainforest, this Suite offers a unique opportunity to immerse yourself in nature while still enjoying all the comforts of modern living. The real highlight of this room category is the private balcony overlooking the jungle canopy. Relax in your own personal paradise as you listen to the sounds of nature, watch the birds playing in the trees, and breathe in the fresh air while taking in the breathtaking views.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-11-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5250026,'824','Mr. Diego Baron Cano',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route (Taman Ayun-Jatiluwih-Ulun Danu Bratan-Tanah Lot)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-08','2024-11-08','Jacob','Praba',1,'Person (1)',1596000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-08\", \"text\": \"Jalan Suweta, Banjar Bentuyung Sakti, Ubud – Gianyar Phone: +62361 2091788\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-08\", \"text\": \"Jalan Suweta, Banjar Bentuyung Sakti, Ubud – Gianyar Phone: +62361 2091788\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5250027,'826','Esteban Borrell Bardaji',30606,203160,'Beach Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-10-14','2024-10-16','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',8803200.00,'The Beach Room are a stylish, sleek and serene addition to our hotel on Seminyak Beach. Witness a marriage of contemporary design and Balinese tradition, complete with yielding beds, sunny balconies and lavish en-suite bathrooms with indulgent soaking tubs and powerful rain showers. Hand-carved wooden accents are offset by warm-toned furnishings and fabrics that span the spectrum from burgundy via espresso to cappuccino.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-10-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5250035,'826','Esteban Borrell Bardaji',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-16','2024-10-16','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1747200.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-16\", \"text\": \"Jl. Kayu Aya, Pantai Seminyak, Kuta, Seminyak, Kec. Kuta, Kabupaten Badung\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Seminyak Beach Resort & Spa\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-16\", \"text\": \"Jl. Suweta No.88, Bentuyung Sakti, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Adiwana Unagi Suites\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5250036,'824','Mr. Diego Baron Cano',30508,202893,'Lempuyang Temple Tour (Tenganan Village-Virgin Beach-Lempuyang Temple)','Confirmed','C2I-BALI11',1,'2024-11-09','2024-11-09','Jacob','Praba',1,'Person (1)',1620000.00,'At the agreed time, our guide will pick you up to start the tour in the eastern part of Bali. The first place you will visit is Goa Lawah Temple. Goa Lawah Temple consists of two names, \"Goa\" which means cave and \"Lawah\" which means bat. Several thousand bats are flying in the cave as the name suggests. With the lights fading as you go deeper inside the cave, it gives off a very strange atmosphere. From Goa Lawah, we continue our way to Lempuyang Temple. Upon arrival, the temple will greet you with its gratifying panorama that extends into infinity. On a clear, sunny day, you\'ll be able to gaze out over the mountains, Amlapura city, and Mount Agung, an incredibly magnificent sight that\'s beautiful beyond words. This portrait of heaven is beautifully framed by the Gapura Candi Bentar (the gate of the temple). Our journey continues to visit Tirta Gangga. The site is a paradise surrounded by water, with all the pools decorated with unusual statues. With its seclusion and a view of the surrounding rice paddies, Tirta Gangga is a wonderful place. At the end of the trip we go to Tenganan Village, the most famous Bali Agas (the “original” Bali people) in the city. With its characteristics, the city village is arranged in parallel along the wide main road paved with rows of cobblestones. In Tenganan, women still weave the famous Kamben Geringsing, or \"burnt cloth,\" which has the power to immunize the wearer against evil. We take a close look at what they do in their daily lives in a traditional lifestyle. From Tenganan, we will transfer you to the hotel.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-09\", \"text\": \"Jalan Suweta, Banjar Bentuyung Sakti, Ubud – Gianyar Phone: +62361 2091788\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-09\", \"text\": \"Jalan Suweta, Banjar Bentuyung Sakti, Ubud – Gianyar Phone: +62361 2091788\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5250039,'826','Esteban Borrell Bardaji',30508,202883,'Ubud Electric Bike Tour','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-17','2024-10-17','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1270000.00,'We offer the best way to experience a bike tour Ubud. Electric bike! A mix between riding a motorcycle and a bicycle, the electric bicycle is the best of both worlds. easily while pedaling through the hills, magnificent rice terraces and villages. Our local guides will give you knowledge of Bali more than just landscapes. We will have 2 hours of cycling trip out of the busy center of Ubud through the village of Mambal, where you can see the unique Subak at work and stroll around the rustic and lush surroundings. While you ride your bike you will see beautiful rice fields, dams and waterfalls, we make a stop on the Ayung River, go through the Bali Green School and go through small villages. Our local guides have an intimate knowledge about the entire route. After your bike ride, a healthy lunch is served in a traditional Balinese house.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-17\", \"text\": \"Please be ready at the hotel\'s lobby 5 minutes before.\", \"time\": \"08:20\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Adiwana Unagi Suites\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5250063,'826','Esteban Borrell Bardaji',30508,207379,'Ubud to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-20','2024-10-20','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Adiwana Unagi Suites\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-20\", \"text\": \"ETD 08.30 by Gili Gili Fast Boat to Gili Air on 20 Oct\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bai Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5250067,'824','Mr. Diego Baron Cano',31083,212371,'2D1N LOB Rinca - Padar - Komodo Island Tour (Medium Standard Boat)','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-11-14','2024-11-15','Jacob','Praba',1,'Person (1)',22800000.00,'TOUR ITINERARY Highlights: Menjarite, Kelor, Kalong, Rinca, Padar, Komodo Island, Pink Beach, Manta Point, Sebayur DAY 1 : DPS - LABUAN BAJO - MENJARITE - KELOR - RINCA - KALONG ISLAND Arrival at Komodo Airport in Labuan Bajo west Flores, meeting service with our tour guide and transfer to the pier of Labuan Bajo for Rinca Island. It’s about 2 hours sail to the island of Komodo Dragon, stop at Menjarite island for snorkeling then continue to Rinca island-the Island of Komodo dragon, you will find not just e Dragons but also many wild animals like, deer, wild buffalo, long-tailed macaque and wild pig also numerous of birds. Keep your eyes look up as sometime you will find the young Komodo dragons on the trees. A local ranger will lead you through this natural preservation. Late afternoon sailing directly to Kalong Rinca Island to see the hundreds of fling foxes set out from the mangrove tree at 06-07pm, the lovely sunset from the boat trip really enjoyable here. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Boat Cabin Air Conditioning DAY 2 : KALONG - PADAR - KOMODO - PINK BEACH - MANTA POINT - LABUAN BAJO After having breakfast in your boat, heading to Padar Island, taking trek to Padar Island until having the top view point to get breathtaking scenery of three bays around, Padar Island hike in Komodo has some of the most amazing views in Indonesia, trek to downhill and back to the Boat for sailing directly to Loh Liang – the Ranger station in Komodo Island. By passing through many small islands, After registering start to take basic trekking to see the GIANT RIZARD / KOMODO DRAGON and other wild animals as: Timor deer, wild pig, wild chicken and many variously of tropical bird. Please keep your look at any directions as sometimes you will also find young Komodo dragon hanging over the trees. A local ranger will be led you during the trek. Return to the boat on to Pink beach for snorkeling, swimming and relaxing. It is really spectacular and unspoiled coral reef and many color fish. This is one of best side for snorkeling diving. Sail toward MANTA POINT to exploring Huge Mantas by snorkeling even watching from your boat trip (can’t be guaranteed if weather is not good, like wave and current are strongly) visit also the taka Makaasar its really tiny island with white sand beach really enjoyable to relaxing or beach walking then heading to to Labuan Bajo for getting flight to Denpasar. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Attention: The itinerary is subject to change due to the weather, tide level and operating conditions without prior notice.',NULL,'TOUR ITINERARY Day 01: Dps – LBJ- Menjarite-Kelor-RINCA - Kalong island Day 02: Kalong -Padar - Komodo – Pink Beach – Manta Point – Labuan Bajo','{\"date\": \"2024-11-14\", \"text\": \"ETA 09:10 by Batik Air ID6333 from Denpasar\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Bandara International Komodo Labuan Bajo\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-15\", \"text\": \"l. Pantai Pede, Labuan Bajo, Kec. Komodo, Kabupaten Manggarai Barat, Nusa Tenggara Timur Telepon: (0385) 2443710\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Puri Sari Beach Hotel\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5250095,'824','Mr. Diego Baron Cano',30701,207546,'Superior Room + Oneway Airport Transfer','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-15','2024-11-16','Jacob','Praba',1,'Double',900000.00,'Our Superior Room at 38 sqm of room area, equipped with AC, Western toilet and shower with hot & cold water, desk, seating area, and many more. Breakfast is included in the room rate. Featuring a balcony or terrace, guests can enjoy spectacular views of the garden, pool or the sea.',NULL,'Flight information: ETD 13:35 by Batik Air ID6330 to Denpasar','{\"date\": \"2024-11-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5250121,'826','Esteban Borrell Bardaji',32602,215975,'One Bedroom Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-10-20','2024-10-24','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',16800000.00,'Each room offers the same comfort: one bedroom villas with terrace, swimming pool, kitchenette and office space, comfortable sunbeds, lovely coconut garden. Particular care to the quality of the beddings, the home stylist Valérie Barkowski has added her touch of originality with a predominant colour selection of orange, grey, red, green, bordeaux or black. Choose your holiday colour!',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS','{\"date\": \"2024-10-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5250124,'824','Mr. Diego Baron Cano',30596,201103,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-11-16','2024-11-19','Jacob','Praba',1,'Double',7380000.00,'Experience timeless elegance in our Deluxe Room. Perfect for couples or solo travelers seeking a spacious single/double bed. Our room offers premium linens, plush pillows, and a peaceful ambiance. Enjoy high-speed internet, a flat-screen TV, coffee and tea-making facilities, and an in-room safe deposit box, ensuring a convenient and enjoyable stay. Unwind on the balcony overlooking the pool, to recharge after a day of activities.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-11-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5250135,'824','Mr. Diego Baron Cano',30508,207270,'Seminyak to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-19','2024-11-19','Jacob','Praba',1,'Person (1)',300000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver will wait up to 30 minutes after your scheduled pickup time. - Please keep in mind that any further delay could affect your timely arrival at the airport for your flight. - For any changes in flight departure time, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available). - Requests for pickup time earlier than originally booked are subject to availability.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-19\", \"text\": \"Jalan Padma Utara, Legian Kaja, Bali Telephone: +62361 757688\", \"time\": \"14:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Bali Niksoma Boutique Beach Resorts\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-19\", \"text\": \"Domestic Departure ETD 17:20 by Garuda Indonesia GA419 to Jakarta\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5250141,'824','Mr. Diego Baron Cano',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-19','2024-11-20','Jacob','Praba',1,'Double',840000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Flight Information: 19 November 2024: ETA 18:25 by Garuda Indonesia GA419 from Denpasar 20 November 2024: ETD 18:10 by Iberia Air IB6284 to Doha Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK-IN. FM7 Hotel Airport Pickup Service: +62811-8815-053 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-11-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5250143,'826','Esteban Borrell Bardaji',30508,214949,'Padang Bai to Kuta','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-24','2024-10-24','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-24\", \"text\": \"ETA