,'Nicholas','Praba',1,'Persons (4)',840000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting at the arrival hall exit, holding a signboard of your name/group name. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 3 hours after the flight’s estimated arrival time (ETA). - For any flight delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-11-06\", \"text\": \"Domestic Arrival ETA 13:45 by Citilink QG698 from Surabaya\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-06\", \"text\": \"Jl. Cok Rai Pudak No.10, Peliatan, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar Telepon: (0361) 979270\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kajane Yangloni Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5251084,'807','Ms. Beatriz Borrella Petisco',30708,200935,'UMA KANGIN Mansion (Junior Suite Room)','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-11-06','2024-11-09','Nicholas','Praba',2,'Double',8316000.00,'At 60 square meters, One Bedroom with no private pool but there is a comfortable public pool available. The concept of Mansion is building with 4th floor’s which each floor consist of few rooms, it’s facing to small river orrice field and bamboo tree.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-11-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5251087,'807','Ms. Beatriz Borrella Petisco',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route (Taman Ayun-Jatiluwih-Ulun Danu Bratan-Tanah Lot)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-07','2024-11-07','Nicholas','Praba',4,'Persons (4)',2832000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-07\", \"text\": \"Jl. Cok Rai Pudak No.10, Peliatan, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar Telepon: (0361) 979270\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kajane Yangloni Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-07\", \"text\": \"Jl. Cok Rai Pudak No.10, Peliatan, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar Telepon: (0361) 979270\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kajane Yangloni Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5251091,'807','Ms. Beatriz Borrella Petisco',30508,207379,'Ubud to Padang