hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK-IN. FM7 Hotel Airport Pickup Service: +62811-8815-053 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-12-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5253630,'258','Abyssworld Group Samambaia 23 Dec 2024 - 03 Jan 2025',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-22','2024-12-23','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Single',784000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'The guest has a separate booking for 21-22 December 2024. Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK-IN. FM7 Hotel Airport Pickup Service: +62811-8815-053 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-12-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5253902,'832','Elisabeth Stephanie KOLAR',31092,203847,'2D1N Banjarmasin Trip / A. Swiss-Belhotel *3','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-11-16','2024-11-17','Ayu','Agus',1,'Persons (2)',0.00,'DAY 1 : AIRPORT - BANJARMASIN - CANAL - ALALAK Arrival, meeting service with your guide then driving 1 hour to Banjarmasin for check in hotel. Joining the river trip boating to Alalak Island and pass through the canal of most populated canal in the city. Back to hotel. Free program. DAY 2 : FLOATING MARKET LOK BAINTAN - TRANSFER OUT Early morning at 05.15 by a slow motor boat to reach lok baintan floating market at the upper stream of Martapura River which takes 90 minutes from the hotel. You may see a hundred of canoes offer the local product of fruits and vegetables. Back to Hotel, break fast, check out then transfer out to Airport.',NULL,'Note: Regina is allergy to pumpkin Flight information: ETA 14.40 by Super Air Jet IU636 from Surabaya on 16 November 2024 ETD 14.00 by Air Asia QZ619 to Denpasar on 17 November 2024','{\"date\": \"2024-11-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5254442,'836','Karynna Tuan',30806,208758,'3D2N Shared Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO8',3,'2024-10-15','2024-10-17','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Person (1)',7840000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.00 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you canhave your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan is Cape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even see crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Shared Klotok Boat *The SHARED klotok will be ready by 10.30 AM and will depart at 12.00 PM sharp. Check-in time: Klotok at 10.30 AM, check-out time: 08.00 AM *If you arrive at the port before 12 PM, you may walk around the area of the port by yourself. Alternatively, when the boat is ready, you can also wait for the other travelers on the boat. Note: The guide may not assist you during the waiting time. *All participants should arrive at the latest 10.30 AM at Pangkalanbun Airport. If you arrive late, you must take the speedboat to join the klotok. The speedboat costs around IDR 600.000/boat/way to be paid directly to the captain. Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continue to add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Shared Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: - IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board. - Guide will be bilingual, English & Spanish Flights information ETA: 08.10 by Batik Air ID6135 from Surabaya on 15 Oct ETD: 07.55 by Batik Air ID6203 to Jakarta on 17 Oct','{\"date\": \"2024-10-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5254538,'502','Mr. David Esteso Villar',30680,200914,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-24','2024-09-25','Melysa','Praba',1,'Double',960000.00,'Enjoy our spacious elegant deluxe room with 40 m2 of room size. Enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, hot and cold shower, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Flight details 24 September 2024: ETA 15:25 by Qatar Airways QR956 from Doha 25 September 2024: ETD ETD 06:00 by by Batik Air ID6202 to Pangkalan Bun Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK-IN. FM7 Hotel Airport Pickup Service: +62811-8815-053 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-09-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5254573,'502','Mr. David Esteso Villar',30680,200914,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-05','2024-10-06','Melysa','Praba',1,'Double',960000.00,'Enjoy our spacious elegant deluxe room with 40 m2 of room size. Enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, hot and cold shower, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Flight details: 5 Oct : ETA 18:50PM by Garuda Indonesia GA435 from Lombok 6 Oct : ETD 09:10AM by Qatar Airways QR959 to Doha Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK-IN. FM7 Hotel Airport Pickup Service: +62811-8815-053 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-10-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5255020,'837','Chaitali NATH',30783,213432,'2D1N Yogyakarta / C. Adhisthana (Superior Room)','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-09-28','2024-09-29','Ayu','Eddy',1,'Person (1)',4680000.00,'D1 : Arrival Yogyakarta International Airport - Visit Borobudur Temple incl. Mendut and Pawon - check in hotel Welcome to the cradle of Indonesian culture, Yogyakarta. A tourist destination for its ancient palaces, temples, batik workshops, gamelan music orchestras, court dances and wayang puppet shows. Upon your arrival in Yogyakarta a representative of come2indonesia will be waiting for you with a sign indicating your name to start exploring this special city. We will start by heading towards Borobudur Temple (Candi Borobudur), the great Stupa, the largest Buddhist monument in the world and one of the seven wonders. We will tour around the temple, observe the hundreds and centenary statues of Buddha and witness how dozens of Buddhists come to preach from all over the world. Historically it was established during the relatively brief Sailendra dynasty of Central Java between 778 and 856 BC and is in constant restoration due to the breaks that the tremors of the neighbouring Merapi volcano has been producing during its history. After visiting one of the most important Buddhist temples in Southeast Asia, we continue our journey to the Mendut temple and Pawon temple. D2 : Morning visit Prambanan Temple - City Tour Yogyakarta visit Sultan Palace, Watercastle and Bird Market - Transfer to Yogyakarta International Airport You will enjoy a well-deserved breakfast at the hotel and we will start by heading towards Candi Prambanan, the temple of the Hinduists and classified as a World Heritage Site by Unesco since 1991. The built of this temple was finished around the year 856 to commemorate the victory of the descendant Sanjaya of Siva, Rikai Pikatan on the last sovereign Sailendra of Central Java. Take your time to enjoy each carving on the rocks and feel the spirituality that each of the stones perched in this set of more than 200 Hindu temples that are dedicated to the Trimurti, the expression of God as the Creator, the Preserver and the destroyer. After this visit we go to the Keraton known as the Sultan’s Palace. The palace is a complex building two centuries old, located in the heart of the city. You will hear the song of the “freedom” of the birds in the bird market, we will visit the “Water Castle” that occupies the highest part at the northern end of the vast complex of Taman Sari, Malioboro Street, main street of Yogyakarta, with its merchants, horse carriages, taxi-bikes and markets. An incredible experience that will make the hours fly by. According to the time of your flight, we will pick you up to take you to the airport and take the flight to your next destination. End of our services. Thank you very much for exploring Yogyakarta by the hand of Come2indonesia.',NULL,'Program: 28 SEP. Arrive in Yogyakarta - Borobudur Temple - Prambanan Temple 29 SEP. Transfer from Adhisthana Hotel to Yogyakarta Airport Hotel: Adhisthana Hotel - Superior Room','{\"date\": \"2024-09-28\", \"text\": \"ETA 07.25 by Lion Air JT3569 from Denpasar on 28 September 2024\", \"time\": \"07:25\", \"locality\": \"AIRPORT YOGYAKARTA\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-29\", \"text\": \"ETD 08.05 by Lion Air JT560 to Denpasar on 29 September 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"AIRPORT YOGYAKARTA\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5255026,'837','Chaitali NATH',30923,202520,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-09-29','2024-10-01','Ayu','Eddy',1,'Single',1680000.00,'At 30 sqm room size, Deluxe room with bed configuration 1 double bed (king) or 2 single bed (twin) and max occupancy for 3 Adult or 2 Adult with 2 Child. Have a private balcony overlooking to the garden. Interconnecting Room available which consist of 1 Room with King Size bed and 1 room with 2 single bed.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-09-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5255032,'837','Chaitali NATH',30508,202897,'Uluwatu Temple and Kecak Dance','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-29','2024-09-29','Ayu','Eddy',1,'Person (1)',1938000.00,'This half-day tour, is an exciting tour package to visit Padang-Padang Beach, Uluwatu Temple, the famous Balinese Hindu Temple in south part of Bali with breathtaking view of sunset and Indian Ocean. Uluwatu Temple is one of Balinese Hindu Temples located right on the petrifying hill with the crevasse exist in the right and left side. Uluwatu Temple is one of Sad Khayangan (6 biggest temple in Bali) owns magnificent view of the Indian Ocean and sunset as a backdrop. This temple is very amazing where the location is right on the narrow peninsula with deep seawater under it. This tour package is combined with the spectacular Balinese traditional dance performance of Kecak Dance. Balinese Kecak Dance is a spectacular traditional dance with the group of people playing this dance with fire game. It is very exciting and unique dance due to the sound of gamelan is not using the normal gamelan but use their mouth. The dancers make the compact choir with the exquisite dance movement that is one of this dance features. After the dance we returned back to the hotel or seafood restaurant in Jimbaran.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-29\", \"text\": \"ETA 10.30 by Lion Air JT560 from Yogyakarta on 29 September 2024\", \"time\": \"10:30\", \"locality\": \"Ngurah Rai Airport Bali (International Terminal)\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-29\", \"text\": \"Jl. Wana Segara, Kuta, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Risata Bali Resort and Spa\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5255036,'837','Chaitali NATH',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-30','2024-09-30','Ayu','Eddy',1,'Person (1)',1596000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-30\", \"text\": \"Risata Bali Resort and Spa Jl. Wana Segara, Kuta, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-30\", \"text\": \"Jl. Wana Segara, Kuta, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Risata Bali Resort and Spa\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5255039,'837','Chaitali NATH',30508,207266,'Kuta to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-01','2024-10-01','Ayu','Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',300000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'Flight information: ETD 10.20 by Singapore Airlines SQ935 to Singapore on 01 October 2024 The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver will wait up to 30 minutes after your scheduled pickup time. - Please keep in mind that any further delay could affect your timely arrival at the airport for your flight. - For any changes in flight departure time, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available). - Requests for pickup time earlier than originally booked are subject to availability.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-01\", \"text\": \"Risata Bali Resort and Spa Jl. Wana Segara, Kuta, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": \"06:50\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-01\", \"text\": \"ETD 10.20 by Singapore Airlines SQ935 to Singapore on 01 October 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Ngurah Rai Airport Bali (International Terminal)\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5255216,'837','Chaitali NATH',30508,212571,'Jimbaran to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-09-28','2024-09-28','Ayu','Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',300000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver will wait up to 30 minutes after your scheduled pickup time. - Please keep in mind that any further delay could affect your timely arrival at the airport for your flight. - For any changes in flight departure time, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available). - Requests for pickup time earlier than originally booked are subject to availability.','{\"date\": \"2024-09-28\", \"text\": \"Intercontinental Bali Jimbaran Uluwatu St No.45, Jimbaran, South Kuta, Badung Regency, Bali 80361\", \"time\": \"04:30\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-09-28\", \"text\": \"ETD 07.00 by Lion Air JT3569 To Yogyakarta on 28 September 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Ngurah Rai Airport Bali (Domestic Terminal)\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5256529,'831','KOSMALA Margaux',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-10-05','2024-10-07','Ayu','Ayu',1,'Single',1568000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK-IN. FM7 Hotel Airport Pickup Service: +62811-8815-053 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-10-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5256530,'831','KOSMALA Margaux',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-18','2024-