ar',0.00,NULL,NULL,'22 October 2024 Transfer from Airport Ambon to Swiss Bel Ambon Flight information: ETA 16.00 by Garuda Indonesia GA646 from Jakarta on 22 October 2024','{\"date\": \"2024-10-22\", \"text\": \"ETA 16.00 by Garuda Indonesia GA646 from Jakarta on 22 October 2024\", \"time\": \"16:00\", \"locality\": \"Pattimura Airport of Ambon\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Swiss-Belhotel Ambon\", \"location\": \"Jl. Benteng Kapaha No.88, Uritetu, Kec. Sirimau, Kota Ambon, Maluku 97124\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5263902,'857','Juan Dizon',33298,219798,'Transfer from Swiss Bel Hotel Ambon to Ambon Dive Explore (White Manta Liveaboard)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-23','2024-10-23','Ayu','Ayu',2,'Per Car',0.00,NULL,NULL,'Pick up at 09.30 at Swiss Bel Hotel Ambon 23 Oct. Transfer from Swiss Bel Hotel Ambon to White Manta Liveaboard, Laha Bay, Ambon White Manta liveaboard, Laha Bay, Teluk Ambon (Ambon Dive Explorer) Contact number (Agun / vessel manager); +62813 64000556','{\"date\": \"2024-10-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"09:30\", \"locality\": \"Swiss-Belhotel Ambon\", \"location\": \"Jl. Benteng Kapaha No.88, Uritetu, Kec. Sirimau, Kota Ambon, Maluku 97124\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-23\", \"text\": \"Contact number (Agun / vessel manager); +62813 64000556\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Ambon Dive Explore (White Manta Liveaboard)\", \"location\": \"Laha, Teluk Ambon, Kota Ambon, Maluku\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5263963,'845','Journaway 7D6N Borneo Java Bali (SHARED)',30680,200914,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-01','2024-11-02','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Single',0.00,'Enjoy our spacious elegant deluxe room with 40 m2 of room size. Enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, hot and cold shower, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK-IN. FM7 Hotel Airport Pickup Service: +62811-8815-053 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-11-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5263964,'845','Journaway 7D6N Borneo Java Bali (SHARED)',30806,202002,'4D3N Borneo Orangutan & Reforestation Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO7',4,'2024-11-02','2024-11-05','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Persons (2)',13104000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN – KUMAI PORT – TANJUNG HARAPAN Your “Orangutan & Reforestation Tour” begins upon arrival at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan is Cape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch – Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : TANJUNG HARAPAN VILLAGE – PROBOSCIS TOUR – CAMP LEAKEY After an extraordinary breakfast, you go to visit the village inside the national park, named Tanjung Harapan Village. Here you will see the activities of the locals. After the visit, you will return to the klotok cruise up to the Sekonyer River. You will see nice vegetation around the river bank, including Nipa Palm, Pandanus, and some kinds of trees that are growing up around the river. See some wildlifes such as birds, Macaques, Proboscis Monkeys and Orangutans. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large monitor lizards. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. Note: The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. Meals : Breakfast – Lunch – Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : PONDOK TANGGUI – CAMP LEAKEY – BOAT After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continue to add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After lunch, you will have the opportunity to repeat feeding camp at Camp Leaky. It is a unique opportunity to dedicate more time to your observation and to discover more wild animals, along with the Orangutans. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note: If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast – Lunch – Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 4 : KUMAI PORT – PANGKALAN BUN Today we end our stay in the jungles of Borneo. Our “Orangutan & Reforestation Tour” is about to finish. In the early morning we will have breakfast on the boat, to then go to the port and in turn, be transferred to the airport. The boat departure will be at the latest at 10am, but we adapt to your flights if your flight leaves earlier in the morning. If you decide to take an afternoon flight, we can take you directly to the airport at 10 or if you want a city tour in the Arut village to drop you off at the airport later, it could be arranged at extra cost. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board. Flights information ETA: 07.15 by Batik Air ID6202 from Jakarta on 02 Nov ETD: 08.50 by Batik Air ID6134 to Surabaya on 05 Nov','{\"date\": \"2024-11-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5263967,'845','Journaway 7D6N Borneo Java Bali (SHARED)',30684,200640,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-05','2024-11-06','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Single',0.00,'Designed to embody fresher and younger ambience, our Deluxe Room is a convenient stay for those who plan a relatively shorter stay in Semarang. The room is provided with either a king size or deluxe twin beds.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-11-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5263968,'845','Journaway 7D6N Borneo Java Bali (SHARED)',31015,203232,'3D2N - Surabaya Mount Bromo Ijen Tour Package drop Bali','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-11-05','2024-11-07','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Persons (2)',0.00,NULL,NULL,'Accommodation 05-06 Nov: Jiwa Jawa Bromo 06-07 Nov: Dialoog Hotel Banyuwangi','{\"date\": \"2024-11-05\", \"text\": \"ETA: 10.00 by Batik Air ID6134 from Pangkalan Bun on 05 Nov\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Surabaya Airport\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"The Sun of Granary Resort & Villas Ubud\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5263969,'845','Journaway 7D6N Borneo Java Bali (SHARED)',30679,200582,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-06','2024-11-07','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Single',0.00,'Stylish, spacious and bright with an open-concept bedroom and bathroom, and a private balcony with daybed. Room includes a desk, a small sofa and a floor-to-ceiling window for maximum natural light.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-11-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5264428,'858','Mrs. Beatriz Bascuas',30783,213061,'Transfer from Yogyakarta to Semarang Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-28','2024-10-28','Jacob','Praba',1,'Per Car',960000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-28\", \"text\": \"Jl. KH. Ahmad Dahlan No.123, Notoprajan, Ngampilan, Kota Yogyakarta Telepon: (0274) 2870298\", \"time\": \"03:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ayaartta Hotel Malioboro\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-28\", \"text\": \"ETD 08:30 by Batik Air ID6302 to Pangkalan Bun\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ahmad Yani Airport Semarang\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5264558,'737','Begona Velasco Makuba',33299,219805,'Room With Sea View','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-11-06','2024-11-08','Norberto','Febrina',1,'Double',960000.00,NULL,NULL,'07 Nov 2024 / 1 Day Tour in Kei Island include English speaking guide and Lunch Box Breakfast at Casa di Stella – Depart to Ngurtavur by local boat from Ngurbloat – Relax and sunbathing at Ngurtavur - Continuo to Ohoiew for Snorkeling and Lunch – Back to Ngurbloat – Drive to Goa Hawang – Visit Goa Hawang – Drive to Bukit Masbait after visit Goa Hawang – Panoramic View at Bukit Masbait – Continuo to Ohoidertawun – Visit Goa Vid Nit – Return to Casa di Stella. 08 Nov 2024 / Transfer out Hotel - Tual Airport for 2 persons Flight details: ETD 11:30 by Lion Air JT881 to Ambon on 08 Nov','{\"date\": \"2024-11-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5264836,'737','Begona Velasco Makuba',33299,219806,'FD Tour in Kei Island (Goa Vid Nit – Masbait Hill – Goa Hawang – Ngurtavur)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-07','2024-11-07','Norberto','Febrina',2,'Person',3000000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-11-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5264839,'737','Begona Velasco Makuba',33299,219806,'Hotel - Airport Transfer','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-08','2024-11-08','Norberto','Febrina',1,'Per Car',300000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-11-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5264893,'327','Thomas Ploem Group',30508,207250,'Airport to Kuta','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-26','2024-10-26','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting at the arrival hall exit, holding a 