em.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-11\", \"text\": \"Sebatu, Tegallalang, Gianyar Regency, Bali 80561\", \"time\": \"05:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Nau villa ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-11\", \"text\": \"ETD 08:00 by The Angkal Fast Boat to Nusa Penida\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Kusamba Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5268298,'861','Sheila Robles Zamorano',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-10-11','2024-10-11','Jacob','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',952000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-11\", \"text\": \"ETA 08.30 by The Angkal Fast Boat from Kusamba on 11 Oct\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sampalan Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-11\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Toya Pakeh - Ped, Dusun Sebunibus, Sakti, Kec. Nusa Penida\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Semabu Hills Hotel Nusa Penida\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5268299,'861','Sheila Robles Zamorano',30508,207337,'Snorkeling to Nusa Penida (from Nusa Penida) (Sharing Trip)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-12','2024-10-12','Jacob','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1232000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-12\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Toya Pakeh - Ped, Dusun Sebunibus, Sakti, Kec. Nusa Penida\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Semabu Hills Hotel Nusa Penida\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5268308,'861','Sheila Robles Zamorano',30508,207388,'Sanur to Seminyak','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-13','2024-10-13','Jacob','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-13\", \"text\": \"ETA 13.00 by Maruti Fast Boat from Nusa Penida\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sanur Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-13\", \"text\": \"Jl. Petitenget No.188, Seminyak, Kec. Kuta Utara, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"KANVAZ Village Resort Seminyak\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5268322,'862','Amparo Llaosa & (PARTY) in Option B (4 PERSON)',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-29','2024-10-30','Jacob','Eddy',1,'Double',840000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'ETA : 29OCT 1910 From Yogyakarta ID6377 by Batik Air ETD: 30OCT 18:20 to Doha QR957 By Qatar Airways Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK-IN. FM7 Hotel Airport Pickup Service: +62811-8815-053 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-10-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5268358,'861','Sheila Robles Zamorano',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Custom Itinerary)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-14','2024-10-14','Jacob','Tami',2,'Person (1)',1713600.00,NULL,NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-14\", \"text\": \"Jl. Petitenget No.188, Seminyak, Kec. Kuta Utara, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": \"13:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"KANVAZ Village Resort Seminyak\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5271128,'863','Jose Luis',30701,207546,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-10','2024-10-11','Norberto','Komang',1,'Double',900000.00,'Our Superior Room at 38 sqm of room area, equipped with AC, Western toilet and shower with hot & cold water, desk, seating area, and many more. Breakfast is included in the room rate. Featuring a balcony or terrace, guests can enjoy spectacular views of the garden, pool or the sea.',NULL,'Flight schedule on 10 October 2024 ETA at 17.00 by Air Asia Air Asia QZ646 on 10 OCT 2024','{\"date\": \"2024-10-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5271129,'863','Jose Luis',32766,216808,'3D2N Open Trip Komodo - Lady Grace / Junior Suite','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-10-11','2024-10-13','Norberto','Komang',2,'Per Person (Min. 2 Person)',16440000.00,'DAY 1 : Kelor Island - Manjerite Island - Kalong Island DAY 2 : Padar Island - Long / Pick Beach - Komodo Island - Manta Point - Taka Makasar DAY 3 : Kanawa Island',NULL,'Pickup & Dropoff point : Hotel Puri Sari Labuan Bajo Jl. Pantai Pede, Labuan Bajo, Kec. Komodo, Kabupaten Manggarai Barat, Nusa Tenggara Tim. 86554 Telepon: (0385) 2443710 Time pickup between 09.00 - 09.30 AM','{\"date\": \"2024-10-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5271130,'863','Jose Luis',30701,207546,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-13','2024-10-14','Norberto','Komang',1,'Double',900000.00,'Our Superior Room at 38 sqm of room area, equipped with AC, Western toilet and shower with hot & cold water, desk, seating area, and many more. Breakfast is included in the room rate. Featuring a balcony or terrace, guests can enjoy spectacular views of the garden, pool or the sea.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5271131,'863','Jose Luis',31083,213917,'6D5N Flores - Waerebo Tour / Junggle Villa Manulalu','Confirmed',NULL,6,'2024-10-14','2024-10-19','Norberto','Komang',2,'Persons (2-3 / Single)',24216000.00,'TOUR ITINERARY DAY 1 : ARRIVAL IN MAUMERE - MONI Arrival in Maumere, the cultural capital of the Isla de Flores, in this part of the trip, we will cross the island of Flores, from east to west, along the famous and only road that crosses the island, known among locals as La Transflores. At the Frans Seda airport, our native Flores guide will be waiting for you, along with him and a driver, we drive to Moni by private car. It will take about four hours, but we will be able to make some stops in the towns of Ledadero, Sikka and other places on the way to Moni. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Kelimutu Ecolodge or Kelimutu Paradise Resort DAY 2 : MONI - KELIMUTU VOLCANO - BAJAWA Today we will get up early (again!) To see sunrise at the top of the Kelimutu. The Kelimutu is a great volcano, which we access practically by car, until the last 20 minutes, which will be practically a walk in the countryside. When we reach the top, we will be able to see 3 craters, which have become three lakes, of different colors. One black, one yellow and the other a little purple, but the magnificent thing is that they change color, especially at dawn! Wear a coat, because sometimes it is a little cold in what we expect the sunrise. After admiring this natural wonder, we head to Bajawa. You could be found yourself in the Lio ethnic’s environment – pay at call to their village Wologai and try to comprehend the locals daily life or just having closer look into their work of architectures In the vicinity of our hotel in Moni, we will be able to kick around the villages, where we can see how most women make Sarongs with looms, in a totally traditional way. We can also pass by a waterfall in the surroundings of the town. On the way to Bajawa we will stop at the political capital of Flores, a huge bay opens to the Indian Ocean, the city of Ende, where we will have lunch, visit the market, etc. On the outskirts of Ende, we will stop to see a cove, called the blue stones beach (although are the stones really green?) Where we will see dozens of workers, collecting stones and classifying them, to be later exported, due to the Beauty they represent for gardens in Hong Kong and Singapore. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Junggle Villa Manulalu Day 03 : BAJAWA - BENA - GURU SINA - AIMERE - RUTENG Today in the morning we will be able to pay a visit to the Wawo Muda volcano, a one hour walk, in a quite gentle voluntary trekking, where we will see a great volcano, with lakes, that when they have water, they form colors, similar to those of their older brother Kelimutu. We will also enjoy views of impressive volcanoes such as the Inerie and Ebulobo. After seeing the sunrise, we return to the hotel, to have our well-deserved breakfast. And then, we go to Bena, one of the traditional towns, better known in Flores, they belong to the Ngada tribes. Tribes that despite being Christianized, still maintain their animistic beliefs. We will take the opportunity to go further on foot, and reach other villages Ngada as located behind a jungle of bamboo. After having lunch in Bajawa, our new and long drive begins, around another 4-5 hours until we reach Ruteng. But we will stop in a traditional town, called Aimere, where we will see and (those who want to try) how the Palm liquor is distilled, called \"Arak.\" Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Spring Hill or Sinda or Revaya Hotel Day 04 : RUTENG - DENGE - TREK WAEREBO Today begins your journey to Waerebo, to the tribes of the high Manggarai Mountains, but before you start, you will pass by a place, where you will be able to see the only spider web rice fields in the world. Then 5 - 6 hours by car, bordering the south coast of flowers, overlooking the Sea of Savu, to arrive at the time to go inland, to reach a town called Dintor, here you can having lunch at local restaurant. Moving forward to get wae lomba the starting point of trekking to Waerebo -+ 2.30 hours the oldest traditional village of Manggarainesse. The rain forest along the trek to Waerebo is one of the Wealthiest areas in Indonesia in biological terms. The forest is simply like a huge Garden of Eden. Then walk through the forest with deferent vegetation is of great interest, from the families of orchids, palms, ferns, etc. Natural voice of various type singing birds will entertain you along the trip. The clear and fresh water river on the way up to the village is a good point to take rest. In the village of Waerebo, visitor can see conical houses, which one of it is a ‘drum house’ with very unique architectures, place for holding meetings, rituals and Sunday morning prayers. The drum house is a communal building for a clan or clan branch, symbolizing the ideal unity of patrilineal descent. The place has been developed as tourism site; sleeping on the traditional house and having local cuisine together with local community is very wonderful and unforgettable moment for the visitor. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Waerebo Guest house (with mattresses on the floor). DAY 05 : WAEREBO - DENGE - DINTOR - LABUAN BAJO After breakfast trekking down to Waelomba then continue Labuan Bajo- the Western tip of Flores island. On the way stops will be made at REPI Beach for quick swimming, relaxing or beach walking, lunch boxes are provided. Driving along the south coast is very fantastic with breathtaking panoramic of sea and hill view. Stop at Lembor area for afternoon coffee break and to have closer look of huge area Rice field in Flores island. Then direct driving to Labuan Bajo, On arrival direct check into your hotel. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Puri Sari or La Cecile or Golo Hilltop DAY 06: LABUAN BAJO - OUT After breakfast transfer to the airport or to the next destination.',NULL,'Pickup point on 14 Oct : Hotel Puri Sari Labuan Bajo Pickup time : Between 07.30 - 07.45 AM Schedule flight in Ende Airport on 19 Oct : ETD at 11.55 by Wings Air IW1953 on 19 OCT 2024 14 - 19 Oct : 6D5N Labuan Bajo - Waerebo - Flores Tour / Double room - 14 Oct: LABUAN BAJO – DENGE – TREKK WAEREBO ==>Waerebo Guest House – Standard (with mattresses on the floor) - 15 Oct : WAEREBO TREK DOWNHILL – RUTENG (include Visit Gua Liang Bua/Homo Florensiensis)==> Spring Hill Hotel – Grand Deluxe room - 16 Oct : RUTENG - AIMERE - BAJAWA ==> Manulalu B&B – Jungle Villa room - 17 Oct : BAJAWA – ENDE – MONI ==> Kelimutu Paradiso Hotel – Deluxe room - 18 Oct : MONI – VOLCANO KELIMUTU – ENDE ==> Grand Wisata Hotel – Suite room - 19 Oct : ENDE – END OF TRIP','{\"date\": \"2024-10-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5271587,'864','Ms. Emoke VIZHANYO',30680,200912,'Superior Ro