,'Rendy','Rendy',2,'Person (1)',5286400.00,'Morning shift: - Meeting time 7:15 AM at the dive center, walking by your own to the dive center (12 – 15 minutes) at DPM Diving Gili Trawangan ( Jl. Ikan Nautilus, Gili Trawangan ) - Boat departure time for 2 morning dives at 7:50 AM - Back at the dive center ~ 11:30 AM Afternoon shift: - Meeting time 12:30 PM at the dive center. - Boat departure time for 2 afternoon dives at 1 PM - Back at the dive center ~ 4:30 PM Here are the most popular dive sites and their respective highlights: - Shark Point: Shipwreck & white and black tip sharks. - Turtle Heaven: Nice coral and turtles. - Halik: Coral reef & reef sharks. - Bounty: Underwater platform, nice corals & turtles. - Turbo: beautiful coral, reef sharks & rays.',NULL,'IMPORTANT: - Please check in with the dive center one day before your diving to consult the time - Please find your way to the dive center located in Gili Trawangan: DPM Diving Gili Trawangan (on Google Maps) Jl. Ikan Nautilus, Gili Trawangan Note: National Marine Park Fee: For all diving activities in Gili Trawangan there’s a 100,000 IDR fee that needs to be paid (by Cash only) for the use of the National Marine Park. This fee is to support conservation efforts put in place by the government. This must be paid only once and you can dive unlimited times.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5282473,'881','Carole SUGNAUX',31638,208167,'Fun Dives - 2 Dives','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-12','2024-11-12','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Per Person (Min. 2 Person)',3696000.00,'Times may vary depending on the tides, the sites we will dive or your constraints. If you have a boat to take to reach Bali or the Gili Islands we can for example keep your luggage at the dive center toko. And bring you back on time to Toyapakeh port to catch your boat.',NULL,'Please check in to the dive center one day before diving.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-12\", \"text\": \"Please be ready in hotel lobby at the mentioned time.\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": \"La Roja Bungalows Nusa Penida\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"La Roja Bungalows Nusa Penida\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5282489,'881','Carole SUGNAUX',33390,220032,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-11-03','2024-11-05','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Twin',1800000.00,NULL,NULL,'Check-in time 14.00 Check-out time 12.00 Early check-in is subject to availability and may be charged additional cost.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5282555,'882','ANTONIO DIAZ',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-17','2024-11-18','Jacob','Komang',2,'Single + Double',1646400.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK-IN. FM7 Hotel Airport Pickup Service: +62811-8815-053 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-11-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5282718,'882','ANTONIO DIAZ',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-11-18','2024-11-20','Jacob','Komang',3,'Persons (3)',12432000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan isCape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continueto add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5283728,'882','ANTONIO DIAZ',30783,216543,'4D3N Jogja-Bromo-Surabaya Incl. Train / B. Gallery Prawirotaman (Superior Room) & Bromo Terrace (De','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-11-20','2024-11-23','Jacob','Komang',2,'Persons (2-3 / Double)',16968000.00,'D1 : Arrival Yogyakarta International Airport – Visit Prambanan Temple – Transfer to hotel D2 : Borobudur temple incl. Mendut and Pawon ,Yogyakarta City Tour Visit Sultan Palace, Watercastle and Bird/Traditional Market D3 : Jogja – Mojokerto by Train then continue drive to Bromo – overnight in Bromo D4 : Sunrise and Mt. Bromo crater tour incl. Jeep ( Horse rise Exclude ) – Transfer to Surabaya airport',NULL,'Flight in Semarang ETA : 11.35 by Batik Air ID6303 from Pangakalan Bun on 20 November 2024 Flight in Surabaya ETD : 15.35 by Lion AIr JT920 to Denpasar on 23 November 2024 Program : 20 Nov/D1 : Arrival in Semarang - Borobudur transfer Yogyakarta 21 Nov/D2 : Yogyakarta City Tour - Prambanan Temple 22 Nov/D3 : Yogyakarta - Bromo by Train 23 Nov/D4 : Sunrise Bromo - Transfer to Surabaya Airport 2 unit room in Yogyakarta & Bromo (2 Double or 1 double + 1 Single room) in Yogyakarta Based on Gallery Prawirotaman - Superior room in Bromo based on Bromo Terrace - Deluxe room','{\"date\": \"2024-11-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5283784,'882','ANTONIO DIAZ',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-23','2024-11-23','Jacob','Komang',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting at the arrival hall exit, holding a signboard of your name/group name. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 3 hours after the flight’s estimated arrival time (ETA). - For any flight delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-11-23\", \"text\": \"ETA : 17.35 by Lion Air JT920 from Surabaya on 23 Nov 2024\", \"time\": \"17:35\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-23\", \"text\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort, Jl. Suweta, Bentuyung Sakti, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 2091788\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Visesa Resort, Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5283798,'882','ANTONIO DIAZ',30985,212179,'Jungle Suite Room with Private Balcony','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-11-23','2024-11-26','Jacob','Komang',2,'Double',12297600.00,'Escape the hustle and bustle of everyday life and immerse yourself in the beauty of nature with our Jungle Suite with Private Balcony. Located in the heart of the lush tropical rainforest, this Suite offers a unique opportunity to immerse yourself in nature while still enjoying all the comforts of modern living. The real highlight of this room category is the private balcony overlooking the jungle canopy. Relax in your own personal paradise as you listen to the sounds of nature, watch the birds playing in the trees, and breathe in the fresh air while taking in the breathtaking views.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-11-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5283807,'882','ANTONIO DIAZ',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route (Taman Ayun-Jati Luwih-Bedugul-Tanah Lot)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-24','2024-11-24','Jacob','Komang',3,'Persons (3)',2016000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-24\", \"text\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort, Jl. Suweta, Bentuyung Sakti, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 2091788\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-24\", \"text\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort, Jl. Suweta, Bentuyung Sakti, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 2091788\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5283810,'882','ANTONIO DIAZ',30508,202893,'Lempuyang Temple Tour (Lempuyang-Tirta Gangga-Virgin Beach - Tenganan)','Confirmed','C2I-BALI11',1,'2024-11-25','2024-11-25','Jacob','Komang',3,'Persons (3)',2083200.00,'At the agreed time, our guide will pick you up to start the tour in the eastern part of Bali. The first place you will visit is Goa Lawah Temple. Goa Lawah Temple consists of two names, \"Goa\" which means cave and \"Lawah\" which means bat. Several thousand bats are flying in the cave as the name suggests. With the lights fading as you go deeper inside the cave, it gives off a very strange atmosphere. From Goa Lawah, we continue our way to Lempuyang Temple. Upon arrival, the temple will greet you with its gratifying panorama that extends into infinity. On a clear, sunny day, you\'ll be able to gaze out over the mountains, Amlapura city, and Mount Agung, an incredibly magnificent sight that\'s beautiful beyond words. This portrait of heaven is beautifully framed by the Gapura Candi Bentar (the gate of the temple). Our journey continues to visit Tirta Gangga. The site is a paradise surrounded by water, with all the pools decorated with unusual statues. With its seclusion and a view of the surrounding rice paddies, Tirta Gangga is a wonderful place. At the end of the trip we go to Tenganan Village, the most famous Bali Agas (the “original” Bali people) in the city. With its characteristics, the city village is arranged in parallel along the wide main road paved with rows of cobblestones. In Tenganan, women still weave the famous Kamben Geringsing, or \"burnt cloth,\" which has the power to immunize the wearer against evil. We take a close look at what they do in their daily lives in a traditional lifestyle. From Tenganan, we will transfer you to the hotel.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-25\", \"text\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort, Jl. Suweta, Bentuyung Sakti, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 2091788\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Visesa Resort Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-25\", \"text\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort, Jl. Suweta, Bentuyung Sakti, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 2091788\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5283812,'882','ANTONIO DIAZ',30508,207379,'Ubud to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-26','2024-11-26','Jacob','Komang',1,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-26\", \"text\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort, Jl. Suweta, Bentuyung Sakti, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 2091788\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-26\", \"text\": \"ETD : 08.30 by Gili Gili Fastboat from Padang Bay to Gili Trawangan\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bay Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5283814,'882','ANTONIO DIAZ',30659,203068,'Deluxe Ombak Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-11-26','2024-11-28','Jacob','Komang',2,'Double',7168000.00,'At 63 m2 room size, \"Convertible, Spacious and Tropical\" the convertible Deluxe Ombak Rooms are perfect for those travelling in groups or families. Each room is equipped with a double bed or twin bed arrangement, an indoor day bed that is easily converted into an extra bed and comes with interconnecting options. The open-air bathroom maintains the unique island feel.',NULL,'The original voucher issued by travel agent must back up guest check in. The voucher should clearly specify all instructions and required services.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5283875,'882','ANTONIO DIAZ',30661,203865,'Deluxe Pool Suite','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-11-28','2024-11-30','Jacob','Komang',2,'Double',7470400.00,'Would you love a quiet and peaceful spot to come home to after a day of exploring the surroundings? Then booking one of our pool side suites is the perfect choice for you. Each of these rooms can be made up as a double, twin or triple room so it can host up to three people to indulge in blissful serenity. You’ll be right by the swimming pool for a refreshing dip or to simply relax overlooking the beautiful gardens. The koi fish and guinea fowl will make sure to entertain you while you sit back and our restaurant staff is only a phone call away for room service if you are craving for something delicious to complete your day in paradise. Your Jivana experience will surely make you look back on your holiday with a smile on your face.',NULL,'The original voucher issued by travel agent must back up guest check in. The voucher should clearly specify all instructions and required services.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5283921,'882','ANTONIO DIAZ',30806,213012,'3D2N Borneo Orangutan Tour / Super Deluxe II, III, IV, V','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-11-18','2024-11-20','Jacob','Komang',3,'Persons (3-4)',28479060.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN – KUMAI PORT – TANJUNG HARAPAN – PROBOSCIS TOUR Upon your arrival at Pangkalan Bun Airport, meet and greet with our staff and guide, then direct transfer to Kumai. It will take about 15–20 minutes by car. Upon your arrival in Kumai, you will be transferred directly to the houseboat. Lunch will be provided on board. Afterward, boating down the Kumai River. It takes approximately 15 minutes to reach the Seikonyer River, the main river in Tanjung Puting National Park. As you cruise up the Seikonyer River, you will see nice vegetation around the river bank: Nipa palm, Pandanus, and some kinds of trees that are growing up around the river. See some wildlife, such as birds, macaques, Proboscis monkeys, and orangutans. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. Then at 16.00, return back to the boat and continue boating up to observe and learn more about Proboscis monkeys along the river banks. Proboscis monkeys are an endemic animal that can be seen only in Borneo. Dinner and overnight on the Super Deluxe Houseboat Meals : Lunch – Dinner Accommodation : Super Deluxe Houseboat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY – CAMP LEAKEY After breakfast, you boat up to Pondok Tanggui, the second rehabilitation center for orangutans. Visit the orangutan feeding at 09.00 AM. Enjoy your time while taking some pictures. Then, at 10 a.m., return back to the houseboat and continue boating up to Camp Leakey. Camp Leakey is the highlight of the National Park. You will be passing by the Black River, which is full of wildlife, such as many kinds of birds, primates, fish, and crocodiles. Lunch will be served by our own cook with a variety of special food. On arrival in Camp Leakey, you will visit small museum to see all the work of Dr. Birute Galdikas, who studied the orangutan here from 1971 until today. Enjoy your time until 14.00, when you trek up into the forest to see orangutans feeding. Enjoy the time until 16.00, when you return to the boat and boat down directly to the Nipa Palm area to see thousands of fireflies. Dinner and overnight in the houseboat. Note : The Birute Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. Meals : Breakfast – Lunch – Dinner Accommodation : Super Deluxe Houseboat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT – PANGKALAN BUN After breakfast on board, you will boat down directly to Kumai and then have a direct transfer to Pangkalan Bun airport for your next destination. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5284085,'866','Ms. Noraliah Abdul Samad & Family',30723,213467,'Deluxe Premium Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-11','2024-12-12','Ayu','Eddy',5,'Double',4470000.00,'Deluxe Premium Type rooms are available with Queen Beds 180 x 200, and have a room area size of 23 m2. This room is equipped with, Individually controlled air-conditioning, IDD telephone, 32 inch LCD TV with international channels, high speed internet access, 14 inch laptop size in-room safe, coffee and tea making facilities, and bathroom with shower.',NULL,'TOTAL PAX : 9 ADLT + 3CHD (7,8,9 YO) + 1INF (Below 2 YO) - Shall your company has Credit Facility with the hotel, Hotel will only confirm the reservations upon received your Copy of Room Voucher or Guarantee Letter prior to the guest arrival. - Should the Hotel has not received the Copy of Room Voucher or Guarantee Letter upon the Guest check-in; the Hotel shall apply Walk-in Rates to the guest (s) and should be settled by the guest upon check-out.','{\"date\": \"2024-12-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5284106,'883','Mr. Louise FERCHAUT',32338,215100,'Ubud to Tegalalang (Shared)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-18','2024-10-18','Ayu','Wiwik',2,'Person (1)',1236480.00,'For the Ubud to Tegalalang trip, we currently do two tours per day. The morning tour starts at 9 am and the afternoon tour starts at 3 pm. If your guests are requesting a different time please contact us and we will do our best to accommodate them. The tours last about 2.5 hours.','This trip is shared with other guests.',NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:20\", \"locality\": \"Kampoeng Joglo Abangan Ubud\", \"location\": \"Jl. Raya Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Kampoeng Joglo Abangan Ubud\", \"location\": \"Jl. Raya Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5284110,'883','Mr. Louise FERCHAUT',30508,202890,'Mount Batur Sunrise Trekking Tour','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-20','2024-10-20','Ayu','Wiwik',2,'Persons (2)',1120000.00,'Enjoy trek or climb Mount Batur and see the sunrise from the top of Batur Volcano. The Batur Volcano is one of the sacred mountain according to Hindu believe. We will get in ahead of schedule morning around 02.00 am depend the area of you stay, and afterward we specifically going to Mount Batur starting point. Starting in the dark under starlight sky, you will be guided to ascend the slope of Mount Batur. You will approach the peak of Mount Batur (1717 meters) at about 06.00 am. While waiting for the sunrise you will have a simple breakfast and hot coffee or tea served by your guide in Mount Batur. Witness the breathtaking sunrise overlooking the majestic view of Lake Batur and Mount Rinjani. After witnessing the sunrise, continue for our descent, at about 9 am, you will be arriving at the finishing point.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5284122,'883','Mr. Louise FERCHAUT',30508,207382,'Sanur to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-27','2024-10-27','Ayu','Wiwik',2,'Persons (1-3)',1120000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"06:30\", \"locality\": \"JL Hang Tuah No 58. Sanur - villa A (next to Pia Bintang)\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Office Ekajaya Fast Boat to Gili Meno (ETD: 09.00AM)\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5284123,'883','Mr. Louise FERCHAUT',30508,207387,'Padang Bai to Sanur','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-30','2024-10-30','Ayu','Wiwik',2,'Persons (1-3)',1120000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"15:30\", \"locality\": \"Office Ekajaya Fast Boat from Gili Meno\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"JL Hang Tuah No 58. Sanur - villa A (next to Pia Bintang)\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5284203,'883','Mr. Louise FERCHAUT',30508,207278,'PRIVATE CAR & DRIVER (BATUR TREKKING)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-20','2024-10-20','Ayu','W