taking scenery, a spacious design for rejuvenation, and customizable bedding options. Add an extra bed for families or groups. The private bathroom features a standing shower and standard amenities. In-room essentials include a safety box, mini refrigerator, and telephone. Whether for business or leisure, the Taksu Suite at Taksu Sanur Hotel ensures a harmonious blend of comfort and sophistication for a memorable stay. Interconnecting rooms with the Junior Suite Pool View Balcony are available upon request and subject to availability.',NULL,'Check-in time 14.00 Check-out time 12.00 Early check-in is subject to availability upon arrival and may be charged additional cost.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5284217,'884','Luann Andrew',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Custom Itinerary)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-25','2024-10-25','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Person (1)',1568000.00,NULL,NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-10-25\", \"text\": \"Please be ready in hotel lobby at the mentioned time.\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"Taksu Hotel Sanur\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Taksu Hotel Sanur\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5284218,'884','Luann Andrew',31695,208635,'Harris Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-11-01','2024-11-03','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Double',1523200.00,'The 25 sqm HARRIS Room has a contemporary design combination of pure white color with orange touch. This sleek and fresh design create a cool, fun and spirited atmosphere. These rooms at our hotel in Kuta Tuban, Bali are designed for business and vacation purposes.','Rates are inclusive of 21% government tax and service charges.','NOTES: - Guests will arrive in the morning of 02 November, and check out in the evening of the same day.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5285573,'871','Miguel Meca',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-11-27','2024-11-29','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',10640000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan isCape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continueto add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5285578,'871','Miguel Meca',31015,203230,'2D1N - Surabaya Mount Bromo Tour drop Surabaya Airport','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-11-29','2024-11-30','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',4480000.00,NULL,NULL,'Flight schedule in Surabaya Airport ETA : 10.10 by Batik Air ID6134 from Pangkalan Bun on 29 Nov 2024 ETD : 15.35 by Lion Air JT920 to Denpasar on 30 Nov 2024 Hotel in Bromo : JIWA JAWA BROMO Jl. Raya Bromo, Wonotoro, Kec. Sukapura, Kabupaten Probolinggo, Jawa Timur 67254 Telepon: 0822-7202-6000','{\"date\": \"2024-11-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5285594,'871','Miguel Meca',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-30','2024-11-30','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (1-3)',336000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting at the arrival hall exit, holding a signboard of your name/group name. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 3 hours after the flight’s estimated arrival time (ETA). - For any flight delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-11-30\", \"text\": \"ETA : 17.35 by Lion Air JT920 from Surabaya on 30 November 2024\", \"time\": \"17:35\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-30\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 6207070\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Tejaprana Bisma Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5285612,'871','Miguel Meca',30623,200583,'Garden Villa','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-11-30','2024-12-03','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',8400000.00,'The Garden Villas provide an ideal sanctuary, featuring a private garden that ensures a peaceful and intimate atmosphere for guests seeking the perfect retreat. These one-bedroom villas are well-equipped with a floor area of 100 m², a king-size bed, air conditioning, sleek appointed bathroom with a rainfall showerhead, beautiful view of the garden, and various amenities for a comfortable stay. Unwind in the serenity of the villa’s private outdoor haven, whether it’s within the comforting embrace of the gazebo, lounging by the refreshing plunge pool, or indulging in pure relaxation while soaking in the outdoor natural stone bathtub.',NULL,'The Guest is Honeymooner','{\"date\": \"2024-11-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5285613,'885','Ms. Katherine Susan Withers',31083,213580,'2D1N Kelimutu Crater Lakes Flores Culture Tour','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-11-04','2024-11-05','Yudha','Praba',3,'Persons (2-3 / Double)',11070000.00,'DAY 1 : DENPASAR - MAUMERE / ENDE - MONI Upon arrival in Ende meet and greet with our Tour Guide and driving directly to Moni. Visit Detusoko area to see the amazing terrace rice field where it’s setting on the slope. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Kelimutu Ecolodge DAY 02 : MONI - KELIMUTU LAKES - ENDE - DENPASAR It’s worth to experience the sun rise at Kelimutu three colored crater lakes, you will begin your day early in the morning ( start abt 04.00 o’clock). Last update: 15 Jul 2013, Typical eruption style: Explosive, Kelimutu volcano eruptions: 1968, 1938, 1865. Kelimutu (Keli Mutu) volcano incentral Flores, Indonesia, is famous for its 3 colorful acid crater lakes, where different salts andoxides in suspension or solution give the lakes varying colors ranging from blue and dark green to intense red. In historic times, few small phreatic explosions have been the only activity at the volcano.The scenic craters with their lakes are popular tourist destinations. Background: The western lake, Tiwu Ata Mbupu (Lake of Old People) is commonly blue. Tiwu Nua Muri Kooh Tai (Lake of Young Men and Maidens) and Tiwu Ata Polo (Bewitched, or Enchanted Lake), which share a common crater wall, are commonly green-and red-coloured, respectively, although lake colours vary periodically. During the dry season reduction processes let Ba, Cu, and Asminerals precipitate, in the wet season, the oxidation and precipitation of iron minerals (ferricoxide: Fe2O3) produces intense red colors. Active upwelling occurs at the two eastern lake sand is probably fed by subaqueous fumaroles. Kelimutu volcano is flanked by the older conesof Kelido and Kelibara 3 km to the north and 2 km to the south, respectively (Source: GVP). On the way you will experience the dramatic change in both nature pattern and ethnicity. You could be found yourself in the Lio ethnic’s environment–pay at call to their villages Wologai and try to comprehend the local’s daily life or just having closer look into their work of architectures. Continue drive to Ende or Maumere and transferring to the Airport to have flight to Denpasar. Tour Ends. Meals : Breakfast',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-11-04\", \"text\": \"ETA 14:25 by Wings Air IW1830 from Labuan Bajo\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Bandara H. Hasan Aroeboesman Ende\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-05\", \"text\": \"ETD 11:55 by Wings Air IW1953 to Labuan Bajo\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Bandara H. Hasan Aroeboesman Ende\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5285617,'871','Miguel Meca',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (TEGALALANG (CAFÉ LUWAK) – TIRTA EMPUL – KINTAMANI – BESAKIH)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-01','2024-12-01','Guio','Komang',2,'Person (1)',2352000.00,NULL,NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-12-01\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 6207070\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Tejaprana Bisma Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-01\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 6207070\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Tejaprana Bisma Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5285634,'871','Miguel Meca',30508,207262,'Ubud to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-03','2024-12-03','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver will wait up to 30 minutes after your scheduled pickup time. - Please keep in mind that any further delay could affect your timely arrival at the airport for your flight. - For any changes in flight departure time, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available). - Requests for pickup time earlier than originally booked are subject to availability.','{\"date\": \"2024-12-03\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 6207070\", \"time\": \"05:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Tejaprana Bisma Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-03\", \"text\": \"ETD : 09.10 by Wings Air IW1832 to Tambolaka on 03 December 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5285667,'886','Mr. David Wayne Beaven',31083,213580,'2D1N Kelimutu Crater Lakes Flores Culture Tour','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-10-28','2024-10-29','Yudha','Praba',1,'Person (1)',7200000.00,'DAY 1 : DENPASAR - MAUMERE / ENDE - MONI Upon arrival in Ende meet and greet with our Tour Guide and driving directly to Moni. Visit Detusoko area to see the amazing terrace rice field where it’s setting on the slope. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Kelimutu Ecolodge DAY 02 : MONI - KELIMUTU LAKES - ENDE - DENPASAR It’s worth to experience the sun rise at Kelimutu three colored crater lakes, you will begin your day early in the morning ( start abt 04.00 o’clock). Last update: 15 Jul 2013, Typical eruption style: Explosive, Kelimutu volcano eruptions: 1968, 1938, 1865. Kelimutu (Keli Mutu) volcano incentral Flores, Indonesia, is famous for its 3 colorful acid crater lakes, where different salts andoxides in suspension or solution give the lakes varying colors ranging from blue and dark green to intense red. In historic times, few small phreatic explosions have been the only activity at the volcano.The scenic craters with their lakes are popular tourist destinations. Background: The western lake, Tiwu Ata Mbupu (Lake of Old People) is commonly blue. Tiwu Nua Muri Kooh Tai (Lake of Young Men and Maidens) and Tiwu Ata Polo (Bewitched, or Enchanted Lake), which share a common crater wall, are commonly green-and red-coloured, respectively, although lake colours vary periodically. During the dry season reduction processes let Ba, Cu, and Asminerals precipitate, in the wet season, the oxidation and precipitation of iron minerals (ferricoxide: Fe2O3) produces intense red colors. Active upwelling occurs at the two eastern lake sand is probably fed by subaqueous fumaroles. Kelimutu volcano is flanked by the older conesof Kelido and Kelibara 3 km to the north and 2 km to the south, respectively (Source: GVP). On the way you will experience the dramatic change in both nature pattern and ethnicity. You could be found yourself in the Lio ethnic’s environment–pay at call to their villages Wologai and try to comprehend the local’s daily life or just having closer look into their work of architectures. Continue drive to Ende or Maumere and transferring to the Airport to have flight to Denpasar. Tour Ends. Meals : Breakfast',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-28\", \"text\": \"ETA 11:35 by Wings Air IW1952 from Labuan Bajo\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Bandara H. Hasan Aroeboesman Ende\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-29\", \"text\": \"Drop Place TBA\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Labuan Bajo\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5285689,'871','Miguel Meca',30528,215500,'4D3N Explore Sumba / The Sanubari Sumba - Garden Studio Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-12-03','2024-12-06','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (1-3)',4100000.00,'DAY 1 : ARRIVAL TMC - BONDO KAPUMBU VILLAGE - SALT FARMERS VISIT - LENDONGARA HILL SUNSET Meet and greet with our guide at the Tambolaka airport in south-west Sumba.After that, we go to a local restaurant for lunch. Then we will start our journey by visiting Bondo Kapumbu Village, a hidden traditional village in south-west Sumba. Continuing to Ketewel Beach, you can visit the salt farmers, where you can see how they make the salt in a traditional way. Then we head to Lendongara to watch the sunset over the hills and the Sumba landscape. Then we go to your hotel to check in and rest. Meals : Lunch Accomodation : A. Mario Hotel (Deluxe Jineng Room) DAY 2 : SUMBA CASHEW FARM & PRODUCTION - WAIKACURA RICE FIELD - WATUBELA BEACH After breakfast, we will go to Talasi to see the cashew farm and production. Here you will get a chance to try their original cashew milk. After that, we go to the Waikacura area, where you can go trekking to the rice fields. Get a chance to see the local farmers do their activities, and at the end of the trek you will see the stunning river in the middle of the rice field. Next, after trekking, we go to West Sumba and have lunch at a local restaurant. After lunch, we go to visit the beautiful hidden beach of Watubela. On the way, you will pass a small village and palm garden to get to the beach. Relax on the beach, and we\'ll go to your hotel after that. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch Accomodation : A. Rua Beach Hotel (Deluxe Room) DAY 3 : SUMBANESE COOKING & ACTIVITIES EXPERIENCE - LAPOPU WATERFALL Breakfast at the hotel, then we go to the traditional village in West Sumba, where you will be warmly welcomed by the locals. Talking with them and listening to the story of the village and the island. After engaging with them, they will invite you to join them in cooking Sumba\'s traditional foods. Once the foods are ready, have lunch together. Have coffee or tea after lunch, sit with them for a while, then say goodbye. Our trip is continuing to Lapopu Waterfall. After a drive through the endless hilly and green landscape of Sumba, you will arrive near the waterfall. To visit the waterfall, you will need to do a short hike of approximately 15 minutes and cross a bamboo bridge to get there. There is a nice spot to sit down where you can watch the water find its way down the hill. After the visits, go back to the hotel to rest. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch Accomodation : A. Rua Beach Hotel (Deluxe Room) DAY 4 : PRAIJING VILLAGE - OUT TMC AIRPORT After breakfast and checking out of the hotel, we will go to visit the village of Praijing, a traditional village uphill surrounded by lots of greenery. This is one of the few villages where we can actually have a beautiful overview of the entire village and get an idea of how the village is conducted. Take some time to walk around the village, the elders occupy most of the houses, and kids are always around to share their smiles. And then go to the airport to catch a flight to your next destination. Meals : Breakfast Accomodation : -',NULL,'The Guest is Hoeymooner Pickup / Dropoff : The Sanubari Sumba pantai Dasang, Harona Kala, Laboya Barat, West Sumba Regency, East Nusa Tenggara Telepon: 0821-4639-4499','{\"date\": \"2024-12-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5285706,'871','Miguel Meca',30508,214239,'Airport to Uluwatu','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-06','2024-12-06','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting at the arrival hall exit, holding a signboard of your name/group name. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 3 hours after the flight’s estimated arrival time (ETA). - For any flight delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-12-06\", \"text\": \"ETA : 13.00 by Wings Air IW1833 from Tambolaka on 06 Dec\", \"time\": \"13:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-06\", \"text\": \"Jl. Pantai Balangan No.54, Jimbaran, Kec. Kuta Sel., Balangan, Bali 80361 Telepon: 0877-8702-7629\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"La Cabane Bali, Uluwatu\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5285711,'871','Miguel Meca',30508,216161,'Uluwatu to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-07','2024-12-07','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver will wait up to 30 minutes after your scheduled pickup time. - Please keep in mind that any further delay could affect your timely arrival at the airport for your flight. - For any changes in flight departure time, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available). - Requests for pickup time earlier than originally booked are subject to availability.','{\"date\": \"2024-12-07\", \"text\": \"Jl. Pantai Balangan No.54, Jimbaran, Kec. Kuta Sel., Balangan, Bali 80361 Telepon: 0877-8702-7629\", \"time\": \"14:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"La Cabane Bali, Uluwatu\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-07\", \"text\": \"ETD : 18.55 by Qatar QR963 to Doha on 07 December 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"International Ngurah Rai Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5285724,'871','Miguel Meca',33169,218992,'Bungalow Lua','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-06','2024-12-07','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',3304000.00,NULL,NULL,'The Guest is Honeymooner','{\"date\": \"2024-12-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5285731,'887','CARLOS MORENO',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-14','2024-11-15','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',823200.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK-IN. FM7 Hotel Airport Pickup Service: +62811-8815-053 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-11-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5285742,'887','CARLOS MORENO',30783,201486,'3D2N Best of Yogyakarta City Tour / A. Melia Purosani (Deluxe Room)','Confirmed','JS-Java01',3,'2024-11-15','2024-11-17','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2 / Double)',8848000.00,'Day 1 : Arrival at Yogyakarta Welcome to the cradle of Indonesian culture, Yogyakarta. A tourist destination for its ancient palaces, temples, batik workshops, gamelan music orchestras, court dances and wayang puppet shows. Upon your arrival in Yogyakarta a representative of Come2Indonesia will be waiting for you with a sign indicating your name to take you to your hotel and the rest of the day is free for you. Meals : - Accommodation : A. The Phoenix - Deluxe Legacy Room Day 2 : Yogyakarta City Tour - Prambanan and Borobodur You will start your day with breakfast at the hotel. Today’s excursion will make us get lost in the authentic magic of Yogyakarta. One of the most beautiful and complete routes of the cultural capital of Indonesia. At the scheduled time, your guide will pick you up to begin your tour to Borobudur Temple (Candi Borobudur), the great Stupa, the largest Buddhist monument in the world and one of the seven wonders. We will tour around the temple, observe the hundreds and centenary statues of Buddha and witness how dozens of Buddhists come to preach from all over the world. Historically it was established during the relatively brief Sailendra dynasty of Central Java between 778 and 856 BC and is in constant restoration due to the breaks that the tremors of the neighbouring Merapi volcano have been producing during its history. After visiting one of the most important Buddhist temples in Southeast Asia, we continue our journey to the heart of the city. We will visit the Keraton, known as the Sultan’s Palace. The palace is a complex building two centuries old, located in the heart of the city. You will hear the song of “freedom” in the bird market. We will visit the “Water Castle” that occupies the highest part at the northern end of the vast complex of Taman Sari. Then we continue to Malioboro Street, main street of Yogyakarta, with its merchants, horse carriages, taxi-bikes and markets. An incredible experience that will make hours fly by. Finishing the tour in the centre of the city of Yogyakarta, we will head northeast towards Candi Prambanan, the temple of Hinduists which have been classified as a World Heritage Site by UNESCO since 1991. It was finished around the year 856 to commemorate the victory of the descendant Sanjaya of Siva, Rikai Pikatan on the last sovereign Sailendra of Central Java. Take your time to enjoy each carving on the rocks and feel the spirituality that each of the stones perched in this set of more than 200 Hindu temples that are dedicated to the Trimurti, the expression of God as the Creator, the Preserver and the Destroyer. After this unforgettable day, we will take you back to your hotel. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : A. The Phoenix - Deluxe Legacy Room Day 3 : Hotel - Airport You will enjoy a well-deserved breakfast at the hotel and according to the time of your flight, we will pick you up to take you to the airport and take the flight to your next destination. End of our services. Thank you very much for exploring Yogyakarta with Come2indonesia. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Flight schedule : ETA : 11.05 by Batik Air ID6378 from Jakarta on 15 November 2024 ETD : 08.30 by Lion Air JT560 to Denpasar on 17 November 2024 Program 3D2N Yogyakarta Tour D1/15 Nov : Arrival Yogyakarta - City Tour - Prambanan Temple D2/16 Nov : Borobudur Temple - Candirejo Village D3/17 Nov : Out of hotel - YIA Hotel Based in Melia Purosani - Double Deluxe room Noted : The Guest is Honeymooner','{\"date\": \"2024-11-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5285764,'887','CARLOS MORENO',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-17','2024-11-17','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting at the arrival hall exit, holding a signboard of your name/group name. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 3 hours after the flight’s estimated arrival time (ETA). - For any flight delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-11-17\", \"text\": \"ETA : 11.15 by Lion Air JT560 from Yogyakarta on 17 November 2024\", \"time\": \"11:15\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ngurah Rai Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-17\", \"text\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort, Jl. Suweta, Bentuyung Sakti, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 2091788\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Visesa Resort Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5285772,'887','CARLOS MORENO',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route (Taman Ayun-Jati Luwih-Bedugul-Tanah Lot)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-18','2024-11-18','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',1747200.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-18\", \"text\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort, Jl. Suweta, Bentuyung Sakti, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 2091788\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-18\", \"text\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort, Jl. Suweta, Bentuyung Sakti, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 2091788\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5285780,'887','CARLOS MORENO',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Goa Gajah-Gunung Kawi-Tirta Empul-Tegalalang)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-19','2024-11-19','Guio','Komang',2,'Persons (2)',1747200.00,NULL,NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-19\", \"text\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort, Jl. Suweta, Bentuyung Sakti, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 2091788\", \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-19\", \"text\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort, Jl. Suweta, Bentuyung Sakti, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 2091788\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5285782,'887','CARLOS MORENO',30508,207379,'Ubud to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-20','2024-11-20','Guio','Komang',1,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-20\", \"text\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort, Jl. Suweta, Bentuyung Sakti, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Telepon: (0361) 2091788\", \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Visesa Ubud Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-20\", \"text\": \"ETD : 08.30 by Gili Gili Fastboat to Gili Air\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Padang Bay Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5285800,'887','CARLOS MORENO',30852,202033,'Villa Surya - One Bedroom Private Pool and Tropical Garden','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-20','2024-11-21','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',3472000.00,'Our cozy one bed Villa Surya is perfect for a solo traveler or a romantic getaway at 150 sqm private property. The spacious bedroom features a king-size bed with an extra thick mattress with 100% cotton linen, ensuring a blissful sleep. With high-ceilings, large windows, and a pivoting door onto your patio, the space is able to breathe whilst being basked in a beautiful, natural light. The ensuite bathroom, equipped with a bespoke basin area, rainfall shower, quality toiletries and 100% cotton towels leads out to the real star of this villa, the indulgent open-air bathtub. Large enough for two, with views of your private pool and tropical garden, while away hours in pure relaxation.',NULL,'The guest is HONEYMOONER','{\"date\": \"2024-11-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5286156,'775','Dmitry Komissarchik',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route (TAMAN AYUN-JATILUWIH-ULUNDANU BERATAN-TANAH LOT)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-26','2024-12-26','Nicholas','Wiwik',4,'Persons (4)',2832000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-12-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": \"Komaneka at Bisma\", \"location\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar. Phone: (0361) 971933\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Komaneka at Bisma\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5286160,'775','Dmitry Komissarchik',30508,202894,'Kehen Temple - Pengelipuran - Kintamani','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-27','2024-12-27','Nicholas','Wiwik',4,'Persons (4)',2448000.00,'Our wonderful tour starts from Kehen Temple. It is an ancient Hindu temple complex boasting unique architectural features. The staircases reaching from the ground to temple courtyard are carved sandstone mythical animal and Balinese folklore figure statues and also the central vestibule. The temple’s walls are also ornate with Chinese porcelain plates, which are a tribute to the historical relations between the local Bali kingdom and China. Afterwards, we continue to Penglipuran, a village that succeeded in preserving its 75-hectare bamboo forest located in the northern part of the village. Members of this village have a strong commitment to the system of \'Ayahan Desa\' - a philosophy committed to respecting the land on which the village stands. To concludes the day, we stop by at Tukad Cepung Waterfall. Well-guarded by the circular cliffs, this waterfall is difficult to locate for the first time visitor. The circular cliffs give you the feeling of being in a cave, while the open sky right from where the waterfall emerges, gives you the most enchanting view. The sunlight falls on the glistering waterfall creating a rainbow, which feels as though it is projected right up to you. If you have never seen water flowing from the sky, then this would be your chance! After spending your time there, we go back to your hotel.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-12-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": \"Komaneka at Bisma\", \"location\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar. Phone: (0361) 971933\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Komaneka at Bisma\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5286178,'888','Siegfried Schreiber',31158,204275,'VIP Transfer Domestic to International with Fast Track','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-19','2024-10-19','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Person (1)',906080.00,'- Departure Domestic: Service start from meet clients at departure hall until client boarding. - Arrival International: Pick up at before immigration area (near Plaza Bali or Duty Free).',NULL,'Flights information ETA: 16.45 by Lion Air JT21 from Denpasar on 19 Oct ETD: 21.00 by Turkish Airlines TK57 to Istanbul on 19 Oct','{\"date\": \"2024-10-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5286453,'871','Miguel Meca',30805,202689,'CGK-PKN','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-27','2024-11-27','Guio','Komang',2,'Person',3103000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-11-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5286495,'871','Miguel Meca',30805,212272,'PKN-SUB','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-29','2024-11-29','Guio','Komang',2,'Person',3124400.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-11-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5286506,'871','Miguel Meca',30805,202685,'SUB-DPS','Confir