 Room promises quality relaxation for guests looking to experience Ubud. A feature wall in dark timber is enhanced by cleverly concealed mood lighting to bring an element of tranquillity to the space. The modern en-suite bathroom comes with a separate tub and shower recess.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-11-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5291524,'303','WILLIAM EDWIN MCGRADY II',30671,200626,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-11-25','2024-11-27','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Double',2240000.00,'Deluxe Room with a room area of 28 square meters each, there are 2 types of bed, king and twin bed with a size of 28 square meters each.',NULL,'Check-in time 14.00 Check-out time 12.00 Early check-in is subject to availability and may be charged additional cost.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5291526,'899','Denisse Corral Guizar',30596,201103,'Deluxe Room (DBL + Extra Bed)','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-11-15','2024-11-17','Igo','Igo',1,'Double',5992000.00,'Experience timeless elegance in our Deluxe Room. Perfect for couples or solo travelers seeking a spacious single/double bed. Our room offers premium linens, plush pillows, and a peaceful ambiance. Enjoy high-speed internet, a flat-screen TV, coffee and tea-making facilities, and an in-room safe deposit box, ensuring a convenient and enjoyable stay. Unwind on the balcony overlooking the pool, to recharge after a day of activities.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-11-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\":