soma Boutique Beach Resort, Seminyak\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5291598,'899','Denisse Corral Guizar',30508,207270,'Seminyak to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-17','2024-11-17','Igo','Igo',1,'Persons (1-3)',224000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'ETD at 19.50 by EK369 to DXB on 17 NOV 2024','{\"date\": \"2024-11-17\", \"text\": \"Bali Niksoma Boutique Beach Resort\", \"time\": \"16:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-17\", \"text\": \"Denpasar Airport - International Departure\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5291615,'900','Lillie Charlotte SVANEN',30959,213942,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-29','2024-12-30','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Single',1044000.00,'Specially designed for savvy travelers seeking comfort and style at 48 sqm of room size. Available in King and Double bet with the option of an extra bed for an additional fee. The room features a cozy living room with a comfortable sofa, LED wall-mounted TV, complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi, and in-room amenities to ensure a relaxing stay experience.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. Aston Sorong Hotel Airport Pickup Service: +62821 97722224 (WhatsApp available)','{\"date\": \"2024-12-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5291735,'871','Miguel Meca',30684,200640,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-29','2024-11-30','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',1680000.00,'Designed to embody fresher and younger ambience, our Deluxe Room is a convenient stay for those who plan a relatively shorter stay in Semarang. The room is provided with either a king size or deluxe twin beds.',NULL,'Check-in time 14.00 Check-out time 12.00 Early check-in is subject to availability and may be charged additional cost','{\"date\": \"2024-11-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5292626,'897','Ms. Vesta Werner',30682,200893,'Villa\'s Deluxe','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-10-29','2024-10-30','Ayu','Tami',1,'Triple',2418000.00,'Villa Deluxe with 42 sqm room area. 23 rooms available (13 double + 10 twin), single and twin beds available with a capacity of 2 people per room. see the greatest view in Ijen Mountain. See the magic of the blue fire at night. Sophisticated design in Ijen Resort and Villas, in Banyuwangi, East Java. You can see the best view from your room, the rice field, mountains.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-10-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-10-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5292769,'901','Einari Talviste',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-07','2024-11-07','Melysa','Tami',1,'Persons (14)',1200000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting at the arrival hall exit, holding a signboard of your name/group name. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 3 hours after the flight’s estimated arrival time (ETA). - For any flight delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-11-07\", \"text\": \"ETA 19.15 by Turkish Airways TK0066 from Istanbul on 07 Nov\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-07\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5292774,'901','Einari Talviste',30705,201147,'Premier Room Garden View','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-11-07','2024-11-09','Melysa','Tami',7,'Double + Twin',15120000.00,'Get back to nature in one of our Premier Garden View suites. These spacious, light-filled rooms have beautiful Balinese double doors that can be closed to create a cool air-conditioned space or opened to merge indoor and outdoor living. The balconies overlook the resort’s lush gardens, which are awash in tropical flowers and foliage.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-11-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5292784,'901','Einari Talviste',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-08','2024-11-08','Melysa','Tami',14,'Persons (14)',11172000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-11-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5292785,'887','CARLOS MORENO',30985,203053,'One Bedroom Ricefield Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-11-17','2024-11-20','Guio','Komang',1,'Double',11256000.00,'Offering terraced areas equipped with sunbeds and umbrellas with views on the jungle. Guests enjoy a private pool. The villa is fitted with a flat-screen cable TV, an iPod dock, a minibar, a coffee machine and a personal safe. It has a seating area, a dining room and a bathroom with a bath and a shower. Extras include a hairdryer, robes, slippers and free toiletries. Guests enjoy free daily permaculture course of making soil bed, composting and planting. Guests enjoy 30% discount on spa treatments',NULL,'The Guest is Honeymooner','{\"date\": \"2024-11-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5292787,'901','Einari Talviste',30508,202883,'Ubud Electric Bike Tour','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-09','2024-11-09','Melysa','Tami',14,'Persons (14)',14700000.00,'We offer the best way to experience a bike tour Ubud. Electric bike! A mix between riding a motorcycle and a bicycle, the electric bicycle is the best of both worlds. easily while pedaling through the hills, magnificent rice terraces and villages. Our local guides will give you knowledge of Bali more than just landscapes. We will have 2 hours of cycling trip out of the busy center of Ubud through the village of Mambal, where you can see the unique Subak at work and stroll around the rustic and lush surroundings. While you ride your bike you will see beautiful rice fields, dams and waterfalls, we make a stop on the Ayung River, go through the Bali Green School and go through small villages. Our local guides have an intimate knowledge about the entire route. After your bike ride, a healthy lunch is served in a traditional Balinese house.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-09\", \"text\": \"ETD 21.10 by Citilink QG691 to Jakarta on 09 Nov\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5292837,'902','Miriam Crumols Galan',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-11','2024-11-12','Igo','Igo',1,'Double',780000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK-IN. FM7 Hotel Airport Pickup Service: +62811-8815-053 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-11-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5292846,'902','Miriam Crumols Galan',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-11-12','2024-11-14','Igo','Igo',2,'Persons (2)',10800000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan isCape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continueto add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-12\", \"text\": \"ETA 07.30 by Batik Air ID6202 from Jakarta on 12 Nov\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pangkalan Bun Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-14\", \"text\": \"ETD 10.25 by Batik Air ID6303 to Semarang on 14 Nov\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5292861,'902','Miriam Crumols Galan',30783,218071,'5D4N Jogja-Bromo-Ijen-Bali Incl. Train / C. Adhisthana (Superior) & Bromo Terrace (Deluxe) & Ketapan','Confirmed',NULL,5,'2024-11-14','2024-11-18','Igo','Igo',2,'Persons (2 / Double)',20580000.00,'D1 Arrival at Yogyakarta International Airport - Borobudur temple tour Incl.Mendut and Pawon D2 Yogyakarta City tour visit Sultan Palace, Wateracastle and Bird Market, Visit Prambanan temple D3 Jogja - Mojokerto by train - drive to Bromo - overnight in Bromo D4 Mt. Bromo Sunrise tour incl. Jeep - Transfer to Ijen for overnight D5 Mt. Ijen crater tour - transfer to Bali across Ketapang - Gilimanuk harbour - drop at your hotel in Bali',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-11-14\", \"text\": \"ETA 11.35 by Batik Air ID6303 from Pangkalan Bun on 14 Nov\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Semarang International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-18\", \"text\": \"Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5292869,'902','Miriam Crumols Galan',30705,201147,'Premier Room Garden View','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-11-18','2024-11-22','Igo','Igo',1,'Double',5352000.00,'Get back to nature in one of our Premier Garden View suites. These spacious, light-filled rooms have beautiful Balinese double doors that can be closed to create a cool air-conditioned space or opened to merge indoor and outdoor living. The balconies overlook the resort’s lush gardens, which are awash in tropical flowers and foliage.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-11-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5292871,'902','Miriam Crumols Galan',30508,202892,'Fantastic Route','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-19','2024-11-19','Igo','Igo',2,'Persons (2)',1872000.00,'At the appointed time, pick you up at your hotel and begin our tour to enjoy the beauty of Bali. First we’ll go to Taman Ayun Temple, it is a Royal Temple of Mengwi Empire and it is located in Mengwi Village, Mengwi sub district, It is set on the land which is surrounded by the big fish pond and look like a drift on the water. Then we go to Rice Terrace Jatiluwih, the rice terrace forms beautiful sight at all seasons, during the watering, or before planting the rice looks, as far as u go, u can see the beautiful greens of it, then continue to Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, is a Balinese Hindu Temple located at Candi Kuning countryside, Baturiti sub district and Tabanan regency. It is set at lakeside of Beratan with beautiful lake view and hills surround it. It is situated in the plateau area with cool atmosphere surround it and hills as a backdrop. It was the unique Bali temple which are now many tourists paying a visit to this place. And last we go to Tanah Lot Temple, the big Holy Temples in Bali. The temple is built on the rock with 3 acre size and reachable in a few minute by walk, because it is just 20 meters from the coastal lip. This temple is very famous among tourist destinations in Bali with spectacular view of sunset.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-11-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5292874,'902','Miriam Crumols Galan',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Custom Itinerary)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-20','2024-11-20','Igo','Igo',2,'Person (1)',2028000.00,NULL,NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-20\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5292885,'902','Miriam Crumols Galan',30508,207262,'Ubud to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-22','2024-11-22','Igo','Igo',1,'Persons (1-3)',360000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'The driver will be