,1,'2024-11-22','2024-11-22','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-22\", \"text\": \"ETA 15.55 by Bluewater Express from Gili Air on 22 Nov\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Serangan Harbour\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-22\", \"text\": \"Jl. Pantai Balangan, Jimbaran, South Kuta, Badung Regency, Bali 80361\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"La Joya Biu Biu Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5293015,'904','MS. CLAUDIA EDITH CASTILLO LOVERA',30680,200914,'Deluxe Room + Extra Bed','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-06','2024-11-07','Jacob','Praba',1,'Triple',1380000.00,'Enjoy our spacious elegant deluxe room with 40 m2 of room size. Enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, hot and cold shower, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Flight information: ETA 23:45 by United Airlines UA7915 from Tokyo on 6 Nov ETD 06:00 by Batik Air ID6202 to Pangkalan Bun on 7 Nov Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK-IN. FM7 Hotel Airport Pickup Service: +62811-8815-053 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-11-06\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5293017,'903','Marta Canton Rodriguez',31308,205334,'One-Bedroom Villa with Private Pool','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-11-19','2024-11-22','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',9912000.00,'The pool with a view is a top feature of this villa. Boasting a private entrance, this air-conditioned villa comes with 1 living room, 1 separate bedroom and 1 bathroom with a walk-in shower and a hairdryer. Meals can be prepared in the well-fitted kitchen, which features a stovetop, a refrigerator, kitchenware and a tea and coffee maker. The unit has a mini-bar, garden views, a terrace and wine/champagne is available for guests. The unit has 1 bed.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-11-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5293019,'172','Annika Wienecke',30719,214472,'Transport Fee (from Hotel to Airport)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-15','2024-12-15','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Per Car',280000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-12-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5293020,'904','MS. CLAUDIA EDITH CASTILLO LOVERA',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-11-07','2024-11-09','Jacob','Praba',3,'Persons (3)',12600000.00,'Day 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan isCape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continueto add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note : The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat Day 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'Note: IDR 100.000/person/camp for surcharge of Sunday / Collective Leave Day / National or Public Holiday is excluded in the tour and it has to be paid on-board.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-07\", \"text\": \"ETA 07:30 by Batik Air ID6202 from Jakarta\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Bandar Udara Iskandar Pangkalan Bun\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-09\", \"text\": \"ETD 08:10 by Batik Air ID 6203 to Jakarta and connecting flight to Manado ETD 11:50 by ID6272\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Bandar Udara Iskandar Pangkalan Bun\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5293021,'903','Marta Canton Rodriguez',30915,202457,'Gardenside Lodge Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-22','2024-11-23','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',2426032.00,'At 32 m2 room size, the Garden-side Lodge known for its rustic interior has its own outdoor terrace, which extends out to a private garden. Guests choose this room to wind down to the greener pastures and to take a break from the beach or the sunny outdoors. The lodge offers additional lounging space with a two-seat sofa settee on the side of the room. Wood-framed glass patio entrance connects this rustic room to its exclusive outdoor garden.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-11-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5293022,'903','Marta Canton Rodriguez',30508,216161,'Uluwatu to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-23','2024-11-23','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver will wait up to 30 minutes after your scheduled pickup time. - Please keep in mind that any further delay could affect your timely arrival at the airport for your flight. - For any changes in flight departure time, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available). - Requests for pickup time earlier than originally booked are subject to availability.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-23\", \"text\": \"Jl. Pantai Balangan, Jimbaran, South Kuta, Badung Regency, Bali 80361\", \"time\": \"19:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"La Joya Biu Biu Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-23\", \"text\": \"ETD 00.05 by Emirates EK399 to Dubai on 24 Nov\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5293066,'904','MS. CLAUDIA EDITH CASTILLO LOVERA',31591,207373,'3D2N Tangkoko','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-11-09','2024-11-11','Jacob','Praba',3,'Persons (3 / Triple-extra bed)',12420000.00,'Day 1 : MANADO - TANGKOKO - The expedition begins The adventure begins with meeting your guide at the Manado airport. Then you will start the journey of about 2 and a half hours by car to the Tangkoko Forest where you will do the check in at your Homestay or Lodge. Upon arrival, you will have a talk about what you will see and preparations for the trekking. Meals : Dinner Accommodation : Bird House Homestay or Similar Days 02 : Tangkoko Nature Reserve These days will be dedicated to exploring the jungle in search of animals and bird watching. You will start the trekking that will take you to Tangkok National Park. In just 40 minutes by boat, you will reach the Batuangus beach where you will then climb Mount Tangkoko (1500 m). The dense and virgin jungle is home to some unique animal species in North Sulawesi such as the crested black macaque and the tarsier spectrum that has become known as \"the smallest primate in the world\". As you will be trekking through the lush jungle, you will probably see and hear the red gnarled hornbill as well as the Maleo which is a Megapod Bird that lays eggs on large mounds it builds on the black sand. You can also find couscous, which is a relative of the Australian koala. The forest ranger will accompany you all the way to the top of Tangkoko Mountain. In the afternoon you will return to the station. Alternatively, you can have three hours of trekking in the lowland jungle or swimming on the black sand beach of Tangkoko Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Bird House Homestay or Similar Day 03 : Tangkoko - Manado After breakfast, you can spend the morning in the surroundings of the National Park and at the agreed time, with your guide, you will have the transfer to Manado. Thank you for exploring this unique jungle with us. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-11-09\", \"text\": \"ETA 16:10 by Batik Air ID6272 from Jakarta\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Bandar Udara Internasional Sam Ratulangi\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-11\", \"text\": \"ETD 06:00 by Lion Air JT741 to Denpasar\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Bandar Udara Internasional Sam Ratulangi\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5293094,'904','MS. CLAUDIA EDITH CASTILLO LOVERA',30571,202567,'Superior Room + Extra Bed','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-11','2024-11-12','Jacob','Praba',1,'Triple',1170000.00,'Located at the Second Floor, 35 sqm comfort living with a touch of Balinese style featuring completed fitting, Cable TV, a fancy bathroom comprises rain shower and good quality amenities. Also dedicated Wi-Fi Access to complete your day.',NULL,'Flight information: ETA 10:15 by Lion Air JT741 from Manado on 11 Nov Check-in time 14.00 Check-out time 12.00 Early check-in is subject to availability and may be charged additional cost.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5293099,'904','MS. CLAUDIA EDITH CASTILLO LOVERA',30508,212305,'Kuta to Sanur','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-12','2024-11-12','Jacob','Praba',1,'Persons (3)',300000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-12\", \"text\": \"Jl. Kartika Plaza No.127, Kuta Telepon: (0361) 765700\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"The Vira Bali Boutique Hotel Kuta\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-12\", \"text\": \"ETD 10:30 by The Angkal Fastboat to Nusa Penida\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sanur Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5293254,'904','MS. CLAUDIA EDITH CASTILLO LOVERA',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-11-12','2024-11-12','Jacob','Praba',3,'Persons (3)',1080000.00,'Today, embark on a unique adventure as you explore the enchanting Nusa Penida, a neighboring island of Bali. Your day begins with a convenient hotel pick-up, followed by a journey to the Sanur port where a fast boat awaits to transport you to Nusa Penida in just 30 minutes. Nusa Penida, located in the southeast of Bali, is a true paradise waiting to be discovered. Upon your arrival, a friendly driver will be ready to guide you through the day\'s captivating itinerary. Your first destination is the mesmerizing Angel\'s Billabong, a natural wonder resembling a pristine pool nestled in the heart of nature. Take a refreshing swim, but exercise caution on the steps and heed your driver\'s recommendations. Next, we head to Broken Beach, a charming bay that was once a cave, now open to the sky, offering a unique and captivating scenery. Although inaccessible by land, the view from above is nothing short of breathtaking. Keep an eye out for the possibility of spotting giant manta rays gracefully gliding on the water\'s surface. Our journey continues to the renowned Kelingking Beach, famous for its stunning cliffs and the iconic hand-shaped mountain. This beach is not only one of the island\'s most famous attractions but also a favorite subject for photographers. We conclude the day at the pristine Crystal Beach, where white sands meet turquoise waters in perfect harmony. As the sun sets, you\'ll have the opportunity to relax and savor the beauty that surrounds you. This unforgettable experience concludes with a return boat trip to Bali from the Toya Pakeh port at 16:30, followed by a comfortable transfer to your hotel.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-12\", \"text\": \"ETA 11:00 by The Angkal Fastboat from Sanur\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Banjar Nyuh Harbour Nusa Penida\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-12\", \"text\": \"Banjar Anyar, Desa Sakti Dusun Sebunibus, Nusa Penida Telepon: 0851-8699-7788\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Pramana Natura Nusa Penida\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5293286,'904','MS. CLAUDIA EDITH CASTILLO LOVERA',33168,220075,'One Bedroom Villa Ocean View + Extra Bed','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-12','2024-11-13','Jacob','Praba',1,'Double',6300000.00,'Providing ample living space, our Pool Villa is much more than just a room, it’s a stunning space to make your own. Create once in a lifetime memories and soak in the panoramic ocean views from the privacy of your own pool and balcony. The villa also features a king-size bed, a day bed for lounging, hot and cold shower, bathtub, bathrobe, mini bar, electric kettle with coffee/tea, IDD phone, and in-room safety deposit box. Book your stay today for the ultimate luxury experience.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-11-12\", \"tex