 IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 3 hours after the flight’s estimated arrival time (ETA). - For any flight delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-11-03\", \"text\": \"ETA 14.15 by Thai TG431 from Bangkok on 03 Nov 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Alila Seminyak\", \"location\": \"Jl. Taman Ganesha Jl. Petitenget No.9, Seminyak\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5303756,'912','Mr. Wit',30508,207270,'Seminyak to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-07','2024-11-07','Ayu','Ayu',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver will wait up to 30 minutes after your scheduled pickup time. - Please keep in mind that any further delay could affect your timely arrival at the airport for your flight. - For any changes in flight departure time, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available). - Requests for pickup time earlier than originally booked are subject to availability.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"13:00\", \"locality\": \"Alila Seminyak\", \"location\": \"Jl. Taman Ganesha Jl. Petitenget No.9, Seminyak\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-07\", \"text\": \"ETD 16.10 by Thai TG432 to Bangkok on 07 Nov 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5306169,'914','Matthew Zhang',30662,207308,'6D5N Explore The Nature of Leuser National Park Sumatra Elephant & Sumatra Orang Utan','Confirmed','RVL 06D ENLNP SE',6,'2024-11-12','2024-11-17','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Persons (2-3 / Double)',17616000.00,'DAY 01 : ARRIVAL IN MEDAN Upon arrival at Kualanamu International Airport pick up by our tour guide and then Transfer to hotel, afternoon free at own leisure. Meals : - Accommodation : Emerald Garden Hotel or Le Polonia Hotel or Similar Hotel DAY 02 : MEDAN - CITY TOUR - TANGKAHAN After breakfast, pick up by our tour guide and then transfer to town for city tour visiting Sultan Palace, Great Mosque, Chinese Temple and then drive to Tangkahan via Binjai and Batang Serangan. Afternoon arrival at Tangkahan check in at Mega Inn. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : Mega Inn Lodge DAY 03 : TANGKAHAN - ELEPHANT WASHING & RIVER SAFARI After breakfast walking to the elephant station and then join with the Mahout during washing the Elephant, and then feed the elephant, after feeding the Elephant enjoying tubing through the river and stop will be made at Fantastic Buluh Waterfall where you may enjoy the waterfall where you can take nature shower and then you can enjoy sun bathing and swimming on the river and enjoying picnic lunch on the beach of the river. Afternoon arrival at the village you can get in touch with local people, where you can see the daily activities of the local people and then return to guest house by walking, arrival at guest house you can take a rest or visit hot springs and waterfall near the guest house. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch Accommodation : Mega Inn Lodge DAY 04 : TANGKAHAN - BUKIT LAWANG BY CAR After breakfast leave Tangkahan for Bukit Lawang by car passing plantation and jungle road, on the way stop at Plantation and several interesting places (school) for enjoying the panorama and witness the activities of the local people. Upon arrival at Bukit Lawang check in to hotel and afternoon free at own leisure to enjoy the nature of Bukit Lawang. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : Bukit Lawang Cottage or Rindu Alam Hotel DAY 05 : FULL DAY LEUSER NATIONAL PARK TRACKING After breakfast walking to the jungle to start a jungle tracking to explore the nature of Leuser National Park with their flora and fauna, the possibility to see Orang Utan on their own habitat and other kind of animal such as Thomas leaf monkeys, long tail macaque, gibbon, black gibbon and other kind of flora and fauna of tropical rain forest. This full day tracking will finish in the afternoon. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch Accommodation : Bukit Lawang Cottage or Rindu Alam Hotel DAY 06 : BUKIT LAWANG - MEDAN / AIRPORT After breakfast drive Medan via Binjai, on the way visiting traditional market at Kuala, arrival in Medan directly transfer to Kuala Namu International airport for your flight to next destination. Meals : Breakfast',NULL,'Itinerary: DAY 01 : ARRIVAL IN MEDAN - TANGKAHAN DAY 02 : TANGKAHAN – ELEPHANT WASHING & RIVER SAFARI (B, L) DAY 03 : TANGKAHAN – BUKIT LAWANG BY Jeep (B) DAY 04 : BUKIT LAWANG – FULLDAY LEUSER NATIONAL PARK TREKKING (B, L) DAY 05 : BUKIT LAWANG – 3 HOURS JUNGLE TREKKING – AIRPORT HOTEL (B) DAY 06 : DEPARTURE FROM MEDAN (B) Accommodation: 12-14 Nov: Mega Inn (Standard Room) 14-16 Nov: Ecolodge Bukit Lawang Cottage (Thomas Monkey Room) 16-17 Nov: Anara Sky Kuala Namu (at Deluxe room)','{\"date\": \"2024-11-12\", \"text\": \"ETA: 08.15 by Batik Air Malaysia OD322 from Kuala Lumpur on 12 Nov\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Medan Airport\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5306390,'909','OLIVIER FIVAZ',30508,207259,'Airport to Tulamben','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-05','2024-11-05','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Persons (1-3)',784000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting at the arrival hall exit, holding a signboard of your name/group name. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 3 hours after the flight’s estimated arrival time (ETA). - For any flight delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 371