her delay could affect your timely arrival at the airport for your flight. - For any changes in flight departure time, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available). - Requests for pickup time earlier than originally booked are subject to availability.','{\"date\": \"2024-12-31\", \"text\": \"Please be ready in hotel lobby at the mentioned time.\", \"time\": \"14:00\", \"locality\": \"KajaNe Tulamben\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-31\", \"text\": \"ETD: 21.40 by KLM KL836 to Amsterdam on 31 Dec\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Denpasar Airport\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5307763,'737','Begona Velasco Makuba',30527,200579,'Valley View Villa','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-11-16','2024-11-18','Norberto','Febrina',1,'Double',6240000.00,'The Valley View Villas are located on the lowest level of the hotel grounds. This ensures guests have a clear view of the jungle valley below and complete privacy. The bedroom features a King-sized bed, and the 70 m2 floor area gives guests lots of space inside, in addition to the beautiful outdoor area. Lounge on a chair on the personal terrace with gazebo, take a plunge in the infinity pool, or let the daily worries of life drift away in the outdoor natural stone bathtub. Air conditioning and a private bathroom with bathtub, along with many other amenities, add to the comfort level of these villas.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-11-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5307766,'737','Begona Velasco Makuba',30623,200587,'Terrace Villa','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-11-18','2024-11-22','Norberto','Febrina',1,'Double',12480000.00,'The Terrace Villas offer a spectacular view which creates an idyllic retreat, inviting guests to relax and unwind amidst the serene ambiance. With 100 m² of living space, these one-bedroom villas are well-equipped with a king-size bed, air conditioning, a private bathroom with a rainfall showerhead, a beautiful view of the jungle valley, and other various amenities for a comfortable stay. Discover solace in the peaceful seclusion of the villa’s private outdoor oasis, whether ensconced in the comforting ambiance of the gazebo, reclining next to the revitalizing plunge pool, or surrendering to absolute relaxation in the outdoor bathtub.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-11-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5307767,'737','Begona Velasco Makuba',30508,207278,'Full Day Tour Car & Driver (8-10 hours)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-17','2024-11-17','Norberto','Febrina',1,'Persons (2)',780000.00,NULL,NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Tejaprana Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Tejaprana Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5307768,'737','Begona Velasco Makuba',30508,207278,'Full Day Tour Car & Driver (8-10 hours)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-18','2024-11-18','Norberto','Febrina',1,'Persons (2)',780000.00,NULL,NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Tejaprana Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Tejaprana Bisma\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5307769,'737','Begona Velasco Makuba',30508,207278,'Full Day Tour Car & Driver (8-10 hours)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-19','2024-11-19','Norberto','Febrina',1,'Persons (2)',780000.00,NULL,NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"09:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Tejaprana Bisma\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-19\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Tejaprana Bisma\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5308917,'901','Einari Talviste',30508,202897,'Uluwatu Temple and Kecak Dance','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-17','2024-11-17','Melysa','Tami',14,'Persons (7-10)',8400000.00,'This half-day tour, is an exciting tour package to visit Padang-Padang Beach, Uluwatu Temple, the famous Balinese Hindu Temple in south part of Bali with breathtaking view of sunset and Indian Ocean. Uluwatu Temple is one of Balinese Hindu Temples located right on the petrifying hill with the crevasse exist in the right and left side. Uluwatu Temple is one of Sad Khayangan (6 biggest temple in Bali) owns magnificent view of the Indian Ocean and sunset as a backdrop. This temple is very amazing where the location is right on the narrow peninsula with deep seawater under it. This tour package is combined with the spectacular Balinese traditional dance performance of Kecak Dance. Balinese Kecak Dance is a spectacular traditional dance with the group of people playing this dance with fire game. It is very exciting and unique dance due to the sound of gamelan is not using the normal gamelan but use their mouth. The dancers make the compact choir with the exquisite dance movement that is one of this dance features. After the dance we returned back to the hotel.','Visits : - Uluwatu Temple','The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-17\", \"text\": \"ETA 14.05 by Citilink QG 684 from Jakarta on 17 Nov\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-17\", \"text\": \"Jl. Pratama No.62, Tj. Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ikosharold Resort Benoa\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5308934,'901','Einari Talviste',30537,220540,'Deluxe Balcony Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-17','2024-11-18','Melysa','Tami',7,'Double + Twin',7560000.00,'A Fusion of Comfort and Panoramic Views Elevate your stay at Ikosharold Resort Benoa with the Deluxe Balcony Room, a harmonious blend of modern comfort and breathtaking vistas. Step into your sanctuary, where contemporary elegance meets Balinese charm. The room welcomes you with its spacious layout and tasteful decor, featuring touches of Indonesian-inspired accents that evoke a sense of warmth and tranquility. Slide open the doors to your private balcony and be greeted by sweeping views of the surrounding landscape. Whether you\'re gazing out at the shimmering waters of the pool or admiring the vibrant hues of a Bali sunset, the balcony offers the perfect vantage point to soak in the beauty of your surroundings.',NULL,'Bedding Type Request : 3 Double + 4 Twin Room','{\"date\": \"2024-11-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-18\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5308956,'901','Einari Talviste',30508,207268,'Nusa Dua to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-18','2024-11-18','Melysa','Tami',2,'Persons (7-10)',1920000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver will wait up to 30 minutes after your scheduled pickup time. - Please keep in mind that any further delay could affect your timely arrival at the airport for your flight. - For any changes in flight departure time, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available). - Requests for pickup time earlier than originally booked are subject to availability.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-18\", \"text\": \"Jl. Pratama No.62, Tj. Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": \"17:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Ikosharold Resort Benoa\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-18\", \"text\": \"ETD 21.25 by Turkish Airlines TK67 to Istanbul on 18 Nov\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5310093,'661','Kathleen Barrett 20235023',30959,213942,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-12-15','2024-12-17','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Single',1948800.00,'Specially designed for savvy travelers seeking comfort and style at 48 sqm of room size. Available in King and Double bet with the option of an extra bed for an additional fee. The room features a cozy living room with a comfortable sofa, LED wall-mounted TV, complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi, and in-room amenities to ensure a relaxing stay experience.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. Aston Sorong Hotel Airport Pickup Service: +62821 97722224 (WhatsApp available)','{\"date\": \"2024-12-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5310099,'661','Kathleen Barrett 20235023',30959,212511,'One-way Airport Transfer','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-17','2024-12-17','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Per Car',168000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-12-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-17\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5310234,'237','D\'Anne Marie DUCLOS',31158,204263,'VIP Service Fast Track International Arrival - Joumpa CGK','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-08','2024-11-08','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Person (1)',672000.00,'Arrival International: Pick up at before immigration area (near Plaza Bali or Duty Free).',NULL,'MEETING POINT: Your personal assistant will be waiting for you before the Visa-on-Arrival desk and the immigration area (near transfer desk/duty-free plaza), holding a sign of your name. They will assist you with during all arrival processes, including handling your visas and other essential documents as well as VoA (if prepaid), fast assistance at immigration counters, assistance through customs clearance, and help with the luggage. Lastly, the assistant will take you to Anara Airport Hotel.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Anara Airport Hotel - Terminal 3\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5311434,'237','D\'Anne Marie DUCLOS',31158,204263,'VIP Service Fast Track International Arrival - Joumpa CGK','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-10','2024-11-10','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Person (1)',672000.00,'Arrival International: Pick up at before immigration area (near Plaza Bali or Duty Free).',NULL,'MEETING POINT: Your personal assistant will be waiting for you before the Visa-on-Arrival desk and the immigration area (near transfer desk/duty-free plaza), holding a sign of your name. They will assist you with during all arrival processes, including handling your visas and other essential documents as well as VoA (if prepaid), fast assistance at immigration counters, assistance through customs clearance, and help with the luggage. Lastly, the assistant will take you to Anara Airport Hotel.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-10\", \"text\": \"ETA: 07.05 by Qatar Airways QR958 from Doha on 10 Nov\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-10\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Anara Airport Hotel - Terminal 3\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5312556,'313','Josiah Vincent VIVONA',30680,200914,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-11-08','2024-11-11','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Single',2688000.00,'Enjoy our spacious elegant deluxe room with 40 m2 of room size. Enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, hot and cold shower, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK-IN. FM7 Hotel Airport Pickup Service: +62811-8815-053 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-11-08\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5313565,'920','Mr John Liddiard',30923,202520,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-02','2024-12-03','Ayu','Eddy',1,'Double',784000.00,'At 30 sqm room size, Deluxe room with bed configuration 1 double bed (king) or 2 single bed (twin) and max occupancy for 3 Adult or 2 Adult with 2 Child. Have a private balcony overlooking to the garden. Interconnecting Room available which consist of 1 Room with King Size bed and 1 room with 2 single bed.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-12-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5313567,'920','Mr John Liddiard',30508,207250,'Airport to Kuta','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-02','2024-12-02','Ayu','Eddy',2,'Persons (1-3)',560000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting at the arrival hall exit, holding a signboard of your name/group name. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 3 hours after the flight’s estimated arrival time (ETA). - For any flight delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-12-02\", \"text\": \"ETA 22.40 by Qatar QR960 from Doha on 02 Dec 2024\", \"time\": \"22:40\", \"locality\": \"Ngurah Rai International Airport Bali\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"Risata Bali Resort and Spa\", \"location\": \"Jl. Wana Segara, Kuta, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5315596,'913','Calabrese Salvatore',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-21','2024-12-22','Ayu','Tami',1,'Double',784000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK-IN. FM7 Hotel Airport Pickup Service: +62811-8815-053 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-12-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5316342,'922','Mrs. Séverine POLIZZI',31973,220641,'Balinese Wedding Ceremony - Silver Package (include guide & private car)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-11','2024-11-11','Ayu','Wiwik',2,'Persons (2)',0.00,'Embark on a journey steeped in the rich cultural heritage of Bali with Come2Indonesia’s Balinese Traditional Wedding Blessing Ceremony. Whether you’re basking in the glow of your honeymoon or commemorating a special wedding anniversary, our ceremony offers a unique experience that intertwines love with the island’s enchanting traditions. Your celebration begins with the Segehan ritual, a spiritual cleansing performed at the entrance of a traditional Balinese house. This ancient practice sets the stage for a day filled with profound cultural significance, marking the start of your union in a uniquely Balinese way. As the afternoon sun begins to wane at 4 o’clock, the mystical aura of Bali becomes palpable, providing the perfect backdrop for your ceremony. Held in the authentic ambiance of a traditional Balinese house, each ritual resonates with the island’s spirit. Our ceremonies are more than just an event; they’re a passage into the heart of Balinese culture. We invite you to immerse yourself in this experience, where every detail is carefully crafted to honor the sacredness of your commitment.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-11-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"07:30\", \"locality\": \"Hanging Gardens Of Bali\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5317926,'924','Mr. Valentine Jean Serge Faure',30783,218071,'5D4N Jogja-Bromo-Ijen-Bali Incl. Train/ Gallery Prawirotaman (Superior) & Bromo Terrace (Deluxe) & K','Confirmed',NULL,5,'2024-12-23','2024-12-27','Yudha','Praba',1,'Person (1)',20580000.00,'D1 Arrival at Yogyakarta International Airport - Borobudur temple tour Incl.Mendut and Pawon D2 Yogyakarta City tour visit Sultan Palace, Wateracastle and Bird Market, Visit Prambanan temple D3 Jogja - Mojokerto by train - drive to Bromo - overnight in Bromo D4 Mt. Bromo Sunrise tour incl. Jeep - Transfer to Ijen for overnight D5 Mt. Ijen crater tour - transfer to Bali across Ketapang - Gilimanuk harbour - drop at your hotel in Bali',NULL,'D1: Arrival Yogyakarta - check in at Gallery Prawirotaman D2: Borobudur Temple - Yogyakarta City Tour - Prambaban Temple D3: Yogyakarta - Bromo by Train - check in Bromo Terrace Hotel D4: Bromo Sunrise Tour - check in at Ketapang Indah Hotel D5: Ijen Trekking - Ketapang - Gilimanuk - Bali - check in hotel Bali','{\"date\": \"2024-12-23\", \"text\": \"ETA 17:40 by Lion Air JT567 from Denpasar\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Yogyakarta International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-27\", \"text\": \"TBA\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Hotel Bali TBA\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5318006,'925','Ana Eulalia Serrano Donoso',30508,212289,'Airport to Nusa Dua','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-02','2024-12-02','Igo','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting at the arrival hall exit, holding a signboard of your name/group name. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 3 hours after the flight’s estimated arrival time (ETA). - For any flight delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-12-02\", \"text\": \"ETA 12.15 by Air Asia D7-798 from Kuala Lumpur on 2 Dec\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-02\", \"text\": \"Jl. Pratama, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80363\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sadara Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5318012,'925','Ana Eulalia Serrano Donoso',30580,202387,'Sadara Premier Room','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-12-02','2024-12-05','Igo','Tami',1,'Double',4704000.00,'One bedroom SADARA Premier offers pleasant experience. Decorated with a modern interior which brings the comfort and style at the same time. With 42 square meters size, this air-conditioned room has its own private balcony or terrace overlooking the boasting garden and overviewing the tranquil blue ocean. The complete room facilities of a minibar, coffee and tea maker, hairdryer, 2 mineral bottles and safety box, Free win, will make your stay conveniently.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-12-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5318015,'925','Ana Eulalia Serrano Donoso',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Monkey forest - Tegalalang - Lake Batur - Goa Gajah)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-03','2024-12-03','Igo','Tami',2,'Person (1)',1904000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-12-03\", \"text\": \"Jl. Pratama, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80363\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sadara Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5318020,'925','Ana Eulalia Serrano Donoso',30508,220657,'Uluwatu Temple and Kecak Dance (without dinner)','Confirmed','C2I-BALI16',1,'2024-12-04','2024-12-04','Igo','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1713600.00,'This half-day tour, is an exciting tour package to visit Padang-Padang Beach, Uluwatu Temple, the famous Balinese Hindu Temple in south part of Bali with breathtaking view of sunset and Indian Ocean. Uluwatu Temple is one of Balinese Hindu Temples located right on the petrifying hill with the crevasse exist in the right and left side. Uluwatu Temple is one of Sad Khayangan (6 biggest temple in Bali) owns magnificent view of the Indian Ocean and sunset as a backdrop. This temple is very amazing where the location is right on the narrow peninsula with deep seawater under it. This tour package is combined with the spectacular Balinese traditional dance performance of Kecak Dance. Balinese Kecak Dance is a spectacular traditional dance with the group of people playing this dance with fire game. It is very exciting and unique dance due to the sound of gamelan is not using the normal gamelan but use their mouth. The dancers make the compact choir with the exquisite dance movement that is one of this dance features. After the dance we returned back to the hotel.','Visits : - Uluwatu Temple','The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-12-04\", \"text\": \"Jl. Pratama, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80363\", \"time\": \"15:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sadara Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5318026,'925','Ana Eulalia Serrano Donoso',30508,207268,'Nusa Dua to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-05','2024-12-05','Igo','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',280000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver will wait up to 30 minutes after your scheduled pickup time. - Please keep in mind that any further delay could affect your timely arrival at the airport for your flight. - For any changes in flight departure time, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available). - Requests for pickup time earlier than originally booked are subject to availability.','{\"date\": \"2024-12-05\", \"text\": \"Jl. Pratama, Benoa, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80363\", \"time\": \"05:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sadara Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-05\", \"text\": \"ETD 09.05 by Air Asia QZ-504 to Singapore on 5 Dec\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5319952,'927','Marina Bermejo Mesa',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-03','2024-12-03','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, meeting service with the driver who will take you to the booked accommodation.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting at the arrival hall exit, holding a signboard of your name/group name. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 3 hours after the flight’s estimated arrival time (ETA). - For any flight delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-12-03\", \"text\": \"ETA 16.30 by Emirates EK368 from Dubai on 03 Dec\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-03\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Tejaprana Bisma\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5319956,'927','Marina Bermejo Mesa',30623,200583,'Garden Villa','Confirmed',NULL,4,'2024-12-03','2024-12-07','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',10304000.00,'The Garden Villas provide an ideal sanctuary, featuring a private garden that ensures a peaceful and intimate atmosphere for guests seeking the perfect retreat. These one-bedroom villas are well-equipped with a floor area of 100 m², a king-size bed, air conditioning, sleek appointed bathroom with a rainfall showerhead, beautiful view of the garden, and various amenities for a comfortable stay. Unwind in the serenity of the villa’s private outdoor haven, whether it’s within the comforting embrace of the gazebo, lounging by the refreshing plunge pool, or indulging in pure relaxation while soaking in the outdoor natural stone bathtub.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-12-03\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5319959,'927','Marina Bermejo Mesa',30508,202892,'Bali Fantastic Route Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI13',1,'2024-12-04','2024-12-04','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1747200.00,'At the agreed time, we will meet at your hotel and we will begin to mark your footprints in this “home” of the Gods. Today, we are taking you on Fantastic Route created by Come2Indonesia. The first site will be the Taman Ayun Temple founded in the seventeenth century and located in the village of Mengwi, which until 1891 was the seat of a powerful king dating back to the Gellel Dynasty. The temple is surrounded by a moat that looks like a landscaped shrine, which explains the term taman or garden. The temple is a penyawangan or place to worship other sacred sites. From Taman Ayun, the compass heads towards Jatiluwih, where we will undoubtedly admire and enjoy a beautiful view of the rice paddies that encompass the entire landscape of South Bali. The name Jatiluwih is composed of two words, Jati which means truly, and Luwih which means beautiful, good and special. Undoubtedly, this place not only has a beautiful name, but is also reflected in its landscape. From Jatiluwih, we will go to Bedugul where we will visit the Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, the famous temple that stands in a small development located on the shore of Lake Beratan that has a beautiful landscape with the lake and the mountains as a backdrop. It is, without a doubt, one of the most photogenic temples on the island. This temple is dedicated to Dewi Danu, the goddess of the waters. We’ll close the visit of this Fantastic Route by watching the sunset at the most famous and photographed temple in Bali, the Pura Tanah Lot. Torn from the earth on a stone pedestal sculpted by the incoming tides, the solitary black towers of Tanah Lot and the plumes of foliage spilling over the precipices, recall the delicacy of Chinese painting. The Pura Tanah Lot or the Earth Temple in the middle of the sea was built in the 16th century. At the end of the day, you’ll be transferred to your hotel.','Visits : - Taman Ayun - Jatiluwih - Ulun Danu - Tanah Lot',NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-12-04\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Tejaprana Bisma\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5319961,'927','Marina Bermejo Mesa',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Goa Gajah - Tampaksiring - Gunung Kawi Sebatu Temple - Tegalalang)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-05','2024-12-05','Guio','Tami',2,'Person (1)',2128000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-12-05\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Tejaprana Bisma\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-05\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5319963,'927','Marina Bermejo Mesa',30508,220657,'Uluwatu Temple and Kecak Dance (without dinner)','Confirmed','C2I-BALI16',1,'2024-12-07','2024-12-07','Guio','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1713600.00,'This half-day tour, is an exciting tour package to visit Padang-Padang Beach, Uluwatu Temple, the famous Balinese Hindu Temple in south part of Bali with breathtaking view of sunset and Indian Ocean. Uluwatu Temple is one of Balinese Hindu Temples located right on the petrifying hill with the crevasse exist in the right and left side. Uluwatu Temple is one of Sad Khayangan (6 biggest temple in Bali) owns magnificent view of the Indian Ocean and sunset as a backdrop. This temple is very amazing where the location is right on the narrow peninsula with deep seawater under it. This tour package is combined with the spectacular Balinese traditional dance performance of Kecak Dance. Balinese Kecak Dance is a spectacular traditional dance with the group of people playing this dance with fire game. It is very exciting and unique dance due to the sound of gamelan is not using the normal gamelan but use their mouth. The dancers make the compact choir with the exquisite dance movement that is one of this dance features. After the dance we returned back to the hotel.','Visits : - Uluwatu Temple','The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-12-07\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": \"13:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Tejaprana Bisma\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-07\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bangbang Metuug, Pecatu, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Green Escape - Eco Resort\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5319970,'927','Marina Bermejo Mesa',30930,202592,'One Bedroom Bungalow','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-12-07','2024-12-09','Guio','Tami',1,'Double',5152000.00,'Room size : 37 sqm. Our One-Bedroom Bungalow is a unique Romantic Eco-Boho Bungalow nestles in Green Escape Resort. You will stay in a sumptuous air-conditioned bungalow that has been handcrafted using recycled wood and tastefully decorated to offer you an authentic Balinese getaway. It\'s the very epitome of a tranquil escape. This Bungalow offers a deluxe king-size bed and a daybed to relax. It offers a comfy mattress, as we know the benefits of a good night’s sleep. The semi-outdoor bathroom with a rain shower will help you revive yourself. Enjoy the comfy sofa on your private terrace which opens onto the exotic garden & pool. The daybed can be used to extend the sleeping capacity of your private bungalow.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-12-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5319975,'927','Marina Bermejo Mesa',30508,216161,'Uluwatu to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-09','2024-12-09','Guio','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver will wait up to 30 minutes after your scheduled pickup time. - Please keep in mind that any further delay could affect your timely arrival at the airport for your flight. - For any changes in flight departure time, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available). - Requests for pickup time earlier than originally booked are subject to availability.','{\"date\": \"2024-12-09\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bangbang Metuug, Pecatu, Kec. Kuta Sel., Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Green Escape - Eco Resort\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-09\", \"text\": \"ETD 13.00 by Singapore Airlines SQ939 to Singapore on 09 Dec\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5321676,'928','AMALIA AQUINO ABAOAG',33355,220556,'Executive Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-11-22','2024-11-25','Yudha','Eddy',1,'Double',19800000.00,'Experience the executive treatment in one of our superbly appointed Executive Suite. Our 105-square meter Executive Suites offer city or swimming pool views. The elegant bed room area is equipped with living room with cozy arm chairs and tea table. The room completed with exclusive benefits including continental breakfast daily, daily refreshments, VIP express check-in and use of the business center facility at The Executive Lounge. In addition to complimentary food and beverage from the mini bar, guest stay at Executive Suite have the benefit to brew coffee from the pod coffee machine.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-11-22\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5321677,'928','AMALIA AQUINO ABAOAG',30684,200640,'Deluxe Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-25','2024-11-26','Yudha','Eddy',1,'Double',1638000.00,'Designed to embody fresher and younger ambience, our Deluxe Room is a convenient stay for those who plan a relatively shorter stay in Semarang. The room is provided with either a king size or deluxe twin beds.',NULL,'Check-in time 14.00 Check-out time 12.00 Early check-in is subject to availability and may be charged additional cost','{\"date\": \"2024-11-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-26\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5321768,'928','AMALIA AQUINO ABAOAG',30682,200893,'Villa\'s Deluxe','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-27','2024-11-28','Yudha','Eddy',1,'Double',2418000.00,'Villa Deluxe with 42 sqm room area. 23 rooms available (13 double + 10 twin), single and twin beds available with a capacity of 2 people per room. see the greatest view in Ijen Mountain. See the magic of the blue fire at night. Sophisticated design in Ijen Resort and Villas, in Banyuwangi, East Java. You can see the best view from your room, the rice field, mountains.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-11-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5322177,'930','IGNACIO MARTÍNEZ GARCÍA',30806,212931,'3D2N Best Borneo Orangutan Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO1',3,'2024-11-27','2024-11-29','Igo','Igo',4,'Persons (4)',14880000.00,'Get ready to immerse yourself in this Orangutan Tour and the authentic wildlife of the Borneo rainforests on this private two-night expedition in Tanjung Puting National Park. On board a traditional boat that we call klotok and together with a local crew and your guide, you will explore the wildlife that lives on the banks of the river. In this Biosphere Reserve, you will feel closely the passage of the Orangutans in their natural habitat, and you will see hundreds of endemic Borneo proboscis monkeys, macaques, gibbons, hornbills, wild boars, and hopefully some crocodiles near your boat. In addition, you will be living this adventure in a sustainable way because our boats are all renovated following ecological patterns and go totally hand in hand with nature. Let the adventure begin! 3D2N BEST BORNEO ORANGUTAN TOUR DAY 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Arrive at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan is Cape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat DAY 2 : PONDOK TANGGUY - CAMP LEAKEY Today you will wake up to the sounds and colors of the jungle. Without a doubt, you will never forget how you woke up on the river, surrounded by overflowing nature. After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continue to add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After the Orangutans begin to leave, you will return to the klotok again to go further up the river. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large lizards, together with Gibbon’s and proboscis monkeys. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. When you are finished observing the orangutans in this camp, and if the weather and conditions permit, you will make a short trek through the jungle on our way back to the boat to look for wild orangutans and other animals. You will have the opportunity to learn from our local guides, some of whom were born in the jungle, how to look for animals or plants, or simply listen to their experience of life in the jungle. The jungles of Borneo have given life and have been home to the settlers for many years. The jungles, under the eyes of the grandparents, are able to give you everything you need. Food, water, medicines, etc. Yes... Never put anything in your mouth without the recommendation of your guide. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note: The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. *If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat DAY 3 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN In the early morning you will enjoy the last moments of the sounds of the jungle before heading to the port to, in turn, be transferred to the airport. The check-out time will be at 8 a.m. If you decide to take a flight in the afternoon, we can take you directly to the airport, or if you want a city tour in the town of Arut to be transferred to the airport later, this can be organized at an additional cost. Thank you for joining us on this Borneo Orangutan Tour by Come2Indonesia! Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,'ETA at 07.15 by ID6202 from CGK on 27 NOV 2024 ETD at 08.50 by ID6134 to SUB on 29 NOV 2024 No food restriction.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-29\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5322265,'855','Ilya Raskin',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-15','2024-11-16','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Twin',840000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK-IN. FM7 Hotel Airport Pickup Service: +62811-8815-053 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-11-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5322823,'824','Mr. Diego Baron Cano',30650,208425,'Private Pool Villa','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-11-14','2024-11-16','Jacob','Praba',1,'Double',4800000.00,'Each villa embraces calmness, comfort and privacy in a simple and elegant setting. Guests can relax while peacefully sipping drinks in an inviting plunge pool surrounded by a lush tropical garden and at an old-wooden deck. At 85 m2 room size, this villa\'s special feature is the private pool. The air-conditioned villa features 1 bedroom and 1 bathroom with a shower and a hairdryer. The villa provides a mini-bar, a tea and coffee maker, a seating area as well as a terrace with garden views. The unit offers 1 bed.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-11-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5322834,'824','Mr. Diego Baron Cano',30508,207379,'Ubud to Padang Bai','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-14','2024-11-14','Jacob','Praba',1,'Person (1)',600000.00,'At the appointed time, meeting service with your driver who will take you to the designated destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: -