8,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-11','2024-12-11','Jacob','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',336000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, you’ll be greeted by the driver, who will be waiting for you at the exit of the arrival hall, holding a signboard with your name or group name. The driver will assist you with your luggage and ensure a comfortable journey to your booked accommodation.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting at the arrival hall exit, holding a signboard of your name/group name. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 3 hours after the flight’s estimated arrival time (ETA). - For any flight delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-12-11\", \"text\": \"ETA 19.10 by Turkish Airlines TK66 from Istanbul on 11 Dec\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-11\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Bisma\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5325285,'935','Maite Martinez Garcia',30711,200830,'Bisma Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-12-11','2024-12-14','Jacob','Tami',1,'Double',9424800.00,'Spacious one-bedroom suite of 88 sqm with private balcony for a sophisticated Ubud getaway. Interiors feature extensive use of wood and fine Indonesian textiles and art, lending an understated elegance to the space. Featuring a private balcony, this room includes a flat-screen TV and an en-suite bathroom with a bathtub and a shower, and many more.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS Check In Time : 14.00 Check Out Time : 12.00 Early check-in/late check-out is subject to availability and may be charged additional cost.','{\"date\": \"2024-12-11\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5325297,'935','Maite Martinez Garcia',30508,215968,'1D Bali Tour (Goa Gajah - Tampaksiring - Gunung Kawi Sebatu – Tegalalang)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-12','2024-12-12','Jacob','Tami',2,'Person (1)',2128000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-12-12\", \"text\": \"Please be ready in hotel lobby at the mentioned time.\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Bisma\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-12\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5325301,'935','Maite Martinez Garcia',30508,202892,'Bali Fantastic Route Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI13',1,'2024-12-13','2024-12-13','Jacob','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1747200.00,'At the agreed time, we will meet at your hotel and we will begin to mark your footprints in this “home” of the Gods. Today, we are taking you on Fantastic Route created by Come2Indonesia. The first site will be the Taman Ayun Temple founded in the seventeenth century and located in the village of Mengwi, which until 1891 was the seat of a powerful king dating back to the Gellel Dynasty. The temple is surrounded by a moat that looks like a landscaped shrine, which explains the term taman or garden. The temple is a penyawangan or place to worship other sacred sites. From Taman Ayun, the compass heads towards Jatiluwih, where we will undoubtedly admire and enjoy a beautiful view of the rice paddies that encompass the entire landscape of South Bali. The name Jatiluwih is composed of two words, Jati which means truly, and Luwih which means beautiful, good and special. Undoubtedly, this place not only has a beautiful name, but is also reflected in its landscape. From Jatiluwih, we will go to Bedugul where we will visit the Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, the famous temple that stands in a small development located on the shore of Lake Beratan that has a beautiful landscape with the lake and the mountains as a backdrop. It is, without a doubt, one of the most photogenic temples on the island. This temple is dedicated to Dewi Danu, the goddess of the waters. We’ll close the visit of this Fantastic Route by watching the sunset at the most famous and photographed temple in Bali, the Pura Tanah Lot. Torn from the earth on a stone pedestal sculpted by the incoming tides, the solitary black towers of Tanah Lot and the plumes of foliage spilling over the precipices, recall the delicacy of Chinese painting. The Pura Tanah Lot or the Earth Temple in the middle of the sea was built in the 16th century. At the end of the day, you’ll be transferred to your hotel.','Visits : - Taman Ayun - Jatiluwih - Ulun Danu - Tanah Lot','The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-12-13\", \"text\": \"Please be ready in hotel lobby at the mentioned time.\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Komaneka at Bisma\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-13\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5325325,'935','Maite Martinez Garcia',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Trip','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-12-14','2024-12-14','Jacob','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',952000.00,'We will live a different day in neighboring Nusa Penida. We will pick you up at your hotel to go to the port and there take the fast boat to Nusa Penida. After approximately 30 minutes fast, we will arrive at the paradise island of southeast Bali. There we will be waiting for you to start your route. Our first stop will be Angel’s Billabong, a natural paradise in the form of a natural pool. If you want to take a bath, be careful with the steps and follow your driver’s recommendation. From here we will go to Broken Beach, a small bay that was once a cave and has been losing the roof over time. We can not access by land but the view from above is beautiful and with a bit of luck, we can see giant manta rays swimming on the surface. Our next stop will be Kelingking Beach, one of the most famous and photographed beaches on the island with its cliffs and the hand-shaped mountain. And we will end the day with relaxing in Crystal Beach, a white sand beach and turquoise waters. Afternoon, we transfer you back to the harbor to catch a fastboat return to Bali.',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-12-14\", \"text\": \"ETA 08.30 by The Angkal Fast Boat from Kusamba Harbour\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sampalan Harbour, Nusa Penida\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-14\", \"text\": \"Sakti, Nusa Penida, Klungkung Regency, Bali 80771\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Māua Nusa Penida\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5325331,'935','Maite Martinez Garcia',30582,203387,'One Bedroom Luxury Villas','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-12-14','2024-12-16','Jacob','Tami',1,'Double',6988800.00,'Each One Bedroom Luxury Villa is designed with a private infinity pool, scenic view across the Gamat Bay or garden view, and some have a small private garden. Every villas features the following: An integrated universal power outlet, Room safe (suitable for storing laptops), Cable TV with international news and movie channels, Eco-friendly bathroom amenities, Coffee and tea-making facilities.',NULL,'HONEYMOONERS Check In Time : 02.00 PM Check Out Time : 11.00 AM Early check-in/late check-out is subject to availability and may be charged additional cost.','{\"date\": \"2024-12-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-2