ped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, hot and cold shower, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK-IN. FM7 Hotel Airport Pickup Service: +62811-8815-053 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-11-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5326966,'938','Joe Dave Herron',31158,204263,'VIP Service Fast Track International Arrival - Joumpa CGK','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-27','2024-11-27','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Person (1)',3024000.00,'Arrival International: Pick up at before immigration area (near Plaza Bali or Duty Free).',NULL,'MEETING POINT: Your personal assistant will be waiting for you before the Visa-on-Arrival desk and the immigration area (near transfer desk/duty-free plaza), holding a sign of your name. They will assist you with during all arrival processes, including handling your visas and other essential documents as well as VoA (if prepaid), fast assistance at immigration counters, assistance through customs clearance, and help with the luggage. Lastly, the assistant will take you to meet the person who will pick you up at the airport, or help you find a taxi.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5327226,'940','Ana Martin',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-11-29','2024-11-29','Jacob','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, you’ll be greeted by the driver, who will be waiting for you at the exit of the arrival hall, holding a signboard with your name or group name. The driver will assist you with your luggage and ensure a comfortable journey to your booked accommodation.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting at the arrival hall exit, holding a signboard of your name/group name. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 3 hours after the flight’s estimated arrival time (ETA). - For any flight delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-11-29\", \"text\": \"ETA 11:05 by Singapore Airline SQ936 from Singapore on 29 Nov\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-11-29\", \"text\": \"Jl. Bisma, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Tejaprana Bisma\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5327229,'940','Ana Martin',30508,202892,'Bali Fantastic Route Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI13',1,'2024-12-01','2024-12-01','Jacob','Tami',2,'Persons (2)',1747200.00,'At the agreed time, we will meet at your hotel and we will begin to mark your footprints in this “home” of the Gods. Today, we are taking you on Fantastic Route created by Come2Indonesia. The first site will be the Taman Ayun Temple founded in the seventeenth century and located in the village of Mengwi, which until 1891 was the seat of a powerful king dating back to the Gellel Dynasty. The temple is surrounded by a moat that looks like a landscaped shrine, which explains the term taman or garden. The temple is a penyawangan or place to worship other sacred sites. From Taman Ayun, the compass heads towards Jatiluwih, where we will undoubtedly admire and enjoy a beautiful view of the rice paddies that encompass the entire landscape of South Bali. The name Jatiluwih is composed of two words, Jati which means truly, and Luwih which means beautiful, good and special. Undoubtedly, this place not only has a beautiful name, but is also reflected in its landscape. From Jatiluwih, we will go to Bedugul where we will visit the Ulun Danu Bratan Temple, the famous temple that stands in a small development located on the shore of Lake Beratan that has a beautiful landscape with the lake and the mountains as a backdrop. It is, without a doubt, one of the most photogenic temples on the island. This temple is dedicated to Dewi Danu, the goddess of the waters. We’ll close the visit of this Fantastic Route by watching the sunset at the most famous and photographed temple in Bali, the Pura Tanah Lot. Torn from the earth on a stone pedestal sculpted by the incoming tides, the solitary black towers of Tanah Lot and the plumes of foliage spilling over the precipices, recall the delicacy of Chinese painting. The Pura Tanah Lot or the Earth Temple in the middle of the sea was built in the 16th century. At the end of the day, you’ll be transferred to your hotel.','Visits : - Taman Ayun - Jatiluwih - Ulun Danu - Tanah Lot','The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-12-01\", \"text\": \"Please be ready in hotel lobby at the mentioned time.\", \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Tejaprana Bisma\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5327237,'940','Ana Martin',30508,207262,'Ubud to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-02','2024-12-02','Jacob','Tami',1,'Persons (1-3)',392000.00,'At the appointed time, your driver will pick you up from the hotel and transfer you to the airport for your flight to the next destination.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver will wait up to 30 minutes after your scheduled pickup time. - Please keep in mind that any further delay could affect your timely arrival at the airport for your flight. - For any changes in flight departure time, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available). - Requests for pickup time earlier than originally booked are subject to availability.','{\"date\": \"2024-12-02\", \"text\": \"Please be ready in hotel lobby at the mentioned time.\", \"time\": \"05:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Tejaprana Bisma\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-02\", \"text\": \"ETD 09:10 by Nam Air IN640 to Tambolaka\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5327337,'941','Aleksandra Gwizd',31295,220820,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-12-07','2024-12-09','Melysa','Agus',4,'Twin',0.00,NULL,NULL,'Check in / out : Check in time 2.00 pm, Check out 12:00 noon, Late checkout is subject to room availability. Early Arrival can not be guaranteed. Should you require a guaranteed early arrival we suggest pre registering the room for the night before. Rooming List : MRS Gwizd Aleksandra ( TOUR LEADER ) MRS Milczarek Ewa MR Kryczka Rafal MR Mróz Marcin MR Danilowicz Dariusz MRS Danilowicz Daria MR Friebe Tomasz MR Trzaskowski Leszek ( arrive 08 Dec 2024 )','{\"date\": \"2024-12-07\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-09\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5327351,'941','Aleksandra Gwizd',31295,220820,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-08','2024-12-09','