3,'2024-11-28','2024-12-01','Melysa','Eddy',2,'Double + Twin',0.00,NULL,NULL,'Check in Time Start from 02.00 PM Check Out Time 12.00 noon Late Check Out until 6 PM is subject to 50% from the room rate.','{\"date\": \"2024-11-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5339437,'951','Christian Schuka',30662,212912,'(Journaway) 7D6N Medan - Bukit Lawang - Brastagi - Lake Toba','Confirmed',NULL,7,'2024-12-24','2024-12-30','Rendy','Rendy',2,'Persons (2-3 / Double)',22348480.00,'Day-01 : AIRPORT/MEDAN - BUKIT LAWANG Arrival at Kualanamu International Airport Medan meet by our tour guide and then drive to Bukit Lawang with enroute stop at several plantations for rubber and oil palm. Arriving in Bukit Lawang check-in to hotel. Meals : - • Overnight at : Eco-lodge Bukit Lawang Cottages - Standard Room Day-02 : BUKIT LAWANG - LEUSER PARK TREKKING (B,L,D) After breakfast walking to the jungle to start a jungle trekking to explore the nature of Leuser National Park with its rich flora and fauna, there will be chances to see Orangutans on their own natural habitat and other kinds of animal such as Thomas-leaf monkeys, long tail macaque, gibbon, black gibbon and other kind of flora and fauna of this tropical rain-forest. Lunch and dinner provided. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner • Overnight at : Tent or Shelter in the jungle Day-03 : CONTINUE TREKKING - RETURN TO BUKIT LAWANG (TUBING) (B,L) After breakfast prepared by tour guide continue trekking, today is full day walking and explore the rain tropical forest with its wildlife living in their natural habitat. In mid-afternoon, we will make our way back by tubing in the river. At the end, we will return to the hotel for check-in. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch • Overnight at : Eco-lodge Bukit Lawang Cottages - Standard Room Day-04 : BUKIT LAWANG - BERASTAGI (B) After breakfast drive to Berastagi with enroute stop at Sembahe river, arriving in Berastagi visiting Lumbhini Park to see the replica of the Shwedagon pagoda, and visit at Fruit Market. In mid-afternoon check-in to hotel. Meals : Breakfast • Overnight at : Mikie Holiday Resort - Superior Room • Alternative : Hotel Sinabung Hills - Superior Room Day-05 : SIBAYAK VOLCANO HIKING - TRANSFER TO SAMOSIR/LAKE TOBA (B) At early morning (take away your Breakfast Box) and transferred to the slope of Sibayak Volcano and then start hiking to the top of the Sibayak Volcano, to go and back will spend about 3 hours. Arriving on its peak enjoy the scenic panorama of its surroundings and the sunrise (weather depends). After take a rest and enjoy its view, start trekking back to Berastagi and then continuing the drive head for Samosir Island in Lake Toba via TELE. En-route stop at : • Dokan (to see the traditional village of the Batak Karo tribe) • Sipisopiso Waterfall (from here you can admire the scenic view of the Lake Toba from its northern tip combined with the slender 90 meters high waterfall) • Tele (a nice place for over-viewing the lake from its western part) • Efrata (another beautiful waterfall found on the way to Samosir Island) • Lumban Suhi-suhi (to see the Tobanase traditional houses where we could observe also the women doing the weaving) In mid-afternoon arriving at Tuktuk area on Samosir and check-in to hotel. Meals : Breakfast • Overnight at : Tabo Cottages - Deluxe Room • Alternative : Samosir Villa - Deluxe Room Day-06: SAMOSIR EXCURSION - AIRPORT/MEDAN CITY (B) After breakfast we start for our fullday excursion by car in the interior of Samosir Island with en-route visits at : • Ambarita (to see the stone chairs and tables where once used as the execution site by the ancient tribal chieftains) • Aek Natonang (here we can see the small lake found of the top of Samosir Island and its panorama view) • Tomok (to see the old sarcophages belonged to former Sidabutar Kings and his descendants) At mid-day, we will return to the harbor to catch the 1 PM ferry back to Parapat (1 hour sailing duration). Arriving at Parapat harbour continue the driving directly to Medan via Pematang Siantar and Tebing Tinggi (about 5 hours driving time). We will drop you off at the airport for overnight at airport hotel and be ready for morning flight departure. Meals : Breakfast Overnight: Hotel Horison Sky Kualanamu - Deluxe Room Day-07 : DEPARTURE After an early breakfast, you will continue to the departure terminal for your flight. TOUR ENDS. Meals : Breakfast','- All the above prices are not valid during Super High Season period for Idul Fitri (01-20 April 2024), Christmas & New Year festive season (18 December 2024 - 08 January 2025). - Surcharge to be advised','Per confirmed program: Day-01: AIRPORT/MEDAN – BUKIT LAWANG Day-02: BUKIT LAWANG – GUNUNG LEUSER NATIONAL PARK TREKKING (B, L) Day-03: CONTINUE TREKKING – RETURN TO BUKIT LAWANG (B, L) Day-04: BUKIT LAWANG – BERASTAGI (B) Day-05: SIBAYAK VOLCANO HIKING – TRANSFER TO SAMOSIR/LAKE TOBA (B) Day-06: SAMOSIR EXCURSION – AIRPORT (B) Day-07: DEPARTURE MEDAN Accommodation based on 1 Double Room: 3 Nights at Bukit Lawang Eco-Lodge – Butterfly Room 1 Night Sibayak Hotel – Superior Executive Room 1 Night at Toledo Inn – Deluxe Room 1 Night at Hotel Anara Sky Kualanamu – Deluxe Room Flights information: ETA: 08.30 by Batik Air Malaysia OD322 from Kuala Lumpur on 24 Dec ETD: 08.40 by Singapore Airlines SQ991 to Singapore on 30 Dec','{\"date\": \"2024-12-24\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5344902,'960','Antoni Serra',31591,207373,'3D2N Tangkoko','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-12-11','2024-12-13','Jacob','Tami',2,'Persons (2 / Single)',8640000.00,'Day 1 : MANADO - TANGKOKO - The expedition begins The adventure begins with meeting your guide at the Manado airport. Then you will start the journey of about 2 and a half hours by car to the Tangkoko Forest where you will do the check in at your Homestay or Lodge. Upon arrival, you will have a talk about what you will see and preparations for the trekking. Meals : Dinner Accommodation : Bird House Homestay or Similar Days 02 : Tangkoko Nature Reserve These days will be dedicated to exploring the jungle in search of animals and bird watching. You will start the trekking that will take you to Tangkok National Park. In just 40 minutes by boat, you will reach the Batuangus beach where you will then climb Mount Tangkoko (1500 m). The dense and virgin jungle is home to some unique animal species in North Sulawesi such as the crested black macaque and the tarsier spectrum that has become known as \"the smallest primate in the world\". As you will be trekking through the lush jungle, you will probably see and hear the red gnarled hornbill as well as the Maleo which is a Megapod Bird that lays eggs on large mounds it builds on the black sand. You can also find couscous, which is a relative of the Australian koala. The forest ranger will accompany you all the way to the top of Tangkoko Mountain. In the afternoon you will return to the station. Alternatively, you can have three hours of trekking in the lowland jungle or swimming on the black sand beach of Tangkoko Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Bird House Homestay or Similar Day 03 : Tangkoko - Manado After breakfast, you can spend the morning in the surroundings of the National Park and at the agreed time, with your guide, you will have the transfer to Manado. Thank you for exploring this unique jungle with us. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -',NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-12-11\", \"text\": \"ETA 15.45 by Lion Air JT799 from Sorong on 11 Dec 2024\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sam Ratulangi International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-13\", \"text\": \"ETD - TBA\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5345113,'961','EDUARDO',30687,221067,'2D1N Komodo Tour','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-11-30','2024-12-01','Norberto','Komang',1,'Persons (1-4)',37200000.00,NULL,NULL,'Pickup Time : 09.00 AM Pickup point in Labuan Bajo on 30 Nov : HOTEL AYANA KOMODO WAECICU BEACH Pantai Waecicu, Labuan Bajo, Kec. Komodo, Kabupaten Manggarai Barat, Nusa Tenggara Tim. 86554 Telepon: (0385) 2441000 Dropoff point on 01 Dec : AIRPORT LABUAN BAJO ETD : 18.30 by Air Asia on 01 Dec 2024','{\"date\": \"2024-11-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-01\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5350465,'967','Daen Andrew WOMBWELL',30959,213942,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-12-14','2024-12-16','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Double',1948800.00,'Specially designed for savvy travelers seeking comfort and style at 48 sqm of room size. Available in King and Double bet with the option of an extra bed for an additional fee. The room features a cozy living room with a comfortable sofa, LED wall-mounted TV, complimentary high-speed Wi-Fi, and in-room amenities to ensure a relaxing stay experience.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. Aston Sorong Hotel Airport Pickup Service: +62821 97722224 (WhatsApp available)','{\"date\": \"2024-12-14\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-16\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5353871,'967','Daen Andrew WOMBWELL',30959,212511,'One-way Airport Transfer','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-15','2024-12-15','Rendy','Rendy',1,'Per Car',168000.00