, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-15\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5366955,'989','ALI EZZEDDINE Mr (1 PAX)',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-21','2024-12-21','Yudha','Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',420000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, you’ll be greeted by the driver, who will be waiting for you at the exit of the arrival hall, holding a signboard with your name or group name. The driver will assist you with your luggage and ensure a comfortable journey to your booked accommodation.','Car and driver only, no guide service. - 1-3 Pax by Avanza / APV - 4-6 Pax by HIACE - 7-10 Pax by HIACE + Luggage Van','The driver will be waiting at the arrival hall exit, holding a signboard of your name/group name. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 3 hours after the flight’s estimated arrival time (ETA). - For any flight delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-12-21\", \"text\": \"ETA: 21 Dec 202416:30 From Dubai EK0368 By Emirate Airlines\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"BALI AIRPORT\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-21\", \"text\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud Address: Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone: (0361) 972385\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5366956,'989','ALI EZZEDDINE Mr (1 PAX)',30705,201147,'Premier Room Garden View','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-12-21','2024-12-23','Yudha','Eddy',1,'Double',2676000.00,'Get back to nature in one of our Premier Garden View suites. These spacious, light-filled rooms have beautiful Balinese double doors that can be closed to create a cool air-conditioned space or opened to merge indoor and outdoor living. The balconies overlook the resort’s lush gardens, which are awash in tropical flowers and foliage.',NULL,'Check In Time : 14.00 Check Out Time : 12.00 Early check-in/late check-out is subject to availability and may be charged additional cost.','{\"date\": \"2024-12-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5366963,'989','ALI EZZEDDINE Mr (1 PAX)',30798,201630,'One Bedroom Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-12-23','2024-12-25','Yudha','Eddy',1,'Double',3384000.00,'The two-story, 45 sqm One Bedroom Suite features an natural and airy interior, complemented with modern furnishings and views overlooking to the private terrace with a plunge pool. Floor-to-ceiling glass doors provide generous natural lighting and a dynamic ambience. Plush linens and a marble bathroom surround guests in elegance.',NULL,'Check In Time : 14.00 PM Check Out Time : 12.00 NOON Early check-in/late check-out is subject to availability and may be charged additional cost.','{\"date\": \"2024-12-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-25\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5366967,'989','ALI EZZEDDINE Mr (1 PAX)',30508,212531,'Seminyak to Sanur','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-24','2024-12-24','Yudha','Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',300000.00,'At the scheduled time, your driver will pick you up from your hotel or designated location and provide a transfer to the designated destination.','Car and driver only, no guide service. - 1-3 Pax by Avanza / APV - 4-6 Pax by HIACE - 7-10 Pax by HIACE + Luggage Van','The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-12-24\", \"text\": \"Kayumas Seminyak Resort Address: Jl. Pura Telaga Waja No.18A, Kerobokan Kelod, Kec. Kuta Utara, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361 Phone: (0361) 9348348\", \"time\": \"07:15\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-24\", \"text\": \"SANUR (08:30) By The Angkal\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"SANUR HARBOUR\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5366973,'989','ALI EZZEDDINE Mr (1 PAX)',30508,207388,'Sanur to Seminyak','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-24','2024-12-24','Yudha','Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',300000.00,'At the scheduled time, your driver will pick you up from your hotel or designated location and provide a transfer to the designated destination.','Car and driver only, no guide service. - 1-3 Pax by Avanza / APV - 4-6 Pax by HIACE - 7-10 Pax by HIACE + Luggage Van','NUSA PENIDA (17.00) - SANUR (17.45) By The Angkal The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-12-24\", \"text\": \"SANUR (17.45) By The Angkal\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"SANUR HBR\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-24\", \"text\": \"Kayumas Seminyak Resort Address: Jl. Pura Telaga Waja No.18A, Kerobokan Kelod, Kec. Kuta Utara, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361 Phone: (0361) 9348348\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5366979,'989','ALI EZZEDDINE Mr (1 PAX)',30508,207112,'1D Nusa Penida West Trip','Confirmed','C2I-BALI19',1,'2024-12-24','2024-12-24','Yudha','Eddy',1,'Person (1)',960000.00,'We will live a different day in neighboring Nusa Penida. We will pick you up at your hotel to go to the port and there take the fast boat to Nusa Penida. After approximately 30 minutes fast, we will arrive at the paradise island of southeast Bali. There we will be waiting for you to start your route. Our first stop will be Angel’s Billabong, a natural paradise in the form of a natural pool. If you want to take a bath, be careful with the steps and follow your driver’s recommendation. From here we will go to Broken Beach, a small bay that was once a cave and has been losing the roof over time. We can not access by land but the view from above is beautiful and with a bit of luck, we can see giant manta rays swimming on the surface. Our next stop will be Kelingking Beach, one of the most famous and photographed beaches on the island with its cliffs and the hand-shaped mountain. And we will end the day with relaxing in Crystal Beach, a white sand beach and turquoise waters. Afternoon, we transfer you back to the harbor to catch a fastboat return to Bali.',NULL,'The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-12-24\", \"text\": \"NUSA PENIDA (09:15) By The Angkal\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"BANJAR NYUH\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-24\", \"text\": \"NUSA PENIDA (17.00) By The Angkal\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": \"BANJAR NYUH\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5366983,'989','ALI EZZEDDINE Mr (1 PAX)',30508,207270,'Seminyak to Airport','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-25','2024-12-25','Yudha','Eddy',1,'Persons (1-3)',300000.00,'At the scheduled time, your driver will pick you up from your hotel or designated location and provide a transfer to the airport for your onward flight to your next destination.','Car and driver only, no guide service. - 1-3 Pax by Avanza / APV - 4-6 Pax by HIACE - 7-10 Pax by HIACE + Luggage Van','The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver will wait up to 30 minutes after your scheduled pickup time. - Please keep in mind that any further delay could affect your timely arrival at the airport for your flight. - For any changes in flight departure time, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available). - Requests for pickup time earlier than originally booked are subject to availability.','{\"date\": \"2024-12-25\", \"text\": \"Please be ready in hotel lobby at the mentioned time. Kayumas Seminyak Resort Address: Jl. Pura Telaga Waja No.18A, Kerobokan Kelod, Kec. Kuta Utara, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361 Phone: (0361) 9348348\", \"time\": \"19:30\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-25\", \"text\": \"ETD: 26 Dec 202400:05AM to Dubai EK0399 By Emirate Airlines\", \"time\": \"00:05\", \"locality\": \"BALI AIRPORT\", \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5366989,'989','ALI EZZEDDINE Mr (1 PAX)',30508,202889,'Ubud – Tamblingan Jungle Trek – Ulun Danu Temple – Seminyak','Confirmed','C2I-BALI14',1,'2024-12-23','2024-12-23','Yudha','Eddy',1,'Person (1)',1788000.00,'Today we will explore the nature of Buyan and Tamblingan lake in our lovely village, it’ will help you to escape from the crowds and fell the Nature atmosphere of the real jungle of Bali. We will pick you at your hotel at 07:30 AM and we drive to Tamblingan lake. Arrive in the trekking start point, we will have an explanation about the trekking. We will start the trek by entering a lush protected rain-forest area with giant old tress, animal such as macaque, black giant squirrel, birds and old legend temple inside in the Jungle. You will then walk along the shore of this lake situated in the caldera of an extinct Jungle Mountain. Our trekking guide will explain more detail about plants and living creatures in the jungle, This tour also combine with a session of thirty five minutes exploring the Tamblingan lake by dugout canoe to finishing point. Finish with trekking we will drop you to your hotel but we will make a stop at Ulun Danu Temple. Ulun Danu Temple Bratan, the famous temple stands on a small promontory located in the shore of Lake Bratan and has beautiful scen- ery with this lake and the mountains as backdrop sight.','Visits : - Short Jungle Trek + Canoa - Ulundanu Temple','The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-12-23\", \"text\": \"Please be ready in hotel lobby at the mentioned time. The Artini Dijiwa Ubud Address: Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone: (0361) 972385\", \"time\": \"07:30\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-23\", \"text\": \"Kayumas Seminyak Resort Address: Jl. Pura Telaga Waja No.18A, Kerobokan Kelod, Kec. Kuta Utara, Kabupaten Badung, Bali 80361 Phone: (0361) 9348348\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5367031,'989','ALI EZZEDDINE Mr (1 PAX)',30508,202893,'Lempuyang Temple Tour','Confirmed','C2I-BALI11',1,'2024-12-22','2024-12-22','Yudha','Eddy',1,'Person (1)',1620000.00,'At the agreed time, our guide will pick you up to start the tour in the eastern part of Bali. The first place you will visit is Goa Lawah Temple. Goa Lawah temple consists of two names, “Goa” which means cave and “Lawah” which means bat. Several thousand bats are flying in the cave as the name suggests. With the lights fading as you go deeper inside the cave, it gives off a very strange atmosphere. From Goa Lawah, we continue our way to Lempuyang temple. Upon arrival, the temple will greet you with its gratifying panorama that extends into infinity. On a clear, sunny day, you’ll be able to gaze out over the mountains, Amlapura city, and Mount Agung, an incredibly magnificent sight that’s beautiful beyond words. This portrait of heaven is beautifully framed by the Gapura Candi Bentar (the gate of the temple). Our journey continues to visit Tirta Gangga. The site is a paradise surrounded by water, with all the pools decorated with unusual statues. With its seclusion and a view of the surrounding rice paddies, Tirta Gangga is a wonderful place. At the end of the trip we go to Tenganan Village, the most famous Bali Agas (the “original” Bali people) in the city. With its characteristics, the village is arranged in parallel along the wide main road paved with rows of cobblestones. In Tenganan, women still weave the famous Kamben Geringsing, or “burnt cloth,” which has the power to immunize the wearer against evil. We take a close look at what they do in their daily lives in a traditional lifestyle. From Tenganan, we will transfer you to the hotel. NOTE: The order of visits may change depending on traffic and the influx of people that may be.','Visits : - Goa Lawah - Lempuyang - Tirta Gangga - Tenganan','The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-12-22\", \"text\": \"Please be ready in hotel lobby at the mentioned time. The Artini Dijiwa Ubud Address: Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone: (0361) 972385\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": \"READY AT LOBBY\", \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-22\", \"text\": \"The Artini Dijiwa Ubud Address: Jl. Raya Pengosekan Ubud, Ubud, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571 Phone: (0361) 972385\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5376161,'1001','Juan Francisco Nadal Romero',30805,212256,'CGK-DPS','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-27','2024-12-27','Alicia Ortiz','Tami',5,'Person',9075000.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-12-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:29:18','2026-08-28 07:29:18'),(5376163,'1001','Juan Francisco Nadal Romero',30508,207254,'Airport to Ubud','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-27','2024-12-27','Alicia Ortiz','Tami',1,'Persons (4-6)',840000.00,'Upon your arrival at the airport, you’ll be greeted by the driver, who will be waiting for you at the exit of the arrival hall, holding a signboard with your name or group name. The driver will assist you with your luggage and ensure a comfortable journey to your booked accommodation.','Car and driver only, no guide service. - 1-3 Pax by Avanza / APV - 4-6 Pax by HIACE - 7-10 Pax by HIACE + Luggage Van','The driver will be waiting at the arrival hall exit, holding a signboard of your name/group name. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 3 hours after the flight’s estimated arrival time (ETA). - For any flight delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available).','{\"date\": \"2024-12-27\", \"text\": \"ETA 15.05 by Lion Air JT20 from Jakarta on 27 Dec\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"I Gusti Ngurah Rai International Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-27\", \"text\": \"Jl. Padang Getas, Singakerta, Kecamatan Ubud, Kabupaten Gianyar, Bali 80571\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Tanadewa Resort Ubud Bali by Cross Collection\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5376178,'1001','Juan Francisco Nadal Romero',30715,200730,'Sky Suite Room','Confirmed',NULL,3,'2024-12-27','2024-12-30','Alicia Ortiz','Tami',2,'Room(s)',15120000.00,'Our elegantly designed Sky Suite combines modern design and traditional Balinese interiors. This one bedroom suite, offering 41 sqm, consists of an extra king size bed or twin beds, ensuite bathroom, work desk, private balcony, electric kettle and led TV.',NULL,'Special Request (Subject to availability) - 1 Double + 1 Twin - Side by Side Room Check In Time : 15.00 Hours Check Out Time : 11.00 Hours Early check-in/late check-out is subject to availability and may be charged additional cost.','{\"date\": \"2024-12-27\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5376191,'1001','Juan Francisco Nadal Romero',30508,202864,'Ubud and Surrounding Tour','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-28','2024-12-28','Alicia Ortiz','Tami',5,'Persons (5-6)',3330000.00,'We will be picking you up from your hotel to enjoy the wealth of art in Ubud. First we will visit Monkey Forest; the Ubud Monkey Forestis a nature reserve and temple complex in Ubud, Bali. It houses approximately 340 Crab-eating Macaque (Macacafascicularis) monkeys. The Monkey Forest contains the Pura Dalem Agung Padangtegal temple as well as a “Holy Spring” bathing temple and another temple used for cremation ceremonies.. Next we go to Ubud Traditional Art Market where the existence is not far different from other markets available in the tourism area. This market as a society economics center of Ubud and it is apposite to the existence of Ubud Empire that is called Puri Saren. Our last destination is Gua Gajah (Elephant Cave). This cave is built at crevasse edge from the federation of 2 rills that is called Pangkung River, where the irrigation is mixed with Petanu River flow. The word of Gua Gajah is anticipated coming from the word of Lwa Gajah, the name of Buddhist Templeor hermitage for Buddhist monk. There is a relief which is almost looking like the form of mountain on the entrance of this cave. It was carved many designed on the relief like grove with the stick, close leaf, animal for example forest pig, tortoise and specters. The cave mouth is decorated by the bas-relief with the eye turn around to the right or west side. At the end of tour wewill transferred back you to the hotel.','Visits : - Monkey Forest - Ubud Market - Goa Gajah - Tegalalang',NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-12-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"08:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Tanadewa Resort Ubud Bali by Cross Collection\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-28\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5376196,'1001','Juan Francisco Nadal Romero',30508,220657,'Uluwatu Temple and Kecak Dance (without dinner)','Confirmed','C2I-BALI16',1,'2024-12-30','2024-12-30','Alicia Ortiz','Tami',5,'Persons (5-6)',3390000.00,'This half-day tour, is an exciting tour package to visit Padang-Padang Beach, Uluwatu Temple, the famous Balinese Hindu Temple in south part of Bali with breathtaking view of sunset and Indian Ocean. Uluwatu Temple is one of Balinese Hindu Temples located right on the petrifying hill with the crevasse exist in the right and left side. Uluwatu Temple is one of Sad Khayangan (6 biggest temple in Bali) owns magnificent view of the Indian Ocean and sunset as a backdrop. This temple is very amazing where the location is right on the narrow peninsula with deep seawater under it. This tour package is combined with the spectacular Balinese traditional dance performance of Kecak Dance. Balinese Kecak Dance is a spectacular traditional dance with the group of people playing this dance with fire game. It is very exciting and unique dance due to the sound of gamelan is not using the normal gamelan but use their mouth. The dancers make the compact choir with the exquisite dance movement that is one of this dance features. After the dance we returned back to the hotel.','Visits : - Uluwatu Temple','The driver will be waiting in the hotel lobby or at the specified pickup point. IMPORTANT: - The driver may wait up to 30 minutes after the scheduled pickup time. Please be advised that extended wait times could affect your planned activities. - For any potential delays, please inform us in advance at +62813 37165036 (WhatsApp available), or inform the driver upon meeting them.','{\"date\": \"2024-12-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"12:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Tanadewa Resort Ubud Bali by Cross Collection\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Grand Mirage Resort & Thalasso Bali\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5376203,'1001','Juan Francisco Nadal Romero',30508,212475,'Nusa Dua to Sanur','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-31','2024-12-31','Alicia Ortiz','Tami',1,'Persons (4-6)',720000.00,'At the scheduled time, your driver will pick you up from your hotel or designated location and provide a transfer to the designated destination.','Car and driver only, no guide service. - 1-3 Pax by Avanza / APV - 4-6 Pax by HIACE - 7-10 Pax by HIACE + Luggage Van',NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-12-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": \"06:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Grand Mirage Resort & Thalasso Bali\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-31\", \"text\": \"ETD 07.30 by Sugriwa Express to Nusa Penida on 31 Dec\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Sanur Harbour\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'