ntrance to Cools Lounge, Turn down service, Kids club/playground access and daily kids activities Airport transfer and non-motorized water sports can be arranged at additional charges.',NULL,'Check In Time : After 14.00 Check Out Time : 12.00 Early check-in/late check-out is subject to availability and may be charged additional cost.','{\"date\": \"2024-12-30\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2025-01-02\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5376265,'1001','Juan Francisco Nadal Romero',30854,221427,'Snorkeling Only (Sharing)','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-12-31','2024-12-31','Alicia Ortiz','Tami',5,'Persons (5-7)',4050000.00,NULL,NULL,'Fast Boat Schedule 31 Dec 2024 / Sanur – Penida / ETD 07.30 AM 31 Dec 2024 / Penida – Sanur / ETD 13.45 PM','{\"date\": \"2024-12-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-12-31\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5623607,'1423','Mr. Juan Felipe de la Malla Gomez',31591,229698,'One Day Car and Driver from Manado to Tangkoko with stop arround Minahasa','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-07','2024-08-07','Guio','Praba',7,'Persons (7)',2039998.80,NULL,NULL,'Use 2 Car, in one car maximum 4 persons','{\"date\": \"2024-08-07\", \"text\": \"ETA 05:50 by Batik Air ID6274 from Jakarta\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Manado Airport\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-07\", \"text\": \"Address: Tangkoko Gallery Guest House and Resto Phone: +6285342763082\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Tangkoko Gallery Guest House and Resto\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5623795,'1423','Mr. Juan Felipe de la Malla Gomez',31591,229698,'Transfer from Tangkoko to Bahovo Port','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-11','2024-08-11','Guio','Praba',7,'Persons (7)',1199996.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": \"Address: Batuputih Bawah, Kec. Ranowulu, Kota Bitung, Sulawesi Utara 95535 Phone: +6285342763082\", \"time\": \"08:00\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Tangkoko Gallery Guest House and Resto\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-11\", \"text\": \"Address: Tongkeina, Kec. Bunaken, Kota Manado, Sulawesi Utara\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Dermaga Pantai Bahowo\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5623805,'1423','Mr. Juan Felipe de la Malla Gomez',31591,229698,'Transfer from Bahovo Port to Airport Manado','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-14','2024-08-14','Guio','Praba',7,'Persons (7)',1199996.00,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": \"Address: Tongkeina, Kec. Bunaken, Kota Manado, Sulawesi Utara\", \"time\": \"10:30\", \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Dermaga Pantai Bahowo\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-14\", \"text\": \"ETD 13:10 by Batik Air ID6281 to Jakarta\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Manado Airport\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5623809,'1423','Mr. Juan Felipe de la Malla Gomez',31137,213552,'2D1N Banjarmasin Tour','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-08-05','2024-08-06','Guio','Praba',7,'Persons (7)',14400002.40,'DAY 1: BANJARMASIN Upon arrival at Banjarmasin airport, by car transfer for about 1.5 hours to Banjarmasin, check in at hotel, dinner at local restaurant. Meals : Dinner Accommodation : Hotel Swiss Bel DLX Room Banjarmasin Twin Share DAY 2 : FLOATING MARKET & CANAL Early in the morning, we will visit the floating market of Banjarmasin as being part of Kalimantan ’s river-life, here we can explore the unique culture of Banjarese who trade commodities as fruit, and vegetables from boat to boat. Cannal trip Banjarmasin River while sightseeing people activities at riverside, Transfer to Banjarmasin airport. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -','ACCOMMODATION DAY 01 : Hotel Swiss Bel DLX Room Banjarmasin Twin Share','Itinerary: D1/4 August : Transfer in airport - Swiss-Belhotel Banjarmasin (include airport transfer only) D2/5 August : Halfday Canal Trip Banjarmasin D3/6 August : Floating Market Tour - Transfer to airport Accommodations: 5 - 6 August 20251 Night Hotel Swiss Bel DLX room Banjarmasin 2 Double + 3 Single Room','{\"date\": \"2024-08-05\", \"text\": \"ETA 14:40 by Super Air Jet IU636 from Surabaya\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Airport Banjarmasin\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-06\", \"text\": \"ETD 16:10 by Super Air Jet IU621 to Jakarta\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Airport Banjarmasin\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34'),(5652315,'547','Norberto Rodriguez',30680,200912,'Superior Room','Confirmed',NULL,2,'2024-07-21','2024-07-23','Norberto','Komang',1,'Twin',1680000.00,'Sleep soundly in one of the 111 Superior Room with 25 m2 of room size, featuring plush bedding, extra bed is not allowed with this room type. Enjoy our modern bathroom with hot and cold shower or simply relax in front of the TV and enjoy our facilities as swimming pool, hot and cool whirlpool, sauna, steam, and fitness center with personal trainers. This room also equipped with LED TV 43\", local and international telephone, broadband internet access, safety deposit box, air conditioning, radio, non or smoking room option, 24 hours room service, minibar, tea & coffee maker, in room message, slippers, and hairdryer.',NULL,'Check-in time is 14:00. Check-out time is 12:00. Early check-in/late check-out is based on availability upon arrival and at an additional charge payable directly to the hotel. PLEASE CONSULT YOUR AIRPORT TRANSFER TIME DURING CHECK-IN. FM7 Hotel Airport Pickup Service: +62811 8815055‬ (Concierge - Pickup Service).','{\"date\": \"2024-07-21\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','{\"date\": \"2024-07-23\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": null}','2026-08-28 06:49:25','2026-08-28 06:54:29'),(5654751,'1423','Mr. Juan Felipe de la Malla Gomez',31137,231534,'One-Way Airport Transfer','Confirmed',NULL,1,'2024-08-04','2024-08-04','Guio','Praba',1,'Per Car',257143.20,NULL,NULL,NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-04\", \"text\": \"ETA\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Airport Banjarmasin\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-04\", \"text\": null, \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Swiss Belhotel Banjarmasin\"}','2026-08-28 07:09:31','2026-08-28 07:09:31'),(5655323,'1423','Mr. Juan Felipe de la Malla Gomez',30806,202002,'4D3N Borneo Orangutan & Reforestation Tour','Confirmed','C2B-BORNEO7',4,'2024-08-01','2024-08-04','Guio','Praba',7,'Persons (7)',29820000.00,'In this Borneo Orangutan & Reforestation Tour, you will get away from the world in one of our traditional boats through the rivers and forests of Borneo, one of the last refuges of our cousins, the Orangutans. You can also see proboscis monkeys, long-tailed macaques, monitor lizards, crocodiles, gibbons, wild boars, and endemic birds. Understand what life in the jungle is like on this three-night eco tour from one of our local guides as you explore the jungle of the third-largest island on the planet. Let the adventure begin! 4D3N BORNEO ORANGUTAN & REFORESTATION TOUR DAY 1 : PANGKALAN BUN - KUMAI PORT - TANJUNG HARAPAN Your “Orangutan & Reforestation Tour” begins upon arrival at Pangkalan Bun Airport, on the island of Borneo, better known by the Indonesians as Kalimantan. Upon arrival at the airport, your guide will be waiting for you. You will transfer to the port of Kumai in about 15-20 minutes by car, where you will embark on a great adventure! You arrive to at our traditional wooden boat, called a klotok. Our guide will reconfirm with the crew that everything is ready and start the cruise up the river in the famous Sekonyer River aboard a klotok. If your flight arrives early (before 11.30 AM), you can arrive in time to the rehabilitation center of Tanjung Harapan, where at 3 o’clock in the afternoon, the rangers of the national park feed the orangutans, and you can have your first close encounters with them. The translation of Tanjung Harapan is Cape of Hope. This first camp is one of the ones with more wetlands, and being in the afternoon has more mosquitoes, so make sure you put on enough mosquito repellent. Here you also can do the reforestation, where you can be volunteers to plant a tree, and so take pride that you have contributed a grain of sand to conservation with your step over there. After visiting this Rangers Camp, you will continue upstream, resting on the boat, while you search for animals in the vicinity of the Sekonyer River. This afternoon, it is very frequent to see groups of proboscis monkeys and monkeys in the treetops, jumping from one branch to another, or even crocodiles, and lizards in the shallow waters of the sides of the river. Prepare for sunset. The boat moored on one side of the river to spend the night. Tonight, you can do a walk into the jungle to look for night animals like snakes, tarantulas or if you are lucky luminescent mushrooms or tarsiers. Meals : Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat DAY 2 : TANJUNG HARAPAN VILLAGE - PROBOSCIS TOUR - CAMP LEAKEY After an extraordinary breakfast, you go to visit the village inside the national park, named Tanjung Harapan Village. Here you will see the activities of the locals. After the visit, you will return to the klotok cruise up to the Sekonyer River. You will see nice vegetation around the river bank, including Nipa Palm, Pandanus, and some kinds of trees that are growing up around the river. See some wildlifes such as birds, Macaques, Proboscis Monkeys and Orangutans. You will see how the coloration of the river changes, and you will have the opportunity to see crocodiles and large monitor lizards. Arrival at Camp Leakey, the old orangutan research and rehabilitation center since 1971, when a student at UCLA Los Angeles University, Birutte Galdikas began studying the Orangutans there. The name Camp Leaky comes from Birutte’s own teacher, the Paleoanthropologist Louis Leakey. At least 200 orangutans had already been cured and returned to the jungles, thanks to this center. However, since 1995, the Government of Indonesia has banned the introduction of more Orangutans into this camp, so Orangutans are increasingly adapting more to freedom. To this day, this camp is used as an investigation into the behavior and feeding of Orangutans. You will take advantage of your guide to explore the interiors of the jungle a bit to look for orangutans in freedom and other animals. At 14.00, you can see the feeding time of the Orangutans. You can also visit the small museum made by the scientist Dr. Birute Galdikas. Note: The Birate Galdikas Museum at Camp Leaky is currently closed for maintenance purposes. Regrettably, visits to this site will not be possible until further notice. We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause and will keep you updated on the reopening of the museum. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat DAY 3 : PONDOK TANGGUI - CAMP LEAKEY - BOAT After an extraordinary breakfast, you will go in time to see the Pondok Tanggui Camp at the time of feeding (9 AM). Sooner or later, you will see how the branches of the treetops begin to move, and then you will see the silhouettes of the Orangutans arriving at the feeding platform. Pondok Tanggui was a release camp for young Orangutans that were rehabilitated, and they continue to add food every day to prevent the Orangutans from leaving because of a lack of food. They end up outside the National Park, with the following risk of falling into traps of settlers or fields of palm oil plantations. After lunch, you will have the opportunity to repeat feeding camp at Camp Leaky. It is a unique opportunity to dedicate more time to your observation and to discover more wild animals, along with the Orangutans. In the afternoon, if the circumstances permit, the boat will be docked near a firefly congregation, and you can enjoy the show of its luminescence. Note: If your return flight leaves early in the morning (around 7 a.m.), tonight the klotok will sleep closer to the port in order to get you to the airport in time. Meals : Breakfast - Lunch - Dinner Accommodation : Klotok Boat DAY 4 : KUMAI PORT - PANGKALAN BUN Today we end our stay in the jungles of Borneo. Our “Orangutan & Reforestation Tour” is about to finish. In the early morning we will have breakfast on the boat, to then go to the port and in turn, be transferred to the airport. The boat departure will be at the latest at 10am, but we adapt to your flights if your flight leaves earlier in the morning. If you decide to take an afternoon flight, we can take you directly to the airport at 10 or if you want a city tour in the Arut village to drop you off at the airport later, it could be arranged at extra cost. Meals : Breakfast Accommodation : -','- Check-in time Klotok at 10.30am, check-out time at 08.00am. Early check-in or late check-out will be based on availability. Consult us! - Conditions for babies and children: 0-24 Months: 25% charge of the price of an adult - Not operate during Idul Fitri (29th March - 1st April 2025) and Idul Adha (6th June - 7th June 2025).',NULL,'{\"date\": \"2024-08-01\", \"text\": \"ETA 07:25 by Batik Air ID6202 from Jakarta\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Bandar Udara Iskandar Pangkalan Bun\"}','{\"date\": \"2024-08-04\", \"text\": \"ETD 08:55 by Batik Air ID6134 to Surabaya (connecting flight ETD 12:30 by Super Air Jet IU636 to Banjarmasin)\", \"time\": null, \"locality\": null, \"location\": \"Bandar Udara Iskandar Pangkalan Bun\"}','2026-08-28 07:00:34','2026-08-28 07:00:34');
